window.CONVERGENCE_DATA = {"worlds":[{"slug":"galactic-patrol-headquarters","title":"Galactic Patrol Headquarters","type":"Landmark","excerpt":"🌌 Galactic Patrol Headquarters — The Eye of the Cosmos 🌌 At the very heart of the galaxy, where gravitational currents twist and star systems converge, floats the Galactic Patrol Headquarters—a colossal, ever-active station that serves as the center of univers…","messages":[{"title":"Galactic Patrol Headquarters — The Eye of the Cosmos","html":"<div><span><h1>🌌 Galactic Patrol Headquarters — The Eye of the Cosmos 🌌</h1>At the very heart of the galaxy, where gravitational currents twist and star systems converge, floats the Galactic Patrol Headquarters—a colossal, ever-active station that serves as the center of universal law. It is not anchored to any world, nor claimed by any single race, existing instead as a neutral authority above all civilizations. From afar, it appears as a radiant construct of metal and light, its surface layered with docking rings, defense arrays, and observation spires that never sleep.\nThis station is more than a base of operations—it is the nervous system of the galaxy itself. Information flows into it constantly from thousands of worlds, processed in real time by vast intelligence networks. Every distress signal, every conflict, every anomaly eventually finds its way here. From this singular point, the Galactic Patrol watches, judges, and acts. To many, it is a symbol of safety. To others… it is a reminder that nowhere is beyond reach.\n<h1>⚖️ The Universal Peace Charter</h1>The Galactic Patrol operates under a single guiding doctrine—the Universal Peace Charter. Unlike the laws of any one planet, the Charter exists as a unifying code, designed to maintain stability across vastly different civilizations. It does not demand conformity, but it does enforce limits—particularly when one world’s actions threaten another.\nThe Patrol intervenes in matters of piracy, war escalation, illegal experimentation, and interstellar crime, acting as both mediator and enforcer. Their authority is widely accepted, though not universally loved. Some see them as protectors. Others see them as overseers imposing order on a universe that was never meant to be controlled. Still, one truth remains undeniable; when the Patrol arrives… something has already gone wrong.\n<h1>👑 The Hierarchy of Command</h1>At the pinnacle of the Galactic Patrol stands King Sealas, the Supreme Overseer. Unlike traditional rulers, Sealas does not command through presence, but through reach. Rarely seen in person, his influence extends through every layer of the organization. His decisions are calculated, often made with knowledge far beyond what others possess, giving rise to a quiet belief among some that he sees more of the galaxy than he should.\nBeneath him stands Captain Breno, the operational core of the Patrol. Where Sealas is distant, Breno is present—leading missions, directing fleets, and standing at the forefront of conflict. His reputation is carved into the minds of both allies and enemies alike, known as a commander who does not hesitate when action is required. If Sealas is the mind of the Patrol, Breno is its will made manifest.\nSupporting them is the Stellar Circle, an elite council that governs the major divisions of the Patrol. Each member oversees a critical branch—intelligence, diplomacy, combat, and infrastructure—ensuring that the Patrol remains both efficient and adaptable. Their decisions ripple across the galaxy, often shaping events long before the public becomes aware of them.</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483922611070308494/1483933531804532867","messageId":"1483933531804532867"},{"title":"🚀 The Reach of the Patrol","html":"<div><span><h1>🚀 The Reach of the Patrol</h1>Beyond the command structure lies the true strength of the organization—its network. The galaxy is divided into monitored sectors, each overseen by Vice-Captains and Precinct Commanders who coordinate localized responses. This decentralized structure allows the Patrol to act quickly, adapting to threats before they spiral out of control.\nAt the frontlines are the Patrol Agents, individuals chosen not just for strength, but for capability. Agents operate in teams, deployed to handle everything from minor disturbances to full-scale crises. Some are diplomats, others are warriors, and many are both. Regardless of their role, they carry the authority of the Patrol with them—often making decisions that determine the fate of entire systems.\nBehind them stands the Support Division, an often unseen but essential force. Engineers maintain fleets and infrastructure, medics ensure survivability in extreme conditions, and analysts within the Central Intelligence Nexus sift through unimaginable volumes of data. It is here that patterns are recognized, threats are predicted, and missions are born before the galaxy even realizes danger is coming.\n<h1>🛰️ A Living Station</h1>The Headquarters itself is a world unto its own. Entire districts exist within its structure—command centers filled with holographic star maps, docking bays capable of housing entire fleets, and residential sectors where agents and staff live between assignments. Observation decks stretch outward into open space, offering a direct view of the galaxy the Patrol is sworn to protect.\nDespite its function, the station is not devoid of life. Cultures from across the galaxy intersect here, creating a unique environment where ideas, technologies, and perspectives collide. It is one of the few places where a Tuffle engineer, a Saiyan warrior, and a Cerealian scientist might stand side by side—not as rivals, but as part of something larger.\n<h1>🌌 A Fragile Authority</h1>For all its power, the Galactic Patrol is not invincible. Its reach is vast, but not absolute. Forces like the Frost Force, rogue empires, and entities from beyond the mortal realm constantly test its limits. There are regions where its authority weakens, places where law gives way to survival, and enemies who operate just beyond its grasp.\nEven within the Patrol, questions linger. How much control is too much? When does protection become interference? And who ensures that those enforcing the law remain just themselves? These are questions without easy answers. And answers the Patrol cannot afford to ignore.</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483922611070308494/1483933653259259994","messageId":"1483933653259259994"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483922611070308494","art":"assets/art/world-galactic-patrol-headquarters.svg","wordCount":876},{"slug":"makyo-realm","title":"Makyo Realm","type":"Realm","excerpt":"🌌 The Makyo Realm — Dominion of Chaos and Creation 🌌 The Makyo Realm exists parallel to the Mortal Realm, a dimension where order was never meant to take root. It is the birthplace of the Majin, a realm shaped not by natural law, but by will, emotion, and raw …","messages":[{"title":"The Makyo Realm — Dominion of Chaos and Creation","html":"<div><span><h1>🌌 The Makyo Realm — Dominion of Chaos and Creation 🌌</h1>The Makyo Realm exists parallel to the Mortal Realm, a dimension where order was never meant to take root. It is the birthplace of the Majin, a realm shaped not by natural law, but by will, emotion, and raw cosmic energy. Where the Mortal Realm seeks balance, Makyo thrives in extremes—creation and destruction, beauty and horror, all existing side by side without contradiction.\nDespite its chaotic nature, the realm is not without structure. Over time, it has formed into three distinct layers, each representing a different aspect of existence within Makyo. From the lowest depths of despair to the heights of power and influence, these layers define the hierarchy of the realm itself. At its peak stands Sahloknir, the Majin Emperor, whose rule brings a fragile sense of order to a domain that resists it at every turn. Yet even he does not know all that lies within his own empire.\n<h1>🔥 Varkul — The Forsaken Depths</h1>At the lowest layer of Makyo lies Varkul, a desolate and suffocating expanse where existence itself feels unwelcome. The land is broken, cracked, and lifeless, illuminated only by slow-moving rivers of black energy that cut through the terrain like scars. There is no sky—only an endless void pressing down on everything below. This is not a place of civilization. It is a place of endurance. Those who exist here are either cast down or drawn by something darker, forced to survive against both the environment and each other. The few ruins scattered across the wasteland hint that something once lived here long ago… and failed. Hidden deep within this abyss rests one of Makyo’s greatest secrets—a Dragon Ball, guarded by the entity known as Tamagami Caligo. Born from the very darkness of the Abyss, Caligo is less a creature and more a manifestation of the realm itself. Those who seek it rarely return, and those who do… are never the same.</span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483922951106724181/1484004661366231112","messageId":"1484004661366231112"},{"title":"Zyrael— The Living Core","html":"<div><span><h1>✨ Zyrael— The Living Core</h1>Above the Abyss lies Zyrael, the heart of the Makyo Realm and the only layer where something resembling civilization truly thrives. Unlike the emptiness below, Zyrael is vibrant, chaotic, and alive. Its skies swirl with color and energy, and its space is filled with floating worlds, each one a domain of its own.  Zyrael is a place of trade, power, and intrigue. Markets deal in forbidden artifacts, knowledge lost to time, and energies that should not exist. Alliances are formed and broken just as quickly, and influence is often more valuable than strength. It is here that the majority of Makyo’s population resides, navigating a society built on shifting power. Within Zyrael exist three of the most significant planets in all of Makyo:</span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483922951106724181/1484004718748373096","messageId":"1484004718748373096"},{"title":"Nomakia — The Fractured Origin Once a sacred world born from Zalama’s essence, Nomakia was the birthplace of the Namekians","html":"<div><span><ul><li><strong>🌌 Nomakia — The Fractured Origin</strong></li></ul>Once a sacred world born from Zalama’s essence, Nomakia was the birthplace of the Namekians before their exodus to the Mortal Realm. It remains a planet of immense natural beauty—emerald forests, vast lakes, and energy-rich land that still resonates with divine creation. But that beauty hides something darker.\nNomakia is now ruled by Kilos, the self-proclaimed Demon King and progenitor of the Demon Clan Namekians. As the “other-half” of Grand Elder Lokai, Kilos embodies the opposite path—ambition over balance, domination over harmony. Under his influence, parts of Nomakia have been twisted into training grounds for his followers, where power is cultivated without restraint. The planet exists in a constant state of duality. Life flourishes… while corruption spreads beneath it. Hidden somewhere within Nomakia lies the second Makyo Dragon Ball, protected by Tamagami Aetheris, a radiant and overwhelming force that stands in direct contrast to the darkness of Kilos’ rule.</span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483922951106724181/1484004872482455562","messageId":"1484004872482455562"},{"title":"🌳 Glindi — The Silent World Once the origin of the Glind, Glindi is a planet that should be full of life... but is not. It was","html":"<div><span><ul><li><strong>🌳 Glindi — The Silent World</strong></li></ul>Once the origin of the Glind, Glindi is a planet that should be full of life… but is not. It was here that the Glinds were born from the great Kaiju Trees, beings shaped from Rymus’s essence, tied directly to the life force of the planet itself. The forests once stretched endlessly, alive with energy, each tree capable of birthing new life into existence.  But that age has passed. After the Glinds departed Makyo, driven out by the unrest of other Majin, Glindi was left behind. Without them, the world did not die—but it changed. The forests remain, but they no longer grow as they once did. The air is still. The energy lingers, but without direction. Glindi is not dead. It is… waiting.</span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483922951106724181/1484005044813561997","messageId":"1484005044813561997"},{"title":"❄️ Arcose — The Frozen Dominion Among the floating worlds of Astrarion lies Arcose, a planet of endless frost and unyielding","html":"<div><span><ul><li><strong>❄️ Arcose — The Frozen Dominion</strong></li></ul>Among the floating worlds of Astrarion lies Arcose, a planet of endless frost and unyielding ambition. It is the true origin of the Arcosians, a race defined by survival, adaptation, and conquest. Arcose is a brutal world—its surface locked in ice, its environment unforgiving. Those born here are shaped by necessity, forced to become strong or perish. From this world rose rulers like Lord Frost, who united the Arcosians and began their expansion beyond Makyo, eventually spreading their influence into the Mortal Realm. Even now, Arcose remains a stronghold of power. While many Arcosians have left to build empires among the stars, the planet continues to produce warriors and leaders who carry the same philosophy: that survival is not enough—dominance is required.</span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483922951106724181/1484005163135139900","messageId":"1484005163135139900"},{"title":"🏰 Thaexis — Throne of Makyo","html":"<div><span><h1>🏰 Thaexis — Throne of Makyo</h1>At the highest layer of the Makyo Realm stands the Thaexis , a domain of overwhelming presence and power. This is not a single world, but a network of floating structures and connected realms, all centered around a massive obsidian citadel that serves as the seat of Sahloknir’s rule.\nThe air itself hums with energy, and the environment bends subtly to the will of those who reside there. This is where the strongest Majin gather—the elite, the rulers, and the heirs of power. Surrounding the citadel are the domains of Sahloknir’s children, each one reflecting the nature of its ruler, from realms of illusion to endless archives of forbidden knowledge. Hidden within this layer lies the final Makyo Dragon Ball, guarded by Tamagami Umbra, a being of pure void that moves unseen even within the Emperor’s own domain. Even here… there are things beyond Sahloknir’s control.\n<h1>🐉 The Tamagami — Guardians of the Hidden Power</h1>Across the three layers exist the Tamagami, ancient entities bound to the protection of Makyo’s Dragon Balls. Each one embodies the nature of the layer they inhabit—Caligo of the Abyss, Aetheris of Astrarion, and Umbra of the Citadel. They are not servants. They are not rulers. They simply are. Even the strongest beings in Makyo avoid them, for their purpose is absolute—to ensure that the power they guard is never misused.\n<h1>👑 Sahloknir — The Emperor of Chaos</h1>At the peak of it all stands Sahloknir, ruler of the Makyo Realm and the being who has done what few thought possible—impose structure on chaos. His strength is unmatched, his mind sharp, and his influence extends across every layer of the realm. Yet his rule is not absolute. Makyo cannot be fully controlled—it can only be guided. Beneath his authority, countless forces move unseen, ancient powers remain hidden, and truths linger just beyond his reach. He is the Emperor. But even he rules a realm that does not fully belong to him.</span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483922951106724181/1484005402235506949","messageId":"1484005402235506949"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483922951106724181","art":"assets/art/world-makyo-realm.svg","wordCount":1208},{"slug":"otherworld","title":"Otherworld","type":"Realm","excerpt":"🌌 Otherworld — The Infinite Threshold 🌌 Otherworld is not a single realm, but an interconnected expanse where existence continues beyond death. It is a domain governed not by chaos, but by structure, where every soul is guided, judged, and placed with purpose.…","messages":[{"title":"Otherworld — The Infinite Threshold","html":"<div><span><h1>🌌 Otherworld — The Infinite Threshold 🌌</h1>Otherworld is not a single realm, but an interconnected expanse where existence continues beyond death. It is a domain governed not by chaos, but by structure, where every soul is guided, judged, and placed with purpose. Unlike the mortal realm, where life unfolds unpredictably, Otherworld operates with quiet precision—each soul entering a system that has existed since the earliest ages of creation.\nAt the center of this system stands the Grand Arbiter, an entity whose authority transcends kings, gods, and mortals alike. The Arbiter does not rule through power, but through judgment—measuring the weight of a soul’s life, not by singular acts, but by the totality of its existence. Around them exists a vast celestial order: scribes who record lifetimes, guides who escort souls, and overseers who maintain the flow between realms. Death, in this system, is not an end. It is a transition.\n<h1>🔥 Hell — The Crucible of Truth</h1>Hell is not a place of eternal punishment, but of confrontation. It is a realm shaped by consequence, where souls are forced to face the truths they denied in life. Its landscapes are ever-shifting—molten rivers, fractured wastelands, endless chasms—but these are not random horrors. They are reflections, tailored to each soul’s burden.\nPain exists here, but not without purpose. Every trial is designed to strip away illusion, to force understanding where there was once ignorance. Some souls endure quickly, accepting their faults and emerging changed. Others resist, clinging to pride or denial, prolonging their suffering. Hell does not exist to destroy. It exists to refine. And when a soul is ready… it moves on.\n<h1>🌄 Heaven — The Stillness Beyond Struggle</h1>Where Hell burns, Heaven soothes. It is a realm of peace, where souls are freed from the weight of mortal existence. Vast open fields, radiant skies, and quiet waters define its landscapes, each shaped not just by beauty, but by comfort.\nHere, souls reconnect—with others, with themselves, and with the meaning of their lives. Time has little meaning in Heaven. There is no urgency, no suffering, no need to struggle. It is a place of rest, reflection, and quiet growth. But Heaven is not stagnation. Even in peace, souls continue to evolve. Some choose to remain, embracing eternity. Others, once fulfilled, choose to return to the cycle—to be reborn, carrying fragments of what they have learned.\n<h1>🌌 The Divine Expanse — Beyond Heaven and Hell</h1>Beyond both Heaven and Hell lies a higher layer of existence—one not meant for mortals, but for those who govern reality itself. This is where the cosmic balance is maintained, where creation and destruction are guided rather than unleashed.\n<ul><li>It is here that two sacred worlds exist:\n<ul><li>Kaioros… and Virethos.</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483922823050432602/1483932255050006578","messageId":"1483932255050006578"},{"title":"Planet Kaioros — Seat of Creation","html":"<div><span><h1>🌌 Planet Kaioros — Seat of Creation 🌌</h1>Kaioros exists as the heart of divine creation, a world shaped not by time, but by purpose. Its landscapes are impossibly serene—rolling fields that glow faintly with cosmic energy, still waters that reflect more than just light, and skies that seem to stretch into infinity. Everything on Kaioros resonates with a quiet harmony, as if the planet itself is alive and aware of its role in the universe.\nAt its core flows a vast reservoir of divine energy, the same essence that connects the Kais to the fabric of existence. This energy is not raw power, but refined balance, allowing those attuned to it to perceive the flow of life across the cosmos. Hidden throughout the planet are ancient archives—records not written in ink, but in energy itself—preserving the history of creation from its earliest moments.\n<ul><li><strong>👑 Kiru — The Last Grand Supreme Kai</strong></li></ul>Once, Kaioros was home to many. A council of Supreme Kais governed the universe, each responsible for a portion of existence. But that era has long since passed.\nNow, only Kiru remains. As the last Grand Supreme Kai, Kiru carries the full weight of a system that was never meant to rest on one being. She does not rule through dominance, but through understanding, guiding the universe with subtle influence rather than direct control. Her presence is felt more than seen, her actions deliberate, intervening only when balance itself is threatened. Despite the loss of her fellow Kais, she continues forward—not out of duty alone, but out of belief.\n<ul><li><strong>🏞️ The Worlds of Apprenticeship</strong></li></ul>Orbiting Kaioros are smaller celestial bodies—training worlds designed to test those chosen to walk the path of divine stewardship. These are not simple trials of strength, but of spirit, judgment, and understanding.\nThose who train here are not selected for power alone. They are chosen for potential—the ability to carry responsibility without being consumed by it. Many fail. Some rise. And a rare few… become something more.</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483922823050432602/1483932502237253783","messageId":"1483932502237253783"},{"title":"Planet Virethos — Domain of Destruction","html":"<div><span><h1>🌌 Planet Virethos — Domain of Destruction 🌌</h1>Where Kaioros embodies creation, Virethos represents its counterpart. But destruction here is not chaos—it is necessary. The planet itself reflects this philosophy, its violet skies swirling above landscapes that shift between life and desolation. Lush, glowing forests exist beside crystalline wastelands, and oceans of light border endless dunes. Virethos is not a dead world. It is a controlled one, where destruction exists not to end life, but to ensure it does not spiral beyond balance. Every element of the planet reflects this—growth and decay existing in constant, deliberate harmony.\n<ul><li><strong>🌀 Romas — The Goddess Who Restrains Power</strong></li></ul>At the center of Virethos stands Romas, the current Goddess of Destruction. Unlike many who have held such a title, she does not revel in ruin. She understands it. Her role is not to destroy indiscriminately, but to act when necessary—when imbalance threatens to consume existence.\nHer palace rises as a monument to this philosophy, not just a seat of power, but a place where decisions are made with care. She does not act often—but when she does, it is absolute.\n<ul><li><strong>🌀 Azanek — The Silent Predecessor</strong></li></ul>Before Romas, there was Azanek. Though believed lost, he remains on Virethos still—not as a ruler, but as a watcher. A former God of Destruction who chose to step down, understanding that power must evolve beyond its wielder. His presence is quiet, known to few, but his influence lingers in the very structure of the world.</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483922823050432602/1483932696898961599","messageId":"1483932696898961599"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483922823050432602","art":"assets/art/world-otherworld.svg","wordCount":1035},{"slug":"planet-cereal","title":"Planet Cereal","type":"Planet","excerpt":"🌌 Planet Cereal — The Harvest of Resilience 🌌 In the far reaches of the East Galaxy rests Planet Cereal, a world often described as deceptively simple at first glance. Rolling golden plains stretch endlessly beneath calm skies, broken only by elegant cities th…","messages":[{"title":"Planet Cereal — The Harvest of Resilience","html":"<div><span><h1>🌌 Planet Cereal — The Harvest of Resilience 🌌</h1>In the far reaches of the East Galaxy rests Planet Cereal, a world often described as deceptively simple at first glance. Rolling golden plains stretch endlessly beneath calm skies, broken only by elegant cities that seem to grow naturally from the land itself. Unlike many advanced civilizations, the Cerealians never sought dominance or expansion—they sought balance. Their progress was not measured in conquest, but in how seamlessly they could blend innovation with nature.\nCereal became known across the cosmos as a model of sustainable advancement. Their technology was refined rather than excessive, focused on improving life without disrupting the planet’s natural harmony. Agricultural systems were perfected to the point of abundance, energy was drawn from renewable planetary sources, and architecture was designed to coexist with the environment rather than replace it. Every aspect of Cerealian life reflected a singular belief: progress should elevate existence, not control it. This philosophy shaped their people into thinkers, creators, and innovators—but not warriors. And in a universe where strength often dictates survival, that absence would come at a cost.\n<h1>🌌 The Cerealian Identity</h1>Cerealians are a people defined by curiosity and creativity. From a young age, they are encouraged to explore disciplines ranging from engineering and science to art and philosophy, creating a culture rich in both intellect and expression. Their society is structured, yet flexible—governed by leadership that values fairness and long-term stability over power.\nDespite their peaceful nature, the Cerealians are not naïve. They understand the dangers of the wider universe, but for generations, they believed distance and diplomacy would be enough to shield them. Their world was not fortified like others, nor did it maintain a standing military force capable of resisting a true invasion. Instead, they relied on cooperation, trade, and the assumption that their lack of aggression would keep them safe. For a time, it did. Until it didn’t.\n<h1>❄️ The Frost Force Invasion</h1>Planet Cereal’s prosperity eventually drew the attention of a rising power—the Frost Force, led by the Arcosian warlord Lord Frostbyte. Unlike the Cerealians, Frostbyte saw the universe as something to be claimed, not preserved. Cereal, with its resources, technology, and undefended population, became an ideal target.\nThe invasion was swift and overwhelming. Frost Force fleets descended upon the planet, their forces cutting through infrastructure and scattering resistance before it could even form. Cities that once stood as symbols of harmony were reduced to battlegrounds, and the Cerealians—unprepared for war—found themselves facing extinction. For the first time in their history, the people of Cereal were forced to confront a truth they had long avoided: peace alone could not protect them.</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483922654334554233/1483929736756592651","messageId":"1483929736756592651"},{"title":"⚔️ The Saiyan Intervention","html":"<div><span><h1>⚔️ The Saiyan Intervention</h1>At the height of the invasion, salvation arrived from an unlikely source—Sadala. A Saiyan force led by King Ziex, alongside Prince Azurik and General Boru, descended upon Cereal, not as conquerors, but as liberators.\nZiex, known for his ruthless reputation, brought with him overwhelming power and battlefield precision. Where the Cerealians lacked experience, the Saiyans brought instinct. Where the Frost Force relied on domination, the Saiyans countered with adaptability. The battle that followed reshaped the fate of the planet, as Saiyan warriors tore through Frostbyte’s forces while rallying the Cerealians to stand alongside them.\nAzurik, even then, stood apart. While Ziex led through strength, Azurik inspired through unity, encouraging the Cerealians to fight not as victims, but as defenders of their home. Boru, ever the strategist, ensured that the scattered resistance became coordinated, turning chaos into calculated retaliation. Together, they broke the invasion. And for the first time, Cereal fought back—and won.\n<h1>🌟 Aftermath — A Changed World</h1>Though the Frost Force was driven from the planet, the cost of victory was not easily forgotten. Cereal had survived, but it was no longer the same world it once was. The scars of invasion lingered—not just across its landscapes, but within its people.\nIn the years that followed, the Cerealians began to evolve. While they did not abandon their values, they adapted them. Defensive systems were implemented, not to wage war, but to ensure survival. Training programs emerged, blending their natural precision and intellect with basic combat awareness. For the first time, the Cerealians accepted that peace must be protected—not assumed.\nTheir relationship with Sadala also endured. What began as a rescue became a bond, rooted in shared experience and mutual respect. The Saiyans came to see Cereal not as weak, but as something different—something worth preserving. And the Cerealians, in turn, came to understand strength not as violence, but as necessity.</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483922654334554233/1483929865546633387","messageId":"1483929865546633387"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483922654334554233","art":"assets/art/world-planet-cereal.svg","wordCount":758},{"slug":"planet-dathomir","title":"Planet Dathomir","type":"Planet","excerpt":"🌑 Planet Dathomir — The Shadowed Cradle 🌑 From the earliest age of creation, Planet Dathomir has existed as a world steeped in hostility and shadow. Its skies burn with a permanent crimson twilight, casting the land in an unending dusk, while its surface is ca…","messages":[{"title":"🌑 Planet Dathomir — The Shadowed Cradle 🌑","html":"<div><span><h1>🌑 Planet Dathomir — The Shadowed Cradle 🌑</h1>From the earliest age of creation, Planet Dathomir has existed as a world steeped in hostility and shadow. Its skies burn with a permanent crimson twilight, casting the land in an unending dusk, while its surface is carved by jagged mountain ranges, suffocating swamps, and barren plains where survival is never guaranteed. The planet does not nurture life—it tests it. Every breath carries weight, every step invites danger, and every living thing exists in a constant struggle to endure.\nTo most civilizations, Dathomir is nothing more than a cursed world. But to two of the galaxy’s most powerful races, it was something far greater—it was their origin, their proving ground, and ultimately, their downfall.\n<h1>🦍 The Saiyans — Born of Conflict (Age 0–110)</h1>Long before Sadala, before their name echoed across the stars, the Saiyans were forged on Dathomir. The planet’s brutality shaped them into what they would become—warriors driven by instinct, hardened by constant battle, and strengthened through survival. Predators stalked them, storms crushed them, and the land itself resisted them, forcing the Saiyans to evolve through conflict alone.\nIt was here that the first clans unified under King Azanek, the First King of the Saiyans. Azanek was not simply a ruler—he was the embodiment of dominance, a warrior whose strength and will forged order from chaos. Under his reign, the Saiyans evolved from scattered survivors into a structured warrior race, their culture rooted in strength, loyalty, and conquest. Dathomir became their throne, and for a time, it seemed nothing could challenge them.\n<h1>🐺 The Maoians — Keepers of Balance</h1>But the Saiyans were not alone. Alongside them lived the Maoians, a race of discipline, grace, and calculated strength. Where Saiyans embraced raw power, the Maoians pursued mastery—refining their abilities through balance, precision, and unity. Their society, led by Pharaoh Beroos, was built on respect and growth rather than domination, fostering warriors who were as intelligent as they were powerful.\nThe Maoians were divided into two natural paths: the swift and strategic Sphinxians, and the resilient and adaptive Anubians. Together, they formed a society that valued competition without destruction, discipline without oppression. For a time, they coexisted with the Saiyans in a fragile equilibrium, each respecting the strength of the other, yet never truly aligned.\n<h1>⚔️ The War That Ended a World</h1>That fragile balance would not last. As both civilizations expanded, territorial disputes ignited into a war that consumed the entire planet. The Saiyans, driven by conquest and survival, sought dominance over Dathomir, while the Maoians fought to preserve their lands and way of life. What began as conflict quickly escalated into annihilation.\nThe war reshaped Dathomir into something unrecognizable. Forests burned into ash, plains became graveyards, and entire regions collapsed under the weight of constant battle. Neither side could claim victory, yet neither would yield. The Saiyans grew stronger through the conflict, but the Maoians adapted just as quickly, matching force with precision, aggression with strategy.\nIn the end, Dathomir itself began to fail. The planet, unable to withstand the destruction, became unstable—its ecosystems collapsing, its surface scarred beyond recovery. Civilization fell not because one side won, but because the world itself could no longer support them.</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483922443927027873/1483927627520544858","messageId":"1483927627520544858"},{"title":"🌑 Aftermath — A World Left Behind","html":"<div><span><h1>🌑 Aftermath — A World Left Behind</h1>With their home collapsing around them, both races were forced into exile. The Saiyans scattered across the stars, eventually finding their way to Kythera—what would become Sadala. The Maoians, led by Pharaoh Beroos, endured and remained tied to Dathomir, refusing to abandon their origin despite its ruin.\nOver time, Dathomir transformed from a world of civilization into a world of remnants. The echoes of war still linger in its lands, its atmosphere heavy with the energy of countless battles fought and lives lost. What was once a cradle of two great races became a graveyard of their shared history.\n<h1>🩸 The Vampyric Reign</h1>In time, Dathomir would not remain empty. From beyond, the progenitors of the Vampyre race arrived, led by Queen Lamae. Recognizing the planet’s nature as one of suffering, endurance, and darkness, they chose it not as a conquest—but as a home. Rather than destroy what remained, Lamae formed a pact with Pharaoh Beroos, establishing a rare co-rule between Vampyre and Maoian.\nUnder this rule, Dathomir was reshaped once more—not into a place of life, but into a place of purpose. The Vampyres embraced the planet’s cursed nature, building their society within its shadows, while the Maoians endured alongside them, maintaining their traditions even in a world forever changed.</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483922443927027873/1483927733351481365","messageId":"1483927733351481365"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483922443927027873","art":"assets/art/world-planet-dathomir.svg","wordCount":756},{"slug":"planet-earth","title":"Planet Earth","type":"Planet","excerpt":"🌍 Planet Earth — The Silent Power of the Cosmos 🌍 Planet Earth is often underestimated. To many across the universe, it appears to be a world of ordinary life—sprawling cities, diverse cultures, and civilizations that lack the overwhelming power of warrior rac…","messages":[{"title":"🌍 Planet Earth — The Silent Power of the Cosmos 🌍","html":"<div><span><h1>🌍 Planet Earth — The Silent Power of the Cosmos 🌍</h1>Planet Earth is often underestimated. To many across the universe, it appears to be a world of ordinary life—sprawling cities, diverse cultures, and civilizations that lack the overwhelming power of warrior races like the Saiyans or the imperial dominance of the Arcosians. Yet beneath that surface lies one of the most dangerous truths in the cosmos: Earth does not produce power easily, but when it does, it produces it without limit. Its people are not born with greatness—they grow into it, shaping themselves through hardship, discipline, and innovation in ways few other races can replicate.\nBy Age 1,737, Earth has evolved into a nexus of culture, trade, and steady advancement. Its technological level sits in a unique position—not the most advanced in the universe, but among the most adaptable. Capsule technology allows for compact storage of massive objects, gravity-based training systems push warriors beyond natural limits, and experimental energy systems continue to blur the line between science and Ki. Rather than relying purely on technological superiority, Earth has developed a hybrid approach, combining human ingenuity with martial evolution, allowing even ordinary individuals to rise into something extraordinary over time.\n<h1>⚔️ The Kaizokian Invasion</h1>Earth’s place in the cosmos was not secured through peaceful growth alone. In Age 634, a Kaizokian King—whose name has long since faded into obscurity—set his sights on Earth, viewing it not as an equal, but as a resource to be claimed. His forces descended upon the planet with overwhelming technological superiority, bringing augmented warriors, advanced weaponry, and strategies designed for total domination. By all expectations, Earth should have fallen quickly, lacking the raw power and military structure to resist such an invasion.\nBut what the Kaizokians failed to account for was Mutaito. Rising as Earth’s first true protector, he redefined what it meant to fight. Where others relied on brute force, Mutaito saw combat as a system—one that could be controlled, redirected, and ultimately overcome. Through mastery of martial arts, elemental bending, and spiritual attunement, he turned Earth itself into a weapon, using terrain, movement, and precision to dismantle a force far beyond humanity’s level. His victory was not just survival—it was a statement that Earth would not fall quietly.\n<h1>🔥 Mutaito’s Legacy</h1>Despite his victory, Mutaito understood that Earth had merely survived—not secured its future. Rather than ruling or building an army, he chose to create something far more enduring: a legacy. He trained a select group of disciples, each embodying different aspects of his philosophy, ensuring that his teachings would persist beyond his lifetime. Some would leave Earth, spreading his influence across the stars, while others remained, reinforcing the planet’s foundation.\nAmong those who stayed, Selena Kyoshi rose as his true successor. After Mutaito’s passing, she refined his teachings into the Dragon School, a system centered on balance between instinct, discipline, and spirit. Under her guidance, Earth’s martial culture evolved into one of the most complete in the universe—not focused on overwhelming strength, but on adaptability, precision, and control. Through her, Earth retained not just its defenses, but its identity.</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483922307087994902/1483926230557528064","messageId":"1483926230557528064"},{"title":"The Jinago Among Humanity","html":"<div><span><h1>⚡ The Jinago Among Humanity</h1>Beneath Earth’s visible growth lies another truth—one far less understood. Among its population exists the Jinago, individuals indistinguishable from ordinary humans, yet possessing immense and often unstable power. Born from generations of mutation and adaptation, they represent an evolution of humanity that defies natural limits. Their existence has long been a source of fear, as their power can rival that of off-world warriors despite their human appearance.\nOver time, however, the Jinago have become an accepted—though closely watched—part of Earth’s society. Through the lineage of Lord Pocu and his connection to Queen Sarai, their presence has reached even the highest levels of leadership. No longer outcasts, they now stand as both protectors and reminders of what humanity is capable of becoming when pushed beyond its limits.</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483922307087994902/1483926247347191898","messageId":"1483926247347191898"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483922307087994902","art":"assets/art/world-planet-earth.svg","wordCount":648},{"slug":"planet-kaizoku","title":"Planet Kaizoku","type":"Planet","excerpt":"🌍 Planet Kaizoku — Legacy of Innovation & Fallen Divinity 🌍 Nestled beneath emerald-lit skies, Planet Kaizoku is a world of vast oceans, dense forests, and floating landmasses shaped by both natural beauty and engineered design. It stands today as one of the m…","messages":[{"title":"🌍 Planet Kaizoku — Legacy of Innovation & Fallen Divinity 🌍","html":"<div><span><h1>🌍 Planet Kaizoku — Legacy of Innovation &amp; Fallen Divinity 🌍</h1>Nestled beneath emerald-lit skies, Planet Kaizoku is a world of vast oceans, dense forests, and floating landmasses shaped by both natural beauty and engineered design. It stands today as one of the most advanced and culturally unified planets in the known universe—but it was not always so. Kaizoku was once a fractured world, divided between three dominant clans: the Hera, Heeter, and Brench, each embodying a different path of power.\nThe Hera thrived on strength and conquest, building their dominance through sheer combat ability. The Heeter pursued knowledge, blending early technology with arcane practices to gain advantage through innovation. The Brench, refined and charismatic, positioned themselves as leaders and diplomats, valuing influence and control over brute force. For centuries, these three factions waged relentless war in what became known as the Tri-War, reducing Kaizoku’s once-thriving ecosystems into scarred battlegrounds and pushing the planet toward collapse.\n<h1>⚔️ The Tri-War &amp; The Rise of King Jorka</h1>The endless conflict would not last forever. From within the chaos emerged a figure who would change the course of Kaizoku’s history—Jorka, a child of the Hera clan. Born into war, Jorka was shaped by it, but unlike those before him, he saw beyond it. Possessing both immense strength and rare clarity, he united warriors, thinkers, and outcasts from all three clans under a single cause: ending the cycle of destruction.\nAt only ten years old, Jorka led a rebellion that dismantled the old powers. General Vrahk fell to his own arrogance, Chieftess Zyma’s ambitions collapsed under the weight of unity, and High Lord Salthis’ influence fractured as his people turned away from isolation. Through decisive action and unyielding resolve, Jorka achieved what none before him could—he unified Kaizoku.\nNow, over two centuries into his reign, King Jorka stands as a living symbol of that unity. Under his rule, the Hera became defenders rather than conquerors, the Heeter refined their craft into world-shaping innovation, and the Brench evolved into true leaders of diplomacy. The scars of the Tri-War remain etched into the planet, but they serve as reminders—not of failure, but of what unity overcame.\n<h1>⚙️ A Civilization of Innovation &amp; Adaptation</h1>Modern Kaizoku is one of the most technologically advanced planets in existence, rivaling even the greatest scientific civilizations. Cities stretch across oceans and float above forests, powered by advanced energy cores and stabilized by gravitational manipulation systems. Starships, trade routes, and interstellar communication networks are commonplace, making Kaizoku a major hub for both commerce and technological exchange.\nWhat sets Kaizoku apart, however, is not just its technology—but how it is used. Kaizokians do not rely solely on machinery. Instead, they integrate technology with energy manipulation and refined combat systems, creating a society where science enhances the individual rather than replacing them. This philosophy stems from their past, ensuring that no single path—strength, intellect, or influence—dominates the others again.</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483922386695749683/1483926977105887474","messageId":"1483926977105887474"},{"title":"🌿 Echoes of the Glind — A Forgotten Origin","html":"<div><span><h1>🌿 Echoes of the Glind — A Forgotten Origin</h1>Beneath Kaizoku’s progress lies a truth known only to a select few: its people were not always as they are now. Long ago, the ancestors of the Kaizokians were something far greater—beings deeply connected to magic, born from sacred sources tied to the very fabric of creation. These early beings, now remembered only in fragments of myth, once possessed abilities far beyond what modern Kaizokians can naturally achieve.\nOver time, that connection faded. Through exile, adaptation, and generations of change, the race evolved—losing their immortality and innate magical dominance, but gaining something else in its place: ingenuity. Where they once shaped reality through spirit alone, they now build, design, and innovate.\nYet the past is not entirely gone. On rare occasions, individuals are born with ancient lineage awakened, displaying a natural affinity for spirit control and energy manipulation far beyond their peers. These individuals are often seen as anomalies… or omens—living reminders that Kaizoku was not just a world of invention, but once a cradle of something far more divine.</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483922386695749683/1483926978892398663","messageId":"1483926978892398663"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483922386695749683","art":"assets/art/world-planet-kaizoku.svg","wordCount":664},{"slug":"planet-namek","title":"Planet Namek","type":"Planet","excerpt":"🌌 Planet Namek — The Children of Zalama 🌌 Before Planet Namek ever existed, the Namekians were born within the depths of the Makyo Realm, on a sacred world known as Nomakia. This was no ordinary planet, but a place saturated with the essence of Zalama himself,…","messages":[{"title":"Planet Namek — The Children of Zalama","html":"<div><span><h1>🌌 Planet Namek — The Children of Zalama 🌌</h1>Before Planet Namek ever existed, the Namekians were born within the depths of the Makyo Realm, on a sacred world known as Nomakia. This was no ordinary planet, but a place saturated with the essence of Zalama himself, where life did not simply evolve—it was formed with purpose. Every Namekian carried a fragment of that divine will, giving them an innate connection to magic, creation, and balance.\nNomakia was a world of stillness amidst chaos. While the Makyo Realm churned with volatile energy and ambition, Nomakia stood apart as a place of harmony, where the Namekians cultivated knowledge, spirit, and restraint. Their society was guided not by conquest, but by understanding. Elders taught that power was not meant to dominate, but to create, preserve, and guide.\nBut peace cannot exist untouched in a realm like Makyo. Over time, the surrounding Majin—driven by ambition and hunger for power—began to turn their attention toward Nomakia. What they saw was not a peaceful people, but a resource. A race tied directly to Zalama’s essence… something to be controlled, or consumed.\n<h1>⚔️ The Schism — Birth of the Demon King</h1>As tensions grew, so too did division among the Namekians themselves. While most sought to preserve their way of life, one among them chose a different path. His name was Kilos. Kilos was not separate from the Namekians—he was one of them, born from the same essence, carrying the same connection to Zalama. But where others felt harmony, he felt potential. Where others saw balance, he saw limitation. Drawn to the chaotic energies of the Makyo Realm, Kilos embraced what his people rejected.\nIn time, he would become something far more than a Namekian. He became the progenitor of the Demon Clan, reshaping himself and those who followed him into beings fueled by dominance and power. Declaring himself the Demon King, Kilos established his rule over Nomakia, turning the sacred world into something darker—a place where Zalama’s essence was no longer used for creation, but for control. To the Namekians, this was not just betrayal. It was a fracture of their very existence.\n<h1>🚶 The Exodus — A People Divided</h1>Faced with the rise of Kilos and the growing influence of the Majin, the Namekians were forced into an impossible decision. To remain was to either submit or be consumed. To leave was to abandon their origin—the very world they were born from.\nUnder the guidance of Grand Elder Lokai, the Namekians chose exile. They departed the Makyo Realm, carrying with them only what they could preserve—knowledge, tradition, and the will of Zalama that still burned within them. Their journey into the Mortal Realm was not one of conquest, but survival. Nomakia was left behind… but not abandoned. It remained, now under the rule of Kilos, a constant reminder of what the Namekians had lost—and what they could have become.</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483922771510558840/1483931115004756059","messageId":"1483931115004756059"},{"title":"🌍 The Birth of Namek","html":"<div><span><h1>🌍 The Birth of Namek</h1>In the vastness of the Mortal Realm, the Namekians discovered a world untouched by conflict. A planet rich with life, open skies, and fertile lands. They named it Namek, not as a replacement for Nomakia, but as a continuation of their existence.\nHere, they began again. Under Lokai’s leadership, Namek became a sanctuary—a world where their connection to Zalama could flourish without corruption. The planet itself seemed to respond to them, its ecosystems aligning naturally with their spiritual energy. Vast fields, calm waters, and towering trees became symbols of a life rebuilt from loss.\nRather than replicate what they had lost, the Namekians chose to evolve. Their society formed around purpose rather than hierarchy, dividing naturally into two paths: those who would create, and those who would protect.\n<h1>🐉 The Clans of Purpose</h1>The Dragon Clan emerged as the spiritual heart of Namek. These Namekians devoted themselves to wisdom, creation, and the deeper mysteries of their existence. From this path came one of their greatest achievements—the Dragon Balls, artifacts born from their connection to Zalama, capable of reshaping reality itself. These were not tools of power, but symbols of responsibility, entrusted only to those who understood their weight.\nThe Warrior Clan, by contrast, embodied the will to defend. While Namek was peaceful, its people were not defenseless. Warrior Namekians trained not for conquest, but to ensure that what happened on Nomakia would never happen again. Their strength was tempered by discipline, their purpose rooted in protection rather than domination. Together, these clans formed a balance—creation and defense, wisdom and strength—reflecting the duality within Zalama’s own will.\n<h1>🌑 The Shadow of Nomakia</h1>Though Namek flourished, Nomakia was never forgotten. Stories of Kilos and the Demon Clan were passed down through generations, not as myths, but as warnings. The Namekians understood that the same power that allowed them to create could also be used to destroy.\nKilos himself became something more than a distant ruler. He became a symbol—the embodiment of what happens when power is pursued without balance. As the self-proclaimed Demon King, his influence spread through the Makyo Realm, and whispers of his existence reached even Namek. To this day, the connection remains. Namekians and Demon Clan Namekians are not separate species—they are two paths born from the same origin. Two halves of a truth that neither side can fully escape.</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483922771510558840/1483931339093704764","messageId":"1483931339093704764"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483922771510558840","art":"assets/art/world-planet-namek.svg","wordCount":881},{"slug":"planet-plant","title":"Planet Plant","type":"Planet","excerpt":"🌍 Planet Plant — A World of Renewal & Duality 🌍 Planet Plant stands as one of the most unique worlds in the universe—not because of its power, but because of its origin. It is not a world born of a single people, nor shaped by a single ideology, but one forged…","messages":[{"title":"🌍 Planet Plant — A World of Renewal & Duality 🌍","html":"<div><span><h1>🌍 Planet Plant — A World of Renewal &amp; Duality 🌍</h1>Planet Plant stands as one of the most unique worlds in the universe—not because of its power, but because of its origin. It is not a world born of a single people, nor shaped by a single ideology, but one forged from exile, survival, and unlikely unity. Beneath its vibrant skies and advanced cities lies a history rooted in loss, as it became the refuge of a civilization that had lost everything.\nThe Tuffles, once rulers of Planet Kythera, were a people defined by intellect, innovation, and cultural refinement. For centuries, they thrived as one of the most advanced civilizations in the cosmos, building vast cities and advancing technology far beyond their time. But their golden age came to an end with the rise of the Saiyans. What began as coexistence turned into tension, and tension into war. By Age 1,200, after a century of conflict, the Saiyans claimed Kythera—renaming it Sadala—and the Tuffles were forced into exile.\nWith their home lost and their people nearly wiped out, the Tuffles fled into the void, carrying only fragments of their once-great civilization. What they found was a new world—untouched, resource-rich, and seemingly uninhabited. They named it Planet Plant, both in honor of their fallen General Plant and as a symbol of regrowth after devastation.\n<h1>🔮 The Hidden Inhabitants — The Genies</h1>What the Tuffles did not know was that Planet Plant was not truly empty. Long before their arrival, another race had already claimed it—the Genies. Having fled the Makyo Realm at the dawn of the age, the Genies sought a world where they could exist freely, away from the chains that once bound them. They found that world in Plant, then a barren and lifeless planet.\nThrough their very nature, the Genies reshaped it. Deserts bloomed into forests, oceans returned where there had been none, and the land itself became infused with living magic. Their cities rose not through construction, but through will—crystalline structures that shifted and evolved as they did. To them, Plant was not just a home, but a canvas—proof of their freedom and their ability to create without restraint.\nWhen the Tuffles arrived, they could not sense the Genies at all. Unlike other races, the Genies did not rely on Ki, but on a deeper, more chaotic magical essence, rendering them effectively invisible to conventional detection. It was only through time—and eventual discovery—that the two civilizations became aware of one another.\n<h1>🤝 The Co-Rule of Casuran &amp; Aboo</h1>What followed could have been another war. Instead, it became something far rarer—coexistence. Under the leadership of King Casuran of the Tuffles and Lord Aboo of the Genies, Planet Plant entered an era unlike any other. Rather than competing for dominance, the two leaders recognized the potential of unity. The Tuffles brought structure, logic, and technological brilliance, while the Genies embodied creativity, magic, and limitless transformation.\nTogether, they established a dual-rule system, where neither race ruled over the other, but both shaped the planet’s future side by side. Tuffle cities expanded with precision and efficiency, powered by advanced energy systems and engineered infrastructure, while Genie domains remained fluid and ever-changing, bending reality itself into art and function.\nThis balance turned Planet Plant into something extraordinary—a world where science and magic coexist, where rigid structure meets endless possibility, and where two fundamentally different civilizations thrive without erasing one another.</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483922508720766986/1483928536824811520","messageId":"1483928536824811520"},{"title":"⚙️ A Hub of Innovation — Sovatski Tech","html":"<div><span><h1>⚙️ A Hub of Innovation — Sovatski Tech</h1>As Plant stabilized, it quickly grew into a center of technological advancement, rivaling even the greatest civilizations of the past. At the heart of this rise was Sovatski Tech, founded by the brilliant twin sisters Lydia and Vera Sovatski. Their work pushed the limits of what Tuffle technology could achieve, blending advanced engineering with experimental energy systems that reshaped daily life on the planet.\nTheir innovations revolutionized everything from infrastructure to combat, attracting investors, travelers, and opportunists from across the cosmos. Plant became not just a home, but a destination—a place where ideas were currency and progress moved at an unmatched pace.\nYet brilliance came with consequence. Their greatest creation, the cyborg androids Veronica and Vector, blurred the line between life and machine, sparking ethical division even among their own people. Lydia’s ambitions grew darker, seeing these creations as tools for domination, while Vera pushed forward with unchecked innovation. Though the sisters’ paths diverged, their legacy remains embedded in the planet itself—progress that walks the edge between advancement and danger.</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483922508720766986/1483928595666698432","messageId":"1483928595666698432"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483922508720766986","art":"assets/art/world-planet-plant.svg","wordCount":748},{"slug":"planet-sadala","title":"Planet Sadala","type":"Planet","excerpt":"🌍 Planet Sadala — The Warrior’s Evolution 🌍 Long before it was known as Sadala, the planet bore the name Kythera, a world ruled by the brilliant and technologically unmatched Tuffles. Their civilization stood as one of the most advanced of its time, defined by…","messages":[{"title":"🌍 Planet Sadala — The Warrior’s Evolution 🌍","html":"<div><span><h1>🌍 Planet Sadala — The Warrior’s Evolution 🌍</h1>Long before it was known as Sadala, the planet bore the name Kythera, a world ruled by the brilliant and technologically unmatched Tuffles. Their civilization stood as one of the most advanced of its time, defined by innovation, structure, and diplomacy. Vast cities of metal and light stretched across the surface, powered by planetary energy grids and defended by automated systems that ensured stability and control. Under rulers such as Cretos I, Virelia, Thalen, Orvex, and Zalyra, Kythera became a beacon of progress—a world where intellect governed and order prevailed.\nThe Tuffles did not seek conquest, but preservation. Their strength lay in preparation, strategy, and the belief that knowledge could outpace brute force. Yet even in their golden age, change was already taking root. From beyond their world came a race forged in hardship—the Saiyans—whose arrival would begin the slow unraveling of everything Kythera had built.\n<h1>🦍 The Saiyan Arrival — Strength in Silence</h1>Following the fall of Dathomir, the Saiyans arrived on Kythera as survivors, led by King Rovan and the remnants of their people. At first, they lived under Tuffle oversight, allowed to settle and rebuild so long as they remained controlled. For generations, the Saiyans adapted, growing in number and strength while maintaining their warrior traditions beneath the surface.\nThrough successive kings—Rovan, Teryk, Veyrus, Dravos, and Korvak—the Saiyans transformed from scattered refugees into a unified people once more. They built their own strongholds, trained relentlessly, and preserved their identity even within a system that was not their own. To the Tuffles, they were manageable. To themselves, they were waiting. By Age 1,000, that waiting ended.\n<h1>⚔️ King Sadala — The War That Changed Everything</h1>With the rise of King Sadala, the Saiyans claimed their destiny. No longer content to exist beneath another civilization, Sadala led his people into open conflict, igniting the Saiyan–Tuffle War. What followed was not a simple battle, but a century-long struggle between two opposing ideologies—technology versus instinct, control versus evolution.\nThe Tuffles fought with precision, strategy, and advanced weaponry, pushing the Saiyans to their limits. But the Saiyans possessed something the Tuffles could not replicate—the ability to grow stronger through battle itself. With every loss, they adapted. With every defeat, they returned stronger.\nBy Age 1,200, the war reached its end. The Tuffles were forced into exile, fleeing the planet they once ruled, and Kythera was reborn under a new name: Sadala. The Saiyans had claimed their home, not through inheritance, but through survival and conquest.</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483922549153861753/1483929007308275743","messageId":"1483929007308275743"},{"title":"The Age of Kings — Growth, Power, and Division","html":"<div><span><h1>🔥 The Age of Kings — Growth, Power, and Division</h1>With Sadala now under Saiyan rule, a new era began—one defined by both progress and internal struggle. King Azarth, known as the Titan of the Skies, sought to elevate Sadala beyond its war-torn beginnings, pushing for exploration and interstellar expansion while encouraging diplomacy alongside strength. His reign marked the first time Saiyans looked outward not just as conquerors, but as participants in a larger universe.\nHis successor, King Zarnok, shifted that vision inward. Focused on structure and power, he formalized Saiyan society, building a rigid hierarchy based on strength and establishing systems that turned Sadala into a disciplined warrior state. While his rule made the Saiyans stronger than ever, it also deepened divisions within their people, placing power above unity.\nThose divisions came to a head under King Ziex, whose reign pushed Sadala into one of its darkest periods. Known as the Shadow King, Ziex embraced expansion and control without restraint, draining the planet’s resources and fueling internal unrest. His rule demonstrated the full danger of Saiyan nature when left unchecked—power without balance, ambition without direction.\n<h1>👑 King Azurik — The New Era</h1>Following the turmoil of Ziex’s reign, King Azurik ascended as a force of change. Where previous rulers leaned into conquest or control, Azurik sought something different—balance. He recognized that strength alone was not enough to sustain Sadala’s future, and that the cycle of war and division would eventually consume the planet if left unbroken.\nThrough diplomacy, Azurik reestablished contact with the surviving Tuffles, most notably forming an alliance with King Casuran of Planet Plant. This marked a turning point not just for Sadala, but for both races. Where there had once been war, there was now cooperation. Tuffle technology and Saiyan strength began to complement one another, reshaping Sadala into a more advanced and unified world.\nUnder Azurik’s rule, cities were rebuilt, ecosystems restored, and a cultural renaissance began. Saiyans were no longer defined solely by battle, but by growth, exploration, and identity. Strength remained central to their nature—but it was no longer their only path.</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483922549153861753/1483929158500487440","messageId":"1483929158500487440"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483922549153861753","art":"assets/art/world-planet-sadala.svg","wordCount":770},{"slug":"tenkaichi-island","title":"Tenkaichi Island","type":"Landmark","excerpt":"🌍 Tenkaichi Island — The Eternal Arena 🌍 Drifting within the vast expanse between star systems lies Tenkaichi Island, a colossal, self-contained world created not for life—but for conflict. Though called an “island,” its scale rivals that of small planets, its…","messages":[{"title":"🌍 Tenkaichi Island — The Eternal Arena 🌍","html":"<div><span><h1>🌍 Tenkaichi Island — The Eternal Arena 🌍</h1>Drifting within the vast expanse between star systems lies Tenkaichi Island, a colossal, self-contained world created not for life—but for conflict. Though called an “island,” its scale rivals that of small planets, its surface stretching endlessly with shifting environments and boundless arenas. It does not orbit a star, nor belong to any system. It exists independently, suspended in space as if placed there with intention… and purpose.\nForged in an ancient age by the Supreme Kais, Tenkaichi Island was never meant to be a place of destruction, but a solution to it. Rather than allowing wars to ravage entire worlds, the Kais created a neutral ground where strength could be tested and disputes could be settled without collateral devastation. Every inch of the island was imbued with divine energy, ensuring that no battle—no matter how catastrophic—could tear it apart. Even after the fall of the Kais, the island endured. Untethered. Unclaimed. Unbroken.\n<h1>🌀 The Living Battlefield</h1>Tenkaichi Island is not static—it is alive in function, constantly reshaping itself to challenge those who step upon it. One moment, fighters may stand upon a vast stone arena beneath open skies. The next, the world shifts—turning into volcanic fields, frozen wastelands, dense jungles, or endless oceans.\nThese transformations are not random. They are responsive, designed to push combatants beyond simple strength. Adaptability, awareness, and creativity become just as important as power. The island does not favor any one style of fighter—it forces all who enter to confront their limits.\nAt its core lies a deeper function. The energy woven into the island suppresses techniques that would destabilize reality itself. Abilities that would normally shatter planets or distort dimensions are regulated, ensuring that victory is determined not by overwhelming force alone, but by mastery. On Tenkaichi Island… power is tested, not unleashed recklessly.\n<h1>⚔️ The Galactic Tenkaichi</h1>At the heart of the island’s purpose lies the Galactic Tenkaichi Tournament, a recurring event that draws warriors from every corner of existence. Held on a universal cycle, it is more than a competition—it is a proving ground where reputations are forged and legends are born. Fighters do not come here lightly. Some arrive seeking glory. Others seek validation. And some come simply to see where they stand in a universe filled with beings far stronger than themselves.\nThe tournament is structured, but never predictable. Each match takes place within a different environment, forcing competitors to adapt in real time. Strength alone is rarely enough to claim victory—strategy, endurance, and mental discipline often decide the outcome long before the final blow is struck. To win the Tenkaichi is to be recognized across the galaxy. To lose… is often the beginning of something greater.\n<h1>🦜 The Varga — Keepers of the Arena</h1>Overseeing the island are the Varga, an enigmatic race whose presence predates most modern civilizations. Avian in form and highly advanced, they serve as the guardians and organizers of the Tenkaichi, maintaining both its structure and its integrity.\nThe Varga do not rule the island—they preserve it. Their role is to ensure fairness, to enforce the rules of engagement, and to protect both fighters and spectators from unintended consequences. Their technology, combined with their understanding of the island’s ancient energies, allows them to manage an arena that should by all means be uncontrollable.\nThey are also responsible for selecting participants. Invitations are not requested—they are given. Those deemed worthy receive a call, often in the form of a crystalline signal that resonates with their spirit. To ignore it is possible… but few ever do.</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483922723775447120/1484003436755419308","messageId":"1484003436755419308"},{"title":"🏛️ The Hall of Champions","html":"<div><span><h1>🏛️ The Hall of Champions</h1>At the center of Tenkaichi Island stands a structure untouched by the shifting terrain—the Hall of Champions. This immense monument records the names of every victor who has claimed the title of Tenkaichi Champion.\nEach name etched into its surface carries weight. Not just as a mark of victory, but as proof that, at one moment in time, that individual stood above all others. For many fighters, this hall is not just a destination—it is a goal that defines their journey. To have your name inscribed is to become part of something eternal.\n<h1>🌌 More Than a Battlefield</h1>Despite its purpose, Tenkaichi Island is not solely a place of combat. Between tournaments, it becomes a crossroads for cultures across the galaxy. Fighters, merchants, scholars, and spectators gather here, exchanging knowledge, forming alliances, and observing the ever-evolving hierarchy of power within the universe. It is one of the few places where enemies can stand side by side without war—if only temporarily. The island demands it.</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483922723775447120/1484003543441477702","messageId":"1484003543441477702"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483922723775447120","art":"assets/art/world-tenkaichi-island.svg","wordCount":765},{"slug":"universal-origin","title":"Universal Origin","type":"Origin","excerpt":"🌑 The Makyo Realm: Cradle of Creation 🌑 Before light pierced the void, before time could be measured or named, there existed only the Makyo Realm — an endless expanse of chaotic energy, where creation and destruction coiled together as one. It was not a place …","messages":[{"title":"🌑 The Makyo Realm: Cradle of Creation 🌑","html":"<div><span><h1>🌑 The Makyo Realm: Cradle of Creation 🌑</h1>Before light pierced the void, before time could be measured or named, there existed only the Makyo Realm — an endless expanse of chaotic energy, where creation and destruction coiled together as one. It was not a place of order, but of raw existence itself, where reality had yet to decide what it would become.\nFrom this storm of boundless power, four primordial beings emerged — not born, but formed from the very essence of the realm itself:\n<ul><li>Zeno, the Super Majin of Destruction, whose childlike presence concealed a power capable of unraveling existence with a mere thought.</li><li>Rymus, the Super Majin of Creation, whose will gave shape to the void and breathed form into the formless.</li><li>Daishinkan, the perfect mediator, forged to maintain balance between creation and destruction, ensuring neither force consumed the other.</li><li>Zalama, the Supreme Majin King, the first true ruler — a being who did not merely exist within the Makyo Realm, but sought to command it.</li></ul>Where Zeno destroyed and Rymus created, Zalama envisioned dominion. He saw beyond the Makyo Realm — beyond chaos — and desired an empire that would stretch across realities yet to be born.\nThus, at Zalama’s command, Rymus began shaping the first universes, while Zeno tempered them through destruction. This eternal cycle became the foundation of existence itself — the rhythm by which the multiverse would expand, collapse, and evolve.\n<ul><li><strong>🌀 The First Creations 🌀</strong></li></ul><ul><li>From Rymus’ hand, life emerged — not as a single race, but as many forms of existence shaped by different aspects of the Makyo Realm. Though all shared a common origin, they diverged in purpose, nature, and destiny. The earliest of these were the Majin, beings of fluid form and boundless potential. They were not bound to one nature — some sought joy, others knowledge, others power — their existence shaped by will rather than design.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>From among them arose distinct lineages:</strong><ul><li>✨ The Glind, rare beings born directly from Rymus’s refined essence. Deeply attuned to magic and spirit, they stood apart from other Majin, eventually becoming the first Supreme Kais, tasked with overseeing creation itself.</li></ul><ul><li>🔮 The Genies, born from Zeno’s chaotic essence, shaped and stabilized by Rymus. They embodied raw magical potential, their existence unpredictable and ever-shifting, tied more to magic than to physical law.</li></ul><ul><li>🌿 The Namekians, formed when Zalama infused fragments of his own essence into creation. They became vessels of balance, wisdom, and arcane power — each carrying a fragment of his will.</li></ul><ul><li>🌓 The Kanassans, a lesser-known Majin subspecies, gifted with the rare ability to perceive the threads of fate. They served the Glind as seers and attendants, offering glimpses into futures yet to unfold in exchange for protection and survival.</li></ul></li></ul>Though different in form and purpose, all of these beings were, at their core, children of the Makyo Realm — fragments of its endless energy given shape.\n<s>═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════</s>\n<h1>⚖️ The First Order</h1>As creation spread beyond the Makyo Realm into newly formed universes, structure became necessary. The Glind were chosen to lead this expansion. Elevated as Supreme Kais, they were entrusted with nurturing life, guiding civilizations, and maintaining the balance of growth. Lesser Glind served beneath them as guardians and overseers of sectors across reality.\n<ul><li>Alongside them rose two figures whose existence would shape the cosmos itself:\n<ul><li>Akatosh, a being of wisdom, patience, and cosmic understanding.</li></ul><ul><li>Roak, a warrior spirit, embodying will, strength, and resolve.</li></ul></li></ul>Together, they acted as stewards of balance — not rulers, but watchers — ensuring that creation and destruction remained in harmony as the multiverse expanded. For a time, this system held.</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483917072437084161/1483918729396879412","messageId":"1483918729396879412"},{"title":"The Fracturing of Makyo","html":"<div><span><s>═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════</s>\n<h1>🌌 The Fracturing of Makyo 🌌</h1>Peace within the Makyo Realm did not last. As lesser Majin grew in number and power, unrest began to spread. Many rejected the authority of the Glind, viewing their elevated status as unjust. The same resentment extended toward the Genies, whose chaotic nature and unique abilities set them apart.\nWhat began as tension became upheaval. Driven by this uprising, both the Glind and the Genies were forced from the Makyo Realm.\nThe Genies, seeking refuge, departed into the Mortal Realm at Age 0, eventually settling upon Planet Plant, where their magic allowed them to exist unseen by those who relied solely on Ki.\nThe Glind, stripped from their position of power, scattered across the cosmos. Some continued their duties as Kais, while others withdrew entirely. Those who settled upon a distant world would, over generations, lose their immortality and divine connection — becoming what are now known as the Kaizokians. This transformation was not immediate, but gradual — a slow fading of divinity into mortality. Yet traces of their origin remain. On rare occasions, a Kaizokian is born with ancient Glind blood, granting them an unnatural affinity for magic and spirit from birth.\nThe Kanassans, once sustained under the protection of the Glind, could not survive their absence. Without their patrons, their fragile society collapsed. Their gift of foresight became a burden rather than a blessing, as they witnessed their own extinction without the power to prevent it.\nOver time, the Kanassans vanished entirely — leaving behind no surviving lineage, only whispers of a race that once saw the future… and could not escape it.\n<s>═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════</s>\n<h1>🌟 The Vanishing of the Primordials 🌟</h1>For eons, the four primordial beings governed existence. But as time stretched on, they disappeared — suddenly, and without explanation. Whether they fell, ascended, or sacrificed themselves remains unknown.\n<ul><li>In their absence:\n<ul><li>Sahloknir, a powerful Majin, rose to claim the title of Supreme Majin King, ruling over the Makyo Realm.</li></ul><ul><li>Kiru, a Glind of unmatched clarity, ascended as Grand Supreme Kai, restoring order among the Kais.</li></ul><ul><li>Akatosh and Roak inherited the will of Zalama, becoming unseen shepherds of the cosmos, maintaining balance from beyond direct rule.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🌟 The Super Dragon Balls 🌟</strong><ul><li>Before his disappearance, Zalama, with the guidance of Rymus, created the Super Dragon Balls — perfect vessels of cosmic energy capable of granting nearly any desire.</li></ul><ul><li>These artifacts were forged from the combined essence of creation, destruction, and Makyo itself.</li></ul></li></ul>When the primordial beings vanished, their power did not fade — it was passed on. The energy of the Super Dragon Balls, along with Zalama’s will, flowed into Akatosh and Roak, cementing them as eternal custodians of balance across the multiverse.\n<s>═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════</s>\n<h1>🌍 The Dawn of Civilizations 🌍</h1>With the structure of the cosmos stabilized, life began to flourish across countless worlds — each shaped by conflict, adaptation, and the lingering influence of divine origins. From these beginnings, the great civilizations of the modern era would rise…</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483917072437084161/1483918746090209414","messageId":"1483918746090209414"},{"title":"🌍 Planet Dathomir — World of Ruin & Shadow Once a world of harsh beauty and primal survival, Planet Dathomir stood as the bir","html":"<div><span><ul><li><strong>🌍 Planet Dathomir — World of Ruin &amp; Shadow</strong></li></ul>Once a world of harsh beauty and primal survival, Planet Dathomir stood as the birthplace of two powerful civilizations: the Saiyans and the Maoians. Though vastly different in philosophy, both races thrived under the planet’s unforgiving conditions. The Saiyans embraced strength and dominance, while the Maoians upheld balance, tradition, and connection to the land. For a time, this uneasy coexistence held… but it was never meant to last.\nAs both civilizations expanded, territorial disputes ignited into a devastating war that consumed the entire planet. Neither side would yield, and the conflict escalated until Dathomir itself began to collapse under the strain. Ecosystems were destroyed, lands rendered barren, and both races were pushed to the brink of extinction. In the end, there were no victors — only survivors scattered among the ruins.\nIn the aftermath, a new power emerged. The progenitors of the Vampyre race, led by Queen Lamae, arrived and struck a pact with the Maoian leader, Pharaoh Beroos. Together, they established a fragile co-rule over the broken world. Dathomir, once a battlefield of warriors and tradition, became a realm of darkness — a haunting reminder of what unchecked conflict leaves behind.\n<s>═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════</s><ul><li><strong>🌍 Planet Sadala — The Saiyan Throneworld</strong></li></ul>Once known as Kythera, Planet Sadala became the new home of the Saiyan race after their near extinction on Dathomir. Led by King Rovan and a surviving force of one thousand warriors, the Saiyans arrived as refugees, settling under the watchful eye of the technologically advanced Tuffles. Though they lived under Tuffle oversight, the Saiyans never abandoned their warrior identity, slowly rebuilding their strength across generations.\nOver time, their presence grew too powerful to remain contained. Under King Sadala, tensions erupted into the Saiyan–Tuffle War, a century-long conflict that reshaped the planet. The Saiyans, driven by their adaptability and ever-growing power, ultimately emerged victorious, forcing the Tuffles into exile. With their triumph, Kythera was renamed Sadala, marking the birth of the first true Saiyan empire.\nToday, Sadala stands as a world forged in battle and rebirth. Under King Azurik, the Saiyan people have begun to evolve beyond their brutal past, embracing both strength and unity. Yet beneath this new era lies a legacy of war, ambition, and survival — one that continues to define what it means to be Saiyan.\n<s>═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════</s><ul><li><strong>🌍 Planet Plant — Nexus of Magic &amp; Innovation</strong></li></ul>Planet Plant is a world unlike any other — a place where advanced technology and raw magic exist side by side. Long before the arrival of the Tuffles, the planet was inhabited by the Genies, beings of chaotic magical essence who had fled the Makyo Realm at the dawn of the age. Their presence remained hidden, as their power did not rely on Ki, rendering them undetectable to most forms of perception.\nWhen the exiled Tuffles arrived, believing the planet to be uninhabited, they soon discovered the truth. Rather than descend into conflict, the two civilizations chose cooperation. Under the leadership of King Casuran and Lord Aboo, a peaceful co-rule was established — a rare and powerful alliance between science and magic.\nThis union transformed Planet Plant into a hub of innovation and mystery. Tuffle ingenuity shaped its cities and infrastructure, while Genie magic infused the world with unpredictable and ever-evolving energy. Together, they created a civilization that thrives on balance — a delicate harmony between logic and chaos, precision and possibility.</span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483917072437084161/1483919931782336726","messageId":"1483919931782336726"},{"title":"🌍 Planet Earth — World of Hidden Potential Planet Earth is a world defined not by overwhelming power, but by limitless potent","html":"<div><span><ul><li><strong>🌍 Planet Earth — World of Hidden Potential</strong></li></ul>Planet Earth is a world defined not by overwhelming power, but by limitless potential. Its inhabitants, known as Earthlings, evolved under the distant guidance of the Kais, developing martial arts, elemental techniques, and philosophies that emphasize growth through discipline. Figures such as Lord Mutaito laid the foundation for Earth’s martial legacy, shaping generations of warriors who would come to influence the wider universe.\nAmong humanity exists another presence — the Jinago, a mutated evolution of Earthlings born from extreme conditions and unnatural influence. Though visually indistinguishable from ordinary humans, the Jinago possess immense and often unstable power. Feared by many yet accepted as part of the world’s reality, they exist as a hidden force within Earth’s society.\nThrough the lineage of Lord Pocu, a former ruler of Earth and father of Queen Sarai, the Jinago have become intertwined with the planet’s leadership. Earth now stands as a world of duality — ordinary on the surface, yet harboring individuals capable of extraordinary power beneath it.\n<s>═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════</s><ul><li><strong>🌍 Planet Kaizoku — Legacy of the Fallen Divine</strong></li></ul>Planet Kaizoku is a world of innovation, industry, and hidden legacy. Its inhabitants, the Kaizokians, are known across the cosmos for their mastery of technology and engineering, creating devices that blur the line between science and energy manipulation. Their civilization thrives on adaptation, constantly pushing the boundaries of what is possible.\nWhat few realize is that the Kaizokians are the descendants of the ancient Glind — beings once imbued with divine magic and immortality. After being driven from the Makyo Realm, the Glind lost their connection to their origin over generations, their power fading as they evolved into a mortal race.\nYet their past has not been entirely lost. On rare occasions, individuals are born with pure Glind lineage, awakening dormant abilities tied to magic and spirit control. These rare beings stand as living reminders of what the Kaizokians once were — a civilization that has traded divinity for progress, but still carries echoes of its former greatness.</span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483917072437084161/1483920344300392599","messageId":"1483920344300392599"},{"title":"🌍 Planet Cereal — The Quiet World Planet Cereal is a world of calm resilience and enduring tradition. The Cerealians, its nat","html":"<div><span><ul><li><strong>🌍 Planet Cereal — The Quiet World</strong></li></ul>Planet Cereal is a world of calm resilience and enduring tradition. The Cerealians, its native inhabitants, built their society upon agriculture, culture, and spiritual balance, valuing preservation over expansion. Unlike many civilizations shaped by war, Cereal developed through patience, maintaining harmony with its environment and its people.\nThough the planet has faced external pressures and periods of domination, the Cerealians have never lost their identity. Their traditions, passed down through generations, serve as a foundation that cannot easily be erased. Beneath their peaceful exterior lies a quiet strength — one that has allowed them to endure where others have fallen.\nTraces of ancient influence linger within their world, subtle remnants of early cosmic guidance. These echoes of the past continue to shape their culture, ensuring that even in a universe defined by conflict, Planet Cereal remains a symbol of stability and perseverance.\n<s>═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════</s><ul><li><strong>🌍 Planet Namek — Sanctuary of Balance</strong></li></ul>Planet Namek stands as one of the purest reflections of Zalama’s lingering will within the Mortal Realm. A world of vast oceans, emerald skies, and quiet lands, Namek is not defined by conflict, but by preservation. Its people, the Namekians, are deeply spiritual beings, naturally attuned to magic, creation, and the unseen flow of the cosmos.\nUnder the guidance of figures like Grand Elder Lokai, Namek became more than just a home — it became a sanctuary. Here, the knowledge of creation was refined, and the sacred art of the Dragon Balls was preserved and passed down through generations. Namekians do not seek dominance, but balance, acting as quiet stewards of power rather than rulers of it.\nYet even Namek is not untouched by duality. Every act of creation casts a shadow, and within that shadow lies the truth that Namekian power is not purely benevolent — but a force that must always be guided. Namek endures as a place of peace, but also as a reminder that even the most harmonious worlds must remain vigilant.</span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483917072437084161/1483920462487617658","messageId":"1483920462487617658"},{"title":"🌍 Planet Arcose — The Frozen Throne Within the second layer of the Makyo Realm, Astrarion, lies Planet Arcose — a world of en","html":"<div><span><ul><li><strong>🌍 Planet Arcose — The Frozen Throne</strong></li></ul>Within the second layer of the Makyo Realm, Astrarion, lies Planet Arcose — a world of endless frost and imperial dominance. The Arcosians, native to this frozen realm, built their civilization upon conquest, discipline, and absolute authority. Their society thrives on hierarchy and strength, with power determining status above all else.\nFrom this icy world, Arcosian leaders expanded beyond the Makyo Realm, carving out empires across the Mortal Realm. Figures such as Lord Frostbyte led these expansions, bringing entire systems under Arcosian control through calculated campaigns and overwhelming force. Despite this outward expansion, Arcose itself remains the heart of their power — a symbol of their origin and authority. even now, Arcose stands as a seat of influence across realms, its rulers continuing to shape the balance of power through ambition and conquest. It is not merely a planet, but a throne — one forged in ice and maintained through strength.\n<s>═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════</s><ul><li><strong>🌍 Planet Nomakia — Birthplace of Division</strong></li></ul>Hidden within the Astrarion layer of the Makyo Realm lies Planet Nomakia, the original birthplace of the Namekian race. Unlike the serenity of Namek, Nomakia is a world steeped in ancient, volatile energy — a place where creation and corruption exist side by side. The land itself feels alive, pulsing with power that is far less restrained than what is seen in the Mortal Realm.\nIt is here that the divide within the Namekians first took form. While many would eventually leave to pursue balance and harmony, others embraced the darker aspects of their nature. From this divergence rose Kilos, the self-proclaimed Demon King and progenitor of the Demon Clan Namekians. As the other half of Grand Elder Lokai, Kilos represents the embodiment of what Namekians could become when power is pursued without restraint.\nUnder Kilos’ rule, Nomakia is no sanctuary — it is a domain of dominance, where strength and ambition dictate survival. The Demon Clan thrives here, embracing power in its rawest form, shaping the planet into a reflection of their will. Nomakia stands not just as a birthplace, but as a warning — proof that even a race born of divine essence is not immune to corruption.\n<s>═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════</s><ul><li><strong>🌍 Planet Glindi — The Silent Origin</strong></li></ul>Planet Glindi is a world long abandoned, its silence echoing with the remnants of something once divine. This was the birthplace of the Glind, beings born not through conventional means, but from the very life of the planet itself — emerging from sacred trees infused with the essence of creation. Each Glind was a manifestation of balance, magic, and purpose, deeply connected to the cosmic order.\nIn its prime, Glindi was a world of radiant life and quiet majesty. Vast forests stretched endlessly, their towering trees acting as both cradle and conduit for new life. The Glind were not merely inhabitants of this world — they were extensions of it, existing in harmony with its energy and the greater design of the universe.\nBut that era has long since passed. When the Glind were driven from the Makyo Realm, their connection to Glindi was severed. Without them, the planet began to wither. The great trees no longer bear life, the energy that once flowed through the world now lies dormant, and the planet itself has become a hollow shell of its former self. Glindi remains… but only as a relic. A quiet, desolate world that once birthed beings of immense importance — now left behind as the universe moved forward without them.</span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483917072437084161/1483920757724680388","messageId":"1483920757724680388"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483917072437084161","art":"assets/art/world-universal-origin.svg","wordCount":2939}],"races":[{"name":"Android","slug":"android","accent":"#76d6ef","shade":"#537cfc","description":"Androids are an artificially created race of biomechanical warriors, forged through advanced cybernetic augmentation and synthetic biology. Engineered by some of the galaxy’s most brilliant minds, they were designed to transcend t…","about":[{"title":"🤖 The Androids 🤖","html":"<div><span><h1>🤖 The Androids 🤖</h1>Androids are an artificially created race of biomechanical warriors, forged through advanced cybernetic augmentation and synthetic biology. Engineered by some of the galaxy’s most brilliant minds, they were designed to transcend the limitations of organic life. Built for overwhelming strength, precision, and efficiency, Androids are capable of feats far beyond those of natural-born species.\nUnlike most races, Androids do not produce natural ki, making them virtually invisible to energy sensing. Their power is instead fueled by an internal artificial core — either an infinite generator, an energy absorption unit. Some retain biological components from their original species, resulting in unique Cyborgs that blend machine logic with primal instinct. Others, like the elusive Bio-Androids, are more than synthetic—they evolve. Bio-Androids are a special classification of Android built through DNA splicing, cybernetics, and life-force assimilation. They grow stronger by absorbing other beings, integrating genetic material and techniques into their ever-shifting physiology. This volatile adaptability makes them one of the most dangerous creations in the universe.\n<ul><li><strong>Androids are exclusively created by three technologically advanced civilizations</strong>:</li></ul>&gt; <strong>🧊 Arcosians;</strong> Known for their adaptable bio-tech engineering.\n&gt; <strong>🧠 Tuffles;</strong> Masters of cybernetic augmentation and AI integration.\n&gt; <strong>🏴‍☠️ Kaizokians;</strong> Rogue engineers who infuse machine enhancements with aggressive warfare tactics.\n&gt; 🧪 Bio-Androids are exclusively crafted by the infamous Dr. Vera of Planet Plant or an unknown geneticist hidden deep within Arcose’s laboratories. Any other specimens are considered ancient relics, unstable failures, or discarded prototypes.\n# <s>--------------------------------------------------</s></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335290588676751473/1389988707498721433","messageId":"1389988707498721433"},{"title":"🦾 Strengths 🦾 🤖 I.E.M/E.A.M/Cyborg 🤖 💪 Enhanced Strength: Capable of lifting immense weights and overpowering foes with machi","html":"<div><span><ul><li> <strong>🦾 Strengths 🦾</strong><ul><li><strong>🤖 I.E.M/E.A.M/Cyborg 🤖</strong></li></ul><ul><li><strong>💪 Enhanced Strength:</strong> Capable of lifting immense weights and overpowering foes with machine-calculated force.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>👁️ Heightened Senses:</strong> Superior optical, auditory, and analytical processing allows Androids to track movement with near-instant precision.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔄 Adaptability:</strong> Designed to quickly adjust to combat situations, learning from fights and optimizing responses.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🛡️ Enhanced Durability:</strong> Reinforced exo-structures grant a 10% damage reduction, making Androids more resistant to impact and environmental hazards.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧪  Bio-Android 🧪</strong><ul><li><strong>💪 Superhuman Strength:</strong> Bio-Androids are unnaturally strong, capable of crushing reinforced metal, shattering barriers, and overwhelming opponents with pure physical might.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>👁️‍🗨️ Enhanced Senses:</strong> They possess hyper-advanced sensory perception, allowing them to track movement, detect ki signatures, and anticipate attacks with inhuman precision.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔄 Adaptive Evolution:</strong> Unlike most races that train over time, Bio-Androids grow stronger by absorbing others, inheriting abilities and enhancing their physiology with every assimilation.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧬 Genetic Selective Strength:</strong> At creation, Bio-Androids inherit a strength from one of their DNA strands (e.g., heightened speed, elemental control, durability, or regeneration) and permanently integrate it into their biology.</li></ul></li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Weaknesses ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🤖 I.E.M/E.A.M/Cyborg 🤖</strong></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🩹 Limited Healing:</strong> While minor damage can self-repair, major injuries require external rebuilding or replacement parts.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Electronic Malfunction:</strong> Critical system damage (head, back, power core) can leave an Android vulnerable to environmental hazards like water, EMP attacks, or extreme electrical surges.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧪  Bio-Android 🧪</strong><ul><li><strong>💥 Overload Risk:</strong> Absorbing too much energy or genetic material at once can cause their systems to overload, leading to temporary paralysis or forced regression to an earlier form.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Instability:</strong> Due to the mixture of multiple DNA strains, Bio-Androids suffer from mental instability, erratic behavior, and conflicting genetic urges, making their personalities highly volatile.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔋Evolutionary Dependence:</strong> Unlike other races that naturally grow stronger, Bio-Androids must absorb others to reach their full potential, making their progression dependent on external factors.</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul># <s>--------------------------------------------------</s></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335290588676751473/1389988710925209650","messageId":"1389988710925209650"},{"title":"Untitled section","html":"<div><span><ul><li><strong>💥 Abilities 💥</strong><ul><li><strong>🤖 I.E.M/E.A.M/Cyborg 🤖</strong></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔍 Scanner:</strong> An advanced analysis system that detects power levels, energy types, movement patterns, and stores combat data for future reference.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Artificial Energy:</strong> Androids produce no organic ki signature, making them undetectable by energy sensing.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🛡️ Energy Shields:</strong> By condensing their Artificial Energy, they can form highly resilient protective barriers that absorb or deflect incoming attacks.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔧 Modifications:</strong> Androids can receive up to three cybernetic upgrades, granting +5% permanent damage reduction per enhancement.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>📜 Extra Training:</strong> Androids can solo train two additional times per day, surpassing organic limits.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧪  Bio-Android 🧪</strong><ul><li><strong>✨ Ki Manipulation:</strong> Bio-Androids can harness energy-based techniques, including powerful energy blasts, beams, and defensive Ki-based shielding.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌿 Absorption Techniques:</strong> Using specialized limb extensions, tail siphons, or direct energy siphoning, they can absorb their opponent’s energy, life force, or even genetic material to increase their own power.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🛡️ Energy Shields:</strong> By condensing their Ki, they can form highly resilient protective barriers that absorb or deflect incoming attacks.</li></ul></li></ul></li><li><strong>🌟 Special Abilities 🌟</strong><ul><li><strong>🔋 Android (Infinite Energy Model)</strong></li></ul><ul><li><strong>Limitless Power:</strong> Gains +20% ki reserves per turn, allowing relentless combat pressure.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>No Fatigue:</strong> Does not experience stamina drain like organic beings.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💥 Android (Energy Absorption Model)</strong><ul><li><strong>Ki Absorption:</strong> Can absorb energy-based attacks or drain power from enemies through physical contact, replenishing 10% ki reserves.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>Stored Power Boost:</strong> The next physical or ki attack is enhanced by the absorbed energy’s strength (Max absorption: 3x power level before overload).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🤖 Android (Cyborg Model)</strong><ul><li><strong>Hybrid Physiology:</strong> Retains two racial abilities from the Android’s former species, including one special ability.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧪  Bio-Android 🧪</strong><ul><li><strong>🌌Complete Absorption:</strong> By fully consuming a target, Bio-Androids permanently inherit their victim’s power, abilities, and even memories.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔴 Cerealian DNA – Eye Evolution:</strong> Grants access to cerealian eye evolutions.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🟣 Genie DNA – Complete Regeneration:</strong> Allows the use of complete regeneration, down to a single nucleus</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🦁 Maoian DNA – Spirit Bond:</strong> Allows temporary energy synchronization with an ally, boosting the power of both users.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🐌  Namekian DNA – Mind Reading:</strong> Allows the user to invade someone's mind and perceive their next attack</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🐒  Saiyan DNA – Zenkai:</strong> Allows a massive boost in power after recovering from a near death situation (Cannot be paired with regeneration)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Super Earthling DNA – Elemental Overdrive:</strong> Enhances physical attacks with elemental properties like fire, water, or terra.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🖥️ Tuffle DNA – Technomancy:</strong> Grants control over nearby technology, hacking abilities, and cybernetic integration.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🩸 Vampire DNA – Hemamancy:</strong> Naturally attuned to hemamancy, allowing manipulation of blood in simple but potent ways.</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul><h1><s>--------------------------------------------------</s></h1><ul><li><strong>🌟 Android Classifications🌟</strong><ul><li><strong>🤖 I.E.M/E.A.M/Cyborg 🤖</strong></li></ul><ul><li>Artificial Ki Reserves: 200%</li></ul><ul><li>Rage &amp; Potential Boost: Dependent on prior race.</li></ul></li></ul><span><strong><code>SPARKING!</code></strong></span><ul><li><strong>🧪 Bio-Android 🧪</strong></li></ul><ul><li>Rage Boost: Dependant on DNA</li></ul><ul><li>Potential Boost: Dependant on DNA</li></ul><ul><li>Ki Reserves: Dependant on DNA</li></ul><h1><s>--------------------------------------------------</s></h1><ul><li><strong>🔥 Starting Techniques 🔥</strong><ul><li>Each Android gets to choose a technique used by the race they are created by</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335290588676751473/1389988774942867536","messageId":"1389988774942867536"},{"title":"Quick Trip","html":"<div><span><h1>Quick Trip</h1><a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335290588676751473/1389988707498721433\">Racial Info</a></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335290588676751473/1389989312166236291","messageId":"1389989312166236291"}],"paths":[{"name":"Foundational forms","kind":"core","forms":[{"title":"Core Overdrive ⚡","html":"<div><span><h1>⚡ <a href=\"https://media.tenor.com/d9t0exbmKpEAAAAM/android17-dragon-balls.gif\">Core Overdrive</a> ⚡</h1>Core Overdrive is the first major transformation available to Androids, pushing their artificial bodies beyond standard operational limits. This state taps directly into their energy core, triggering an immense surge of power that enhances combat efficiency, speed, and durability. The user's body begins to glow faintly, circuits humming with intensified energy flow, and their movements become smoother, faster, and nearly effortless. With a reinforced power grid, an Android in Core Overdrive achieves an overwhelming level of strength, rivaling even seasoned warriors of organic races. However, this power comes with a strict operational time limit, as extended use places extreme strain on the mechanical body.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Core Overdrive ⚙️</strong><ul><li>⚙️ <strong>Enhanced Energy Circulation</strong>: The core’s output increases exponentially, amplifying power, speed, and reaction time.</li></ul><ul><li>⚡ <strong>Adaptive Combat Processing</strong>: The Android’s internal systems optimize battle efficiency, reducing reaction time and improving strategic execution.</li></ul><ul><li>🔋 <strong>Limit Break Protocol</strong>: The transformation temporarily overrides safety limits, allowing for rapid energy regeneration and extended combat engagement.</li></ul><ul><li>🛡️ <strong>Reinforced Durability</strong>: The user’s body adapts to high-energy combat, increasing resilience to incoming attacks.</li></ul><ul><li>🔄 <strong>Self-Repair Mechanism</strong>: The Android's automated repair systems become 10% more efficient while in this form, slightly mitigating damage taken.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Undergo an advanced training session focused on internal diagnostics and efficiency maximization.</li></ul><ul><li>Androids must recalibrate their energy core to withstand the increased output strain. (Must be repeated per stage)</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li>⏳ <strong>Operational Limit</strong>: Due to the intense strain, Core Overdrive can only remain active for 20 turns before the Android’s safety protocols force shutdown (Energy Absorption Model only).</li></ul><ul><li>🔋 <strong>Energy Consumption</strong>: While power is amplified, the energy drain is significant, making prolonged fights increasingly difficult to sustain.</li></ul><ul><li>🛑 <strong>Overheat Risk</strong>: Exceeding the transformation’s limit can trigger an emergency shutdown, rendering the user temporarily inoperable.</li></ul><ul><li>🔩 <strong>Component Stress</strong>: Repeated activation without proper maintenance accelerates wear on internal components, requiring post-battle recalibration.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 10x [Be Created]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 25x [250,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Third Stage:</strong> 50x [3,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335290588676751473/1389988842983129311","messageId":"1389988842983129311","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"⚡  Core Overdrive  ⚡ Core Overdrive is the first major transformation available to Androids, pushing their artificial bodies beyond standard operational limits. This state taps directly into t"},{"title":"Enhanced Warrior ⚡","html":"<div><span><h1>⚡ <a href=\"https://media.tenor.com/JmpPGHmsHnQAAAAM/dbz-android17.gif\">Enhanced Warrior</a> ⚡</h1>Enhanced Warrior is not a transformation in the traditional sense, but rather a state in which an Android surpasses its original programming and achieves unprecedented combat efficiency. This upgrade is the result of rigorous combat adaptation, system recalibration, and the refinement of internal mechanics. Unlike organic beings who grow stronger through emotions and training, Androids evolve through optimization, allowing them to push their reaction time, energy control, and strategic calculations beyond their original limitations.\nWhile the Android’s outward appearance remains largely unchanged, subtle enhancements take place—movements become flawlessly precise, energy regulation reaches peak efficiency, and damage resistance is significantly bolstered. At this stage, an Android is no longer just a machine but a warrior of unparalleled refinement, proving that technology can rival the strongest organic warriors.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Enhanced Warrior ⚙️</strong><ul><li>🛡 <strong>Adaptive Combat Protocols</strong>: The Android learns and reacts to enemy attack patterns at an accelerated rate, increasing overall evasion and counter-strike accuracy.</li></ul><ul><li>🔋 <strong>Overclocked Power Core</strong>: The Android's energy output becomes significantly more efficient, granting an unyielding supply of power with minimal waste.</li></ul><ul><li>🤖 <strong>Precision Optimization</strong>: Strikes become faster, more refined, and more lethal, making every attack count with near-perfect accuracy.</li></ul><ul><li>⚔ <strong>Tactical Dominance</strong>: The Android can process combat strategies in real-time, predicting enemy movements with extreme efficiency, making counterattacks highly effective.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Engage in a serious fight and emerge victorious</li></ul><ul><li>Base Power Level of 8,000,000.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li>⏳ <strong>System Strain</strong>: The intensity of this form places significant stress on internal systems, leading to potential overheating.</li></ul><ul><li>🛑 <strong>Overdrive Limits</strong>: This state can only be maintained for 20 turns before automatic shutdown engages due to self-preservation protocols (E.A.M only).</li></ul><ul><li>⚡ <strong>Energy Burnout</strong>: While energy efficiency is increased, prolonged use beyond limits can lead to a complete energy depletion, requiring extensive downtime for full recovery.</li></ul><ul><li>🛠 <strong>Self-Modification Lock</strong>: Once in this state, an Android’s ability to make rapid internal adaptations is significantly reduced, preventing any further mid-battle upgrades or recalibrations.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multiplier 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 100x</strong></li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335290588676751473/1389988910163034112","messageId":"1389988910163034112","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"⚡  Enhanced Warrior  ⚡ Enhanced Warrior is not a transformation in the traditional sense, but rather a state in which an Android surpasses its original programming and achieves unprecedented c"},{"title":"Legacy Drive ⚡","html":"<div><span><h1>⚡ <a href=\"https://c.tenor.com/YpnT35fkEIEAAAAd/tenor.gif\">Legacy Drive</a> ⚡</h1>No longer confined by the limitations of conventional android capabilities, you have shattered your previous restrictions and redefined the boundaries of synthetic evolution. This transformation pushes your mechanical core into overdrive, optimizing power output and recalibrating internal systems to operate with unmatched precision. Energy courses through your circuits with an almost organic fluidity, creating a seamless fusion of calculated efficiency and relentless combat potential.\nWith each movement, your frame hums with newfound intensity, radiating an aura of controlled devastation. Every calculation, every maneuver, every strike is executed with machine-like perfection, maximizing speed and impact. However, this transformation does not come without cost—such heightened performance places immense strain on your systems, risking overheating, power fluctuations, and potential structural fatigue if pushed beyond sustainable limits.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Legacy Drive ⚙️</strong><ul><li>🛡️ <strong>Adaptive Combat Protocols</strong>: The Android learns and reacts to enemy attack patterns at an accelerated rate, increasing overall evasion and counter-strike accuracy.</li></ul><ul><li>🔋 <strong>Overclocked Power Core</strong>: The Android's energy output becomes significantly more efficient, granting an unyielding supply of power with minimal waste, allowing for rapid energy regeneration and extended combat engagement. Your core runs at maximum output, significantly amplifying your power and reaction speed.</li></ul><ul><li>🤖 <strong>Precision Optimization</strong>: Strikes become faster, more refined, and more lethal, making every attack count with near-perfect accuracy.</li></ul><ul><li>⚔ <strong>Tactical Dominance</strong>: The Android can process combat strategies in real-time, predicting enemy movements with extreme efficiency, making counterattacks highly effective.</li></ul><ul><li>🛡️ <strong>Reinforced Durability</strong>: Structural integrity is reinforced, increasing resistance against high-impact attacks.</li></ul><ul><li>🔄 <strong>Self-Repair Mechanism</strong>: The Android's automated repair systems become 20% more efficient while in this form, slightly mitigating damage taken.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 12,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>A slight surge of emotion (anger, desperation, or urgency) is required to activate this form.</li></ul><ul><li>The android must undergo a self-diagnostic recalibration before fully utilizing this transformation.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li>🕒 <strong>Limited Activation</strong>: This transformation can only be sustained for 20 turns before self-preservation protocols forcibly deactivate it (E.A.M only).</li></ul><ul><li>💀 <strong>Risk of System Malfunction</strong>: Engaging in this state may cause temporary instability or shutdown due to power overuse.</li></ul><ul><li>⚠️ <strong>Berserk Protocol Risk</strong>: Due to conflicting directives, activating this form may trigger an uncontrolled state (roll 1-10; a result of 7 or above causes the android to go berserk) [I.A.M only].</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 250x</strong></li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335290588676751473/1389989157878632448","messageId":"1389989157878632448","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"⚡  Legacy Drive  ⚡ No longer confined by the limitations of conventional android capabilities, you have shattered your previous restrictions and redefined the boundaries of synthetic evolution"},{"title":"Dual-Legacy Drive ⚡","html":"<div><span><h1>⚡ <a href=\"https://media.tenor.com/FvbOmdiRE2AAAAAM/android17-dbz.gif\">Dual-Legacy Drive</a> ⚡</h1>As an android, you have endured countless trials, exposing yourself to the harshest conditions, relentless battles, and adversaries of unparalleled strength. Each confrontation has pushed your body to adapt, fortify, and evolve beyond conventional limitations. No longer bound by the constraints of standard android functionality, you have refined your systems to their utmost efficiency, reaching a level of technological supremacy that rivals the universe’s greatest warriors.\nThrough this arduous journey, your frame has undergone a monumental enhancement—the integration of a secondary core. This revolutionary upgrade works in perfect unison with your main core, amplifying your energy output, processing speeds, and battle efficiency beyond measure. With this cutting-edge advancement, your combat potential is no longer just formidable; it is boundless, a mechanical force capable of standing toe-to-toe with the strongest beings in existence. The path ahead is still uncertain, but with this power, you are no longer just an android—you are a harbinger of evolution itself.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Dual Legacy Drive ⚙️</strong><ul><li>🛠️ <strong>Dual-Core Optimization</strong>: The addition of a secondary energy core enhances overall combat efficiency, allowing for higher sustained power output without overheating or system failures.</li></ul><ul><li>⚡ <strong>Surge Overclocking</strong>: The user can temporarily double their power for 5 turns, but afterward, system stability decreases, reducing combat effectiveness by 30% for the next 3 turns.</li></ul><ul><li>🔋 <strong>Enhanced Energy Reserves</strong>: The dual-core system provides a near-inexhaustible energy pool, reducing the cooldowns of abilities by 25%.</li></ul><ul><li>💥 <strong>Kinetic Absorption</strong>: The user can absorb and repurpose kinetic energy from incoming attacks, converting a portion of damage taken into power restoration (10% damage converted to energy recovery).</li></ul><ul><li>🔄 <strong>Adaptive Combat Algorithms</strong>: The user's fighting style evolves mid-battle, analyzing and countering enemy attacks with precision, increasing dodge efficiency by 20%.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>📊 Power Level of 50,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>⚙️ Only a skilled technician or engineer can properly install and integrate the second core without compromising system stability.</li></ul><ul><li>🏆 The user must endure battles that push them to the brink, proving their ability to handle the strain of extreme power output.</li></ul><ul><li>📈 Undergo intensive training to fine-tune the dual-core system for real-time combat performance.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li>⏳ <strong>Energy Drain Limitations</strong>: While the second core improves efficiency, prolonged use at peak output drastically increases energy consumption.</li></ul><ul><li>💀 <strong>System Strain</strong>: Due to the immense energy coursing through the user’s body, they only have 20 turns of activation before the self-preservation protocols forcibly shut the form down. (E.A.M only)</li></ul><ul><li>⚡ <strong>Core Instability</strong>: The strain of dual-core functionality puts immense stress on the user's frame, leading to a 15-turn limit before complete system failure results in forced shutdown (I.A.M only).</li></ul><ul><li>🔥 <strong>Overheating Risk</strong>: Prolonged activation increases internal temperature, making the user vulnerable to overheating malfunctions if pushed beyond limits.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 400x</strong></li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335290588676751473/1389989237188988998","messageId":"1389989237188988998","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"⚡  Dual-Legacy Drive  ⚡ As an android, you have endured countless trials, exposing yourself to the harshest conditions, relentless battles, and adversaries of unparalleled strength. Each confr"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335290588676751473","notes":[],"classification":"foundational"},{"name":"Bio-Android","kind":"branch","forms":[{"title":"🧬 Imperfect 🧬","html":"<div><span><h1>🧬 <a href=\"https://i.makeagif.com/media/6-20-2018/qt2j3_.gif\">Imperfect</a> 🧬</h1>Twisted sinew and synthetic plating writhe into place as your body mutates into its earliest and most grotesque form. In the Imperfect state, the Bio-Android resembles a nightmare constructed from stolen genes—sickly green skin, asymmetrical muscle growth, and mechanical protrusions that pulse with unstable energy. This transformation is not elegant—it’s primal. A ravenous instinct awakens deep within. You don't just sense life—you smell it, hear it, feel it vibrating in your core. And you know one thing above all else: <strong>You. Must. Consume.</strong><ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of The Imperfect Form ⚙️</strong></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧬 Predatory Instinct:</strong> Detect life signatures and energy patterns within a wide radius. Gain +1 post advantage when pursuing or tracking targets.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Adaptation Matrix:</strong> For every 3 characters absorbed, you may “learn” a basic technique (pending staff approval) from one of the victims.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧹 Organic Filter:</strong> Immune to poison, disease, and other biological debuffs due to hybrid construction.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧪 Absorption Tracker:</strong> Each OC/NPC absorbed increases your transformation’s potential. Must be done through RP-justified combat or staff-approved events.</li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong></li></ul><ul><li>Must be Created (lab-born, bio-grown, or cybernetically synthesized)</li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧟 Grotesque Appearance:</strong> Your monstrous frame makes you difficult to conceal and frightening even to allies</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🩸 Unstable Frame:</strong> Takes +15% damage from critical hits and high-level energy attacks</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌀 Uncontrolled Appetite:</strong> If no combat or absorption occurs for 15+ RP posts, you may suffer mental instability (hallucinations, rage, etc.)</li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong></li></ul><ul><li>🔺 ×1 [Birth]</li></ul><ul><li>🔺 ×5 [Absorb 15 OCs / NPCs]</li></ul><ul><li>🔺 ×10 [Absorb 30 OCs / NPCs]</li></ul><span><em>These are treated like a transformation only when powering up, for example, you have absorbed 10 OCs/NPCs and you get into a fight, you can treat the full power of this form like its a transformation</em></span></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1389684086020374609/1389991289381982258","messageId":"1389991289381982258","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🧬  Imperfect  🧬 Twisted sinew and synthetic plating writhe into place as your body mutates into its earliest and most grotesque form. In the Imperfect state, the Bio-Android resembles a nightm"},{"title":"🧬 Semi-Perfect 🧬","html":"<div><span><h1>🧬 <a href=\"https://media.tenor.com/iNBQEpPqS8cAAAAM/semi-perfect-cell-cell2nd-form.gif\">Semi-Perfect</a> 🧬</h1>Your body refines itself—elongating, strengthening, and stabilizing. Your mass increases, but your control improves with it. No longer hunched and erratic, your stance is upright, purposeful. The grotesque shell of your Imperfect self begins to harden into something calculated… commanding.\nYou are no longer a creature that merely consumes. You are now the hunter. The apex. And you’re learning how to think like a king.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of the Semi-Perfect Form ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>👁️ Intimidating Presence:</strong> Your growing menace causes hesitation in those with lower PL, reducing their first combat action effectiveness by 25% unless they pass a Willpower check.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Adaptive Combat:</strong> You now subconsciously analyze enemy patterns mid-battle, granting a minor edge against repeated techniques or predictable behavior.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🛡️ Enhanced Durability:</strong> Your improved physique offers +10% damage resistance to physical and ki-based attacks.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 100,000</li></ul><ul><li>Must absorb either:\n<ul><li>1 Android</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>OR</strong><ul><li>250 NPCs/OCs</li></ul><ul><li>10 NPCs/OCs absorbed per stage after obtained\n<ul><li>(Absorptions must be RP-justified)</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>😬 Still Ugly:</strong> While you're bigger and meaner, you're still unnerving and far from \"perfect\"—social interactions are often hindered by appearance.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Cocky Mutation:</strong> You begin to feel superior, even prematurely. This can lead to underestimating opponents with lower power levels or ignoring smarter strategies.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 50x [100,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 100x [500,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Third Stage:</strong> 400x [1,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1389684086020374609/1389992295197179985","messageId":"1389992295197179985","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🧬  Semi-Perfect  🧬 Your body refines itself—elongating, strengthening, and stabilizing. Your mass increases, but your control improves with it. No longer hunched and erratic, your stance is up"},{"title":"🧬 Perfect Form 🧬","html":"<div><span><h1>🧬 <a href=\"https://i.makeagif.com/media/6-25-2022/c7qc7T.gif\">Perfect Form</a> 🧬</h1>You’ve reached symmetry. You’ve reached elegance. Every inch of your form is calculated, deadly, and eerily flawless. Your voice is smooth, your movements efficient, your aura oppressive—and somehow… charming. You don’t move, you glide. You don’t attack, you dominate. Gone is the hunger, gone is the chaos. Now there is only purpose. You are no longer a creature. You are perfection, incarnate.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of the Perfect Form ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>👑 Perfect Presence:</strong> Your sheer power output and symmetrical form create psychological strain on enemies, lowering the confidence of those within 25% of your PL or below. They must pass a Willpower check each post or suffer -10% to technique success.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Absolute Adaptation:</strong> You now adapt in real time, granting you a one-time-per-fight “perfect counter” to a previously used enemy technique (must be staff approved, not auto-hit).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧱 Enhanced Durability:</strong> Your biology reaches near-armor levels of resistance, cutting incoming damage by 15% from all sources.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 5,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Must absorb either:\n<ul><li>2 Androids</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>OR</strong><ul><li>500 NPCs/OCs</li></ul><ul><li>10 NPCs/OCs Aborbed per stage after obtained\n<ul><li>(All absorptions must be RP-justified)</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🎭 Overconfidence Complex:</strong> You believe yourself to be untouchable, which can affect IC decisions—especially against lower PL opponents.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎶 Uncontrollable Singing:</strong> Sometimes, you just… break into theatrical monologues about being perfect. It's involuntary and usually happens after dominating moments.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💅 Superiority Syndrome:</strong> You struggle to see others as threats, allies, or equals. This can interfere with team dynamics or cooperative events.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 800x [5,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 2,000x [10,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Third Stage:</strong> 4,000x [20,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1389684086020374609/1389993514515042496","messageId":"1389993514515042496","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🧬  Perfect Form  🧬 You’ve reached symmetry. You’ve reached elegance. Every inch of your form is calculated, deadly, and eerily flawless. Your voice is smooth, your movements efficient, your au"},{"title":"🧬 Super-Perfect 🧬","html":"<div><span><h1>🧬 <a href=\"https://media.tenor.com/l5w2ioWNk3QAAAAM/perfect-cell.gif\">Super-Perfect</a> 🧬</h1>Lightning crackles along your form as if the universe itself recognizes your arrival. Your aura roars with unstable energy—raw, untamed, and furious. Perfection was the plateau. This… is the storm that shatters it. In this state, your eyes glow with power, and your presence alone distorts the air around you. You no longer walk—you tremble the ground beneath you. The battlefield fears you. And it should.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of the Super-Perfect Form ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>💢 Authoritative Aura:</strong> Opponents must pass a Willpower check at the start of combat or suffer -15% morale-based penalties for the first 3 posts (attack reduction, delayed reactions, fear effects).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧘 Unyielding Willpower:</strong> Immune to fear, illusions, mind control, or Ki-based suggestion effects.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🥷 Combat Prowess Amplification:</strong> You execute advanced combat maneuvers with +10% accuracy and +5% reaction time; this stacks with Adaptation traits from previous forms.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 40,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Must have fought in Perfect Form a minimum of 10 times</li></ul><ul><li>Must achieve a significant breakthrough or power boost during a combat-related moment (Staff approval required, Must also be repeated per stage)</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🪫 High Activation Cost:</strong> 50% of total Ki is drained instantly upon transformation</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⏳ Time Limit:</strong> Lasts for 12 posts per transformation unless refreshed by a second wind (RP approved)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧨 Overwhelming Aura:</strong> Your power output is no longer concealable—everyone can sense your presence unless within an anti-detection field</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 10,000x [40,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 20,000x [100,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Third Stage:</strong> 30,000x [250,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1389684086020374609/1389994706573983886","messageId":"1389994706573983886","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🧬  Super-Perfect  🧬 Lightning crackles along your form as if the universe itself recognizes your arrival. Your aura roars with unstable energy—raw, untamed, and furious. Perfection was the pla"},{"title":"🧬 Hyper-Perfect 🧬","html":"<div><span><h1>🧬 <a href=\"https://i.pinimg.com/736x/24/63/cf/2463cf657219c376a9a6b0b69cb6ea67.jpg\">Hyper-Perfect</a> 🧬</h1>Your body erupts in a divine storm of power, your form no longer bound by the flesh that bore you. This is not perfection—it is transcendence. A metallic sheen cloaks your body like armor forged from dying stars. The atmosphere trembles around you as your aura warps reality in pulses of chromatic distortion. No longer a bio-weapon. No longer a science project. You are now a cataclysm made manifest—a force of evolution untamed.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of the Hyper-Perfect Form ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🦾 Metallic Shell:</strong> Grants +20% resistance to physical and energy-based attacks. Additionally, once per combat, you may ignore the effects of a critical hit.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌀 Terrifying Presence:</strong> Opponents with less than 75% of your PL lose 1 action per round unless they pass a Willpower test. Aura alone causes environmental collapse (buildings crack, terrain warps).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚔️ Reckless Abandon:</strong> While in this form, your attacks become less predictable. Unorthodox methods increase your attack unpredictability (+15% crit chance, but -10% defense while active).</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 500,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Must have survived a near-death experience and fully recovered (Must be repeated per stage)</li></ul><ul><li>Must absorb a major energy source (e.g., a powerful warrior, a planet) with staff approval</li></ul><ul><li>Must have used Super-Perfect Form in 3 major events or battles</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🧠 Mental Instability Risk:</strong> After 8 posts, must roll for mental corruption (RP effects may include cold detachment, erratic rage, or combat obsession)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧬 Cellular Degradation:</strong> After 15 posts, begin to lose 5% HP per turn due to genetic strain</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧟‍♂️ Aesthetic Atrocity:</strong> Your form becomes more monstrous than ever—terrifying even to allies, leaving a trail of destruction behind by mere presence</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 50,000x [500,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 75,000x [750,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Third Stage:</strong> 100,000x [1,000,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1389684086020374609/1389997341938946240","messageId":"1389997341938946240","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🧬  Hyper-Perfect  🧬 Your body erupts in a divine storm of power, your form no longer bound by the flesh that bore you. This is not perfection—it is transcendence. A metallic sheen cloaks your"},{"title":"🌞 Solar Perfection 🌞","html":"<div><span><h1>🌞 Solar Perfection 🌞</h1>After absorbing the entirety of a solar system—its planets, inhabitants, and the star itself—the Bio-Android undergoes a radical transformation that permanently binds its physiology to its most dominant DNA strain.\n<ul><li><strong>❄️ Arcosian DNA ❄️</strong><ul><li>Your form sharpens into a sleek, polished frame of obsidian-plated armor trimmed with pale chrome. Arcosian elegance meets bio-engineered brutality—tall, broad, and glimmering like black ice. The horns curve with calculated symmetry, and your presence feels colder, more composed.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎯 Cerealian DNA 🎯</strong><ul><li>This form molds your bio-frame into something lean, sharp, and honed—built for one purpose: efficiency. Emerald vents pulse with stabilized power across your forearms and legs, while an armored mantle flows down like a commander's coat. Your visor-like optics burn with an eerie green, constantly adjusting focus, reading movement, and calculating impact.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🏴‍☠️ Kaizokian DNA 🏴‍☠️</strong><ul><li>This form turns your body into a cybernetic titan—dense, armored, and forged for domination. Neon veins of volatile green energy crackle beneath your carbon-steel plating, and your helm-like crown juts forward like the prow of a warship. You look less like a being and more like a walking siege weapon—ruthless, calculated, and aggressive.</li></ul></li><li><strong>😈 Majin DNA 😈</strong><ul><li>Your form twists into an infernal silhouette, your skin a deep maroon armor-like carapace riddled with spined tendrils that lash and coil as if alive. Your eyes glow with predatory cunning, and a forked tongue occasionally flicks between jagged teeth. From your back sprout writhing appendages—organic weapons that move with a will of their own, snapping like vipers.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🪄 Genie DNA 🪄</strong><ul><li>You ascend into a whimsical nightmare of beauty and madness. Your skin becomes sleek and elastic, with hues that shift depending on your temperament—vibrant pinks when elated, deep violet when enraged, and eerie white when detached. Your hair flares in wild coils of arcane energy, and your tail twitches with unpredictable rhythm.</li></ul></li><li><strong>✨ Glind DNA ✨</strong><ul><li>Your body refines into a tranquil masterpiece of divine design—symmetrical, radiant, and laced with holy motifs. Glowing crests line your arms and chest, pulsing with ethereal ki that feels almost sacred. The form bears the elegance of a Shinjin yet hums with the suppressed wrath of a perfected weapon. Flowing cape-like appendages drift effortlessly behind you, as if untouched by gravity. Your eyes shimmer with wisdom, yet pierce like a blade—every action measured, every strike absolute.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🐉 Namekian DNA 🐉</strong><ul><li>Your form takes on the divine visage of a living legend, fusing the strength of a warrior with the grace of a divine protector. Scaled emerald flesh coils around golden muscle, with antennae stretched like celestial horns and a glowing gem embedded within your chest—reminiscent of ancient wish-granting relics. Your mane flares like spiritual fire, flowing behind your back in streaks of sacred gold and blue.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🦇 Vampyre DNA 🦇</strong><ul><li>You erupt into a grotesquely regal monstrosity—pure, predatory beauty cloaked in nightmare flesh. Your body is a shifting amalgamation of dark bio-armor and blood-vein markings, pulsing with unholy vitality. Tendrils whip and coil from your back like living serpents, each radiating a vampyric aura that drains the life of everything nearby. Your eyes glow with a hunger not just for blood—but for dominance. Fangs extend beyond natural limits, and your voice echoes with layers of rage and reverence.</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1389684086020374609/1390026411162599636","messageId":"1390026411162599636","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌞 Solar Perfection 🌞 After absorbing the entirety of a solar system—its planets, inhabitants, and the star itself—the Bio-Android undergoes a radical transformation that permanently binds its"}],"notes":[{"title":"🌫️ Maoian DNA 🌫️ Veiled in swirling umbral energy and bathed in hues of violet and shadow, your form becomes hauntingly regal","html":"<div><span><ul><li><strong>🌫️ Maoian DNA 🌫️</strong><ul><li>Veiled in swirling umbral energy and bathed in hues of violet and shadow, your form becomes hauntingly regal—embodying the mysticism and power of the Makyosei-born. Ornate black claws extend from fingers that move with eerie grace, as your aura dances like a slow-burning flame of forbidden sorcery. The Maoian influence has enhanced your psychic prowess, your energy now twisted through space like ribboned dark matter.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🦍 Saiyan DNA 🦍</strong><ul><li>This form radiates raw, sovereign dominance. Your body gleams with a golden sheen so polished and luminous it looks sculpted from divine metal. Your facial structure sharpens, noble yet lethal, with glowing violet eyes cutting through the air like blades. Your armored flesh reflects light like a walking sun, each movement trailing gold dust-like sparks. A long tail coils with silent menace, and your ki burns not with fire, but molten brilliance—stable, focused, and ready to dominate.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚔️ Super-Earthling DNA ⚔️</strong><ul><li>This form embodies the height of adaptive intellect and physical refinement. Broad crimson plating covers your frame like a next-gen battle suit, tightly packed over lean, reactive muscle. Lime-green bio-luminescent lines pulse along your limbs and tail, reflecting an advanced nervous system constantly processing thousands of tactical possibilities per second. Your posture is upright, confident, and human-like—yet too precise, too calculated to be mistaken for organic. Energy crackles in geometric bursts around you, as though the universe itself is obeying a higher algorithm.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🧠 Tuffle DNA 🧠</strong><ul><li>This form is the crystallization of tactical supremacy. Your body is sleek and balanced, honed to mechanical precision—each limb a perfect blend of enhanced musculature and seamless energy efficiency. Your armor gleams with a white-silver sheen, accented by vibrant red and blue cores along your limbs, symbolizing dual processing systems: logic and instinct. A large glowing core sits embedded in your chest like a living reactor, pulsing with pure data-fed ki. Twin tails coil with awareness, responsive and prehensile.</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1389684086020374609/1390026420063047834","messageId":"1390026420063047834"},{"title":"⚙️ Mechanics of Solar Perfection ⚙️ 🌌 Solar Core Overdrive: The energy of a star fuels your body. Your ki attacks ignore 20%","html":"<div><span><ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Solar Perfection ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🌌 Solar Core Overdrive:</strong> The energy of a star fuels your body. Your ki attacks ignore 20% of defensive buffs and shields.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧬 DNA Prime Resonance:</strong> You gain access to 1 additional racial technique or ability exclusive to your dominant DNA (staff approval).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧬 Race Specific Mechanics:</strong><ul><li><strong>❄️ Arcosian:</strong> Upon transformation, the user emits an aura of suppressive cold that reduces enemy ki-based regeneration or charging by 25% for 2 turns.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Cerealian:</strong> Once per battle, the user may target a specific limb, organ, or structural weak point on an opponent. If successful, that target suffers reduced effectiveness for 2 turns (e.g., arm = halved physical attack; leg = halved speed; core = technique delay).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🏴‍☠️ Kaizokian:</strong> After landing a successful melee combo, Kaizokians may \"plunder\" a temporary stat buff from the opponent — randomly gaining +10% to either Strength, Speed, or Defense for 2 turns, while the opponent suffers a -10% penalty to the same stat.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>😈 Majin:</strong> The user can absorb a portion of damage dealt (10% of total) and restore their own health once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🪄 Genie:</strong> Once per battle, the user can convert an enemy technique into a healing pulse, recovering 15% HP and nullifying the attack.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>✨ Glind:</strong> Once per battle, Glinds may channel their internal energy through perfect mental balance, causing their next Ki or Spirit-based attack to ignore enemy resistances or defensive buffs. This surge also grants them a brief window of clarity, reducing incoming damage by 25% until the end of the turn.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🐉 Namekian:</strong> Automatically regenerates 10% of lost HP at the start of every turn for 3 turns. Can only be triggered once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🦇 Vampyre:</strong> Sacrificing 5% HP allows for a +50% power boost to one ability or technique, usable once every 3 turns.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌫️ Maoian:</strong> Once per battle, can reflect one single-target energy attack back at the attacker at 80% of its original power.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🦍 Saiyan:</strong> After landing 3 successful melee hits, all physical damage is increased by 20% for the next 2 turns.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚔️ Super-Earthling:</strong> Can instantly copy the elemental or energy signature of the last technique used against them, allowing for a mirrored version to be cast on the next turn. Usable once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Tuffle:</strong> May preemptively analyze an opponent at the start of battle (or once per battle) to reduce the cooldown of one learned technique by 1 turn and immediately dodge the next non-ultimate ability used against them.</li></ul></li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 3,000,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Dominant DNA must be established through admin review</li></ul><ul><li>Absorb an entire Star (must be roleplayed across a major arc or approved event, Must also be repeated per stage)</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🔥 System Overload:</strong> Using this form consumes 30% Ki immediately and another 5% per post. Exceeding 20 posts forces an immediate reversion and leaves you unconscious.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Ego Corruption:</strong> The godlike sensation may cause megalomania. If you dominate more than 3 battles in this form, your Bio-Android may develop a god complex (RP consequence; Staff enforced).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧬 Instability Pulse:</strong> The fusion of solar energy and unstable genes causes a feedback loop. If struck by a Ultimate technique while under 25% HP, you take +25% more damage.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multiplier 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 250,000x [3,000,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 500,000x [7,000,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1389684086020374609/1390026468347740352","messageId":"1390026468347740352"},{"title":"Arcosian Cerealian Kaizokian Majin Genie","html":"<div><span><a href=\"https://i.pinimg.com/736x/47/a1/0d/47a10d027ca5492d2302da402409101d.jpg\">Arcosian</a>\n<a href=\"https://i.pinimg.com/736x/09/33/4c/09334c1f1f4a2ab4ea0c7a7c07ac6459.jpg\">Cerealian</a>\n<a href=\"https://i.pinimg.com/736x/2c/40/64/2c406433ea0bd5f75383b2a19aa00bbf.jpg\">Kaizokian</a>\n<a href=\"https://i.pinimg.com/736x/82/ec/60/82ec6048839944626b652d0408dc7bef.jpg\">Majin</a>\n<a href=\"https://i.pinimg.com/736x/06/70/5d/06705d42c388774783ba651706dd821c.jpg\">Genie</a></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1389684086020374609/1390026555895447675","messageId":"1390026555895447675"},{"title":"Glind Namekian Vampyre Maoian Saiyan","html":"<div><span><a href=\"https://i.pinimg.com/736x/8d/6d/fe/8d6dfe4b78726c68705262aa0a0c45a8.jpg\">Glind</a>\n<a href=\"https://i.pinimg.com/736x/1e/ef/fc/1eeffc1396b3be7ef48907f8710b41b0.jpg\">Namekian</a>\n<a href=\"https://i.pinimg.com/736x/8e/ce/03/8ece03fa92cf518d5f8d5781100a7d47.jpg\">Vampyre</a>\n<a href=\"https://i.pinimg.com/736x/13/d9/10/13d91028dcd5e571d226bf3c3c36143a.jpg\">Maoian</a>\n<a href=\"https://i.pinimg.com/736x/f8/aa/de/f8aadeebaa546b2b23409586ba0c7028.jpg\">Saiyan</a></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1389684086020374609/1390026561662488687","messageId":"1390026561662488687"},{"title":"Super-Earthling Tuffle","html":"<div><span><a href=\"https://i.pinimg.com/736x/02/56/d5/0256d5c13c037522ef0bd99248df9f32.jpg\">Super-Earthling</a>\n<a href=\"https://i.pinimg.com/736x/20/4b/87/204b879460e301351996fa936ff11fea.jpg\">Tuffle</a></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1389684086020374609/1390026602855010395","messageId":"1390026602855010395"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1389684086020374609","imageOnly":false,"classification":"sparking"},{"name":"Cybernetic Berserker","kind":"branch","forms":[{"title":"⚙️ Integrated Evolution ⚙️","html":"<div><span><h1>⚙️ <a href=\"https://media.tenor.com/FlyRlS5DCIoAAAAM/android13.gif\">Integrated Evolution</a> ⚙️</h1>Witnessing the remnants of fallen androids around you, you make the ultimate decision—to incorporate their components into yourself, ensuring their legacy continues within you. Through this integration, your body undergoes a drastic transformation, becoming more robust and heavily reinforced. Height, muscle density, and even aesthetic elements like skin tone, eye color, and plating may alter as your form adapts to this newfound power. But above all else, this fusion elevates you beyond conventional limitations, propelling you into a tier of strength most beings could only dream of attaining.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Integrated Evolution ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🔋 Core Fusion:</strong> By assimilating additional processing units and power cores, your energy reserves are expanded, allowing for prolonged combat efficiency.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Amplified Combat Instincts:</strong> The integration of combat data from multiple sources grants increased adaptability, making counters and tactical shifts near-instantaneous.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Overcharged Systems:</strong> Your attacks hit harder and faster, as your body operates beyond standard efficiency.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🦾 Structural Reinforcement:</strong> Your augmented body resists wear and tear, reducing external damage taken by 20%.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🤖 System Override:</strong> The fusion grants an occasional power surge, temporarily boosting your speed and strength by 50% for 5 turns (once per battle).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💢 Adaptive Rage Protocol:</strong> Damage received in combat temporarily increases power output, enhancing all offensive actions. Once this transformation is obtained, the android's rage boost is multiplied by 4x, further amplifying their combat effectiveness.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔀 Adaptation Choice:</strong> Choose whether to maintain Infinite Energy Model (I.E.M) benefits or Energy Absorption Model (E.A.M) perks upon integration.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 180,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Collect and integrate the cores and processing units of 1 android (NPCs or OCs, Must be repeated per stage).</li></ul><ul><li>Master Dual Legacy Overdrive.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🛑 System Instability:</strong> The unnatural assimilation process creates instability, limiting you to 20 turns of operation before automatic shutdown (E.A.M only).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Overclocking Risk:</strong> Running at maximum efficiency may cause a forced reboot post-transformation, leaving you vulnerable.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Directive Conflict:</strong> The amalgamation of multiple systems may introduce conflicting protocols, leading to sporadic loss of control. (Roll 1-10, 7 or above results in temporary berserk mode) [I.A.M only].</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Increased Energy Consumption:</strong> The sheer amount of processing power and energy required reduces long-term sustainability in drawn-out fights.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 10,000x [180,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 14,000x [500,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1351605484913950780/1351832583041716245","messageId":"1351832583041716245","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"⚙️  Integrated Evolution  ⚙️ Witnessing the remnants of fallen androids around you, you make the ultimate decision—to incorporate their components into yourself, ensuring their legacy continue"},{"title":"⚙️ Overdrive Protocol ⚙️","html":"<div><span><h1>⚙️ <a href=\"https://cdnb.artstation.com/p/assets/images/images/018/432/651/original/jordan-weisgerber-c13-p02-02.gif?1559340541\">Overdrive Protocol</a> ⚙️</h1>You have reached the pinnacle of synthetic evolution, yet your ambition refuses to let you stagnate. By analyzing and replicating advanced energy sources, you override the limitations set upon your mechanical frame, unlocking power far beyond what was once thought possible. Your systems now pulse with an overwhelming force, pushing your durability, energy output, and combat effectiveness to an entirely new level. With every movement, your circuits surge with electrified energy, your body reinforced to withstand and deliver devastating force. This upgrade represents the final stage of self-imposed evolution, proof that artificial life has no ceiling to its potential.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Overdrive Protocol ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>⚡ Synthetic Power Surge:</strong> The user’s energy output is optimized, reducing the energy cost of all techniques by 25%.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔋 Infinite Processing:</strong> Combat response time is drastically improved, allowing for heightened reaction speed and increased attack efficiency.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Overclocked Resilience:</strong> Damage resistance is enhanced by 30%, making the user significantly harder to injure.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💀 Unrelenting Assault:</strong> The user's raw strength is amplified, increasing the power behind physical strikes by 50%.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚙️ Machine Dominance:</strong> Android Rage Boost is quadrupled, increasing offensive efficiency in prolonged battles.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 1,000,000,000.</li></ul><ul><li>Completion of an extensive training session pushing your synthetic frame beyond its known limits (does not contribute to PL increase, Must be repeated per stage).</li></ul><ul><li>Must have endured an encounter against a vastly superior energy source and adapted to its properties.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li>⏳ The transformation can only be sustained for 20 turns before system protocols forcibly deactivate it (E.A.M. only).</li></ul><ul><li>⚠️ Entering this state forces a cooldown period in which the user’s combat efficiency is significantly reduced for 5 turns post-deactivation.</li></ul><ul><li>🔻 Processing strain may cause a temporary systems reboot, limiting reaction speed for 3 turns in extended engagements.</li></ul><ul><li>🚫 Due to its overwhelming power, fine motor control becomes difficult, slightly reducing precision in long-range combat.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 18,000x [1,000,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 22,000x [3,000,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1351605484913950780/1351865880195367012","messageId":"1351865880195367012","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"⚙️  Overdrive Protocol  ⚙️ You have reached the pinnacle of synthetic evolution, yet your ambition refuses to let you stagnate. By analyzing and replicating advanced energy sources, you overri"},{"title":"⚙️ Core Meltdown ⚙️","html":"<div><span><h1>⚙️ <a href=\"https://giffiles.alphacoders.com/169/169959.gif\">Core Meltdown</a> ⚙️</h1>Harnessing the full extent of your power, you push your core to its absolute limit, forcing it into a state of volatile overdrive. As energy builds up within your system, your power levels surge to unprecedented heights, granting you an explosive boost in both strength and defense. However, the immense strain placed on your core means this transformation comes with a heavy price. Once your core reaches maximum capacity, the energy can be expelled in a devastating detonation, annihilating everything caught within its radius.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Core Meltdown ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>⚡ Overcharged Power:</strong> The user’s energy output skyrockets, temporarily amplifying all offensive and defensive capabilities.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Unstable Surge:</strong> The longer this form is maintained, the more unstable the core becomes, increasing power but also risking internal damage.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💥 Core Detonation:</strong> When energy storage reaches critical mass, the user can unleash an explosive release of raw power, causing immense area-wide destruction.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💀 Last Resort Mode:</strong> If the user fails to properly regulate their energy levels, they risk entering an uncontrolled meltdown, causing self-damage over time.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💢 Adaptive Rage Protocol:</strong> Damage received in combat temporarily increases power output, enhancing all offensive actions. Once this transformation is obtained, the android's rage boost is multiplied by 4x, further amplifying their combat effectiveness.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>The user must force one of their cores into a destructively overclocked state.</li></ul><ul><li>Base Power Level of 7,000,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Requires the ability to efficiently channel and manipulate internal energy sources without immediate failure.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⚠️ Core Destruction:</strong> Upon activation, one core is permanently sacrificed, resulting in a 20% loss in total energy efficiency.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚠️ Limited Duration:</strong> The transformation can only be sustained for a short period of 10 turns before it reaches unstable levels.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚠️ Risk of Implosion:</strong> If the user fails to vent excess energy properly, they risk internal damage and potential system failure.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚠️ Recovery Time:</strong> After deactivating, the user enters a temporary weakened state, significantly reducing combat effectiveness.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 26,000x</strong></li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1351605484913950780/1351868864526417973","messageId":"1351868864526417973","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"⚙️  Core Meltdown  ⚙️ Harnessing the full extent of your power, you push your core to its absolute limit, forcing it into a state of volatile overdrive. As energy builds up within your system,"}],"notes":[],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1351605484913950780","imageOnly":false,"classification":"normal"},{"name":"Neo Android","kind":"branch","forms":[{"title":"⚙️ Force Upgrade ⚙️","html":"<div><span><h1>⚙️ <a href=\"https://c.tenor.com/DFJOAhopypgAAAAd/tenor.gif\">Force Upgrade</a> ⚙️</h1><ul><li><strong>Infinite Energy Model (I.E.M):</strong> As an Infinite Energy Model, your body has transcended normal limitations, operating at an unparalleled efficiency. With your synthetic core now generating vast amounts of self-sustaining power, you no longer experience energy depletion. This advancement allows you to maintain consistent pressure in battle, fighting relentlessly without fear of exhaustion. The golden energy coursing through you is no mere imitation—it's an evolution of machine perfection, granting you a fluidity of movement that rivals even organic lifeforms.</li><li><strong>Energy Absorption Model (E.A.M):</strong> Your Energy Absorption Model design has reached a new pinnacle of efficiency. Now, not only can you absorb and redirect incoming energy attacks, but your systems autonomously refine absorbed energy to temporarily enhance your combat performance. In this form, your core operates at peak optimization, cycling absorbed power back into your attacks, making each blow more devastating than the last. Your golden aura crackles with the residual power of stolen energy, a testament to your ability to turn enemy strength into your own.</li><li><strong>Cyborg Model (C.M):</strong> As a Cyborg, your synthetic enhancements now operate at full integration with your organic self, allowing you to wield a level of precision and adaptability unique to your kind. Unlike your fully mechanical counterparts, your transformation heightens your biological reflexes, making you an apex combatant. Your body surges with golden energy, reinforcing your natural endurance and granting you the ability to repair minor damage on the fly. No longer bound by the weaknesses of flesh, you stand at the precipice of true cybernetic perfection.</li><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Force Upgrade ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🛡️ Enhanced Durability:</strong> Your defensive capabilities are heightened, making barrier-based techniques 25% stronger.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💥 Overwhelming Force:</strong> Each successful strike has a 15% chance to partially bypass enemy defensive buffs or barriers.</li></ul><ul><li>🛐 <strong>Artificial Divine Energy:</strong> By artificially replicating divine energy, your attacks carry the weight of godly power, making them 20% more effective. Your health replenishes by 5% every 6 turns.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔋 Infinite Energy Model (I.E.M) Perk:</strong> Your core produces an endless supply of energy, allowing for near-limitless ki-based attacks without cooldown restrictions.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔌 Energy Absorption Model (E.A.M) Perk:</strong> Absorbing an energy attack restores 10% of your total health and temporarily boosts your power output by 15% for 3 turns.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🦾 Cyborg Model (C.M) Perk:</strong> Your cybernetic body can auto-repair minor wounds, passively restoring 5% HP every 4 turns while in combat.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 180,000,000.</li></ul><ul><li>Completion of an advanced training session exploring your physiology and pushing it to its limit (doesn't count for PL increase).</li></ul><ul><li>Must have experienced godly ki firsthand in combat, whether through being struck by or interacting with a divine being.</li></ul><ul><li>Master Dual-Legacy Drive</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li>⏳ The unnatural method of achieving this form puts immense strain on your body, limiting you to 20 turns of action before the form forcibly deactivates due to self-preservation protocols.</li></ul><ul><li>⚠️ Upon deactivation, you suffer a severe stamina crash, reducing your action economy by half for 5 turns.</li></ul><ul><li>🚫 Energy absorption only works on ki-based attacks – physical strikes and unconventional energy types are unaffected.</li></ul><ul><li>🩸 Healing effects are 50% weaker while in this form, making recovery much harder.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 10,000x [180,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 14,000x [500,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1351605786685734932/1351613453697159289","messageId":"1351613453697159289","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"⚙️  Force Upgrade  ⚙️    Infinite Energy Model (I.E.M):  As an Infinite Energy Model, your body has transcended normal limitations, operating at an unparalleled efficiency. With your synthetic"},{"title":"⚙️ Superior Assimilation ⚙️","html":"<div><span><h1>⚙️ <a href=\"https://media4.giphy.com/media/v1.Y2lkPTc5MGI3NjExMHVnbWF3c3Y5NjdtOHQ0bHo2ZDhjMnI5NDU0cHZraXYwdzVkcGFhcyZlcD12MV9pbnRlcm5hbF9naWZfYnlfaWQmY3Q9Zw/klf2j6C1pupjBcqQe0/giphy.gif\">Superior Assimilation</a> ⚙️</h1>When two Androids of opposing models make the ultimate decision to assimilate, they unlock a form beyond anything either could achieve alone. This fusion dramatically enhances height, muscle mass, and can even alter physical features such as skin tone, hair color, and eye pigmentation. However, the most significant transformation occurs internally—systems sync in perfect unison, maximizing combat efficiency while pushing power levels to unimaginable heights. This form embodies the pinnacle of artificial evolution, granting access to abilities once thought unattainable.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Superior Assimilation ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>♾️ Dual-Powered Core:</strong> The fusion of two Android types creates an energy source far greater than a singular unit, exponentially boosting power output.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Adaptive Energy Flow:</strong> The user's core operates at optimal levels, allowing seamless transitions between offense and defense without energy drain.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌀 Fusion Efficiency:</strong> The assimilation allows for a perfect blend of Infinite Energy and Energy Absorption, enabling ki-based sustainability and enhanced countermeasures against enemy attacks.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🚨 Tactical Override:</strong> The user can override one negative status effect (stun, debuff, etc.) once per battle, resetting their combat capabilities to peak condition.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔧 Model-Specific Upgrades:</strong> Each combination of Android types grants unique enhancements;\n<ul><li><strong>IEM + EAM – Perpetual Conversion:</strong> The fusion achieves perfect energy efficiency, allowing absorbed energy to be immediately converted into raw power, increasing attack potency by 15% for 3 turns after absorption.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>IEM + CM – Adaptive Reconstruction:</strong> The merged body can self-repair minor damage in real-time, reducing incoming damage by 10% and restoring 5% HP every 5 turns.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>EAM + CM – Overclocked Optimization:</strong> The assimilation enhances reaction time and combat adaptability, granting a 10% boost to speed and evasiveness, while allowing absorbed energy to fortify defenses by 20% for 2 turns.</li></ul></li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 1,000,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Find an Android of the Opposite Type (I.E.M/E.A.M/C.M) and Assimilate (Must be repeated per stage)</li></ul><ul><li>Master Force Upgrade</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⏳ Limited Activation:</strong> The immense strain on your systems allows this form to last only 20 turns before forcibly shutting down due to self-preservation protocols.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚠️ Berserk Probability:</strong> Due to conflicting internal directives, engaging in this form has a high risk of mental instability <em>(Roll 1-10: A 7 or higher triggers uncontrollable aggression).</em></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔋 Overheating Risk:</strong> Continuous high-energy output leads to 10% increased energy depletion per turn after the 10th turn.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 18,000x [1,000,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 22,000x [3,000,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1351605786685734932/1351617565558050898","messageId":"1351617565558050898","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"⚙️  Superior Assimilation  ⚙️ When two Androids of opposing models make the ultimate decision to assimilate, they unlock a form beyond anything either could achieve alone. This fusion dramatic"},{"title":"Overclocked Evolution ⚡","html":"<div><span><h1>⚡ <a href=\"https://c.tenor.com/VsbgTQvtLRAAAAAC/tenor.gif\">Overclocked Evolution</a> ⚡</h1>Harnessing a force once beyond your reach, you have assimilated divine energy into your very being. No longer bound by the limitations of synthetic power alone, you have fused your android core with Godly Ki, unlocking newfound frontiers of strength and adaptability. This transformation allows you to wield divine energy with unparalleled efficiency, pushing your limits beyond what was once thought possible. Your energy output now surges with a divine radiance, amplifying your capabilities in both combat and endurance, with temporary power boosts lasting longer than ever before.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Overclocked Evolution ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>⚡ Divine Conduit:</strong> Your synthetic body seamlessly integrates Godly Ki, making all energy-based attacks 30% stronger while reducing incoming energy damage by 25%.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Overloaded Core:</strong> Temporary power boosts now last 4 turns instead of 2, extending the duration of peak combat efficiency.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🛡️ Enhanced Durability:</strong> Godly Ki fortifies your structure, increasing overall endurance and reducing stamina drain.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>✨ Energy Overflow:</strong> Your body passively emits excess divine energy, making it harder for enemies to track your movements and sense your energy signature.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Complete an advanced training session focused on mastering the properties of Godly Ki (Does not grant PL increase).</li></ul><ul><li>Engage in battle with a warrior possessing Godly Ki and successfully absorb their energy.</li></ul><ul><li>Base  Power Level of 7,000,000,000</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⏳ Energy Overload:</strong> Your synthetic core struggles to regulate divine energy, capping your form usage at 15 turns before system shutdown.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🛑 Critical System Strain:</strong> Failure to regulate energy flow results in total system exhaustion, causing forced deactivation after 15 turns.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚠️ Instability Risk:</strong> Prolonged exposure to unrefined Godly Ki can cause temporary malfunctions or erratic combat behavior, requiring recalibration post-battle.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 26,000x</strong></li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1351605786685734932/1351624878087864351","messageId":"1351624878087864351","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"⚡  Overclocked Evolution  ⚡ Harnessing a force once beyond your reach, you have assimilated divine energy into your very being. No longer bound by the limitations of synthetic power alone, you"}],"notes":[],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1351605786685734932","imageOnly":false,"classification":"normal"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335290588676751473","formCount":16,"art":"assets/brand.png","sparkingNotes":["SPARKING! 🧪 Bio-Android 🧪 Rage Boost: Dependant on DNA Potential Boost: Dependant on DNA Ki Reserves: Dependant on DNA","The Basic Information associates SPARKING! with Bio-Android, although the role screenshot does not explicitly label it SPARKING!."]},{"name":"Arcosian","slug":"arcosian","accent":"#bb97ed","shade":"#654be1","description":"Hailing from the frigid landscapes of Planet Arcose, the Arcosians are a race of naturally powerful, highly intelligent, and nearly indestructible beings. Known for their raw strength, extreme durability, and unparalleled energy c…","about":[{"title":"🧊 The Arcosians 🧊","html":"<div><span><h1>🧊 The Arcosians 🧊</h1>Hailing from the frigid landscapes of Planet Arcose, the Arcosians are a race of naturally powerful, highly intelligent, and nearly indestructible beings. Known for their raw strength, extreme durability, and unparalleled energy control, they are among the most feared species in the universe.\nPossessing a unique transformation hierarchy, Arcosians have the ability to compress or expand their power at will, adopting restrictive forms to regulate their overwhelming strength or unleashing their full potential in battle. Their natural adaptability allows them to survive in the vacuum of space, making them formidable cosmic conquerors.\nDespite their immense might, Arcosians are not without weaknesses—they are vulnerable to magic-based attacks, particularly fire-based techniques, and their overconfidence often leads them to underestimate their opponents.\n<h1><s>--------------------------------------------------</s></h1><ul><li><strong>💪 Arcosian Strengths 💪</strong><ul><li><strong>💪 Enhanced Strength:</strong> Capable of shattering mountains, overwhelming enemies in melee combat, and crushing opponents with sheer brute force.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>👁️ Heightened Senses:</strong> Possess enhanced vision, acute hearing, and heightened spatial awareness, allowing them to track even the fastest of foes.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🛡️ Extreme Survivability:</strong> Arcosians can thrive in the vacuum of space, resisting extreme temperatures, radiation, and even prolonged periods without oxygen.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>❄️ Cryogenic Resistance:</strong> Their ice-hardened biology allows them to resist cold-based attacks and survive in sub-zero conditions with ease.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Arcosian Weaknesses ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🔥 Magical Aversion:</strong> Arcosians possess a natural weakness to Pyromancy, making them highly susceptible to fire-based attacks and heat-based energy techniques.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>👑 Arrogance &amp; Overconfidence:</strong> Due to their superiority complex, Arcosians tend to underestimate opponents, leaving them vulnerable to deception, ambushes, and surprise counterattacks.</li></ul></li></ul><h1><s>--------------------------------------------------</s></h1><ul><li>💥 Arcosian Abilities 💥<ul><li><strong>✨ Ki Manipulation:</strong> Arcosians have exceptional ki control, allowing them to generate energy blasts, enhance physical strikes, and sense power fluctuations.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>❄️ Cryomancy:</strong> Through ki-infused ice manipulation, Arcosians can freeze opponents, summon ice weaponry, create defensive shields, and even shape massive constructs.</li></ul><ul><li><strong> ⚔️ Zenkai:</strong> When a Arcosian’s health drops below 15% and they survive, their body adapts and permanently increases their Power Level by 20%–130%, <span>(-10% for SPARKING)</span> and a maximum of 3 Zenkais per saga/major arc. Non-lethal injuries do not trigger Zenkai, and immediate medical, magical, or technological healing caps the boost at 20%.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🌟 Special Abilities 🌟</strong><ul><li><strong>🌟 Heightened Potential:</strong> Arcosians can temporarily unleash their full latent power, boosting their power level by 2.75x. This state grants better ki control and increases the potency of techniques for a limited time. However, extended use leads to exhaustion, making it best for short bursts in combat.</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335290480014921769/1335307179695144960","messageId":"1335307179695144960"},{"title":"Untitled section","html":"<div><span><h1><s>--------------------------------------------------</s></h1><ul><li><strong>🔥 Starting Techniques / Caps and Boosts 🔥</strong><ul><li><strong>👑 Royal Class</strong></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Ultimate Technique:</strong> Supernova\n<ul><li>A colossal sphere of blazing energy, brimming with destructive force, is formed above the user. This attack carries planet-erasing capabilities, detonating on impact with an explosion capable of decimating entire landscapes. Due to its immense power, it requires a long charge time and high energy consumption, making it a technique best used as a finisher or strategic strike.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>💀 Super Technique:</strong> Death Ball\n<ul><li>A highly condensed energy sphere, fired with lethal precision, designed to eradicate targets instantly upon impact. This fast-moving attack can pierce through multiple opponents or detonate upon contact, delivering devastating shockwaves in its wake.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🥶  Super-Elite Class</strong><ul><li>🌍 Ultimate Technique: Planet Crusher Beam</li></ul><ul><li>A devastating, continuous energy beam, capable of cutting through mountains, enemies, and even barriers with relentless power. This beam grows stronger the longer it is sustained, making it an ideal attack for overwhelming defensive opponents and carving through large-scale obstacles.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>❄️ Super Technique:</strong> Frost Barrage\n<ul><li>Unleashes a rapid flurry of high-speed frost-infused energy blasts, designed to bombard opponents with sheer volume and pinpoint accuracy. Each blast carries a chilling effect, slowing enemy movements upon contact. The rapid-fire nature of this attack makes it excellent for both offensive pressure and counterplay.</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul><h1><s>--------------------------------------------------</s></h1><ul><li><strong> <span>@Arcosian (Ascension)</span> | <span>@Arcosian (Augmented)</span></strong><ul><li>Rage Boost: 1.45x</li></ul><ul><li>Potential Boost: 10%</li></ul><ul><li>Ki Reserves: 150%</li></ul></li></ul><span><strong><code>SPARKING!</code></strong></span><ul><li><strong><span>@Arcosian (Mutant)</span></strong></li></ul><ul><li>Rage Boost: 3.5x (+40% every 8 posts)</li></ul><ul><li>Potential Boost: 25%</li></ul><ul><li>Ki Reserves: 200%</li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335290480014921769/1335307190885417083","messageId":"1335307190885417083"},{"title":"Form names are determined by the user","html":"<div><span><h1>🌌 Form names are determined by the user 🌌</h1><ul><li><strong>🌀 <a href=\"https://media.tenor.com/kfuA-c7bAawAAAAM/frieza.gif\">First Form</a> 🌀</strong><ul><li>The base state of an Arcosian, appearing small and sleek, with a natural exoskeleton providing inherent durability. Their signature horns curve from their head, and their crimson eyes hold a glimmer of cunning intelligence. While unassuming, this form conceals immense potential waiting to be unleashed.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🔥 <a href=\"https://media.tenor.com/HuDTUiEy0zEAAAAM/freeza-frieza.gif\">Second Form</a> 🔥</strong><ul><li>Upon evolving, the Arcosian’s frame grows in height and muscle density, amplifying their raw strength and resilience. Their horns elongate, and their voice deepens, radiating a more commanding presence. This transformation signifies a significant leap in power, making them a fearsome combatant.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🦇 <a href=\"https://i.makeagif.com/media/12-02-2015/Zz3PTR.gif\">Third Form</a> 🦇</strong><ul><li>The most alien and monstrous transformation, the Arcosian elongates unnaturally, their face distorting into an eerie, skeletal visage. Horns multiply and curve backward, and their voice becomes distorted, almost unrecognizable. This transformation prioritizes speed and aggression, overwhelming opponents with relentless barrages.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🌟 <a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/dragonballfanon/images/d/de/Final_Form_Frieza.gif/revision/latest?cb=20200708214204\">Final Form</a> 🌟</strong><ul><li>The Arcosian refines their power into a sleek and perfected form, their grotesque features condensing into a more compact, elegant physique. Gone are the excess protrusions; instead, their body gleams with smooth, polished skin, their energy signature refined to absolute efficiency. This is their pinnacle state before reaching more specialized evolutions.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Arcosian Basics ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>Second Form;</strong></li></ul><ul><li><strong>✊ Brute Force:</strong> Physical attacks deal 25% more damage due to increased muscle mass.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🛡️ Enhanced Durability:</strong> Incoming damage is reduced by 15% as the exoskeleton strengthens.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Third Form;</strong><ul><li><strong>🚅 Frenzied Assault:</strong> Speed is boosted by 30%, allowing for rapid consecutive strikes.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>❗ Terror Inducing:</strong> Opponents suffer a 10% decrease in defensive effectiveness due to the monstrous nature of this form.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔨 Pain Threshold:</strong> Receives 20% less flinching from attacks, allowing for uninterrupted combat flow.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>Final Form;</strong><ul><li><strong>💪 Absolute Power:</strong> No wasted energy, increasing attack efficiency by 25%.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🚅 Untouchable Grace:</strong> Movements are more fluid and instinctual, granting a 15% increase to evasion.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>❗ Dominant Presence:</strong> Opponents feel immense pressure, decreasing their offensive effectiveness by 10%.</li></ul></li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖 Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li><strong>Second Form:</strong> </li></ul><ul><li>Must achieve natural progression through training or combat.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Third Form:</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 65,000.</li></ul><ul><li>Achieve evolution through sustained combat or intense emotion.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>Final Form:</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 8,000,000.</li></ul><ul><li>Achieve transformation through mastery of previous states.</li></ul></li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>Second Form;</strong> </li></ul><ul><li><strong>weights Increased Bulk weights:</strong> Speed is reduced by 10% due to the body’s increased mass.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Third Form;</strong><ul><li><strong>⚡ Unstable Form:</strong> Requires higher energy consumption, decreasing stamina regeneration.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🏹 Distorted Movements:</strong> Precision in energy-based attacks is slightly reduced.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>Final Form:</strong><ul><li><strong>🪫 Energy Overload:</strong> The sheer potency of this form can result in minor stamina drain over prolonged battles.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>😱 Target of Fear:</strong> This transformation makes the user a priority target in battle due to its overwhelming strength.</li></ul></li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multiplier 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 1x</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 2x</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Third Stage:</strong> 5x [65,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Fourth Stage:</strong> 113x [8,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335290480014921769/1407480673060520049","messageId":"1407480673060520049"},{"title":"Quick Trip","html":"<div><span><h1>Quick Trip</h1><a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335290480014921769/1335307179695144960\">Racial Info</a></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335290480014921769/1407480695411966094","messageId":"1407480695411966094"}],"paths":[{"name":"Ascension Path","kind":"branch","forms":[{"title":"Chromacron 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://i.makeagif.com/media/2-13-2016/5oG3Af.gif\">Chromacron</a> 🌟</h1>Polished to perfection, this transformation represents the user’s ultimate mastery over their own potential—a flawless culmination of training, discipline, and sheer will. Their body gleams with a radiant crimson-gold sheen, as if dipped in molten divinity, every inch exuding superiority and pride. The energy they emit no longer crackles with raw chaos, but instead flows in steady, controlled pulses—calm, lethal, and impossibly refined. Their aura no longer screams; it commands. Eyes gleam with confident certainty, and even the faintest movement seems intentional, sharp, and untouchable. The air bends with reverence around them—this is not just power... it's perfection made manifest.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Evolution ⚙️</strong><ul><li>🌌 <strong>Aura Flare:</strong> Emits a powerful burst of radiant energy, repelling nearby enemies and deflecting mid-level projectiles. Can be used once every 5 posts.</li></ul><ul><li>🔥 <strong>Fiery Destruction:</strong> Fires a devastating energy beam from the hands or mouth with massive AoE damage. Deals double damage to fortified terrain or barriers.</li></ul><ul><li>🌐 <strong>Gravity Crush:</strong> Manipulates the local gravity around a single target, immobilizing them for 1 post (1 use every 10 posts). Useful for control and setups.</li></ul><ul><li>💥 <strong>Post Scaling Duration:</strong> Form starts with a 10-post limit on first activation. After rest, future activations increase to 15 posts max.</li></ul><ul><li>🧠 <strong>Mental Clarity:</strong> Despite the overwhelming power, this form grants a focused mind, allowing the user to remain calm under duress and ignore fear or pain-based effects.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 50,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Must complete 50 posts of focused, body-breaking training (Must be repeated per stage)</li></ul><ul><li>Must experience a moment of overwhelming personal realization or awakened will (can be event or story-based)</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li>🪫 <strong>Initial Drain:</strong> First activation is highly taxing—form lasts only 10 posts before auto-reverting</li></ul><ul><li>🔁 <strong>Cooldown:</strong> After each use, a cooldown of 10 posts is required before reuse</li></ul><ul><li>🧍 <strong>Aura Interference:</strong> While Aura Flare is active, user’s vision blurs slightly and Ki attacks are less accurate</li></ul><ul><li>🧷 <strong>High Emotional Tether:</strong> The form draws power from the user’s will—extreme doubt or guilt can destabilize it mid-use</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 400x [50,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 10,000x [180,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 14,000x [500,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1248501505078722603/1363041527097458851","messageId":"1363041527097458851","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Chromacron  🌟 Polished to perfection, this transformation represents the user’s ultimate mastery over their own potential—a flawless culmination of training, discipline, and sheer will. The"},{"title":"Neo-Chromacron 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://pa1.aminoapps.com/7726/12207f79ee0d3660bf8f68dbb24d8c269a19484fr1-480-252_hq.gif\">Neo-Chromacron</a> 🌟</h1>This is no longer just a transformation—True Evolution is the embodiment of perfection incarnate. Transcending the already-magnificent Evolved state, this form blazes with an iridescent radiance, its glow intense enough to challenge the very sun. A flawless harmony of grace and destruction, the user's physique now walks the line between celestial beauty and cataclysmic force. Their aura pulses in slow, powerful waves, distorting the very fabric of reality around them. Movement becomes poetry—measured, elegant, and lethal. Despite the serenity that graces their face, a roiling storm of cosmic power lies just beneath the surface. With every breath, the air quivers; with every step, reality trembles. This is absolute dominance, made flesh.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of True Evolution ⚙️</strong><ul><li>🌌 <strong>Enhanced Aura Flare:</strong> A perfected version of Aura Flare—can now knock back stronger opponents and vaporize weaker projectiles completely. 1 use per 5 posts.</li></ul><ul><li>🔥 <strong>Fiery Destruction – Omega:</strong> This evolved blast now pierces energy shields and can detonate mid-flight to create a shockwave of energy. 2-post cooldown.</li></ul><ul><li>🌐 <strong>Gravity Crush – Dominance Field:</strong> The range is increased; affects multiple targets within a small radius. Immobilizes for 1 post or slows movement for 2. 1 use per 10 posts.</li></ul><ul><li>🧠 <strong>Absolute Clarity:</strong> Emotions no longer interfere with the user's control—they gain immunity to fear, rage triggers, or mental-based debuffs while transformed.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Power Level of 1,000,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Must have Evolution unlocked and fully mastered</li></ul><ul><li>Complete 60 posts worth of training, sparring, or combat while using Evolution (Must be repeated per stage)</li></ul><ul><li>Must experience a moment of total resonance—a breakthrough where body and mind perfectly align during combat or meditation</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li>🪫 <strong>Extreme Energy Cost:</strong> Despite its refinement, this form continuously drains energy. Can be held for 12 posts max before cooldown</li></ul><ul><li>🔁 <strong>Cooldown Phase: </strong>After ending this form, user cannot transform again for 15 posts due to system overload</li></ul><ul><li>⚡ <strong>Energy Signature Surge:</strong> The user’s presence is extremely hard to hide; stealth becomes impossible while transformed</li></ul><ul><li>💥 <strong>Collateral Hazard:</strong> The sheer aura output can unintentionally damage allies or the environment if not restrained</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 18,000x [1,000,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 22,000x [3,000,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1248501505078722603/1363042832335634574","messageId":"1363042832335634574","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Neo-Chromacron  🌟 This is no longer just a transformation—True Evolution is the embodiment of perfection incarnate. Transcending the already-magnificent Evolved state, this form blazes with"},{"title":"Nocticron 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://media.tenor.com/pIPLVX5LfjwAAAAd/black-frieza-dragon-ball-super.gif\">Nocticron</a> 🌟</h1>Frozen Ascension is the final frontier—the embodiment of a predator honed through obsession, torment, and unforgiving mastery. The user’s body becomes a monument of cosmic terror, sheathed in sleek, obsidian-black bio-armor that reflects no light—only inevitability. A spectral frost bleeds from their aura, rippling in phantom wisps like death made visible. Their eyes burn with ruthless intelligence, and their presence alone chokes the air from the lungs of those nearby. Every motion is silent precision, every glare a sentence of execution. This is not evolution—it is dominion, frozen in time and sharpened to perfection.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Frozen Ascension ⚙️</strong><ul><li>❄️ <strong>Frozen Pulse:</strong> Upon transformation, an icy shockwave expands outward, slowing the movement and reaction speed of all nearby opponents for 2 posts</li></ul><ul><li>💀 <strong>Execution State:</strong> Damage dealt to opponents below 75% of the user's PL is amplified by 1.5x for the first 5 posts of combat</li></ul><ul><li>🌌 <strong>Null Zone:</strong> Passive. Incoming techniques with a lower Ki signature than the user’s are weakened by 25% upon impact</li></ul><ul><li>🩸 <strong>Chilling Precision:</strong> All attacks have a 10% increased critical hit rate (stackable with other buffs if applicable)</li></ul><ul><li>⚔️ <strong>Cold Calculus:</strong> The user can instantly analyze a target’s combat rhythm after 3 consecutive posts of observing them—granting a +1 post advantage in dodging or countering that target’s next attack</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Power Level of 7,000,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Must have mastered True Evolution and undergone 80 posts of absolute, isolated training</li></ul><ul><li>Must survive or cause a moment of cataclysmic loss or breakthrough—this form is born from hatred, solitude, or a ruthless final lesson</li></ul><ul><li>Must meditate in zero-gravity or planetary void for 10 posts to prepare the body for its Frozen State</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li>🧊 <strong>Internal Strain:</strong> Maintaining this form causes slow internal fatigue; after 15 posts, the user takes increasing stamina damage per post</li></ul><ul><li>🛑 <strong>No Partial Power Usage:</strong> The user must enter this form at full intensity—no scaling down, meaning it can’t be suppressed</li></ul><ul><li>📉 <strong>Emotional Suppression:</strong> Emotions become nearly inaccessible while transformed—this can disrupt bonds or prevent Zenkai triggers</li></ul><ul><li>🌀 <strong>Overkill Syndrome:</strong> If the user defeats an enemy while emotionally unstable, they may lose control and attack allies or surroundings</li></ul><ul><li>🔁 <strong>Long Cooldown:</strong> Can only be used once every 25 posts after deactivation due to severe strain on the body</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 26,000x</strong></li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1248501505078722603/1363044531842449489","messageId":"1363044531842449489","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Nocticron  🌟 Frozen Ascension is the final frontier—the embodiment of a predator honed through obsession, torment, and unforgiving mastery. The user’s body becomes a monument of cosmic terr"}],"notes":[],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1248501505078722603","imageOnly":false,"classification":"normal"},{"name":"Augmentation Path","kind":"branch","forms":[{"title":"First Augmentation 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://media.tenor.com/a0E7XUeH5RAAAAAM/cooler-cooler-dbz.gif\">First Augmentation</a> 🌟</h1>Upon achieving the First Augmentation, the Arcosian transcends the limitations of their fourth form, transforming into a powerhouse of raw strength and tactical dominance. Their body expands dramatically, muscles bulging with overwhelming force while their once-smooth skin now gleams with a metallic, almost crystalline sheen. Horns curve backward menacingly from their head, and their piercing eyes radiate a fiery intensity that embodies both determination and authority. A faint, shimmering aura of violet and silver energy surrounds them, pulsating with each movement and signaling their elevated mastery over both their body and energy. This form solidifies the Arcosian as a force few could challenge, blending unbreakable resilience with immense destructive potential.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of First Augmentation ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🛡️ Reinforced Exoskeleton:</strong> Gains an additional layer of protective energy plating, significantly boosting defense and reducing physical damage from melee attacks.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Power Surge:</strong> Temporarily amplifies energy output, making attacks more devastating and difficult for opponents to withstand.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧲 Magnetic Field:</strong> Generates a field capable of attracting or repelling objects, allowing battlefield manipulation and environmental control.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Mastery over 4th/Final Form</li></ul><ul><li>Base Power Level of 50,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Complete a rigorous enhancement process to push beyond natural limits. (Must be repeated per stage)</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⏳ High Energy Drain:</strong> Augmentation puts immense strain on the user, rapidly depleting stamina and ki.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌀 Overload Risk:</strong> Extended use can fatigue the mind and body, potentially causing temporary disorientation or energy backlash.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 400x [50,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 10,000x [180,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Third Stage:</strong> 14,000x [500,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1248501643264393269/1406309737439694989","messageId":"1406309737439694989","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  First Augmentation  🌟 Upon achieving the First Augmentation, the Arcosian transcends the limitations of their fourth form, transforming into a powerhouse of raw strength and tactical domina"},{"title":"Reinforced Augmentation 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://images-wixmp-ed30a86b8c4ca887773594c2.wixmp.com/f/4f8733c2-4b20-400a-be6d-bb117b1a8c17/ddy0oe3-8066ebbc-843e-4001-a1b7-9fed67aca4ff.png/v1/fill/w_1280,h_1768/commission___king_cold_new_form_by_chibidamz_ddy0oe3-fullview.png?token=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..vH9ddnRV9eXO4vOD2mhz9Qm31EEt4zXWZl6YjRd8pxw\">Reinforced Augmentation</a> 🌟</h1>This form represents the Arcosian’s second augmentation, a masterful evolution of strength, resilience, and battlefield control. The body expands in both size and musculature, exuding raw power, while a subtle iridescent glow suffuses the skin, signaling the immense energy coursing within. Facial features sharpen, giving an imposing, refined appearance, and the overall silhouette radiates dominance and agility. The aura flickers with kinetic energy, visible as streaks of violet and silver light that shimmer with every movement. This transformation is the embodiment of perfect control over both physical might and energy manipulation, allowing the Arcosian to operate with precision and overwhelming force.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Reinforced Augmentation ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>⚡ Kinetic Absorption:</strong> Absorbs energy from incoming physical attacks, converting it into temporary boosts to strength and speed.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🛡️ Adaptive Exoskeleton:</strong> The Arcosian’s body gains a resilient energy armor that dynamically adjusts to incoming attacks, reducing damage from melee or energy attacks by 30–50% depending on intensity.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Energy Redirection:</strong> Absorbed energy from attacks can be redirected into the next attack, allowing strikes to hit with increased force or altered trajectory.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Must have mastered all prior Arcosian forms </li></ul><ul><li>Base Power Level of 1,000,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Spend 1 year in focused meditation and conditioning to harmonize with new energy output (Must be repeated per stage)</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⏳ Medium Energy Drain:</strong> While easier to maintain than previous augmentations, prolonged use still consumes substantial stamina.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌀 Precision Dependency:</strong> Many abilities rely on accurate energy control; reckless usage reduces effectiveness.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Strain on Musculature:</strong> Extended combat can cause temporary fatigue due to the increased muscle mass and energy flow.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 18,000x [1,000,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 22,000x [3,000,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1248501643264393269/1406313318821662800","messageId":"1406313318821662800","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Reinforced Augmentation  🌟 This form represents the Arcosian’s second augmentation, a masterful evolution of strength, resilience, and battlefield control. The body expands in both size and"},{"title":"Colossal Augmentation 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://preview.redd.it/the-fan-made-webcomic-dragon-ball-multiverse-gave-king-cold-v0-ck1nlgyxci4e1.jpg?width=640&amp;crop=smart&amp;auto=webp&amp;s=4c951536d70e0bb05f331896c1a13df866bf2d6d\">Colossal Augmentation</a> 🌟</h1>Colossal Augmentation is the ultimate expression of the Arcosian Augmentation Path, transforming the user into an immense powerhouse whose sheer size and aura command dominance on the battlefield. Musculature and body mass increase exponentially, towering over all previous forms. The skin shimmers with a metallic sheen, reflecting the energy radiating from within, while veins pulse with visible surges of kinetic power. Horns lengthen and curve with a more menacing arc, facial features sharpen, and glowing eyes pierce with unyielding focus. This transformation represents the perfect fusion of strength, energy control, and battlefield manipulation. The sheer presence of a Colossal Augmented Arcosian causes smaller opponents to hesitate, intimidated by both size and the aura of raw force.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Colossal Augmentation ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🛡️ Titanic Exoskeleton:</strong> Energy plating becomes massive and highly resistant, reducing melee and energy damage significantly while allowing the user to act as a mobile barrier.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Kinetic Absorption:</strong> Converts incoming kinetic energy from physical impacts into temporary boosts to strength, speed, and durability.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Energy Overload:</strong> The Arcosian can temporarily release stored kinetic or absorbed energy to dramatically increase attack potency for 1–2 turns.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌊 Shockwave Generation:</strong> Every physical strike releases concussive shockwaves, creating AoE damage and staggering nearby foes.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌊 Colossal Presence:</strong> The extreme size and aura not only intimidate weaker opponents, but cause small-scale environmental effects like tremors and wind displacement with movements.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>The user must have fully mastered the 6th form (Reinforced Augmentation), demonstrating complete control over its mechanics in multiple combat scenarios.</li></ul><ul><li>Must undergo a year-long extreme conditioning program combining high-intensity physical training, energy control exercises, and meditative focus to harmonize size, power, and energy flow.</li></ul><ul><li>Base Power Level of 7,000,000,000</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🔋 High Ki Drain:</strong> Maintaining this form is extremely taxing; prolonged usage can severely weaken the user afterward.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Body Strain:</strong> High damage and energy usage can cause intense physical strain, requiring recovery time between fights.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 26,000x</strong></li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1248501643264393269/1406313988135976961","messageId":"1406313988135976961","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Colossal Augmentation  🌟 Colossal Augmentation is the ultimate expression of the Arcosian Augmentation Path, transforming the user into an immense powerhouse whose sheer size and aura comma"}],"notes":[],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1248501643264393269","imageOnly":false,"classification":"normal"},{"name":"Mutant Path","kind":"branch","forms":[{"title":"Mutant Arcosian Suppression Forms 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 Mutant Arcosian Suppression Forms 🌟</h1>Mutant Arcosians are born with an uncontrollable surge of natural power—monstrous, volatile, and overwhelming. Rather than evolving upward like normal Arcosians, they must learn to suppress their strength just to survive. Their transformation path is one of containment, achieved through sheer will, training, and emotional duress. Until mastery is achieved, they cannot access these forms at will. Instead, they are triggered only through high-emotion moments, and always in sequential order, never skipped. Mastery unlocks the ability to suppress consciously without consequence.\n<ul><li><strong>🔹 Suppression Form Index 🔹</strong><ul><li><a href=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/11f6698a84b648b162c87e8943123495/tumblr_ptt8q3qcPR1xrcg8po1_500.gif\">First Suppression</a></li></ul><ul><li><a href=\"https://media.tenor.com/HuDTUiEy0zEAAAAM/freeza-frieza.gif\">Second Suppression</a></li></ul><ul><li><a href=\"https://i.makeagif.com/media/1-20-2016/hG-QOH.gif\">Third Suppression</a></li></ul><ul><li><a href=\"https://media.tenor.com/V9m6OIYokS8AAAAM/frieza-freeza.gif\">True Base</a></li></ul></li><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics Of Suppression ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>First Suppression;</strong></li></ul><ul><li>🔇 Natural energy signature is heavily muted, near undetectable</li></ul><ul><li>🐉 Techniques cost half as much Ki in this form</li></ul><ul><li>❄️ Reduces aggression-based impulses—makes the user calm and composed</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Second Suppression;</strong><ul><li>🛡️ Can form temporary bone-armor plating for 1 post every 5 posts</li></ul><ul><li>🐾 Dash speed increases significantly (short bursts)</li></ul><ul><li>😈 <strong>Passive intimidation:</strong> opponents with less PL lose 1 post of action due to fear on first encounter</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>Third Suppression;</strong><ul><li>🔮 User can fire chaotic beam volleys that ignore terrain and energy shields</li></ul><ul><li>🌀 Gains a 10% Ki regeneration buff passively</li></ul><ul><li>🔊 Aura resonates in pulses, making stealth impossible, but creating area-wide Ki pressure</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li>True Base;\n<ul><li>⚡ <strong>Ki Refinement Mastery:</strong> All energy-based attacks cost 25% less Ki and charge 1 post faster. This makes their offense feel fluid, clean, and effortless.</li></ul><ul><li>🧠 <strong>Perfect Combat Clarity:</strong> While in this form, the user gains heightened perception, granting a passive +1 post reaction bonus to dodge or parry once every 3 posts.</li></ul><ul><li>🔄 <strong>Adaptation Surge:</strong> After receiving damage for 3 consecutive posts, the user gains a temporary +100% PL buff for 5 posts (once per transformation).</li></ul></li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li><strong>Second Suppression;</strong></li></ul><ul><li>Complete 15 trainings of control</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Third Suppression;</strong><ul><li>Complete 30 trainings of control</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>True Base;</strong><ul><li>Complete 60 trainings of control</li></ul></li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>First Suppression;</strong></li></ul><ul><li>🐣 Physically frail; damage resistance is halved</li></ul><ul><li>💢 Cannot transform unless pushed into an emotional state, without training <span>(Into Second Suppression)</span></li></ul><ul><li><strong>Second Suppression;</strong><ul><li>🔄 Form becomes unstable after 10 posts, reducing defense</li></ul><ul><li>💀 Constant internal aggression—user may lash out without intent</li></ul><ul><li>💢 Cannot transform unless pushed into an emotional state, without training <span>(Into Third Suppression)</span></li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>Third Suppression;</strong><ul><li>🧠 Hallucinations or warped senses may trigger during long use</li></ul><ul><li>🛑 Cannot revert manually—must burn out or be knocked out</li></ul><ul><li>😖 Speech and complex thought become difficult while active</li></ul><ul><li>💢 Cannot transform unless pushed into an emotional state, without training <span>(Into True Base)</span></li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>True Base;</strong><ul><li>🔋 Extremely energy intensive without training—causes rapid fatigue if not mastered</li></ul><ul><li>❗ Afterburn: body overheats, reducing PL by 10% for 5 posts after exit</li></ul><ul><li>🧿 If entered emotionally, the user may lose moral restraint and act purely on instinct</li></ul></li></ul></li><li><strong>📉 Multiplier 📉</strong><ul><li><strong>🔻 First Suppression:</strong> Divide by 113</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔻Second Suppression;</strong> Divide by 56.5</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔻Third Suppression:</strong> Divide by 28.25</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔻True Base:</strong> 1x</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1248501883895550003/1363056000281608375","messageId":"1363056000281608375","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟 Mutant Arcosian Suppression Forms 🌟 Mutant Arcosians are born with an uncontrollable surge of natural power—monstrous, volatile, and overwhelming. Rather than evolving upward like normal Arc"},{"title":"🧬 Augmented Base 🧬","html":"<div><span><h1>🧬 <a href=\"https://media.tenor.com/a0E7XUeH5RAAAAAd/cooler-cooler-dbz.gif\">Augmented Base</a> 🧬</h1>Among the feared and revered forms of the Mutant Arcosians, Empowered Apex stands alone as the pinnacle of brutal beauty and overwhelming might. In this ultimate metamorphosis, the user’s body swells with refined muscle mass, their already imposing frame becoming titanic in presence. Smooth bio-armor gives way to a radiant luster—like polished obsidian infused with icy crystal, glimmering with deadly elegance. Horns arch backward in a sharpened curve, framing a visage of primal royalty.\nTheir eyes glow with molten intent, locking onto foes with a gaze that bends even the boldest knees. Every motion is weighted with absolute dominance—slow, deliberate, and filled with killing intent. In this form, a Mutant Arcosian doesn't just suppress or reveal power—they embody it.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Augmented Base ⚙️</strong><ul><li>🔥 <strong>Energy Overflow:</strong> Attacks deal 2.5x damage, but the user constantly radiates visible energy, making stealth or concealment impossible.</li></ul><ul><li>⚡ <strong>Adrenaline Rush:</strong> Enhanced instinct grants a passive +1 post dodge or counter advantage every 4 posts (resets after use).</li></ul><ul><li>💪 <strong>Overdrive Body:</strong> Physical techniques (melee, grapples, throws) deal +50% damage, and allow for minor knockback or stun if enemy PL is lower.</li></ul><ul><li>🧠 <strong>Combat Prediction:</strong> After observing a target for 2 posts, the user gains insight into their attack pattern, granting +10% dodge chance for the next incoming technique.</li></ul><ul><li>💥 <strong>Aura Detonation (Optional):</strong> Can unleash stored energy in a massive pulse, forcing knockback on all nearby enemies and temporarily reducing their Ki output by 15% for 2 posts. Usable once per transformation.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️ </strong><ul><li>Must be in True Form; This is an augmentation, not a separate evolution</li></ul><ul><li>Can only be activated after complete mastery of all suppression forms and 30 posts of combat practice in True Base</li></ul><ul><li>The user must use the form in battle 5 times, before continuing to the next stage</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li>🔋 <strong>High Energy Drain:</strong> Form can only be maintained for 10 posts before fatigue begins to rapidly reduce performance</li></ul><ul><li>🌠 <strong>Aura Uncontainable:</strong> Cannot conceal power signature — always visible on scouters and to Ki-sensors</li></ul><ul><li>⚠️ <strong>Strain Surge:</strong> After using Aura Detonation, the user suffers -5% to their defense for 3 posts due to system overload</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 10x [Once True Form is Mastered]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 50x [100,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Third Stage:</strong> 100x [500,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Fourth Stage:</strong> 400x [1,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1248501883895550003/1363058682455265402","messageId":"1363058682455265402","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🧬  Augmented Base  🧬 Among the feared and revered forms of the Mutant Arcosians, Empowered Apex stands alone as the pinnacle of brutal beauty and overwhelming might. In this ultimate metamorph"},{"title":"Chromacron (Mutant) 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://i.makeagif.com/media/2-13-2016/5oG3Af.gif\">Chromacron (Mutant)</a> 🌟</h1>There exists a form among the Mutant Arcosians that transcends the grotesque suppression of their past—it is not an evolution of power, but a refinement of identity. Known simply as Evolution, this form doesn’t roar with chaos; it glides with precision, poise, and pride. When awakened, the user’s body takes on a sleek, polished appearance, encased in reflective bio-armor that gleams like crystallized starlight.\nThis form is aesthetic and destructive, both elegant and terrifying. Their chosen hue—be it obsidian-black, flame-gold, crimson-violet, or any other—becomes the defining mark of their dominion. With a faint smile and unwavering posture, the user radiates perfect control, even as their aura hums with the intensity of a caged sun. It is no longer about suppressing their power. In this form, they celebrate it.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Chromacron (Mutant) ⚙️</strong><ul><li>🌈 <strong>Chromatic Core:</strong> The user selects a signature aura color upon first evolution—this color becomes unique to them and cannot be changed. Their aura pulses with that hue, and all energy-based attacks inherit visual and cosmetic flair related to it.</li></ul><ul><li>🧬 <strong>Refined Mutation:</strong> Physical and Ki-based abilities are honed to perfection—accuracy and critical strike chance are increased by 15%.</li></ul><ul><li>🛡️ <strong>Molecular Reinforcement:</strong> The user’s bio-armor becomes ultra-dense, reducing all incoming damage by 40%.</li></ul><ul><li>🌀 <strong>Pressure Lock Aura:</strong> Opponents with less than 50% of the user's PL suffer 1 post delay in their reaction or dodge attempts on first exposure.</li></ul><ul><li>🧠 <strong>Absolute Precision:</strong> The user no longer loses composure from rage. This form retains cold clarity and full mental control even in the heat of battle.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Must have fully mastered True Base</li></ul><ul><li>Must reach a minimum of 5,000,000 Power Level</li></ul><ul><li>Complete 50 posts of high-stakes battle or transformation conditioning while in True Base</li></ul><ul><li>Must undergo a moment of internal turmoil of some sort (Must be repeated per stage)</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li>🪫 <strong>Stamina-Intensive:</strong> Initial transformation lasts 10 posts; extended use (after full rest) allows for up to 15 posts</li></ul><ul><li>🔁 <strong>Cooldown Required:</strong> Cannot be reused until after full recovery.</li></ul><ul><li>💢 <strong>Aura of Isolation:</strong> The user’s aura causes discomfort and distrust even among allies—roleplay-wise, others may react with awe, fear, or unease</li></ul><ul><li>💀 <strong>Overconfidence Hazard:</strong> While mentally stable, this form can still lead to arrogance—strategic tunnel vision may occur during long fights</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 800x [5,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 2,000x [10,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Third Stage:</strong> 4,000x [20,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1248501883895550003/1363204236019630333","messageId":"1363204236019630333","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Chromacron (Mutant)  🌟 There exists a form among the Mutant Arcosians that transcends the grotesque suppression of their past—it is not an evolution of power, but a refinement of identity."},{"title":"Augmented Chromacron 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://pa1.aminoapps.com/6892/6e851859bb38284aea24775a394402f6b3376206r1-407-229_hq.gif\">Augmented Chromacron</a> 🌟</h1>When a Mutant Arcosian reaches the very ceiling of power—when Chromacron’s radiance and Empowered Apex’s might merge under the weight of emotional collapse—what is born is not a form, but an event. Mutant Evolved Apex is a refined monster, forged through torment, pride, and unrelenting self-mastery.\nTheir physique becomes exponentially larger, but still perfectly sculpted—bulging with divine muscle, yet sleek and angular, as if crafted by celestial hands. Their once-polished skin now gleams with a metallic radiance mirroring the hue of their personal Chromacron form, glistening like crystalized obsidian, gold, violet, or whatever power color they chose to own. Their horns sweep backward in an imperial arc, their aura flaring violently around them like a crown of cosmic flame. They do not scream. They do not boast. They simply exist—and everything around them breaks.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Augmented Chromacron ⚙️</strong><ul><li>💥 <strong>Overwhelming Force:</strong> All physical stats (strength, speed, durability) are drastically heightened. The user can overpower even similarly-leveled opponents through brute force alone.</li></ul><ul><li>🌪️ <strong>Aura of Chaos (Unstable):</strong> The user’s energy lashes out violently and unpredictably, damaging both the terrain and any creature within 10 meters—including allies. The aura cannot be turned off and grows more violent the longer the form is active. Cannot be suppressed unless the user willingly expends 5 posts to focus.</li></ul><ul><li>♻️ <strong>Resilient Recovery:</strong> Minor to moderate injuries begin healing while still in combat. However, each healing tick increases Ki drain by 5%, stacking up to 20% per use.</li></ul><ul><li>🧠 <strong>Cold Calculation:</strong> Despite the chaos, this form grants absolute mental clarity. The user becomes hyper-aware, calculating, and ruthless. Emotion fuels the transformation—but does not control it.</li></ul><ul><li>🩸 <strong>Pressure Annihilation:</strong> If a target is more than 50% weaker than the user's PL, their defenses are partially bypassed by energy strikes. (10% defense reduction against weaker opponents.)</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Must have fully mastered Chromacron and Augmented Base</li></ul><ul><li>Base Power Level of 40,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>🔧 <strong>Form Fusion Mastery:</strong> The user must complete 20 separate training sessions specifically focused on stabilizing and merging their Augmented Base form with their Chromacron state. \n<ul><li>During this training, the user must fail at least once in attempting the merge, resulting in temporary loss of control or injury.</li></ul><ul><li>The user must experience a moment of total vulnerability or emotional collapse. This can be brought on by betrayal, isolation, loss, or a forced confrontation with their mutant nature. This moment serves as the unlock trigger—the moment where mutation, pride, and pain align. (Must be repeated per stage)</li></ul></li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li>🧠 <strong>Mental Stability Strain:</strong> While initially clear-headed, prolonged use leads to emotional numbness or cold apathy—roleplay consequences are encouraged</li></ul><ul><li>🪫 <strong>Severe Energy Drain:</strong> Once the form ends, the user suffers a 70% stamina drop and cannot transform again for 15 posts</li></ul><ul><li>🩹 <strong>Delayed Collapse:</strong> After using Resilient Recovery three times, the body begins to reject energy intake, causing a crash at the end of the form (+10% extra drain per recovery used)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🛑 Cannot suppress energy signature:</strong>the user's Ki is violently radiant and detectable across vast distances</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 10,000x [40,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 20,000x [100,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Third Stage:</strong> 30,000x [250,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1248501883895550003/1363211117018611923","messageId":"1363211117018611923","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Augmented Chromacron  🌟 When a Mutant Arcosian reaches the very ceiling of power—when Chromacron’s radiance and Empowered Apex’s might merge under the weight of emotional collapse—what is b"},{"title":"Nocticron (Mutant) 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://media.tenor.com/pIPLVX5LfjwAAAAd/black-frieza-dragon-ball-super.gif\">Nocticron (Mutant)</a> 🌟</h1>Forged not in light, but in the collapsing gravity of ambition and agony, Nocticron represents the final stage of mutant Arcosian supremacy. This form is not elegant—it is eclipsed. Shrouded in an obsidian void that seems to swallow all radiance, the user's body becomes unnaturally symmetrical yet grotesque in detail—twisted perfection, armored in midnight crystal and soaked in unrelenting malice.\nTheir aura crackles with chaotic electricity, shadowfire pulsing through every breath. Their face is concealed in a veil of shifting black Ki, and their piercing eyes glow like the last stars at the edge of the universe. Their voice—if they speak at all—echoes like a whisper from the event horizon. This is not a transformation. It’s a condemnation. Once achieved, the user becomes something no longer Arcosian. No longer mortal. Just... inevitable.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Nocticron (Mutant) ⚙️</strong><ul><li>🛡️ <strong>Mutated Barrier (Always Active):</strong> A constantly-active energy layer reduces all incoming damage by 30%. This defense cannot be deactivated and pulses with crackling energy.</li></ul><ul><li>🧠 <strong>Savage Instinct:</strong> Combat instinct is pushed to its breaking point—attacks become faster, more brutal, and harder to predict. However, friend or foe distinction may blur after 5 posts.</li></ul><ul><li>💪 <strong>Overwhelming Power:</strong> Strength, speed, and stamina are boosted to absurd levels—easily overpowering even similarly-ranked enemies. Can ignore minor defensive techniques and barriers.</li></ul><ul><li>⚡ <strong>Electric Vortex:</strong> The user’s aura becomes a charged storm, crackling with unstable lightning. Once every 3 posts, they may launch a charged attack that; Deals electrical disruption damage  |  Interrupts one technique or charging action  |  Inflicts a lingering shock debuff (targets lose 1 post of action if struck directly)</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Must have fully mastered Augmented Chromacron</li></ul><ul><li>Minimum Power Level of 500,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Must complete 15 RP sessions attempting to stabilize their mutant energy in silence or isolation.</li></ul><ul><li>Can only awaken during a total emotional breakdown—losing control in a pivotal moment, sacrificing something personal, or surrendering to their own monstrous identity (Must be repeated per stage)</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li>🧠 <strong>Sanity Degradation:</strong> After 10 posts in this form, the user’s clarity begins to fade, making it difficult to roleplay rational thoughts. They may even lash out at allies if provoked or damaged.</li></ul><ul><li>🪫 <strong>Crippling Energy Drain:</strong> Upon exiting the form, the user suffers a 70% stamina reduction and cannot transform again for 20 posts</li></ul><ul><li>🛑 <strong>No Partial Power Usage:</strong> The user must enter this form at full intensity—no scaling down, meaning it can’t be suppressed</li></ul><ul><li>💀 <strong>Void Echo (RP Only):</strong> The user may begin to experience lingering hallucinations, emotional numbness, or existential dread after prolonged use (optional for long-term arc flavor)</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 50,000x [500,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 75,000x [750,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Third Stage:</strong> 100,000x [1,000,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1248501883895550003/1363212883885818151","messageId":"1363212883885818151","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Nocticron (Mutant)  🌟 Forged not in light, but in the collapsing gravity of ambition and agony, Nocticron represents the final stage of mutant Arcosian supremacy. This form is not elegant—i"},{"title":"Augmented Nocticron 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/c8122f6b-70a9-4763-868d-a227758cdc91/scale-to-width/755\">Augmented Nocticron</a> 🌟 </h1>There exists a stage of transformation so precise, so sharpened by agony and ascension, that even the stars seem to recoil in its presence. Known only as Augmented Nocticron, this form is not the result of chaos—it is the refinement of it. A perfected synthesis of celestial potential and abyssal power, this form marks the final step in a mutant Arcosian’s journey to claim absolute sovereignty.\nThe user’s physique expands with symmetrical perfection—sleek yet immense, armored in crystalline plating that glimmers with blackened luster and eclipsed radiance, reflecting the color of their former Chromacron lineage, now corrupted and fully matured. Obsidian horns crown their skull like the fangs of a dying star, and every movement trails both starlight and shadow, leaving a signature streak of dread in their wake. Their aura is silent—not because it lacks volume, but because it commands it. The battlefield bows to their presence. Their gaze? Icy. Their intentions? Unknowable. And their power? Final.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Augmented Nocticron ⚙️</strong><ul><li>💢 <strong>Unleashed Potential:</strong> All physical attributes (Strength, Speed, Reflex, Endurance) are pushed to their theoretical peak. Even the user's weakest attacks carry planet-level force.</li></ul><ul><li>🧠 <strong>Indomitable Will:</strong> Grants full immunity to mental interference, status effects, and morale-based debuffs. Pain is acknowledged—but irrelevant.</li></ul><ul><li>👁️ <strong>Overwhelming Presence:</strong> Opponents with less than 50% of the user’s PL suffer morale damage on sight (must pass a Willpower/Resolve check to act on first post).</li></ul><ul><li>♻️ <strong>Energy Efficiency:</strong> Ki techniques cost 25% less energy while damage and control are increased. Defensive and evasive maneuvers are performed with supernatural economy and speed.</li></ul><ul><li>⚡ <strong>Void Requiem (Passive):</strong> Energy that strikes the user while this form is active is partially devoured by their aura. 10% of absorbed energy is converted into minor healing (1 use per 3 posts).</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Must have fully mastered Nocticron (Mutant) and Augmented Chromacron</li></ul><ul><li>Minimum Power Level of 3,000,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Must engage in a battle against a rival or equal-tier opponent, pushing the user to their absolute brink; Awakens only after enduring crippling loss or existential clarity during said battle—this form is not about rage or pain... it’s about acceptance of what you truly are (Must be repeated per stage)</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li>🔋 <strong>Severe Strain:</strong> Augmented Nocticron cannot be maintained longer than 12 posts without suffering internal feedback damage. After 12 posts, the user takes 5% HP damage per post.</li></ul><ul><li>🧠 <strong>Void Drift:</strong> Emotional numbness begins after 6 posts. Roleplay-wise, the user becomes detached, even from allies or their original motivations.</li></ul><ul><li>💀 <strong>Post-Burn:</strong> Upon exiting the form, the user is left with a 70% stamina reduction and cannot access any transformation for the next 20 posts</li></ul><ul><li>📡 <strong>Inescapable Signature:</strong> This form’s Ki radiates across planetary and interstellar distances. Hiding is impossible; you are the storm.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 250,000x [3,000,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 500,000x [7,000,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1248501883895550003/1363217430792634368","messageId":"1363217430792634368","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Augmented Nocticron  🌟  There exists a stage of transformation so precise, so sharpened by agony and ascension, that even the stars seem to recoil in its presence. Known only as Augmented N"}],"notes":[],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1248501883895550003","imageOnly":false,"classification":"sparking"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335290480014921769","formCount":12,"art":"assets/brand.png","sparkingNotes":["SPARKING! @Arcosian (Mutant) Rage Boost: 3.5x (+40% every 8 posts) Potential Boost: 25% Ki Reserves: 200%"]},{"name":"Cerealian","slug":"cerealian","accent":"#92ddbb","shade":"#4c9778","description":"The Cerealians are a race of warriors renowned for their pinpoint accuracy, heightened senses, and unrivaled adaptability in combat. Hailing from a distant and often isolated world, they have spent generations honing their abiliti…","about":[{"title":"The Cerealians 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 The Cerealians 🌟</h1>The Cerealians are a race of warriors renowned for their pinpoint accuracy, heightened senses, and unrivaled adaptability in combat. Hailing from a distant and often isolated world, they have spent generations honing their abilities, becoming some of the greatest marksmen and warriors in the universe.\nTheir greatest strength lies in their extraordinary vision, capable of tracking the slightest movements, discerning weak points, and locking onto distant targets with near-perfect accuracy. This, combined with their natural Ki manipulation, combat instinct, and adaptability, makes them lethal opponents in any battle. However, despite their exceptional power, Cerealians suffer from distinct vulnerabilities. Their sensitive eyes leave them prone to blinding attacks.\n<h1><s>--------------------------------------------------</s></h1><ul><li><strong>💪 Cerealian Strengths 💪</strong><ul><li><strong>💪 Enhanced Strength:</strong> Cerealians possess incredible physical power, allowing them to lift heavy objects, overpower opponents, and deliver devastating melee attacks.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>👁️‍🗨️ Supreme Vision:</strong> The hallmark of their race, Cerealians have unmatched eyesight, able to see across vast distances, track movements in slow motion, and identify an enemy’s weaknesses with astonishing clarity.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔄 Combat Adaptability:</strong> Their instincts and battle-hardened nature allow them to adjust mid-fight, countering enemy tactics and quickly overcoming disadvantages.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Cerealian Weaknesses ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🌞 Light Sensitivity:</strong> Due to their highly sensitive eyesight, they are vulnerable to blinding attacks, such as Solar Flare or intense flashes of light.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Pyromantic Weakness:</strong> Their bodies have a natural aversion to extreme heat and fire-based magic, making them especially weak against Pyromancers.</li></ul></li></ul><h1><s>--------------------------------------------------</s></h1><ul><li><strong>💥 Cerealian Abilities 💥</strong><ul><li><strong>✨ Ki Manipulation:</strong> Cerealians naturally wield Ki with great efficiency, allowing them to fire energy blasts, enhance their physical strikes, and generate protective barriers.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Instinctual Reflexes:</strong> They possess an uncanny ability to predict movements, allowing them to react faster than most races, making them exceptionally difficult to hit.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>👁️ Eagle-Eye:</strong> Cerealians possess a biologically evolved ocular system far beyond any mechanical scouter. This living sensor allows them to instinctively process complex battlefield data in real time—measuring enemy energy levels, visualizing trajectories, and pinpointing critical openings with uncanny clarity. By channeling their ki through their enhanced eye, Cerealians can perceive microscopic muscle twitches, shifts in breathing, and even the faintest ki fluctuations—granting them the ability to calculate where their opponent will be rather than where they are. Prolonged use or over-reliance in chaotic, high-speed melee may lead to ocular strain, causing blurred vision or delayed perception for 6 posts.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🌟 Special Abilities 🌟</strong><ul><li><strong>🎯 Bullseye:</strong> Cerealians possess a legendary ocular technique that grants them absolute precision in battle. By focusing their energy into their eyes, they gain the ability to see and exploit weak points in an opponent’s body, drastically increasing their attack effectiveness. While active, Bullseye allows Cerealians to strike weak points with nearly undodgeable precision, ensuring their attacks hit with maximum force. This ability works effectively up to 2.25x the user's BPL (Base Power Level). However, excessive use can strain the eyes, leading to temporary blindness or permanent ocular damage.</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335290794516545708/1335336202840047646","messageId":"1335336202840047646"},{"title":"Untitled section","html":"<div><span><h1><s>--------------------------------------------------</s></h1><ul><li><strong>📜 Starting Techniques / Cap and Boosts📜</strong><ul><li>Flight (Support Technique) – Enables Cerealians to move freely in the air.</li></ul><ul><li>Afterimage (Support Technique) – Uses high-speed movement to create illusions.</li></ul><ul><li>Solar Flare (Support Technique) – Emits an intense flash of light to blind opponents.</li></ul><ul><li>Luminescent Strike (Weak Technique) – A precise melee attack that briefly illuminates the target.</li></ul><ul><li>Starfall Drop (Medium Technique) – A high-speed aerial dropkick infused with energy.</li></ul><ul><li>Photon Dash (Support Technique) – Uses energy to propel themselves at lightning speeds.</li></ul><ul><li>Sunflare Burst (Super Technique) – Fires a concentrated blast of energy infused with burning light.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🟣 Royal Class:</strong><ul><li><strong>🔥 Ultimate Technique:</strong> True Precision Barrage</li></ul><ul><li>Unleashes a barrage of pinpoint energy blasts, each targeting a vital point, dealing critical damage and bypassing armor.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔮 Super Technique:</strong> Foresight Counter\n<ul><li>Utilizes enhanced perception to predict an opponent’s next move, dodging and delivering an immediate counterstrike.</li></ul></li></ul></li><li><strong>🔵 Super-Elite Class:</strong><ul><li><strong>⚡ Ultimate Technique:</strong> Guided Convergence Shot</li></ul><ul><li>Fires a homing energy blast that relentlessly tracks the target, growing in power the longer it remains active.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔪 Super Technique:</strong> Sharp Vision Strike\n<ul><li>A Ki-infused melee attack enhanced by the Cerealian’s advanced eyesight, capable of cutting through dense armor and defenses.</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul><h1><s>--------------------------------------------------</s></h1><ul><li><strong><span>@Cerealian (Ryokugan)</span> | <span>@Cerealian (Deadeye)</span> </strong><ul><li>Rage Boost: 1.55x</li></ul><ul><li>Potential Boost: 5%</li></ul><ul><li>Ki Reserves: 150%</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335290794516545708/1335336205293846589","messageId":"1335336205293846589"},{"title":"Eye Evolution","html":"<div><span># <code>Eye Evolution</code></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335290794516545708/1390396770512797747","messageId":"1390396770512797747"},{"title":"Quick Trip","html":"<div><span><h1>Quick Trip</h1><a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335290794516545708/1335336202840047646\">Racial Info</a></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335290794516545708/1405211922374197451","messageId":"1405211922374197451"}],"paths":[{"name":"Foundational forms","kind":"core","forms":[{"title":"Flourishment 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://media.tenor.com/irX4AMalXFEAAAAM/granoladbs-granolaceresiano.gif\">Flourishment</a> 🌟</h1>The Flourishment form marks the Cerealian’s awakening—the moment where instinct merges with spirit and nature, sparking a transformation as fluid as it is fierce. Their hair sharpens into jade tufts, fluttering like blades of grass in a windstorm, while their posture becomes poised and alert, ready to strike at a moment's notice. The air around them carries a gentle pressure, like the calm before a storm, and their senses stretch outward, harmonizing with the environment. This form doesn't erupt—it blooms, representing the Cerealian’s first real step into their ancestral potential.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Flourishment ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🌬️ Wind-Step Movement:</strong> Your speed and reaction time drastically improve, allowing you to dodge or reposition with incredible swiftness once every 3 turns.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Instinctive Targeting:</strong> Minor boosts to accuracy with projectiles and energy-based attacks.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Environmental Awareness:</strong> Gain passive battlefield awareness; detect enemies even when out of sight within a short radius.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>The user’s heart must be either purely selfless or wholly resolute in purpose (good or evil-aligned).</li></ul><ul><li>First triggered while surrounded by untouched nature (forest, mountains, etc).</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li>🌫️ 15% ki drain every 5 turns due to the high sensory processing and energetic connection to nature.</li></ul><ul><li>⚖️ Cannot maintain the form for more than 20 turns without rest or recharging.</li></ul><ul><li>🌌 Vulnerable to heavy ki-suppression zones or artificial environments that sever natural connection.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 10x (Birth)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 25x (250,000)</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335290794516545708/1390391245251149998","messageId":"1390391245251149998","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Flourishment  🌟 The Flourishment form marks the Cerealian’s awakening—the moment where instinct merges with spirit and nature, sparking a transformation as fluid as it is fierce. Their hair"},{"title":"Stellar Ascension 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://media.tenor.com/BfIpjZEJiUAAAAAM/granola-granolah.gif\">Stellar Ascension</a> 🌟</h1>In this second stage of Cerealian evolution, the user’s ki no longer roars—it resonates. Upon achieving Stellar Ascension, a faint, prism-like glow surrounds the body, cycling between cool teals and soft violets, like refracted starlight. Their hair rises with celestial energy, reflecting the harmony between mind and muscle. This form represents the quiet convergence of refined vision and heightened power, allowing the Cerealian to project calm dominance—like a marksman in stillness, waiting for the perfect moment. It’s not just strength—it’s precision perfected by poise.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Stellar Ascension ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>✨ Sniper's Reflex:</strong> Grants temporary slow-motion vision once per battle, allowing the user to anticipate and counter a high-speed attack.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔭 Ki Lensing:</strong> Enhances ranged ki-based abilities by 25%, refining beam focus and energy conservation.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧘 Energy Pulse Meditation:</strong> By spending one full turn unmoving, the user can recover 10% ki and cleanse debuffs or minor ailments.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 3,000,000.</li></ul><ul><li>Train in Flourishment at least 10 times. (Must be repeated per stage)</li></ul><ul><li>Meditate alone on a mountain peak or at high altitude for 3 hours uninterrupted.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li>💥 After 8 turns in this form, the user suffers 25% ki exhaustion due to intense astral-channeling strain.</li></ul><ul><li>⚡ This form is unstable near areas of high electromagnetic interference, making precision falter in chaotic environments.</li></ul><ul><li>🛡️ Unable to use defensive barriers or shielding moves while Sniper's Reflex is on cooldown.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Use:</strong> 50x [3,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Use:</strong> 100x [12,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335290794516545708/1390392336785080511","messageId":"1390392336785080511","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Stellar Ascension  🌟 In this second stage of Cerealian evolution, the user’s ki no longer roars—it resonates. Upon achieving Stellar Ascension, a faint, prism-like glow surrounds the body,"},{"title":"Ultimate Cerealian 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://i.pinimg.com/736x/3f/58/68/3f58689085c7180ac279f706871e84de.jpg\">Ultimate Cerealian</a> 🌟</h1>The Ultimate Cerealian form is not achieved through peace, but through pressure—triggered by a breaking point born from devastating grief or unrelenting rage. Upon activation, the user's aura bursts into a fierce lime-green blaze laced with gold sparks, flickering wildly like a storm trapped in human form. Their muscles tighten, veins glow faintly, and their signature eye sharpens into something primal. The very atmosphere feels heavier, as if gravity itself acknowledges the warrior’s unleashed potential. The transformation doesn’t just radiate energy—it warns of what's to come.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Ultimate Cerealian ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>⚡ Lightning Reflexes:</strong> Increases agility and reaction time by 25%, allowing for near-instant counters and repositioning.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💥 Break Point Boost:</strong> When health drops below 30%, gain an additional temporary x1.5 multiplier for 3 turns.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔍 Pinpoint Ferocity:</strong> Attacks targeting weak points or vital zones deal 20% more damage.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧿 Heightened Focus:</strong> Mental resistance against illusions, manipulation, and stun-based abilities is increased by 40%.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Must undergo a traumatic or rage-fueled event that unlocks this form under emotional duress.</li></ul><ul><li>Mastery of the Flourishment transformation.</li></ul><ul><li>Base Power Level of 50,000,000.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🛑 Endurance Penalty:</strong> Endurance and stamina are reduced by 25% due to unstable energy expenditure.</li></ul><ul><li>💢 If activated in calm states, the form is unstable—losing access to Heightened Focus for the first 2 turns.</li></ul><ul><li>⚠️ Cannot stack with external support or fusion-based multipliers while in this form.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 400x</strong></li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335290794516545708/1390393879869521981","messageId":"1390393879869521981","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Ultimate Cerealian  🌟 The Ultimate Cerealian form is not achieved through peace, but through pressure—triggered by a breaking point born from devastating grief or unrelenting rage. Upon act"},{"title":"Blossoming Radiance 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/E5zJ7x_WYAUqgDe.jpg:large\">Blossoming Radiance</a> 🌟</h1>When emotions break past the barriers of restraint, the Cerealian warrior erupts into Blossoming Radiance—a fierce, golden blaze that burns not only with power, but conviction. The user’s aura ignites in brilliant yellow flame, flickering with crimson and amber sparks that surge like wildfire. Their hair stands on edge, glowing like heated iron, while their eyes gleam with clarity and unwavering intent. This transformation represents a rebirth forged through emotional extremity, where raw potential meets sharpened instinct—untamed, focused, and unrelenting.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Blossoming Radiance ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🌪 Momentum Surge:</strong> Movement and attack speed are enhanced by 30%, enabling quick burst maneuvers and precision strikes.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔁 Burn Cycle:</strong> Every 3 turns, recover 10% of stamina if the user lands a direct blow or critical hit.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Pressure Pulse:</strong> Once per battle, release a shockwave of kinetic force that knocks back all enemies within close range, disrupting their next action.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Must be pushed into this state through extreme emotional duress—rage, grief, or betrayal.</li></ul><ul><li>Must reach a Power Level of 75,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Completed Intensive Physical Training (verified via RP thread or Training Submission).</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li>⚠️ 25% reduction in stamina and endurance while active.</li></ul><ul><li>🔥 The fiery aura gives away the user’s exact location, making stealth impossible.</li></ul><ul><li>⚡ Cannot stack this form’s speed bonus with technique-based speed buffs.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 800x</strong></li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335290794516545708/1390394788175548519","messageId":"1390394788175548519","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Blossoming Radiance  🌟 When emotions break past the barriers of restraint, the Cerealian warrior erupts into Blossoming Radiance—a fierce, golden blaze that burns not only with power, but c"},{"title":"Evolved Left/Right Eye 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://imgur.com/pYqIvLp\">Evolved Left/Right Eye</a> 🌟</h1>Cerealians have long been admired—and underestimated—for the exceptional power of their Right Eye, capable of locking onto even the most elusive targets. But there are a rare few who defy genetic convention and awaken the dormant power in their Left Eye, pushing past what their species was ever meant to accomplish. When both eyes are fully awakened, they gleam with eerie, synchronized energy—often glowing red or shimmering cyan—granting the user unprecedented levels of visual dominance, combat awareness, and precision targeting. This transformation is not one of brawn, but of vision… sharpened into something nearly prophetic.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Evolved Left/Right Eye ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🧠 Enhanced Combat Perception:</strong> Can react to and evade attacks from opponents up to 1.5x the user’s Power Level, anticipating movement based on micro-gestures and ki flow.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔍 Vital Sight (Requires Mastery):</strong> Allows precise targeting of muscle contractions, joint stress points, and blood flow, increasing critical strike chance by 35%.</li></ul><ul><li>☀️ <strong>Solar Clarity:</strong> Blinding effects like Solar Flare are nullified as the user switches to detecting ki signatures rather than relying purely on visual stimuli.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔄 Eye Sync (RP Flavor):</strong> When both eyes are used in harmony, the user’s field of vision becomes nearly panoramic, reducing sneak attacks and flanking success rates.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Engage in at least 1 Serious Spar or Combat Encounter.</li></ul><ul><li>Undergo 4 Hours of Focused Meditation on eye control and perception.</li></ul><ul><li>Each eye must be trained separately (Left and Right must each go through individual training submissions).</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🕒 Turn Limit:</strong> Can only remain active for 20 Turns before causing extreme eye strain and bleeding (locks eyes for 2 turns after deactivation).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🩸 Strain &amp; Burnout:</strong> While active, user suffers a 10% penalty to Stamina Regen due to the constant sensory overload.</li></ul><ul><li>✔️ Mastery removes all drawbacks, allowing for permanent eye usage without penalty.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li>🔺 This form does not modify Power Level directly, but its abilities stack with any PL-based transformation currently active.</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335290794516545708/1390397873086140567","messageId":"1390397873086140567","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Evolved Left/Right Eye  🌟 Cerealians have long been admired—and underestimated—for the exceptional power of their Right Eye, capable of locking onto even the most elusive targets. But there"},{"title":"Full Optical Awakening 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://i.redd.it/t1hwhtb9gn9a1.jpg\">Full Optical Awakening</a> 🌟</h1>When both eyes are fully awakened, the user doesn’t just see the battlefield—they own it. Their pupils shimmer with radiant energy, one eye glowing with focused crimson clarity while the other pulses with piercing azure brilliance. Their aura crackles like an electric storm, tendrils of ki swirling as their perception reaches superhuman levels. Every detail becomes a tactical advantage; nothing escapes their gaze. This transformation isn't about brute strength—it's about supremacy through awareness, where every action is calculated, and every weakness is an opportunity.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Full Optical Awakening ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🧠 Hyper Perception:</strong> The user can react to and evade attacks from enemies up to 2x their Power Level, processing motion and stimuli in near real-time.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>👁️ Vital Sight+:</strong> Can perfectly identify weak points, muscle tension, and ki flow—making dodging and countering attacks significantly easier (+25% dodge and +15% crit chance).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔍 X-Ray Vision:</strong> See through most solid matter within a medium range—useful for locating enemies, traps, or concealed objects.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Bullseye!:</strong> Once per battle, the user may target an opponent’s critical weak spot to deliver a guaranteed critical hit dealing 2x PL damage if it connects.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💫 Passive Healing:</strong> Minor injuries (cuts, bruises, burns) recover naturally during battle at a slow but steady pace.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Must have Mastered both Evolved Left and Right Eyes.</li></ul><ul><li>Survive and give your all in a Fight to the Death (must be documented or approved).</li></ul><ul><li>Must experience a moment of total clarity or desperation in battle that forcibly synchronizes the eyes.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⏳ Limited Duration:</strong> Can only remain active for 25 Turns per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔒 Cooldown:</strong> After use, the transformation is locked for 6 IRL Hours, regardless of mastery.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚠️ Eye Fatigue:</strong> Pushing beyond the turn limit causes both eyes to shut down temporarily (2-turn blindness if attempted).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Sensory Overload:</strong> In environments with high visual or energy interference, perception bonuses are halved.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li>🔺 This form does not modify Power Level directly, but its abilities stack with any PL-based transformation currently active.</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335290794516545708/1390397887803949087","messageId":"1390397887803949087","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Full Optical Awakening  🌟 When both eyes are fully awakened, the user doesn’t just see the battlefield—they own it. Their pupils shimmer with radiant energy, one eye glowing with focused cr"},{"title":"Symmetrical Evolution 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://tiermaker.com/images/template_images/2022/15920613/db-tl-15920613/a9916deb78bb8c411c3026b33fbcd5f5.png\">Symmetrical Evolution</a> 🌟</h1>The final threshold of Cerealian ocular mastery—Symmetrical Evolution—represents not just balance between left and right eye, but the synchronization of body, mind, and energy. Both eyes shine with a blazing red intensity, locked in perfect harmony as the user's vision transcends the physical realm. The aura ripples in symmetrical waves, hinting at the heightened precision now granted. With full command over their visual prowess, the user unleashes a storm of pinpoint energy attacks that bend around terrain, pierce defenses, and anticipate every dodge. No angle is blind. No opponent unseen.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Symmetrical Evolution ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>👁 360° Vision:</strong> You can see in every direction simultaneously. Surprise attacks become nearly impossible to land.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Bullseye++: </strong>Once per fight, your next Ki-Based attack hits a vital spot, dealing 4x PL damage if it lands.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔍 Full Optical Sight:</strong> See through objects, track muscle tension, blood flow, and ki fluctuation. Dodge rate boosted against foes up to 2x your PL.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Homing Shot:</strong> Ki attacks lock onto your opponent and track them for 1 turn after launch.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Hyper Perception:</strong> The user can react to and evade attacks from enemies up to 2x their Power Level, processing motion and stimuli in near real-time.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Full Power Shot:</strong> Ki-based attacks now naturally deal 2x PL in damage.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Passive Double Eye Mastery:</strong> No longer consumes turns or energy to maintain both evolved eyes.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💫 Passive Healing:</strong> Minor injuries (cuts, bruises, burns) recover naturally during battle at a slow but steady pace.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Must have Mastered Full Optical Awakening.</li></ul><ul><li>Must train with a Martial Arts Master a total of 23 times (can be spread across arcs).</li></ul><ul><li>Must experience an emotional or mental state of perfect clarity and balance in a combat scenario.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>💢 Ki Drain:</strong> Gradual drain of 25% ki over time (scaled per 10 turns).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Mental Overload (if abused):</strong> Using Symmetrical Evolution more than twice in a 24hr IRL period triggers a 6-hour lockout period due to neural strain.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧪 Weakened against Blind Combatants:</strong> Opponents who fight without relying on their own vision are harder to predict (negates homing and 360° by 50%).</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li>🔺 This form does not modify Power Level directly, but its abilities stack with any PL-based transformation currently active.</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335290794516545708/1390399581677944994","messageId":"1390399581677944994","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Symmetrical Evolution  🌟 The final threshold of Cerealian ocular mastery—Symmetrical Evolution—represents not just balance between left and right eye, but the synchronization of body, mind,"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335290794516545708","notes":[],"classification":"foundational"},{"name":"Deadeye Path","kind":"branch","forms":[{"title":"Crimson Cerealian 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://images-wixmp-ed30a86b8c4ca887773594c2.wixmp.com/f/e73b48cf-a082-4192-bd3b-b58e12eb5461/dft9p2g-0c4f5105-e65b-40fa-b9d6-3fa302024a57.jpg/v1/fill/w_929,h_860,q_70,strp/super_cerealian_granola_by_azull33_dft9p2g-pre.jpg?token=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..JQ2aPPDROmXb73YZfNmEj7hmjfAopAJAcZxgBPy8ABQ\">Crimson Cerealian</a> 🌟</h1>Crimson Cerealian marks the apex of focused might within the Deadeye Path. Upon achieving this form, the user’s hair blazes a radiant crimson, standing upright in divine formation as their eyes burn with unwavering clarity. A calm, controlled aura pulses around them—less like a storm and more like the focused glow of a sniper’s scope. This form is not roared into existence—it is called upon with practiced stillness, embodying the balance between discipline, instinct, and divinity. When activated, it symbolizes not raw destruction, but supreme precision, spiritual harmony, and the absolute mastery of one’s inner ki.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Crimson Cerealian ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of the Divine:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Divine Energy:</strong> The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns. Their ki undetectable to those without Divine Ki.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>👁️ Perfect Ki Sense:</strong> You see both internal and external ki, making it nearly impossible to lose track of enemies—even through illusions, invisibility, or smoke.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔒 God-Ki Barrier:</strong> Non-divine techniques below 70% of your current PL cannot interrupt your attacks while this form is active.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Must have a Power Level of 180,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Mastery of the Ultimate Cerealian transformation</li></ul><ul><li>Must have awakened God/Divine Ki through training or divine ritual</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li>🔋 -25% to Endurance and Stamina, causing faster energy drain in prolonged fights</li></ul><ul><li>🧠 Overuse can result in targeting misfires or internal feedback damage if form is pushed beyond safe limits</li></ul><ul><li>⏳ Can only remain active for 10 consecutive turns before forced cooldown (2 turn rest)</li></ul><ul><li>🔄 Will of the Divine only activates once per combat, and requires RNG</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Use:</strong> 10,000x [180,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Use:</strong> 14,000x [500,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1390382838666366986/1390384812866535425","messageId":"1390384812866535425","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Crimson Cerealian  🌟 Crimson Cerealian marks the apex of focused might within the Deadeye Path. Upon achieving this form, the user’s hair blazes a radiant crimson, standing upright in divin"},{"title":"Divine Marksman 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://i.makeagif.com/media/7-08-2021/RfdhML.gif\">Divine Marksman</a> 🌟</h1>Upon crossing the threshold into the Realm of the Gods, the Cerealian warrior sheds the limits of mortal sight and instinct. Their once-short hair erupts into a wild crimson mane, billowing like divine fire, while their presence exudes a silent, absolute focus. Every breath, every motion, is purposeful. The air crackles with latent power, and a golden-green aura flares around their body in waves. This is not just an evolution of strength—it is a declaration that the Cerealian is no longer merely a sharpshooter… they are now a celestial force of judgment.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Divine Marksman ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🎯 Deadeye Focus:</strong> Once per turn, the user can charge a precision shot that ignores evasion-based defenses and strikes through most physical barriers. If the opponent’s PL is lower or equal, the shot cannot be deflected unless blocked directly.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Combat Anticipation:</strong> The user reads movements several moments ahead, allowing one instant dodge per battle without consuming an action. This dodge must be declared before damage is calculated.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💥 Ki Vectoring:</strong> Ki-based attacks can now curve mid-flight or split in transit, allowing them to home in on targets that would otherwise be hidden, airborne, or behind cover.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>👁️ Sniper’s Patience:</strong> When holding their action for a turn, the user's next attack gains +30% accuracy and deals bonus damage based on how long it was delayed—up to 2 turns for max bonus (+20% DMG).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔒 God-Ki Barrier:</strong> Non-divine techniques below 70% of your current PL cannot interrupt your attacks while this form is active.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Must reach a Power Level of 1,000,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Must have fully mastered Crimson Cerealian</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⌛ Unstable Surge:</strong> Upon first achieving this form, the sudden surge in power causes rapid hair growth, signaling a moment of instability—user is dazed for 1 turn (only on first unlock).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💢 Stamina Drain:</strong> Maintaining this form for more than 6 consecutive turns results in a -25% stamina reduction per turn thereafter.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Use:</strong> 18,000x [1,000,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Use:</strong> 22,000x [3,000,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1390382838666366986/1390388607004446882","messageId":"1390388607004446882","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Divine Marksman  🌟 Upon crossing the threshold into the Realm of the Gods, the Cerealian warrior sheds the limits of mortal sight and instinct. Their once-short hair erupts into a wild crim"},{"title":"Ranger of Artemis 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://preview.redd.it/you-can-choose-only-one-of-these-units-to-be-in-dragon-ball-v0-4625azunkjxc1.jpg?width=640&amp;crop=smart&amp;auto=webp&amp;s=1a707337d8dbf9378fb210d3f6024069ecc2e419\">Ranger of Artemis</a> 🌟</h1>The final evolution of the Deadeye Path, Ranger of Artemis marks the apex of what a Cerealian warrior can become. With a sweeping emerald aura crackling like a storm and hair surging upward with radiant energy, the user's every movement carries the weight of discipline honed through lifetimes of battle. Their gaze pierces space and time itself, locking onto targets with instinctual precision. This form is not about divinity—it is about supremacy through clarity, reaction, and finesse. Achieving it means you’ve surpassed instinct and tapped into the full combat potential of your species.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Ranger of Artemis ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🎯 Absolute Tracking:</strong> No attack escapes your vision. The user can react to high-speed techniques or teleportation up to 1.5x above their own speed once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔫 Synchronized Fire:</strong> The user's body and mind move in unison—techniques require no verbal callout, cannot be anticipated through normal means, and have a +25% activation speed bonus.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Combat Calculation Matrix:</strong> Can predict an opponent’s next move if they’ve used the same technique or attack type twice. The user gains resistance (25%) against repeated moves.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>☄️ Marked Shot:</strong> Once per battle, the user may mark a single target. Against that marked opponent, all attacks for 3 turns gain +15% accuracy and cannot be redirected or deflected.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔒 God-Ki Barrier:</strong> Non-divine techniques below 70% of your current PL cannot interrupt your attacks while this form is active.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Power Level of 7,000,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Mastery of Divine Marksman</li></ul><ul><li>Must face another God/Divine Ki user in combat and survive</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🔋 Extreme Focus Drain:</strong> Maintaining absolute vision and reaction speed exhausts mental stamina, causing minor penalties to Ki regeneration after 5 turns.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💥 Tunnel Vision:</strong> If the marked opponent is KO’d early, the user suffers -10% overall focus for the next two turns due to momentary imbalance.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⌛ Cooldown Syncing:</strong> The user’s advanced techniques (e.g., Marked Shot, Tracking Dodge) share cooldown timers and cannot overlap.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 26,000x</strong></li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1390382838666366986/1390388622431228078","messageId":"1390388622431228078","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Ranger of Artemis  🌟 The final evolution of the Deadeye Path, Ranger of Artemis marks the apex of what a Cerealian warrior can become. With a sweeping emerald aura crackling like a storm an"}],"notes":[],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1390382838666366986","imageOnly":false,"classification":"normal"},{"name":"Ryokugan Path","kind":"branch","forms":[{"title":"Ryokugan: Shūketsugan 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://tenor.com/view/sasuke-sharingan-naruto-anime-remake-gif-26864365\">Ryokugan: Shūketsugan</a> 🌟</h1>The Ryokugan: Shūketsugan (lit. “Blood-Binding Eye”) is the first tremor of sorrow made manifest. It awakens in moments of seething inner torment—when pain cannot be screamed, only seen. A single eye ignites with a crimson hue, its tomoe swirling like a storm of suppressed fury. Rage, grief, and regret coil within the user's spirit, sharpening their senses into blades.\nIn this form, time itself feels warped—not slowed, but dragged through the weight of emotional collapse. Every glance is saturated with rageful calculation, every heartbeat a reminder of what’s been lost… or what might be taken next.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Ryokugan: Shūketsugan ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 Tomoe Manifestation:</strong> Grants the ability to process and respond to combat at speeds up to 2x the user’s Power Level—excellent for tracking high-speed movement.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Perceptive Focus:</strong> The user can intuitively read opponent cues: muscle tension, ki fluctuations, and micro-expressions—greatly improving dodge success.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧲 Prediction Protocol:</strong> Once per combat encounter, the user may completely dodge an attack if it’s from an opponent at or below 1.5x their Power Level.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💫 Distortion Filter:</strong> Vision is no longer reliant on light. The user sees energy signatures, heat differentials, and aura pulses, effectively nullifying blindness or darkness.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>📊 Combat Insight (Passive):</strong> The eye grants passive insight into an enemy’s power level, aura stability, and emotional state, akin to a combat scanner but instinctive and real-time.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Must have Mastered either the Evolved Left Eye or Evolved Right Eye.</li></ul><ul><li>Must have a Power Level of 50,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Must undergo a 4-hour meditation in complete isolation, visualizing the transformation of perception over power.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>(Optional)</strong> A secondary catalyst—such as reliving a moment of unbearable loss, or being forced to confront a memory too painful to forget—may awaken the second eye.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🩸 Blindness Risk (Overuse):</strong> Excessive use (15+ turns) without rest leads to escalating retinal fatigue and temporary blindness, which must be healed or rested.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔋 Ki Drain:</strong> Passively consumes 10% of total Ki every 10 turns due to sensory overclocking.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>👁️ One-Eye Limit (Initially):</strong> Regardless of mastery, only one Ryokugan eye may be active at this level unless the secondary catalyst is fulfilled. Dual-eye usage without meeting this requirement causes -50% accuracy and severe migraines.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 Single Eye:</strong> 400x [50,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Duel-Eye:</strong> 10,000x [Meet Catalyst Requirement]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1390400386778796064/1390405865403846798","messageId":"1390405865403846798","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Ryokugan: Shūketsugan  🌟 The Ryokugan: Shūketsugan (lit. “Blood-Binding Eye”) is the first tremor of sorrow made manifest. It awakens in moments of seething inner torment—when pain cannot b"},{"title":"Ryokugan: Yūgengan 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://i.pinimg.com/originals/51/8d/47/518d478a04f76ed2a7c2aa39e266f8c3.gif\">Ryokugan: Yūgengan</a> 🌟</h1>The Ryokugan: Yūgengan, or “Eye of Profound Depth,” awakens when the dam finally breaks. Both eyes now blaze—no longer with clarity, but with despair refined into precision. The tomoe evolve into cruel, jagged shapes; their glow now leaves energy trails like blood tears streaking through the air. The user becomes a sentinel of sorrow, their aura oppressive, unrelenting.\nThis form is forged not through growth, but through empathy ripped raw. It demands the user witness a future they could not stop… and a past they cannot change. Rage fuels reaction. Grief fuels resolve. And in that pain, the battlefield bends to the eye’s command.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Ryokugan: Yūgengan ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🧠 Dual Perception:</strong> With both eyes awakened, the user’s vision becomes omnidirectional in combat. Attacks from behind or sides are now recognized as clearly as those from the front.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>📡 Combat Precognition (Passive):</strong> The user can sense and intuit their enemy's next move with incredible accuracy. If the opponent’s PL is less than 2.5x the user’s, they cannot land sneak or feint-based attacks.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌀 Dimensional Echo:</strong> Once per combat, the user may create a one-turn visual afterimage that mimics their exact actions, misleading the enemy while the real user can reposition freely.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Amatsukami Pulse:</strong> Ki-based ranged attacks now phase through energy barriers unless specifically tuned to negate Ryokugan energy.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>📍Soul Insight:</strong> All deception techniques (clones, illusions, transformations) are automatically seen through, even if the user has never encountered them before.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Must have Mastered Ryokugan: Shūketsugan with at least 1 eye active.</li></ul><ul><li>Must unlock through a moment of great emotional clarity or protection of another at cost to oneself.</li></ul><ul><li>Power Level of 180,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Must experience a Vision Memory Echo (an admin-approved hallucination of a past/future event related to emotional growth).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>(Optional)</strong> A secondary catalyst—such as through an act of desperate protection or fury—such as shielding someone from death, or unleashing repressed wrath in response to betrayal.—may awaken the second eye, but only if both Ryokugan: Shūketsugan eyes have been mastered.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🩸 Blindness Risk:</strong> Overuse beyond 15 turns without rest induces optical degeneration, risking temporary blindness unless treated through spiritual or surgical healing.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔋 Ki Drain:</strong> Passive energy cost of 15% every 8 turns to sustain the cognitive and perceptive load.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧿 Multi-Target Fatigue:</strong> Attempting to track more than 3 targets using predictive focus lowers technique accuracy by 30% for 2 turns.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>👁️ Visual Fragility:</strong> If either eye is directly damaged, the transformation is forcibly disabled for 6 turns as ocular nerves self-repair.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 Single Eye:</strong> 10,000x [180,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Duel-Eye:</strong> 14,000x [Meet Catalyst Requirement]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1390400386778796064/1390407339986653285","messageId":"1390407339986653285","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Ryokugan: Yūgengan  🌟 The Ryokugan: Yūgengan, or “Eye of Profound Depth,” awakens when the dam finally breaks. Both eyes now blaze—no longer with clarity, but with despair refined into prec"},{"title":"Ryokugan: Kōmugan 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://media.tenor.com/bq7jzQpfod4AAAAM/sasuke-mangekyou-sharingan.gif\">Ryokugan: Kōmugan</a> 🌟</h1>The Ryokugan: Kōmugan is birthed in the hollow left by betrayal and loss. The tomoe are no more—replaced by a shuriken-like symbol, carved in anguish and obsession. Crimson pulses beat in rhythm with the user's fractured soul, while veins around the eye darken as if the body struggles to contain the power drawn from emotional ruin.\nThis eye doesn’t just perceive the battlefield—it haunts it. The user becomes a figure carved from vengeance, shaped by heartbreak. Every movement feels heavier. Every enemy’s breath becomes a target. They are no longer a warrior—they are a reckoning wearing grief like armor.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Ryokugan: Kōmugan ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🧠 Trauma Insight:</strong> The eye resonates with emotionally unstable opponents. Once per encounter, the user can detect the opponent's greatest source of grief or guilt, reducing that enemy's damage output by 15% for 3 turns due to emotional destabilization.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🗡️ Piercing Stare:</strong> The user may ignore energy-based visual obstructions (afterimages, illusions, and phasing) and lock onto the true opponent with absolute certainty.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🩸 Residual Burn:</strong> If the user is struck during this form, a ghostly afterimage of the attack lingers in their vision, giving them a 10% damage resistance to similar attacks for the next 3 turns.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Power level of 500,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Must have Mastered Ryokugan: Yūgengan with at least 1 eye active.</li></ul><ul><li>Must experience a trauma-driven loss (e.g., an ally dying in-character, or betrayal during a saga-level arc).</li></ul><ul><li>Must meditate for 2 full IRL days on their emotional conflict and overcome it internally.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>(Optional)</strong> A secondary catalyst—such as a moment of pure emotional collapse—such as being forced to strike down someone they once loved or witnessing irreversible failure due to their own hesitation—may awaken the second eye, but only if both Ryokugan: Yūgengan eyes have been mastered.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🩸 Blindness Risk:</strong> Overuse beyond 15 turns without rest induces optical degeneration, risking temporary blindness unless treated through spiritual or surgical healing.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💔 Emotional Instability:</strong> For the first 3 turns after activation, the user's personality may shift, leaning toward obsession, vengeance, or emotional outbursts (roleplay element; mild debuff to logic-based planning).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>👁️ Ocular Strain:</strong> After 10 turns of use, the eye begins to bleed and blur, reducing its effects by 20% unless the form is ended or rotated out.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔋 Energy Burn:</strong> Each turn active consumes 8% Ki due to the advanced sensory and temporal manipulation.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>❌  One-Eye Limit (Initial):</strong> Only one eye may awaken to this level unless the catalyst is fulfilled. Forcing dual use without meeting this requirement results in instant feedback blindness (-100% accuracy for 5 turns).</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 Single-Eye:</strong> 14,000x [500,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Duel-Eye:</strong> 18,000x [Meet Catalyst Requirement]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1390400386778796064/1390411303591481435","messageId":"1390411303591481435","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Ryokugan: Kōmugan  🌟 The Ryokugan: Kōmugan is birthed in the hollow left by betrayal and loss. The tomoe are no more—replaced by a shuriken-like symbol, carved in anguish and obsession. Cri"},{"title":"Ryokugan: Enshingan 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://i.pinimg.com/originals/04/b7/15/04b71538b6edb5c8068a0b55a5b49222.gif\">Ryokugan: Enshingan</a> 🌟</h1>The Ryokugan: Enshingan is the final scream of a soul that has bled too long. The second eye twists into a hypnotic spiral of glyphs, echoing the void where hope used to live. The aura turns indigo—no longer the color of power, but of mourning. The gaze alone unsettles, because within it lies every memory the user failed to forget.\nThis stage is not born of power, but punishment. The user becomes the architect of pain, sculpting each battle like a funeral march for those they couldn't save. The world around them doesn't slow—it shudders, caught in the rhythm of rage made manifest.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Ryokugan: Enshingan⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🧠 Intent Reading:</strong> The second eye grants the user real-time prediction of incoming moves, granting +15% evasion and the ability to preempt one incoming melee strike per combat with a perfectly timed counter.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔍 Pattern Lock:</strong> Every 6 turns, the user may “mark” an opponent, reading their physical and energetic behavior. For 2 turns, that opponent suffers -10% evasion and cannot use dodging-based counters.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Must have Mastered Ryokugan: Kōmugan with at least 1 eye active.</li></ul><ul><li>Must endure a prolonged sparring match (7+ turns) where the user is pushed to a near-death state without using transformations.</li></ul><ul><li>Must witness a major betrayal or be forced to make a strategically necessary sacrifice (such as abandoning a comrade or ally) in-character during a live roleplay.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>(Optional)</strong> A secondary catalyst—such as abandoning an ally for the greater mission, or unleashing their full power in a moment of grief so intense it leaves permanent emotional scars.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🩸 Blindness Risk:</strong> Overuse beyond 15 turns without rest induces optical degeneration, risking temporary blindness unless treated through spiritual or surgical healing.</li></ul><ul><li>🧠 Mental Noise: With the eye reading multiple intent layers at once, the user can become overwhelmed in chaotic fights (5+ enemies), suffering -10% to focus-based abilities.</li></ul><ul><li>⏱️ Shortened Use Limit: This stage can only be held for 20 turns before inducing severe ocular fatigue. After use, the user cannot reenter any Ryukugan form for 6 IRL hours.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 Single-Eye:</strong> 18,000x [1,000,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Duel-Eye:</strong> 22,000x [Meet Catalyst Requirement]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1390400386778796064/1390412872852574371","messageId":"1390412872852574371","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Ryokugan: Enshingan  🌟 The Ryokugan: Enshingan is the final scream of a soul that has bled too long. The second eye twists into a hypnotic spiral of glyphs, echoing the void where hope used"},{"title":"Ryokugan: Tenmeigan 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://media.tenor.com/j_vK8zEwZnQAAAAM/rinne-sharingan.gif\">Ryokugan: Tenmeigan</a> 🌟</h1>The Ryokugan: Tenmeigan, Upon reaching this level, a third eye opens at the center of the user’s forehead—glowing with a swirling, triple-layered tomoe spiral. The user’s face takes on a ghostly glow, as if lit by an inner fire of truth. Their original eyes remain active, retaining their earlier forms and abilities, but this new eye binds all layers of perception into a singular, horrifying clarity.\nThis transformation is not just power—it is enlightenment through loss. The user has survived the burdens of betrayal, sacrifice, and near-death insight. They no longer see reality... they dissect it.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Ryokugan: Tenmeigan ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🧠 Perfect Intent Mapping:</strong> The user can now visually trace not only physical movement, but the intended action path of any target within 3x their PL. This grants +25% dodge chance and allows them to mirror one technique per fight at 75% effectiveness.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Absolute Target Lock:</strong> Once per combat, the user may declare a single strike or technique to become “unavoidable” to a single opponent below 2.5x their PL, unless the opponent sacrifices 30% of their max Ki to break the focus lock.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧬 Trinary Perception:</strong> The user perceives an opponent's stamina, ki, and combat drive in real time. They can target whichever is weakest with enhanced damage (1.5x to stamina/ki-drained enemies).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🛡️ Instinct Parry:</strong> Once every 12 turns, an incoming physical technique is passively countered with a flat palm or parry with no Ki cost, so long as the user sees the strike coming.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚙️ Cumulative Insight:</strong> This stage retains all abilities from both the previous Kōmugan stages, making the user a walking library of perception-based counters, vision modes, and prediction layers.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Must have Mastered Ryokugan: Enshingan with at least 1 eye active.</li></ul><ul><li>Must undergo a 24-hour in-character ritual involving full sensory deprivation, loss of ego, and a symbolic death/rebirth arc (can be assisted by another player/mentor NPC).</li></ul><ul><li>The user must sacrifice something deeply personal (e.g., an alliance, a major ability, a bound item, or a permanent stat reduction to Ki Reserves or Health) during a meaningful IC decision.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🔥 Cerebral Overclocking:</strong> While active, the user cannot sleep or rest in-character for 24 in-game hours post-use, risking instability in long events or arcs.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Split Focus:</strong> Due to the triple-perception system, illusions or mass-spam tactics cause stress. If facing 4+ enemies or multi-stage illusions, the user suffers -10% accuracy for 4 turns.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💥 Power Lock Trigger:</strong> If the third eye is damaged (via targeted eye-based attacks or critical hits), the transformation immediately deactivates and places all Ryokugan stages on cooldown for 12 IRL hours.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💢 No Emotion, No Mercy:</strong> The user becomes emotionally numb while active. This is RP-based but must be acknowledged; empathy, fear, and compassion are dulled.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 Single-Eye:</strong> 22,000x [3,000,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Duel-Eye:</strong> 24,000x [7,000,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Tri-Eye:</strong> 26,000x [Meet Catalyst Requirement]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1390400386778796064/1390413811126763551","messageId":"1390413811126763551","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Ryokugan: Tenmeigan  🌟 The Ryokugan: Tenmeigan, Upon reaching this level, a third eye opens at the center of the user’s forehead—glowing with a swirling, triple-layered tomoe spiral. The us"}],"notes":[],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1390400386778796064","imageOnly":false,"classification":"normal"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335290794516545708","formCount":15,"art":"assets/brand.png","sparkingNotes":[]},{"name":"Genie","slug":"genie","accent":"#90bfed","shade":"#6d67c4","description":"The Genies of Planet Geushuu are an enigmatic race of playful, mischievous, and nearly indestructible beings. Masters of shapeshifting, regeneration, and absorption, they possess some of the most unique and unpredictable abilities…","about":[{"title":"🌀 The Genies 🌀","html":"<div><span><h1>🌀 The Genies 🌀</h1>The Genies of Planet Geushuu are an enigmatic race of playful, mischievous, and nearly indestructible beings. Masters of shapeshifting, regeneration, and absorption, they possess some of the most unique and unpredictable abilities in the universe. Their biology defies logic, allowing them to regenerate instantly, twist their forms into impossible shapes, and absorb the powers of others. Despite their whimsical nature, Genies are not to be underestimated. Their immortality, magical prowess, and boundless energy make them dangerous opponents in battle. However, their love for sweets and emotional instability can sometimes leave them distracted or vulnerable.\n<h1><s>--------------------------------------------------</s></h1><h1>💪 Genie Strengths 💪</h1><ul><li>💪 Immense Strength: Genies are naturally incredibly strong, allowing them to lift massive objects, crush enemies with ease, and fight at a level far beyond most organic beings.</li><li>🔄 Shapeshifting Mastery: Their bodies are highly malleable, able to stretch, contort, reshape, or liquefy at will. This allows them to evade attacks, extend their reach, and morph their limbs into weapons.</li><li>♾️ Immortality: Genies possess a unique form of immortality (Type 5 &amp; 6), granting them both eternal youth and instantaneous regeneration. They cannot age, and even fatal wounds heal within moments.</li><li>👁️‍🗨️ Heightened Senses: They have extraordinary perception, allowing them to see, hear, smell, taste, and feel things far beyond normal beings.</li></ul><h1>⚠️ Genie Weaknesses ⚠️</h1><ul><li>🔒Sealing Aversion: Genies are highly vulnerable to sealing magic and containment spells. If captured inside an artifact (like a lamp or jar), they can be completely trapped and rendered powerless.</li><li>💥 Self-Destructive Emotion: If a Genie becomes overwhelmed with rage or despair, they may choose to self-implode, releasing an immense explosion that devastates everything nearby. However, this renders them inactive for 25 RP posts or until the scene ends.</li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335290869150122067/1335345293444518119","messageId":"1335345293444518119"},{"title":"Untitled section","html":"<div><span><h1><s>--------------------------------------------------------------------</s></h1><h1>💥 Genie Abilities 💥</h1><ul><li>✨ Ki Manipulation: Genies possess advanced Ki control, allowing them to launch energy attacks, form barriers, and amplify their physical abilities.</li><li>🩹 Regeneration: Genies can instantly heal from nearly any wound and even regrow lost limbs within a single turn without energy drain.</li></ul><h1>🌟 Special Ability 🌟</h1><ul><li>🌀 Absorption: Genies possess a rare and dangerous ability to absorb the energy, abilities, or even characteristics of others. \n<ul><li>By making physical contact, they can steal techniques, Ki energy, or physical traits from their opponents. They may either borrow the power for a short time or permanently integrate it into their skillset.</li></ul><ul><li>A Genie may only absorb six abilities at a time—if they reach their limit, they must sacrifice an old power to gain a new one. More powerful abilities require longer contact time to fully absorb.</li></ul></li></ul><h1><s>--------------------------------------------------------------------</s></h1><h1>📜 Starting Techniques / Cap and Boosts 📜</h1><ul><li>Magic Materialization (Support Technique) – The ability to create objects out of thin air.</li><li>Healing (Support Technique) – The ability to restore health or regenerate others.</li><li>Afterimage (Support Technique) – Uses rapid movement to create illusions.</li><li>Complete Absorption (Support Technique) – Allows the Genie to absorb abilities or energy from a target.</li><li>Minor Mimicry (Dependent Technique) – The ability to copy another’s move for a short period.</li><li>Body Manipulation (Support Technique) – Enables the Genie to alter their shape at will.</li><li>Candy Crush Chaos (Ultimate Technique) - Temporarily transforms an opponent into candy or another harmless object, leaving them defenseless for a short period. Can be used to stall an enemy, weaken their defenses, or even consume them for energy.</li><li>Elastic Blitz (Super Technique) - Delivers rapid-fire, unpredictable attacks by stretching their limbs at high speed, overwhelming foes from multiple angles.</li><li>Malevolent Melt (Ultimate Technique) - Fires a corrosive energy beam that melts through armor and continues to burn the target, dealing damage over time.</li><li>Shapeshifting Assault (Super Technique) - Transforms parts of their body into blades, maces, or other weapons, increasing melee attack power.</li></ul><h1><s>--------------------------------------------------------------------</s></h1><span><strong><code>SPARKING!</code></strong></span><ul><li><strong><span>@Genie (Unification)</span> &amp; <span>@Genie (Rebirth)</span></strong></li></ul><ul><li>Rage Boost: 8x</li></ul><ul><li>Potential Boost: 30%</li></ul><ul><li>Ki/Mana Reserves: 300%</li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335290869150122067/1335345300491075635","messageId":"1335345300491075635"},{"title":"Quick Trip","html":"<div><span><h1>Quick Trip</h1><a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335290869150122067/1335345293444518119\">Racial Info</a></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335290869150122067/1413220689124790292","messageId":"1413220689124790292"}],"paths":[{"name":"Foundational forms","kind":"core","forms":[{"title":"Essence Fracture 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://tenor.com/view/dragon-ball-daima-majin-kuu-gif-1991195564334064447\">Essence Fracture</a> 🌟</h1>When a Genie undergoes Essence Fracture, their body sheds excess bulk and returns to a sleeker, prime state — a perfect balance of agility and destructive potential. Their skin lightens in hue, though it always reflects their natural color, and their eyes ignite with a feral, glowing intensity. An unstable aura of chaotic energy crackles around them, spilling arcs of magic-infused lightning. This form embodies a Genie’s most primal self — raw power unchained by reason. In this state, they lose the ability to form words, reverting to childlike tendencies, both playful and cruel. Though the transformation is permanent once triggered, its multipliers are temporary, shifting into a rage-driven boost after the first use. From that point forward, the Genie can access the form’s power at will.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Essence Fracture ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🎭 Chaotic Persona:</strong> The Genie’s demeanor becomes unstable, leaning into primal instincts and impulsive violence, making them less predictable in battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Aura Instability:</strong> The aura lashes outward in arcs of energy, capable of minor collateral damage to the environment or nearby allies if not controlled.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🛡️ Magic Immunity:</strong> Near-total resistance to magical attacks and enchantments.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔄 Permanent Regression:</strong> Once this form is unlocked, the Genie’s body permanently remains in this “prime” shape until they transform again. Multipliers only activate when surging power is called upon, but the form itself never disappears.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Must attempt to absorb someone drastically more powerful, resulting in rejection and backlash.</li></ul><ul><li>Triggered when the Genie is pushed to the brink of death in battle. (Must be repeated per stage)</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🧠 Mental Instability:</strong> The Genie loses the ability to form words and reason clearly, behaving with the unpredictable mindset of a child.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎲 Unpredictable Attacks:</strong> While attacks gain raw destructive potential, they lose fine control — precision techniques often misfire or scatter.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⏳ Stamina Strain:</strong> Prolonged use causes extreme fatigue, as the body constantly struggles to stabilize chaotic energy.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🤝 Social Vulnerability:</strong> Lack of speech and reasoning makes communication and strategizing nearly impossible.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 10x [Birth]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 50x [100,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Third Stage:</strong> 100x [500,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Fourth Stage:</strong> 400x [1,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335290869150122067/1406804547246100602","messageId":"1406804547246100602","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Essence Fracture  🌟 When a Genie undergoes Essence Fracture, their body sheds excess bulk and returns to a sleeker, prime state — a perfect balance of agility and destructive potential. The"},{"title":"Ascendance 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://i.makeagif.com/media/8-18-2025/LSkZGh.gif\">Ascendance</a> 🌟</h1>The Genie's chaotic form stabilizes, shedding the raw unpredictability of Essence Fracture and refining into something more menacingly composed. Their body stretches taller and leaner, their musculature sculpted into sharp definition. The Genie's skin tone deepens into a darker, richer hue, retaining its original color but now carrying an almost metallic gleam. Their once-feral expressions give way to a sinister, calculating calm, with glowing eyes radiating either benevolent purity or malevolent malice depending on which side has consumed the other. An aura of pulsating energy engulfs them — wild and chaotic, yet strangely ordered — as their fractured essence stabilizes into dominance. For the first time, the Genie’s voice sharpens into coherence, allowing them to form sentences and commands. Ascendance symbolizes not just raw power, but the evolution of self: the Genie’s fractured chaos now honed into supremacy.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Ascendance ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>💠 Dual Alignment:</strong> Whichever side (Good or Evil) dominates through absorption permanently determines the Genie's alignment. This alignment influences personality, aura color, and RP opportunities.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Aura Instability:</strong> The aura lashes outward in arcs of energy, capable of minor collateral damage to the environment or nearby allies if not controlled.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔄 Permanent Ascension:</strong> Unlike their fractured state, the Genie can now communicate, reason, and strategize, making them far more dangerous. Multipliers only activate when surging power is called upon, but the form itself never disappears.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🛡️ Magic Immunity:</strong> Near-total resistance to magical attacks and enchantments.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Absorb at least 5 beings of meaningful strength. (Must be repeated per stage)</li></ul><ul><li>User's Good/Evil sides split, and begin a battle, alignment is determined when one side absorbs the other (Good or Evil).</li></ul><ul><li>Base Power Level of 5,000,000.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🧠 Lingering Instability:</strong> Despite gaining clarity, conflicting absorbed personalities can still bleed through, clouding decisions in moments of stress.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💀 Permanent Change:</strong> Once chosen, the Genie's alignment (Good/Evil) cannot be reversed without monumental, story-driven events.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Overconfidence:</strong> The refined power fuels arrogance, sometimes leading to reckless choices in combat.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 800x [5,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 2,000x [10,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Third Stage:</strong> 4,000x [20,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335290869150122067/1406804739798073405","messageId":"1406804739798073405","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Ascendance  🌟 The Genie's chaotic form stabilizes, shedding the raw unpredictability of Essence Fracture and refining into something more menacingly composed. Their body stretches taller an"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335290869150122067","notes":[],"classification":"foundational"},{"name":"Rebirth Path","kind":"branch","forms":[{"title":"Soul Renewal 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://tenor.com/view/uub-db-gif-9796203\">Soul Renewal</a> 🌟</h1>In the moment of true death, when the body should have vanished into nothing, the Genie's willpower proves too unshakable to fade away. Through sheer force of spirit, they are reborn—shedding much of their chaotic essence and emerging in a body tied to a new race. Their skin tone, aura, and eyes take on a softer glow, carrying the faint but unshakable reminder of their Genie origins. While most of their old powers are lost, what remains is refined into something purer: a vessel of willpower, rage, and determination. This form symbolizes both redemption and unrelenting resolve, granting them a chance to live anew.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Soul Renewal ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🌌 Reincarnation:</strong> The Genie is reborn into their chosen race, gaining access to that race’s natural abilities and transformations (limited—see below).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💢 Genie’s Rage:</strong> Retains the chaotic Rage Boost unique to the Genie, fueling greater power in battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔮 Magic Immunity:</strong> Retains near-complete immunity to magical abilities, resisting spells and enchantments with ease.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Divine Energy:</strong> The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns. Their ki undetectable to those without Divine Ki. <span>(If acquired before death)</span></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔒 God-Ki Barrier:</strong> Non-divine techniques below 70% of your current PL cannot interrupt your attacks while this form is active. <span>(If the user has God/Divine Ki)</span></li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Must die in battle or through roleplay event.</li></ul><ul><li>Be reincarnated as a chosen race (determined by player).</li></ul><ul><li>Strong willpower and refusal to give in to death are required to awaken this form.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>😠 Irritability:</strong> The reborn Genie becomes unstable in battle, losing control after 10 turns.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⛔ Limited Transformations:</strong> Only the first 3 transformations of the new race are available (giant/unique racial forms excluded).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🩸 Weakened Regeneration:</strong> Immortality remains, but it is dulled to near-humanoid levels, noticeable only in small healing over time.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 Permanent Base Boost:</strong> 10x</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1237637333583396865/1407074108914667663","messageId":"1407074108914667663","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Soul Renewal  🌟 In the moment of true death, when the body should have vanished into nothing, the Genie's willpower proves too unshakable to fade away. Through sheer force of spirit, they a"},{"title":"Essence of the Genie 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://media1.giphy.com/media/v1.Y2lkPTc5MGI3NjExazJhczVtOXhwOTQwOGdpZGJ3ZnRnb2E2Ymp5N3hqMjhvdW15b3VkNyZlcD12MV9pbnRlcm5hbF9naWZfYnlfaWQmY3Q9Zw/XT8vvIP8ZPlF43TXXI/giphy.gif\">Essence of the Genie</a> 🌟</h1>The Essence of the Genie is the pivotal point of self-realization where past chaos and present humanity collide. No longer a creature of pure destruction, the Genie sheds the shell of their monstrous heritage, stepping into something far more fragile yet unshakably resolute: a being of willpower and purpose. A radiant white aura bursts forth, tinged with subtle streaks of purple and blue, wrapping the user in a glow that feels both divine and grounded. Their body stabilizes, muscles refined rather than swollen, their eyes burning with clarity. Yet, beneath this purity lies the fractured memory of the Genie they once were—an echo that threatens to claw its way back whenever emotions overflow. This form is a test of balance: redemption versus relapse.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Essence of the Genie ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>✨ Immunity to Magic:</strong> All hostile magical effects and curses fail to bind or debilitate the user.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of the Genie:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Divine Energy:</strong> The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns. Their ki undetectable to those without Divine Ki. <span>(If the user has God/Divine Ki)</span></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔒 God-Ki Barrier:</strong> Non-divine techniques below 70% of your current PL cannot interrupt your attacks while this form is active. <span>(If the user has God/Divine Ki)</span></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌀 Stable Soul:</strong> Energy expenditure is reduced by 20% compared to previous forms, reflecting the user’s greater control.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 100,000</li></ul><ul><li>Must experience a serious life-or-death battle after discovering your heritage. (Must be repeated per stage)</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>😡 Irritability:</strong> Emotional strain makes the user prone to anger, risking loss of control after 10 turns.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⏳ Temporary Stability:</strong> If overused, the form risks collapse, forcing the user into a weakened state for 1 turn afterward.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💔 Fractured Psyche:</strong> The echo of their former self occasionally influences behavior, creating hesitation or reckless choices in combat.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 50x [100,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 100x [500,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Third Stage:</strong> 400x [1,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Fourth Stage:</strong> 800x [5,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Fifth Stage:</strong> 2,000x [10,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Sixth Stage:</strong> 4,000x [20,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Seventh Stage:</strong> 10,000x [40,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1237637333583396865/1407075695045251174","messageId":"1407075695045251174","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Essence of the Genie  🌟 The Essence of the Genie is the pivotal point of self-realization where past chaos and present humanity collide. No longer a creature of pure destruction, the Genie"},{"title":"Corruption 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcQnvBoxiD0c-4pFjtXwZ0tC2nl-PXCpVaTgog&amp;s\">Corruption</a> 🌟</h1>A twisted inversion of the Genie’s spirit, this form emerges when overwhelming negativity consumes the user’s essence. The Genie’s body becomes leaner yet more menacing, their aura shifting into a turbulent storm of shadowed energy laced with chaotic light. Their features sharpen unnaturally, eyes glowing with a void-like intensity that reflects the collapse of their former self. This is not just transformation—it’s a rebirth into something corrupted and monstrous, a being defined by what they were not meant to be.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Corruption ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>✨ Immunity to Magic:</strong> All hostile magical effects and curses fail to bind or debilitate the user.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚔️ Absorption:</strong> The user may absorb opponents, gaining 10% of their power and traits.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💀 Inverse Spirit:</strong> Personality is flipped (good becomes cruel, evil becomes merciful in twisted ways).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of the Genie:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Divine Energy:</strong> The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns. Their ki undetectable to those without Divine Ki. <span>(If the user has God/Divine Ki)</span></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔒 God-Ki Barrier:</strong> Non-divine techniques below 70% of your current PL cannot interrupt your attacks while this form is active. <span>(If the user has God/Divine Ki)</span></li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 100,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Triggered by intense negative emotions I.E: hatred, despair, betrayal. (Must be repeated per stage </li></ul><ul><li>Survive a life-or-death battle where defeat feels inevitable.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🧠 Loss of Self:</strong> The user’s identity is inverted; their sense of morality and intent may shift permanently.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⏳ Instability:</strong> Difficult to maintain composure; prolonged use risks collapse or berserk loss of control.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>❤️ Isolation:</strong> Bonds with allies weaken, as the corrupted energy makes cooperation nearly impossible.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔄 Slow Growth:</strong> Absorption grants boosts but slows natural training progression while in this form by 10%</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 20,000x [100,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 30,000x [250,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Third Stage:</strong> 50,000x [500,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Fourth Stage:</strong> 75,000x [750,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1237637333583396865/1407082730159870143","messageId":"1407082730159870143","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Corruption  🌟 A twisted inversion of the Genie’s spirit, this form emerges when overwhelming negativity consumes the user’s essence. The Genie’s body becomes leaner yet more menacing, their"},{"title":"Essence Unbound 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://media2.giphy.com/media/v1.Y2lkPTc5MGI3NjExeWZmbnoyYjI2a2pmdTBybHNwY3Ayc2k0M2lwNWI4b3NkYTV4em8xdiZlcD12MV9pbnRlcm5hbF9naWZfYnlfaWQmY3Q9Zw/ht4qzgluCMMuXDbrP3/giphy.gif\">Essence Unbound</a> 🌟</h1>A low, otherworldly hum fills the air as the Genie sheds all traces of their fractured existence. The chaotic energy of corruption, once impossible to tame, now courses in harmony alongside their disciplined spirit. Their body sharpens into a perfected, balanced form — sleek yet radiant, with an aura that pulses in waves of shadowed violet and pure white. Every motion carries the paradox of serenity and fury intertwined, as if the universe itself is watching through them. Essence Unbound represents the true equilibrium of instinct and intellect, corruption and purity: a state where the Genie no longer battles with themselves, but instead wields both halves as one unstoppable truth.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Essence Unbound ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🌀 Balance of Essence:</strong> Grants immunity to all magic-based effects (curses, seals, debuffs) as the user’s body becomes a perfected vessel.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💠 Absorption Refined:</strong> Absorbing others now converts their energy into raw stamina/ki rather than random mutations, making it controlled and sustainable.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌌 Beyond the Gods!:</strong> The sheer pressure of your existence changes the battlefield. Enemies within range suffer a 20% reduction to accuracy and -10% speed, their bodies trembling under the crushing weight of your aura. At the same time, your strikes ignore 15% of enemy defenses, as if reality itself bends to your will. This effect cannot be dispelled and lasts as long as the form is active.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of the Genie:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Divine Energy:</strong> The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns. Their ki undetectable to those without Divine Ki. <span>(If the user has God/Divine Ki)</span></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔒 God-Ki Barrier:</strong> Non-divine techniques below 70% of your current PL cannot interrupt your attacks while this form is active. <span>(If the user has God/Divine Ki)</span></li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 1,000,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Be consumed by the Genie’s destructive side at least five times, then wrestle it back into balance. (Must be repeated per stage)</li></ul><ul><li>Defeat an opponent wielding God/Divine Ki, proving worthiness of ascension.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⏳ Stamina Drain:</strong> Extended use beyond 15 turns severely fatigues the body, cutting multipliers by half until the fight ends.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎭 Dual Nature:</strong> The form suppresses corruption, but if forced past its turn limit, the Genie risks unraveling into a rampaging state for 3 turns (cannot be controlled).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧩 Absorption Overload:</strong> Attempting to absorb beings of equal or greater strength risks a 50% chance of backlash, stunning the user for 10 turns and temporarily reducing their power level by 50%.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 100,000x [1,000,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 250,000x [3,000,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Third Stage:</strong> 500,000x [7,000,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1237637333583396865/1407117553792454757","messageId":"1407117553792454757","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Essence Unbound  🌟 A low, otherworldly hum fills the air as the Genie sheds all traces of their fractured existence. The chaotic energy of corruption, once impossible to tame, now courses i"}],"notes":[],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1237637333583396865","imageOnly":false,"classification":"sparking"},{"name":"Unification Path","kind":"branch","forms":[{"title":"Divine Paradox 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://i.pinimg.com/736x/67/57/f4/6757f4fc0d1570c8034262647980f43a.jpg\">Divine Paradox</a> 🌟</h1>The Genie’s form sharpens as their chaotic essence clashes with the serenity of divinity. Their skin tone remains true to their natural hue, but a shimmering, radiant aura of violet-gold flares outward — half heavenly brilliance, half chaotic distortion. Their body becomes sleeker, more defined, with eyes that glow like burning stars. This state represents the impossible balance between chaos and order: a Genie who has dared to consume divinity itself. The transformation is permanent once unlocked, but its true power multipliers remain temporary, surging only when consciously drawn upon. This form is both a blessing and a curse. Though divinity bolsters the Genie’s strength, it also awakens the opposite side of their nature — Good or Evil — which occasionally surfaces in moments of vulnerability, forcing inner conflict and dangerous hesitation.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Divine Paradox ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of the Divine:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Divine Energy:</strong> The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns. Their ki undetectable to those without Divine Ki.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔒 God-Ki Barrier:</strong> Non-divine techniques below 70% of your current PL cannot interrupt your attacks while this form is active.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔮 Magic Immunity:</strong> Near-total resistance to magical attacks and enchantments.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚔️ Dual Nature Surge:</strong> The Genie may tap into bursts of chaotic fury or calm precision depending on which side of their psyche surfaces — Good or Evil. This grants situational advantages (damage spikes vs. chaos stability boosts).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌌 Permanent Paradox:</strong> Once this form is achieved, the Genie keeps the body/aesthetic permanently, but multipliers only activate when the form’s divine essence is consciously tapped into.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 40,000,000.</li></ul><ul><li>Successfully absorb someone with God/Divine Ki.</li></ul><ul><li>Must endure a near-death struggle where their opposite side (Good/Evil) briefly surfaces, testing their willpower. (Must be repeated per stage)</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🌓 Opposite Self Awakens:</strong> Absorbing divinity forces out the user’s hidden nature (Good/Evil). This can cause hesitation, self-doubt, or even momentary loss of control in combat.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💀 Mental Strain:</strong> Maintaining balance between chaos and divinity is exhausting, leading to post-battle fatigue.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🪓 Divine Recoil:</strong> Attacks empowered by divinity drain more stamina than standard Genie techniques.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 10,000x [40,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 20,000x [180,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Third Stage:</strong> 30,000x [250,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1241763580400111658/1406827725691555851","messageId":"1406827725691555851","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Divine Paradox  🌟 The Genie’s form sharpens as their chaotic essence clashes with the serenity of divinity. Their skin tone remains true to their natural hue, but a shimmering, radiant aura"},{"title":"Unified Self 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://glben.dokkaninfo.com/assets/global/en/character/card/1019590/card_1019590_character.png\">Unified Self</a> 🌟</h1>When the Genie finally reconciles the eternal clash between their light and darkness, body and spirit transcend division, fusing into a perfected whole. Their skin retains its natural hue, but their form sharpens and refines — no longer bound to roundness or distortion, but unified in purpose. A radiant aura shimmers in both divine white and chaotic violet, reflecting the harmony struck between good and evil. The Genie’s energy becomes frighteningly still — not due to weakness, but due to the balance of infinite power compressed into one being. Every step carries divine weight, every motion ripples with both creation and destruction. This form is not rage, nor peace — it is the truth of self, manifested.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Unified Self ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>✨ Duality Made Whole:</strong> User gains complete control over both their chaotic and peaceful energies, allowing them to call upon either aspect at will without losing themselves.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔮 Magic Immunity:</strong> Near-total immunity to most magical techniques and enchantments. Only divine-tier magic can affect the user.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of the Divine:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Divine Energy:</strong> The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns. Their ki undetectable to those without Divine Ki.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Unification Surge:</strong> By focusing both halves of their being, the Genie can release a devastating surge attack — damage output spikes dramatically by 3x, but leaves the user drained afterward.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔒 God-Ki Barrier:</strong> Non-divine techniques below 70% of your current PL cannot interrupt your attacks while this form is active.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 500,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Must undergo an internal trial, finding peace between their good and evil selves.</li></ul><ul><li>Unlockable only by engaging in a serious life-or-death battle, where the user’s resolve to unify is tested. (Must be repeated per stage)</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🌀 Mental Turmoil:</strong> Even in unity, the opposite side of the self still whispers — sudden personality shifts or intrusive thoughts can strike mid-battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔋 Energy Compression:</strong> Sustaining this form strains the body; extended combat may lead to rapid fatigue if pushed beyond normal limits.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌓 Fragile Balance:</strong> If the Genie leans too far toward chaos or serenity for too long, the form risks destabilization, reverting to a weaker state until equilibrium is restored.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⌛ One Chance Awakening:</strong> The initial unlock requires a once-in-a-lifetime moment of balance — if failed, it cannot be retried until another equivalent event occurs.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 50,000x [500,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 75,000x [750,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Third Stage:</strong> 100,000x [1,000,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1241763580400111658/1406830137240195143","messageId":"1406830137240195143","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Unified Self  🌟 When the Genie finally reconciles the eternal clash between their light and darkness, body and spirit transcend division, fusing into a perfected whole. Their skin retains i"},{"title":"True Unification 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://i.redd.it/ok308mx3zfeb1.gif\">True Unification</a> 🌟</h1>When a Genie fully embraces the harmony of their light and dark aspects, casting aside inner conflict, they ascend into Ethereal Sovereignty. Their form stabilizes, shedding their chaotic tendencies for a refined, radiant manifestation of energy. Physically, the Genie’s body becomes streamlined, limbs slightly elongated, and their amorphous structure gains definition while retaining flexibility. Luminous patterns ripple across their skin, glowing in a mesmerizing interplay of light and shadow. Their aura shimmers with balanced energy — neither aggressive nor passive, but commanding a presence that resonates with both order and chaos.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Ethereal Sovereignty ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>✨ Unified Aura:</strong> Aura now radiates both light and dark energy, allowing the user to subtly influence the emotions of nearby foes, causing hesitation or unease.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💠 Adaptive Form:</strong> The Genie’s body automatically adjusts to optimize speed, strength, and flexibility depending on the type of attack they face, reducing incoming physical or energy damage by 15%.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of the Divine:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Divine Energy:</strong> The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns. Their ki undetectable to those without Divine Ki.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔮 Energy Harmony:</strong> Incoming energy attacks of opposite alignment (light/dark) are partially absorbed, converting a portion into temporary stamina or Ki restoration.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔒 God-Ki Barrier:</strong> Non-divine techniques below 70% of your current PL cannot interrupt your attacks while this form is active.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 1,000,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Meditate for 1 week IRP, reconciling and harmonizing with your other self.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌀 Energy Strain:</strong> Maintaining this form for extended periods is physically and mentally taxing; prolonged combat without recovery may lead to fatigue.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌗 Residual Turmoil:</strong> The Genie’s opposite alignment occasionally manifests in subtle ways, risking minor lapses in focus or impulsive actions.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Stability Window:</strong> Overexertion can destabilize the aura, temporarily reducing multipliers or forcing the Genie into a neutral, weaker state until balance is restored.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 250,000x [3,000,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 500,000x [7,000,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1241763580400111658/1406831769889669243","messageId":"1406831769889669243","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  True Unification  🌟 When a Genie fully embraces the harmony of their light and dark aspects, casting aside inner conflict, they ascend into Ethereal Sovereignty. Their form stabilizes, shed"}],"notes":[],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1241763580400111658","imageOnly":false,"classification":"sparking"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335290869150122067","formCount":9,"art":"assets/brand.png","sparkingNotes":["SPARKING! @Genie (Unification) & @Genie (Rebirth) Rage Boost: 8x Potential Boost: 30% Ki/Mana Reserves: 300%"]},{"name":"Glind","slug":"glind","accent":"#a7e8e3","shade":"#5888dc","description":"The Glind are an ancient and enigmatic race native to Planet Batapi, known as masters of Spirit Control and elemental magic. Their civilization is built on spiritual mastery, intellectual pursuit, and a deep connection to the univ…","about":[{"title":"The Glind","html":"<div><span><h1>🌌 The Glind 🌌</h1>The Glind are an ancient and enigmatic race native to Planet Batapi, known as masters of Spirit Control and elemental magic. Their civilization is built on spiritual mastery, intellectual pursuit, and a deep connection to the universe’s energy. The Council of Elders, a revered governing body, ensures that the Glind’s knowledge and traditions remain intact, guiding younger generations in the delicate balance between ki, magic, and wisdom.\nDespite their peaceful nature, the Glind are not defenseless. Their control over Spirit Energy and elemental forces makes them formidable in battle. Though physically fragile compared to brute-force races, their mastery of energy efficiency, elemental manipulation, and instantaneous movement allows them to stand against even the most battle-hardened warriors.\n<ul><li><strong>🌟 Glind Society &amp; Culture 🌟</strong></li></ul><ul><li>🌀 Keepers of Spirit Control: The Glind are the foremost teachers of Spirit Control in the universe, with an unmatched ability to manipulate and refine ki. They are responsible for training other races in energy efficiency, Instant Transmission, Forced Spirit Fission, and Energy Sharing.</li></ul><ul><li>📜 The Council of Elders: This elite governing body consists of the wisest and most powerful Glinds, who oversee their civilization’s growth, preserve ancient knowledge, and ensure the ethical use of magic and energy.</li></ul><ul><li>🔮 Elemental Prowess: Every Glind is born attuned to one elemental magic type (Fire, Water, Wind, Earth, Lightning, Ice, etc.), giving them a natural affinity for spellcasting and mystical combat.</li></ul><ul><li>⚖️ The Seekers of Balance: The Glind do not actively interfere in galactic affairs unless balance itself is threatened. They remain neutral scholars and spiritual guides, teaching those who prove worthy of their knowledge.</li></ul><h1><s>--------------------------------------------------------------------</s></h1><h1>💪 Glind Strengths 💪</h1><ul><li>👁️ Heightened Senses: Glinds possess ultra-sensitive senses, allowing them to perceive minute energy fluctuations, detect hidden opponents, and see in extreme darkness.</li><li>🛡️ Extreme Survivability: Their unique physiology allows them to survive without oxygen, making them one of the few races capable of thriving in the vacuum of space without external support.</li><li>📖 Innate Knowledge: From birth, Glinds inherit an intuitive understanding of Spirit Control, elemental magic, and ki flow, allowing them to learn and refine abilities much faster than other races.</li><li>🧘‍♂️ Natural Energy Efficiency: Their mastery of ki control and meditation makes their techniques less draining, allowing them to fight for prolonged periods without exhausting their reserves.</li><li>🔮 Elemental Affinity: Every Glind is attuned to one elemental magic type, giving them an automatic advantage when wielding that element.</li></ul><h1>⚠️ Glind Weaknesses ⚠️</h1><ul><li>🎶 Sound Sensitivity: Due to their ultra-sensitive ears, Glinds suffer greatly from high-pitched noises and sonic-based attacks, which can temporarily disorient or incapacitate them.</li><li>🌀 Energy Disruption: Techniques that nullify or disrupt energy flow (such as Forced Spirit Fission or Ki Suppression Fields) greatly weaken them, as they rely heavily on refined energy control.</li><li>🔥 Fragile Physique: Compared to physically dominant races like Saiyans or Jinago, Glinds are physically weaker and must rely on mobility, magic, and technique rather than brute strength.</li><li>🌪️ Elemental Limitation: A Glind can only master one elemental magic type naturally. While they can learn other elements through intense training, their primary element remains dominant.</li></ul># <s>--------------------------------------------------------------------</s></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335292006024482891/1337612227703869441","messageId":"1337612227703869441"},{"title":"Glind Abilities 💥","html":"<div><span><h1>💥 Glind Abilities 💥</h1><ul><li>✨ Spirit Control: Glinds are the foremost masters of ki manipulation, granting them advanced techniques such as:\n<ul><li>Instant Transmission – Allows them to teleport across vast distances by locking onto energy signatures.</li></ul><ul><li>Forced Spirit Fission – Enables them to split apart energy fused through external means (e.g., fusion techniques or absorbed power).</li></ul><ul><li>Energy Sharing – Allows them to transfer ki to allies, revitalizing their strength.</li></ul></li><li>🌊 Elemental Mastery: Each Glind starts with Basic-to-Advanced mastery of an elemental magic type, integrating elemental power into their ki-based techniques.</li><li>🌀 Ki Absorption: While not as potent as Androids, Glinds can absorb small amounts of ki energy to restore their reserves and maintain their stamina in battle.</li><li>🧘‍♂️ Meditation Training: Glinds can regenerate ki and mana through deep meditation, making them exceptional long-term combatants.</li></ul><h1>🌟 Special Abilities 🌟</h1><ul><li>♾️ Arcane Supremacy: Glinds possess a natural connection to magic and energy refinement, making their attacks 50% harder to disrupt or counteract compared to other races.</li><li>🔄 Spirit Refinement: Through extensive training, a Glind can refine their ki and magic into a purer state, improving efficiency and making their energy techniques stronger and more stable.</li><li>📜 Secret Scrolls of Batapi: Every Glind has access to forbidden knowledge from their ancestors, allowing them to uncover hidden or lost techniques through extensive study.</li></ul><h1><s>--------------------------------------------------------------------</s></h1><h1>📜 Starting Techniques 📜</h1><ul><li>🌀 Flight (Support Technique)</li><li>⚡ Afterimage (Support Technique)</li><li>🔮 Advanced Instant Transmission (Support Technique)</li><li>🔥 Elemental Infusion (Support Technique)</li><li>🌊 Minor Energy Fission (Super Technique)</li><li><strong>👑 Prince/Princess Class:</strong><ul><li>🌌 Ultimate Technique: Starlight Surge</li></ul><ul><li>A concentrated wave of ki and magical energy projected forward like an intense beam. While not destructive on a godly scale, it’s designed to overwhelm an opponent's defenses and force them into retreat.</li></ul><ul><li>🌀 Super Technique: Mystic Heal\n<ul><li>The Glind summons a small pool of healing energy that can quickly close minor wounds and stabilize allies. This technique has limited uses before exhausting the user’s stamina.</li></ul></li></ul></li><li><strong>🌟 Warlord Class:</strong><ul><li>💥 Ultimate Technique: Arcane Blast</li></ul><ul><li>A burst of magical energy that is released in all directions, stunning enemies nearby for a few moments. This move is not lethal but effective for gaining a tactical advantage.</li></ul><ul><li>🌀 Super Technique: Gravity Pulse\n<ul><li>The Glind manipulates gravity in a small area, temporarily slowing opponents' movements and making it harder for them to maintain balance.</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul><h1><s>--------------------------------------------------------------------</s></h1><span><strong><code>SPARKING!; Only with Spirit Control Abilities</code></strong></span><ul><li><strong><span>@deleted-role</span> | <span>@deleted-role</span></strong></li></ul><ul><li>Rage Boost: 2.5x</li></ul><ul><li>Ki/Mana Reserves: 250%</li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335292006024482891/1337612258670280766","messageId":"1337612258670280766"}],"paths":[{"name":"Non-Path Specific (Konatsian)","kind":"branch","forms":[{"title":"Non-Path Specific (Konatsian) · artwork reference","html":"<p>This original forum export contains image attachments but no readable form descriptions. Artwork and details can be added after the source images are supplied.</p>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1276018353638608916","messageId":"","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"This original forum export contains image attachments but no readable form descriptions. Artwork and details can be added after the source images are supplied."}],"notes":[],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1276018353638608916","imageOnly":true,"classification":"normal"},{"name":"Oni Path","kind":"branch","forms":[{"title":"Oni Path · artwork reference","html":"<p>This original forum export contains image attachments but no readable form descriptions. Artwork and details can be added after the source images are supplied.</p>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1276018779805192252","messageId":"","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"This original forum export contains image attachments but no readable form descriptions. Artwork and details can be added after the source images are supplied."}],"notes":[],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1276018779805192252","imageOnly":true,"classification":"normal"},{"name":"Origin Path","kind":"branch","forms":[{"title":"Origin Path · artwork reference","html":"<p>This original forum export contains image attachments but no readable form descriptions. Artwork and details can be added after the source images are supplied.</p>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1276019074077294593","messageId":"","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"This original forum export contains image attachments but no readable form descriptions. Artwork and details can be added after the source images are supplied."}],"notes":[],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1276019074077294593","imageOnly":true,"classification":"normal"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335292006024482891","formCount":3,"art":"assets/brand.png","sparkingNotes":["The current written Glind information says “SPARKING!; Only with Spirit Control Abilities” but references deleted Discord roles, so no path can be assigned confidently. The Glind path artwork also remains absent from this archive."]},{"name":"Kaizokian","slug":"kaizokian","accent":"#fa8f7c","shade":"#a13d6c","description":"Hailing from the vibrant and resource-rich Planet Kaizoku, the Kaizokians are a race defined by power, intellect, and leadership. Their society is divided into three prominent clans—the Hera Clan, Brench Clan, and Heeter Clan—each…","about":[{"title":"🏴‍☠️ The Kaizokians 🏴‍☠️","html":"<div><span><h1>🏴‍☠️ The Kaizokians 🏴‍☠️</h1>Hailing from the vibrant and resource-rich Planet Kaizoku, the Kaizokians are a race defined by power, intellect, and leadership. Their society is divided into three prominent clans—the Hera Clan, Brench Clan, and Heeter Clan—each with its own unique strengths, traditions, and influence. Though their approaches to combat, governance, and trade differ, they share a common resilience and ambition that has shaped them into one of the most dominant civilizations in the universe.\n<ul><li><strong>⚔️ The Clans of the Kaizokians ⚔️</strong></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 The Hera Clan – The Indomitable Warriors</strong><ul><li>The Hera Clan embodies combat superiority, brute strength, and martial honor. Members of this clan are powerful warriors, trained in rigorous disciplines to perfect their combat prowess and endurance. Many Hera warriors bear intricate tattoos that serve as marks of their achievements—each symbolizing a battle won or a feat accomplished.</li></ul><ul><li>Traits: Exceptional strength, resilience, and an unyielding warrior spirit.</li></ul><ul><li>Fighting Style: Direct, aggressive, and overwhelming, favoring brute force and powerful energy techniques.</li></ul><ul><li>Cultural Pillars: Honor, physical strength, and proving oneself in battle.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>👑 The Brench Clan – The Royalty of Kaizoku</strong><ul><li>The Brench Clan is considered the nobility of Kaizokians, acting as the leaders, diplomats, and tacticians of their civilization. They are known for their regal presence, tactical brilliance, and diplomatic acumen. Many Brench warriors are trained in both combat and leadership, ensuring they can both fight and rule effectively. Their ornate armor and ceremonial robes symbolize their high status and authority.</li></ul><ul><li>Traits: Superior speed, strategic brilliance, and strong leadership.</li></ul><ul><li>Fighting Style: Graceful, calculated, and efficient, favoring speed, agility, and precise energy-based attacks.</li></ul><ul><li>Cultural Pillars: Tactical supremacy, governance, and legacy.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🛠️ The Heeter Clan – The Cunning Merchants and Engineers</strong><ul><li>The Heeter Clan is a powerhouse of intellect, commerce, and technological mastery. Unlike the warrior-driven Hera and noble Brench, the Heeters thrive in manipulation, invention, and strategic trade. They possess a deep understanding of technology, allowing them to craft, modify, and hack machinery and weapons with ease. Some of the universe’s most advanced tech originates from the Heeter engineers and black-market traders.</li></ul><ul><li>Traits: Unrivaled intelligence, adaptability, and mastery over technology.</li></ul><ul><li>Fighting Style: Deceptive and highly strategic, favoring gadgetry, precision weaponry, and energy-based enhancements.</li></ul><ul><li>Cultural Pillars: Wealth, intelligence, and technological supremacy.</li></ul></li></ul># <s>--------------------------------------------------</s></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335291740374044722/1337926669016764427","messageId":"1337926669016764427"},{"title":"Untitled section","html":"<div><span><ul><li><strong>💪 Kaizokian Strengths 💪</strong><ul><li><strong>💪 Enhanced Strength:</strong> All Kaizokians possess immense physical strength, with Hera warriors capable of shattering boulders, Brench elites delivering devastating strikes, and Heeters enhancing their bodies with tech.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>👀 Heightened Senses:</strong> Their superior senses allow them to see, hear, and react faster, giving them an edge in combat, piloting, and reconnaissance.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌌 Extreme Survivability:</strong> Kaizokians can survive and function in space without external support, allowing them to fight in environments where others would perish.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Charisma:</strong> Their natural leadership, wit, and presence make them persuasive in battle, negotiations, and trade.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Kaizokian Weaknesses ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>💧 Magical Aversion:</strong> Kaizokians struggle against Hydromancy, as water-based attacks can suppress their ki and weaken their strength over time.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚔️ Overconfidence:</strong> Many Kaizokians, especially Hera warriors and Brench nobles, are prone to underestimating opponents, leading to risky maneuvers or avoidable defeats.</li></ul></li></ul><h1><s>--------------------------------------------------</s></h1><ul><li><strong>💥 Kaizokian Abilities 💥</strong><ul><li><strong>✨ Ki Manipulation:</strong>All Kaizokians can control and refine their ki, allowing for energy-based attacks, flight, and enhanced combat techniques.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Intuition:</strong> Their natural instincts allow them to predict and counter attacks, making them exceptional warriors and strategists.</li></ul><ul><li><strong> ⚔️ Zenkai:</strong> When a Kaizokian's health drops below 15% and they survive, their body adapts and permanently increases their Power Level by 15%–120%, and a maximum of 3 Zenkais per saga/major arc. Non-lethal injuries do not trigger Zenkai, and immediate medical, magical, or technological healing caps the boost at 15%.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🌟 Special Abilities 🌟</strong><ul><li><strong>🏴‍☠️ Pirate’s Sight (Hera Clan Exclusive) 💎</strong></li></ul><ul><li>Hera Clan members possess a rare gift known as Pirate’s Sight—a highly attuned perception ability that allows them to sense valuable resources, hidden energy signatures, and magical presences with pinpoint accuracy. This makes them exceptional hunters, treasure-seekers, and resource extractors.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🛠️ Techno-Mastery (Heeter Clan Exclusive) 🤖</strong><ul><li>Members of the Heeter Clan are technological prodigies, able to intuitively understand and manipulate any device, weapon, or machinery. This ability allows them to hack, modify, and upgrade technology, making them lethal in both combat and espionage.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>👑 Royal Command (Brench Clan Exclusive) 🏛️</strong><ul><li>The Brench Clan’s natural authority and tactical acumen give them an edge in leadership. With a mere command, they can boost their allies’ morale, increase teamwide coordination, and weaken enemy resolve. This ability makes Brench leaders invaluable in war and governance.</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul># <s>--------------------------------------------------</s></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335291740374044722/1337926732119805963","messageId":"1337926732119805963"},{"title":"Untitled section","html":"<div><span><ul><li><strong>📜 Starting Techniques / Caps and Boosts 📜</strong><ul><li><strong>🔥 Hera Clan</strong></li></ul><ul><li>Flight (Support Technique)</li></ul><ul><li>Afterimage (Support Technique)</li></ul><ul><li>Galactic Buster (Super Technique)</li></ul><ul><li>Trap Shooter (Medium Technique)</li></ul><ul><li>Psycho Barrier (Support Technique)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>👑 Brench Clan</strong><ul><li>Flight (Support Technique)</li></ul><ul><li>Afterimage (Support Technique)</li></ul><ul><li>Elegant Blaster (Super Technique)</li></ul><ul><li>Crusher Ball (Medium Technique)</li></ul><ul><li>Death Slash (Weak Technique)</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🛠️ Heeter Clan</strong><ul><li>Flight (Support Technique)</li></ul><ul><li>Afterimage (Support Technique)</li></ul><ul><li>Energy Chains (Support Technique)</li></ul><ul><li>Psychic Pulse (Weak Technique)</li></ul><ul><li>Energy Arrows (Medium Technique)</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>👑 Brench Clan</strong><ul><li><strong>🔥 Ultimate Technique:</strong> Speed Reaper</li></ul><ul><li>A high-speed strike that leaves afterimages, hitting the target multiple times in an instant.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚔️ Super Technique:</strong> Plasma Bolt\n<ul><li>A quick, precise energy projectile fired at blinding speeds, ideal for long-range combat.</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Heeter Clan</strong><ul><li><strong>⚡ Ultimate Technique:</strong> Energy Siphon</li></ul><ul><li>Drains the Ki of nearby opponents, replenishing the user’s reserves while weakening enemies.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Super Technique:</strong> Ki Anchor\n<ul><li>Fires an energy construct that binds the target to a specific location, limiting their movement.</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Hera Clan</strong><ul><li><strong>🏴‍☠️ Ultimate Technique:</strong> Galactic Crusher</li></ul><ul><li>Fires a massive energy projectile that travels slowly but explodes with devastating force.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚔️ Super Technique:</strong> Spiral Destruction\n<ul><li>Spins rapidly to create a whirlwind of energy that shreds nearby foes.</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul><h1><s>--------------------------------------------------</s></h1><ul><li><strong><span>@Kaizokian (Brench)</span></strong><ul><li>Rage Boost: 1.75x</li></ul><ul><li>Potential Boost: 7.5%</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong><span>@Kaizokian (Heeter)</span></strong><ul><li>Rage Boost: 1.55x</li></ul><ul><li>Potential Boost: 7.5%</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong><span>@Kaizokian (Hera)</span></strong><ul><li>Rage Boost: 1.65x</li></ul><ul><li>Potential Boost: 7.5%</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335291740374044722/1337927496666185770","messageId":"1337927496666185770"},{"title":"After mastering this form, progress through your Clan-specific transformations first. Once those are completed, continue adva","html":"<div><span><code>After mastering this form, progress through your Clan-specific transformations first. Once those are completed, continue advancing from this point.</code></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335291740374044722/1405231497291501612","messageId":"1405231497291501612"},{"title":"Quick Trip","html":"<div><span><h1>Quick Trip</h1><a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335291740374044722/1337926669016764427\">Racial Info</a></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335291740374044722/1405429877934653461","messageId":"1405429877934653461"}],"paths":[{"name":"Foundational forms","kind":"core","forms":[{"title":"Brutal Fury 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://tenor.com/view/dbz-dragon-ball-movie-bojack-full-power-gif-7612195085547006650\">Brutal Fury</a> 🌟</h1>When a Kaizokian unleashes Brutal Fury, their body undergoes a staggering metamorphosis. A fierce lime-green aura radiates outward in a volatile shimmer, distorting the air around them. Their hair ignites into a more vibrant shade of its natural color, pulsing with raw energy, while their skin takes on a similarly heightened hue — as if their very life force has been amplified. Muscle mass swells, veins thrum with power, and their height surges by a full foot, giving them an imposing, towering presence. This form is not just a display of physical might; it is the embodiment of their untamed willpower, forged through relentless struggle and sharpened instinct.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Brutal Fury ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🛡️ Overwhelm Presence:</strong> The Kaizokian’s increased size and energy output impose an intimidating aura that can stagger or slow nearby foes for a brief moment upon activation.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💥 Shockwave Rush:</strong> Sudden bursts of force with each step or dash; movement in this form can create concussive shockwaves that knock back opponents or destabilize terrain.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>✊ Power Compression:</strong> The lime-green aura condenses energy around their muscles, amplifying physical strikes for massive short-range damage without needing long charge-ups.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔄 Relentless Momentum:</strong> Consecutive attacks grow stronger with each successful hit. (double damage per 10 hits)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🪨 Anchor Stance:</strong> Increased mass and stability make it harder to be knocked down or displaced, allowing the user to endure heavy impacts without losing footing.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Complete 5 posts of rigorous combat or meditation for each stage of the form’s progression. (Each stage requires this to be done again)</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>📉 Stamina Drain:</strong> The immense strain of maintaining Brutal Fury causes gradual energy loss over time.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Combat Tunnel Vision:</strong> The user’s heightened aggression can lead to overcommitting or taking unnecessary risks.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⏳ Beginners Misfortune:</strong> Until mastered, sustaining the form for extended periods is extremely taxing.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 10x [Birth]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 25x [250,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Third Stage:</strong> 50x [3,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335291740374044722/1405231223877402785","messageId":"1405231223877402785","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Brutal Fury  🌟 When a Kaizokian unleashes Brutal Fury, their body undergoes a staggering metamorphosis. A fierce lime-green aura radiates outward in a volatile shimmer, distorting the air a"},{"title":"Leviathan’s Wrath 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/dragonball/images/c/c1/Full_Power_Bojack_empowered_by_Demigra.jpeg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/732?cb=20230212172333\">Leviathan’s Wrath</a> 🌟</h1>A rare and awe-inspiring step  of Kaizokian evolution, Leviathan’s Wrath represents the seamless fusion of raw, ascended might and god-tier mastery. The bulky frame of lesser power-ups is stripped away, leaving behind a honed, perfected physique — a weaponized form of their true self. The aura ignites into a deep, volatile crimson halo, rippling with divine energy that distorts the very air. Hair and eyes sharpen in intensity, and a subtle divine shimmer clings to every movement, marking the Kaizokian as something beyond mortal comprehension. This transformation is not just strength — it’s transcendence.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Leviathan’s Wrath ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of the Divine:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Divine Energy:</strong> The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns. Their ki undetectable to those without Divine Ki.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🗡️ Blood Oath Resonance:</strong> Damage taken in battle fuels this form instead of draining it; for every 10% health lost, the user gains +5% Power Level temporarily.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌊 Crimson Tide Overrun:</strong> The Kaizokian can unleash a “flow-state assault” — a continuous barrage of strikes that ignores turn order once per battle, but leaves them winded afterward.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🪝 Harpoon Instinct:</strong> As a nod to their predatory roots, the user can “mark” a foe; for the next 3 turns, all attacks automatically home in, bypassing evasions if the foe is half of their PL or less.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔒 God-Ki Barrier:</strong> Non-divine techniques below 70% of your current PL cannot interrupt your attacks while this form is active.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level 180,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Previous Clan-Based form fully mastered</li></ul><ul><li>Must have awakened God/Divine Ki through training or divine ritual</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⏳Drain:</strong> Extremely difficult to maintain for extended periods</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💣 Explosive Personality:</strong> Risk of losing control due to overwhelming divine power, leading to erratic or self-damaging strikes</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 10,000x [180,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 14,000x [500,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Third Stage:</strong> 18,000x [1,000,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335291740374044722/1405427135493181482","messageId":"1405427135493181482","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Leviathan’s Wrath  🌟 A rare and awe-inspiring step  of Kaizokian evolution, Leviathan’s Wrath represents the seamless fusion of raw, ascended might and god-tier mastery. The bulky frame of"},{"title":"Kaizokian Overdrive 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/EutESEYVEAY3LuL?format=jpg&amp;name=900x900\">Kaizokian Overdrive</a> 🌟</h1>Kaizokian Overdrive is the long-lost pinnacle of Kaizokian evolution — a forgotten genetic gift buried deep within their bloodline. Upon awakening, the user’s body surges with primal divinity; their height increases by a full foot, muscle mass swells, and every fiber of their being radiates violent energy. Their natural hair and skin colors ignite into more vibrant, saturated hues, while a violent aura — shimmering between deep crimson and cosmic violet — crackles with raw power. Lightning-like arcs dance across their body, and each breath feels like the roar of an ancient sea beast breaking the surface. This form isn’t just power — it’s dominance incarnate. Once awakened, the Kaizokian stands as a living myth, feared and revered in equal measure. Whether this strength is wielded for liberation or tyranny… is entirely the user’s choice.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Kaizokian Overdrive ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of the Divine:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Divine Energy:</strong> The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns. Their ki undetectable to those without Divine Ki.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌊 Leviathan Pulse:</strong> Emit surging waves of power at will, destabilizing enemy defenses and causing mild knockback within a short radius.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Overdrive Resonance:</strong> Every physical strike releases a shockwave of energy that disorients nearby foes, reducing their reaction speed.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔒 God-Ki Barrier:</strong> Non-divine techniques below 70% of your current PL cannot interrupt your attacks while this form is active.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 3,000,000,000.</li></ul><ul><li>Triggered by a life-or-death battle or extreme emotional upheaval that pushes the user’s limits beyond breaking. (Must be repeated per stage)</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>💥 Severe Strain:</strong> Extended use drains stamina at an accelerated rate, risking physical collapse.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌀 Overwhelming Force:</strong> Risk of partial or total loss of control during intense emotional states.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⏳ Short Burn:</strong> Maximum safe duration of 8 combat turns before penalties to speed and reaction time begin stacking.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Use:</strong> 22,000x (3,000,000,000)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Use:</strong> 26,000x (7,000,000,000)</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335291740374044722/1405429458298732575","messageId":"1405429458298732575","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Kaizokian Overdrive  🌟 Kaizokian Overdrive is the long-lost pinnacle of Kaizokian evolution — a forgotten genetic gift buried deep within their bloodline. Upon awakening, the user’s body su"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335291740374044722","notes":[],"classification":"foundational"},{"name":"Brench Path","kind":"branch","forms":[{"title":"Velocity Breaker 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/dbz-dokkanbattle/images/5/54/STR_SSR_Jeice_artwork.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/250?cb=20180315224432\">Velocity Breaker</a> 🌟</h1>The Velocity Breaker is a rare and dangerous transformation unique to the Brench Clan — a form where the user pushes their body to the absolute edge of speed and impact power. Upon transformation, the user’s aura flares into a fiery red-and-white jetstream, trailing behind them like the wake of a meteor. Muscles tighten, bones reinforce, and every movement seems to slice through the air, leaving streaks of afterimages. Legends tell of Brench warriors who reached this form only in the heat of desperation, often in battles where survival hinged on split-second decisions. While the Velocity Breaker grants blistering speed and devastating strike potential, the toll it takes on the body is just as legendary — many never walk away from their first use unscathed.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Velocity Breaker ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>💨 Velocity Veil:</strong> Moving at extreme speeds compresses the air into a thin shield, reducing incoming energy/projectile damage by 25% and making you harder to lock onto. Opponents see multiple afterimages, forcing them to guess your true position.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🥊 Momentum Strike:</strong> Every attack transfers built-up velocity into explosive impact. Melee attacks deal ×2 normal damage, but also increase recoil strain on the user.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌐 Sonic Burst:</strong> Breaking the sound barrier with each movement sends shockwaves across the battlefield, disrupting footing and throwing off enemy aim.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Combat Flow:</strong> Speed becomes ½ of your Power Level, allowing faster engagement and disengagement from combat situations.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong>\\\n<ul><li>Base Power Level of12,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Must experience a near-death event or intense battle that pushes the body beyond its current speed limits.</li></ul><ul><li>Acceptance of the life-threatening risk — many who unlock this form do not survive its strain.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🩸 Fatigue:</strong> Severe strain on muscles, joints, and heart — prolonged use risks permanent damage.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⏳ Stamin Drain:</strong> High stamina drain, with max safe usage being 5 posts before deterioration sets in.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💢 Velocity Crack:</strong> Momentum-based attacks damage the user if used excessively.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li>🔺 100x</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1276016564503842917/1405728097839353940","messageId":"1405728097839353940","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Velocity Breaker  🌟 The Velocity Breaker is a rare and dangerous transformation unique to the Brench Clan — a form where the user pushes their body to the absolute edge of speed and impact"},{"title":"Chimera's Monster 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://tenor.com/view/zarbon-super-zarbon-transform-dbz-dragon-ball-z-gif-3495261063872528504\">Chimera's Monster</a> 🌟</h1>The Chimera Ascension is a nightmarish evolution that pushes a Brenchian beyond the limits of elegance and grace, warping their body into a grotesque fusion of brute strength and primal instinct. Muscles swell to unnatural proportions, skin stretches and hardens, and facial features twist into a fearsome visage of fangs, horns, or beast-like crests. An unsteady, chaotic aura of deep violet and crimson rages around the user, carrying the scent of blood and the weight of fear.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Chimera Ascension ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🐾 Primal Devastation:</strong> Physical strikes deal 3x normal melee damage, crushing through armor and bone alike.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💉 Feral Regeneration:</strong> Regenerates 10% HP per turn while under heavy emotional stress (e.g., rage, fear, or pain).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💪 Size &amp; Mass Increase:</strong> Strength and durability scale proportionally to the increase in muscle mass, granting +25% damage resistance to non-energy-based attacks.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 25,000,000.</li></ul><ul><li>Must undergo a moment of complete emotional surrender (rage, grief, or fear).</li></ul><ul><li>A triggering battle or life-or-death moment where holding back is no longer an option.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>😵 Mental Instability:</strong> Prolonged use risks attacking allies as instinct overrides reason.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⏳ Stamina Drain:</strong> Loses 5% max stamina every turn due to constant muscle strain.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🩸 Loss of Refinement:</strong> Once transformed, speed and agility suffer (-10% speed), favoring brute force over technique.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li>🔺 250x</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1276016564503842917/1405728843989516308","messageId":"1405728843989516308","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Chimera's Monster  🌟 The Chimera Ascension is a nightmarish evolution that pushes a Brenchian beyond the limits of elegance and grace, warping their body into a grotesque fusion of brute st"},{"title":"Monstrous Beauty 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://i.pinimg.com/736x/57/58/61/5758612d0fb6342ca1d547128f4c9537.jpg\">Monstrous Beauty</a> 🌟</h1>Monstrous Beauty is the pinnacle of the Brench Clan’s discipline over their primal Chimera’s Monster form. Through relentless training and iron mental control, the user unlocks every ounce of the previous form’s raw might—yet refines it into a state of elegance and composure. Their physique remains perfectly proportioned, radiating beauty, while their aura sharpens into a prismatic display of shimmering reds, silvers, and purples. Every motion is a harmonious blend of lethal precision and fluid grace, captivating allies and unsettling foes. Where Chimera’s Monster was chaos unleashed, Monstrous Beauty is chaos mastered—power and elegance entwined in one deadly dance.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Monstrous Beauty ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>💃 Elegant Destruction:</strong> Melee attacks deal 3.5× damage, delivered through fluid, dance-like movements that blend offense and defense seamlessly.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌌 Refined Aura Control:</strong> Aura exerts a subtle emotional influence, bolstering ally morale while instilling hesitation or fear in enemies.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Controlled Frenzy:</strong> Retains the primal boosts of Chimera’s Monster while granting full composure, allowing maximum speed, strength, and reflexes without mental degradation.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔄 Adaptive Flow:</strong> The user can shift between aggressive bursts and defensive counters mid-battle, maintaining stamina more efficiently than in Chimera’s Monster.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 50,000,000.</li></ul><ul><li>Full mastery of Chimera’s Monster through rigorous training and mental discipline.</li></ul><ul><li>Deep understanding and acceptance of one’s inner primal instincts without succumbing to them.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🧠 Focus Reliance:</strong> Any lapse in mental control reverts the user to Chimera’s Monster.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💔 Emotional Dependency:</strong> Strong emotional disruption can destabilize the form, weakening boosts.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔋 Continuous Drain:</strong> Although more efficient than Chimera’s Monster, the constant fine control still burns stamina over prolonged fights.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li>🔺 400x</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1276016564503842917/1405730261101973627","messageId":"1405730261101973627","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Monstrous Beauty  🌟 Monstrous Beauty is the pinnacle of the Brench Clan’s discipline over their primal Chimera’s Monster form. Through relentless training and iron mental control, the user"}],"notes":[{"title":"After mastering this form, progress through the next level in Basic Info.","html":"<div><span><code>After mastering this form, progress through the next level in Basic Info.</code></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1276016564503842917/1405730572508332083","messageId":"1405730572508332083"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1276016564503842917","imageOnly":false,"classification":"normal"},{"name":"Heeter Path","kind":"branch","forms":[{"title":"Bestial Instincts 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://images-wixmp-ed30a86b8c4ca887773594c2.wixmp.com/f/2844d369-3572-4372-8a19-c7b680f797be/dewth61-964afa83-885c-4ada-b00d-0235cdb02bcf.jpg/v1/fill/w_1280,h_721,q_75,strp/gas_dragon_ball_super_manga_77_colored_by_vs_animations_dewth61-fullview.jpg?token=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..dIJ24BMzPHgQ4PQaZXV1oLbunhwhQZykTBSVrzkFa60\">Bestial Instincts</a> 🌟</h1>The Heeter Clan is known for cunning and strategy, but beneath their refined exterior lies a dormant predator. Bestial Instincts is the moment that predator takes the throne. The user’s frame swells with dense, corded muscle, horns curve forward like the crown of an apex hunter, and their aura takes on a deep, molten hue—red at the core, fading to smoky grey at the edges. Their movements grow raw and instinct-driven, each action calculated by primal efficiency rather than intellect. It is not a loss of control—it’s the acceptance of one’s true nature. In this form, a Heeter becomes the embodiment of calculated savagery, balancing the line between beast and tactician… for as long as their mind can keep the beast leashed.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Bestial Instincts ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>💪 Predator’s Might:</strong> Strikes carry double the force of the user’s base, capable of sending even heavily-armored opponents reeling.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🐂 Hornbreaker Charge:</strong> A brutal rushing attack using enhanced horns; deals piercing damage that ignores up to 25% of an opponent’s physical defense.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🦅 Instinctive Guard:</strong> Muscle memory and heightened senses grant a passive +15% dodge chance against melee attacks.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🩸 Hunter’s Momentum:</strong> Landing consecutive melee hits in the same turn boosts attack power by +5% per successful strike (caps at +15%).</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 12,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Must have experienced a battle where survival demanded raw physical dominance over strategy.</li></ul><ul><li>A moment of heightened adrenaline, anger, or desperation to awaken latent primal traits.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🔥 Aggressive Temperament:</strong> The user is quicker to pick fights and less likely to consider alternatives.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Dulling Strategy:</strong> Tactical precision drops significantly the longer the form is active.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⏳ Slow Reversion:</strong> Requires 1 full turn of vulnerability to safely drop the form without strain.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🩸 Cognitive Drift:</strong> Overuse can cause lingering animalistic impulses for hours after transformation.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li>🔺 100x</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1276016624897359965/1405622987717345291","messageId":"1405622987717345291","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Bestial Instincts  🌟 The Heeter Clan is known for cunning and strategy, but beneath their refined exterior lies a dormant predator. Bestial Instincts is the moment that predator takes the t"},{"title":"Instincts Unleashed 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/dragonball/images/4/40/Transformed_Gas'_colored_pic.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/340?cb=20220922215207\">Instincts Unleashed</a> 🌟</h1>Instincts Unleashed is the Heeter Clan’s ultimate regression to their ancestral roots a predator form born from centuries of survival instinct, honed and unleashed in its purest state. When triggered, the user’s physique swells with dense, coiled muscle; their horns elongate into menacing, jagged curves; and their eyes blaze with a predatory gleam, stripped of compassion or reason. A jagged, deep-crimson aura mixed with black static surges around the body, pulsing in rhythm with their heartbeat. Every movement becomes raw, instinctual, and unrestrained — a living embodiment of untamed ferocity. In this state, the user ceases to fight like a warrior and instead hunts like a beast, every strike driven by primal necessity rather than calculated thought.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Instincts Unleashed ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>💥 Berserker Force:</strong> All melee attacks deal 3x normal damage and have a 25% chance to stagger or knock back an opponent.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🐾 Predator’s Step:</strong> Sudden bursts of feral speed allow the user to instantly close gaps or evade attacks with unpredictable movements.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🐺 Relentless Hunt:</strong> While targeting a single opponent, the user gains +10% attack speed each consecutive turn until that target is defeated or the form ends.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 25,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Must undergo a trial to willingly surrender all rational thought, embracing the Heeter’s primal predator instinct.</li></ul><ul><li>A severe emotional trigger (rage, desperation, or fear of loss) must push the user into losing control.</li></ul><ul><li>Must have completed at least one life-or-death hunt where instinct was the only deciding factor for survival.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🧠 Loss of Reason:</strong> All strategic decision-making is lost; the user fights purely on instinct.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔪 Friendly Fire Risk:</strong> Allies are just as likely to be targeted as enemies.</li></ul><ul><li>⏳Difficult to End: Requires strong outside intervention or the complete defeat of all threats to revert back.</li></ul><ul><li>💢 Stamina Drain:Extended use greatly taxes the body, leaving the user heavily fatigued and vulnerable afterward.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li>🔺 250x</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1276016624897359965/1405624513638432798","messageId":"1405624513638432798","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Instincts Unleashed  🌟 Instincts Unleashed is the Heeter Clan’s ultimate regression to their ancestral roots a predator form born from centuries of survival instinct, honed and unleashed in"},{"title":"Beastly Awakening 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/dragonball/images/1/10/Adult_Gas_going_berserk.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20231121044545\">Beastly Awakening</a> 🌟</h1>The Beastly Awakening form marks the Heeter Clan’s brutal awakening into their most primal state. Triggered when instincts and rage eclipse restraint, the user’s body undergoes a savage transformation—muscles swell, height increases, and their hair and skin shift into a deep, exotic blend of dark violet and light teal. A jagged, storm-like aura crackles with violent energy, carrying a faint distortion in the air as if reality bends around their power. This state is more than raw strength—it is the embodiment of the Heeter Clan’s predatory lineage, unlocking senses sharp enough to track the faintest heartbeat, alongside ferocity capable of crushing even the sturdiest of foes. However, the wild nature of this form demands control, lest the beast consume its wielder entirely.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Beastly Awakening ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🦅 Predator’s Fury:</strong> Melee attacks deal 3x normal damage, shattering guard and defenses through sheer force.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🛡️ Savage Resilience:</strong> Damage taken is halved due to monstrous durability, allowing extended close-range combat.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Instinct Overdrive:</strong> The longer you remain in this form, the faster your speed and reaction time rise, but this also burns stamina at an increasing rate. (by 10% per 10 turns for speed and stamina)</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 50,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Engage in battle with up to 5 different opponents while in Instincts Unleashed. These fights do not need to be back-to-back, but cannot be spread over more than 2 weeks.</li></ul><ul><li>Must reach a point of desperation or rage that forces instinct to override strategy, tapping into the beast within.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⏳ Time-Locked Power:</strong> Can only remain in this form for 20 turns before forced reversion to base.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💀 Overexertion Risk:</strong> Pushing past your limit causes total stamina collapse, leaving you too drained to fight for 10 full turns.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🩸 Loss of Precision:</strong> Fine motor control and energy manipulation weaken—Ki-based techniques suffer reduced accuracy.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Mental Strain:</strong> Extended use heightens aggression, potentially making it harder to distinguish friend from foe in chaotic battles.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li>🔺 400x</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1276016624897359965/1405720941333450823","messageId":"1405720941333450823","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Beastly Awakening  🌟 The Beastly Awakening form marks the Heeter Clan’s brutal awakening into their most primal state. Triggered when instincts and rage eclipse restraint, the user’s body u"}],"notes":[{"title":"After mastering this form, progress through the next level in Basic Info.","html":"<div><span><code>After mastering this form, progress through the next level in Basic Info.</code></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1276016624897359965/1405721636719693897","messageId":"1405721636719693897"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1276016624897359965","imageOnly":false,"classification":"normal"},{"name":"Hera Path","kind":"branch","forms":[{"title":"Bloodfury Awakening 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/character-stats-and-profiles/images/e/e5/Bojack_(Full_Power)(SDBH).png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/490?cb=20210422015950\">Bloodfury Awakening</a> 🌟</h1>Bloodfury Awakening is the Hera Clan’s most volatile state — a primal surge triggered when unbearable loss, betrayal, or mortal peril pushes them beyond the brink. In this form, their physique bulks up dramatically, muscles swelling with raw force. Their hair spikes upward, eyes glaze over in a lifeless white haze, and an intense aura distorts the air around them. Unlike Brutal Fury, their hair and skin retain their natural colors, making the transformation’s violent energy all the more unnerving. This is not a strategic evolution — it’s a living weapon forged in pain. A Hera in Bloodfury Awakening is a relentless force of destruction, their every strike echoing with the agony that birthed the form. Friend and foe alike are at risk, for in this state, there is only the fight.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Bloodfury Awakening ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>💥 Wrath-Fueled Might:</strong> Melee damage is doubled, with power output increasing the longer the user remains enraged.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🛡️ Relentless Endurance:</strong> Pain and injury are ignored — the user can keep fighting through otherwise fight-ending wounds.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Unpredictable Assault:</strong> Wild, erratic movements make the user’s attacks harder to predict or counter.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔊 Fear Incarnate:</strong> The user’s overwhelming presence reduces enemy morale, causing hesitation in weaker opponents.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 12,000,000.</li></ul><ul><li>Triggered by:\n<ul><li>A traumatic event or near-death experience.</li></ul><ul><li>The theft or destruction of something deeply precious to the user.</li></ul></li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>😡 Mindless Frenzy:</strong> No distinction between allies and enemies — anything in range is attacked.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⏳ Rapid Burnout:</strong> Prolonged use leads to extreme stamina drain and crippling post-transformation fatigue.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌀 Emotional Dependency:</strong> Cannot be activated without an intense triggering event; cannot be calmly willed into existence.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li>🔺 100x</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1276016660439892041/1405594399638950051","messageId":"1405594399638950051","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Bloodfury Awakening  🌟 Bloodfury Awakening is the Hera Clan’s most volatile state — a primal surge triggered when unbearable loss, betrayal, or mortal peril pushes them beyond the brink. In"},{"title":"Vengeful Onslaught 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://images-wixmp-ed30a86b8c4ca887773594c2.wixmp.com/f/0357ed28-275f-4975-841f-0ea339084ed3/deau7i7-56f3fbf3-513b-4036-b54e-68dc44435082.png/v1/fill/w_774,h_1032,q_70,strp/sobura__the_herajin_queen_by_anthony60_deau7i7-pre.jpg?token=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..l7-5V7u4JftSZZwR0Vt3I9Ed7G-o1hK9otw7QgnIiPk\">Vengeful Onslaught</a> 🌟</h1>When a Hera Clan warrior’s pride is scarred beyond repair, and their spirit is pushed past every conceivable limit, a new form is born—Vengeful Onslaught. This transformation channels the ferocity of the Bloodfury Awakening, yet hones it into a razor edge of discipline and instinct. The user’s aura ignites into a deep crimson blaze laced with streaks of black lightning, resonating with their heartbeat like the drums of war. Their muscles tighten without bulking, their eyes sharpen to a predator’s glare, and the very air around them grows heavy with tension. This form does not scream for vengeance—it executes it. The warrior becomes a living embodiment of retribution, fueled not by rage alone, but by an unshakable will to see justice dealt at any cost.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Vengeful Onslaught ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🔥 Relentless Fury:</strong> Melee strikes deal 3x base damage, driven by an unyielding offensive rhythm that forces enemies onto the defensive.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Predator’s Instinct:</strong> Enhanced reflexes allow perfect exploitation of enemy weaknesses; critical hits deal +50% damage when landing on a known weak point.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🛡️ Unshaken Will:</strong> Immune to fear, intimidation, and mind-altering effects while in this form.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 25,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Must endure a significant personal trial or defeat that challenges both body and conviction.</li></ul><ul><li>Must have previously awakened Bloodfury and mastered control over its base instincts.</li></ul><ul><li>Requires the willpower to choose restraint even in the heat of battle before triggering the form.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⚡ Severe Strain:</strong> Rapid stamina depletion over extended use; extended fights can cause permanent muscular fatigue.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🩸 Lingering Damage:</strong> Overuse risks internal bleeding and nerve strain, reducing maximum HP for the remainder of the battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Instinct Overload:</strong> In rare cases, the form’s predatory nature can override strategy, forcing the user into reckless assaults.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⏳ Limited Duration:</strong> Maintaining full power for more than 10 posts/rounds causes multipliers to drop by 25%.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li>🔺 250x</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1276016660439892041/1405600188189511742","messageId":"1405600188189511742","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Vengeful Onslaught  🌟 When a Hera Clan warrior’s pride is scarred beyond repair, and their spirit is pushed past every conceivable limit, a new form is born—Vengeful Onslaught. This transfo"},{"title":"Havoc Incarnate 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://tenor.com/view/super-dragon-ball-heroes-dragon-ball-bojack-gif-4082352432126527161\">Havoc Incarnate</a> 🌟</h1>When a Hera warrior’s rage and pride finally shatter into something unrecognizable, they may awaken the cataclysm known as Havoc Incarnate. This transformation does not just amplify power—it corrupts it, turning every ounce of strength into raw, uncontrollable destruction. The user’s aura becomes a violent storm of crimson and black, bursting outward in surges that distort the air itself. Eyes blaze with unholy intensity, movements grow erratic, and even their voice carries an unnatural, warping echo.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Havoc Incarnate ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>💥 Uncontrolled Devastation:</strong> All attacks deal massive area damage with collateral destruction.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🩸 Annihilation Frenzy:</strong> The longer the user remains in this state, the more their power snowballs: +20% PL every 5 turns as carnage fuels their strength.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Chaotic Momentum:</strong> Even when staggered, the user can lash out instantly, making them unpredictable and dangerous to approach.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 50,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Must have achieved Vengeful Onslaught and experienced the edge of complete mental collapse.</li></ul><ul><li>Triggered by an overwhelming moment of trauma, betrayal, or catastrophic loss that breaks remaining restraint.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🔥 Loss of Control:</strong> The user attacks everything in sight; allies are not safe.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⏳ Severe Stamina Burn:</strong> Cannot be sustained for more than 8 posts/rounds before the body begins shutting down.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🩸 Aftermath Damage:</strong> Upon reverting, the user suffers severe internal strain, halving combat effectiveness for the remainder of the thread.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 No Tactical Precision:</strong> Attacks are unpredictable, making it nearly impossible to execute coordinated strategies.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li>🔺 400x</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1276016660439892041/1405603152652144713","messageId":"1405603152652144713","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Havoc Incarnate  🌟 When a Hera warrior’s rage and pride finally shatter into something unrecognizable, they may awaken the cataclysm known as Havoc Incarnate. This transformation does not j"}],"notes":[{"title":"After mastering this form, progress through the next level in Basic Info.","html":"<div><span><code>After mastering this form, progress through the next level in Basic Info.</code></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1276016660439892041/1405603360094158948","messageId":"1405603360094158948"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1276016660439892041","imageOnly":false,"classification":"normal"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335291740374044722","formCount":12,"art":"assets/brand.png","sparkingNotes":[]},{"name":"Majin","slug":"majin","accent":"#f5a1c8","shade":"#a448b4","description":"Emerging from the primordial darkness of the Makyo Realm, the Majin are ancient, shapeless entities born from raw dark energy and twisted sorcery. Their bodies are malleable, their power limitless, and their morality… fleeting at …","about":[{"title":"👹 The Majin 👹","html":"<div><span><h1>👹 The Majin 👹</h1>Emerging from the primordial darkness of the Makyo Realm, the Majin are ancient, shapeless entities born from raw dark energy and twisted sorcery. Their bodies are malleable, their power limitless, and their morality… fleeting at best. Capable of rapid regeneration, reality-defying transformations, and supernatural resilience, Majin exist as some of the most chaotic beings in the cosmos. While most traditional Majin remain in the Makyo Realm, thriving in an environment ruled by power and deceit, some of their kin evolved beyond their origins, venturing into the mortal realm where they forged new identities and cultures, giving birth to four distinct sub-races. Though these races no longer fall under the moniker of 'Majin' therefore the name is used for the other beings residing from Makyo\nThese include the Namekians, the Glinds, the Genies, and the Vampyres. Despite their different paths, all these beings descend from the same chaotic origins, forever carrying the remnants of Majin heritage within them.\n<ul><li><strong>🌑 The Majin Offshoots 🌑</strong></li></ul><ul><li><strong> 👿 Majin:</strong> The majority of the Makyo realms population born from magically infused rocks. The term 'Majin' is a loose name used for the other beings residing in Makyo. <span>(Playable)</span></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🟢 Namekians:</strong> The warrior-monks and mystics of the cosmos. Once Majin who rejected chaos, they sought enlightenment and spiritual growth, developing a deep connection to nature and creation. <span>(Playable)</span></li></ul><ul><li><strong> 🧝‍♀️ Glind:</strong> A subspecies of Majin who are born as plants from tree, the vast majority of these beings fled the realm to live on Planet Batapi, where they sought enlightenment and developed the Spirit Control abilities. <span>(Non-Playable)</span></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔮 Genies:</strong> A rare subspecies of Majin who abandoned destruction, embracing a life of servitude, guidance, and protection. They act as keepers of wisdom, not bound by trickery or servitude but by honor and self-discipline. <span>(Playable)</span></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🦇 Vampyres:</strong> The result of a forbidden union between Lord Dagon and Lamae Beolfag, Vampyres are a cursed offshoot of the Majin race, with blood magic, enhanced regeneration, and supernatural allure. <span>(Playable)</span></li></ul><h1><s>--------------------------------------------------</s></h1><ul><li><strong>💪 Majin Strengths 💪</strong><ul><li><strong>💪 Enhanced Strength:</strong> Majin possess immense physical strength, making them capable of overpowering nearly any opponent in raw power.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>♾️ Immortality:</strong> Type 7 Immortality means Majin do not age and cannot die of natural causes. However, they can still be killed through external means.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔄 Extreme Adaptability:</strong> Majin can alter their bodies at will, allowing them to create weapons from their own flesh, reform after being injured, or stretch their limbs for unpredictable combat maneuvers.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Intuition:</strong> Majin have sharp instincts, allowing them to make split-second decisions and react faster than most other races.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Majin Weaknesses ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>👑 Pride and Overconfidence:</strong> Majin often believe themselves superior to all other races, leading them to underestimate opponents or ignore potential weaknesses.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌀 Magical Aversion:</strong> Majin are particularly weak to Illusiomancy, as their chaotic minds can be easily influenced by deception, mirages, and illusions.</li></ul></li></ul># <s>--------------------------------------------------</s></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335292115588223078/1338495597459800095","messageId":"1338495597459800095"},{"title":"Majin Abilities 💥 ✨ Ki Manipulation: Majin can harness and control their internal energy (Ki), allowing them to fire energy","html":"<div><span><ul><li><strong>💥 Majin Abilities 💥</strong><ul><li><strong>✨ Ki Manipulation:</strong> Majin can harness and control their internal energy (Ki), allowing them to fire energy blasts, manipulate their strength, and defy normal physical laws.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔄 Shapeshifting:</strong> Majin can freely alter their form, making them highly unpredictable fighters. They can change their body shape, liquefy to avoid attacks, or stretch their limbs to extreme lengths.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌀 Magic Affinity:</strong> All Majin possess an innate connection to magic, granting them a natural boost (+2%) when training magical abilities.</li></ul><ul><li><strong> ⚔️ Zenkai:</strong> When a Majin's health drops below 15% and they survive, their body adapts and permanently increases their Power Level by 20%–130%, <span>(-10% for SPARKING)</span> and a maximum of 3 Zenkais per saga/major arc. Non-lethal injuries do not trigger Zenkai, and immediate medical, magical, or technological healing caps the boost at 20%.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🌟 Special Abilities 🌟</strong><ul><li><strong>🌑 Makyo Surge</strong></li></ul><ul><li>Majin can draw energy from the Makyo Star or areas of high Makyo energy, temporarily increasing their power but reducing mental clarity.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Effects:</strong><ul><li>2.5x increase in power level for 3 turns.</li></ul><ul><li>After-effects leave the user slightly disoriented for 2 turns.</li></ul><ul><li>If used twice in one battle, the user must roll for control (Admin oversight required).</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌌 Portal Creation: </strong><ul><li>Majin possess the ability to instantly transport themselves between locations, even traveling between dimensions at will.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Limitations:</strong><ul><li>Can only teleport to locations they have been before.</li></ul><ul><li>Using this ability more than 3-5 times per day results in fatigue and weakened stamina.</li></ul><ul><li>Cannot be used offensively (i.e., teleporting inside an enemy or attacking mid-teleport).</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong> 🟪 Bunkai Distortion: (Bezalba Path)</strong><ul><li>The Majin rips reality apart into cubes, scattering their form and instantly reforming elsewhere. They can also weaponize these rifts, using them as openings to redirect or launch attacks through portals.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Limitations:</strong><ul><li>Once per turn, the user can instantly reposition, dodging one attack completely.</li></ul><ul><li>Offensive techniques can be fired through a rift, making them unpredictable unless the target understands portal abilities.</li></ul><ul><li>Each use builds strain on the Majin’s chaotic essence. After 3 uses in a single battle, stamina recovery is halved, and defenses drop by 10% for the remainder of the fight.</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul># <s>--------------------------------------------------</s></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335292115588223078/1338495828767150110","messageId":"1338495828767150110"},{"title":"Untitled section","html":"<div><span><ul><li><strong>📜 Starting Techniques / Cap and Boosts📜</strong><ul><li>Flight (Support Technique)</li></ul><ul><li>Afterimage (Support Technique)</li></ul><ul><li>Super Explosive Wave (Super Technique)</li></ul><ul><li>Regeneration (Support Technique)</li></ul><ul><li>Chaos Pulse (Ultimate Technique)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>👑 Royal Class</strong><ul><li><strong>🔥 Ultimate Technique:</strong> Endless Oblivion Blast</li></ul><ul><li>The Majin channels all of their Ki into a spiraling orb of chaotic energy, causing massive area damage, but leaves them drained for two turns.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Super Technique:</strong> Dark Chains\n<ul><li>The Majin launches Ki-infused tendrils that attempt to restrain and drain their opponent’s energy.</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Super Elite Class</strong><ul><li><strong>⚡ Ultimate Technique:</strong> Chaotic Blitz</li></ul><ul><li>The Majin envelops themselves in raw Ki energy, boosting speed for a rapid, unpredictable melee assault.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Super Technique:</strong> Nightmare Malice\n<ul><li>The Majin blends into the shadows, emerging behind an enemy with a massive explosion of condensed dark energy.</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Bezalba Path</strong><ul><li><strong>⚡ Ultimate Technique:</strong> Pandemonium Breaker</li></ul><ul><li>Channeling pure chaotic essence, the Majin floods the battlefield with warped cubes of distorted energy. These fragments collapse inward on the target in a violent implosion, dealing devastating area-of-effect damage that shreds terrain and bypasses barriers entirely.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Super Technique:</strong> Makyo's Rift\n<ul><li>The Majin tears open a jagged rift in space with their hands, unleashing a storm of chaotic energy that spills through from another dimension. This attack engulfs a wide area, ignoring physical defenses and striking all within range. Once used, the rift collapses violently, causing a brief recoil that leaves the user unable to attack on their next turn.</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul><h1><s>--------------------------------------------------</s></h1><ul><li><strong><span>@Majin (Devourer)</span>  | <span>@Majin (Rebirth)</span></strong><ul><li>Rage Boost: 1.6x</li></ul><ul><li>Potential Boost: 10%</li></ul><ul><li>Spirit Control Boost: 1.5%</li></ul><ul><li>Ki/Mana Reserves: 200%</li></ul></li></ul><span><strong><code>SPARKING!</code></strong></span><ul><li><span>@Majin (Bezalba)</span></li></ul><ul><li>Rage Boost: 5x</li></ul><ul><li>Potential Boost: 25%</li></ul><ul><li>Ki/Mana Reserves: 250%</li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335292115588223078/1338495864674582569","messageId":"1338495864674582569"},{"title":"Quick Trip","html":"<div><span><h1>Quick Trip</h1><a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335292115588223078/1338495597459800095\">Racial Info</a></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335292115588223078/1411777543714902199","messageId":"1411777543714902199"}],"paths":[{"name":"Foundational forms","kind":"core","forms":[{"title":"Daimasin 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://i.makeagif.com/media/7-14-2025/tSr3qG.gif\">Daimasin</a> 🌟</h1>When a Majin taps into the unstable chaos at the core of their being, their body begins to twist and rupture with overwhelming power. Their skin boils from its normal hue into a deep crimson red, features elongating and hardening into sharp, monstrous ridges. The transformation is violent, primal — bones crack, muscles tear and reforge, and arcs of crackling electricity lash out wildly as if reality itself is rejecting the sudden surge. The Daimasin looms as a towering colossus, anywhere between 20 and 50 feet tall, its very presence distorting the battlefield. Its eyes burn with manic intensity, its movements thunderous and unpredictable. This form is not one of elegance, but of unrestrained might and fear, the raw chaos of the Majin given terrifying shape.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Daimasin ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🌋 Titanic Growth:</strong> User grows to a massive size (60–120ft), their physical power and reach drastically increasing. Basic strikes can level terrain and crush weaker foes outright.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💪 Titanic Frame:</strong> Upon transforming, the Majin's body surges to an immense size (20–50 feet). Their attacks gain devastating weight, increasing raw striking power by 15%, but their larger frame makes them slightly easier to hit.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌊 Shockwave Generation:</strong> Every physical strike releases concussive shockwaves, creating AoE damage and staggering nearby foes.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌊 Colossal Presence:</strong> The extreme size and aura not only intimidate weaker opponents, but cause small-scale environmental effects like tremors and wind displacement with movements.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Living Conduit:</strong> The Majin’s unstable magical energy constantly arcs across its body like crackling lightning. Whenever the Majin takes damage from a melee attack, the attacker suffers 10% of that damage back as magical recoil. If struck by Ki-based energy attacks, the Majin absorbs a fraction (5%) of the energy as raw vitality, healing slightly.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Must have completed at least 5 Training Sessions.</li></ul><ul><li>Must endure a near-fatal wound or moment of overwhelming rage to trigger the first awakening. (Must be repeated per stage)</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⏳ Limited Duration:</strong> Transformation lasts 10 turns before forced reversion.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🪫 Stamina Drain:</strong> After reverting, the user suffers 5% Stamina Drain due to the immense strain.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Mental Instability:</strong> In Daimasin form, the Majin’s mind is clouded by primal rage — strategy becomes harder to maintain, often leading to reckless overextension.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 10x [Birth]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 25x [250,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335292115588223078/1411764593449107498","messageId":"1411764593449107498","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Daimasin  🌟 When a Majin taps into the unstable chaos at the core of their being, their body begins to twist and rupture with overwhelming power. Their skin boils from its normal hue into a"},{"title":"Majin's Will 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://tenor.com/view/dabura-dbz-meditation-gif-6427527668839722439\">Majin's Will</a> 🌟 </h1>Upon entering Majin's Will, the user fully embraces their inner demonic nature, grounding themselves in a meditative, predator-like focus. Their body subtly darkens, skin taking on a faint obsidian hue, while jagged crimson markings trace across their limbs. Eyes glow a piercing, intense red, reflecting a mind that has accepted its darkest instincts. Sparks of chaotic, dark electricity flicker intermittently along their body, signaling raw, barely-contained power. Unlike uncontrolled rage, this form exudes a calculated menace, embodying both restraint and overwhelming destructive potential.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Majin's Will ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🗡️ Electrified Strikes:</strong> Physical and energy attacks are imbued with natural fulgurmancy, adding piercing shock effects on impact. The electricity can travel along weapons or connected objects, allowing attacks to extend through conductive materials.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Essence Drain:</strong> On successful physical or energy strikes, the user siphons a small portion of the target’s energy or stamina, subtly fueling themselves.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🛡️ Hardened Form:</strong> Prolonged meditation allows the user to harden specific parts of their body temporarily, giving added resistance to attacks without affecting mobility.=</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 3,000,000.</li></ul><ul><li>Must confront and accept their inner darkness, embracing destructive impulses without succumbing to blind rage.</li></ul><ul><li>Triggered under extreme emotional stress or life-threatening conditions, where the user’s survival instincts align with their demonic nature. (Must be repeated per stage)</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🩸 Stamina Drain:</strong> Sustaining the form gradually exhausts the user due to the effort of controlling chaotic energy.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Mental Strain:</strong> Extended use risks emotional instability, creating potential long-term psychological effects.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚠️ Overconfidence:</strong> Reliance on bursts of destructive power can lead to miscalculations or reckless decisions.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 50x [3,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 100x [12,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335292115588223078/1411764698516291684","messageId":"1411764698516291684","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Majin's Will  🌟  Upon entering Majin's Will, the user fully embraces their inner demonic nature, grounding themselves in a meditative, predator-like focus. Their body subtly darkens, skin t"},{"title":"Makyo’s Embrace 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://tenor.com/view/mira-gif-13620375\">Makyo’s Embrace</a> 🌟</h1>When Makyo’s Embrace is activated, the user becomes a vessel for the energies of Makyo—a realm of pure darkness and malevolence. Their skin darkens to a deep crimson or obsidian, and veins glow faintly with an ominous light. Eyes burn with an unsettling intensity, capable of piercing shadows as if seeing through the very fabric of the battlefield. The transformation enhances the user’s physical and magical abilities to superhuman levels, but it comes with a predatory, almost insatiable personality: calm and calculating, yet consumed by a hunger for power and dominance. The form reflects a balance of ruthless intelligence and destructive instinct.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Makyo’s Embrace ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🔮 Dark Manipulation:</strong> The user can shape and weaponize shadows, creating constructs or tendrils of dark energy to bind or strike enemies.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>☠️ Cursed Infliction:</strong> Strikes or energy attacks can carry curses that weaken, paralyze, or disrupt an opponent’s abilities over time.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>👀 Shadow Sight:</strong> The user perceives enemies and hidden threats even in complete darkness, allowing them to anticipate actions without enhancing reflexes.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⏳ Energy Sacrifice:</strong> The user can temporarily overcharge attacks by sacrificing a portion of their own stamina or vitality, dealing more damage at personal cost.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 50,000,000.</li></ul><ul><li>Triggered by overwhelming desire for power or a significant emotional event.</li></ul><ul><li>The user must willingly sacrifice a portion of their soul to maintain the form. (Must be repeated per stage)</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🩸 Physical Corruption:</strong> Prolonged use can cause permanent changes or mutations, gradually eroding humanity.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Mental Strain:</strong> The user risks losing their sense of self, becoming more a vessel for Oblivion’s will.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚠️ Exhaustion Risk:</strong> Maintaining the form is extremely taxing; overuse can lead to collapse or even death.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔗 Soul Sacrifice Required:</strong> Attacks or  abilities that push the form’s limits consume fragments of the user’s soul, limiting how long the form can be sustained.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 400x [50,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 800x [75,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335292115588223078/1411764719794257990","messageId":"1411764719794257990","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Makyo’s Embrace  🌟 When Makyo’s Embrace is activated, the user becomes a vessel for the energies of Makyo—a realm of pure darkness and malevolence. Their skin darkens to a deep crimson or o"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335292115588223078","notes":[],"classification":"foundational"},{"name":"Bezalba Path","kind":"branch","forms":[{"title":"Colossus 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://media.tenor.com/tgDj0SBb-XEAAAAM/gordo-clapping.gif\">Colossus</a> 🌟</h1>The Colossus is not a form willingly sought, but the dreadful result of a Majin’s unstable essence reaching its breaking point. Towering at an unfathomable height, this gargantuan yellow demon embodies the raw, unshaped chaos of its kind. Its body is bloated and monstrous, a grotesque monument to instability, with each step causing the ground to quake beneath its colossal weight. Unlike other transformations, the Colossus radiates no aura—its existence alone is suffocating. The sheer density of its being twists the battlefield itself, pressing down on all around it with an oppressive, inescapable weight. It is chaos given flesh, an unrefined nightmare made manifest, feared not for what it projects but for what it is.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Colossus ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⛰️ Titanic Bulk:</strong> The Majin’s body becomes impossibly durable, shrugging off most physical and energy attacks. Physical damage taken is reduced by 20%, but agility-based maneuvers become harder to execute.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌊 Shockwave Generation:</strong> Every physical strike releases concussive shockwaves, creating AoE damage and staggering nearby foes.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌊 Colossal Presence:</strong> The extreme size and aura not only intimidate weaker opponents, but cause small-scale environmental effects like tremors and wind displacement with movements.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🍖 Gluttonous Absorption:</strong> The Colossus can consume Ki-based attacks and convert them into stamina or a small regeneration boost. Cannot be used consecutively.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔄 Permanent Progression:</strong> Once this form is unlocked, the Majin's body permanently remains in this shape until they transform again. Multipliers only activate when surging power is called upon, but the form itself never disappears.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Must devour an immense source of energy, such as a corrupted artifact, lesser demon, or Makyo fragment. (Must be repeated per stage)</li></ul><ul><li>A display of unchecked indulgence—whether hunger, greed, or desire—that awakens the Bezalba strain within the Majin’s being.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⏳ Sluggish Form:</strong> Speed is reduced by 75% the Colossus trades mobility for overwhelming durability and strength.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Mental Instability:</strong> The Majin loses the ability to form words and reason clearly, behaving with the unpredictable mindset of a child.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🤝 Social Vulnerability:</strong> Lack of speech and reasoning makes communication and strategizing nearly impossible.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⏳ Stamina Strain:</strong> Prolonged use causes extreme fatigue, as the body constantly struggles to stabilize chaotic energy.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎲 Unpredictable Attacks:</strong> While attacks gain raw destructive potential, they lose fine control — precision techniques often misfire or scatter.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌪️ Environmental Backlash:</strong> Shockwaves, wind displacement, and flame eruptions can alter the battlefield unpredictably, potentially blocking movement or creating hazards for both enemies and allies.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 10x [Birth]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 50x [100,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Third Stage:</strong> 100x [500,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Fourth Stage:</strong> 400x [1,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Fifth Stage:</strong> 800x [5,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Sixth Stage:</strong> 2,000x [10,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Seventh Stage:</strong> 4,000x [20,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Eighth Stage:</strong> 10,000x [40,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1415228923943321672/1415381264839741490","messageId":"1415381264839741490","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Colossus  🌟 The Colossus is not a form willingly sought, but the dreadful result of a Majin’s unstable essence reaching its breaking point. Towering at an unfathomable height, this gargantu"},{"title":"Khaos Reaver 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://media0.giphy.com/media/v1.Y2lkPTc5MGI3NjExcWwzcGlrNTNmNDkzMnRtcGtlaDMxeGp2d2JiNDA3ZGVvZ2plcGtvayZlcD12MV9pbnRlcm5hbF9naWZfYnlfaWQmY3Q9Zw/1q2VHDC3G6q3kwLbY2/giphy.gif\">Khaos Reaver</a> 🌟</h1>The Khaos Reaver is the terrifying manifestation of a Majin’s chaotic potential, a permanent evolution that cannot be consciously chosen. Standing smaller than its prior Colossus form, the user’s body becomes compact yet unnervingly muscular, with crimson-red skin and piercing yellow eyes that radiate malice. Purple, jagged plating forms along their shoulders and torso, giving the appearance of living armor. A long, whip-like tail and clawed hands enhance their menace, allowing for brutal melee attacks. Every movement is deliberate yet unnerving, with a presence that seems to warp the environment subtly—shadows twist unnaturally in proximity to the Reaver. Its personality is cunning, sadistic, and playful, often taunting opponents with cruel delight while exploiting their mistakes.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Khaos Reaver ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🗡️ Malevolent Grip:</strong> Claws or tail attacks temporarily sap energy from the target, reducing their attack output by 15% for 2 turns if the strike lands successfully.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🟪 Mutated Barrier (Always Active):</strong> An inherent barrier of dark energy surrounds the Majin, reducing damage from all attacks by 3.75×, constantly reinforcing their defenses.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌑 Makyo Infusion:</strong> The Reaver can absorb ambient energy from areas or defeated foes, temporarily increasing raw damage output by 50% for 3 turns. Overuse causes minor feedback to stamina (5–10% HP loss).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧩 Fractured Form:</strong> The Reaver can split portions of its body into semi-independent segments (arms, tails, or horned protrusions) to attack from multiple angles simultaneously. Each segment has 25–40% of base damage and returns to the user afterward.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔄 Permanent Progression:</strong> Once this form is unlocked, the Majin's body permanently remains in this shape until they transform again. Multipliers only activate when surging power is called upon, but the form itself never disappears.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 100,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Must devour an immense source of energy, such as a corrupted artifact, lesser demon, or Makyo fragment.</li></ul><ul><li>The user must commit a prolonged, extreme act of indulgence, destruction, or cruelty during combat, fully embracing the sadistic aspect of the form.</li></ul><ul><li>Experience emotional turmoil, such as betrayal, rage, or grief, to trigger the full wrath of the form. (Must be repeated per stage)</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🧠 Mental Instability:</strong> The Majin loses the ability to form words and reason clearly, behaving with the unpredictable mindset of a child.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🤝 Social Vulnerability:</strong> Lack of speech and reasoning makes communication and strategizing nearly impossible.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⏳ Stamina Strain:</strong> Prolonged use causes extreme fatigue, as the body constantly struggles to stabilize chaotic energy.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎲 Unpredictable Attacks:</strong> While attacks gain raw destructive potential, they lose fine control — precision techniques often misfire or scatter.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 20,000x [100,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 30,000x [250,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Third Stage:</strong> 50,000x [500,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Fourth Stage:</strong> 75,000x [750,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1415228923943321672/1415381879468593212","messageId":"1415381879468593212","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Khaos Reaver  🌟 The Khaos Reaver is the terrifying manifestation of a Majin’s chaotic potential, a permanent evolution that cannot be consciously chosen. Standing smaller than its prior Col"},{"title":"Makyo Conqueror 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://tenor.com/view/super-janemba-black-janemba-janemba-black-super-janemba-black-black-super-janemba-gif-2648143652862326772\">Makyo Conqueror</a> 🌟</h1>The Makyo Conqueror is a monstrous embodiment of chaos and corruption given flesh. Its black-and-red body is massive, sinewy, and jagged, every movement distorting the battlefield beneath it. Limbs, claws, and tail lash unpredictably, each strike radiating sheer destructive intent. Unlike other Majin transformations, the Conqueror emits no external aura—its very form carries the weight of its malevolence, a living monument to indulgence, cruelty, and primal chaos. This form is not attained by choice; it erupts from overwhelming desire, rage, or sadistic instinct, granting the user unparalleled strength while forging a distinct, cunning personality that blends unpredictability with raw cunning.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Makyo Conqueror ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🗡️ Malevolent Grip:</strong> Claws or tail attacks temporarily sap energy from the target, reducing their attack output by 15% for 2 turns if the strike lands successfully.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🟪 Mutated Barrier (Always Active):</strong> An inherent barrier of dark energy surrounds the Majin, reducing damage from all attacks by 3.75×, constantly reinforcing their defenses.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌑 Makyo Infusion:</strong> The Majin an absorb ambient energy from areas or defeated foes, temporarily increasing raw damage output by 50% for 3 turns. Overuse causes minor feedback to stamina (5–10% HP loss).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧩 Fractured Form:</strong> The Majin split portions of its body into semi-independent segments (arms, tails, or horned protrusions) to attack from multiple angles simultaneously. Each segment has 25–40% of base damage and returns to the user afterward.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔄 Permanent Progression:</strong> Once this form is unlocked, the Majin's body permanently remains in this shape until they transform again. Multipliers only activate when surging power is called upon, but the form itself never disappears.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of the Divine:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Divine Energy:</strong> The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns. Their ki undetectable to those without Divine Ki.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔒 God-Ki Barrier:</strong> Non-divine techniques below 70% of your current PL cannot interrupt your attacks while this form is active.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 1,000,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Must have awakened God/Divine Ki through training or divine ritual</li></ul><ul><li>Must devour an immense source of energy, such as a corrupted artifact, lesser demon, or Makyo fragment.</li></ul><ul><li>The user must commit a prolonged, extreme act of indulgence, destruction, or cruelty during combat, fully embracing the sadistic aspect of the form.</li></ul><ul><li>Experience emotional turmoil, such as betrayal, rage, or grief, to trigger the full wrath of the form. (Must be repeated per stage)</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🧠 Mental Instability:</strong> The Majin loses the ability to form words and reason clearly, behaving with the unpredictable mindset of a child.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🤝 Social Vulnerability:</strong> Lack of speech and reasoning makes communication and strategizing nearly impossible.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⏳ Stamina Strain:</strong> Prolonged use causes extreme fatigue, as the body constantly struggles to stabilize chaotic energy.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎲 Unpredictable Attacks:</strong> While attacks gain raw destructive potential, they lose fine control — precision techniques often misfire or scatter.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 100,000x [1,000,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 250,000x [3,000,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Third Stage:</strong> 500,000x [7,000,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1415228923943321672/1415392127395037246","messageId":"1415392127395037246","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Makyo Conqueror  🌟 The Makyo Conqueror is a monstrous embodiment of chaos and corruption given flesh. Its black-and-red body is massive, sinewy, and jagged, every movement distorting the ba"}],"notes":[],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1415228923943321672","imageOnly":false,"classification":"sparking"},{"name":"Devourer Path","kind":"branch","forms":[{"title":"🌑 Dark Factor 🌑","html":"<div><span><h1>🌑 <a href=\"https://i.makeagif.com/media/9-27-2020/VqU5Yh.gif\">Dark Factor</a> 🌑</h1>The Dark Factor manifests when a Majin’s will to endure surpasses the weight of their own inner corruption. The transformation cloaks the user in an unnerving stillness—like the moment before a storm breaks. Their body hardens with dense, shadow-like energy that clings tightly to their frame, rather than flaring outward like a normal aura. In the gif, the faint sparks dancing around the still, meditative stance reflect the quiet yet unshakable power being compressed within, as if the user is containing a divine flame inside a shell of darkness.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Dark Factor ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of the Divine:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Divine Energy:</strong> The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns. Their ki undetectable to those without Divine Ki.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🗡️ Stillness of Power:</strong> Energy output is compressed instead of flaring outward. This makes the user even harder to sense through Ki detection, allowing them to conceal their presence while maintaining immense strength.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>👊 Graviton Strikes:</strong> Every attack is weighted with a “suffocating pressure,” like the crushing pull of gravity. Strikes land heavier, not faster, forcing opponents to endure the sheer density of the user’s energy.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔮 Soul Binding:</strong> The user can anchor their Ki into weapons, ground, allowing the user to essentially have horcruxes.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔒 God-Ki Barrier:</strong> Non-divine techniques below 70% of your current PL cannot interrupt your attacks while this form is active.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 180,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Must have awakened God/Divine Ki through training or divine ritual</li></ul><ul><li>The user must undergo training in emotional restraint and inner balance (cannot trigger through rage, must also be repeated per stage).</li></ul><ul><li>The transformation requires a deep-seated drive — a mission, belief, or vow that the user refuses to abandon, even when all odds turn against them.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🧠 Mental Strain:</strong> The form constantly tests the user’s resolve; doubt or hesitation can weaken its stability mid-battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚖️ Moral Erosion:</strong> Prolonged reliance subtly shifts the user’s worldview, making it harder to distinguish necessity from obsession.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🩹 Recovery Lag:</strong> After exiting the transformation, the body endures an extended fatigue state, slowing recovery between battles.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 10,000x [180,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 14,000x [500,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1411773892585980048/1411775831122116700","messageId":"1411775831122116700","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌑  Dark Factor  🌑 The Dark Factor manifests when a Majin’s will to endure surpasses the weight of their own inner corruption. The transformation cloaks the user in an unnerving stillness—like"},{"title":"Supreme King Incarnate 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://i.makeagif.com/media/11-29-2023/El2Zj1.gif\">Supreme King Incarnate</a> 🌟</h1>When the Majin unleashes their Supreme King Incarnate form, their body undergoes a grotesque and awe-inspiring metamorphosis. Their flesh swells into a hulking mass of muscle and hardened ridges, almost as if their body is being reforged into living armor. Horns curl upward from their skull, jagged and crown-like, while their jaw distorts into a bestial maw bristling with predatory fangs. Their eyes glow with a piercing, feral hunger, radiating nothing but destruction and domination. Each step shakes the ground beneath them, and the aura they emit is suffocating—heavy, oppressive, and primal, as if the very essence of ruin has been given flesh. \n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Supreme King Incarnate ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🍖 Voracious Consumption:</strong> Successful melee strikes siphon 5% of the opponent’s stamina or ki reserves, feeding the user’s own pool. This effect cannot exceed 20% total per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>👺 Maw of Makyo:</strong> The user can attempt to “devour” projectiles or ki-based attacks directed at them. On a successful defense roll, the attack is absorbed and converted into a small temporary stat boost (+5% all stats for 1 turn).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⛓️ Parasitic Bond:</strong> The user can mark one opponent in battle. Against this target, their strikes deal 10% more damage, but they also become slightly tunnel-visioned, making them more vulnerable to other enemies.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌊 Shockwave Generation:</strong> Every physical strike releases concussive shockwaves, creating AoE damage and staggering nearby foes.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🪨 Colossal Presence:</strong> The extreme size and aura not only intimidate weaker opponents, but cause small-scale environmental effects like tremors and wind displacement with movements.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of the Divine:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Divine Energy:</strong> The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns. Their ki undetectable to those without Divine Ki.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔒 God-Ki Barrier:</strong> Non-divine techniques below 70% of your current PL cannot interrupt your attacks while this form is active.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 1,000,000,000.</li></ul><ul><li>Must endure a battle or ritual where the Majin faces starvation or suppression, forcing their hunger to mutate violently. (Must be repeated per stage)</li></ul><ul><li>A story-driven event where the Majin must “devour” a powerful foe’s energy or essence, or a large \"Celestial Being\" like a planet.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⏳ Stamina Drain:</strong> The form rapidly drains stamina the longer it’s maintained. Extended use can leave the user completely exhausted.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💢 Berserker Hunger:</strong> The user becomes increasingly unstable, often prioritizing feeding and destruction over strategy. Risk of losing control in long battles.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💔 Fragile Mind:</strong> Each use increases mental instability, making it harder to revert back or resist the urge to consume allies or surroundings.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 18,000x [1,000,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 22,000x [3,000,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1411773892585980048/1411785871316746330","messageId":"1411785871316746330","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Supreme King Incarnate  🌟 When the Majin unleashes their Supreme King Incarnate form, their body undergoes a grotesque and awe-inspiring metamorphosis. Their flesh swells into a hulking mas"},{"title":"World-Eater 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://media.tenor.com/LZtsmWYHBLgAAAAM/teq-demigra-demigra.gif\">World-Eater</a> 🌟</h1>The World-Eater form is the Majin’s full embrace of their unstable nature, warping their body into a monstrous display of unpredictable power. Their muscles swell and shift like living shadows, with jagged horns sprouting outward in twisted arcs, and their flesh pulsing with veins of dark, chaotic energy. The transformation grants them a form that never truly stabilizes—limbs flex and contort with unnatural strength, giving them an ever-changing and terrifying silhouette. Their eyes burn with a relentless, unnatural glow, embodying the unyielding hunger of chaos itself. Energy leaks off their form in erratic bursts, sparking and surging like a storm contained in flesh, making even their smallest movements feel volatile. In this state, the Majin becomes less a warrior and more a walking calamity—an engine of destruction whose strength lies not in control, but in the wild, relentless nature of their chaotic essence.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of World-Eater ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🍖 Devourer’s Maw:</strong> The user can absorb chunks of energy or matter from defeated foes to restore 10% HP or stamina once per battle. Energy absorbed from powerful foes strengthens the next attack by +25%.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>☄️ Celestial Consumption:</strong> After unlocking this form, the user’s Ki signature permanently shifts, reflecting the celestial body they absorbed. Once per combat, they can unleash a devastating “Eclipse Burst,” a condensed sphere of chaotic energy equal to 150% of their PL.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💢 Cataclysm Drive:</strong> Attacks carry unstable destructive force, causing collateral damage in the battlefield (terrain shatters, structures collapse). Enemies cannot “hide” behind environmental cover against these attacks.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⛓️ Endless Hunger:</strong> While active, stamina consumption is reduced by 20%, but every turn in this form increases the user’s risk of losing control at 100%.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 7,000,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Must endure a battle or ritual where the Majin faces starvation or suppression, forcing their hunger to mutate violently.</li></ul><ul><li>A story-driven event where the Majin must “devour” a powerful foe’s energy or essence, or a large \"Celestial Being\" like a planet from the Makyo Realm.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⏳ Berserk Risk:</strong> Each turn raises the Berserk Meter—if it maxes out, the user loses control and becomes indiscriminate, attacking friend and foe alike.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💥 Collateral Destruction:</strong> The form’s raw power makes precision impossible; allies may take splash damage in chaotic battles.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🩸 Soul Erosion:</strong> Each use chips away at the user’s identity and morality. Long-term reliance risks permanent mutation into an unthinking Devourer.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💫 Celestial Backlash:</strong> If the absorbed Makyo body’s energy destabilizes, the form immediately ends, leaving the user at the brink of death.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺  26,000x</strong></li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1411773892585980048/1415228600810209373","messageId":"1415228600810209373","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  World-Eater  🌟 The World-Eater form is the Majin’s full embrace of their unstable nature, warping their body into a monstrous display of unpredictable power. Their muscles swell and shift l"}],"notes":[],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1411773892585980048","imageOnly":false,"classification":"normal"},{"name":"Rebirth Path","kind":"branch","forms":[{"title":"Soul Renewal 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://tenor.com/view/uub-db-gif-9796203\">Soul Renewal</a> 🌟</h1>In the moment of true death, when the body should have vanished into nothing, the Majin's willpower proves too unshakable to fade away. Through sheer force of spirit, they are reborn—shedding much of their chaotic essence and emerging in a body tied to a new race. Their skin tone, aura, and eyes take on a softer glow, carrying the faint but unshakable reminder of their Majin origins. While most of their old powers are lost, what remains is refined into something purer: a vessel of willpower, rage, and determination. This form symbolizes both redemption and unrelenting resolve, granting them a chance to live anew.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Soul Renewal ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🌌 Reincarnation:</strong> The Majin is reborn into their chosen race, gaining access to that race’s natural abilities and transformations (limited—see below).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💢 Majin's Rage:</strong> Retains the chaotic Rage Boost unique to the Majin , fueling greater power in battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔮 Magic Immunity:</strong> Retains near-complete immunity to magical abilities, resisting spells and enchantments with ease.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Divine Energy:</strong> The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns. Their ki undetectable to those without Divine Ki. <span>(If acquired before death)</span></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔒 God-Ki Barrier:</strong> Non-divine techniques below 70% of your current PL cannot interrupt your attacks while this form is active. <span>(If the user has God/Divine Ki)</span></li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Must die in battle or through roleplay event.</li></ul><ul><li>Be reincarnated as a chosen race (determined by player).</li></ul><ul><li>Strong willpower and refusal to give in to death are required to awaken this form.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>😠 Irritability:</strong> The reborn Majin becomes unstable in battle, losing control after 10 turns.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⛔ Limited Transformations:</strong> Only the first 3 transformations of the new race are available (giant/unique racial forms excluded).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🩸 Weakened Regeneration:</strong> Immortality remains, but it is dulled to near-humanoid levels, noticeable only in small healing over time.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 Permanent Base Boost:</strong> 10x</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1270237628452573227/1411778588251787395","messageId":"1411778588251787395","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Soul Renewal  🌟 In the moment of true death, when the body should have vanished into nothing, the Majin's willpower proves too unshakable to fade away. Through sheer force of spirit, they a"},{"title":"Corruption 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://preview.redd.it/narahk-the-first-narak-namekian-my-cac-v0-n1s9imy1khjf1.jpg?width=1080&amp;crop=smart&amp;auto=webp&amp;s=b5f2713b826ac49ab2f0011331cd3b4d186af585\">Corruption</a> 🌟</h1>A twisted inversion of the Majin's spirit, this form emerges when overwhelming negativity consumes the user’s essence. The Majin's body becomes leaner yet more menacing, their aura shifting into a turbulent storm of shadowed energy laced with chaotic light. Their features sharpen unnaturally, eyes glowing with a void-like intensity that reflects the collapse of their former self. This is not just transformation—it’s a rebirth into something corrupted and monstrous, a being defined by what they were not meant to be.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Corruption ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>✨ Immunity to Magic:</strong> All hostile magical effects and curses fail to bind or debilitate the user.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💀 Inverse Spirit:</strong> Personality is flipped (good becomes cruel, evil becomes merciful in twisted ways).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of the Majin:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Divine Energy:</strong> The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns. Their ki undetectable to those without Divine Ki. <span>(If the user has God/Divine Ki)</span></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔒 God-Ki Barrier:</strong> Non-divine techniques below 70% of your current PL cannot interrupt your attacks while this form is active. <span>(If the user has God/Divine Ki)</span></li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 100,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Triggered by intense negative emotions I.E: hatred, despair, betrayal. (Must be repeated per stage </li></ul><ul><li>Survive a life-or-death battle where defeat feels inevitable.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🧠 Loss of Self:</strong> The user’s identity is inverted; their sense of morality and intent may shift permanently.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⏳ Instability:</strong> Difficult to maintain composure; prolonged use risks collapse or berserk loss of control.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>❤️ Isolation:</strong> Bonds with allies weaken, as the corrupted energy makes cooperation nearly impossible.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 20,000x [100,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 30,000x [250,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Third Stage:</strong> 50,000x [500,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Fourth Stage:</strong> 75,000x [750,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1270237628452573227/1411779616682545322","messageId":"1411779616682545322","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Corruption  🌟 A twisted inversion of the Majin's spirit, this form emerges when overwhelming negativity consumes the user’s essence. The Majin's body becomes leaner yet more menacing, their"},{"title":"Essence Unbound 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://tenor.com/view/demigra-dragon-ball-heroes-demigra-dragon-ball-heroes-dark-king-demigra-gif-4563363452840187854\">Essence Unbound</a> 🌟</h1>A low, otherworldly hum fills the air as the Majin sheds all traces of their fractured existence. The chaotic energy of corruption, once impossible to tame, now courses in harmony alongside their disciplined spirit. Their body sharpens into a perfected, balanced form — sleek yet radiant, with an aura that pulses in waves of shadowed violet and pure white. Every motion carries the paradox of serenity and fury intertwined, as if the universe itself is watching through them. Essence Unbound represents the true equilibrium of instinct and intellect, corruption and purity: a state where the Majin no longer battles with themselves, but instead wields both halves as one unstoppable truth.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Essence Unbound ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🌀 Balance of Essence:</strong> Grants immunity to all magic-based effects (curses, seals, debuffs) as the user’s body becomes a perfected vessel.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌌 Beyond the Gods!:</strong> The sheer pressure of your existence changes the battlefield. Enemies within range suffer a 20% reduction to accuracy and -10% speed, their bodies trembling under the crushing weight of your aura. At the same time, your strikes ignore 15% of enemy defenses, as if reality itself bends to your will. This effect cannot be dispelled and lasts as long as the form is active.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of the Majin:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Divine Energy:</strong> The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns. Their ki undetectable to those without Divine Ki. <span>(If the user has God/Divine Ki)</span></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔒 God-Ki Barrier:</strong> Non-divine techniques below 70% of your current PL cannot interrupt your attacks while this form is active. <span>(If the user has God/Divine Ki)</span></li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 1,000,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Be consumed by the Majin's destructive side at least five times, then wrestle it back into balance. (Must be repeated per stage)</li></ul><ul><li>Defeat an opponent wielding God/Divine Ki, proving worthiness of ascension.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⏳ Stamina Drain:</strong> Extended use beyond 15 turns severely fatigues the body, cutting multipliers by half until the fight ends.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎭 Dual Nature:</strong> The form suppresses corruption, but if forced past its turn limit, the Genie risks unraveling into a rampaging state for 3 turns (cannot be controlled).</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 100,000x [1,000,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 250,000x [3,000,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Third Stage:</strong> 500,000x [7,000,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1270237628452573227/1411780395258876005","messageId":"1411780395258876005","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Essence Unbound  🌟 A low, otherworldly hum fills the air as the Majin sheds all traces of their fractured existence. The chaotic energy of corruption, once impossible to tame, now courses i"}],"notes":[{"title":"Essence of the Majin 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://media1.giphy.com/media/v1.Y2lkPTc5MGI3NjExazJhczVtOXhwOTQwOGdpZGJ3ZnRnb2E2Ymp5N3hqMjhvdW15b3VkNyZlcD12MV9pbnRlcm5hbF9naWZfYnlfaWQmY3Q9Zw/XT8vvIP8ZPlF43TXXI/giphy.gif\">Essence of the Majin</a> 🌟</h1>The Essence of the Majin is the pivotal point of self-realization where past chaos and present humanity collide. No longer a creature of pure destruction, the Majin sheds the shell of their monstrous heritage, stepping into something far more fragile yet unshakably resolute: a being of willpower and purpose. A radiant white aura bursts forth, tinged with subtle streaks of purple and blue, wrapping the user in a glow that feels both divine and grounded. Their body stabilizes, muscles refined rather than swollen, their eyes burning with clarity. Yet, beneath this purity lies the fractured memory of the Majin they once were—an echo that threatens to claw its way back whenever emotions overflow. This form is a test of balance: redemption versus relapse.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Essence of the Majin ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>✨ Immunity to Magic:</strong> All hostile magical effects and curses fail to bind or debilitate the user.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of the Majin:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Divine Energy:</strong> The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns. Their ki undetectable to those without Divine Ki. <span>(If the user has God/Divine Ki)</span></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔒 God-Ki Barrier:</strong> Non-divine techniques below 70% of your current PL cannot interrupt your attacks while this form is active. <span>(If the user has God/Divine Ki)</span></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌀 Stable Soul:</strong> Energy expenditure is reduced by 20% compared to previous forms, reflecting the user’s greater control.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 100,000</li></ul><ul><li>Must experience a serious life-or-death battle after discovering your heritage. (Must be repeated per stage)</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>😡 Irritability:</strong> Emotional strain makes the user prone to anger, risking loss of control after 10 turns.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⏳ Temporary Stability:</strong> If overused, the form risks collapse, forcing the user into a weakened state for 1 turn afterward.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💔 Fractured Psyche:</strong> The echo of their former self occasionally influences behavior, creating hesitation or reckless choices in combat.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 50x [100,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 100x [500,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Third Stage:</strong> 400x [1,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Fourth Stage:</strong> 800x [5,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Fifth Stage:</strong> 2,000x [10,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Sixth Stage:</strong> 4,000x [20,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Seventh Stage:</strong> 10,000x [40,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1270237628452573227/1411778960190341242","messageId":"1411778960190341242"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1270237628452573227","imageOnly":false,"classification":"normal"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335292115588223078","formCount":12,"art":"assets/brand.png","sparkingNotes":["SPARKING! @Majin (Bezalba) Rage Boost: 5x Potential Boost: 25% Ki/Mana Reserves: 250%"]},{"name":"Maoian","slug":"maoian","accent":"#ffb38b","shade":"#a4537c","description":"The Maoians are a proud and regal race of feline and canine humanoids, hailing from the ancient and sun-scorched Planet Maoi. Their civilization thrives under a powerful monarchy, where the Pharaoh and their lineage are revered as…","about":[{"title":"🐆 The Maoian 🐆","html":"<div><span><h1>🐆 The Maoian 🐆</h1>The Maoians are a proud and regal race of feline and canine humanoids, hailing from the ancient and sun-scorched Planet Maoi. Their civilization thrives under a powerful monarchy, where the Pharaoh and their lineage are revered as divine rulers, embodying the essence of cosmic balance. These beings are known for their natural agility, keen instincts, and deep-rooted ancestral connections that shape their formidable combat prowess and mystical presence. Both clans serve under Pharaoh Beroos, a Sphinxian of unparalleled power and celestial dominance, ruling with both benevolence and tyranny. Under his reign, Maoi thrives, yet its people live under an iron-clad philosophy: order, power, and destiny rule above all.\n<ul><li><strong>🏺 The Two Great Maoian Clans 🏺</strong></li></ul><ul><li>🦁 Sphinxians (Feline Maoians) – The graceful and calculating members of the Maoian race, resembling lions, tigers, panthers, and cheetahs. They are known for their immense agility, intellect, and combat precision, using their clawed strikes and acrobatic combat to outmaneuver foes.</li></ul><ul><li>🐺 Anubians (Canine Maoians) – The relentless and disciplined warriors of the Maoian race, resembling wolves, jackals, foxes, and wild dogs. They possess unmatched endurance, keen senses, and brutal efficiency, often excelling in pack tactics and relentless combat strategies.</li></ul># <s>--------------------------------------------------</s></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335293655652630619/1338730347361337418","messageId":"1338730347361337418"},{"title":"💪 Maoian Strengths 💪 💪 Enhanced Strength: Sphinxians and Anubians are physically gifted, allowing them to overwhelm opponents","html":"<div><span><ul><li><strong>💪 Maoian Strengths 💪</strong><ul><li><strong>💪 Enhanced Strength:</strong> Sphinxians and Anubians are physically gifted, allowing them to overwhelm opponents in raw power and endurance.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>👀 Heightened Senses:</strong> Maoians have ultra-sensitive eyesight, hearing, and smell, making them formidable hunters and warriors.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌌 Extreme Survivability:</strong> Due to their biological resilience, Maoians can endure harsh conditions, high gravity, and even temporary exposure to space.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Maoian Weaknesses ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>👾 Tail Sensitivity:</strong> If their tails are grabbed (unless trained), Maoians will momentarily lose focus and strength, leaving them vulnerable.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💧 Magical Aversion:</strong> Maoians are highly susceptible to Hydromancy, as water disrupts their fur’s insulating properties and weakens their Ki flow.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌙 Lunar Instinct:</strong> During full moons or intense celestial events, Maoians may lose control of their emotions, leading to reckless actions or uncontrollable battle instincts.</li></ul></li></ul># <s>--------------------------------------------------</s></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335293655652630619/1338730382333448302","messageId":"1338730382333448302"},{"title":"Maoian Abilities 💥 ✨ Ki Manipulation: As warriors attuned to energy, Maoians naturally harness Ki, using it for combat tech","html":"<div><span><ul><li><strong>💥 Maoian Abilities 💥</strong><ul><li><strong>✨ Ki Manipulation:</strong> As warriors attuned to energy, Maoians naturally harness Ki, using it for combat techniques, flight, and energy-based attacks.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Telepathic Bond:</strong> Maoian's can communicate telepathically with others, conveying thoughts, warnings, and emotions without speaking.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Predator’s Reflexes:</strong> Their heightened instincts allow them to sense approaching attacks and react faster than most species.</li></ul><ul><li><strong> ⚔️ Zenkai:</strong> When a Maoian's health drops below 15% and they survive, their body adapts and permanently increases their Power Level by 15%–120%, and a maximum of 3 Zenkais per saga/major arc. Non-lethal injuries do not trigger Zenkai, and immediate medical, magical, or technological healing caps the boost at 120%.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🌟 Special Ability 🌟 </strong><ul><li><strong>🔥 Eternal Legacy 🔥</strong></li></ul><ul><li>Maoian warriors inherit the strength of their ancestors, forging a spiritual link to their lineage in moments of great need. Activating Eternal Legacy – A fiery blue or purple aura engulfs the Maoian, as the voices of their forebears whisper in their mind.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Effects:</strong><ul><li>3.0x power boost for 4 turns (maintaining control requires focus).</li></ul><ul><li>Allows access to one forgotten technique of their ancestors (once per battle).</li></ul><ul><li>Weakens the user afterward, reducing speed and Ki reserves by 15% for 3 turns.</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul># <s>--------------------------------------------------</s></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335293655652630619/1338730419172147281","messageId":"1338730419172147281"},{"title":"Untitled section","html":"<div><span><ul><li><strong>📜 Starting Techniques / Caps and Boosts 📜</strong><ul><li><strong>🐱 Sphinxian Clan</strong></li></ul><ul><li>Flight (Support Technique)</li></ul><ul><li>Afterimage (Support Technique)</li></ul><ul><li>Ankh Beam (Medium Technique)</li></ul><ul><li>Crescent Talon (Super Technique)</li></ul><ul><li>Sand Mirage (Support Technique)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🐺 Anubian Clan</strong><ul><li>Flight (Support Technique)</li></ul><ul><li>Afterimage (Support Technique)</li></ul><ul><li>Jackal Pounce (Medium Technique)</li></ul><ul><li>Predator’s Scent (Support Technique)</li></ul><ul><li>Obelisk Slam (Super Technique)</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🐱 Sphinxian Clan</strong><ul><li><strong>🔥 Ultimate Technique:</strong> Sun Fang</li></ul><ul><li>A blinding flash of radiant Ki shaped like a blazing sun, searing foes and impairing vision.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚔️ Super Technique:</strong> Crescent Talon\n<ul><li>A graceful, arcing slash of concentrated Ki, striking enemies with precision from mid-range.</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🐺 Anubian Clan</strong><ul><li><strong>⚡ Ultimate Technique:</strong> Blood Fang Barrage</li></ul><ul><li>A relentless flurry of claw and fang strikes, each charged with Ki to shred through defenses.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Super Technique:</strong> Jackal Pounce\n<ul><li>A burst of speed to close the gap and deliver a bone-crushing blow to the opponent.</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul><h1><s>--------------------------------------------------</s></h1><ul><li><strong><span>@Maoian (Sphinxian)</span></strong><ul><li>Rage Boost: 10x</li></ul><ul><li>Potential Boost: 10%</li></ul><ul><li>Ki/Mana Reserves: 200%</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong><span>@Maoian (Anubian)</span></strong><ul><li>Rage Boost: 5x</li></ul><ul><li>Potential Boost: 12.5%</li></ul><ul><li>Ki/Mana Reserves: 220%</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335293655652630619/1338730492970795122","messageId":"1338730492970795122"},{"title":"After mastering this form, progress through your Clan-specific transformations.","html":"<div><span><code>After mastering this form, progress through your Clan-specific transformations.</code></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335293655652630619/1405962415006421064","messageId":"1405962415006421064"},{"title":"Quick Trip","html":"<div><span><h1>Quick Trip</h1><a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335293655652630619/1338730347361337418\">Racial Info</a></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335293655652630619/1413220784251469855","messageId":"1413220784251469855"}],"paths":[{"name":"Foundational forms","kind":"core","forms":[{"title":"Predator’s Prowess 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 Predator’s Prowess 🌟</h1>The Predator’s Awakening is the primal ignition of Maoian instinct — a feral surge of power born not from calm focus, but from rage, desperation, and the will to dominate. This first form fuses the raw swiftness once associated with the Sphinxian path and the heightened awareness of the Anubian path, resulting in a balanced yet untamed combat state. When triggered, the user’s aura flares violently, their movements becoming sharper and faster while every sense locks onto prey with unshakable clarity. This is the moment the predator steps out of the shadows — not perfect, but dangerous enough to turn the tide of battle.\n<ul><li><strong>🦁 <a href=\"https://gifdb.com/images/high/dragon-ball-battle-of-gods-beerus-versus-goku-ybqm8123o8bp8152.gif\">Sphinxian</a> :</strong> The aura crackles in deep violet and black, rippling in jagged arcs. Facial features sharpen, muscles streamline, and the body takes on a sleeker, more aerodynamic frame. Eyes glow gold with streaks of violet energy coursing across the skin in faint, lightning-like patterns.</li><li><strong>🐺 <a href=\"https://tenor.com/view/bergamo-sparking-zero-dragon-ball-triangle-danger-beam-dragonball-gif-17764410401234393009\">Anubian</a> :</strong> The aura surges in vibrant gold or blue or red, burning hotter near the hands and feet. The frame becomes denser and more battle-ready, with defined muscle lines. Eyes blaze bright crimson or amber, or azure, and subtle energy flares trace up the arms like hunting marks.</li><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Predator’s Prowess ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🔮 Instinctive Flow:</strong> Drastically boosts reaction speed, allowing the user to act in sync with instinct rather than thought.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🐾 Predator’s Rush:</strong> Significantly increases movement and attack speed, making the user almost impossible to visually track.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>👁️ Keen Vigilance:</strong> Enhances all senses, enabling detection of concealed enemies, energy signatures, and incoming attacks from any direction.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🛡️ Guardian’s Resolve:</strong> Gains a temporary durability boost when protecting oneself or allies.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚔️ Adaptive Predator:</strong> The user’s movements and combat style naturally adjust mid-fight to counter an opponent’s tactics.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Triggered by intense rage or emotional stress during battle.</li></ul><ul><li>The first awakening often occurs after prolonged exhaustion, starvation, or injury — forcing the body to tap into primal reserves. (This must be repeated for each stage)</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🩹 Overdrive Strain:</strong> The sudden explosive movements place immense stress on muscle fibers and tendons, leading to temporary loss of speed or agility once the form is released.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔋 Metabolic Burnout:</strong> The body’s energy reserves are rapidly consumed, leaving the user fatigued even if attacks are precise and controlled.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Target Lock Fixation:</strong> The heightened predatory focus can cause the user to miss peripheral dangers or secondary threats while locked on to their prey.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 Stage 1:</strong> ×10 [Unlocked at Birth]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Stage 2:</strong> ×25 [250,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Stage 3:</strong> ×50 [3,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Stage 4:</strong> ×100 [12,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Stage 5:</strong> ×400 [50,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335293655652630619/1405962391832756355","messageId":"1405962391832756355","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟 Predator’s Prowess 🌟 The Predator’s Awakening is the primal ignition of Maoian instinct — a feral surge of power born not from calm focus, but from rage, desperation, and the will to dominat"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335293655652630619","notes":[],"classification":"foundational"},{"name":"Anubian Path","kind":"branch","forms":[{"title":"Predator's Instinct 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://i.pinimg.com/1200x/59/47/5c/59475c8a097d7e847e8692b0bda47644.jpg\">Predator's Instinct</a> 🌟</h1>Upon awakening, an Anubian’s primal instincts surge to the forefront, reshaping their body and mind. Muscles swell and pulse with raw, sinewy power; claws extend and sharpen, fangs gleam in the dimmest light. Their eyes blaze with a violet-gold glow, reflecting the hunter’s focus within. A crackling, untamed aura of violet and gold ripples across their form, shifting like living shadows that mirror their emotions. Every breath seems to draw in the very essence of the wild, granting them unparalleled awareness of their surroundings. Movements are fluid yet explosive, blending raw aggression with animalistic grace. The form embodies both predator and protector—unstoppable in offense, almost untouchable in perception, but always teetering on the edge of feral chaos.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Predator's Instinct ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🦴 Heightened Senses:</strong> Detect even subtle changes in the environment—movement, sounds, or ki signatures—allowing preemptive reactions to threats or prey.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💪 Predatory Strength:</strong> Physical attacks gain immense power, capable of breaking through most defenses. 2x Melee Damage</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🏃‍♂️ Enhanced Agility:</strong> Reflexes, speed, and evasive maneuvers are significantly improved, enabling acrobatic combat and flawless repositioning.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of the Divine:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Divine Energy:</strong> The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns. Their ki undetectable to those without Divine Ki.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔒 God-Ki Barrier:</strong> Non-divine techniques below 70% of your current PL cannot interrupt your attacks while this form is active.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 180,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Must have awakened God/Divine Ki through training or divine ritual</li></ul><ul><li>Survive intense wilderness trials, mastering harsh environments and predatory instincts (This must be repeated for each stage)</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🐺 Feral Overdrive:</strong> Instincts can override rational thought, potentially causing uncontrollable rage or reckless behavior.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⏳ Energy Maintenance:</strong> Prolonged use drains stamina faster than normal due to the strain of sustaining Divine Ki.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌀 Sensory Overload:</strong> Heightened senses can overwhelm the mind, leading to distraction or hesitation if focus lapses.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 10,000x [180,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 14,000x [500,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1405962617209622638/1406304228690886817","messageId":"1406304228690886817","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Predator's Instinct  🌟 Upon awakening, an Anubian’s primal instincts surge to the forefront, reshaping their body and mind. Muscles swell and pulse with raw, sinewy power; claws extend and"},{"title":"Savage Dominion 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://i.pinimg.com/1200x/2d/9f/3b/2d9f3bc531dba6a532138b0d85ba4e9c.jpg\">Savage Dominion</a> 🌟</h1>Savage Dominion is a form where raw primal energy and refined cunning merge. Their body becomes even more muscular and defined, veins coursing with visible divine energy. A dark, stormy aura ripples across their form, crackling with violet-gold sparks that mirror their predatory focus. Their claws elongate and sharpen further, fangs glint dangerously, and piercing eyes radiate authority over both nature and foes. In this state, the Anubian moves with terrifying fluidity, blending brute force, divine speed, and tactical cunning. The aura exudes dominance; even weaker creatures instinctively sense the predator within, halting before the Anubian strikes.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Savage Dominion ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🦴 Unyielding Durability:</strong> Body becomes highly resilient; natural healing accelerates and physical punishment is far less debilitating. (Damage taken is halved)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌪️ Dominion Over Nature:</strong> Can call upon wild beasts to aid them in combat or tracking</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Savage Intellect:</strong> Primal instincts are balanced with tactical cunning; excels at environmental combat and predicting opponents’ moves.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>😱 Terrifying Presence:</strong> Aura and demeanor instill fear in enemies; weaker opponents may hesitate or flee before engagement.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of the Divine:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Divine Energy:</strong> The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns. Their ki undetectable to those without Divine Ki.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔒 God-Ki Barrier:</strong> Non-divine techniques below 70% of your current PL cannot interrupt your attacks while this form is active.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 1,000,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Conquer a legendary beast in single combat, proving dominance over the wild and earning nature’s respect (This must be repeated for each stage)</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🐺 Hunting Urge:</strong> Constant need to hunt and dominate can disrupt peaceful interactions and focus.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⏳ Energy Maintenance:</strong> Maintaining full form for extended periods drains stamina more rapidly.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌀 Sensory Overload:</strong> Heightened awareness can overwhelm the mind if focus slips.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Rage Risk:</strong> Intense combat can push the form toward uncontrollable feral aggression, making strategic control difficult.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 18,000x [1,000,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 22,000x [3,000,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1405962617209622638/1406304235598909621","messageId":"1406304235598909621","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Savage Dominion  🌟 Savage Dominion is a form where raw primal energy and refined cunning merge. Their body becomes even more muscular and defined, veins coursing with visible divine energy."},{"title":"Predator's Dominion 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://i.pinimg.com/1200x/ad/2e/09/ad2e09b0c8e4fcbbceb1515be67f2d0d.jpg\">Predator's Dominion</a> 🌟</h1>Upon completing the ritual of ascension and embracing the pure essence of the wild, the Anubian attains Predator's Dominion. Their form reaches an almost terrifying perfection: muscles ripple with unparalleled strength, claws and fangs are honed to lethal precision, and eyes glow with a predatory intensity that commands reverence and fear. A swirling aura of violet-gold energy encases their body, crackling with raw instinctual power and pulsating like the heartbeat of the wild itself. Movement becomes instantaneous and fluid, blending devastating strikes with unmatched agility. This form exudes an aura of dominance over all life, establishing the seeker as the ultimate predator—ruler of both battlefield and wilderness.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Predator's Dominion ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🦴 Ultimate Physical Prowess:</strong> Strength, speed, and agility surpass all previous forms; capable of obliterating terrain and overwhelming multiple foes simultaneously.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌿 Primal Command:</strong> Full control over nature—plants, animals, enabling battlefield manipulation on a massive scale.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of the Divine:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Divine Energy:</strong> The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns. Their ki undetectable to those without Divine Ki.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔒 God-Ki Barrier:</strong> Non-divine techniques below 70% of your current PL cannot interrupt your attacks while this form is active.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 7,000,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Complete the Ritual of Ascension, fully embracing the essence of the wild</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🐺 Overwhelming Instincts:</strong> Pure instinct can override rational thought, risking loss of self-identity.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⏳ Sustained Energy Drain:</strong> Maintaining this form for extended periods is extremely taxing on stamina.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌀 Sensory Overload:</strong> Extreme awareness can disorient or distract if focus lapses.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Permanent Transformation Risk:</strong> Prolonged use may irreversibly shift the user into a being of pure instinct, losing former personality traits.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 26,000</strong></li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1405962617209622638/1406305606218027130","messageId":"1406305606218027130","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Predator's Dominion  🌟 Upon completing the ritual of ascension and embracing the pure essence of the wild, the Anubian attains Predator's Dominion. Their form reaches an almost terrifying p"}],"notes":[],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1405962617209622638","imageOnly":false,"classification":"normal"},{"name":"Sphinxian Path","kind":"branch","forms":[{"title":"Instinct Fracture 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://i.makeagif.com/media/8-02-2022/vvbzdk.gif\">Instinct Fracture</a> 🌟</h1>When a Sphinxian achieves this state, their body becomes enveloped in a faint, shimmering radiance that dances like moonlight over water. The aura pulses with quiet intensity, radiating both mystery and wisdom, while their eyes glow faintly as if gazing into truths beyond mortal comprehension. Unlike other forms born of raw rage or brute force, Eidolic Ascension is a razor’s edge of control — the user must maintain unwavering mental clarity, for even the smallest lapse collapses the transformation’s balance. It is not only a power-up, but an evolution of presence: a state where intellect and instinct harmonize, making the Maoian seem less like a warrior and more like an omen of inevitability.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Instinct Fracture ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🔮 Mystic Veil:</strong> A protective aura subtly bends energy around the user, deflecting weaker blasts and clouding illusions, giving the impression of untouchable grace.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Wisdom Infusion:</strong> Heightened awareness sharpens the user’s perception, allowing them to anticipate counters and predict patterns with surgical precision.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of the Divine:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Divine Energy:</strong> The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns. Their ki undetectable to those without Divine Ki.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔒 God-Ki Barrier:</strong> Non-divine techniques below 70% of your current PL cannot interrupt your attacks while this form is active.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 180,000,000.</li></ul><ul><li>Must have awakened God/Divine Ki through training or divine ritual</li></ul><ul><li>Completion of an esoteric ritual: prolonged meditation and mental conditioning to forge the stability needed for this razor’s edge form. (This must be done per stage)</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🧠 Mental Strain:</strong> The precision required taxes the mind heavily, leading to exhaustion or lapses in focus if prolonged.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>✨ Aura Fragility</strong> Though protective, the Mystic Veil only shields against weaker blasts or illusions; overwhelming force easily shatters it.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌀 Cognitive Overload</strong> Over-processing possibilities and predictions can cause the user to hesitate if too many inputs overwhelm their focus.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 10,000x [180,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 14,000x [500,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1405962690429718758/1406293253178785792","messageId":"1406293253178785792","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Instinct Fracture  🌟 When a Sphinxian achieves this state, their body becomes enveloped in a faint, shimmering radiance that dances like moonlight over water. The aura pulses with quiet int"},{"title":"Prowler's Drive 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://media.tenor.com/qru6zWAA_S4AAAAM/lord-beerus-shout.gif\">Prowler's Drive</a> 🌟</h1>This form represents the razor’s edge of mortal capability—an evolution born not of divinity, but of willpower, rage, and discipline. Upon transformation, the user’s aura erupts in radiant streams of gold and violet, shimmering like unstable flames as raw energy pulses outward. Their physique sharpens into a refined, predator-like stature, with eyes glowing intensely as if burning from within. Unlike forms of divine grace, this state is volatile and primal—an embodiment of the Maoian drive to surpass limitation, harnessing inner fury to breach new heights of strength.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Prowler's Drive ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of the Divine:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Divine Energy:</strong> The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns. Their ki undetectable to those without Divine Ki.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💥 Shattering Pulse:</strong> Every 8 turns, unleash a concussive burst of energy that knocks back enemies and briefly stuns weaker opponents (stun lasts 1 turn, stronger foes resist but still take a quarter of the damage).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌀 Predator’s Flow:</strong> Increases user’s reaction speed and precision drastically. Gain advantage on dodging, making it easier to avoid incoming attacks.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>✨ Aura Overdrive:</strong> If stamina drops below 20%, the aura burns hotter, adding to their power by 50% until the form deactivates.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔒 God-Ki Barrier:</strong> Non-divine techniques below 70% of your current PL cannot interrupt your attacks while this form is active.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 1,000,000,000.</li></ul><ul><li>The user must endure a life-or-death battle where retreat is not an option, emerging victorious despite near-certain defeat. (This must be done per stage)</li></ul><ul><li>Transformation is only unlocked after experiencing a moment of overwhelming rage tied to loss, betrayal, or survival instinct.</li></ul><ul><li>Must have honed at least two advanced Maoian techniques to their peak, proving control over body and spirit before channeling this unstable power.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>💢 Unstable Aura:</strong> The overwhelming energy radiates outward uncontrollably, causing localized destruction and making stealth impossible.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Mental Strain:</strong> Maintaining the form requires razor-sharp concentration; lapses in control lead to temporary disorientation.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔋 Burnout Risk:</strong> Stamina burns at an accelerated rate, making prolonged battles taxing.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>😡 Volatile Rage:</strong> Prolonged usage amplifies aggression, making strategic restraint harder to maintain.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 18,000x [1,000,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 22,000x [3,000,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1405962690429718758/1406293261949079674","messageId":"1406293261949079674","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Prowler's Drive  🌟 This form represents the razor’s edge of mortal capability—an evolution born not of divinity, but of willpower, rage, and discipline. Upon transformation, the user’s aura"},{"title":"Eternal Prowler 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://i.pinimg.com/originals/9b/3c/4e/9b3c4ec29b143ef5a39a67b9afc2c685.gif\">Eternal Prowler</a> 🌟</h1>The Eternal Prowler is the culmination of the Sphinxian’s predatory evolution—where raw instinct and honed drive transcend mortality itself. Unlike the reckless ferocity of earlier stages, this form embodies patience, wisdom, and unrelenting resilience. The user’s physique sharpens, their aura radiates a deep, steady golden-violet glow, and ancient markings trace across their body, signifying the balance between instinct and enlightenment. In this state, the Sphinxian does not simply fight to kill—they fight to endure, moving with the composure of one who has hunted across centuries.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Eternal Prowler ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of the Divine:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Divine Energy:</strong> The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns. Their ki undetectable to those without Divine Ki.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>♾️ Timeless Vitality:</strong> Aging, disease, and fatigue no longer affect the user. They remain at their physical peak indefinitely, though damage can still harm or kill them.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🦁 Aura of Dominance:</strong> Their presence unsettles foes (slight -5% attack debuff to nearby enemies) while instilling courage and calm in allies (+5% defense buff to allies in range).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔒 God-Ki Barrier:</strong> Non-divine techniques below 70% of your current PL cannot interrupt your attacks while this form is active.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 7,000,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>User must be at least 400 years old, signifying long-lived wisdom and endurance.</li></ul><ul><li>Completion of a personal “Predator’s Trial” storyline (staff event/quest: surviving against overwhelming odds without fleeing).</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⏳ Psychological Toll:</strong> Near-immortality can cause detachment, loneliness, or apathy if not handled well.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔋 Stamina Drain:</strong> Extended combat beyond 15 turns causes a 10% stat drop each additional turn.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💔 Emotional Anchor:</strong> Losing a bonded ally/family member while in this form results in penalties (-20% damage dealt for 4 turns every transformation).</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li>🔺 26,000x</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1405962690429718758/1406295986694783071","messageId":"1406295986694783071","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Eternal Prowler  🌟 The Eternal Prowler is the culmination of the Sphinxian’s predatory evolution—where raw instinct and honed drive transcend mortality itself. Unlike the reckless ferocity"}],"notes":[],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1405962690429718758","imageOnly":false,"classification":"normal"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335293655652630619","formCount":7,"art":"assets/brand.png","sparkingNotes":[]},{"name":"Namekian","slug":"namekian","accent":"#79dcb0","shade":"#2a9b83","description":"The Namekians, a proud and ancient Majin subrace, are the spiritual protectors of Planet Namek. Rooted in deep mysticism, they are renowned for their natural affinity for magic, regeneration, and telepathic communication. Unlike t…","about":[{"title":"🌿 The Namekians 🌿","html":"<div><span><h1>🌿 The Namekians 🌿</h1>The Namekians, a proud and ancient Majin subrace, are the spiritual protectors of Planet Namek. Rooted in deep mysticism, they are renowned for their natural affinity for magic, regeneration, and telepathic communication. Unlike their Majin kin, the Namekians embraced harmony and chose to settle in the mortal realm rather than remain in the chaotic Makyo Realm.\n<ul><li><strong>🌌 Namekian Clans &amp; Lineages 🌌</strong></li></ul><em>The Namekian race is divided into three primary clans, each with distinct roles in society and combat:</em><ul><li><strong>🐉 Dragon Clan:</strong> The spiritual leaders of Namek, the Dragon Clan possess a deep connection to magic and are the only Namekians capable of creating Dragon Balls. They are revered as healers, scholars, and mystical guides, wielding unparalleled knowledge of the arcane.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚔️ Warrior Clan:</strong> The defenders of Namek, the Warrior Clan excels in combat and physical prowess. Their bodies are naturally built for battle, boasting superior strength and regenerative capabilities. Though they lack magical expertise, they make up for it with brute force and tactical mastery.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>😈 Demon Clan:</strong> The most feared of the Namekians, the Demon Clan carries dark energy mutations from their ancient Majin origins. While often misunderstood, not all Demon Clan members are evil—some seek redemption, while others embrace raw power and destruction. Their abilities include summoning offspring, magic detection, and unique mutations that set them apart.</li></ul><ul><li><strong> ✨ Precursor Path:</strong> Rare beyond measure, Precursor Namekians are individuals born carrying literal fragments of the First Supreme Demon King Zalama’s soul within their spirit. While many believe their existence to be myth—stories claiming one appears only once in millions of years—the truth is far more mysterious, as their birth is tied to unknown spiritual conditions unique to each individual. These Namekians appear completely normal for most of their lives, their true nature hidden even from themselves.</li></ul><h1><s>-----------------------------------------------------------</s></h1><h1>💪 Namekian Strengths: 💪</h1><ul><li>💪 Enhanced Strength: Namekians are naturally stronger than most beings, allowing them to overpower opponents with their raw might.</li><li>👀 Heightened Senses: Their enhanced hearing, vision, and smell allow them to track movement, detect energy, and react with near-instant reflexes.</li><li>🌌 Extreme Survivability: Namekians can survive in space without oxygen and endure extreme environmental conditions that would destroy lesser beings.</li></ul><h1>⚠️ Namekian Weaknesses: ⚠️</h1><ul><li>🪨 Magical Aversion: Namekians are especially weak to earth-based magic, making them susceptible to Lithomancers and Terramancers.</li><li>🔊 Sound Sensitivity: Their ultra-sensitive hearing makes them extremely vulnerable to high-pitched sounds and sonic attacks.</li></ul># <s>-----------------------------------------------------------</s></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335293758685839380/1339033286051106818","messageId":"1339033286051106818"},{"title":"Namekian Abilities: 💥","html":"<div><span><h1>💥 Namekian Abilities: 💥</h1><ul><li>✨ Ki Manipulation: Namekians possess an innate ability to control Ki, allowing them to fly, enhance their strikes, and fire powerful energy attacks.</li><li>🩹 Regeneration: Capable of rapid healing and limb regeneration, Namekians can recover from severe wounds in 5 turns (15% energy drain per full heal).</li><li>🧠Telepathy: All Namekians can communicate through thoughts, share visions, and sense distant allies without physical speech.</li><li><strong>🌀 Precursor Namekian</strong><ul><li>🔮 <strong>Dragon Resonance:</strong> Precursor Namekians possess a spiritual connection to Dragon Ball energy. They can faintly sense the presence of Dragon Balls within a reasonable distance, feeling a subtle pull toward their location. However, when near the specific Dragon Ball they are spiritually bound to, the sensation becomes unmistakable—like a sudden “click” within their spirit that confirms the bond between them.</li></ul></li></ul><h1>🌟 Special Abilities: 🌟</h1><ul><li><strong>🐉 Dragon Clan</strong><ul><li><strong>📖 Advanced Magic Affinity:</strong> Dragon Clan Namekians have the ability to learn magics much faster than other races, as well as being able to start with advanced level magic</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌱 Healing Touch:</strong> Dragon Clan Namekians can harness their magical abilities to heal injuries and ailments, serving as valuable support healers in battles.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚔️ Warrior Clan</strong><ul><li><strong>🥊 Mystic Fist:</strong> Members of the Warrior Clan can channel their energy into their fists, enhancing the power of their physical attacks, such as punches and strikes.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Warrior’s Call:</strong> When a Warrior Clan Namekian utters a chant in their language, it boosts the strength and determination of all nearby friends and allies, providing a 1.5x power multiplier for a duration of 8 turns. This ability enhances their teamwork and combat effectiveness in the heat of battle.</li></ul></li><li><strong>😈 Demon Clan</strong><ul><li><strong>🧬 Mutated Birthing:</strong> Demon Clan Namekians possess the unique ability to birth mutated versions of Namekians without any loss of their own power. These mutated offspring may have altered physical traits or abilities, adding a level of unpredictability to their clan.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔮 Magical Presence Sense:</strong> Members of the Demon Clan can sense magical energies and presences on an extreme level, making them adept at detecting magical phenomena and identifying magic users.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🌀 Precursor Namekian</strong><ul><li><strong>✨ Dragon’s Covenant:</strong> A Precursor Namekian is spiritually bound to a specific Dragon Ball. When physically holding the Dragon Ball they resonate with, they may invoke its power to grant <strong>one minor wish per month</strong>. The wish must remain within the limitations of the Eternal Dragon tied to that Dragon Ball set and cannot exceed the scale of lesser Dragon Ball wishes. Universal, god-tier, or reality-breaking wishes are not possible through this ability.</li></ul></li></ul># <s>-----------------------------------------------------------</s></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335293758685839380/1339033658220085258","messageId":"1339033658220085258"},{"title":"📜 Starting Techniques / Caps and Boosts 📜","html":"<div><span><h1>📜 Starting Techniques / Caps and Boosts 📜</h1><ul><li>Flight (Support Technique)</li><li>Afterimage (Support Technique)</li><li>Regenerative Immortality (Support Technique)</li><li>Makkankosappo (Ultimate Technique) </li><li>Mystic Flash (Super Technique)</li><li>Hellzone Grenade (Super Technique)</li><li><strong>👑 Prince/Princess Class</strong><ul><li>🔥 Ultimate Technique:  Elder’s Judgment</li></ul><ul><li>Channels ancient Namekian energy into a single, devastating beam that purges all evil within its path.</li></ul><ul><li>🌟 Super Technique: Divine Rejuvenation\n<ul><li>Instantly heals all allies within range, restoring HP, stamina, and removing minor curses or poisons.</li></ul></li></ul></li><li><strong>⚔️ Warlord Class</strong><ul><li>🔥 Ultimate Technique: Dragon Fist</li></ul><ul><li>A massive energy-infused punch in the shape of a golden dragon that explodes on impact.</li></ul><ul><li>🌟 Super Technique: Blitz Barrage\n<ul><li>A furious melee combo, enhanced by Ki, that breaks through defenses.</li></ul></li></ul></li><li><strong>🌀 Precursor Namekians (SPARKING!!)</strong><ul><li>🔥 <strong>Ultimate Technique: Wrath of the Eternal Dragon</strong></li></ul><ul><li>The Precursor channels the ancient energy of the Eternal Dragon they resonate with, causing their aura to erupt with draconic power. For <strong>3 turns</strong>, their combat effectiveness is greatly amplified, doubling the power of their physical attacks and techniques as faint draconic traits manifest across their body.</li></ul><ul><li>🌟 <strong>Super Technique: Draconic Pulse</strong><ul><li>The Precursor releases a burst of dragon-infused energy from their body, creating a powerful shockwave that blasts outward.</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul><h1><s>-----------------------------------------------------------</s></h1><ul><li><strong><span>@Namekian (Demon Clan)</span></strong><ul><li>Rage Boost: 2x</li></ul><ul><li>Potential Boost: 12.5%</li></ul><ul><li>Ki/Mana Reserves: 125%</li></ul></li><li><strong><span>@Namekian (Dragon Clan)</span></strong><ul><li>Rage Boost: 1.4x</li></ul><ul><li>Potential Boost: 5%</li></ul><ul><li>Ki/Mana Reserves: 125%</li></ul></li><li><strong><span>@Namekian (Warrior Clan)</span></strong><ul><li>Rage Boost: 1.6x</li></ul><ul><li>Potential Boost: 7.5%</li></ul><ul><li>Ki/Mana Reserves: 125%</li></ul></li></ul><span><strong><code>SPARKING!</code></strong></span><ul><li><strong><span>@Namekian (Berserker)</span></strong></li></ul><ul><li>Rage Boost: 3.5x (+40% every 8 posts)</li></ul><ul><li>Potential Boost: 25%\n<ul><li>Ki/Mana Reserves: 125%</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335293758685839380/1339035396238999665","messageId":"1339035396238999665"},{"title":"After mastering this form, progress through your Clan-specific transformations first. Once those are completed, continue adva","html":"<div><span><code>After mastering this form, progress through your Clan-specific transformations first. Once those are completed, continue advancing from this point.</code></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335293758685839380/1430277082436337734","messageId":"1430277082436337734"}],"paths":[{"name":"Foundational forms","kind":"core","forms":[{"title":"Colossal Namek 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://media.tenor.com/CiPs0zi2jkoAAAAd/piccolo-dragon-ball.gif\">Colossal Namek</a> 🌟</h1>The user undergoes a dramatic enlargement in size and presence as their body expands into towering proportions. Their limbs lengthen, muscles swell with densely compressed ki, and their skin deepens in hue while their eyes blaze with renewed intensity.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Colossal Namek ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌊 Shockwave Generation:</strong> Every physical strike releases concussive shockwaves, creating an additional 10% AoE damage and staggering nearby foes.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⛰️ Titanic Bulk:</strong> The Namekian's body becomes impossibly durable, shrugging off most physical and energy attacks. Physical damage taken is reduced by 20%, but agility-based maneuvers become harder to execute.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌊 Colossal Presence:</strong> The extreme size and aura not only intimidate weaker opponents, but cause small-scale environmental effects like tremors and wind displacement with movements.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Be born</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⏳ Energy Drain:</strong> Maintaining this colossal form drains stamina by 10% per turn.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🐢 Reduced Agility:</strong> The immense size decreases agility and evasion, making dodging more difficult.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💨 Size Restriction:</strong> Fighting in confined spaces (buildings, small arenas, spacecrafts) imposes heavy attack limitations due to size constraints.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 10x</strong></li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335293758685839380/1430272719638761563","messageId":"1430272719638761563","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Colossal Namek  🌟 The user undergoes a dramatic enlargement in size and presence as their body expands into towering proportions. Their limbs lengthen, muscles swell with densely compressed"},{"title":"Super Namekian 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://media.tenor.com/mGJVloBTg1cAAAAd/super-namekian-dbz.gif\">Super Namekian</a> 🌟</h1>When a Namekian reaches the absolute brink of their spiritual and physical limits, their body undergoes an evolutionary awakening — a state where their latent potential fuses into perfect harmony. The once gentle pulse of their ki becomes a roaring current of divine energy, their aura surging with an emerald inferno laced in threads of gold. Their musculature refines, their antennae glow faintly, and their voice resonates like an echo from the core of Planet Namek itself.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Super Namekian ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>⚡ Power Instability:</strong> The user’s aura lashes out uncontrollably, dealing 5% splash damage to all combatants within close range (ally or foe) each turn.</li></ul><ul><li><strong> 🌪️ Aura Suppression Breaker:</strong> Negates suppression or concealment effects from foes within 60% of the user’s PL in a radius of 30 meters, lasting 2 turns once revealed.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🗻 Colossal Force:</strong> The user’s strikes carry such raw energy that they ignore barriers and shields up to 20% PL strength.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌋 Battlefield Quake:</strong> Foes within 40m within 75% of the user’s PL suffer -15% damage to attacks.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧘 Controlled Flow:</strong> Reduces stamina drain by 50%, allowing extended battle without exhaustion.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Perfected Channeling:</strong> Ki techniques cost 25% less stamina/energy, reflecting complete mastery of output.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>👿 Demon Clan:</strong><ul><li><strong>😈 Dark Assimilation:</strong> Absorbs fragments of enemy ki from defeated foes (+5% PL boost for each defeated opponent in combat)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💀 Corruption Wave:</strong> Projects a wave that weakens enemy Ki Control by 20% for 2 turns</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⛓️ Soul Fracture:</strong> Once per fight, can disrupt an opponent’s concentration, negating one ability activation</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🐉 Dragon Clan:</strong><ul><li><strong>🎇 Mystic Restoration:</strong> Restore 20% Health or Ki of one ally once per battle</li></ul><ul><li><strong>✡️ Arcane Rebirth:</strong> Cast a shield that negates the next incoming attack below 50% user’s PL</li></ul><ul><li><strong>♾️ Ki Conduit:</strong> Energy used in combat gradually cycles back, restoring 5% Ki per turn</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚔️ Warrior Clan:</strong><ul><li><strong>⚔️ Battle Instinct:</strong> Reflexes heighten to match foes up to 3x user’s PL</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💪 Titanic Surge:</strong> Physical attacks gain 25% armor penetration</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Relentless Drive:</strong> Once Health drops below 25%, the user gains +30% Speed and +20% Defense for 3 turns</li></ul></li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 3,000,000.</li></ul><ul><li>Must experience severe emotional or spiritual conflict (Must be repeated per stage)</li></ul><ul><li>Must complete an intensive training ritual under extreme atmospheric or spiritual pressure</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⏳ Stamina Drain:</strong> While more stable than previous grades, the constant electrical output steadily exhausts the body. (50%)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Mental Strain:</strong> Requires high concentration to sustain; mental lapses can cause sudden reversion.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💤 Fatigue:</strong> After deactivation, user suffers reduced ki recovery for a short period due to the body’s overexertion.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 50x [3,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 100x [12,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335293758685839380/1430276966220828893","messageId":"1430276966220828893","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Super Namekian  🌟 When a Namekian reaches the absolute brink of their spiritual and physical limits, their body undergoes an evolutionary awakening — a state where their latent potential fu"},{"title":"Power Awakening 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://media.tenor.com/hXjSeBwSZR4AAAAC/piccolo.gif\">Power Awakening</a> 🌟</h1>Deep within the stillness of meditation, when the Namekian’s spirit touches the edge of something vast and unseen, a whisper from an ancient Dragon stirs within their soul. The air grows heavy, the earth trembles faintly, and a radiant gold aura begins to seep from their skin — flickering like dawn light breaking through storm clouds. Their muscles tighten, skin shimmering with a faint luminous tone as veins of power trace beneath the surface. The aura expands, pure and weighty, illuminating the surroundings in an otherworldly glow that hums with both life and authority. Each breath resonates with a force beyond comprehension, as if the planet itself acknowledges their rise.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Power Awakening ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>💥 Limitless Strength:</strong> Every 10 turns, the Namekian’s power level surges by +40%, reflecting their continuous growth in battle of inner potential.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💥 Overpowering Pressure:</strong> The user’s aura radiates crushing dominance. Enemies within 20 meters suffer -15% speed and -10% Ki efficiency as long as the form is maintained.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>✊ Ascendant Strikes:</strong> The form amplifies physical reinforcement; melee attacks bypass 10% of enemy defense, striking with condensed divine force.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌀 Limit Break Pulse:</strong> Once per battle, the user may surge their aura explosively, doubling their damage for 1 turn but draining 15% of total Health.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of the Divine:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Divine Energy:</strong> The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns. Their ki undetectable to those without Divine Ki.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔒 God-Ki Barrier:</strong> Non-divine techniques below 70% of your current PL cannot interrupt your attacks while this form is active.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔮 Racial Specific:</strong><ul><li><strong>😈 Demon Clan — Infernal Power:</strong> Manipulates flames born of demonic ki, wreathing attacks in fire that inflicts an additional 15% burn damage.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🐉 Dragon Clan — Ancient Magic:</strong> Channels ancient Namekian magic to control elements to mastery, allowing access to advanced level child magics</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚔️ Warrior Clan — Power Surge:</strong> When enraged, the user’s physical and ki attacks double in potency for 3 turns, delivering devastating, tide-turning blows.</li></ul></li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 1,000,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Must engage in battle against an opponent of equal power level, surviving and pushing beyond limits.</li></ul><ul><li>Must undergo relentless divine training, refining god ki to its absolute edge.</li></ul><ul><li>Complete 12 training sessions in another realm. (Second Stage)</li></ul><ul><li>The Riddle:\n<ul><li>“My scales are as hard as steel, my breath can melt stone, I am a creature of legend, my power well known, Gather the sacred orbs, and wish for more — But only the worthy ascend, forevermore.”</li></ul></li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⌛ Severe Stamina Drain:</strong> This form consumes 75% more stamina, making prolonged combat dangerous even for seasoned users.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💔 Cellular Strain:</strong> The condensed divine ki tears at the body; every 3 turns, the user loses 5% Health passively.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⛔ No Recovery:</strong> While active, natural healing and regeneration effects are nullified; the body is too overclocked to repair itself.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💀 Riddle Consequence:</strong> If the riddle is misinterpreted temporarily seals the user’s inner power for 2 weeks (IC).</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multiplier 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 18,000x [1,000,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 22,000x [3,000,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335293758685839380/1430608204584325241","messageId":"1430608204584325241","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Power Awakening  🌟 Deep within the stillness of meditation, when the Namekian’s spirit touches the edge of something vast and unseen, a whisper from an ancient Dragon stirs within their sou"},{"title":"User Chooses Name 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://media.tenor.com/76XVtp7SwKkAAAAd/orange-piccolo-shenlong.gif\">User Chooses Name</a> 🌟</h1>From the quiet depths of the Namekian’s spirit, a radiant blaze erupts — not divine, but ancient, echoing with a power older than the stars themselves. The transformation begins as a low hum, a vibration that ripples through the earth before exploding into a torrent of orange light that engulfs the body. The aura burns like molten fire, alive and heavy with purpose, radiating warmth that feels both familiar and unfathomable. Their form swells with unrestrained might; muscle and ki alike surge to impossible harmony. The orange energy coils around them in spiraling waves — like a living flame, or the breath of something vast and eternal. Those who witness it sense a presence behind the light, as if the Namekian isn’t transforming alone, but awakening something that has long slumbered within their blood. There is no name for this power. Only the chosen may claim it — those who have solved the riddle of strength itself and earned the favor of forces that watch from beyond the veil.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of <em><u>_</u></em> ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>💥 Limitless Strength:</strong> Every 10 turns, the Namekian’s power level surges by +80%, reflecting their continuous growth in battle of inner potential.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💥 Overpowering Pressure:</strong> The user’s aura radiates crushing dominance. Enemies within 20 meters suffer -15% speed and -10% Ki efficiency as long as the form is maintained.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>✊ Ascendant Strikes:</strong> The form amplifies physical reinforcement; melee attacks bypass 10% of enemy defense, striking with condensed divine force.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌀 Limit Break Pulse:</strong> Once per battle, the user may surge their aura explosively, doubling their damage for 1 turn but draining 15% of total Health.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of the Divine:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Divine Energy:</strong> The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns. Their ki undetectable to those without Divine Ki.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔒 God-Ki Barrier:</strong> Non-divine techniques below 70% of your current PL cannot interrupt your attacks while this form is active.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔮 Racial Specific:</strong><ul><li><strong>😈 Demon Clan — :</strong> </li></ul><ul><li><strong>🐉 Dragon Clan — :</strong> </li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚔️ Warrior Clan — :</strong> </li></ul></li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 7,000,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Must engage in battle against an opponent of equal power level, surviving and pushing beyond limits.</li></ul><ul><li>Complete 24 training sessions in another realm</li></ul><ul><li>The Riddle:\n<ul><li>“Born of seven, bound by light, Hidden in scales that gleam through night. Speak the wish, let flame be drawn, From ancient breath, your strength is born. Seek not greed, but balance true, For the beast decides if power finds you.”</li></ul></li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⛓️ Immense Stamina Demand:</strong> Though stabilizing over time, initial stamina cost is 60%, making early battles dangerous.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Ki Burnout:</strong> Overuse (20+ turns) causes divine ki collapse, halving multipliers until the fight ends.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⛔ No Recovery:</strong> While active, natural healing and regeneration effects are nullified; the body is too overclocked to repair itself.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💀 Riddle Consequence:</strong> If the riddle is misinterpreted temporarily seals the user’s inner power for 2 weeks (IC).</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multiplier 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 26,000x</strong></li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335293758685839380/1430609608954613861","messageId":"1430609608954613861","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  User Chooses Name  🌟 From the quiet depths of the Namekian’s spirit, a radiant blaze erupts — not divine, but ancient, echoing with a power older than the stars themselves. The transformati"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335293758685839380","notes":[],"classification":"foundational"},{"name":"Demon Clan","kind":"branch","forms":[{"title":"Demonic Potential 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://media.tenor.com/6V2q_kH2FAoAAAAC/red-eyed-namekian-dbz.gif\">Demonic Potential</a> 🌟</h1>When a Demon Clan Namekian abandons restraint and surrenders fully to the ancient corruption within their blood, their body undergoes a terrifying metamorphosis. Their once-green skin darkens into deep olive tones, veins pulse with molten red light and a fiery red aura erupts — flickering like demonic flame. Their eyes glow with malevolent energy, and their presence alone distorts the air, radiating suffocating dread. This transformation manifests the raw, chaotic force of the Demon Clan — a union of rage, pride, and the dark magic that flows through Namekian history.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Demonic Potential ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🔥 Dominion of Ruin:</strong> The user’s demonic ki manifests as a dense, blood-red aura that erodes the will of weaker beings. Each successful strike slightly drains the target’s stamina (–5% per turn for 3 turns, stackable twice) as their life force is suppressed under your aura’s dominance.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>👹 Sinborn Regeneration:</strong> Unlike typical healing, your regeneration becomes tainted and aggressive — flesh mends with dark ki, burning the wound closed. You recover 15% of total health every 3 turns, but each regeneration inflicts a brief pulse of dark energy around you, damaging nearby foes.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>😈 Malice Wave:</strong> Once every 5 turns, the user can release a concussive blast of crimson energy infused with their hatred — ignoring 20% of an enemy’s defense. The more emotional distress the user has suffered in-battle, the stronger the wave’s intensity (up to +40% damage).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>☠️ Demon’s Dominion:</strong> The aura’s demonic presence warps the battlefield, weakening nearby opponents’ Ki recovery by 25% and amplifying your Ki-based attacks in proportion to the number of enemies affected.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>✨ Ancestral Echo:</strong> The user subconsciously channels the essence of ancient Demon Clan warlords. For 2 turns upon activation, combat instincts sharpen beyond mortal limits — increasing attack damage by 30%. This can only occur once per transformation.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💥 Energy Overflow:</strong> Raw power leaks from the Namekian uncontrollably. Their ki-based attacks surge with destructive potency, dealing 2x their usual damage but making the Namekian more detectable to nearby threats.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>✨ Instinctive Savagery:</strong> Combat instincts heighten to a feral edge, granting faster reflexes, sharper counters, and improved threat detection.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 50,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Must experience complete emotional detachment — anger, sorrow, or loss that fractures the spirit’s purity</li></ul><ul><li>Must undergo the Rite of Corruption — a forbidden Demon Clan ritual that forces the user to face their inner darkness</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>💧 Severe Ki Drain:</strong> Loses 25% Energy per 10 turns due to uncontrolled demonic flux</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧨 Rage Overload:</strong> If pushed beyond 20 turns of continuous battle, the user risks entering a berserk state, attacking indiscriminately</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💔 Corruptive Strain:</strong> Extended use damages the user’s internal energy flow, halving regeneration efficiency post-transformation for 3 hours (RP cooldown)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>☯️ Purity Inhibition:</strong> While transformed, user cannot perform healing or supportive techniques — their ki becomes purely chaotic</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 400x</strong></li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1242335647193235518/1430385879045771417","messageId":"1430385879045771417","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Demonic Potential  🌟 When a Demon Clan Namekian abandons restraint and surrenders fully to the ancient corruption within their blood, their body undergoes a terrifying metamorphosis. Their"},{"title":"Red-Eyed Namekian 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://media.tenor.com/v0iMVNX2VsEAAAAd/neva-dragon-ball.gif\">Red-Eyed Namekian</a> 🌟 </h1>A Namekian who has fused demonic heritage with divine energy, transcending the mortal boundary of corruption and enlightenment alike. Their skin deepens into a darker shade of green, while their eyes glow a haunting crimson — burning with divine rage and unholy resolve. Their aura, once chaotic and raw, now flows with controlled infernal light — a refined storm of scarlet and gold energy that crackles like divine fire.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Red-Eyed Namekian ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🕊️ Divine Composure:</strong> Reduces incoming Ki damage by 40%. The user is also immune to fear, or similar morale-affecting effects, representing the serene calm of divine focus.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚔️ Godly Strikes:</strong> Physical and ki-based attacks bypass 10% of enemy defenses, cutting through mortal barriers with divine sharpness.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>✨ Godly Infusion:</strong> Mortal instincts merge with divine serenity. Techniques deal +25% damage while costing 15% less Ki, representing efficiency fused with ferocity.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Aura Manifestation:</strong> The aura’s divine flame can be concentrated outward. Once per battle, the user may release a burst that staggers enemies, lowering their damage by 10% for 2 turns.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of the Divine:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Divine Energy:</strong> The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns. Their ki undetectable to those without Divine Ki.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔒 God-Ki Barrier:</strong> Non-divine techniques below 70% of your current PL cannot interrupt your attacks while this form is active.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 180,000,000.</li></ul><ul><li>Must have awakened God/Divine Ki through training or divine ritual</li></ul><ul><li>Must prove oneself in battle against a foe who surpasses the limits of mortal strength.</li></ul><ul><li>Must train in another realm 6 times, forging control over divine and mortal ki. (Second Stage)</li></ul><ul><li>Must defeat an opponent wielding God/Divine Ki, proving worthiness to ascend.  (Second Stage)</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⌛ Adjustment Period:</strong> The user must spend 5 training sessions acclimating to godly ki. Until then, their output is capped at 50% strength. <span>(Once the namekian has completed the five trainings in the form, this is null)</span></li></ul><ul><li><strong>♻️ Mortal Drift:</strong> The Namekian risks subconsciously reverting to their mortal state, unaware of the shift, leading to sudden drops in efficiency. <span>(Once Mastered, this is null)</span></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔋 Fragile Vessel:</strong> While the form is efficient, the mortal body was not designed for godly ki. Any critical hit against the user inflicts +10% extra damage. <span>(Once Mastered, this is null)</span></li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 10,000x [180,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 14,000x [500,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1242335647193235518/1430387715719036992","messageId":"1430387715719036992","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Red-Eyed Namekian  🌟  A Namekian who has fused demonic heritage with divine energy, transcending the mortal boundary of corruption and enlightenment alike. Their skin deepens into a darker"}],"notes":[],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1242335647193235518","imageOnly":false,"classification":"normal"},{"name":"Dragon Clan","kind":"branch","forms":[{"title":"Dragon Potential 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://media.tenor.com/mByGn8SYNKMAAAAd/neva-dragon-ball.gif\">Dragon Potential</a> 🌟</h1>When a Dragon Clan Namekian reaches the height of their spiritual refinement, their inner energy begins to flow in perfect harmony with the world around them. A tranquil blue aura engulfs their form — smooth and fluid, like rippling water touched by moonlight. The air hums softly as waves of restorative energy radiate outward, embodying both serenity and strength.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Dragon Potential ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>💠 Flow of Creation:</strong> Energy moves in perfect rhythm within the user’s body. Ki regeneration increases by 20%, and healing-based techniques are 1.5x more effective.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌊 Spirit Convergence:</strong> The user can gather ambient spiritual energy over time — every 3 turns, gain a “Convergence Stack” that boosts Ki Efficiency by +5% (max 3 stacks). Consuming all stacks empowers the next Ki Technique by +50%.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔮 Mystic Pulse:</strong> The user emits a brief surge of magical force that temporarily reduces enemy Ki-based defense by 20% for 2 turns. Can only be used once every 4 turns.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>✨ Lifeweaver’s Touch:</strong> When healing themselves or an ally, there is a 25% chance to instantly restore an additional 10% of total HP. This effect also grants the target slight Ki recovery.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌌 Resonant Insight:</strong> Focused clarity grants the Namekian predictive awareness — a 15% increase to reaction speed and evasion against energy-based attacks.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌀 Soulflare Burst:</strong> Once per battle, the user can release a condensed wave of spiritual power that pushes back all nearby foes and restores 10% of total Ki and HP to the user and nearby allies.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 50,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Must have achieved deep spiritual focus through meditation or training with a Great Elder</li></ul><ul><li>Completion of the Ritual of Harmony, a spiritual test that aligns the Namekian’s soul with the creative flow of Namekian life energy</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>💧 Severe Ki Drain:</strong> Loses 25% Energy per 10 turns due to uncontrolled demonic flux</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧨 Cognitive Overload:</strong> If pushed beyond 20 turns of continuous battle, the user risks entering a comatose state, transforming into stone</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💔 Corruptive Strain:</strong> Extended use damages the user’s internal energy flow, halving regeneration efficiency post-transformation for 3 hours (RP cooldown)</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 400x</strong></li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1242335568390520832/1430391876871258195","messageId":"1430391876871258195","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Dragon Potential  🌟 When a Dragon Clan Namekian reaches the height of their spiritual refinement, their inner energy begins to flow in perfect harmony with the world around them. A tranquil"},{"title":"Blue-Eyed Namekian 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://media.tenor.com/v0iMVNX2VsEAAAAd/neva-dragon-ball.gif\">Blue-Eyed Namekian</a> 🌟 </h1>A Namekian who has fused dragon heritage with divine energy, transcending the mortal boundary of corruption and enlightenment alike. Their skin deepens into a darker shade of green, while their eyes glow a dazzling zure — burning with divine rage and resolve. Their aura, once chaotic and raw, now flows with controlled light — a refined storm of cobalt and gold energy that crackles like divine fire.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Yellow-Eyed Namekian ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🕊️ Divine Composure:</strong> Reduces incoming Ki damage by 40%. The user is also immune to fear, or similar morale-affecting effects, representing the serene calm of divine focus.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚔️ Godly Strikes:</strong> Physical and ki-based attacks bypass 10% of enemy defenses, cutting through mortal barriers with divine sharpness.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>✨ Godly Infusion:</strong> Mortal instincts merge with divine serenity. Techniques deal +25% damage while costing 15% less Ki, representing efficiency fused with ferocity.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Aura Manifestation:</strong> The aura’s divine flame can be concentrated outward. Once per battle, the user may release a burst that staggers enemies, lowering their damage by 10% for 2 turns.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of the Divine:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Divine Energy:</strong> The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns. Their ki undetectable to those without Divine Ki.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔒 God-Ki Barrier:</strong> Non-divine techniques below 70% of your current PL cannot interrupt your attacks while this form is active.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 180,000,000.</li></ul><ul><li>Must have awakened God/Divine Ki through training or divine ritual</li></ul><ul><li>Must prove oneself in battle against a foe who surpasses the limits of mortal strength.</li></ul><ul><li>Must train in another realm 6 times, forging control over divine and mortal ki. (Second Stage)</li></ul><ul><li>Must defeat an opponent wielding God/Divine Ki, proving worthiness to ascend.  (Second Stage)</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⌛ Adjustment Period:</strong> The user must spend 5 training sessions acclimating to godly ki. Until then, their output is capped at 50% strength. <span>(Once the namekian has completed the five trainings in the form, this is null)</span></li></ul><ul><li><strong>♻️ Mortal Drift:</strong> The Namekian risks subconsciously reverting to their mortal state, unaware of the shift, leading to sudden drops in efficiency. <span>(Once Mastered, this is null)</span></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔋 Fragile Vessel:</strong> While the form is efficient, the mortal body was not designed for godly ki. Any critical hit against the user inflicts +10% extra damage. <span>(Once Mastered, this is null)</span></li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 10,000x [180,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 14,000x [500,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1242335568390520832/1430392799215226890","messageId":"1430392799215226890","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Blue-Eyed Namekian  🌟  A Namekian who has fused dragon heritage with divine energy, transcending the mortal boundary of corruption and enlightenment alike. Their skin deepens into a darker"}],"notes":[],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1242335568390520832","imageOnly":false,"classification":"normal"},{"name":"Precursor Path","kind":"branch","forms":[{"title":"Draconic Ascension 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 Draconic Ascension 🌟</h1>As the Precursor Namekian adapts to the overwhelming energy radiating from the Dragon Ball embedded within them, their body begins to stabilize the once-violent power. The sphere now becomes visible at the center of their chest, glowing intensely as its energy courses through their entire body. Their physique grows even more imposing as muscles thicken and dense draconic horns emerge from their skull. The aura surrounding them becomes heavier and more structured, swirling like a raging storm of ancient energy. Though the power is still immense, the Namekian’s body now partially synchronizes with it, allowing them to wield the Dragon Ball’s energy with far greater control while still radiating a terrifying presence on the battlefield.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Draconic Ascension ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⛰️ Titanic Bulk:</strong> The Namekian's body becomes impossibly durable, shrugging off most physical and energy attacks. Physical damage taken is reduced by 10%, but agility-based maneuvers become harder to execute.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Energy Overflow:</strong> Raw power leaks from the user uncontrollably. Their ki-based attacks surge with destructive potency, dealing 3x their usual damage but making the Namekian more detectable to nearby threats.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Rage Overflow:</strong> Each time the user takes damage, their damage output rises by +10% for 2 turns, stacking up to +30%.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of the First:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💎 Core of Resonance:</strong> The Dragon Ball embedded within the Precursor’s chest continuously fuels their body, increasing overall stamina recovery and allowing them to maintain powerful techniques longer in combat.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 5,000,000.</li></ul><ul><li>Must endure an event of profound emotional or physical turmoil (such as betrayal, loss, or near-death) that pushes the Namekian past the brink of their limits.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🔋 Stamina Drain:</strong> Maintaining the transformation consumes vast amounts of energy, draining 50% stamina after regression.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Mental Strain:</strong> The raw intensity of the form strains the mind, making long-term focus difficult and encouraging reckless aggression.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🏋️ Body Stress:</strong> Prolonged use causes severe fatigue and muscular tearing, leaving the user weakened after the form ends.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 800x [5,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 2,000x [10,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Third Stage:</strong> 4,000x [20,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Fourth Stage:</strong> 10,000x [40,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1481452794593542205/1481730166249095218","messageId":"1481730166249095218","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟 Draconic Ascension 🌟 As the Precursor Namekian adapts to the overwhelming energy radiating from the Dragon Ball embedded within them, their body begins to stabilize the once-violent power. T"},{"title":"Fragment Awakening 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://tenor.com/view/dragon-ball-super-superhero-piccolo-gif-25026055\">Fragment Awakening</a> 🌟</h1>When the Precursor Namekian first synchronizes with the Dragon Ball embedded within their body, the dormant fragment of Zalama’s soul violently awakens. The energy radiating from the sphere floods through their entire body at once, causing their physique to swell with sudden density and power as their frame struggles to contain the surge. A storm of radiant energy erupts outward from the Namekian in violent waves, crackling and roaring around them like an uncontrolled tempest. Unlike later stages, the Precursor has almost no control over the power being released — their aura burns brightly and relentlessly, making suppression impossible as the Dragon Ball within them pours its energy into their body. In this state the Precursor is less a master of the power and more a living vessel barely containing the ancient force awakening inside them.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Fragment Awakening ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🌌 Radiant Pressure:</strong> The Dragon Ball embedded within the Precursor constantly radiates energy, increasing their raw attack power by 1.5×, but their ki cannot be suppressed while the form is active.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⛰️ Titanic Bulk:</strong> The Namekian's body becomes impossibly durable, shrugging off most physical and energy attacks. Physical damage taken is reduced by 10%, but agility-based maneuvers become harder to execute.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🛡️ Mutated Barrier:</strong> A volatile, instinctive energy field coats the Namekian’s body, born from their unstable fusion with the Dragon Ball power. The barrier reduces incoming Ki-based damage by 5% and automatically lashes out when struck, dealing retaliatory damage back to the attacker. However, maintaining it taxes the body — stamina drains 10% faster while active.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>The Precursor must possess and absorb the Dragon Ball they are spiritually bound to.</li></ul><ul><li>The Dragon Ball must successfully replicate within their body.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🌋 Energy Leakage:</strong> The Precursor cannot suppress their power while in this form, making them easily detectable to anyone capable of sensing energy.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔋 Stamina Drain:</strong> Maintaining Resonant Awakening drains 20% stamina per use.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🦴 Torment of Power:</strong> The unstable flow of Dragon Ball energy ravages the Namekian’s body, causing micro-tears in muscle and bone with each surge of power. After every 3 turns of continuous use, the user takes 5% self-inflicted damage from internal strain. This damage bypasses defenses and resistances, reflecting the toll of forcing primal energy into a humanoid frame.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Mental Strain:</strong> The overwhelming presence of the Dragon Ball’s energy makes sustained focus difficult, slightly reducing the precision of complex techniques.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 10x [Birth]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 50x [100,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Third Stage: </strong> 100x [500,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Fourth Stage:</strong> 400x [1,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1481452794593542205/1481901692634271894","messageId":"1481901692634271894","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Fragment Awakening  🌟 When the Precursor Namekian first synchronizes with the Dragon Ball embedded within their body, the dormant fragment of Zalama’s soul violently awakens. The energy rad"},{"title":"Zalama's Manifestation 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://media.tenor.com/76XVtp7SwKkAAAAd/orange-piccolo-shenlong.gif\">Zalama's Manifestation</a> 🌟</h1>As the Precursor Namekian pushes beyond the violent instability of Fragment Awakening, their body begins to adapt to the overwhelming power radiating from the Dragon Ball embedded deep within them. The raging storm of energy that once erupted uncontrollably now condenses into a heavier and far more oppressive aura that radiates outward in powerful waves. Their physique expands further as their body grows denser and stronger, while dense draconic horns emerge from their skull — the first physical signs of the mutation taking hold. Though the Dragon Ball’s energy still burns unseen within their chest, its presence is undeniable as it floods through their entire body. In this state the Precursor is no longer simply enduring the power awakening inside them — they have begun to harness it, wielding the fragment of Zalama’s essence with growing dominance.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Zalama's Manifestation ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⛰️ Titanic Bulk:</strong> The Namekian's body becomes impossibly durable, shrugging off most physical and energy attacks. Physical damage taken is reduced by 10%, but agility-based maneuvers become harder to execute.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Energy Overflow:</strong> Raw power leaks from the user uncontrollably. Their ki-based attacks surge with destructive potency, dealing 3x their usual damage but making the Namekian more detectable to nearby threats.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Rage Overflow:</strong> Each time the user takes damage, their damage output rises by +10% for 2 turns, stacking up to +30%.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of the First:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💎 Core of Resonance:</strong> The Dragon Ball embedded within the Precursor’s chest continuously fuels their body, increasing overall stamina recovery and allowing them to maintain powerful techniques longer in combat.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 5,000,000.</li></ul><ul><li>Must endure an event of profound emotional or physical turmoil (such as betrayal, loss, or near-death) that pushes the Namekian past the brink of their limits.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🔋 Stamina Drain:</strong> Maintaining the transformation consumes vast amounts of energy, draining 50% stamina after regression.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Mental Strain:</strong> The raw intensity of the form strains the mind, making long-term focus difficult and encouraging reckless aggression.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🏋️ Body Stress:</strong> Prolonged use causes severe fatigue and muscular tearing, leaving the user weakened after the form ends.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 800x [5,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 2,000x [10,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Third Stage:</strong> 4,000x [20,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Fourth Stage:</strong> 10,000x [40,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1481452794593542205/1481902786982580316","messageId":"1481902786982580316","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Zalama's Manifestation  🌟 As the Precursor Namekian pushes beyond the violent instability of Fragment Awakening, their body begins to adapt to the overwhelming power radiating from the Drag"},{"title":"Zalama’s Heart 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 Zalama’s Heart 🌟</h1>As the Precursor Namekian continues to synchronize with the fragment of Zalama’s soul within them, the immense power hidden within their body finally manifests outward. The replicated Dragon Ball embedded deep within their chest becomes visible beneath their skin, glowing like a radiant second heart as waves of ancient energy pulse outward from its surface. With the core now fully revealed, the mutation intensifies — their horns grow larger and more defined while hardened scales spread across their arms and shoulders. Their physique becomes even more imposing as the power flowing through their body condenses into a crushing aura that radiates outward in steady waves. The Dragon Ball within their chest beats with immense draconic energy, feeding their body with overwhelming power. In this state the Precursor has fully accepted the fragment of Zalama’s essence within them, standing as a living vessel for its ancient power as their presence alone begins to warp the battlefield around them.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Zalama’s Heart ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>💎 Manifest Core:</strong> The Dragon Ball embedded within the Precursor’s chest now acts as a stable power conduit, increasing the damage of all techniques by 1.25x.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌊 Core Pulses:</strong> Every 4 turns, the Dragon Ball core releases a pulse of energy that slightly weakens nearby enemies, reducing their attack output for 1 turn. This thunderous shockwave rattles enemies to their core, reducing opponents’ Ki efficiency by -60% for 2 turns as they struggle to control their own energy amidst the destabilizing resonance.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🛡️ Mutated Barrier: </strong>A volatile, instinctive energy field coats the user’s body, born from their unstable fusion with Dragon Ball power. The barrier reduces incoming Ki-based damage by 40% and automatically lashes out when struck, dealing retaliatory damage back to the attacker. However, maintaining it taxes the body — stamina drains 10% faster while active.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⛰️ Titanic Bulk:</strong> The Namekian's body becomes impossibly durable, shrugging off most physical and energy attacks. Physical damage taken is reduced by 40%, but agility-based maneuvers become harder to execute.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Berserker Momentum:</strong> Each turn the user remains active in the form, their damage output increases by +15%, stacking up to +60%. Resets if the user drops out of the form.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💥 Core Burst:</strong> Once per battle, the Precursor may force the Dragon Ball core to overcharge and release it in a violent explosion. This deals 70% of the user’s Power Level as AoE damage but inflicts 15% recoil damage and reduces stamina recovery by half for the next 2 turns.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 500,000,000.</li></ul><ul><li>Complete 15 training sessions in Zalama's Manifestation.</li></ul><ul><li>The transformation is triggered in the midst of overwhelming, survival-driven rage (battlefield near-death event or equivalent).</li></ul><ul><li>The replicated Dragon Ball within the body must fully manifest.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🔋 Severe Stamina Drain:</strong> Maintaining the form rapidly taxes the body, consuming 60% of stamina reserves.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧩 Unstable Power:</strong> The overwhelming surge can cause difficulty in controlling precision attacks.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⏳ Limited Duration:</strong> Extended use risks muscle collapse, exhaustion, or unconsciousness once the form ends. (5 turns)</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 50,000x [500,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 75,000x [750,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Third Stage:</strong> 100,000x [1,000,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1481452794593542205/1481918051321381076","messageId":"1481918051321381076","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟 Zalama’s Heart 🌟 As the Precursor Namekian continues to synchronize with the fragment of Zalama’s soul within them, the immense power hidden within their body finally manifests outward. The"},{"title":"Zalama's Incarnation 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 Zalama's Incarnation 🌟</h1>When the Precursor Namekian pushes beyond the power of Zalama’s Heart, the fragment of the First Supreme Demon King fully erupts through their body, transforming them into a terrifying draconic vessel. The Dragon Ball embedded in their chest burns like a blazing core of ancient power, its energy flooding every fiber of their being. Their body mutates dramatically as scales spread across their frame, their horns lengthen into massive draconic crests, and powerful wings erupt from their back. Their jaw sharpens into a monstrous maw filled with jagged fangs while long dragon tendrils extend from their head, swaying with the storm of energy radiating around them. Their already immense physique becomes even more imposing as their muscles swell with condensed power, their claws capable of tearing through both flesh and energy alike. The aura surrounding them becomes a catastrophic tempest of golden energy, crackling with violent arcs of power that distort the battlefield itself. In this state the Precursor is no longer simply channeling the fragment of Zalama — they have become its living incarnation, a draconic sovereign whose presence alone radiates overwhelming destruction.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Zalama's Incarnation ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>⚡ Lightning Blitz:</strong> Grants overwhelming bursts of speed, allowing the Saiyan to appear as a blur, striking multiple times before the opponent can react. (x3 to speed)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🗡️ Sovereign Strikes:</strong> Every blow channels more than muscle—it draws from raw life force. All melee and ki techniques deal +20% bonus damage, but each attack consumes +10% extra stamina, symbolizing the toll of forcing unnatural amounts of ki into every strike.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⛰️ Titanic Mutation:</strong> The draconic body becomes immensely durable. Physical damage taken is reduced by 80%, though agility-based maneuvers become slightly slower due to the creature’s immense mass.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Berserker Momentum:</strong> Each turn the user remains active in the form, their damage output increases by +15%, stacking up to +60%. Resets if the user drops out of the form.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💥 Solar-Cracking Burst:</strong> Once per battle, the Saiyan may overcharge their unstable aura and release it in a violent explosion. This deals 90% of the user’s Power Level as AoE damage but inflicts 30% recoil damage and reduces stamina recovery by half for the next 2 turns.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>☄️ Zalama's Voice:</strong> Once per battle, the Precursor unleashes a thunderous roar infused with draconic energy. Enemies within range suffer -60% Ki efficiency for 2 turns as their energy control destabilizes.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 3,000,000,000.</li></ul><ul><li>Must be driven to the brink of collapse by overwhelming emotional turmoil.</li></ul><ul><li>Complete 20 training sessions in Zalama's Heart</li></ul><ul><li>Survival of a near-death experience that forces the Saiyan to break their previous limits.</li></ul><ul><li>Must spend 1 full year in another realm (Otherworld, Sacred Planet, etc.), enduring unnatural conditions to adapt the body and spirit. (Must be repeated per stage)</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⏳ Stamina Drain:</strong> maintaining this form consumes 70% of stamina, shortening battle duration. After reverting, all stats are reduced by -20% for 3 turns as the body recovers.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>👺 Loss of Restraint:</strong> prolonged use risks slipping into mindless violence, causing the Namekian to lash out indiscriminately.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💔 Withering Vessel:</strong> The immense demand of this form warps the user’s body beyond normal limits. While active, healing, recovery, or regeneration effects are reduced by 50%, as the transformation burns through vitality faster than it can be restored. Sustaining the form inflicts 5% HP damage per turn due to internal stress and overheating muscles.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 100,000x [3,000,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 250,000x [7,000,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1481452794593542205/1481923501127372921","messageId":"1481923501127372921","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟 Zalama's Incarnation 🌟 When the Precursor Namekian pushes beyond the power of Zalama’s Heart, the fragment of the First Supreme Demon King fully erupts through their body, transforming them"}],"notes":[],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1481452794593542205","imageOnly":false,"classification":"sparking"},{"name":"Warrior Clan","kind":"branch","forms":[{"title":"Warrior Potential 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://media.tenor.com/i5leQ-MUvr8AAAAd/piccolo-dragon-ball.gif\">Warrior Potential</a> 🌟 </h1>When a Warrior Clan Namekian awakens the true core of their fighting spirit, their energy ignites into a radiant golden aura — sharp, crackling, and alive with disciplined power. This glow doesn’t surge chaotically; it pulses rhythmically with each breath, as though their very heartbeat channels the essence of combat itself. Muscles tighten and sharpen, reflexes heighten beyond mortal precision, and every movement exudes unshakable resolve. In this state, hesitation vanishes. The warrior becomes the fight itself — an instrument of focus, endurance, and willpower forged through endless trials.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Warrior Potential ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>⚡ Battle Instinct:</strong> The user’s perception of combat sharpens to near-perfect clarity. Reaction speed and counter timing improve by +40%, allowing the user to anticipate attacks and exploit openings.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🛡️ Enduring Spirit:</strong> Physical endurance dramatically increases, reducing damage taken by 20% for 5 turns. Each time the user is struck, they gain a +5% defense buff, stacking up to 25%.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Valor Surge:</strong> Each successful melee hit increases the user’s Ki recovery rate by +10% (up to +50%) as their fighting spirit grows stronger through momentum.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💥 Martial Focus:</strong> When under 40% health, the user gains heightened clarity — all attacks gain +25% precision and critical chance for 3 turns.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌪️ Spirit Resonance:</strong> Once per battle, the user may unleash a focused burst of aura that enhances all allied damage by +15% for 2 turns.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 50,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Must have fought to near-death in a battle</li></ul><ul><li>Completion of the Ritual of Unyielding Spirit, a Namekian must channel their Ki through every nerve of their body for seven cycles of dawn, forging their flesh into a conduit of unstoppable resolve.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>💧 Severe Ki Drain:</strong> Loses 25% Energy per 10 turns due to uncontrolled demonic flux</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧨 Vital Overload:</strong> If pushed beyond 20 turns of continuous battle, the user’s body begins to deteriorate under the immense strain of sustained combat, causing muscle failure and internal Ki backlash that rapidly drains Health each turn.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💔 Corruptive Strain:</strong> Extended use damages the user’s internal energy flow, halving regeneration efficiency post-transformation for 3 hours (RP cooldown)</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 400x</strong></li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1242335489487540254/1430597925901176893","messageId":"1430597925901176893","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Warrior Potential  🌟  When a Warrior Clan Namekian awakens the true core of their fighting spirit, their energy ignites into a radiant golden aura — sharp, crackling, and alive with discipl"},{"title":"Yellow-Eyed Namekian 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://media.tenor.com/v0iMVNX2VsEAAAAd/neva-dragon-ball.gif\">Yellow-Eyed Namekian</a> 🌟 </h1>A Namekian who has fused warrior heritage with divine energy, transcending the mortal boundary of corruption and enlightenment alike. Their skin deepens into a darker shade of green, while their eyes glow a dazzling Gold— burning with divine rage and resolve. Their aura, once chaotic and raw, now flows with controlled light — a refined storm of cobalt and gold energy that crackles like divine fire.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Yellow-Eyed Namekian ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🕊️ Divine Composure:</strong> Reduces incoming Ki damage by 40%. The user is also immune to fear, or similar morale-affecting effects, representing the serene calm of divine focus.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚔️ Godly Strikes:</strong> Physical and ki-based attacks bypass 10% of enemy defenses, cutting through mortal barriers with divine sharpness.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>✨ Godly Infusion:</strong> Mortal instincts merge with divine serenity. Techniques deal +25% damage while costing 15% less Ki, representing efficiency fused with ferocity.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Aura Manifestation:</strong> The aura’s divine flame can be concentrated outward. Once per battle, the user may release a burst that staggers enemies, lowering their damage by 10% for 2 turns.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of the Divine:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Divine Energy:</strong> The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns. Their ki undetectable to those without Divine Ki.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔒 God-Ki Barrier:</strong> Non-divine techniques below 70% of your current PL cannot interrupt your attacks while this form is active.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 180,000,000.</li></ul><ul><li>Must have awakened God/Divine Ki through training or divine ritual</li></ul><ul><li>Must prove oneself in battle against a foe who surpasses the limits of mortal strength.</li></ul><ul><li>Must train in another realm 6 times, forging control over divine and mortal ki. (Second Stage)</li></ul><ul><li>Must defeat an opponent wielding God/Divine Ki, proving worthiness to ascend.  (Second Stage)</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⌛ Adjustment Period:</strong> The user must spend 5 training sessions acclimating to godly ki. Until then, their output is capped at 50% strength. <span>(Once the namekian has completed the five trainings in the form, this is null)</span></li></ul><ul><li><strong>♻️ Mortal Drift:</strong> The Namekian risks subconsciously reverting to their mortal state, unaware of the shift, leading to sudden drops in efficiency. <span>(Once Mastered, this is null)</span></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔋 Fragile Vessel:</strong> While the form is efficient, the mortal body was not designed for godly ki. Any critical hit against the user inflicts +10% extra damage. <span>(Once Mastered, this is null)</span></li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 10,000x [180,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 14,000x [500,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1242335489487540254/1430598180709601513","messageId":"1430598180709601513","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Yellow-Eyed Namekian  🌟  A Namekian who has fused warrior heritage with divine energy, transcending the mortal boundary of corruption and enlightenment alike. Their skin deepens into a dark"}],"notes":[],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1242335489487540254","imageOnly":false,"classification":"normal"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335293758685839380","formCount":15,"art":"assets/brand.png","sparkingNotes":["SPARKING! @Namekian (Berserker) Rage Boost: 3.5x (+40% every 8 posts) Potential Boost: 25% Ki/Mana Reserves: 125%","Source discrepancy to review: the race documentation calls the SPARKING! branch Precursor, while the current role screenshot includes “Namekian (Berserker)”."]},{"name":"Saiyan","slug":"saiyan","accent":"#f4b34b","shade":"#ee6549","description":"The Saiyans are among the most formidable species in the universe, defined by their relentless pursuit of strength, their unmatched combat instincts, and their unparalleled ability to adapt and evolve through battle. Unlike many w…","about":[{"title":"🦍 The Saiyans 🦍","html":"<div><span><h1>🦍 The Saiyans 🦍</h1>The Saiyans are among the most formidable species in the universe, defined by their relentless pursuit of strength, their unmatched combat instincts, and their unparalleled ability to adapt and evolve through battle. Unlike many warrior races, the Saiyans do not simply fight for survival—they fight to grow stronger, to test their limits, and to etch their legacy into the stars. Their origins trace back to Planet Dathomir, a wild and untamed world where strength alone determined survival. For generations, they thrived under the leadership of King Azanek, a towering figure in Saiyan history and the father of Akumo, Alacar, and Aloisa—the legendary trio who became symbols of their people’s resilience. Under Azanek’s reign, the Saiyans were united, their power growing steadily as they carved out a place for themselves among the stars.\nThat unity, however, was tested during the invasion of Empress Cicle, whose armies sought to break Dathomir and enslave its people. Though the Saiyans resisted fiercely, the battle left their homeworld scarred. In the wake of this devastation, a far more insidious threat emerged—the rise of the Vampyres, who sought to corrupt and consume the proud warrior race. With Dathomir collapsing under endless war and bloodshed, the trio of Azanek’s heirs—Akumo, Alacar, and Aloisa—rose together, guiding their people in an exodus that led to a new, uninhabited world. It became the Saiyans’ new home, a place where they could rebuild and grow stronger than ever before.\n<ul><li>Over the millennia that followed, the Saiyans were ruled by many kings and queens, each leaving their mark on history. Among the most notable were:</li></ul><ul><li><strong>👑 King Rovan</strong> – The Pioneer (Age 200–360)\n<ul><li>Organized the clans into a unified command while respecting Tuffle authority, laying the foundation of Saiyan society.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>👑 King Teryk</strong> – The Resolute (Age 360–500)\n<ul><li>Strengthened settlements, introduced martial codes, and forged discipline and unity among the Saiyans.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>👑 King Veyrus</strong> – The Builder (Age 500–640)\n<ul><li>Constructed fortresses, arenas, and training grounds, cementing the Saiyans’ warrior culture.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>👑 King Dravos</strong> – The Scholar-Warrior (Age 640–830)\n<ul><li>Blended intellect with strength, introducing tactical strategies alongside traditional raw combat.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>👑 King Korvak</strong> – The Unifier (Age 830–1,000)\n<ul><li>Fully consolidated the clans, preparing the Saiyans for independence and future expansion.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>👑 King Sadala</strong> – The Architect of Conflict (Age 1,000–1,200)\n<ul><li>Led the Saiyan-Tuffle War, renaming Kythera to Sadala and establishing the first true Saiyan empire.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>👑 King Azarth</strong> – The Titan of the Skies (Age 1,200–1,380)\n<ul><li>Expanded Saiyan influence beyond Sadala, balancing diplomacy with ambition, though planting seeds of division.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>👑 King Zarnok</strong> – The Militarist Architect (Age 1,380–1,520)\n<ul><li>Formalized the warrior caste, codified martial traditions, and fortified Saiyan society through strict discipline.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>👑 King Ziex</strong> – The Shadow King (Age 1,520–1,650)\n<ul><li>Expanded Saiyan dominance aggressively, but at the cost of stability, leaving scars of unrest and division.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>👑 King Azurik</strong> – The Dawn of a New Era (Age 1,650–Present)\n<ul><li>Restored unity, rebuilt alliances with the Tuffles, and ushered in cultural, technological, and martial renaissance.</li></ul></li></ul>The Saiyan hierarchy has always been built upon strength and combat prowess, with every warrior’s worth measured by their ability to fight, survive, and evolve. Their society naturally divides into distinct paths of power, shaped by both their innate potential and the crucible of battle. Some hone their brute force, others master speed and technique, while a rare few break beyond natural limits entirely, transcending into forms of power that redefine what it means to be Saiyan.\n# <s>--------------------------------------------------</s></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335293825354043482/1339907857591566389","messageId":"1339907857591566389"},{"title":"Untitled section","html":"<div><span><ul><li><strong>💪 Saiyan Strengths 💪</strong><ul><li><strong>💪 Enhanced Strength:</strong> Saiyans are naturally physically superior, capable of overpowering most races with raw power alone.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>👀 Heightened Senses:</strong> Saiyans possess sharpened senses far beyond normal beings, allowing them to detect movement, power shifts, and danger with heightened awareness.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🏃‍♂️ Extreme Stamina:</strong> Saiyans can endure grueling battles for prolonged periods without tiring, making them some of the most tenacious warriors in the universe. This allows them to use a last resort ultimate attack without the drain</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Saiyan Weaknesses ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⚡ Magical Aversion:</strong> Saiyans have a natural weakness to Fulgurmancy.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>👎 Tail Sensitivity:</strong> If a Saiyan’s tail is grabbed, they suffer immense weakness and paralysis unless they have trained to overcome it.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚔️Battle-Obsessed:</strong> The Saiyan love for combat can cloud their judgment, making them reckless in battle and prone to underestimating their opponents. They often drag fights out for thrill or testing strength, leaving openings for cunning enemies.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>👑 Overwhelming Pride:</strong> Saiyans, particularly B-Type warriors, have overwhelming pride, making them arrogant in fights, often refusing to retreat even when necessary.</li></ul></li></ul><h1><s>--------------------------------------------------</s></h1><ul><li><strong>💥 Saiyan Abilities 💥</strong><ul><li><strong>✨ Ki Manipulation:</strong> All Saiyans possess the innate ability to wield and control their Ki, shaping it into powerful attacks, flight, and energy-based techniques.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🦎 Tail Regrowth:</strong> If a Saiyan’s tail is removed, it regenerates under a full moon or during a moment of dire survival instinct, but this process can only occur once every 4 weeks unless permanently removed through training</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚔️ Zenkai:</strong> When a Saiyan’s health drops below 15% and they survive, their body adapts and permanently increases their Power Level by 15%–125%, <span>(-10% for SPARKING)</span> and a maximum of 3 Zenkais per saga/major arc. Non-lethal injuries do not trigger Zenkai, and immediate medical, magical, or technological healing caps the boost at 15%.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🌟 Special Abilities 🌟</strong><ul><li><strong>🥩 Ancient Wrath: Ancient Rampage</strong></li></ul><ul><li>Upon reaching critical damage, the Saiyan enters a berserk state, unlocking monstrous power at the cost of control. This frenzied form makes them immune to pain, but they can become unstable if not trained properly.</li></ul><ul><li>Power Increase: +40% every 8 turns.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>👑 Primal: Saiyan Pride – Primitive Warriors</strong><ul><li>A Saiyan’s confidence and fighting spirit dramatically boost their strength, speed, and endurance. The longer they fight, the stronger they get, but overuse can strain their bodies.</li></ul><ul><li>Their passion for battle gives them a 2.25x stat multiplier, making them monstrous fighters.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚔️ Divine: The Dual Paths – Saiyan Humility &amp; Dark Charisma</strong><ul><li><strong>Path of Humility:</strong> When grounded in discipline, they gain a stable 2.25x multiplier and sharpened instincts, granting them refined judgment in battle. Their clarity allows them to support allies with strategic synergy, reducing reckless tendencies.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Path of Dark Charisma:</strong> When tempted by darker emotions, they exude a commanding aura that manipulates hostility around them. By drawing strength from hatred, anger, and despair, they amplify their own power — but each use risks permanently tainting their personality and shifting them further down a corrupted path.</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul># <s>--------------------------------------------------</s></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335293825354043482/1339907953809035305","messageId":"1339907953809035305"},{"title":"📜 Starting Techniques / Caps and Boosts 📜 Flight (Support Technique) Afterimage (Support Technique) Wild Sense (Support Techn","html":"<div><span><ul><li><strong>📜 Starting Techniques / Caps and Boosts 📜</strong><ul><li>Flight (Support Technique)</li></ul><ul><li>Afterimage (Support Technique)</li></ul><ul><li>Wild Sense (Support Technique)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🥩 Ancient Wrath Saiyans</strong><ul><li>🌪️ Beast Wave (Super Technique): A catastrophic energy wave that intensifies with rage.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>👑 Primal Saiyans</strong><ul><li>🔥 Crush Cannon (Super Technique): A powerful charged blast, increasing in strength when used consecutively.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚔️ Divine Saiyans</strong><ul><li>⚡ God Shot (Medium Technique): A pinpoint blast of energy striking a foe’s weak point.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>👑 Royal Class:</strong><ul><li><strong>⚡ Ultimate Technique:</strong> Gamma Burst Flash</li></ul><ul><li>A devastating energy attack that concentrates the user's full power into a colossal, high-intensity beam. When unleashed, this energy wave engulfs the battlefield, disintegrating anything caught in its path. The sheer force of the technique makes it a signature move for commanding authority in battle, requiring a brief charge but delivering unmatched destructive power.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Super Technique:</strong> Orga Blaster (One-Handed Galick Gun)\n<ul><li>A condensed, rapid-fire energy beam that is fired from a single hand. While not as overwhelming as a full Galick Gun, it excels in quick execution, precision strikes, and counterattacks. It can be used to pierce through energy barriers or to rapidly punish an opponent before they can react.</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚔️ Super-Elite Class:</strong><ul><li><strong>🌌 Ultimate Technique:</strong> Final Flash</li></ul><ul><li>One of the most feared energy techniques in the universe, the Final Flash requires immense focus and charging time, but once fired, it releases a gigantic energy beam with unstoppable destructive force. Though powerful, its energy cost is high, and missing the target can leave the user vulnerable.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💥 Super Technique:</strong> Galick Gun\n<ul><li>A two-handed energy beam attack, renowned for its versatility and destructive output. It is faster than Final Flash but still packs enough force to obliterate opponents or clash with other high-energy attacks. With quick charge capabilities and a balance between speed and power, it is a staple technique of elite combatants.</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Ancient Wrath <span>(SPARKING!!)</span></strong><ul><li><strong>⚡ Ultimate Technique:</strong> Eraser Cataclysm</li></ul><ul><li>A colossal, planet-shattering sphere of energy hurled with unstoppable force. This technique rapidly expands upon impact, engulfing entire battlefields in a devastating blast.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💥 Super Technique:</strong> Rampage Cannon\n<ul><li>A relentless barrage of energy blasts fired in rapid succession. While less refined, its sheer volume and power make it overwhelming to defend against.</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335293825354043482/1339908690827935836","messageId":"1339908690827935836"},{"title":"Untitled section","html":"<div><span><h1><s>--------------------------------------------------</s></h1><ul><li><strong><span>@Saiyan (Primal)</span> | <span>@Saiyan (Divine)</span> </strong><ul><li>Ki Reserves: 150%</li></ul><ul><li>Rage Boost: 1.6x</li></ul><ul><li>Potential Boost: 10%</li></ul></li></ul><span><strong><code>SPARKING!</code></strong></span><ul><li><strong><span>@Saiyan (Ancient Wrath)</span></strong></li></ul><ul><li>Rage Boost: 3x (+30% every 7 posts)</li></ul><ul><li>Potential Boost: 30%</li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335293825354043482/1339908850488311849","messageId":"1339908850488311849"},{"title":"After this point, the A and B Type Saiyans will head down their own paths (edited)","html":"<div><span><code>After this point, the A and B Type Saiyans will head down their own paths</code></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335293825354043482/1417233856674922607","messageId":"1417233856674922607"},{"title":"Quick Trip","html":"<div><span><h1>Quick Trip</h1><a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335293825354043482/1339907857591566389\">Racial Info</a></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335293825354043482/1417234051630104761","messageId":"1417234051630104761"}],"paths":[{"name":"Foundational forms","kind":"core","forms":[{"title":"Ōzaru / Great Ape 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 Ōzaru / Great Ape 🌟</h1><ul><li><strong>🦍 <a href=\"https://media.tenor.com/nEKP2Lz4IHAAAAAM/kid-goku-oozaru.gif\">Great Ape / Ōzaru</a> </strong><ul><li>The classic Saiyan transformation. Upon exposure to Blutz Waves while possessing a tail, the Saiyan erupts into a towering beast of rage and destruction. Their primal instincts dominate, and their mind succumbs to the bloodthirst of their race’s ancestry.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🦍 <a href=\"https://media0.giphy.com/media/v1.Y2lkPTc5MGI3NjExcnB6eTV2aGZyYWdqMmhlZWdlZGc5bmRvMGdoMmprOXB5bWdmam5tOSZlcD12MV9pbnRlcm5hbF9naWZfYnlfaWQmY3Q9Zw/nAd16YGCs0JcgS2enf/giphy.gif\">Mutant Great Ape A/B-Type Exclusive</a> </strong><ul><li>Among A/B-Type Saiyans, the Great Ape state manifests in a more extreme mutation. Growing up to 120 feet tall, their bodies become grotesquely massive, each movement a cataclysm that can reshape terrain. Unlike standard Ōzaru, their roar carries deeper resonance, cracking earth and shattering nearby structures.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🧍‍♂️ <a href=\"https://media.tenor.com/LWP_PU9S7rEAAAAM/lr-teq-broly-universe-devastating-combat-power.gif\">Ōzaruningen</a> </strong><ul><li>A rare state achieved only through discipline and mastery, Ōzaruningen is the perfected synthesis of mind and beast. The Saiyan condenses their Great Ape energy into their natural body, maintaining humanoid form while still channeling primal ferocity. Their muscles swell, hair bristles wildly, and their eyes glow with a savage yellow intensity.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Ōzaru / Great Ape ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌊 Shockwave Generation:</strong> Every physical strike releases concussive shockwaves, creating an additional 10% AoE damage and staggering nearby foes.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌋 Primal Roar:</strong> The Saiyan releases a roar infused with Blutz Wave energy, shaking opponents to their core. Enemies within range suffer a  -25% to attack power for 2 turns due to intimidation.</li></ul><ul><li>Ōzaru / Great Ape\n<ul><li><strong>⛰️ Titanic Bulk:</strong> The Saiyan's body becomes impossibly durable, shrugging off most physical and energy attacks. Physical damage taken is reduced by 20%, but agility-based maneuvers become harder to execute.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌊 Colossal Presence:</strong> The extreme size and aura not only intimidate weaker opponents, but cause small-scale environmental effects like tremors and wind displacement with movements.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li>Ōzaruningen\n<ul><li><strong>✨ Instinctual Surge:</strong> In moments of extreme stress, a lost tail may regrow, immediately forcing the user into full great ape.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>✊ Condensed Ferocity:</strong> Though smaller than Ōzaru, every strike carries amplified force. Physical attacks deal 1.5× more damage than in base, while retaining humanoid mobility.</li></ul></li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>The Saiyan must possess a tail.</li></ul><ul><li>Exposure to intense Blutz Waves (such as a full moon or artificial generator).</li></ul><ul><li>To access Ōzaruningen, the Saiyan must first master the Ōzaru form and undergo rigorous mind-body training to condense its power.\n<ul><li>Ōzaruningen requires the loss of the tail to stabilize the form in humanoid state.</li></ul></li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li>Ōzaru / Great Ape</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💢 Loss of Reason:</strong> In ape form, intelligence drops drastically, making the user highly aggressive and uncontrollable.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🤝 Collateral Risk:</strong> Saiyans in Ōzaru form cannot easily distinguish friend from foe.</li></ul><ul><li>Ōzaruningen\n<ul><li><strong>🔋 Stamina Strain:</strong> While controlled, Ōzaruningen consumes heavy stamina, draining 25% per use.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💥 Emotional Instability:</strong> Extreme emotions may destabilize the humanoid state, risking a destructive outburst or forced regression into full Ōzaru.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⛓️ Forced Regrowth:</strong> Under duress, a regrown tail may trigger Ōzaru at the worst possible time, stripping the user of control.</li></ul></li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 Ōzaru / Great Ape:</strong> 10x</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Ōzaruningen:</strong> 5x</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Mutated Ōzaru Variant:</strong> 20x</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335293825354043482/1416587087360299089","messageId":"1416587087360299089","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟 Ōzaru / Great Ape 🌟    🦍  Great Ape / Ōzaru     The classic Saiyan transformation. Upon exposure to Blutz Waves while possessing a tail, the Saiyan erupts into a towering beast of rage and d"},{"title":"Super Saiyan 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 Super Saiyan 🌟 </h1><ul><li><strong>🔥 <a href=\"https://i.makeagif.com/media/4-06-2015/uxTOPM.gif\">Grade 1: The Awakening</a> </strong><ul><li>The first stage of Super Saiyan, where rage births golden power. Hair shifts to gold, aura flares violently, and emotions fuel devastating strength. It is raw, unstable, and draining.</li></ul></li><li><strong>✨ <a href=\"https://pa1.aminoapps.com/6451/f6158b461613d9a39fb58430ef665390b7750339_hq.gif\">Grade 2: Next Ascension</a> </strong><ul><li>An amplified but flawed evolution of Grade 1. The aura grows brighter, the body hardens with added muscle, and attacks become devastatingly sharp. However, stamina drains even faster.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🏋️‍♂️ <a href=\"https://media.giphy.com/media/boNwWbB6GhSXXzH7BK/giphy.gif\">Grade 3: Colossal Bulk</a> </strong><ul><li>A hulking, overcharged state where the Saiyan’s physique swells with massive muscle growth. Power soars, but speed plummets, making it highly impractical for prolonged battle.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🧘‍♂️ <a href=\"https://media.giphy.com/media/ZtAvuXQNlRxQxb4Wcl/giphy.gif\">Grade 4: Mastery</a> </strong><ul><li>The perfected state of the Super Saiyan — calm, balanced, and fully optimized. Outwardly, it appears identical to Grade 1, but internally it nullifies the inefficiency of earlier grades. The aura steadies into a controlled, radiant gold. This form embodies the true mastery of the Saiyan’s golden power.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Super Saiyan</strong><ul><li>Grade 1</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Power Instability:</strong> The user’s aura lashes out uncontrollably, dealing 5% splash damage to all combatants within close range (ally or foe) each turn.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Rage Overflow:</strong> Each time the user takes damage, their damage output rises by +10% for 2 turns, stacking up to +50%.</li></ul><ul><li>Grade 2\n<ul><li><strong>💪 Pressure Shockwaves:</strong> Each physical strike releases a shockwave, dealing 10% extra AoE damage in a small radius.</li></ul><ul><li><strong> 🌪️ Aura Suppression Breaker:</strong> Negates suppression or concealment effects from foes within 60% of the user’s PL in a radius of 30 meters, lasting 2 turns once revealed.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li>Grade 3\n<ul><li><strong>🗻 Colossal Force:</strong> The user’s strikes carry such raw energy that they ignore barriers and shields up to 20% PL strength.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌋 Battlefield Quake:</strong> Foes within 40m within 75% of the user’s PL suffer -15% damage to attacks.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li>Grade 4\n<ul><li><strong>🧘 Controlled Flow:</strong> Reduces stamina drain by 50%, allowing extended battle without exhaustion.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Perfected Channeling:</strong> Ki techniques cost 25% less stamina/energy, reflecting complete mastery of output.</li></ul></li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Grade 1</li></ul><ul><li>Must experience intense emotional turmoil or life-threatening desperation.</li></ul><ul><li>Base Power Level of 3,000,000.</li></ul><ul><li>Grade 2\n<ul><li>Must endure prolonged battles in the unstable G1 form, learning to stabilize it through repeated strain.</li></ul><ul><li>Train in Grade 1, 15 times.</li></ul><ul><li>Base Power Level of 6,000,000.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li>Grade 3\n<ul><li>Must push past the limits of control, channeling raw bulk through overexertion in combat scenarios.</li></ul><ul><li>Train in Grade 2, 25 times. </li></ul><ul><li>Base Power Level of 8,000,000.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li>Grade 4\n<ul><li>Must utilize Super Saiyan for an extended period, working to decrease its drawbacks.</li></ul><ul><li>Base Power Level of 10,000,000.</li></ul></li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li>Grade 1</li></ul><ul><li>⏳ Heavy stamina drain (50%).</li></ul><ul><li>💢 Emotional instability fuels reckless actions.</li></ul><ul><li>💥 Muscular strain increases risk of self-injury.</li></ul><ul><li>Grade 2\n<ul><li>⏳ Extreme stamina drain (65%).</li></ul><ul><li>🦴 Lingering muscle fatigue after deactivation.</li></ul><ul><li>🌀 Rage amplification makes focus difficult.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li>Grade 3\n<ul><li>⏳ Critical stamina drain (75%).</li></ul><ul><li>🏋️ Over-bulked body limits combat efficiency.</li></ul><ul><li>💀 Severe fatigue risks collapse if sustained too long.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li>Grade 4\n<ul><li>🌀 Requires constant emotional discipline to avoid regression.</li></ul></li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 Grade 1:</strong> 50x</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Grade 2:</strong> 65x</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Grade 3:</strong> 150x</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Grade 4:</strong> 85x</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335293825354043482/1417233895648137360","messageId":"1417233895648137360","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟 Super Saiyan 🌟     🔥  Grade 1: The Awakening     The first stage of Super Saiyan, where rage births golden power. Hair shifts to gold, aura flares violently, and emotions fuel devastating st"},{"title":"Super Saiyan 2 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://i.imgur.com/kAg5wsN.gif\">Super Saiyan 2</a> 🌟</h1>The already formidable Super Saiyan power reaches heights previously thought unattainable, propelling the Saiyan's might to an entirely new dimension. As this transformation takes hold, the Saiyan's golden hair undergoes a dazzling reformation, becoming even spikier and rising to heights that seem to defy gravity itself. The hair stands on end, as if infused with an electrifying energy, signifying the immense power that now courses through the Saiyan's very core. The aura surrounding the Super Saiyan 2 becomes a magnificent display of sheer intensity, crackling with electric energy that dances and arcs around their body. The air itself seems to shimmer with the surging power that emanates from their being, creating an awe-inspiring spectacle that captures the attention of all who bear witness. In this new pinnacle of strength, the Saiyan's power and speed experience an exponential surge, eclipsing even the most potent of adversaries.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Super Saiyan 2 ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>⚡ Static Overflow:</strong> The form naturally leaks arcs of ki as bio-electric sparks. Every 3 turns, this discharge forces nearby enemies to endure a 2-turn debuff, reducing their Ki Efficiency by 10% (their ki techniques cost more). This represents the unstable atmosphere created around the user, not a conscious attack.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💥 Overload Release:</strong> By pushing the aura to its breaking point, the user creates a violent eruption of purified ki. This deals 20% of the user’s Power Level as AoE damage, ignoring standard defenses. In exchange, the user suffers 10% of their Health in recoil and a 1-turn cooldown where stamina regeneration is halved. Usable once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌠 Focused Amplification:</strong> In SSJ2, the Saiyan’s ki output is far more precise. The first Ki technique used each turn gains +20% effectiveness (damage, range, or potency depending on the move), reflecting the refined energy control of this form.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔊 Pressure Shockwaves:</strong> The raw force of SSJ2 radiates outward with every movement. Each time the user lands a melee strike, a shockwave ripples in a 10-meter radius, dealing 5% of the user’s Power Level as collateral damage to surrounding foes.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 12,000,000.</li></ul><ul><li>Complete 15 training sessions in Super Saiyan Grade 4.</li></ul><ul><li>Must endure a moment of intense emotional upheaval (rage, despair, or resolve).</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⏳ Stamina Drain:</strong> While more stable than previous grades, the constant electrical output steadily exhausts the body. (50%)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Mental Strain:</strong> Requires high concentration to sustain; mental lapses can cause sudden reversion.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💤 Fatigue:</strong> After deactivation, user suffers reduced ki recovery for a short period due to the body’s overexertion.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 100x</strong></li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335293825354043482/1417233926287786128","messageId":"1417233926287786128","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Super Saiyan 2  🌟 The already formidable Super Saiyan power reaches heights previously thought unattainable, propelling the Saiyan's might to an entirely new dimension. As this transformati"},{"title":"Super Saiyan 3 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://tenor.com/view/vegeta-mini-mini-vegeta-vegeta-ssj2-vegeta-ssj3-vegeta-gif-4496372675975467097\">Super Saiyan 3</a> 🌟</h1>Super Saiyan 3 embodies the raw apex of Saiyan ferocity — an overwhelming torrent of power that sacrifices sustainability for sheer might. Upon transformation, the user’s hair grows into a golden cascade, flowing well past their waist, while their brow sharpens into a pronounced, almost primal ridge. Their aura erupts violently, swirling with arcs of crackling energy and a deep, resonant hum that shakes the air itself. This form is not simply about growth — it is about burning one’s life force as fuel. It represents unrelenting determination, but also the peril of overextension, as every second in this state chips away at the user’s stamina.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Super Saiyan 3 ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🌪️ Relentless Aura:</strong> The unstable, turbulent energy of SSJ3 is impossible to contain. Waves of ki pressure radiate outward like storm winds, inflicting 5% passive chip damage per turn to all enemies within close range. This aura cannot be suppressed and reflects the form’s sheer instability.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🗡️ Spirit-Fueled Strikes:</strong> Every blow channels more than muscle—it draws from raw life force. All melee and ki techniques deal +20% bonus damage, but each attack consumes +10% extra stamina, symbolizing the toll of forcing unnatural amounts of ki into every strike.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔊 Resonant Roar:</strong> Once per battle, the Saiyan may unleash a deafening roar charged with volatile ki. This thunderous shockwave rattles enemies to their core, reducing opponents’ Ki efficiency by 15% for 2 turns as they struggle to control their own energy amidst the destabilizing resonance.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Must have trained in Super Saiyan 2 through 20 training sessions.</li></ul><ul><li>Base Power Level of 50,000,000.</li></ul><ul><li>Must spend 1 full year in another realm (Otherworld, Sacred Planet, etc.), enduring unnatural conditions to adapt the body and spirit.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⏳ Severe Stamina Drain:</strong> Though more powerful than previous forms, prolonged combat is limited (85%)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💀 Body Deterioration:</strong> Extended use inflicts 5% HP recoil per turn, representing internal strain.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Mental Fatigue:</strong> After deactivating the form, the user suffers -20% to accuracy and Ki control for 2 turns as recovery time.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔒 Restricted Usage:</strong> This form cannot be maintained indefinitely; after 5 consecutive turns, the user is forced back to base with 0 stamina.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💔 Withering Vessel:</strong> The immense demand of SSJ3 warps the user’s body beyond normal limits. While active, healing, recovery, or regeneration effects are reduced by 50%, as the transformation burns through vitality faster than it can be restored.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 400x</strong></li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335293825354043482/1417233959523323989","messageId":"1417233959523323989","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Super Saiyan 3  🌟 Super Saiyan 3 embodies the raw apex of Saiyan ferocity — an overwhelming torrent of power that sacrifices sustainability for sheer might. Upon transformation, the user’s"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335293825354043482","notes":[],"classification":"foundational"},{"name":"Ancient Wrath Path","kind":"branch","forms":[{"title":"Wrathful Awakening 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://tenor.com/view/cumber-gif-18594028\">Wrathful</a> <a href=\"https://tenor.com/view/broly-dragon-ball-dragon-ball-z-power-gif-15126249\">Awakening</a> 🌟</h1>The Wrathful Awakening is the resurgence of an ancient Saiyan mutation — a dormant gene that channels the primal might of the Great Ape directly into a Saiyan’s humanoid body. Instead of transforming into a towering Ōzaru, the warrior internalizes that monstrous power, compressing its overwhelming force into their own frame. Hair erupts into jagged, feral spikes as crimson/lime energy bleeds through their aura. Their eyes glow with a savage red light, reflecting both the rage of battle and the instincts of ancient Saiyan warriors long forgotten by history. A storm-like aura roars around them, crackling with unstable energy as the Saiyan’s body struggles to contain the power of their ancestral bloodline.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Wrathful Awakening ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔊 Ancient Shockwaves:</strong> The raw force of Ikari radiates outward with every movement, instilling fear into enemies and lowering their morale. Foes are less likely to launch reckless attacks. (up to 2.5x stronger). Each time the user lands a melee strike, a shockwave ripples in a 10-meter radius, dealing 3.75% of the user’s Power Level as collateral damage to surrounding foes.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌋 Primal Roar:</strong> The Saiyan releases a roar infused with Blutz Wave energy, shaking opponents to their core. Enemies within range suffer a  -15% to attack power for 2 turns due to intimidation.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⛰️ Titanic Bulk:</strong> The Saiyan's body becomes impossibly durable, shrugging off most physical and energy attacks. Physical damage taken is reduced by 10%, but agility-based maneuvers become harder to execute.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>✊ Condensed Ferocity:</strong> Though smaller than Ōzaru, every strike carries amplified force. Physical attacks deal 1.5× more damage.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💥 Energy Overflow:</strong> Raw power leaks from the Saiyan uncontrollably. Their ki-based attacks surge with destructive potency, dealing 2x their usual damage but making the Saiyan more detectable to nearby threats.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🛡️ Mutated Barrier:</strong> A volatile, instinctive energy field coats the Saiyan’s body, born from their unstable fusion with Ōzaru power. The barrier reduces incoming Ki-based damage by 5% and automatically lashes out when struck, dealing retaliatory damage back to the attacker. However, maintaining it taxes the body — stamina drains 10% faster while active.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>The Saiyan must undergo extreme emotional distress—most often anger, grief, or desperation.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>💢 Loss of Reason:</strong> In this form, intelligence drops drastically, making the user highly aggressive and uncontrollable.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🤝 Collateral Risk:</strong> Saiyans in this form cannot easily distinguish friend from foe.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔋 Stamina Strain:</strong> While condensed, the form consumes heavy stamina, draining 25% per use.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💥 Emotional Instability:</strong> Extreme emotions may destabilize the humanoid state, risking a destructive outburst or forced regression into full Ōzaru.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🦴 Torment of Power:</strong> The unstable flow of Ōzaru energy ravages the Saiyan’s body, causing micro-tears in muscle and bone with each surge of power. After every 3 turns of continuous use, the user takes 5% self-inflicted damage from internal strain. This damage bypasses defenses and resistances, reflecting the toll of forcing primal energy into a humanoid frame.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 10x [Birth]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 50x [100,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Third Stage: </strong> 100x [500,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Fourth Stage:</strong> 400x [1,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1481540278564421652/1481551679148134490","messageId":"1481551679148134490","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Wrathful   Awakening  🌟 The Wrathful Awakening is the resurgence of an ancient Saiyan mutation — a dormant gene that channels the primal might of the Great Ape directly into a Saiyan’s huma"},{"title":"Restrained Super Saiyan 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://i.pinimg.com/originals/22/86/74/22867457bbac5e8ac71e78c843f72d20.gif\">Restrained Super Saiyan</a> 🌟</h1>When the Saiyan's ancient mutation fully erupts through the Restrained Super Saiyan transformation, their body becomes the embodiment of forgotten Saiyan war instincts. The Saiyan's body barely contains the violent surge of power, their hair flares into a wild green-blue hue as chaotic arcs of jade lightning lash through a storm-like aura. Muscles surge with restrained force as if their frame is barely holding together under the pressure of the raging energy within.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Restrained Super Saiyan ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔊 Ancient Shockwaves:</strong> The raw force of Ikari radiates outward with every movement, instilling fear into enemies and lowering their morale. Foes are less likely to launch reckless attacks. (up to 2.5x stronger). Each time the user lands a melee strike, a shockwave ripples in a 10-meter radius, dealing 3.75% of the user’s Power Level as collateral damage to surrounding foes.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⛰️ Titanic Bulk:</strong> The Saiyan's body becomes impossibly durable, shrugging off most physical and energy attacks. Physical damage taken is reduced by 10%, but agility-based maneuvers become harder to execute.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💥 Unleashed Fury:</strong> The Saiyan’s attacks are empowered with brutal intensity, striking with triple the force of their base blows (3x attack damage).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Energy Overflow:</strong> Raw power leaks from the Saiyan uncontrollably. Their ki-based attacks surge with destructive potency, dealing 3x their usual damage but making the Saiyan more detectable to nearby threats.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Rage Overflow:</strong> Each time the user takes damage, their damage output rises by +10% for 2 turns, stacking up to +30%.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of the Ancients:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 5,000,000.</li></ul><ul><li>Must endure an event of profound emotional or physical turmoil (such as betrayal, loss, or near-death) that pushes the Saiyan past the brink of their limits.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🔋 Stamina Drain:</strong> Maintaining the transformation consumes vast amounts of energy, draining 50% stamina after regression.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Mental Strain:</strong> The raw intensity of the form strains the mind, making long-term focus difficult and encouraging reckless aggression.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🏋️ Body Stress:</strong> Prolonged use causes severe fatigue and muscular tearing, leaving the Saiyan weakened after the form ends.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 800x [5,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 2,000x [10,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Third Stage:</strong> 4,000x [20,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Fourth Stage:</strong> 10,000x [40,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1481540278564421652/1481551684827349082","messageId":"1481551684827349082","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Restrained Super Saiyan  🌟 When the Saiyan's ancient mutation fully erupts through the Restrained Super Saiyan transformation, their body becomes the embodiment of forgotten Saiyan war inst"},{"title":"True Super Saiyan 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 True <a href=\"https://tenor.com/view/shalot-vira-ssj-gif-14156172333320979993\">Super</a> <a href=\"https://i.makeagif.com/media/2-20-2019/o1S3Vf.gif\">Saiyan</a> 🌟</h1>The True Super Saiyan is the rawest expression of ancient Saiyan might — a transformation born from the perfect storm of fury, instinct, and willpower. Drawing upon the forgotten bloodline of the Ancients. When awakened, the Saiyan’s body surges with brutal muscle and vitality as their frame struggles to contain the ancient energy coursing through their blood. Their hair ignites into wild golden spikes, sometimes tinged with unstable hues of green or crimson depending on how their mutation manifests. Their aura roars outward like a living storm — crackling with primal lightning and waves of feral power that warp the air around them.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of True Super Saiyan ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔊 Ancient Shockwaves:</strong> The raw force of Ikari radiates outward with every movement, instilling fear into enemies and lowering their morale. Foes are less likely to launch reckless attacks. (up to 2.5x stronger). Each time the user lands a melee strike, a shockwave ripples in a 10-meter radius, dealing 3.75% of the user’s Power Level as collateral damage to surrounding foes.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⛰️ Titanic Bulk:</strong> The Saiyan's body becomes impossibly durable, shrugging off most physical and energy attacks. Physical damage taken is reduced by 10%, but agility-based maneuvers become harder to execute.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Static Overflow:</strong> The form naturally leaks arcs of ki as bio-electric sparks. Every 3 turns, this discharge forces nearby enemies to endure a 2-turn debuff, reducing their Ki Efficiency by 10% (their ki techniques cost more).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌋 Primal Roar:</strong> The Saiyan releases a roar infused with Blutz Wave energy, shaking opponents to their core. Enemies within range suffer a  -30% to attack power for 2 turns due to intimidation.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🛡️ Mutated Barrier:</strong> A volatile, instinctive energy field coats the Saiyan’s body, born from their unstable fusion with Ōzaru power. The barrier reduces incoming Ki-based damage by 20% and automatically lashes out when struck, dealing retaliatory damage back to the attacker. However, maintaining it taxes the body — stamina drains 10% faster while active.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💥 Overload Release:</strong> By pushing the aura to its breaking point, the user creates a violent eruption of purified ki. This deals 50% of the user’s Power Level as AoE damage, ignoring standard defenses. In exchange, the user suffers 10% of their Health in recoil and a 1-turn cooldown where stamina regeneration is halved. Usable once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of the Ancients:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 100,000,000.</li></ul><ul><li>The Saiyan must face extreme emotional turmoil (grief, anger, or survival-driven rage).</li></ul><ul><li>Must be in the Wrathful Awakening form and transform into a Super Saiyan</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>💢 Loss of Reason:</strong> In this form, intelligence drops drastically, making the user highly aggressive and uncontrollable.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🤝 Collateral Risk:</strong> The user’s mind frays under the weight of power, making it difficult to distinguish ally from enemy.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💔 Withering Vessel:</strong> The immense demand of WSSJ warps the user’s body beyond normal limits. While active, healing, recovery, or regeneration effects are reduced by 50%, as the transformation burns through vitality faster than it can be restored.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 20,000x [100,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 30,000x [250,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1481540278564421652/1481551759922167979","messageId":"1481551759922167979","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟 True  Super   Saiyan  🌟 The True Super Saiyan is the rawest expression of ancient Saiyan might — a transformation born from the perfect storm of fury, instinct, and willpower. Drawing upon t"},{"title":"True Super Saiyan 2 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 True <a href=\"https://tenor.com/view/dragon-ball-legends-shallot-gif-19335112\">Super</a> <a href=\"https://tenor.com/view/broly-broly-legendary-legendary-super-saiyan-broly-legendary-super-saiyan-gogeta-gif-24201416\">Saiyan 2</a> 🌟</h1>The True Super Saiyan 2 form channels the deepest roots of the Saiyan bloodline, awakening the warrior to their ancestral peak. The user’s hair becomes wilder and more upright, glowing with a radiant golden flame. Their eyes ignite with an intense teal glare, sparking with raw, unrefined energy. An aura of searing gold and violent arcs of lightning surround their body, surging and cracking like a storm of ancient power. This transformation symbolizes the unshackled essence of the Saiyan spirit—strength honed by battle, fueled by emotion, and magnified by the primal instincts buried in their lineage. \n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of True Super Saiyan 2 ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>⚡ Energy Overflow:</strong> The overflowing energy of the form destabilizes the battlefield. Every 2 turns, the aura unleashes a pulse that reduces enemy damage by 20% for 1 turn, symbolizing their bodies straining under the oppressive pressure.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔊 Resonant Roar:</strong> Once per battle, the Saiyan may unleash a deafening roar charged with volatile ki. This thunderous shockwave rattles enemies to their core, reducing opponents’ Ki efficiency by -60% for 2 turns as they struggle to control their own energy amidst the destabilizing resonance.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🛡️ Mutated Barrier: </strong>A volatile, instinctive energy field coats the Saiyan’s body, born from their unstable fusion with Ōzaru power. The barrier reduces incoming Ki-based damage by 40% and automatically lashes out when struck, dealing retaliatory damage back to the attacker. However, maintaining it taxes the body — stamina drains 10% faster while active.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔊 Pressure Shockwaves:</strong> The raw force of WSSJ2 radiates outward with every movement. Each time the user lands a melee strike, a shockwave ripples in a 10-meter radius, dealing 30% of the user’s Power Level as collateral damage to surrounding foes.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⛰️ Titanic Bulk:</strong> The Saiyan's body becomes impossibly durable, shrugging off most physical and energy attacks. Physical damage taken is reduced by 40%, but agility-based maneuvers become harder to execute.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Berserker Momentum:</strong> Each turn the user remains active in the form, their damage output increases by +15%, stacking up to +60%. Resets if the user drops out of the form.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💥 Planet-Cracking Burst:</strong> Once per battle, the Saiyan may overcharge their unstable aura and release it in a violent explosion. This deals 70% of the user’s Power Level as AoE damage but inflicts 15% recoil damage and reduces stamina recovery by half for the next 2 turns.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 500,000,000.</li></ul><ul><li>Complete 15 training sessions in True Super Saiyan.</li></ul><ul><li>The transformation is triggered in the midst of overwhelming, survival-driven rage (battlefield near-death event or equivalent).</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🔋 Severe Stamina Drain:</strong> Maintaining the form rapidly taxes the body, consuming 60% of stamina reserves.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧩 Unstable Power:</strong> The overwhelming surge can cause difficulty in controlling precision attacks.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⏳ Limited Duration:</strong> Extended use risks muscle collapse, exhaustion, or unconsciousness once the form ends. (5 turns)</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 50,000x [500,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 75,000x [750,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1481540278564421652/1481551765978480722","messageId":"1481551765978480722","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟 True  Super   Saiyan 2  🌟 The True Super Saiyan 2 form channels the deepest roots of the Saiyan bloodline, awakening the warrior to their ancestral peak. The user’s hair becomes wilder and m"},{"title":"True Super Saiyan 3 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 True <a href=\"https://tenor.com/view/cumber-kanba-super-dragon-ball-heroes-saiyan-evil-saiyan-gif-17318810\">Super</a> <a href=\"https://media.tenor.com/uBDIaeUOV9sAAAAd/dragon-ball-heroes-broly.gif\">Saiyan 3</a> 🌟</h1>When a Saiyan ascends beyond the unstable power of True Super Saiyan 2, their rage and might converge into an explosive, near-apocalyptic form. Their body becomes grotesquely defined, muscles swelling to monstrous proportions as veins pulse beneath their skin. Hair floods down their back in a wild, unkempt mane, glowing with a blazing golden hue and sparking violently with emerald or crimson undertones. The aura is an unrelenting inferno—an oppressive storm of gold lightning that shakes the battlefield itself. \n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of True Super Saiyan 3 ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>⚡ Lightning Blitz:</strong> Grants overwhelming bursts of speed, allowing the Saiyan to appear as a blur, striking multiple times before the opponent can react. (x3 to speed)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🗡️ Spirit-Fueled Strikes:</strong> Every blow channels more than muscle—it draws from raw life force. All melee and ki techniques deal +20% bonus damage, but each attack consumes +10% extra stamina, symbolizing the toll of forcing unnatural amounts of ki into every strike.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⛰️ Titanic Bulk:</strong> The Saiyan's body becomes impossibly durable, shrugging off most physical and energy attacks. Physical damage taken is reduced by 80%, but agility-based maneuvers become harder to execute.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Berserker Momentum:</strong> Each turn the user remains active in the form, their damage output increases by +15%, stacking up to +60%. Resets if the user drops out of the form.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💥 Solar-Cracking Burst:</strong> Once per battle, the Saiyan may overcharge their unstable aura and release it in a violent explosion. This deals 90% of the user’s Power Level as AoE damage but inflicts 30% recoil damage and reduces stamina recovery by half for the next 2 turns.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>☄️ Cataclysmic Roar:</strong> Once per battle, the Saiyan may unleash a deafening roar charged with volatile ki. This thunderous shockwave rattles enemies to their core, reducing opponents’ Ki efficiency by -60% for 2 turns as they struggle to control their own energy amidst the destabilizing resonance.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 1,000,000,000.</li></ul><ul><li>Must be driven to the brink of collapse by overwhelming emotional turmoil.</li></ul><ul><li>Complete 20 training sessions in True Super Saiyan 2</li></ul><ul><li>Survival of a near-death experience that forces the Saiyan to break their previous limits.</li></ul><ul><li>Must spend 1 full year in another realm (Otherworld, Sacred Planet, etc.), enduring unnatural conditions to adapt the body and spirit. (Must be repeated per stage)</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⏳ Stamina Drain:</strong> maintaining this form consumes 70% of stamina, shortening battle duration. After reverting, all stats are reduced by -20% for 3 turns as the body recovers.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>👺 Loss of Restraint:</strong> prolonged use risks slipping into mindless violence, causing the Saiyan to lash out indiscriminately.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💔 Withering Vessel:</strong> The immense demand of WSSJ3 warps the user’s body beyond normal limits. While active, healing, recovery, or regeneration effects are reduced by 50%, as the transformation burns through vitality faster than it can be restored. Sustaining the form inflicts 5% HP damage per turn due to internal stress and overheating muscles.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 100,000x [1,000,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 250,000x [3,000,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1481540278564421652/1481551843665645708","messageId":"1481551843665645708","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟 True  Super   Saiyan 3  🌟 When a Saiyan ascends beyond the unstable power of True Super Saiyan 2, their rage and might converge into an explosive, near-apocalyptic form. Their body becomes g"},{"title":"True Saiyan Evolution 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 True Saiyan Evolution 🌟</h1><ul><li><a href=\"https://i.postimg.cc/wBQfW25Q/idea1.png\">True Super Saiyan 4:</a> When a Saiyan channels Primal Ki, their body embraces the ancient power of the Great Ape lineage. By compressing the overwhelming strength of the Golden Great Ape into a humanoid state, the Saiyan becomes a perfected fusion of beast and warrior. Golden fur spreads across their frame, their hair forms a wild mane of radiant spikes, and their aura burns with the ancient fury of the first Saiyans.</li><li><a href=\"https://i.redd.it/4ycdct53z8z71.png\">True Super Saiyan God:</a> When the Saiyan evolves through Divine Ki, their mutated Wrathful power fuses with godly energy, creating a volatile divine transformation. Their body becomes lean yet impossibly dense with power, their aura erupting into violent storms of crimson and emerald energy as God Ki and Saiyan rage collide.</li><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of True Saiyan Evolution ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🐺 Bloodlust State:</strong> User is immune to fear, or similar morale-affecting effects, representing the serene calm of divine focus.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🐒 Primal Ki:</strong><ul><li><strong>⚡ Prime Peak:</strong> The body is restored to its ultimate prime; physical attacks deal 2x damage due to heightened efficiency and precision.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Primal Energy:</strong> The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of the Ancients:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>👼 Divine/God Ki:</strong><ul><li><strong>🛡️ Mutated God Ki Barrier: </strong>A volatile, instinctive energy field coats the Saiyan’s body, born from their unstable fusion of God Ki with Ōzaru power. The barrier reduces incoming Ki-based damage by 80% and automatically lashes out when struck, dealing retaliatory damage back to the attacker. Non-divine techniques below 70% of your current PL cannot interrupt your attacks while this form is active.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of the Divine:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Divine Energy:</strong> The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns. Their ki undetectable to those without Divine Ki.</li></ul></li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 7,000,000,000</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Primal Ki:</strong><ul><li>Must have achieved and controlled the Golden Ōzaru form.</li></ul><ul><li>Must face an equal or stronger opponent while in Golden Ōzaru, forcing the user to compress their primal chaos into a humanoid state.</li></ul><ul><li>Must have awakened Primal Ki through training or ritual</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>Divine/God Ki:</strong><ul><li>Must have awakened God/Divine Ki through training or divine ritual</li></ul></li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>💢 Volatile Fusion:</strong> The form drains 10% stamina per turn, doubled if stability checks fail. If stamina hits 0, the user risks instant implosion (KO or lethal, GM discretion).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💀 Cosmic Fragility:</strong> Healing techniques are only 25% effective, and forced regeneration (like Senzu Beans) risks triggering an internal God Ki backlash for 50% recoil damage.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⛓️ Loss of Precision:</strong> The berserker instinct clouds judgment; AoE attacks always affect allies unless specifically shielded.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⌛ Finite Timeframe:</strong> Can only be maintained for 12 turns maximum. After collapse, the user suffers a -60% stat debuff for the remainder of combat.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 500,000x</strong></li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1481540278564421652/1481551847746437260","messageId":"1481551847746437260","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟 True Saiyan Evolution 🌟    True Super Saiyan 4:  When a Saiyan channels Primal Ki, their body embraces the ancient power of the Great Ape lineage. By compressing the overwhelming strength of"}],"notes":[],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1481540278564421652","imageOnly":false,"classification":"sparking"},{"name":"Divine Path","kind":"branch","forms":[{"title":"Super Saiyan God 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://media.tenor.com/y4iDc_duXGEAAAAM/dragon-ball-super-broly-vegeta.gif\">Super Saiyan God</a> 🌟</h1>Super Saiyan God is the first true step into divinity, a transformation that transcends the limits of mortal Saiyans. Upon ascending, the Saiyan’s physique slims, their hair shifts to a crimson glow, and their eyes gleam with divine calm. The aura no longer burns like fire but flows like living flame, radiating a holy pressure that separates gods from mortals. This form is not about brute force—it is about perfect harmony with godly ki, granting precision, serenity, and efficiency unmatched by other transformations. It symbolizes the Saiyan’s acceptance into a higher plane of existence, where their will is sharpened into something eternal.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Super Saiyan God ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🕊️ Divine Composure:</strong> Reduces incoming Ki damage by 40% and renders the user immune to basic fear, stun, or rage effects.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧘 Tranquil State:</strong> User is immune to fear, or similar morale-affecting effects, representing the serene calm of divine focus.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚔️ Godly Strikes:</strong> Physical and ki-based attacks bypass 10% of enemy defenses, cutting through mortal barriers with divine sharpness.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of the Divine:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Divine Energy:</strong> The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns. Their ki undetectable to those without Divine Ki.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔒 God-Ki Barrier:</strong> Non-divine techniques below 70% of your current PL cannot interrupt your attacks while this form is active.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 180,000,000.</li></ul><ul><li>Must have awakened God/Divine Ki through training or divine ritual</li></ul><ul><li>Must prove oneself in battle against a foe who surpasses the limits of mortal strength.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⌛ Adjustment Period:</strong> The user must spend 5 training sessions acclimating to godly ki. Until then, their output is capped at 50% strength. <span>(Once the saiyan has completed the five trainings in the form, this is null)</span></li></ul><ul><li><strong>♻️ Mortal Drift:</strong> The Saiyan risks subconsciously reverting to their mortal Super Saiyan state, unaware of the shift, leading to sudden drops in efficiency. <span>(Once Mastered, this is null)</span></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔋 Fragile Vessel:</strong> While the form is efficient, the mortal body was not designed for godly ki. Any critical hit against the user inflicts +10% extra damage. <span>(Once Mastered, this is null)</span></li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li>🔺 10,000x</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1481540484391370792/1481540757037908039","messageId":"1481540757037908039","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Super Saiyan God  🌟 Super Saiyan God is the first true step into divinity, a transformation that transcends the limits of mortal Saiyans. Upon ascending, the Saiyan’s physique slims, their"},{"title":"Super Saiyan Azure / Rose 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 Super Saiyan <a href=\"https://media.tenor.com/UMkPhuHXfj4AAAAM/vegeta-dragon-ball-super.gif\">Azure</a> / <a href=\"https://media4.giphy.com/media/v1.Y2lkPTc5MGI3NjExZXl3azFlbjZncXlwczJoYnpxam9sY3Fuc2U0anFkcGlzNTZwZHJnayZlcD12MV9pbnRlcm5hbF9naWZfYnlfaWQmY3Q9Zw/GgcZOGkbR4zPc9YUQa/giphy.gif\">Rose</a> 🌟</h1>Super Saiyan God Super Saiyan is the perfected results of layering Super Saiyan atop the serenity of Super Saiyan God. This fusion of mortal instinct and divine ki creates a form where control and ferocity coexist in absolute harmony. The aura burns like living fire yet flows with calm precision, an expression of the Saiyan’s mastery of godly energy rather than simple raw power.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Super Saiyan Azure/Rose ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>✨ Godly Infusion:</strong> Mortal instincts merge with divine serenity. Techniques deal +25% damage while costing 15% less Ki, representing efficiency fused with ferocity.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Aura Manifestation:</strong> The aura’s divine flame can be concentrated outward. Once per battle, the user may release a burst that staggers enemies, lowering their damage by 10% for 2 turns.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of the Divine:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Divine Energy:</strong> The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns. Their ki undetectable to those without Divine Ki.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔒 God-Ki Barrier:</strong> Non-divine techniques below 70% of your current PL cannot interrupt your attacks while this form is active.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base a Power Level of 500,000,000.</li></ul><ul><li>Must have mastered Super Saiyan and Super Saiyan God.\n<ul><li>Must master the fusion of Super Saiyan on top of Godly Ki through intent and discipline.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li>Must train in another realm 6 times, forging control over divine and mortal ki.</li></ul><ul><li>Must defeat an opponent wielding God/Divine Ki, proving worthiness to ascend.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⌛ Stamina Drain:</strong> The form consumes 45% more stamina per turn, a cost of maintaining divine ki atop mortal fire.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌀 Ki Instability:</strong> Failing to maintain calm focus may cause techniques to backfire, inflicting 5% recoil damage on the user.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⛔ God Ki Restriction:</strong> Without constant control, the form can abruptly collapse, reverting the user to base or Super Saiyan God mid-battle.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li>🔺 14,000x</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1481540484391370792/1481540763778289756","messageId":"1481540763778289756","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟 Super Saiyan  Azure  /  Rose  🌟 Super Saiyan God Super Saiyan is the perfected results of layering Super Saiyan atop the serenity of Super Saiyan God. This fusion of mortal instinct and divi"},{"title":"Super Saiyan Azure / Rose Evolution 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 Super Saiyan <a href=\"https://media4.giphy.com/media/v1.Y2lkPTc5MGI3NjExMzZqNmVkd2RjbDFqYnphanV6ZjV2ZDVkdnRjaTNzYml5NGxvMTZmZSZlcD12MV9pbnRlcm5hbF9naWZfYnlfaWQmY3Q9Zw/p3nqOFJvRRN5f4zEP4/giphy.gif\">Azure</a> / <a href=\"https://media.tenor.com/42ClTikq-TAAAAAM/goku-black-ssj-rose-evolution-dark.gif\">Rose</a> Evolution 🌟</h1>Super Saiyan God Super Saiyan Evolution is the sharpened peak of godly mastery — the point where raw divine ki and mortal instinct are no longer balanced but forged into a singular, overwhelming force. The aura deepens in intensity, gaining a molten, almost volcanic texture that burns brighter and denser than its predecessor. The user’s physique bulks slightly, not from wasted muscle, but from energy condensed into every fiber of their body.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Azure/Rose Evolution ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>💥 Overpowering Pressure:</strong> The user’s aura radiates crushing dominance. Enemies within 20 meters suffer -15% speed and -10% Ki efficiency as long as the form is maintained.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>✊ Ascendant Strikes:</strong> The form amplifies physical reinforcement; melee attacks bypass 10% of enemy defense, striking with condensed divine force.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌀 Limit Break Pulse:</strong> Once per battle, the user may surge their aura explosively, doubling their damage for 1 turn but draining 15% of total Health.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of the Divine:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Divine Energy:</strong> The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns. Their ki undetectable to those without Divine Ki.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔒 God-Ki Barrier:</strong> Non-divine techniques below 70% of your current PL cannot interrupt your attacks while this form is active.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Must achieve a Power Level of 1,000,000,000.</li></ul><ul><li>Must have mastered Super Saiyan Azure/Rose.\n<ul><li>Must have utilized Super Saiyan Grade 2 and Grade 3 on the path of mastering Super Saiyan.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li>Must engage in battle against an opponent of equal power level, surviving and pushing beyond limits.</li></ul><ul><li>Must undergo relentless divine training, refining god ki to its absolute edge.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⌛ Severe Stamina Drain:</strong> This form consumes 75% more stamina, making prolonged combat dangerous even for seasoned users.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💔 Cellular Strain:</strong> The condensed divine ki tears at the body; every 3 turns, the user loses 5% Health passively.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⛔ No Recovery:</strong> While active, natural healing and regeneration effects are nullified; the body is too overclocked to repair itself.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li>🔺 18,000x</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1481540484391370792/1481540854937030706","messageId":"1481540854937030706","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟 Super Saiyan  Azure  /  Rose  Evolution 🌟 Super Saiyan God Super Saiyan Evolution is the sharpened peak of godly mastery — the point where raw divine ki and mortal instinct are no longer bal"},{"title":"Super Saiyan Azure / Rose 2 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 Super Saiyan <a href=\"https://tenor.com/view/b-gif-10368004775999627241\">Azure</a> / <a href=\"https://media.tenor.com/Hi1lYr5Wn2QAAAAM/gokublack-black.gif\">Rose</a> 2 🌟</h1>Super Saiyan God Super Saiyan 2, often shortened to Azure 2 or Rose 2, is the perfected continuation of the Divine Super Saiyan path. Drawing upon the refined mastery of their Evolution state, the Saiyan pushes their divine ki to the absolute edge, compressing it until it fuses with the essence of their prime body. In either form, the Saiyan’s hair spikes upward more sharply, arcs of divine lightning dance constantly across their body, and their muscles resonate with perfect synchronization of power and ki. This form doesn’t just amplify strength — it returns the body to its physical and spiritual peak, unlocking battle efficiency few mortals or gods can withstand.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Super Saiyan Azure/Rose 2 ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>⚡ Prime Peak:</strong> The body is restored to its ultimate prime; physical attacks deal 2x damage due to heightened efficiency and precision.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌀 Limit Break Pulse:</strong> Once per battle, the user may surge their aura explosively, doubling their damage for 1 turn but draining 15% of total Health.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of the Divine:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Divine Energy:</strong> The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns. Their ki undetectable to those without Divine Ki.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔒 God-Ki Barrier:</strong> Non-divine techniques below 70% of your current PL cannot interrupt your attacks while this form is active.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Power Level of 3,000,000,000.</li></ul><ul><li>Must have defeated an opponent with Primal Ki to prove dominion over primal energy.</li></ul><ul><li>Complete 12 training sessions in another realm.</li></ul><ul><li>Must have fully mastered Super Saiyan God Super Saiyan Evolution (Azure/Rose Evolution).</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⛓️ Stamina Drain:</strong> Though more efficient than Evolution, prolonged use still exhausts the body heavily. (55%)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Overload Risk:</strong> if divine ki isn’t regulated properly, the lightning arcs may destabilize techniques, reducing ki efficiency by 20% for the rest of the fight.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⏳ Turn Cap:</strong> after 15 turns, fatigue reverts the user to SSBE</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li>🔺 22,000x</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1481540484391370792/1481540861589196852","messageId":"1481540861589196852","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟 Super Saiyan  Azure  /  Rose  2 🌟 Super Saiyan God Super Saiyan 2, often shortened to Azure 2 or Rose 2, is the perfected continuation of the Divine Super Saiyan path. Drawing upon the refin"},{"title":"Primal Essence Azure / Rose 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://i.postimg.cc/Df4Bg4WP/image-2025-10-22-130012477.png\">Primal Essence <span>Azure / Rose</span></a> 🌟</h1>When a Saiyan pushes the mastery of Super Saiyan God Super Saiyan beyond mortal comprehension, they ascend into a divine state where their energy no longer rages against their body but instead flows in perfect harmony with it. This ascension can only be reached by those who have awakened Primal Ki — whether through relentless training or sacred divine ritual — as it serves as the foundation for balancing mortal essence with godly resonance. In this state, every breath, heartbeat, and motion is seamlessly infused with divine and primal ki, creating an unbroken cycle of endless power. Azure Divinity radiates with a calm yet fierce blue brilliance, while Rose Divinity emanates an ethereal pink glow — two colors, one state of perfection. Unlike its predecessors, which burn energy like a raging fire, this form refines ki into a flowing current, coursing like lifeblood and returning the Saiyan to their absolute prime, an eternal apex of strength, speed, and will.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Eternal Divinity ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>⚡ Prime Peak:</strong> The body is restored to its ultimate prime; physical attacks deal 2x damage due to heightened efficiency and precision.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌀 Limit Break Pulse:</strong> Once per battle, the user may surge their aura explosively, doubling their damage for 1 turn but draining 15% of total Health.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of the Divine:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Divine Energy:</strong> The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns. Their ki undetectable to those without Divine Ki.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔒 God-Ki Barrier:</strong> Non-divine techniques below 70% of your current PL cannot interrupt your attacks while this form is active.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌌 Eternal Flow:</strong> Stamina drain reduces by 10% every 5 turns the form is sustained, stabilizing the longer it’s maintained.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 7,000,000,000.</li></ul><ul><li>Must have awakened Primal Ki through training or divine ritual</li></ul><ul><li>Must battle and survive against another being of equal power</li></ul><ul><li>Must have completely mastered Super Saiyan Blue/Rose 2 (SSGSS2).</li></ul><ul><li>Complete 24 training sessions in another realm</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⛓️ Immense Stamina Demand:</strong> Though stabilizing over time, initial stamina cost is 60%, making early battles dangerous.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Ki Burnout:</strong> Overuse (20+ turns) causes divine ki collapse, halving multipliers until the fight ends.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li>🔺 26,000x</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1481540484391370792/1481540886557888564","messageId":"1481540886557888564","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Primal Essence  Azure / Rose   🌟 When a Saiyan pushes the mastery of Super Saiyan God Super Saiyan beyond mortal comprehension, they ascend into a divine state where their energy no longer"}],"notes":[],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1481540484391370792","imageOnly":false,"classification":"normal"},{"name":"Primal Path","kind":"branch","forms":[{"title":"Golden Ōzaru / Great Ape 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://media.tenor.com/85rQqh_CSvsAAAAM/oozaru-golden.gif\">Golden Ōzaru / Great Ape</a> 🌟</h1>The Golden Ōzaru is the fearsome union of primal instinct and Super Saiyan power, achieved when a Saiyan with a tail merges the boundless rage of the Great Ape with the golden spark of Super Saiyan. Upon gazing at the full moon—or any potent source of Blutz Waves—the Saiyan erupts into a colossal, golden-furred titan. Their eyes glow red, their roar shakes the land, and their aura burns like a wildfire in the night sky. This form represents both overwhelming might and dangerous instability. The Golden Ōzaru is many times larger and stronger than its base counterpart, yet its power is difficult to rein in, often leaving destruction in its wake. For those with the discipline to master both Super Saiyan and the Ōzaru form, control can be attained—allowing the Saiyan to wield this monstrous form with purpose rather than blind carnage. Furthermore, mastery of Ōzaruningen enables the rare ability to bypass this form entirely, demonstrating true dominion over their primal heritage.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Golden Ōzaru ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⛰️ Titanic Bulk:</strong> The Saiyan's body becomes impossibly durable, shrugging off most physical and energy attacks. Physical damage taken is reduced by 20%, but agility-based maneuvers become harder to execute.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌊 Shockwave Generation:</strong> Every physical strike releases concussive shockwaves, creating AoE damage and staggering nearby foes.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌊 Colossal Presence:</strong> The extreme size and aura not only intimidate weaker opponents, but cause small-scale environmental effects like tremors and wind displacement with movements.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Power Instability:</strong> The user’s aura lashes out uncontrollably, dealing 5% AOE damage to all combatants within close range (ally or foe) each turn.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Rage Overflow:</strong> Each time the user takes damage, their damage output rises by +10% for 2 turns, stacking up to +30%.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💪 Pressure Shockwaves:</strong> Each physical strike releases a shockwave, dealing 10% extra AoE damage in a small radius.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Must be in the Ōzaru / Great Ape form</li></ul><ul><li>Base Power Level of 180,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>If the Saiyan has achieved Ōzaruningen, they may bypass the Golden Ōzaru stage entirely.</li></ul><ul><li>Uncontrolled Golden Ōzaru / Great Ape\n<ul><li>Must meet the rage-fueled conditions for Super Saiyan, allowing emotion to tear open their latent power.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li>Controlled Golden Ōzaru / Great Ape\n<ul><li>Requires complete mastery over both Super Saiyan and Ōzaru forms.</li></ul></li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>💢 Loss of Reason:</strong> In ape form, intelligence drops drastically, making the user highly aggressive and uncontrollable.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🤝 Collateral Risk:</strong> Saiyans in Ōzaru form cannot easily distinguish friend from foe.</li></ul><ul><li><strong> 🦍 Progress:</strong> A Saiyan who cannot seize control of this form will remain trapped in its frenzy, unable to advance toward the next stage of their primal evolution.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 5,000x</strong></li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1481540662200504442/1481541545785036883","messageId":"1481541545785036883","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Golden Ōzaru / Great Ape  🌟 The Golden Ōzaru is the fearsome union of primal instinct and Super Saiyan power, achieved when a Saiyan with a tail merges the boundless rage of the Great Ape w"},{"title":"Super Saiyan 4 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 Super Saiyan 4 🌟</h1>Super Saiyan 4 represents the primal culmination of Saiyan evolution — the unification of their savage instincts and their honed willpower. By fusing the feral essence of the Great Ape with the disciplined strength of their awakened spirit, the Saiyan reclaims a perfected version of themselves, a body drawn back to its prime apex of vitality, ferocity, and dominance. In its <a href=\"https://i.makeagif.com/media/10-27-2016/nS-bSM.gif\">initial</a> state, the form erupts with untamed energy: scarlet fur covers the warrior, their hair darkens and grows unruly, and their aura lashes out like wildfire, a storm of primal rage. Once <a href=\"https://tenor.com/view/super-saiyan-4-goku-daima-super-saiyan-4-goku-dragon-ball-dragon-ball-daima-daima-gif-14543127183309146758\">mastered</a> , however, the transformation shifts — the body becomes sleeker, movements sharpen, and the aura refines into a steady blaze of power, no longer consuming but instead flowing in harmony with the warrior’s ki.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Super Saiyan 4 ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>⚡ Prime Peak:</strong> The body is restored to its ultimate prime; physical attacks deal 2x damage due to heightened efficiency and precision.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🐺 Bloodlust State:</strong> User is immune to fear, or similar morale-affecting effects, representing the serene calm of divine focus.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚔️ Savage Strikes:</strong> Physical and ki-based attacks bypass 10% of enemy defenses, cutting through barriers with primitive sharpness.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Primal Energy:</strong> The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns.</li></ul><ul><li>Mastered\n<ul><li><strong>✨ Primitive Infusion:</strong> Instincts merge with primal savagery. Techniques deal +25% damage while costing 15% less Ki, representing efficiency fused with ferocity.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Aura Manifestation:</strong> The aura’s primal flame can be concentrated outward. Once per battle, the user may release a burst that staggers enemies, lowering their damage by 10% for 2 turns.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of the Ape:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💢 Primal Fury:</strong> When near defeat, the Saiyan instinctively draws on a hidden reserve of primal might, granting a temporary surge in strength (x1.5 boost).</li></ul></li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 500,000,000.</li></ul><ul><li>Engage in a battle against an opponent of equal strength, forcing the Saiyan’s primal instincts to awaken.</li></ul><ul><li>Must have awakened Primal Ki through training or ritual</li></ul><ul><li>Master Golden Ōzaru / Great Ape\n<ul><li>If the Saiyan has accessed Ōzaruningen, they may bypass Golden Ōzaru entirely and unlock the mastered version of SSJ4 directly.</li></ul></li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⌛ Adjustment Period:</strong> The user must spend 5 training sessions acclimating to primal ki. Until then, their output is capped at 50% strength. <span>(Once the saiyan has completed the five trainings in the form, this is null)</span></li></ul><ul><li><strong>♻️ Mortal Drift:</strong> The Saiyan risks subconsciously reverting to their mortal Super Saiyan state, unaware of the shift, leading to sudden drops in efficiency. <span>(Once Mastered, this is null)</span></li></ul><ul><li><strong>👹 Feral Instincts:</strong> The saiyan's personality shifts into a more serious and primitive one making them extremely difficult to reason with. <span>(Once Mastered, this is null)</span></li></ul><ul><li><strong>⛔ Primal Ki Restriction:</strong> Without constant control, the form can abruptly collapse, reverting the user to base or the initial version of Super Saiyan 4 mid-battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 Initial: 10,000x</strong></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Mastered: 14,000x</strong></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1481540662200504442/1481541550168080506","messageId":"1481541550168080506","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟 Super Saiyan 4 🌟 Super Saiyan 4 represents the primal culmination of Saiyan evolution — the unification of their savage instincts and their honed willpower. By fusing the feral essence of th"},{"title":"Super Saiyan 5 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://media.tenor.com/nhcE0klFpjkAAAAM/super-saiyan5-goku.gif\">Super Saiyan 5</a> 🌟</h1>When a Saiyan drives the primal essence of Super Saiyan 4 to its breaking point, they awaken the a state where their feral instincts and battle spirit completely synchronize. Their body becomes wreathed in a silvery-white mane of hair, glowing like tempered steel under pressure, while their aura surges in violent shades of white and flickers of black, embodying pure carnal dominance. This form symbolizes the ultimate predator, a Saiyan who has not just embraced their primal nature but perfected it into a higher state of evolution. \n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Super Saiyan 5 ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>⚡ Prime Peak:</strong> The body is restored to its ultimate prime; physical attacks deal 2x damage due to heightened efficiency and precision.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💢 Primal Fury:</strong> When near defeat, the Saiyan instinctively draws on a hidden reserve of primal might, granting a temporary surge in strength (x1.5 boost).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💥 Overpowering Pressure:</strong> The user’s aura radiates crushing dominance. Enemies within 20 meters suffer -15% speed and -10% Ki efficiency as long as the form is maintained.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚔️ Savage Strikes:</strong> Physical and ki-based attacks bypass 10% of enemy defenses, cutting through barriers with primitive sharpness.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌀 Limit Break Pulse:</strong> Once per battle, the user may surge their aura explosively, doubling their damage for 1 turn but draining 15% of total Health.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of the Ape:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Primal Energy:</strong> The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 1,000,000,000. </li></ul><ul><li>Mastery of Super Saiyan 4</li></ul><ul><li>Be on the losing side of a major battle, forcing your Saiyan spirit into desperation to evolve. (Must be repeated per stage)</li></ul><ul><li>A near-death state when you’re moments from collapse, your body forces the transformation to protect itself.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⌛ Severe Stamina Drain:</strong> This form consumes 75% more stamina, making prolonged combat dangerous even for seasoned users.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💔 Cellular Strain:</strong> The condensed primal ki tears at the body; every 3 turns, the user loses 5% Health passively.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Overload Risk:</strong> if primal ki isn’t regulated properly, the lightning arcs may destabilize techniques, reducing ki efficiency by 20% for the rest of the fight.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⏳ Turn Cap:</strong> after 15 turns, fatigue reverts the user to SSBE</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⛔ No Recovery:</strong> While active, natural healing and regeneration effects are nullified; the body is too overclocked to repair itself.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 Stage 1:</strong> 18,000x</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Stage 2:</strong> 22,000x</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1481540662200504442/1481541613250678834","messageId":"1481541613250678834","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Super Saiyan 5  🌟 When a Saiyan drives the primal essence of Super Saiyan 4 to its breaking point, they awaken the a state where their feral instincts and battle spirit completely synchroni"},{"title":"Divine Essence 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://tenor.com/view/super-saiyan-4-limit-breaker-super-dragon-ball-heroes-xeno-goku-dragon-ball-ssj4-gif-15720614755805745791\">Divine Essence</a> 🌟</h1>When a Saiyan pushes the mastery of Super Saiyan 5 beyond mortal comprehension, they ascend into a divine state where their energy no longer rages against their body but instead flows in perfect harmony with it. This ascension can only be reached by those who have awakened God/Divine Ki — whether through relentless training or sacred divine ritual — as it serves as the foundation for balancing mortal essence with godly resonance. In this state, every breath, heartbeat, and motion is seamlessly infused with divine and primal ki, creating an unbroken cycle of endless power.  Unlike its predecessors, which burn energy like a raging fire, this form refines ki into a flowing current.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Eternal Divinity ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>⚡ Prime Peak:</strong> The body is restored to its ultimate prime; physical attacks deal 2x damage due to heightened efficiency and precision.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌀 Limit Break Pulse:</strong> Once per battle, the user may surge their aura explosively, doubling their damage for 1 turn but draining 15% of total Health.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of the Ape:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Primal Energy:</strong> The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns. Their ki undetectable to those without Divine Ki.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌌 Eternal Flow:</strong> Stamina drain reduces by 10% every 5 turns the form is sustained, stabilizing the longer it’s maintained.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 7,000,000,000.</li></ul><ul><li>Must have awakened God/Divine Ki through training or divine ritual</li></ul><ul><li>Must battle and survive against another being of equal power</li></ul><ul><li>Must have completely mastered Super Saiyan 5.</li></ul><ul><li>Complete 24 training sessions in another realm</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⛓️ Immense Stamina Demand:</strong> Though stabilizing over time, initial stamina cost is 60%, making early battles dangerous.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Ki Burnout:</strong> Overuse (20+ turns) causes primal ki collapse, halving multipliers until the fight ends.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li>🔺 26,000x</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1481540662200504442/1481541618124455996","messageId":"1481541618124455996","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Divine Essence  🌟 When a Saiyan pushes the mastery of Super Saiyan 5 beyond mortal comprehension, they ascend into a divine state where their energy no longer rages against their body but i"}],"notes":[],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1481540662200504442","imageOnly":false,"classification":"normal"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335293825354043482","formCount":19,"art":"assets/brand.png","sparkingNotes":["SPARKING! @Saiyan (Ancient Wrath) Rage Boost: 3x (+30% every 7 posts) Potential Boost: 30%"]},{"name":"Super-Earthling","slug":"super-earthling","accent":"#f5d48a","shade":"#b77957","description":"The Super Earthlings, also known as S-Earthlings, are a race of exceptional beings that emerged from Earth’s long history of struggle, growth, and perseverance. While Earth was once considered an insignificant planet in the vast c…","about":[{"title":"🌎 Super Earthlings 🌎","html":"<div><span><h1>🌎 Super Earthlings 🌎</h1>The Super Earthlings, also known as S-Earthlings, are a race of exceptional beings that emerged from Earth’s long history of struggle, growth, and perseverance. While Earth was once considered an insignificant planet in the vast cosmos, its people have proven time and again that they are among the most adaptable and resourceful warriors in the universe. Renowned for their versatility, ingenuity, and unwavering spirit, Super Earthlings have carved a place for themselves in the galactic stage through relentless training, mastery of Ki, and technological advancements. Despite lacking the raw strength or natural advantages of many other species, their boundless potential has allowed them to overcome seemingly insurmountable odds. The Kaioshin, recognizing their indomitable will and determination, gifted the human race with the Shoryuken, a lesser form of the Shinoken. This technique allows them to push their physical and energy limits beyond natural constraints, letting them stand toe-to-toe with even the mightiest of warriors for brief periods. As they continue to evolve, Super Earthlings embrace both their mortal limitations and their limitless potential, making them one of the most unpredictable and dynamic races in the universe.\n<h1><s>-----------------------------------------------------------</s></h1><ul><li><strong>💪 Super Earthling Strengths 💪</strong><ul><li><strong>🦾 Unyielding Spirit: </strong>Their willpower and resilience allow them to push past their limits in the most desperate situations.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>👀 Heightened Senses:</strong> Super Earthlings have refined sensory perception, allowing them to detect subtle movements, track Ki signatures, and react with precision.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎭 Charisma &amp; Persuasion:</strong> Naturally gifted with strong social skills, they excel in diplomacy, leadership, and negotiation, making them influential figures in any society.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌌 Extreme Survivability:</strong> Jinago can survive in space, endure extreme temperatures, and resist environmental hazards. <span>(SPARKING!)</span></li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Super Earthling Weaknesses ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⏳ Limited Lifespan:</strong> Unlike some races with extended or even infinite lifespans, Super Earthlings have a finite existence, making time their greatest enemy.</li></ul></li></ul><h1><s>-----------------------------------------------------------</s></h1><ul><li><strong>💥 Super Earthling Abilities 💥</strong><ul><li><strong>✨ Ki Manipulation: </strong>Unlike ordinary humans, Super Earthlings have natural proficiency in Ki control, allowing them to perform energy-based attacks and techniques.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌿 Adaptive Evolution:</strong> Their bodies adjust rapidly to combat, environments, and techniques, allowing them to learn and refine skills faster than most other races.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Combat Intuition:</strong> A razor-sharp instinct enables them to predict enemy movements, react with precision, and devise strategies in the heat of battle.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🧘‍♂️ Meditative Mastery:</strong> Through deep meditation, Jinago can gradually unlock their hidden power, gaining a 5% power increase per hour (up to 50%). <span>(SPARKING!)</span></li><li><strong>🌟 Special Abilities 🌟 </strong><ul><li><strong>🔥 Shoryuken – The Gift of the Kais:</strong></li></ul><ul><li>Bestowed upon them by the Kaioshin, this technique temporarily amplifies the user’s physical and energy abilities between 1.5x - 2x for 6 turns.</li></ul><ul><li>Unlike Shinoken, which requires direct Kai training, Shoryuken can be accessed by any Super Earthling willing to train their mind and body to its fullest potential.</li></ul><ul><li>Excessive use strains the body, leading to exhaustion and energy depletion if overused in rapid succession.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💥 Euprigon💥</strong><ul><li>The Jinago suppress their immense pride and ego through rigorous training, storing their power for a single devastating moment.</li></ul><ul><li>When unleashed, they gain a temporary 4x power increase.</li></ul><ul><li>This ability is triggered by extreme stress or anger but is difficult to control, often leading to unpredictable destruction.</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul># <s>-----------------------------------------------------------</s></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335293889086754910/1415408031893684255","messageId":"1415408031893684255"},{"title":"Untitled section","html":"<div><span><ul><li><strong>📜 Starting Techniques / Caps and Boosts 📜</strong><ul><li>Flight (Support Technique)</li></ul><ul><li>Afterimage (Support Technique)</li></ul><ul><li>Energy Field (Support Technique)</li></ul><ul><li>Power Impact (Super Technique)</li></ul><ul><li>Soaring Fist (Super Technique)</li></ul><ul><li>School Mastery (Custom Selection)\n<ul><li>Super Earthlings can start with a technique from any martial school, even those originating from off-world planets. Royals; 5 / Super Elite; 4 / Elite; 3 / Middle; 2 / Low; 1</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul><h1><s>-----------------------------------------------------------</s></h1><ul><li><strong><span>@Super Earthling (No-Ego)</span> | <span>@Super Earthling (Sage)</span></strong><ul><li>Rage Boost: 2.5x</li></ul><ul><li>Potential Boost: 15%</li></ul><ul><li>Spirit Control Boost: 2.5%</li></ul><ul><li>Ki Reserves: 100%</li></ul></li></ul><span><strong><code>GIVEAWAY</code></strong></span><ul><li><strong><span>@Super Earthling (Jinago)</span></strong></li></ul><ul><li>Rage Boost: 4x</li></ul><ul><li>Potential Boost: 25%</li></ul><ul><li>Ki Reserves: 300%</li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335293889086754910/1415408039640432762","messageId":"1415408039640432762"},{"title":"Quick Trip","html":"<div><span><h1>Quick Trip</h1><a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335293889086754910/1415408031893684255\">Racial Info</a></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335293889086754910/1434366011682984059","messageId":"1434366011682984059"}],"paths":[{"name":"Foundational forms","kind":"core","forms":[{"title":"Max Power 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://media2.giphy.com/media/v1.Y2lkPTZjMDliOTUyb3Z5ZWtzMjI0MHk5eGx2cmhsdDNzN2x4OTFjaDBseG4xdmw0eTlhMSZlcD12MV9naWZzX3NlYXJjaCZjdD1n/Iu5oAV0cVffQk/giphy.gif\">Max Power</a> 🌟</h1>Max Power represents the absolute pinnacle of physical conditioning—a state where the user forces every muscle fiber to expand and operate at full capacity. The transformation swells the body with raw strength, creating a physique that looks as though it’s carved from stone and charged with pure vitality. Veins bulge beneath the skin, the muscles tighten to their limit, and the ground may tremble beneath the user’s steps as their mass and energy output surge in unison. The aura emitted during Max Power is dense and pressurized, a visible distortion of heat and Ki wrapping tightly around the body. This form symbolizes the height of human determination—the will to draw out every ounce of power through discipline, control, and effort. While immensely powerful, it demands precise breathing and mental focus to avoid overwhelming the body with its own strength.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Max Power ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>💪 Physical Overflow:</strong> Strength-based techniques and melee attacks gain a x2 power multiplier, granting immense striking power capable of creating shockwaves with each movement.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🛡️ Ironclad Endurance:</strong> Physical resistance increases by 30%, allowing the user to shrug off minor energy blasts and withstand heavy impacts that would normally break bones.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💨 Grounded Momentum:</strong> Despite their size, the user maintains controlled, deliberate movement. Charging attacks or grapples gain +15% accuracy as the fighter’s center of gravity stabilizes.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Tremor Pulse:</strong> Heavy attacks release kinetic bursts on impact, dealing 5% AoE splash damage in close range and potentially staggering weaker opponents.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Focused Breathing:</strong> As long as the user maintains calm concentration, stamina consumption is halved for 3 turns. Losing focus cancels this effect immediately.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Must achieve a Power Level of 50,000</li></ul><ul><li>Must have fully mastered the Forced Expansion form and maintained it for extended durations during training.</li></ul><ul><li>Must push their physical limits to the absolute extreme—training under immense pressure, gravity, or resistance until the body reaches perfect expansion synchronization.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🔋 Gradual Drain:</strong> The body burns through internal Ki reserves to sustain the form, draining 15% Ki every 5 turns of continuous use.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🐢 Reduced Agility:</strong> Due to the increase in mass, movement speed and evasion are decreased by 25%, leaving the user more vulnerable to ranged or high-speed attacks.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💔 Muscular Fatigue:</strong> After deactivating the form, the user suffers temporary muscle strain, reducing physical strength by 10% for 2 turns.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💥 Overextension Risk:</strong> If sustained beyond safe limits (10 turns), the body risks internal injury, inflicting 10% max HP recoil damage each additional turn.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 20x [50,000x]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 35x [150,000x]</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335293889086754910/1428403100535885947","messageId":"1428403100535885947","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Max Power  🌟 Max Power represents the absolute pinnacle of physical conditioning—a state where the user forces every muscle fiber to expand and operate at full capacity. The transformation"},{"title":"Super Human 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://images-wixmp-ed30a86b8c4ca887773594c2.wixmp.com/f/10a5da2b-f8d5-48cf-8383-4499ae747a9a/davw98a-831cdf83-fa01-4d0a-bc6d-0208a685b97f.gif?token=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..DUZGQnmobmujUY2Pp-j-AOC5FqPLrCsDbNpdZwF5WN0\">Super Human</a> 🌟 </h1>When the transformation ignites, the user channels their grief, rage, and unwavering determination into a single, razor-sharp focus. Their body becomes a conduit for controlled fury — every muscle tightens, every movement refines. A brilliant blue aura flares around them, swirling like compressed energy ready to erupt. Their eyes glow an intense azure hue, reflecting the clarity and emotional storm within.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Super Human ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>⚡ Power Instability:</strong> The user’s aura lashes out uncontrollably, dealing 5% splash damage to all combatants within close range (ally or foe) each turn.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Rage Overflow:</strong> Each time the user takes damage, their damage output rises by +10% for 2 turns, stacking up to +50%.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💥 Precision Empowerment:</strong> While active, all basic attacks and techniques gain a +35% Power boost due to enhanced muscular efficiency and reaction time.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Mind Over Matter:</strong> The user becomes immune to fear, intimidation, or paralysis-based effects during Focused Surge.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 3,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Must experience a moment of extreme sadness or grief that pushes their willpower to the edge, allowing their focus to crystallize into pure energy.</li></ul><ul><li>The user must have trained to sustain Max Power form for at least 10 consecutive turns in a prior battle or simulation without collapsing.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🔋 Severe Ki Drain:</strong> Loses 10% Ki per turn while active due to the intense concentration required to maintain full-body control.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💤 Mental Fatigue:</strong> After deactivation, the user suffers a -20% accuracy and -25% speed penalty for 3 turns due to neural strain.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💔 First Awakening Collapse:</strong> Upon the first activation of Focused Surge, the user’s body is overwhelmed — they immediately fall unconscious for 1 turn after the form ends.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Overextension Risk:</strong> If maintained beyond 8 turns, the user begins taking 5% recoil damage per turn from overclocked muscle fibers tearing under pressure.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🕐 Limited Duration:</strong> Cannot exceed 10 turns total — the body cannot sustain such compressed energy beyond this period without severe internal damage.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 50x</strong></li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335293889086754910/1428425987091075213","messageId":"1428425987091075213","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Super Human  🌟  When the transformation ignites, the user channels their grief, rage, and unwavering determination into a single, razor-sharp focus. Their body becomes a conduit for control"},{"title":"Super Human 2 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://i.pinimg.com/originals/98/0b/83/980b83c87870397c22c5c6ad37765110.gif\">Super Human 2</a> 🌟 </h1>The second evolution of humanity’s inner strength — Super Human 2 is born from the storm of emotion that follows great loss or despair. When sadness collapses into pure rage and the body refuses to yield, the human spirit ignites once more.\nThe user’s eyes blaze with azure light, their aura surging into a fierce, shimmering blue that hums with raw bio-electric energy. Each breath feels heavier, but sharper. Every motion becomes a blur of intent. This form doesn’t radiate divinity — it radiates defiance.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Super Human 2 ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>⚡ Static Overflow:</strong> The form naturally leaks arcs of ki as bio-electric sparks. Every 3 turns, this discharge forces nearby enemies to endure a 2-turn debuff, reducing their Ki Efficiency by 10% (their ki techniques cost more). This represents the unstable atmosphere created around the user, not a conscious attack.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💥 Overload Release:</strong> By pushing the aura to its breaking point, the user creates a violent eruption of purified ki. This deals 20% of the user’s Power Level as AoE damage, ignoring standard defenses. In exchange, the user suffers 10% of their Health in recoil and a 1-turn cooldown where stamina regeneration is halved. Usable once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔊 Pressure Shockwaves:</strong> The raw force of SH2 radiates outward with every movement. Each time the user lands a melee strike, a shockwave ripples in a 10-meter radius, dealing 5% of the user’s Power Level as collateral damage to surrounding foes.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🗡️ Spirit-Fueled Strikes:</strong> Every blow channels more than muscle—it draws from raw life force. All melee and ki techniques deal +20% bonus damage, but each attack consumes +10% extra stamina, symbolizing the toll of forcing unnatural amounts of ki into every strike.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Mind Over Matter:</strong> The user becomes immune to fear, intimidation, or paralysis-based effects during Focused Surge.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 6,000,000.</li></ul><ul><li>Train in Super Human, 15 times.</li></ul><ul><li>Must endure prolonged battles in the unstable Super Human form, learning to stabilize it through repeated strain.</li></ul><ul><li>Must spend 1 full year in another realm (Otherworld, Sacred Planet, etc.), enduring unnatural conditions to adapt the body and spirit. (Second Stage Only)</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🔋 Severe Ki Drain:</strong> Loses 10% Ki per turn while active due to the intense concentration required to maintain full-body control.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💤 Mental Fatigue:</strong> After deactivation, the user suffers a -20% accuracy and -25% speed penalty for 3 turns due to neural strain.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Overextension Risk:</strong> If maintained beyond 8 turns, the user begins taking 5% recoil damage per turn from overclocked muscle fibers tearing under pressure.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🕐 Limited Duration:</strong> Cannot exceed 10 turns total — the body cannot sustain such compressed energy beyond this period without severe internal damage.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💔 Withering Vessel:</strong> The immense demand of SH2 warps the user’s body beyond normal limits. While active, healing, recovery, or regeneration effects are reduced by 50%, as the transformation burns through vitality faster than it can be restored.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 100x [12,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 400x [50,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335293889086754910/1428427445006241887","messageId":"1428427445006241887","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Super Human 2  🌟  The second evolution of humanity’s inner strength — Super Human 2 is born from the storm of emotion that follows great loss or despair. When sadness collapses into pure ra"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335293889086754910","notes":[],"classification":"foundational"},{"name":"Jinago Path","kind":"branch","forms":[{"title":"Hint of Immensity 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 Hint of Immensity 🌟</h1>The first stage of the Jinago Path, Hint of Immensity represents the moment when the mortal body begins to sense the scale of might — not by rage or instinct, but through absolute focus. The user’s aura densifies, their presence warping the air itself with serene pressure. Every movement hums with hidden power, every breath resonates with restrained potential. It is the calm that precedes collapse… and the threshold between humanity and transcendence.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Hint of Immensity ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>💢 Unyielding Surge:</strong> Your power level increases by +10% each Standby turn after activating the form. This surge compounds your attack strength by 1.5x per turn, enabling progressively stronger strikes. Upon reaching a 10x cap, all attacks gain a d20 critical roll, dealing double damage on success.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🩸 Vital Echo:</strong> Each critical hit or successful deflection slightly restores 2% stamina, representing the body’s feedback loop of controlled regeneration.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌪️ Controlled Flux:</strong> When performing combos, each consecutive hit slightly increases speed and precision (+2% per hit, up to +10%). The buff resets if concentration breaks.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Moment of Clarity:</strong> Once per battle, the user can purge all status effects and regain composure, restoring 10% stamina and Ki.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔊 Pressure Shockwaves:</strong> The raw force radiates outward with every movement. Each time the user lands a melee strike, a shockwave ripples in a 10-meter radius, dealing 3.75% of the user’s Power Level as collateral damage to surrounding foes.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⛰️ Titanic Bulk:</strong> The Jinago's body becomes impossibly durable, shrugging off most physical and energy attacks. Physical damage taken is reduced by 10%, but agility-based maneuvers become harder to execute.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>✊ Condensed Ferocity:</strong> Though smaller than Ōzaru, every strike carries amplified force. Physical attacks deal 1.5× more damage.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🛡️ Mutated Barrier:</strong> A volatile, instinctive energy field coats the Jiango's body, born from their unstable emotions. The barrier reduces incoming Ki-based damage by 5% and automatically lashes out when struck, dealing retaliatory damage back to the attacker. However, maintaining it taxes the body — stamina drains 10% faster while active.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Perform a deep meditation 5 times (Must repeat per stage)</li></ul><ul><li>You must survive a life-threatening battle</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🧠 Strain of Awareness:</strong> Maintaining such deep focus is mentally taxing. Each turn this form is active drains 5% additional stamina.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🦴 Torment of Power:</strong> The unstable flow of emotions ravages the user’s body, causing micro-tears in muscle and bone with each surge of power. After every 3 turns of continuous use, the user takes 5% self-inflicted damage from internal strain. This damage bypasses defenses and resistances.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multiplier 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 <a href=\"https://tenor.com/view/jiren-dragon-ball-super-walking-tournament-of-power-gif-10782679\">First Stage:</a> </strong> 10x [Birth]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 50x [100,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 <a href=\"https://i.pinimg.com/originals/05/c4/f0/05c4f02aba02dadafc9d9a02cb25519a.gif\">Third Stage:</a> </strong> 100x [500,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Fourth Stage:</strong> 400x [1,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1415407108048027740/1429906009127649363","messageId":"1429906009127649363","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟 Hint of Immensity 🌟 The first stage of the Jinago Path, Hint of Immensity represents the moment when the mortal body begins to sense the scale of might — not by rage or instinct, but through"},{"title":"Condensed Power 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 Condensed Power 🌟</h1>The second transformation in the Jinago Path, Condensed Power represents the mastery of internal restraint — a point where overwhelming energy no longer leaks out wildly, but instead compresses within the body until it becomes pure, unwavering strength. The Jinago’s aura tightens around them like a living flame, glowing a deep crimson edged with black heatwaves. Their every movement is deliberate, refined, and precise — no wasted motion, no unnecessary display.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Condensed Power ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>💥 Focused Output:</strong> Every action performed in this form is precise and efficient. Basic attacks and techniques consume 20% less Ki and stamina, while they deal an additional 25% damage due to the concentrated nature of the energy.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⛰️ Titanic Bulk:</strong> The Jinago's body becomes impossibly durable, shrugging off most physical and energy attacks. Physical damage taken is reduced by 20%, but agility-based maneuvers become harder to execute.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Serenity’s Fury:</strong> The user channels emotion into refined might, gaining a stacking 5% boost to attack power per turn (max 25%) without succumbing to rage. These stacks are lost if composure is broken (stunned, enraged, or panicked).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🛡️ Mutated Barrier:</strong> A volatile, instinctive energy field coats the Jiango's body, born from their unstable emotions. The barrier reduces incoming Ki-based damage by 10% and automatically lashes out when struck, dealing retaliatory damage back to the attacker. However, maintaining it taxes the body — stamina drains 10% faster while active.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Precision Flow:</strong> Ki techniques executed within this form have an increased hit accuracy (+15%) and a 10% chance to ignore standard defensive barriers.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧘 Inner Equilibrium:</strong> Once per battle, the user may restore 10% Ki and stamina by stabilizing their internal flow through meditation (takes one turn of focus).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Moment of Clarity:</strong> Once per battle, the user can purge all status effects and regain composure, restoring 10% stamina and Ki.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 5,000,000.</li></ul><ul><li>Must have fought in Hint of Immensity form at least 10 times.</li></ul><ul><li>Attain emotional balance through focused self-discipline training.</li></ul><ul><li>Survive a life-or-death confrontation that forces total composure under duress. (Must repeat per stage)</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>💢 Energy Compression Strain:</strong> Maintaining such refined control causes immense internal stress. Stamina drains 5% faster per turn after the first 5 turns.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🩸 Ki Feedback:</strong> If struck by a critical hit, the condensed energy momentarily destabilizes, causing self-damage equal to 30% of your Power Level.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Mental Exhaustion:</strong> The extreme focus required dulls reaction speed after prolonged battles. After 6 turns, dodge and counter rates decrease by 15%.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Controlled Temper:</strong> Emotional outbursts, forced rage effects, or Ki corruption instantly cancel this transformation for 1 turn while stamina is halved.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🦴 Torment of Power:</strong> The unstable flow of emotions ravages the user’s body, causing micro-tears in muscle and bone with each surge of power. After every 3 turns of continuous use, the user takes 5% self-inflicted damage from internal strain. This damage bypasses defenses and resistances.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multiplier 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 <a href=\"https://tenor.com/view/jiren-dragonball-super-heat-angry-exploding-gif-11162124\">First Stage:</a> </strong> 800x [5,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 2,000x [10,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 <a href=\"https://pa1.aminoapps.com/6932/68149968cc43a7048913780c4b0cf0e62257f2c1r1-315-202_00.gif\">Third Stage:</a> </strong> 4,000x [20,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Fourth Stage:</strong> 10,000x [40,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1415407108048027740/1430238128446111803","messageId":"1430238128446111803","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟 Condensed Power 🌟 The second transformation in the Jinago Path, Condensed Power represents the mastery of internal restraint — a point where overwhelming energy no longer leaks out wildly, b"},{"title":"Evolved Immensity 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://tenor.com/view/jiren-dragon-ball-gif-11873868\">Evolved Immensity</a> 🌟 </h1>In this state, all restraint collapses into singular purpose. The user’s energy, once contained and disciplined through Hint of Immensity and Condensed Power, now detonates outward — condensed beyond control, yet channeled through sheer will. Their aura ignites into a fiery crimson and silver conflux, pulsating with each heartbeat like a living inferno. The air distorts with every movement, rippling space around their body as if reality itself trembles under the pressure.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Evolved Immensity ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🛡️ Mutated Barrier:</strong> A volatile, instinctive energy field coats the Jiango's body, born from their unstable emotions. The barrier reduces incoming Ki-based damage by 20% and automatically lashes out when struck, dealing retaliatory damage back to the attacker. However, maintaining it taxes the body — stamina drains 10% faster while active.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔊 Pressure Shockwaves:</strong> The raw force radiates outward with every movement. Each time the user lands a melee strike, a shockwave ripples in a 10-meter radius, dealing 15% of the user’s Power Level as collateral damage to surrounding foes.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 20%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💥 Overload Release:</strong> By pushing the aura to its breaking point, the user creates a violent eruption of purified ki. This deals 50% of the user’s Power Level as AoE damage, ignoring standard defenses. In exchange, the user suffers 10% of their Health in recoil and a 1-turn cooldown where stamina regeneration is halved. Usable once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⛰️ Titanic Bulk:</strong> The User's body becomes impossibly durable, shrugging off most physical and energy attacks. Physical damage taken is reduced by 40%, but agility-based maneuvers become harder to execute.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Berserker Momentum:</strong> Each turn the user remains active in the form, their damage output increases by +15%, stacking up to +60%. Resets if the user drops out of the form.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💥 Planet-Cracking Burst:</strong> Once per battle, the user may overcharge their unstable aura and release it in a violent explosion. This deals 70% of the user’s Power Level as AoE damage but inflicts 15% recoil damage and reduces stamina recovery by half for the next 2 turns.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Will of Fire (Passive):</strong> Melee and ki-based attacks leave searing trails of flame, dealing an additional +10% Damage Over Time (DoT) for 2 turns. Fire-based resistance is increased by 40%.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🩸 Unyielding Spirit:</strong> For 5 turns, pain and stamina loss are ignored, effectively granting immunity to stun or flinch effects. Afterward, suffer 15% total stamina drain from accumulated fatigue.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 100,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Must have mastered both Hint of Immensity and Condensed Power.</li></ul><ul><li>Engage in a battle against an opponent leagues above you (Must repeat per stage)</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🔋 Severe Stamina Drain:</strong> Maintaining the form rapidly taxes the body, consuming 60% of stamina reserves.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💔 Withering Vessel:</strong> The immense demand of the form warps the user’s body beyond normal limits. While active, healing, recovery, or regeneration effects are reduced by 50%, as the transformation burns through vitality faster than it can be restored.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⏳ Limited Duration:</strong> Extended use risks muscle collapse, exhaustion, or unconsciousness once the form ends. (5 turns)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🤝 Collateral Risk:</strong> Emotional instability may occur — user may become hyper-focused, ignoring allies and strategy.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 20,000x [100,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 30,000x [250,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Third Stage:</strong> 50,000x [500,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Fourth Stage:</strong> 75,000x [750,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1415407108048027740/1430242725063561340","messageId":"1430242725063561340","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Evolved Immensity  🌟  In this state, all restraint collapses into singular purpose. The user’s energy, once contained and disciplined through Hint of Immensity and Condensed Power, now deto"},{"title":"Limitless Power 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 Limitless Power 🌟</h1>When emotions and power converge into a singular, unbreakable purpose, the Jinago transcends mortal limits and enters the Limitless Power state. In this form, your aura erupts into a crimson-white inferno that bends the very air around you, flickering like a living flame of fury and resolve. Your muscles tighten, veins pulsing with concentrated ki, while your eyes burn with an unwavering glare that pierces through all doubt and fear. The battlefield trembles under your presence—each step echoes with defiance, each movement radiates divine intensity.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Limitless Power ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🌀 Godbreaker Strikes:</strong> The raw force of the form radiates outward with every movement. Each time the user lands a melee strike, a shockwave ripples in a 10-meter radius, dealing 90% of the user’s Power Level as collateral damage to surrounding foes. It will also bypass 40% of enemy damage reduction and negate one defensive technique per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🛡️ Mutated Barrier:</strong> A volatile, instinctive energy field coats the Jinago's body, born from their unstable emotions. The barrier reduces incoming Ki-based damage by 40% and automatically lashes out when struck, dealing retaliatory damage back to the attacker. However, maintaining it taxes the body — stamina drains 10% faster while active.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Berserker Momentum:</strong> Each turn the user remains active in the form, their damage output increases by +15%, stacking up to +60%. Resets if the user drops out of the form.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💥 Solar-Cracking Burst:</strong> Once per battle, the user may overcharge their unstable aura and release it in a violent explosion. This deals 90% of the user’s Power Level as AoE damage but inflicts 30% recoil damage and reduces stamina recovery by half for the next 2 turns.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Will of Fire (Passive):</strong> Melee and ki-based attacks leave searing trails of flame, dealing an additional +20% Damage Over Time (DoT) for 2 turns. Fire-based resistance is increased by 80%.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🩸 Unyielding Spirit:</strong> For 5 turns, pain and stamina loss are ignored, effectively granting immunity to stun or flinch effects. Afterward, suffer 15% total stamina drain from accumulated fatigue.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 1,000,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Complete mastery of Evolved Immensity</li></ul><ul><li>Engage in a battle of emotional and physical breaking point (GM/Event-Driven or RP-confirmed)</li></ul><ul><li>Must have experienced a near-death or irreversible loss that fuels the awakening of will beyond reason (Must repeat per stage)</li></ul><ul><li>Must spend 1 full year in another realm (Otherworld, Sacred Planet, etc.), enduring unnatural conditions to adapt the body and spirit. (Must be repeated per stage)</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⌛ Finite Timeframe:</strong> Can only be maintained for 12 turns maximum. After collapse, the user suffers a -60% stat debuff for the remainder of combat.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>☄️ Star-Level Catastrophe:</strong> If the user loses control completely (failing 3 consecutive stability checks), their body detonates with energy equivalent to solar-system-wide destruction, killing themselves and obliterating the battlefield.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💔 Withering Vessel:</strong> The immense demand of tehf form warps the user’s body beyond normal limits. While active, healing, recovery, or regeneration effects are reduced by 50%, as the transformation burns through vitality faster than it can be restored. Sustaining the form inflicts 5% HP damage per turn due to internal stress and overheating muscles.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 <a href=\"https://tenor.com/view/full-power-jiren-migatte-no-gokui-ultra-instinct-son-goku-gif-19830581\">First Stage:</a> </strong> 100,000x [1,000,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 250,000x [3,000,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 <a href=\"https://s1.ezgif.com/tmp/ezgif-182835b99c44ae.gif\">Third Stage:</a> </strong> 500,000x [7,000,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1415407108048027740/1430247661533135020","messageId":"1430247661533135020","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟 Limitless Power 🌟 When emotions and power converge into a singular, unbreakable purpose, the Jinago transcends mortal limits and enters the Limitless Power state. In this form, your aura eru"}],"notes":[],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1415407108048027740","imageOnly":false,"classification":"sparking"},{"name":"No-Ego Path","kind":"branch","forms":[{"title":"Mikkonutsu 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://pa1.aminoapps.com/6171/b17fda2b98c9e9909796d5e3127204e8c8a308d8_hq.gif\">Mikkonutsu</a> 🌟 </h1>Unlike the raw intensity and volatility of previous forms, this state radiates complete silence — a stillness so profound it seems to quiet the world around it. The user’s aura ignites into a pure, blinding white flame, yet it produces no heat, no sound — only a tranquil, divine luminance that hums with balance and control. Their eyes glow with an ethereal brilliance, reflecting an inner light rather than raw power, while faint motes of energy drift from their body like falling starlight. Every muscle appears relaxed, yet coiled with perfect readiness. In this state, the user transcends emotion-driven strength; their energy flows seamlessly, guided not by ego or rage, but by an enlightened focus.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Mikkonutsu ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🕊️ Divine Composure:</strong> Reduces incoming Ki damage by 40% and renders the user immune to basic fear, stun, or rage effects.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Divine Pulse:</strong> Every third turn, emits a pulse that restores 10% stamina and 5% Ki to self and allies within range.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Divine Ki Control:</strong> Ki-based abilities cost 20% less energy to use, as godly ki flows with precision and without mortal waste.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚔️ Godly Strikes:</strong> Physical and ki-based attacks bypass 10% of enemy defenses, cutting through mortal barriers with divine sharpness.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of the Divine:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Divine Energy:</strong> The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns. Their ki undetectable to those without Divine Ki.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔒 God-Ki Barrier:</strong> Non-divine techniques below 70% of your current PL cannot interrupt your attacks while this form is active.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💫 No-Ego Amplification:</strong> Grants immunity to fear, confusion, and emotion-based control. The user’s focus cannot be broken, ensuring uninterrupted technique execution.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 180,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Must have awakened God/Divine Ki through training or divine ritual</li></ul><ul><li>Must complete an act of self-denial or sacrifice, proving mastery over one’s emotions (No-Ego Path initiation). (Must be repeated per stage)</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⌛ Adjustment Period:</strong> The user must spend 5 training sessions acclimating to godly ki. Until then, their output is capped at 50% strength. <span>(Once the Earthling has completed the five trainings in the form, this is null)</span></li></ul><ul><li><strong>♻️ Mortal Drift:</strong> The Earthling risks subconsciously reverting to their mortal Super Human state, unaware of the shift, leading to sudden drops in efficiency. <span>(Once Mastered, this is null)</span></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔋 Fragile Vessel:</strong> While the form is efficient, the mortal body was not designed for godly ki. Any critical hit against the user inflicts +10% extra damage. <span>(Once Mastered, this is null)</span></li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 10,000x [180,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 14,000x [500,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1237560579594649710/1428813738454024345","messageId":"1428813738454024345","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Mikkonutsu  🌟  Unlike the raw intensity and volatility of previous forms, this state radiates complete silence — a stillness so profound it seems to quiet the world around it. The user’s au"},{"title":"State of Chishiki 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://tenor.com/view/krillin-energy-control-ki-dragon-ball-super-dbs-gif-17716451\">State of Chishiki</a> 🌟</h1>Through unyielding discipline and spiritual awakening, the user transcends the mortal understanding of power, reaching a state of balance between divine awareness and human instinct. Their aura no longer burns with fury or passion — instead, it glows as a radiant, golden-white halo, humming softly with the rhythm of pure enlightenment. Every movement becomes effortless, every strike deliberate. Their eyes gleam with a steady, focused light, representing total unity between mind and ki. In this state, emotion becomes a tool rather than a chain. The user’s power no longer fluctuates with anger or fear — it flows evenly, harmonized with their heartbeat. This transformation embodies the pinnacle of human evolution through peace and mastery, not through destruction.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of the State of Chishiki ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>✨ Godly Infusion:</strong> Mortal instincts merge with divine serenity. Techniques deal +25% damage while costing 15% less Ki, representing efficiency fused with ferocity.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Aura Manifestation:</strong> The aura’s divine flame can be concentrated outward. Once per battle, the user may release a burst that staggers enemies, lowering their damage by 10% for 2 turns.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of the Divine:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Divine Energy:</strong> The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns. Their ki undetectable to those without Divine Ki.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔒 God-Ki Barrier:</strong> Non-divine techniques below 70% of your current PL cannot interrupt your attacks while this form is active.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💫 No-Ego Amplification:</strong> Grants immunity to fear, confusion, and emotion-based control. The user’s focus cannot be broken, ensuring uninterrupted technique execution.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💗 Harmonic Pulse:</strong> The user’s aura naturally stabilizes nearby energy signatures, nullifying unstable ki, destructive waves, or corrupted auras within a short radius (affecting allies and environment alike).</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 1,000,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Engage in combat with another Divine or God Ki user, testing one’s mastery of control and intent.</li></ul><ul><li>Must have fully mastered Mikkonutsu, demonstrating emotional detachment and precise ki regulation.</li></ul><ul><li>Must train in another realm 6 times, forging control over divine and mortal ki.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⌛ Stamina Drain:</strong> The form consumes 45% more stamina per turn, a cost of maintaining divine ki atop mortal fire.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌀 Ki Instability:</strong> Failing to maintain calm focus may cause techniques to backfire, inflicting 5% recoil damage on the user.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⛔ God Ki Restriction:</strong> Without constant control, the form can abruptly collapse, reverting the user to base mid-battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⏳ Overuse Risk:</strong> Exceeding 10 turns in this form risks losing the ability to sense and control ki for 2 in-character days, due to total mental and spiritual exhaustion.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💭 Detached Mindset:</strong> Remaining too long in this tranquil state can dull emotional responses post-transformation, causing temporary apathy or slowed reaction to external stress.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 18,000x [1,000,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 22,000x [3,000,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1237560579594649710/1428819098409898045","messageId":"1428819098409898045","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  State of Chishiki  🌟 Through unyielding discipline and spiritual awakening, the user transcends the mortal understanding of power, reaching a state of balance between divine awareness and h"},{"title":"Hōrinken 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/collisionpoint.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/tenshinhan_by_maimtheworld-d4ka7kw.gif?w=1400&amp;h=&amp;ssl=1\">Hōrinken</a> 🌟</h1>When a Super Earthling transcends beyond mastery of Chishiki, they awaken the State of Equinox — a form where the body, mind, and spirit act as one flawless current. The user’s aura ignites into a prism of radiant light, fluctuating between warm golds, cool silvers, and faint blues. Their presence radiates stillness, yet the air vibrates with power so dense it bends the flow of ki around them. Every motion carries intent; every breath, perfect control. \n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Hōrinken ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>⚡ Prime Peak:</strong> The body is restored to its ultimate prime; physical attacks deal 2x damage due to heightened efficiency and precision.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💥 Overpowering Pressure</strong>: The user’s aura radiates crushing dominance. Enemies within 20 meters suffer -15% speed and -10% Ki efficiency as long as the form is maintained.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>✊ Ascendant Strikes:</strong> The form amplifies physical reinforcement; melee attacks bypass 10% of enemy defense, striking with condensed divine force.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌀 Limit Break Pulse:</strong> Once per battle, the user may surge their aura explosively, doubling their damage for 1 turn but draining 15% of total Health.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💫 No-Ego Amplification:</strong> Grants immunity to fear, confusion, and emotion-based control. The user’s focus cannot be broken, ensuring uninterrupted technique execution.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💗 Harmonic Pulse:</strong> The user’s aura naturally stabilizes nearby energy signatures, nullifying unstable ki, destructive waves, or corrupted auras within a short radius (affecting allies and environment alike).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔮 Adaptive Reflection:</strong> When struck by an attack exceeding 60% of your Power Level, the user automatically learns from the impact — granting a temporary +10% to defense and technique efficiency for 2 turns.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of the Divine:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Divine Energy:</strong> The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns. Their ki undetectable to those without Divine Ki.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔒 God-Ki Barrier:</strong> Non-divine techniques below 70% of your current PL cannot interrupt your attacks while this form is active.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 7,000,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Must have achieved and mastered State of Chishiki</li></ul><ul><li>Must defeat or evenly match a Divine Ki or God-tier opponent in combat</li></ul><ul><li>Must undergo complete emotional detachment training under a martial or spiritual mentor</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⌛ Severe Stamina Drain:</strong> This form consumes 75% more stamina, making prolonged combat dangerous even for seasoned users.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💔 Cellular Strain:</strong> The condensed divine ki tears at the body; every 3 turns, the user loses 5% Health passively.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⛔ No Recovery:</strong> While active, natural healing and regeneration effects are nullified; the body is too overclocked to repair itself.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⏳ Overuse Risk:</strong> Exceeding 10 turns in this form risks losing the ability to sense and control ki for 2 in-character days, due to total mental and spiritual exhaustion.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💭 Detached Mindset:</strong> Remaining too long in this tranquil state can dull emotional responses post-transformation, causing temporary apathy or slowed reaction to external stress.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 26,000x</strong></li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1237560579594649710/1428823625003302919","messageId":"1428823625003302919","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Hōrinken  🌟 When a Super Earthling transcends beyond mastery of Chishiki, they awaken the State of Equinox — a form where the body, mind, and spirit act as one flawless current. The user’s"}],"notes":[],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1237560579594649710","imageOnly":false,"classification":"normal"},{"name":"Sage Path","kind":"branch","forms":[{"title":"Sage Mode 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://i.makeagif.com/media/10-17-2025/sRMQJl.gif\">Sage Mode</a> 🌟</h1>Through intense meditation and spiritual refinement, the user learns to absorb and harmonize with the life energy of their surroundings — the essence known as Natural Ki. Upon entering Sage Mode, the user’s body becomes a vessel of perfect equilibrium: physical strength, spiritual insight, and ki control fuse into one. Their eyes shift into a vivid golden-amber hue with sharp, animal-like pupils, signifying the fusion of human and natural essence. A calm, swirling aura surrounds them — leaves and dust gently caught in the current of their power. In this form, the user embodies the balance of nature itself: serene yet unstoppable.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Sage Mode ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>✨ Tranquil Mind:</strong> The Sage’s consciousness merges with the rhythm of creation itself. Immune to illusions, emotional manipulation, or psychic interference. Once per battle, the user may nullify a mental or sensory-based attack entirely, maintaining perfect focus through spiritual clarity.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌿 Living Convergence:</strong> While in tune with the natural world, the user unconsciously draws vitality from their surroundings. Regenerates 5% Ki and 2% Health per post when in a natural or living environment. In lifeless or artificial areas, regeneration is halved — emphasizing the symbiosis between Sage and nature.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>☯️ Flow of Duality:</strong> The Sage achieves perfect equilibrium of aggression and defense. Ki control is heightened to a near-divine level, reducing Ki costs of all techniques by 30%, and allowing the user to chain offensive and defensive actions without penalty — even in the same turn.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Nature’s Wrath:</strong> The user’s ki becomes saturated with primal natural energy, enhancing technique damage by 25%. These attacks pierce both body and spirit, disrupting an opponent’s energy flow — bypassing their defense by 10% for 2 turns upon a successful strike. </li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Aura Manifestation:</strong> The aura’s primal flame can be concentrated outward. Once per battle, the user may release a burst that staggers enemies, lowering their damage by 10% for 2 turns.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Primal Energy:</strong> The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of Gaia:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 180,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Must possess Primal Ki</li></ul><ul><li>Mastery of Human Ascension and Forced Expansion</li></ul><ul><li>Completion of the Sage Path Trial, which involves meditating in an area dense with life energy to achieve spiritual equilibrium.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⌛ Adjustment Period:</strong> The user must spend 5 training sessions acclimating to primal ki. Until then, their output is capped at 50% strength. <span>(Once the human has completed the five trainings in the form, this is null)</span></li></ul><ul><li><strong>♻️ Mortal Drift:</strong> The Saiyan risks subconsciously reverting to their mortal Super Human  state, unaware of the shift, leading to sudden drops in efficiency. <span>(Once Mastered, this is null)</span></li></ul><ul><li><strong>👹 Feral Instincts:</strong> The saiyan's personality shifts into a more serious and primitive one making them extremely difficult to reason with. <span>(Once Mastered, this is null)</span></li></ul><ul><li><strong>⛔ Primal Ki Restriction:</strong> Without constant control, the form can abruptly collapse, reverting the user to base mid-battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌪️ Ki Overload Risk:</strong> Absorbing too much nature energy without balance causes temporary paralysis or form cancellation.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 10,000x [180,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 14,000x [500,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1237559554666008767/1428832533553877104","messageId":"1428832533553877104","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Sage Mode  🌟 Through intense meditation and spiritual refinement, the user learns to absorb and harmonize with the life energy of their surroundings — the essence known as Natural Ki. Upon"},{"title":"Senjutsu’s Fury 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://media4.giphy.com/media/v1.Y2lkPTc5MGI3NjExcmtkZzZ5ajd4eWlpZHpuNnU3Zml2bGJsZ2ZyOGV4Njg2c3QzbXlqZyZlcD12MV9pbnRlcm5hbF9naWZfYnlfaWQmY3Q9Zw/3oFzm0SGGN13ym2fqE/giphy.gif\">Senjutsu’s Fury</a> 🌟</h1>When harmony collapses under the weight of emotion, and balance becomes something to be felt rather than controlled, the Sage transcends into Verdant Ascension. Their aura erupts into a luminous storm of green, gold, and silver energy — raw life force made visible. Patterns resembling roots and vines flicker across their skin like living tattoos, pulsing in rhythm with their heartbeat. Their eyes shift into radiant amber or emerald, reflecting nature’s primal consciousness now flowing through them. This form represents the moment when the Sage stops channeling nature — and instead becomes it. Calm yet feral, wise yet wrathful, they embody the duality of creation and destruction that defines all living energy.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Senjutsu’s Fury ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🌲 Nature’s Pulse:</strong> The user’s Ki harmonizes with the environment, restoring 5% Health and 10% Ki per turn while fighting in a natural or outdoor setting.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💢 Primal Fury:</strong> When near defeat, the user instinctively draws on a hidden reserve of primal might, granting a temporary surge in strength (x1.5 boost).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💥 Overpowering Pressure:</strong> The user’s aura radiates crushing dominance. Enemies within 20 meters suffer -15% speed and -10% Ki efficiency as long as the form is maintained.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚔️ Harmonic Strikes:</strong> Physical and ki-based attacks bypass 10% of enemy defenses, cutting through barriers with natural precision.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌀 Limit Break Pulse:</strong> Once per battle, the user may surge their aura explosively, doubling their damage for 1 turn but draining 15% of total Health.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of Gaia:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Primal Energy:</strong> The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 1,000,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Mastery of Sage Mode</li></ul><ul><li>Achieve spiritual synchronization with Primal Nature Energy through guided meditation, environmental trials, or emotional turmoil (event-based).</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⌛ Severe Stamina Drain:</strong> This form consumes 75% more stamina, making prolonged combat dangerous even for seasoned users.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💔 Cellular Strain:</strong> The condensed primal ki tears at the body; every 3 turns, the user loses 5% Health passively.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Overload Risk:</strong> if primal ki isn’t regulated properly, the lightning arcs may destabilize techniques, reducing ki efficiency by 20% for the rest of the fight.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⏳ Turn Cap:</strong> after 15 turns, fatigue reverts the user to SSBE</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⛔ No Recovery:</strong> While active, natural healing and regeneration effects are nullified; the body is too overclocked to repair itself.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 18,000x [1,000,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 22,000x [3,000,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1237559554666008767/1428838165279412264","messageId":"1428838165279412264","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Senjutsu’s Fury  🌟 When harmony collapses under the weight of emotion, and balance becomes something to be felt rather than controlled, the Sage transcends into Verdant Ascension. Their aur"},{"title":"Baryon’s Emergence 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://tenor.com/view/naruto-baryon-mode-baryon-naruto-baryon-mode-baka-gif-23147702\">Baryon’s Emergence</a> 🌟 </h1>When a Super Earthling transcends the limits of Sagehood, they unlock a state few can even comprehend — Baryon’s Emergence. This form manifests when the user fuses their own life energy with the raw essence of nature, creating a burning equilibrium of existence and annihilation. Their aura ignites into a brilliant golden-orange inferno threaded with streaks of crimson and white — each flicker eroding the boundaries between body, spirit, and energy. Their eyes glow with blinding luminescence, and even the air distorts around them as space bends to contain the overwhelming fusion of vitality and nature.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Baryon’s Emergence ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>⚡ Prime Peak:</strong> The body is restored to its ultimate prime; physical attacks deal 2x damage due to heightened efficiency and precision.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💥 Overpowering Pressure:</strong> The user’s aura radiates crushing dominance. Enemies within 20 meters suffer -15% speed and -10% Ki efficiency as long as the form is maintained.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Vital Conversion:</strong> The user’s life energy is refined into raw combat potential. All stats are multiplied by x2, and each physical strike drains 3% of the opponent’s Ki and Health on contact.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌿 Senjutsu Confluence:</strong> Combines natural energy with internal Ki. Ki techniques gain a 30% power increase and can bypass conventional resistances — striking both physical and spiritual defenses simultaneously.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>☯️ Baryon Surge:</strong> Upon dropping below 20% Health, the user’s next attack automatically becomes a Critical Hit with +100% base damage — a final surge of dying brilliance.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of Gaia:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Primal Energy:</strong> The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Must have Mastered Senjutsu’s Fury.</li></ul><ul><li>Base Power Level of 7,000,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Completion of the “Cycle of Life” storyline quest (achieved by surviving three life-threatening meditations under the Sage Tree).</li></ul><ul><li>Must complete the “Fusion of Breath” ritual — combining one’s lifeforce with natural energy for a full post cycle under a Sage NPC’s supervision.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>💀 Life Drain:</strong> Each post drains 12% of user’s Health and 8% of total Ki — this cannot be healed or prevented while the form is active.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⏳ Limited Duration:</strong> Can be sustained for a maximum of 10 posts. When the form ends, the user immediately collapses and enters a comatose state for 3 days or until revived.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧘 Isolation of Energy:</strong> The user cannot receive outside Ki or healing from allies during this state — their energy field rejects interference.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚖️ No Reversion:</strong> Once activated, the user cannot deactivate Baryon’s Emergence early — it persists until exhaustion or defeat.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 26,000x</strong></li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1237559554666008767/1428842669496467477","messageId":"1428842669496467477","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Baryon’s Emergence  🌟  When a Super Earthling transcends the limits of Sagehood, they unlock a state few can even comprehend — Baryon’s Emergence. This form manifests when the user fuses th"}],"notes":[],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1237559554666008767","imageOnly":false,"classification":"normal"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335293889086754910","formCount":13,"art":"assets/brand.png","sparkingNotes":["The Jinago branch is explicitly marked (SPARKING!) in the current racial Basic Information. Its full mechanical descriptions remain available on its form cards."]},{"name":"Tuffle","slug":"tuffle","accent":"#ffc279","shade":"#a64e50","description":"The Tuffles are a diminutive but highly intelligent race originating from Planet Sadala, later settling on Planet Plant after centuries of conflict and hardship. Their society is built on knowledge, technological mastery, and surv…","about":[{"title":"🧬 The Tuffles 🧬","html":"<div><span><h1>🧬 The Tuffles 🧬</h1>The Tuffles are a diminutive but highly intelligent race originating from Planet Sadala, later settling on Planet Plant after centuries of conflict and hardship. Their society is built on knowledge, technological mastery, and survival, allowing them to thrive despite their physical disadvantages compared to larger, more brutish races. \nWith a deep-rooted affinity for science and engineering, Tuffles have revolutionized biological and mechanical advancements, making them one of the most technologically superior races in the universe. However, their genetic experiments led to the emergence of the Neo-Mutants, a faction of bio-enhanced Tuffles capable of parasitic assimilation, a dangerous but powerful evolution of their race. While Tuffles often favor diplomacy over combat, their unparalleled ingenuity, adaptability, and tactical brilliance make them formidable when forced into conflict.\n<h1><s>--------------------------------------------------</s></h1><ul><li><strong>🧠 Tuffle Strengths 🧠</strong><ul><li><strong>🔧 Technological Genius:</strong> Tuffles excel in mechanical and scientific advancements, capable of constructing powerful machinery, cybernetics, and advanced weaponry that rival the strongest warriors.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Enhanced Intelligence:</strong> Naturally gifted with superior intellect, Tuffles process information faster than most races, allowing them to strategize, problem-solve, and create new technology at an unmatched pace.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🤸‍♂️ Agile Combatants:</strong> Their small stature makes them swift, nimble, and evasive, allowing them to outmaneuver physically superior opponents in battle.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Tuffle Weaknesses ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🔮 Magical Aversion:</strong> Tuffles have a biological vulnerability to Fulgurmancy (Lightning Magic), as their electro-based technology is highly susceptible to disruption.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>📏 Vertical Restriction:</strong> Tuffles are naturally short, with the tallest recorded member only reaching 5'7\". While this makes them nimble, it also means they struggle against larger and physically imposing foes.</li></ul></li></ul># <s>--------------------------------------------------</s></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335293960595177592/1340149946808139847","messageId":"1340149946808139847"},{"title":"Tuffle Abilities 💥 ✨ Ki Manipulation: While not naturally Ki-based, Tuffles have learned to enhance their energy projection","html":"<div><span><ul><li><strong>💥 Tuffle Abilities 💥</strong><ul><li>✨ Ki Manipulation: While not naturally Ki-based, Tuffles have learned to enhance their energy projection through technology and genetic augmentation.</li></ul><ul><li>🧬 Bio-Engineering: Tuffles can alter genetic material, modifying themselves or others through scientific means, allowing them to create enhanced lifeforms or genetic augmentations.</li></ul><ul><li>⚡ Energy Absorption: Some Tuffles have developed energy siphoning technology, enabling them to absorb and redirect energy-based attacks.</li></ul><ul><li>🦎 Adaptive Camouflage: Utilizing advanced nano-technology, Tuffles can blend into their surroundings, making them nearly invisible to the naked eye.</li></ul><ul><li><strong> ⚔️ Zenkai:</strong> When a Tuffle’s health drops below 15% and they survive, their body adapts and permanently increases their Power Level by 25%–100%, <span>(-10% for SPARKING)</span> and a maximum of 3 Zenkais per saga/major arc. Non-lethal injuries do not trigger Zenkai, and immediate medical, magical, or technological healing caps the boost at 25%.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🌟 Special Abilities 🌟</strong><ul><li>🔰 Photon Barrier: </li></ul><ul><li>Tuffles have developed an advanced energy shield known as the Photon Barrier, a high-density force field capable of absorbing most energy-based attacks for a short duration. </li></ul><ul><li>Limited to 3 uses per battle due to its high energy consumption.</li></ul><ul><li>🦠 Neo Evolution\n<ul><li>Parasitic Overwrite: A Neo-Mutant Tuffle can infect a host with microscopic bio-machinery, gradually overwriting their consciousness and enhancing their own power.</li></ul><ul><li>Adaptive Evolution: Absorbing hosts allows them to gain genetic traits and abilities, though only one trait can be permanently retained per host.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li>Limitations:\n<ul><li>The process takes time and cannot be forced instantly on strong-willed targets.</li></ul><ul><li>They must weaken a host significantly before attempting a full takeover.</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul># <s>--------------------------------------------------</s></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335293960595177592/1340149992207155281","messageId":"1340149992207155281"},{"title":"Untitled section","html":"<div><span><ul><li><strong>📜 Starting Techniques / Caps and Boosts 📜</strong><ul><li>Flight (Support Technique)</li></ul><ul><li>Afterimage (Support Technique)</li></ul><ul><li>Nanobot Barrage (Super Technique)</li></ul><ul><li>Techno-Strike (Super Technique)</li></ul><ul><li>Bio-Circuitry Shield (Support Technique)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Neo-Mutants</strong><ul><li>Minor Mimicry (Support Technique)</li></ul><ul><li>Genetic Rewrite (Super Technique) – Enhances the user's DNA mid-battle, temporarily boosting power.</li></ul></li></ul></li><li><strong>👑 Royal Class:</strong><ul><li><strong>⚡ Ultimate Technique:</strong> Supreme Mind Overload</li></ul><ul><li>Emits an omnidirectional psychic pulse, temporarily disorienting all enemies within range and leaving them vulnerable to attacks.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Super Technique:</strong> Neural Override\n<ul><li>Allows the user to override the motor functions of a target for a few seconds, forcing them to stop or attack allies.</li></ul></li></ul></li><li><strong>⚔️ Super-Elite Class:</strong><ul><li><strong>⚡ Ultimate Technique:</strong> Techno-Swarm Assault</li></ul><ul><li>Deploys a swarm of nanobots to drain energy and disrupt enemy movement.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Super Technique:</strong> Data Assimilation\n<ul><li>Briefly copies an opponent’s last-used technique and adapts it for counter-play.</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul><h1><s>--------------------------------------------------</s></h1><ul><li><strong><span>@Tuffle (Echelon)</span> | <span>@Tuffle (Genetic)</span></strong><ul><li>Rage Boost: 1.25x</li></ul><ul><li>Potential Boost: 10%</li></ul><ul><li>Ki Reserves: 105%</li></ul></li></ul><span><strong><code>SPARKING!</code></strong></span><ul><li><strong><span>@Tuffle (Neo-Mutant)</span></strong></li></ul><ul><li>Rage Boost: 2.5x (+20% every 6 posts)</li></ul><ul><li>Potential Boost: 25%</li></ul><ul><li>Ki/Mana Reserves: 300%</li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335293960595177592/1340150114437562495","messageId":"1340150114437562495"},{"title":"Quick Trip","html":"<div><span><h1>Quick Trip</h1><a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335293960595177592/1340149946808139847\">Racial Info</a></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335293960595177592/1405211829873017008","messageId":"1405211829873017008"}],"paths":[{"name":"Foundational forms","kind":"core","forms":[{"title":"Bio-Core 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://images-wixmp-ed30a86b8c4ca887773594c2.wixmp.com/f/8b3d28fb-af4b-4717-b132-533535289172/df5ynnq-4f95bfe3-9c75-4047-a8d8-8ca8b7f1eef9.png/v1/fill/w_400,h_731/hatchiyack_by_crysisking2021_df5ynnq-fullview.png?token=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..dfPZ48YuithURdJ2o-U97wixT-PXdv3jPo1OokEe9zc\">Bio-Core</a> 🌟</h1>The Bio-Core Form is the awakening of the Tuffle’s most ancient biological lineage—an evolutionary echo of their raw, unshaped potential. Triggered through emotional extremes or guided meditation, this transformation reshapes the user into a towering, biomechanical juggernaut of intellect-infused power. Their height swells dramatically, ranging between 60 and 120 feet tall, their exoskeleton becoming a polished mesh of deep crimson and glistening pink. Embedded within their limbs and chest glow pulsating green cores—organic conduits of energy and memory tied to their genetic heritage. Their once-familiar eyes dim to a pale yellow, glowing faintly like machines that have just reawakened after millennia.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Bio-Core ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🧪 Elemental Absorption:</strong> Temporarily harness elemental energies (fire, earth, wind, water) from the surrounding environment to empower attacks or build reactive barriers.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧲 Energy Resonance:</strong> The embedded green orbs allow passive energy siphoning from local sources, weakening nearby energy-based techniques and amplifying the user’s own power.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧱 Titanic Size:</strong> With their colossal height, their physical reach, area control, and durability increase, enabling them to overpower opponents through sheer presence.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>📡 Signal Pulse:</strong> The form can emit bursts of pressure or energy pulses that disrupt basic tech or overwhelm weaker minds with raw intensity.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>The user must be driven by intense rage or emotion OR undergo extended meditation focused on ancestral resonance.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>(Optional)</strong> Exposure to ancient Tuffle relics or genetic triggers may speed up awakening.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⛓️ Initial Instability:</strong> This form is difficult to control on first use; combat behavior may become unpredictable or erratic.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🪫 Heavy Stamina Drain:</strong> Prolonged use rapidly exhausts the user, leaving them vulnerable or unconscious after deactivation.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Use:</strong> 10x [Birth]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Use:</strong> 25x (250,000 &amp; Optional Requirement)</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335293960595177592/1391834313384923237","messageId":"1391834313384923237","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Bio-Core  🌟 The Bio-Core Form is the awakening of the Tuffle’s most ancient biological lineage—an evolutionary echo of their raw, unshaped potential. Triggered through emotional extremes or"},{"title":"Bio-Enforcer 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://imgur.com/LqIFNqs\">Bio-Enforcer</a> 🌟</h1>The Bio-Enforcer Form is a refined and militarized mutation of the original Tuffle transformation, representing mastery over their proto-biological state and control over their hybridized instincts. The user’s body becomes a crimson monolith—thick, plated, and crowned with radiant green orbs pulsing like living reactors. Their physique becomes even more exaggerated: sharp musculature, reinforced plating, and a domineering aura of authority.\nNo longer just primal might, this form symbolizes the Tuffle’s transformation into a living weapon. It is rage guided by logic, instinct shaped by engineering. In this state, a Tuffle becomes a battlefield juggernaut—able to shrug off volleys of energy, redirect power with bio-electric precision, and recover from injury mid-assault.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Bio-Enforcer ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🧿 Bio-Energy Shielding:</strong> Generates a semi-autonomous protective barrier that absorbs and reflects Super attacks once every 3 turns.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Bio-Electric Control:</strong> The user gains access to high-voltage bio-electric pulses that can paralyze targets, supercharge strikes, or destabilize energy constructs.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧬 Accelerated Regeneration:</strong> While transformed, minor to moderate injuries recover in seconds, and major damage heals significantly faster between turns.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔁 Core Mechanic Inheritance:</strong> Elemental Absorption, Energy Resonance, and Signal Pulse from the <u>Bio-Core</u> form are retained and enhanced—now functioning with greater range, potency, and reactivity.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Mastery of the Bio-Core Form.</li></ul><ul><li>Base Power Level of 12,000,000.</li></ul><ul><li>Must engage in either:\n<ul><li>Prolonged solo combat (over 10+ turns) to sharpen instinct.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><ul><li><strong>OR</strong><ul><li>Intensive mental training to align the Tuffle’s mind with their enhanced biology.</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>💥 Aggression Spike:</strong> The user becomes increasingly irritable or domineering in this form, risking irrational combat decisions.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Cognitive Drain:</strong> Extended use dulls strategic thinking, pushing the user toward brute force over finesse.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔋 Energy Burnout:</strong> Rapid regeneration and shielding consume more energy each turn. Users with low Ki Reserves will burn out faster.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Use:</strong> ×100 (12,000,000)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Use:</strong> ×250 (28,000,000</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335293960595177592/1391834320586670131","messageId":"1391834320586670131","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Bio-Enforcer  🌟 The Bio-Enforcer Form is a refined and militarized mutation of the original Tuffle transformation, representing mastery over their proto-biological state and control over th"},{"title":"Overlord Core 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/perfect-power-level-list/images/a/a9/Super_Grudge_Amplification_Hatchiyack_Prison_Planet.webp/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/640?cb=20240123065041\">Overlord Core</a> 🌟</h1>The Overlord Core Form represents the final perfected stage of the Tuffle’s bio-engineered transformation line. This evolution is not merely physical—it is symbolic of complete symbiosis between Tuffle intellect and genetic might. The user’s body becomes heavily reinforced with an iridescent red and green bio-armor, veined with pulsating energy channels. Towering horns sprout from the head, and every movement exudes dominance and unyielding intent.\nThe transformation ignites a core of burning willpower fused with ancestral memory, giving rise to a being that embodies the legacy of the Tuffle people—resolute, unforgiving, and radiating with latent fury.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Overlord Core ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>♻️ Advanced Regeneration:</strong> Can regenerate deep tissue injuries or near-fatal wounds over time, healing at double the rate of the Bio-Enforcer Form.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧬 Core Mechanic Inheritance:</strong> Elemental Absorption, Energy Resonance, Signal Pulse, Bio-Energy Shielding, and Bio-Electric Control remain active and fully empowered in this form, functioning with high-precision control.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Overload Pulse:</strong> The user can release a wave of destabilized energy stored in the bio-cores, knocking back enemies and nullifying active debuffs once per transformation.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Full Mastery of Bio-Enforcer Form.</li></ul><ul><li>Suffer a critical loss</li></ul><ul><li>Base Power Level of 50,000,000.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🔥 Massive Energy Demand:</strong> Maintaining this form burns through stamina at an aggressive rate; extended usage results in a dramatic crash.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Willpower Strain:</strong> The mental toll of channeling the ancestral force can lead to moments of emotional instability or berserker tendencies.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🛌 Post-Combat Exhaustion:</strong> After deactivating this form, the user suffers severe fatigue, reducing all though processing for 1 full turn.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>❗ Form Lockout:</strong> If forced to revert from Overlord Core due to stamina depletion, the user cannot re-enter it for the remainder of the encounter.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li>🔺 First Use: ×400 (50,000,000)</li></ul><ul><li>🔺 Second Use: ×800 (75,000,000)</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335293960595177592/1391834361988645065","messageId":"1391834361988645065","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Overlord Core  🌟 The Overlord Core Form represents the final perfected stage of the Tuffle’s bio-engineered transformation line. This evolution is not merely physical—it is symbolic of comp"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335293960595177592","notes":[],"classification":"foundational"},{"name":"Dark Echelon Path","kind":"branch","forms":[{"title":"Malevolence Factor 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/villains/images/b/b5/Snapshothearts.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20190712133933\">Malevolence Factor</a>🌟</h1>This is the first descent into the Tuffle’s twisted genius—a transformation born not from instinct, but from raw ambition corrupted by rage. Upon awakening this form, the user’s skin takes on an ashen hue while their eyes blaze with a cold, crimson malice. Their aura churns with a dark, pulsating energy that crackles and distorts the air, a manifestation of unrelenting cunning and repressed fury. This is not madness—it is clarity through cruelty. The user no longer fights for victory. They fight to dominate, dissect, and destroy with precise brutality.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Malevolence Factor ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🧠 Tactical Supremacy:</strong> Gain enhanced combat prediction. Opponent’s next move can be anticipated once per turn, granting +10% dodge and +10% critical chance.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧲 Fear Manipulation:</strong> Nearby enemies suffer -5% evasion and -10% morale-based resistances as long as they are within 15 meters of the user.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌀 Psychic Overdrive:</strong> Once every 6 turns, inflict a Psychic Paralysis effect that delays an enemy’s turn by 1 phase and reduces their next technique’s damage by 25%.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 180,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>The user must undergo a moment of intense moral collapse during roleplay—abandoning, betraying, or sacrificing someone or something they once valued deeply for personal gain.</li></ul><ul><li>Must engage in a conflict where they fight without restraint, embracing their darkest instincts for survival or revenge (must last at least 6 turns and be done without transformation at the start).</li></ul><ul><li>The user must willingly tap into Divine Energy through corrupted means—either absorbing it from a corrupted relic, siphoning it from another being, a ritual, or using an experimental device that exposes them to unstable divine resonance.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🧠 Mental Degradation:</strong> Maintaining this form for too long induces paranoia and delusions. After 10 turns, the user begins suffering -5% focus per turn.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💀 Impulse Surge:</strong> If the user fails to end a fight within 15 turns, they suffer a -20% penalty to all defensive stats as their mind begins to unravel.</li></ul><ul><li>⚠️ Blindness Risk: Overuse of this form across multiple sessions (3+ in a week) may result in temporary blindness, recoverable only through rest or advanced healing.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Use:</strong> 10,000x (180,000,000)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Use:</strong> 14,000x (500,000,000)</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1390722269348626434/1390734293524807773","messageId":"1390734293524807773","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Malevolence Factor 🌟 This is the first descent into the Tuffle’s twisted genius—a transformation born not from instinct, but from raw ambition corrupted by rage. Upon awakening this form, t"},{"title":"Malefic Ascension 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://i.makeagif.com/media/7-29-2019/5DXUEj.gif\">Malefic Ascension</a> 🌟</h1>Malefic Ascension marks the moment a Tuffle forgoes all restraint, fully surrendering to the abyssal powers they've communed with. Their body darkens to an almost ethereal gray, with crimson-glowing eyes that pierce through darkness like twin lances of hate. A jagged, violet aura coils around them like a living entity—radiating a cold, suffocating pressure that twists the air and cracks the ground. The user's mind becomes razor-sharp, their intent singular and corrupted: domination through intellect and dread.\nThis is not a form of rage or brute force. It is deliberate evil, honed through cold logic and sealed with an irreversible pact of subjugation to something far older than themselves.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Malefic Ascension ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🧠 Mind Break:</strong> Enemies within a 20-meter radius suffer -10% focus and defense due to hallucinations, psychic distortion, and dread-based passive effects.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💥 Corruption Surge:</strong> Basic and special attacks have a 35% chance to destabilize enemy energy constructs (barriers, ki attacks, etc.), lowering their effectiveness.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌌 Event Collapse:</strong> Once per fight, the user may cancel one enemy ultimate or transformation attempt, replacing it with a forced backlash (40% Ki drain, 2-turn stun, enemy must be up to 1.5x stronger).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧬 Absolute Dominance:</strong> Once every 10 turns, the user may auto-succeed a bind, snare, or knockback attempt due to their overwhelming aura.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 1,000,000,000.</li></ul><ul><li>Must have mastered Evil Factor and used it in at least 3 major roleplay battles.</li></ul><ul><li>Must bind a portion of a demonic entity’s soul to their own through a dark pact. This IC ritual must be roleplayed in detail and involves a major personal sacrifice (ally, memory, technique, etc.).</li></ul><ul><li>The user must permanently sever their emotional tether to someone or something meaningful, symbolizing the rejection of humanity and logic.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>😵‍💫 Identity Fragmentation:</strong> The more the form is used, the more unstable the user's core self becomes. After 3 consecutive fights in this form, they must rest IC or risk losing control for one full event.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💔 Aura Contamination:</strong> Allies within 10m may feel faint or emotionally off-balance due to the passive demonic energy; this can affect coordination.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💀 Self-Destructive Aura:</strong> If used for longer than 10 turns, the body begins to degrade, dealing 5% max Health damage per turn until deactivation.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔒 Internal Lock:</strong> This form cannot be deactivated mid-combat without an IC trigger or failure, once initiated.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Use:</strong> 18,000x (1,000,000,000)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Use:</strong> 22,000x (3,000,000,000)</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1390722269348626434/1390736438588604629","messageId":"1390736438588604629","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Malefic Ascension  🌟 Malefic Ascension marks the moment a Tuffle forgoes all restraint, fully surrendering to the abyssal powers they've communed with. Their body darkens to an almost ether"},{"title":"Malbrain Sigil 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://i.makeagif.com/media/12-03-2020/Gq5ag5.gif\">Malbrain Sigil</a> 🌟</h1>Malbrain Sigil represents the final convergence of Tuffle intellect with demonic force, where the mind no longer wrestles with evil—it commands it. Their appearance becomes refined yet alien—features sharpened with precision, their body encased in patterns of glowing circuitry, and eyes gleaming with a golden-red hue that pierces through any façade.\nThe aura no longer screams—it hums with pure destructive intention, pulsing like a dark machine wrapped in crimson lightning. They are not just empowered—they are rewritten, restructured into the ultimate predator of willpower and logic.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Malbrain Sigil ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🩸 Voidframe Integration:</strong> The user can phase through solid matter for 1 turn every 4 turns, and becomes immune to traps, binds, and terrain hazards while active.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Hellfire Assimilation:</strong> All physical strikes are laced with hellfire that ignores conventional armor and continues burning over 2 turns (5% Health per turn unless resisted).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Mindlock Field:</strong> Opponents within 25 meters must pass a mental resistance check every 6 turns or suffer action delay (1 turn cooldown on basic techniques).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔱 Singularity Step:</strong> Grants short-range void-based teleportation, enabling them to instantly reposition once every other round—also usable to dodge ultimates (once per combat).</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 7,000,000,000.</li></ul><ul><li>Mastery of Malefic Ascension</li></ul><ul><li>Must survive the Absorption of a Core Demon Essence—a ritual involving the compression and fusion of a demonic being’s life force into the Tuffle’s own neural web.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>💥 Overclocked Overload:</strong> After 8 active turns, user begins suffering internal Ki backlash (-10% Ki per turn until deactivation).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧬 Echo of Madness:</strong> Exposure to Malbrain Sigil leaves behind demonic residue in the user’s psyche, causing brief hallucinations or memory lapses between transformations.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🚫 Allied Interference:</strong> No buffs, healing, or team-based synergy bonuses may be received while this form is active—it is total isolation.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li>🔺 26,000x</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1390722269348626434/1390738519021981876","messageId":"1390738519021981876","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Malbrain Sigil  🌟 Malbrain Sigil represents the final convergence of Tuffle intellect with demonic force, where the mind no longer wrestles with evil—it commands it. Their appearance become"}],"notes":[],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1390722269348626434","imageOnly":false,"classification":"normal"},{"name":"Genetic Evolution Path","kind":"branch","forms":[{"title":"Overdrive 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://tenor.com/view/gogeta-broly-transform-super-saiyan-gif-22424609\">Overdrive</a> 🌟</h1>Genetic Overdrive marks the first breakthrough in the Tuffles’ emulation of Saiyan ascension—a form not awakened by instinct, but by pure intellect sharpened by emotional turmoil. Developed through a combination of genetic manipulation and emotional volatility—particularly envy, rage, and revenge—this form surges with burning bio-energy that mimics the chaotic power of a Super Saiyan, but refined and stabilized by Tuffle intellect.\nUpon activation, the user's hair may stand on end and shimmer with a golden or high-frequency electric hue. Their body becomes bathed in a surging, golden-yellow aura laced with fine arcs of teal bio-circuitry. Muscles slightly bulk without becoming overgrown, and the eyes glow with calculated intensity—no longer just emotional fire, but predatory focus.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Genetic Overdrive ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🧠 Mimicked Instincts:</strong> Grants rapid reaction time boosts akin to primitive Saiyan instincts, but with more precise control—allowing the user to calculate reflexive counters in milliseconds.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Enhanced Neural Acceleration:</strong> The Tuffle’s nervous system accelerates thought and movement, improving both combat strategy and execution in real time.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Bioflare Overclock:</strong> Briefly overcharges the user’s aura with unstable energy, increasing offensive output for a short burst (once per combat scene).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧬 Adaptive Genome Surge:</strong> The transformation forces a rapid mutation in the Tuffle’s genetic structure, allowing their body to adapt mid-battle to certain forms of energy or technique types. After being struck by a specific kind of attack (e.g., Ki-based, elemental, kinetic), the user's body temporarily resists or mitigates similar damage for the next 2–3 turns.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧬 Zenkai Amplification:</strong> Once the Tuffle undergoes the Saiyan DNA infusion of this form, their minimum and maximum Zenkai boost thresholds are raised by +5%, This passive enhancement reflects the body's increasing compatibility with post-battle evolution. Wounds heal faster, the combat body adapts more aggressively to trauma, and power rebounds harder than before — all while retaining the Tuffle’s </li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 180,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Undergo a Controlled Rage Protocol, in which the user must experience a moment of overwhelming emotional instability (envy, vengeance, fear of inferiority) while under stress.</li></ul><ul><li>Complete an experimental neuro-trigger calibration, which syncs emotion-driven bursts with cerebral regulation—performed via advanced Tuffle lab equipment or extreme combat meditation.</li></ul><ul><li>Get 10% Saiyan DNA infused into your DNA</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🧠  Overclock Fatigue:</strong> Prolonged use exhausts the nervous system, reducing reaction time and focus post-transformation.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Aura Feedback:</strong> The unstable biofield may cause self-damage during extreme output spikes (especially if Bioflare Overclock is abused).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💢 Emotion Echo:</strong> Triggers underlying emotional instability. The user may become hyper-focused on vengeance or comparison, causing irrational combat behavior.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧬 Identity Fracture (10%):</strong> Minor surges of battle-euphoria and aggression. The user occasionally struggles to restrain violent urges mid-fight and may dismiss tactical opportunities in favor of brute force.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Use:</strong> 10,000x [180,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Use:</strong> 14,000x [500,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1392905491893456916/1392908313460736134","messageId":"1392908313460736134","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Overdrive  🌟 Genetic Overdrive marks the first breakthrough in the Tuffles’ emulation of Saiyan ascension—a form not awakened by instinct, but by pure intellect sharpened by emotional turmo"},{"title":"Burning Ascent 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://tenor.com/view/hearts-dbs-dbz-dragon-ball-super-super-hero-dragon-ball-gif-13528355224115861089\">Burning Ascent</a> 🌟</h1>The Burning Ascent form represents a breakthrough in genetic acceleration, triggered not by primal rage—but by calculated fury. Fueled by resentment and rivalry toward Saiyan dominance, Tuffles channel their intellect into a powerful evolution of form and function. Upon transformation, the user’s physique becomes leaner yet radiates absolute control and refinement. Their skin takes on a pale, semi-lustrous glow, while their aura burns gold with flickers of crimson embers, resembling energy calculated rather than unleashed. The transformation exudes confidence, arrogance, and calm devastation—less wild and more surgical.\nThe user’s eyes ignite with high-intensity red irises, reflecting their hyper-focused processing speed. Their voice deepens with reverb, and their movements blur with mechanical precision—no wasted energy, only optimized destruction.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Burning Ascent ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🧠 Neuro-Kinetic Surge:</strong> Dramatically enhances reaction time and perception, allowing near-instant counters and predictive combat.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔋 Adaptive Genome Surge:</strong> The Tuffle can momentarily adapt to the energy signature of attacks received, reducing damage from similar types for several turns.\n<ul><li><strong>🌀 Aura Compression Field:</strong> The user can condense their aura for explosive speed and short-range burst movements, ideal for overwhelming slower enemies.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧬 Zenkai Amplification:</strong> Once the Tuffle undergoes the Saiyan DNA infusion of this form, their minimum and maximum Zenkai boost thresholds are raised by +10%, This passive enhancement reflects the body's increasing compatibility with post-battle evolution. Wounds heal faster, the combat body adapts more aggressively to trauma, and power rebounds harder than before — all while retaining the Tuffle’s advanced energy control. </li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Mastery of Overdrive</li></ul><ul><li>Undergo a ritualized DNA stimulation process using synthetic neural modulators or rare alien tech.</li></ul><ul><li>Get 20% Saiyan DNA infused into your DNA </li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⛔ Overload Hazard:</strong> Excessive use of Overclocked Processing leads to temporary neural shutdown (user is stunned for 1 turn if used 3 times in rapid succession).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💢 Emotion Suppression:</strong> This form suppresses empathy and emotional connection, potentially harming allies or teammates in collateral outbursts.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔻 Aura Burnout:</strong> After deactivating the form, user suffers reduced Ki efficiency for a short period, weakening ranged attacks.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧬 Identity Fracture (20%):</strong> Noticeable emotional volatility. The user becomes prone to impulse-driven decisions, especially in high-stress situations. Their ability to strategize is diminished the longer the form is active.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Use:</strong> 18,000x [1,000,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Use:</strong> 22,000x [3,000,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1392905491893456916/1392912988687568997","messageId":"1392912988687568997","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Burning Ascent  🌟 The Burning Ascent form represents a breakthrough in genetic acceleration, triggered not by primal rage—but by calculated fury. Fueled by resentment and rivalry toward Sai"},{"title":"Solar Core 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://tenor.com/view/hearts-ultimate-hearts-godslayer-hearts-hearts-dbh-hearts-sdbh-gif-27222620\">Solar Core</a> 🌟</h1>The culmination of the Tuffle’s most daring act of self-evolution, Burning Apex marks the final fusion of intellect and instinct, of science and savagery. With 30% Saiyan DNA now fully integrated into their biology, the user reaches a state that blurs the line between manufactured brilliance and raw, primal dominance. Their body radiates an incandescent, almost divine yellow-gold glow, encased in bio-armor that crackles with chaotic plasma and sharpened focus. Crimson eyes pierce through the battlefield, and every movement leaves behind trails of distorted light and heat — a symbol of their absolute transcendence.\nIn this form, the Tuffle no longer mimics the Saiyan; they perfect the concept of transformation through controlled combustion of both rage and resolve.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Solar Core ⚙️</strong></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Overclocked Mind-State:</strong> The user’s thought process accelerates exponentially, enabling them to anticipate enemy actions and devise countermeasures in near real-time.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💥 Ignition Break:</strong> The user can focus all energy into a single catastrophic burst, temporarily doubling offensive power but deactivating the form afterward.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧬 Zenkai Amplification:</strong> Once the Tuffle undergoes the Saiyan DNA infusion of this form, their minimum and maximum Zenkai boost thresholds are raised by +15%, This passive enhancement reflects the body's increasing compatibility with post-battle evolution. Wounds heal faster, the combat body adapts more aggressively to trauma, and power rebounds harder than before — all while retaining the Tuffle’s advanced energy control.</li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong></li></ul><ul><li>Mastery of Burning Ascent</li></ul><ul><li>The user must endure a near-death experience through absorption of an entire star, either through artificial containment or raw consumption or reactor overload, pushing both body and mind to complete ignition.</li></ul><ul><li>Get 30% Saiyan DNA infused into your DNA</li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧬 Identity Fracture (30%):</strong> The user risks full cognitive dissonance — moments where their Saiyan instincts override their Tuffle intellect, causing them to enter a berserk-like state. While this can temporarily raise their power even further, they lose the ability to distinguish friend from foe unless forcibly snapped out of it.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Overheat Surge:</strong> Remaining in this form for more than five consecutive posts causes the user’s core temperature to rise uncontrollably, weakening defenses and potentially knocking them unconscious if not reverted.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔋 Core Instability:</strong> Maintaining the power of a star causes the user's body to constantly teeter on the brink of implosion. Overuse may result in total physical collapse.</li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Use:</strong> 26,000x (7,000,000,000)</li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1392905491893456916/1392916594228854836","messageId":"1392916594228854836","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Solar Core  🌟 The culmination of the Tuffle’s most daring act of self-evolution, Burning Apex marks the final fusion of intellect and instinct, of science and savagery. With 30% Saiyan DNA"}],"notes":[],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1392905491893456916","imageOnly":false,"classification":"normal"},{"name":"Neo-Mutant Path","kind":"branch","forms":[{"title":"Parasitic Embryo 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://media.tenor.com/4B4S_ZyQ78oAAAAM/baby-dragon.gif\">Parasitic Embryo</a> 🌟</h1>The Parasitic Embryo marks the terrifying birth of a Neo-Mutant Tuffle—an unstable entity forged from corrupted Tuffle genetics and sinister experimentation. In this initial form, the Neo-Mutant is more a lurking parasite than a warrior, existing as a small, sentient core that seeks out and inhabits a host. The transformation lacks brute strength but makes up for it with cunning and adaptability. Their aura is barely visible—distorted and dark, flickering like interference on a screen. Their voice echoes with dual tones, as if overlapping the consciousness of their host. In this phase, they are quietly evolving, watching, learning... preparing.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Parasitic Embryo ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🧠 Possession:</strong> Allows the Neo-Mutant to briefly inhabit another living being (NPC or enemy) to glean memories, fighting style, and surface abilities. Duration is limited, and damage transfers back partially.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔄 Energy Absorption:</strong> Gradually siphons ambient energy and low-level attacks to restore minor HP and stamina over time.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧬 Adaptive Genome:</strong> Each time the Neo-Mutant is exposed to a new race's technique or energy signature, it can “tag” it—unlocking future evolutionary potential. (Only one tag can be held at this stage.)</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Simply be born/created as a Neo-Mutant Tuffle</li></ul><ul><li>Possess a host body to manifest physically</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🔋 Severely Limited Power:</strong> This form lacks real combat power and is vulnerable to even low-tier energy attacks</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⏳ Time-Limited Possession:</strong> The longer the possession, the more backlash damage and mental fatigue is inflicted.</li></ul><ul><li>🪫 Low Energy Reserves: Struggles to sustain itself for extended periods outside of a host or energy source</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li>🔺 1x</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1276021789272707144/1393296507347927171","messageId":"1393296507347927171","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Parasitic Embryo  🌟 The Parasitic Embryo marks the terrifying birth of a Neo-Mutant Tuffle—an unstable entity forged from corrupted Tuffle genetics and sinister experimentation. In this ini"},{"title":"Synthetic Parasite 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/heroes-unite/images/f/f7/Dragon_ball_gt_baby_teen_by_chrisemerald_chaos_z-d5omcbc.png/revision/latest?cb=20161220171342\">Synthetic Parasite</a> 🌟</h1>The Synthetic Parasite represents the adolescent evolution of the Neo-Mutant—a milestone where the host and parasite begin to merge more seamlessly. The grotesque instability of the embryonic stage has given way to a sleek, humanoid form with vibrant blue skin, angular eyes, and a cold, calculating demeanor. Its body is tall, lean, and unnaturally symmetrical, with armor-like skin that reflects both intelligence and hidden menace. No longer hidden within another, the Neo-Mutant can now move freely with limited independence, broadcasting a faint psionic pulse from beneath its armored chestplate. This is the form where control begins to outweigh chaos, and mutation becomes a choice.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Synthetic Parasite ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>⚡ Accelerated Speed &amp; Strength:</strong> Gains a sharp boost in movement and striking power, making the user notably more formidable in short bursts.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌀 Reflex Optimization:</strong> Reflexes become hyper-attuned, allowing the user to perceive and counter fast-paced attacks with ease.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🛡️ Adaptive Skin:</strong> The outer layer of the Neo-Mutant hardens against physical blows, offering light passive resistance to slashing and impact damage.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Must absorb any type of energy at least 10 times (can include life force, ki, magic, etc.)</li></ul><ul><li>Complete early-stage mutation research or bonding experimentation.</li></ul><ul><li>Form must be housed in a dedicated host body with compatible DNA.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🧠 Mental Strain:</strong> The merging of consciousness can cause temporary memory loss or personality overlap.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💉 Irreversible Mutation:</strong> Once this form is unlocked, the Neo-Mutant can no longer return to a passive parasitic state.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚙️ Genetic Instability:</strong> Host bodies that are not regularly sustained by additional energy risk breaking down over time.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li>🔺 5x [Permanent]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1276021789272707144/1393297003814977761","messageId":"1393297003814977761","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Synthetic Parasite  🌟 The Synthetic Parasite represents the adolescent evolution of the Neo-Mutant—a milestone where the host and parasite begin to merge more seamlessly. The grotesque inst"},{"title":"Host Infusion: Stage 1 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://tenor.com/view/baby-vegeta-1-gif-12877469216922001970\">Host Infusion: Stage 1</a> 🌟</h1>Stage 1 represents the Neo-Mutant's first substantial evolutionary breakthrough—when parasitic intellect and host body fully begin to merge. This form is marked by a stark physical transformation: spiked white hair, pulsating red vein-like markings trailing down the face, and an ominous glow that surrounds the host’s aura. The host’s original features remain recognizable, but are now overlaid with a refined and commanding aesthetic that exudes control and danger. Emotionally, the host becomes more cold and tactical, their thoughts interwoven with the Neo-Mutant's growing will. The bond is no longer temporary—it is rooted, and it blooms into power.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of H.I Stage 1 ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>💥 Super Form Integration:</strong> The Neo-Mutant can tap into and forcibly evolve one of the host's original Non-Giant transformations (e.g., Super Saiyan), amplifying it into a warped “Super” state with distinct boosts and aesthetics.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Partial Control:</strong> During high-stress combat or rage-fueled encounters, the Neo-Mutant's consciousness may temporarily override the host’s actions, granting tactical supremacy in brief bursts.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🛡️ Augmented Durability:</strong> The host’s muscular system and bone density increase, allowing them to tank moderate to heavy hits with greater resilience.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧬 Symbiotic Amplifier:</strong>  This form grants a permanent multiplier to the user upon transformation. However, the Neo-Mutant can push beyond this baseline by tapping into the latent potential of the host. \n<ul><li><strong>Forced Awakening:</strong> If the host does possess a Super Form that they have achieved, the Neo-Mutant may utilize it, but it cannot exceed a maximum equivalent of 50x in Stage 1—regardless of the host’s original potential.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Super Form Catalyst:</strong> If the host does not have a Super Form they have achieved, the Neo-Mutant acts as a catalyst, forcibly unlocking it in a mutated variant—permanently binding it to the hybrid body with altered effects. They must meet the transformation requirements for the form as well.</li></ul></li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Must have intermediate genetic engineering knowledge or direct support from a Tuffle scientist.</li></ul><ul><li>Completion of Synthetic Parasite and prior possession/absorption stage.</li></ul><ul><li>Base Power Level of 50,000</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🧬 Irreversible Binding:</strong> Once this form is entered, the bond between host and Neo-Mutant is permanent—separation becomes biologically impossible without both beings being deceased.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>😖 Cognitive Feedback Loop:</strong> Dual consciousness causes brief moments of confusion, indecision, or memory bleed between host and mutant.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧱 Strain on Nervous System:</strong> Sustained use of this form wears down the host’s nervous system, causing delayed reflexes if overused during extended combat.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li>🔺 5x [Permanent]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1276021789272707144/1393303378452283563","messageId":"1393303378452283563","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Host Infusion: Stage 1  🌟 Stage 1 represents the Neo-Mutant's first substantial evolutionary breakthrough—when parasitic intellect and host body fully begin to merge. This form is marked by"},{"title":"Host Infusion: 2nd Stage 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://tenor.com/view/super-baby-vegeta-1-gif-9198735576328505863\">Host Infusion: 2nd Stage</a> 🌟</h1>The Host Infusion: 2nd Stage marks a pivotal breakthrough in the Neo-Mutant’s biological dominance. At this stage, the Tuffle entity doesn’t just influence its host—it merges with them on a genetic level. The host’s body becomes broader and more muscular, with sharpened white hair, glowing red circuitry-like veins across their chest and face, and draconic, piercing eyes. This is the beginning of true co-dependence—where the Neo-Mutant and host must evolve together or risk destabilization. The aura surrounding them pulses like a heartbeat, a rhythmic blend of Tuffle intelligence and the primal might of their host’s potential.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of H.I Stage 2 ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🧬 Symbiotic Amplifier:</strong> This form grants a permanent multiplier to the user upon transformation. However, the Neo-Mutant can push beyond this baseline by tapping into the latent potential of the host. Having already established a foundational fusion, the Neo-Mutant can now wield the host’s transformation potential freely and with refined mastery.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Accessible Transformation:</strong> The previously awakened Super Form may now be accessed at will, no longer requiring triggering conditions or emotional catalysts.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Super Form Stages:</strong> The Neo-Mutant may utilize the next stages in the hosts transformation line maxing out at whatever form equals a 400x boost. They must meet the transformation requirements for the form as well.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌀 Advanced Energy Absorption:</strong> Can drain ki-based, magical, or environmental energy attacks to restore stamina or charge their next technique.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Telepathic Subjugation:</strong> Able to invade and manipulate the minds of weaker-willed individuals, projecting commands or illusions.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🥋 Combat Perfection:</strong> Their movement becomes eerily efficient—reflexes honed to perfection, with strikes calculated to devastate.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Full mastery of all prior Neo-Mutant possession stages.</li></ul><ul><li>Demonstrated control of advanced genetic mutation techniques.</li></ul><ul><li>The host's Super Form must have already been awakened and utilized in Host Infusion: Stage 1.</li></ul><ul><li>Base Power Level of 500,000</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🧬 Irreversible Mutation:</strong> Once this form is entered, the bond between host and Neo-Mutant is permanent—separation becomes biologically impossible without both beings being deceased.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Mental Overload:</strong> Telepathic usage may cause disorientation or psychological backlash during extended battles.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Energy Saturation:</strong> Over-absorption of energy can destabilize the form, requiring a cooldown period.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚖️ Identity Fracture:</strong> As the Tuffle fuses deeper with the host, identity confusion may occur, blurring who’s truly in control.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li>🔺 5x [Permanent]</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1276021789272707144/1393309894094094456","messageId":"1393309894094094456","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Host Infusion: 2nd Stage  🌟 The Host Infusion: 2nd Stage marks a pivotal breakthrough in the Neo-Mutant’s biological dominance. At this stage, the Tuffle entity doesn’t just influence its h"},{"title":"Host Infusion: 3rd Stage 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://media4.giphy.com/media/v1.Y2lkPTc5MGI3NjExejJyYnRpeTE4cm1zMndwNzYwcnRyOXYxaml5bGU0cWpqZGE1Z21hbiZlcD12MV9pbnRlcm5hbF9naWZfYnlfaWQmY3Q9Zw/vRB3wFxYJoKu9sp7NP/giphy.gif\">Host Infusion: 3rd Stage</a> 🌟</h1>The Host Infusion: 3rd Stage marks the near-complete fusion between the Neo-Mutant parasite and its host, resulting in a form that embodies both of their strengths while erasing most of their individuality. The host’s skin darkens several shades from its natural tone, their hair sharpens into a wild, forward-pointing crest, and bold crimson lines streak across their face and body like battle markings. The physique becomes denser, more sculpted, and emanates an aura of volatile, unstable power — a living testament to the almost-complete assimilation. Though the host’s consciousness lingers in fragments, the Neo-Mutant’s will dominates, driving every motion with lethal precision.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of H.I Stage 3 ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🧬 Symbiotic Amplifier:</strong> This form grants a permanent multiplier to the user upon transformation. However, the Neo-Mutant can push beyond this baseline by tapping into the latent potential of the host. Having already established a foundational fusion, the Neo-Mutant can now wield the host’s transformation potential freely and with refined mastery.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Accessible Transformation:</strong> The previously awakened Super Form may now be accessed at will, no longer requiring triggering conditions or emotional catalysts.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Super Form Stages:</strong> The Neo-Mutant may utilize the next stages in the hosts transformation line maxing out at whatever form equals a 10,000x boost. They must meet the transformation requirements for the form as well.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌀 Expert Energy Absorption:</strong> Can drain ki-based, magical, or environmental energy attacks to restore stamina or charge their next technique.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Telepathic Subjugation:</strong> Able to invade and manipulate the minds of weaker-willed individuals, projecting commands or illusions.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🥋 Combat Perfection:</strong> Their movement becomes eerily efficient—reflexes honed to perfection, with strikes calculated to devastate.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Full mastery of all prior Neo-Mutant possession stages.</li></ul><ul><li>Demonstrated control of advanced genetic mutation techniques.</li></ul><ul><li>The host's next Super Form must have already been awakened and utilized in Host Infusion: Stage 2.</li></ul><ul><li>Base Power Level of 5,000,000</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🧬 Irreversible Mutation:</strong> Once this form is entered, the bond between host and Neo-Mutant is permanent—separation becomes biologically impossible without both beings being deceased.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Mental Overload:</strong> Telepathic usage may cause disorientation or psychological backlash during extended battles.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Energy Saturation:</strong> Over-absorption of energy can destabilize the form, requiring a cooldown period.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚖️ Identity Fracture:</strong> Host’s personality and free will are nearly erased, only surfacing in rare moments of mental resistance.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li>🔺 5x [Permanent]</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1276021789272707144/1403185888661602425","messageId":"1403185888661602425","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Host Infusion: 3rd Stage  🌟 The Host Infusion: 3rd Stage marks the near-complete fusion between the Neo-Mutant parasite and its host, resulting in a form that embodies both of their strengt"},{"title":"Host Infusion: Final Stage 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://i.makeagif.com/media/8-08-2025/VXf07u.gif\">Host Infusion: Final Stage</a> 🌟</h1>The Host Infusion: Final Stage is the ultimate state of Neo-Mutant integration, where host and parasite no longer exist as separate entities. The fusion is seamless — a perfect organism forged through relentless adaptation and evolution. The host’s body becomes sleek and biomechanical in appearance, overlaid with shimmering, bioluminescent streaks of deep crimson and silver. A swirling, dark-aura corona surrounds them, threaded with streaks of molten blue energy that pulse like a heartbeat. Their armor appears alive, reshaping itself in response to incoming threats. In this form, the host wields power with absolute precision — no wasted motion, no hesitance. Every strike carries the weight of perfected strategy and overwhelming force. It symbolizes the complete surrender of individuality to a greater, united will — the perfect Tuffle weapon.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of H.I Stage 3 ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🧬 Symbiotic Amplifier:</strong> This form grants a permanent multiplier to the user upon transformation. However, the Neo-Mutant can push beyond this baseline by tapping into the latent potential of the host. Having already established a foundational fusion, the Neo-Mutant can now wield the host’s transformation potential freely and with refined mastery.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Super Form Stages:</strong> The Neo-Mutant may utilize the next stages in the hosts transformation line maxing out at whatever form the hosts max is. They must meet the transformation requirements for the form as well.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌀 Master Energy Absorption:</strong> Can drain ki-based, magical, or environmental energy attacks to restore stamina or charge their next technique.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Telepathic Subjugation:</strong> Able to invade and manipulate the minds of weaker-willed individuals, projecting commands or illusions.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🥋 Combat Perfection:</strong> Their movement becomes eerily efficient—reflexes honed to perfection, with strikes calculated to devastate.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Full mastery of all prior Neo-Mutant possession stages.</li></ul><ul><li>Demonstrated control of advanced genetic mutation techniques.</li></ul><ul><li>The host's next Super Form must have already been awakened and utilized in Host Infusion: Stage 3.</li></ul><ul><li>Base Power Level of 50,000,000</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🧬 Irreversible Mutation:</strong> Once this form is entered, the bond between host and Neo-Mutant is permanent—separation becomes biologically impossible without both beings being deceased.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Mental Overload:</strong> Telepathic usage may cause disorientation or psychological backlash during extended battles.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Energy Saturation:</strong> Over-absorption of energy can destabilize the form, requiring a cooldown period.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚖️ Identity Fracture:</strong> Host’s personality and free will are entirely erased, only surfacing in rare moments of distress.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li>🔺 5x [Permanent]</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1276021789272707144/1403190524294205471","messageId":"1403190524294205471","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Host Infusion: Final Stage  🌟 The Host Infusion: Final Stage is the ultimate state of Neo-Mutant integration, where host and parasite no longer exist as separate entities. The fusion is sea"}],"notes":[],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1276021789272707144","imageOnly":false,"classification":"sparking"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335293960595177592","formCount":15,"art":"assets/brand.png","sparkingNotes":["SPARKING! @Tuffle (Neo-Mutant) Rage Boost: 2.5x (+20% every 6 posts) Potential Boost: 25% Ki/Mana Reserves: 300%"]},{"name":"Vampyre","slug":"vampyre","accent":"#f48498","shade":"#95344f","description":"Vampyres are an ancient, feared, and enigmatic race born from the unholy union of the Majin Lord Dagon and the mortal woman Lamae Beolfag. This twisted creation gave rise to a cursed lineage—beings neither truly dead nor fully ali…","about":[{"title":"🩸 The Vampyres 🩸","html":"<div><span><h1>🩸 The Vampyres 🩸</h1>Vampyres are an ancient, feared, and enigmatic race born from the unholy union of the Majin Lord Dagon and the mortal woman Lamae Beolfag. This twisted creation gave rise to a cursed lineage—beings neither truly dead nor fully alive, eternally bound to their thirst for blood. Their home, Planet Dathomir, is a dark and foreboding world where the night never ends, and shadows themselves seem to whisper. While their origins are steeped in darkness, not all Vampyres succumb to their monstrous urges. Over time, different paths have emerged within their kind, shaping their strengths, weaknesses, and unique abilities. However, their Makai blood ensures that all Vampyres remain powerful, cunning, and forever bound to the hunger that defines them.\n<ul><li><strong>🦇 Vampyre Paths 🦇</strong></li></ul>Each Vampyre follows a distinct path, influencing their strengths, weaknesses, and abilities. While all Vampyres share a baseline of supernatural traits, their path defines their role in the night. Some become warriors, others masters of secrecy, necromancers, or even legendary beings of the night.\n<ul><li><strong>🌞 Daywalker – The Balanced Predator 🌞</strong><ul><li><strong>Creation:</strong> Daywalkers are created when a mortal willingly accepts the Vampyric curse through a ritualized pact, often involving the mingling of blood under the light of both moon and sun. Unlike others, they are not “bitten” into existence but chosen or bestowed with the curse, binding them to both realms. Daywalkers preserve their special ability from their previous race.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Traits:</strong> Rare and enigmatic, Daywalkers walk the line between night and day, blending seamlessly into both worlds. Their bodies are adapted to withstand exposure to sunlight, though without consequence.</li></ul></li><li><strong>💀 Revenant – The Undying Curse 💀</strong><ul><li><strong>Creation:</strong> Revenants are mortals or Vampyres who died and were forcefully reanimated by necromancers or cursed blood rituals. Unlike natural Vampyric transformation, Revenants are dragged back into existence, their souls tethered unnaturally to their body. Revenants preserve their special ability from their previous race.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Traits:</strong> Revenants are tormented creatures—walking corpses with skin as pale as ash and veins glowing faintly with necrotic energy. They heal slowly unless they drain the life force of others, and pain is their eternal companion. Their endurance, however, is unmatched; they are relentless pursuers who can fight long after their bodies should have collapsed.</li></ul></li><li><strong>👁️‍🗨️ Hollowfang – The Cursed Shell 👁️‍🗨️</strong><ul><li><strong>Creation:</strong> Hollowfangs are created when a mortal is bitten by either a Daywalker or a Revenant, but the transformation fails to take hold. Instead of becoming a true Vampyre, their body and soul remain fractured, leaving them hollow. Hollowfangs preserve their special ability from their previous race.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Traits:</strong> Hollowfangs are anomalies—neither truly Vampyre nor truly alive. They possess no detectable ki signature, existing in a strange void that makes them immune to sensing and most forms of magical domination.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎟️ Ancient Vampyre – Elders of the Night 🎟️</strong><ul><li><strong>Creation:</strong> Ancients are the original bloodline, created directly by Lamae Beolfag or transformed by Lord Dagon himself. No ritual, no accident, just a bite—they are true progenitors, the wellspring from which all other Vampyre paths flow. Ancients do not retain abilities from their previous race. Their blood is too absolute, burning away mortal or racial traits.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Traits:</strong> Ancients carry the purest strain of Vampyric blood, descended directly from Lamae Beolfag or Lord Dagon. Their strength does not come from age alone but from the potency of their lineage, which grants them a higher ceiling for growth than any other path. Freshly turned Ancients may begin stronger than most, while those who endure centuries can become truly terrifying figures.</li></ul></li></ul># <s>--------------------------------------------------</s></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335294030757499002/1340247825547530251","messageId":"1340247825547530251"},{"title":"💪 Vampyre Strengths 💪 🔺 Enhanced Abilities: All Vampyres possess superior strength, speed, and endurance compared to mortals.","html":"<div><span><ul><li><strong>💪 Vampyre Strengths 💪</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 Enhanced Abilities:</strong> All Vampyres possess superior strength, speed, and endurance compared to mortals.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>👀 Heightened Senses:</strong> Their sight, smell, and hearing can detect movement and prey far beyond mortal means.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⏳ Agelessness:</strong> Vampyres do not age naturally, and their bodies recover from most wounds.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🌞 Daywalker 🌞</strong><ul><li><strong>☀️ True Sunlight Tolerance:</strong> Can exist in daylight as comfortably as mortals, making them the only Vampyres not bound to the night.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎭 Mortal Blend:</strong> Can eat mortal food and mimic social behavior almost perfectly, making them exceptional infiltrators.</li></ul></li><li><strong>💀 Revenant 💀 </strong><ul><li><strong>💀 Deathless State:</strong> Cannot be slain by conventional means; only fire, powerful magic, or total dismemberment destroys them.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔮 Alternative Sustenance:</strong> Can feed on necrotic energy, mana, or life-force instead of blood.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🛡️ Unnatural Durability:</strong> Most weapons are ineffective, and their pain tolerance is beyond mortal limits.</li></ul></li><li><strong>👁️‍🗨️ Hollowfang 👁️‍🗨️</strong><ul><li><strong>👻 Untraceable Presence:</strong> They do not register to ki, Vampyric, or magical detection.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Mind Ward:</strong> Immune to fear-based abilities, hypnosis, or mental domination.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🪫 Void Existence:</strong> They do not need constant feeding like other Vampyres, surviving longer between hunts.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎟️ Ancient 🎟️</strong><ul><li><strong>🩸 Potent Bloodline:</strong> Their bite produces stronger offspring and rarely creates Hollowfangs.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🩸 Hemamancy:</strong> Can control, manipulate, and weaponize blood.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>♻️ Near-Instant Regeneration:</strong> Can recover from nearly any wound, making them nearly unkillable.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Vampyre Weaknesses ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>☀️ Sunlight Sensitivity:</strong> Direct sunlight severely weakens Vampyres, reducing their power by half.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Magical Aversion:</strong> Pyromancy-based attacks deal 2x damage, making fire their greatest weakness.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🌞 Daywalker 🌞 </strong><ul><li><strong>🩸 Dependent on Fresh Blood:</strong> Must feed more regularly to maintain regeneration.</li></ul></li><li><strong>💀 Revenant 💀 </strong><ul><li><strong>❌ No Natural Healing:</strong> Cannot regenerate without draining life or energy.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🦴 Decay:</strong> Their bodies are always rotting, requiring magic or disguise to mask it.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Severe Fire Weakness:</strong> Burns spread rapidly across their decaying flesh.</li></ul></li><li><strong>👁️‍🗨️ Hollowfang 👁️‍🗨️</strong><ul><li><strong>🤯 Fragmented Mind:</strong> Without feeding, their sense of self deteriorates into confusion or madness.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🪞 Broken Reflection:</strong> Mirrors and reflective surfaces cause mental strain, reminding them of their unstable existence.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎟️ Ancient 🎟️</strong><ul><li><strong>🩸 Blood Hunger:</strong> Their powerful lineage demands far greater amounts of blood than other Vampyres.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>☀️ Diminished by Sunlight:</strong> They can endure exposure, but their magic and bloodcraft weaken drastically.</li></ul></li></ul># <s>--------------------------------------------------</s></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335294030757499002/1340247891717132351","messageId":"1340247891717132351"},{"title":"Vampyre Abilities 💥 🧬 DNA Breakthrough: The Vampyre race when turned keeps racial abilities, unless Vampyre abilities overr","html":"<div><span><ul><li><strong> 💥 Vampyre Abilities 💥</strong><ul><li><strong> 🧬 DNA Breakthrough:</strong> The Vampyre race when turned keeps racial abilities, unless Vampyre abilities override them. </li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Ki/Mana Manipulation:</strong> Like other advanced races, Vampyres can channel Ki or Mana, often infused with their predatory nature.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>♻️ Regeneration:</strong> Vampyres heal faster than mortals, able to mend broken bones and close wounds rapidly. Severe injuries (like limb loss) require feeding to fully recover.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🦇 Shapeshifting:</strong> Vampyres may assume alternate forms such as mist, bats, or a spectral guise, each with its own tactical use.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🌞 Daywalker 🌞</strong><ul><li><strong>☀️ Solar Attunement:</strong> Unlike other Vampyres, Daywalkers can draw strength from the sun, briefly sharpening speed and stamina.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎭 Seamless Impersonation:</strong> Their physiology lets them pass undetected as mortal for extended periods, even under magical scrutiny.</li></ul></li><li><strong>💀 Revenant 💀</strong><ul><li><strong>💀 Undying Tenacity:</strong> They push beyond the brink, fighting through crippling damage that would incapacitate others.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>😷 Aura of Dread:</strong> Their corpse-like presence instills unease in mortals, sapping the will of weaker foes.</li></ul></li><li><strong>👁️‍🗨️ Hollowfang 👁️‍🗨️</strong><ul><li><strong>👁️ Veil of the Forgotten:</strong> Their fractured existence makes them passively ignored unless directly confronted.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧬 Residual Identity:</strong> Trace echoes of their former self occasionally surface, granting flashes of unusual insight or ability.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎟️ Ancient 🎟️</strong><ul><li><strong>🩸 Bloodcraft Affinity:</strong> Naturally attuned to hemamancy, allowing manipulation of blood in simple but potent ways.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌑 Shadow Weaving:</strong> Can bend darkness into shapes or veils, though mastery requires long years of honing.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🌟 Special Abilities 🌟</strong></li><li><strong>🩸 Bloodthirsty Regeneration 🩸</strong><ul><li>Consuming fresh blood grants rapid healing and temporary boosts to strength and resilience.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Limitations:</strong> Only works with fresh, untainted blood; effects fade quickly.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🌞 Daywalker – Solar Adaptation 🌞</strong><ul><li>Once per day, direct sunlight grants them a short-lived surge in physical ability.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Limitations:</strong> After the boost, prolonged exposure exhausts them until they recover through rest or feeding.</li></ul></li><li><strong>💀 Revenant – Deathless Resolve 💀</strong><ul><li>Can ignore otherwise fatal wounds for a limited time, continuing to fight unhindered.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Limitations:</strong> Damage is not negated, only suppressed; once the effect ends, all harm manifests at once.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🧬 Hollowfang – Blood Echo 🧬</strong><ul><li>Can temporarily replicate minor skills or traits from the souls they consume.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Limitations:</strong> Requires a fresh absorption; cannot copy advanced or deeply racial techniques.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎟️ Ancient – Legacy of the Firstborn 🎟️</strong><ul><li>Ancients draw upon their pure bloodline to enhance blood magic and shadow control, creating unique techniques unavailable to younger Vampyres.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Limitations:</strong> Their powers burn through vast reserves of blood; overuse leaves them drained and vulnerable until they feed.</li></ul></li></ul># <s>--------------------------------------------------</s></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335294030757499002/1340247961220677675","messageId":"1340247961220677675"},{"title":"Untitled section","html":"<div><span><ul><li><strong>🩸 Starting Techniques / Caps and Boosts 🩸</strong><ul><li>Flight (Support Technique)</li></ul><ul><li>Afterimage (Support Technique)</li></ul><ul><li>Bloodsucking Life Absorption (Support Technique): Drains an enemy’s life force through direct contact.</li></ul><ul><li>Telepathy (Support Technique)</li></ul><ul><li>Shadow Cloak (Support Technique): Wraps the user in shadows, making them harder to detect.</li></ul><ul><li>Crimson Strike (Super Technique): A devastating melee attack enhanced by blood magic.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Daywalker</strong><ul><li>☀️ Solar Flare Slash – Uses stored sunlight energy to enhance a blade attack, burning the enemy.</li></ul><ul><li>🌞 Sunlit Mirage – Creates a temporary illusion using reflected light to deceive opponents.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Revenant</strong><ul><li>💀 Wraith Step – Moves through the battlefield as an intangible shadow for a brief moment.</li></ul><ul><li>🕸️ Necrotic Grasp – A melee attack that rapidly drains life force upon touch, weakening the target.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Hollowfang</strong><ul><li>👁️ Phantom Rend – Strikes the target's soul directly, bypassing normal defenses</li></ul><ul><li>🔮 Echo Veil – Temporarily adopts an ability from a recently consumed soul fragment.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Ancient</strong><ul><li>🩸 Blood Puppet – Uses a small amount of an enemy’s blood to manipulate their movements briefly.</li></ul><ul><li>🌑 Abyssal Dominion – Calls forth massive shadow constructs to attack and defend simultaneously.</li></ul></li></ul><h1><s>--------------------------------------------------</s></h1><ul><li><strong><span>@Vampyre (Daywalker)</span> | <span>@Vampyre (Revenant)</span>  | <span>@Vampyre (Hollowfang)</span></strong><ul><li>Rage Boost: 2x</li></ul><ul><li>Potential Boost: 10%</li></ul><ul><li>Ki/Mana Reserves: 150%</li></ul></li></ul><span><strong><code>SPARKING!</code></strong></span><ul><li><strong><span>@Vampyre (Ancient)</span></strong></li></ul><ul><li>Rage Boost: 3x (+20% every 6 posts)</li></ul><ul><li>Potential Boost: 25%</li></ul><ul><li>Ki/Mana Reserves: 300%</li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335294030757499002/1340248808814022696","messageId":"1340248808814022696"},{"title":"Quick Trip","html":"<div><span><h1>Quick Trip</h1><a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335294030757499002/1340247825547530251\">Racial Info</a></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335294030757499002/1407970073683169370","messageId":"1407970073683169370"}],"paths":[{"name":"Foundational forms","kind":"core","forms":[{"title":"Bloodborne Colossus 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 Bloodborne Colossus 🌟</h1>The Bloodborne Colossus marks the first true awakening of a Vampyre’s cursed blood. In this state, their body warps under the pull of hunger and survival — features sharpen, eyes burn with crimson or violet light, and their aura becomes a haze of shadowed red, thrumming with predatory vitality. This form is not merely a loss of control, but an embrace of what they are: both predator and noble, feral and regal.\n<ul><li>Each Vampyre’s Colossus form manifests differently depending on their lineage:\n<ul><li>💀 <strong> <a href=\"https://i.pinimg.com/736x/65/6a/e7/656ae7dadd0423db15c9f1a2387728b4.jpg\">Revenant:</a> </strong> Their body becomes a refined balance of monstrous and regal. Crimson energy flows like veins of fire beneath their pale, armored skin. Wings forged of both shadow and flesh stretch with authority, while their gaze carries the weight of a predator who has mastered the hunt rather than succumbed to it.</li></ul><ul><li>🌞 <strong> <a href=\"https://i.pinimg.com/736x/32/34/2b/32342b918bdfad0c4e10227df5060619.jpg\">Daywalker:</a> </strong> The body becomes semi-corporeal, twisting into writhing black smoke and ethereal tendrils that never remain still. Feral claws form out of living shadow, and eyes blaze with an infernal, ember-like glow. Its figure shifts constantly, never fully solid, giving the sense of a nightmare only half-real.</li></ul><ul><li>👁️ <strong> <a href=\"https://i.pinimg.com/236x/e2/0a/43/e20a43407e3ad1f7c4097c0919f85b11.jpg\">Hollowfang:</a> </strong> The body contorts into a feral bat-like abomination, towering with elongated limbs and wings stretched wide like torn banners of flesh. Muscles bulge beneath dark, leathery skin, and its jaw stretches unnaturally wide, revealing endless rows of fangs designed for tearing. Its blood-red eyes glow like embers under the crimson moon.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Bloodborne Colossus ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🩸 Predatory Surge:</strong> Sharpened reflexes, speed, and agility — the Vampyre moves like a blur, chaining aerial and ground attacks fluidly.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>👁️ Blood Sense:</strong> Can feel the “pulse” of nearby life forces, making it difficult for enemies to escape undetected.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💪 Titanic Frame:</strong> Upon transforming, the Vampyre’s body surges to an immense size (15–20 feet). Their attacks gain devastating weight, increasing raw striking power by 15%, but their larger frame makes them slightly easier to hit.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Must experience near-fatal hunger, exhaustion, or desperation that forces their body into survival instinct.</li></ul><ul><li>Requires exposure to a Blood Moon or a blood-fueled emotional surge.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⏳ Blood Drain:</strong> Rapid stamina consumption if held for too long (10–15 turns depending on endurance).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Mental Strain:</strong> Risk of losing control and slipping into feral aggression if overused.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>☀️ Sunlight Weakness:</strong> Severely weakened in daylight; transformation may even fail to trigger. (Unless Daywalker)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🩸 Hunger Spike:</strong> When reverting, the Vampyre suffers overwhelming bloodlust. If not fed soon, they remain weakened and unstable.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 10x</strong></li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335294030757499002/1407788066105589883","messageId":"1407788066105589883","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟 Bloodborne Colossus 🌟 The Bloodborne Colossus marks the first true awakening of a Vampyre’s cursed blood. In this state, their body warps under the pull of hunger and survival — features sha"},{"title":"Sanguine's Gaze 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://c.tenor.com/BuCTJ3tWYPcAAAAC/tenor.gif\">Sanguine's Gaze</a> 🌟</h1>Sanguine's Gaze, whispered among Vampyres as Sanguine’s Gaze, is not simply a surge of strength — it is a metamorphosis of mind and body. When achieved, the Vampyre’s features sharpen, their eyes glow a deep, unblinking red, and their presence exudes a suffocating sense of inevitability. Veins darken beneath the skin, and their form seems sculpted for the hunt: leaner, colder, and more predatory. This state carries with it a personality of its own — domineering, calculating, and unflinchingly cruel. Unlike feral states that lose themselves to hunger, the Crimson Ascendant embodies control through dominance. The Vampyre becomes a tactician of fear, their every word and movement tainted with the weight of an apex predator who does not chase prey — but forces it to come to them.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Sanguine's Gaze ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🩸 Bloodforged Might:</strong> Muscular density increases, granting significant boosts to raw strength and striking power by 1.5x.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔪  Shadow Grasp:</strong> Darkened energy hardens around the user’s claws or weapon strikes, extending their reach and allowing vicious mid-range slashes.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌑 Shadowflow:</strong> Shadows bend unnaturally around the user, letting them blur their outline, mask movements, or confuse opponents briefly in close combat.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💀 Predator’s Presence:</strong> Their demeanor shifts into a commanding, oppressive personality — enemies often hesitate, misstep, or falter under the sheer pressure of facing them.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Must have survived extended, intense combat with near-death experience. (Must be repeated per stage)</li></ul><ul><li>Must consume the blood of a powerful being beneath a full moon. (Being must be stronger than the user)</li></ul><ul><li>Must face their deepest fear in a metaphysical trial and emerge victorious.</li></ul><ul><li>Base Power Level of 250,000</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⏳ Severe Stamina Drain:</strong> The form consumes vast amounts of energy; overuse can collapse the body.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Personality Bleed:</strong> The cruel, domineering persona of the form may influence the user’s actions even after reverting.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🩸 Post-Form Hunger:</strong> Leaves the Vampyre in a weakened, ravenous state until replenished with fresh blood.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 25x [250,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 50x [3,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335294030757499002/1407849476139385034","messageId":"1407849476139385034","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Sanguine's Gaze  🌟 Sanguine's Gaze, whispered among Vampyres as Sanguine’s Gaze, is not simply a surge of strength — it is a metamorphosis of mind and body. When achieved, the Vampyre’s fea"},{"title":"Bloodline Awakening 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://i.makeagif.com/media/9-12-2017/JaHpbF.gif\">Bloodline Awakening</a> 🌟</h1>The Bloodline Awakening is the Vampyre’s first true emergence of their ancient heritage, a visceral birth of their predatory essence. As the transformation takes hold, their skin pales to moonlit alabaster, their eyes ignite in hues of crimson or violet, and their fangs lengthen into lethal spears of hunger. The back splits with a tearing sound as vast, leathery wings unfurl, dripping shadows and blood-red wisps of flame. The aura they radiate is suffocating — a storm of dread and vitality that warps the air around them, making weaker foes falter just by standing in its presence. This form is not simply raw strength; it is a symbolic surrender to the night itself — a melding of elegance and savagery that marks the Vampyre as something greater than mortal or beast.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Bloodline Awakening ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🩸 Predator’s Grace:</strong> Speed, agility, and reflexes heighten drastically, granting razor-sharp movements and near-instinctive evasion.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>👁️ Aura of Dread:</strong> Nearby foes with weaker willpower or lesser power levels feel their morale crack, suffering hesitation or missteps in combat.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🩶 Crimson Claws:</strong> Talons sharpen into ki-laced weapons capable of tearing through hardened defenses with relative ease.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧬 Blood Instinct:</strong> Gains heightened awareness of surrounding life forces, allowing the Vampyre to track hidden enemies or sense ki signatures with predatory precision.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>The Vampyre must experience an overwhelming emotional trigger — rage, desperation, or hunger so deep it borders madness.</li></ul><ul><li>The presence or consumption of fresh blood to ignite the transformation. (Must be present during each transformation)</li></ul><ul><li>A deep attunement to their vampyric bloodline through training, meditation, or near-death experiences. (Must be repeated per stage)</li></ul><ul><li>Base Power Level of 12,000,000</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⏳ Stamina Drain:</strong> Transformation drains stamina the longer it’s maintained, leaving the user weakened when it ends.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🩸 Hunger intensifies:</strong> the urge to consume blood grows insatiable, risking loss of control and potential harm to allies.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Emotional instability:</strong> Increases rage, frenzy, or cold detachment may override rational decision-making.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 100x [12,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 400x [50,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335294030757499002/1407849509123526816","messageId":"1407849509123526816","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Bloodline Awakening  🌟 The Bloodline Awakening is the Vampyre’s first true emergence of their ancient heritage, a visceral birth of their predatory essence. As the transformation takes hold"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335294030757499002","notes":[],"classification":"foundational"},{"name":"Ancient Path","kind":"branch","forms":[{"title":"Dagon's Aspect 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://tenor.com/view/surtur-fire-demon-demon-fire-marvel-gif-14591213\">Dagon's Aspect</a> 🌟</h1>The Dagon's Aspect form awakens the ancient legacy within a Vampyre, manifesting their dominion over shadows and the night. In this form, the Vampyre towers monstrously between 100–120 feet, their body carved in dark, jagged obsidian-like stone. Crimson flames lick across their frame, flickering with a malevolent glow that mirrors the bloodlust burning in their veins. Eyes burn like molten coals, radiating raw predatory hunger, while their wings — broad and shadowed — sweep the air with a threatening presence. Once masterd, this can be used in one's humanoid form, simply changed their look, and power, and maybe gaining a few inches in height\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Dagon's Aspect⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🌊 Shockwave Generation:</strong> Every physical strike releases concussive shockwaves, creating AoE damage and staggering nearby foes.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌊 Colossal Presence:</strong> The extreme size and aura not only intimidate weaker opponents, but cause small-scale environmental effects like tremors and wind displacement with movements.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚫ Abyssal Grip:</strong> The Vampyre can extend shadowy tendrils from their body to grab, restrain, or pull enemies closer, turning their size and reach into a tactical advantage. Works best on multiple opponents in close proximity.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Crimson Flame Eruption:</strong> Dark crimson flames can erupt from the Vampyre’s body at will, creating localized firestorms that damage enemies over time and mark them with lingering bloodlust energy, increasing damage taken from the Vampyre’s next attacks.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Must be exposed to intense Blutz Waves suffused with crimson light, fully embracing the raw energy. (Until Mastered)</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>😡 Reckless Hunger:</strong> The form amplifies bloodlust, making the Vampyre prone to uncontrolled aggression that can harm allies or leave openings in strategy.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⏳ Turn Limit:</strong> The form can only be sustained for 10 turns before the toll on the body forces reversion.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌪️ Environmental Backlash:</strong> Shockwaves, wind displacement, and flame eruptions can alter the battlefield unpredictably, potentially blocking movement or creating hazards for both enemies and allies.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 10x [Birth]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 50x [100,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Third Stage:</strong> 100x [500,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Fourth Stage:</strong> 400x [1,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Fifth Stage:</strong> 800x [5,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Sixth Stage:</strong> 2,000x [10,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1248503967953059871/1408150830011514992","messageId":"1408150830011514992","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Dagon's Aspect  🌟 The Dagon's Aspect form awakens the ancient legacy within a Vampyre, manifesting their dominion over shadows and the night. In this form, the Vampyre towers monstrously be"},{"title":"Beolfag's Talon 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://i.postimg.cc/wTMTz6H7/image-2025-08-21-140959926.png\">Beolfag's Talon</a> 🌟</h1>Beolfag's Talon is the embodiment of unrestrained aggression and ancient predatory instincts. The Vampyre’s body swells with overwhelming power, golden arcs across their black skin pulsating like molten veins, and the burning sun emblem at their chest flares with fierce intensity. Horns curve ominously from their head, and though their mouth remains unseen, communication emanates as chilling, telepathic commands. Shadows coil around the form, forming a writhing shroud that reacts to every heartbeat, almost sentient in nature. Eyes burn like pits of darkness, reflecting rage and primal instinct.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Beolfag's Talon ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>⚫ Mutated Barrier (Always Active):</strong> An inherent barrier of dark energy surrounds the Vampyre, reducing damage from all attacks by 3.75×, constantly reinforcing their defenses.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>✨ Essence Echo:</strong> When striking an opponent, part of their energy is siphoned and stored in the Vampyre, temporarily enhancing their next attack or fortifying their durability.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🦞 Primordial Grasp:</strong> The Vampyre can extend spectral claws or tendrils of their own essence to strike or restrain multiple opponents simultaneously. These attacks bypass conventional defenses and leave a lingering mark that slightly reduces the target’s defenses for 2 turns.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of Dagon:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 20,000,000.</li></ul><ul><li>Must have engaged in at least five battles to awaken raw instincts. (Must be repeated per stage)</li></ul><ul><li>Experience emotional turmoil, such as betrayal, rage, or grief, to trigger the full wrath of the form. (Must be repeated per stage)</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🔥 Primal Overextension:</strong> Using multiple mechanics in succession pushes the Vampyre’s body and essence beyond safe limits, risking uncontrollable feral bursts that can harm allies or themselves.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Essence Strain:</strong> Maintaining the Essence Echo for prolonged periods creates mental strain, leading to temporary disorientation, slower decision-making, or lapses in focus after reversion.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Energy Feedback:</strong> Primordial Grasp siphons energy from enemies, but repeated use can overload the Vampyre’s essence, causing minor self-damage or reduced effectiveness on subsequent attacks.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 4,000x [20,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 10,000x [40,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Third Stage:</strong> 20,000x [100,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1248503967953059871/1408154571662164068","messageId":"1408154571662164068","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Beolfag's Talon  🌟 Beolfag's Talon is the embodiment of unrestrained aggression and ancient predatory instincts. The Vampyre’s body swells with overwhelming power, golden arcs across their"},{"title":"Undead Monarch 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://i.pinimg.com/736x/0d/65/b1/0d65b19fd7f2b40a81a98be7efba9552.jpg\">Undead Monarch</a> 🌟</h1>Undead Monarch embodies the apex predator and ancient ruler of the Vampyre lineage. Towering and armored, the figure exudes a primordial majesty, with jagged horns curling skyward and eyes that burn with a cold, supernatural light. Shadows cling to the form, writhing as though alive, emphasizing the Vampyre’s dominion over darkness itself. Every movement resonates with authority, sending subtle tremors through the battlefield. The armor, etched with ancient runes of predation, seems to merge with the Vampyre’s own essence, reflecting both centuries of combat experience and raw, primal power. \n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Undead Monarch ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of Dagon:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔮 Echo of Millennia:</strong> The Vampyre channels the combat knowledge of all past Ancient Vampyres, temporarily allowing them to replicate one special move or ability used against them within the same battle for 2 turns.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🗡️ Sovereign Predation:</strong> When engaging multiple foes, the Vampyre can mark one target as prey. While marked, the Vampyre’s attacks against them ignore a portion of defenses and cause lingering corruption, weakening the target for 3 turns.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 250,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Must confront and overcome a personal trauma or flaw, channeling their bloodlust, cunning, and ancient instincts into disciplined dominance. (Must be repeated per stage)</li></ul><ul><li>Must perform the Rite of Shadow Dominion, a ritual connecting the Vampyre to the primordial essence of shadows and the first Vampyres.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>💪 Absolute Strain:</strong> Using all mechanics at once can severely tax the Vampyre, risking self-harm or uncontrolled feral bursts.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌑 Shadow Reliance:</strong> Certain mechanics lose effectiveness in areas with little ambient shadow or vampiric energy, forcing the Vampyre to adapt or rely on alternative strategies.- <strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 30,000x [250,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 50,000x [500,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Third Stage:</strong> 75,000x [750,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1248503967953059871/1408159514360025128","messageId":"1408159514360025128","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Undead Monarch  🌟 Undead Monarch embodies the apex predator and ancient ruler of the Vampyre lineage. Towering and armored, the figure exudes a primordial majesty, with jagged horns curling"},{"title":"Coldharbour’s Damnation 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://i.pinimg.com/1200x/58/e5/24/58e52470306bab2ff68c1797d77147ea.jpg\">Coldharbour’s Damnation</a> 🌟</h1>Coldharbour’s Damnation is  a form that embodies eternal predation, shadow sovereignty, and unchallenged authority. The Vampyre towers in dark, jagged armor fused to their body, etched with ancient runes and symbols of blood, shadows, and dominance, appearing as if the very essence of their ancestors and the abyss itself has been forged into their being. Horned and terrifying, their eyes glow a deep, unholy azure, radiating awareness and intelligence accumulated over centuries. Shadows writhe around them, responding to their will as extensions of their body, capable of striking, binding, or manipulating foes without physical contact. The air itself seems to resist their presence, heavy with dread and the smell of ancient blood.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Coldharbour’s Damnation ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🌊 Shockwave Generation:</strong> Every physical strike releases concussive shockwaves, creating AoE damage and staggering nearby foes.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of Dagon:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌊 Colossal Presence:</strong> The extreme size and aura not only intimidate weaker opponents, but cause small-scale environmental effects like tremors and wind displacement with movements.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚫ Abyssal Grip:</strong> The Vampyre can extend shadowy tendrils from their body to grab, restrain, or pull enemies closer, turning their size and reach into a tactical advantage. Works best on multiple opponents in close proximity.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>✨ Essence Overlord:</strong> The Vampyre absorbs energy from all foes in range, using it to heal, augment attacks, or reinforce defenses. Multiple enemies can be siphoned simultaneously.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔮 Echo of Ancients:</strong> The Vampyre channels the combat knowledge of all past Ancient Vampyres, temporarily replicating one ability or special move used against them within the same battle.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 1,000,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Must personally travel to Coldharbour, the Plane of Makyo, and absorb the essence of the plane itself, integrating its destructive energy into their own being without succumbing to corruption. (Must be repeated per stage)</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🌪️ Environmental Backlash:</strong> Shockwaves, wind displacement, and flame eruptions can alter the battlefield unpredictably, potentially blocking movement or creating hazards for both enemies and allies.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>☠️ Corruption Risk:</strong> Exposure to Coldharbour’s essence, if not fully mastered, risks permanent psychic or physical corruption, warping the Vampyre’s body or mind even outside the form.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💪 Absolute Strain:</strong> Maintaining all abilities simultaneously is physically and mentally devastating; failure can cause self-inflicted injuries or uncontrolled feral bursts.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 100,000x [1,000,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 250,000x [3,000,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Third Stage:</strong> 500,000x [7,000,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1248503967953059871/1408162960286945320","messageId":"1408162960286945320","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Coldharbour’s Damnation  🌟 Coldharbour’s Damnation is  a form that embodies eternal predation, shadow sovereignty, and unchallenged authority. The Vampyre towers in dark, jagged armor fused"}],"notes":[],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1248503967953059871","imageOnly":false,"classification":"sparking"},{"name":"Daywalker Path","kind":"branch","forms":[{"title":"Solar Fracture 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://images-wixmp-ed30a86b8c4ca887773594c2.wixmp.com/f/a475f8db-e88c-4ec6-ac12-92884f68d6e2/di53xr8-8466a940-33fe-48ae-b75b-568023486abc.jpg?token=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..cgAX3Ct8l4loeWDD4MvK523uXACSP3qhOTsk1hhjDEg\">Solar Fracture</a> 🌟</h1>The Solar Fracture is the first great step of the Daywalker, representing the evolution of a Daywalker’s vampyric lineage—The body hardens into obsidian-like armor streaked with glowing crimson veins, each pulse resembling molten rivers of lava flowing just beneath the skin. Blackened talons extend from the hands, dripping with embers, while their wings unfurl into vast infernal appendages—half-shadow, half-flame—that scorch the air with every beat. The eyes blaze like miniature suns, their fiery glare capable of breaking weaker wills outright.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Solar Fracture ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🩸 Hellfire Talons:</strong> Strikes scorch both flesh and soul, leaving burning wounds that regenerate slower while draining Ki on contact.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>☀️ Solar Siphon:</strong> The Daywalker feeds on ambient sunlight to restore stamina in bursts. But too much energy risks destabilizing their body as solar fire fuses with vampyric essence.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🪽 Eclipse Wings:</strong> Vast obsidian-crimson wings shield like armor or shred foes in close combat. When unfurled, they unleash heated shockwaves that stagger weaker enemies.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>👁️ Predatory Instinct:</strong> Heightened senses expose enemy weaknesses, but drive the user into relentless offense, often overriding strategy.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌋 Infernal Eclipse Strike:</strong> Combines stolen sunlight with vampyric hunger into an apocalyptic beam/blast. Devastating… but each use slashes the form’s duration.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of the Divine:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Divine Energy:</strong> The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns. Their ki undetectable to those without Divine Ki.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 180,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Obtain God/Divine Ki through training or Ritual</li></ul><ul><li>The form can only be invoked under immense emotional strain or a conscious act of will, usually tied to moments of judgment, vengeance, or survival. (Must be repeated per stage)</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🔥 Overheating Core:</strong> Solar fire and vampyric essence clash, generating volatile heat. Prolonged use risks internal combustion, leaving burns even after deactivation.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🦇 Blood Frenzy:</strong> After deactivating, hunger surges violently. Without immediate feeding, the Daywalker risks attacking friend or foe alike.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌑 Sunlight Dependency:</strong> While no longer harmful, this form requires sunlight as fuel. Battles in darkness or indoors drastically shorten its duration.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>👹 Eclipse Instinct:</strong> The predatory mindset grows overwhelming, warping judgment and eroding humanity if overused.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Backlash Collapse:</strong> When the form ends, crippling fatigue, muscle searing, and unstable Ki flow leave the user weaker than their base form for several minutes.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 10,000x [180,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 14,000x [500,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1248503825203986433/1408135830396076265","messageId":"1408135830396076265","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Solar Fracture  🌟 The Solar Fracture is the first great step of the Daywalker, representing the evolution of a Daywalker’s vampyric lineage—The body hardens into obsidian-like armor streake"},{"title":"Luminal Ascension 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcRC78i9pT-mpnR_5X_EHdSODrDrTcT0otmGEyOWodDAmoYogTI5\">Luminal Ascension</a> 🌟</h1>Luminal Ascension represents the second step in the Daywalker’s metamorphosis — the moment where the Vampyre’s cursed flesh reconciles with the radiance of daylight itself. Their once-darkened complexion shifts into a pale brilliance, as if kissed by sunlight for the first time. Shimmering, feathered wings unfurl from their back, not fragile or divine, but sharpened extensions of their willpower. Their eyes glow with a golden intensity, mirroring both hunger and serenity, a duality that defines the Daywalker.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Luminal Ascension ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🩸 Blood Rush:</strong> Their strikes grow heavier the longer they fight, stacking ferocity with every blow. Unlike frenzied rampage, these strikes are intentional, each carrying escalating weight.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Daybound Focus:</strong> Ki techniques gain increased potency when used in natural light, amplifying their presence without altering speed or reflexes.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌫️ Bleached Presence:</strong> The user seems unnaturally “washed out” under sunlight, making their movements difficult to track visually. Opponents may misread or underestimate their true positioning.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of the Divine:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Divine Energy:</strong> The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns. Their ki undetectable to those without Divine Ki.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 1,000,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Must face a trial where their hunger and discipline are tested, proving restraint in a moment of overwhelming bloodlust. (Must be repeated per stage)</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⛓️ Suppressed Instincts: </strong>The form dulls feral bursts — reckless or explosive techniques are weaker, forcing the user into controlled pacing.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🩸 Stored Hunger: </strong>By suppressing frenzy during combat, the thirst rebounds hard afterward, leaving the Vampyre dangerously ravenous once the form ends.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🪽 Vulnerable Growths:</strong> The bone-wings can be broken; damage causes intense pain and disrupts the user’s balance mid-fight.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⏳ Mental Strain:</strong> The calm precision comes at the cost of mental fatigue — prolonged use leaves the Vampyre detached, disoriented, and at risk of succumbing to frenzy later.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 18,000x [1,000,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 22,000x [3,000,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1248503825203986433/1408139964134326442","messageId":"1408139964134326442","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Luminal Ascension  🌟 Luminal Ascension represents the second step in the Daywalker’s metamorphosis — the moment where the Vampyre’s cursed flesh reconciles with the radiance of daylight its"},{"title":"🌑 Solaris Noctis 🌑","html":"<div><span><h1>🌑 <a href=\"https://i.postimg.cc/gk99rmbM/image-2025-08-21-132629514.png\">Solaris Noctis</a> 🌑</h1>The body becomes jet black, sleek and chiseled, adorned with intricate golden arcs that pulse faintly across muscles and limbs like living circuitry. A burning sun symbol ignites in the center of their chest, radiating power and dominance without producing literal light. Their horns curve elegantly from their head, framing a visage without a mouth — words emerge through thought, direct and chilling, giving their presence an unsettling, telepathic authority. Movements are fluid yet deliberate, combining predatory grace with calculated menace. Every motion, every tilt of the head or sweep of a clawed hand, speaks of a being who has fully mastered their hunger and ferocity, wielding it like an unstoppable weapon.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Solaris Noctis ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🔥 Solar Core Manifestation:</strong> The sun emblem channels internal power, allowing controlled bursts of raw destructive energy, striking enemies with the force of concentrated sunlight without harming the Daywalker.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>👁️ Telepathic Domination:</strong> Without a mouth, Solaris Noctis communicates and assaults minds directly, instilling terror, hesitation, or panic in foes, bypassing conventional defenses.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Golden Arc Amplification:</strong> The golden lines across their body can store kinetic energy from movements or attacks, releasing it in precise, devastating strikes, enhancing power without speed multipliers.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌑 Shadowed Presence:</strong> Their black skin absorbs light around them subtly, creating a living silhouette that makes it difficult for enemies to gauge distance or strike accurately.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of the Divine:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Divine Energy:</strong> The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns. Their ki undetectable to those without Divine Ki.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 7,000,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Must undergo a ritual of self-reflection and acceptance, confronting their deepest fears and desires.</li></ul><ul><li>Must defeat a formidable opponent without relying on brute force, demonstrating strategic prowess and control.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🔥 Solar Overload:</strong> Using the sun emblem’s energy too aggressively can destabilize the user, causing internal strain and temporary loss of control.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🕯️ Isolation of Presence:</strong> The overwhelming aura and unnatural appearance can repel allies, making coordination in group combat difficult.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⏳ Energy Imbalance:</strong> Storing and releasing kinetic energy through the golden arcs requires careful timing; mistimed release can leave openings in defense.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 26,000x</strong></li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1248503825203986433/1408143624557953075","messageId":"1408143624557953075","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌑  Solaris Noctis  🌑 The body becomes jet black, sleek and chiseled, adorned with intricate golden arcs that pulse faintly across muscles and limbs like living circuitry. A burning sun symbol"}],"notes":[],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1248503825203986433","imageOnly":false,"classification":"normal"},{"name":"Hollowfang Path","kind":"branch","forms":[{"title":"Nightmaw Emergence 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://i.pinimg.com/236x/71/d6/91/71d69182e1b5ea2ea462ba220c448f49.jpg\">Nightmaw Emergence</a> 🌟</h1>The Nightmaw Emergence marks the first step into the Vampyre’s feral heritage. Upon transformation, the user’s body distorts into a predatory silhouette — Shrouded in obsidian armor laced with jagged edges, the user’s mortal features wither away, replaced by a skeletal visage beneath a shadowed hood, claws elongate into wicked talons, fangs sharpen beyond their natural limits, and the jawline grows angular, giving the impression of a beast tearing free from human restraint. . A ghostly green flame flickers at the heart of their chest, burning with necrotic vitality — a beacon of the corruption now coursing through their essence. Their eyes blaze like lanterns in the dark, radiating both malice and power, while their very presence bends the air with a chilling aura of dread.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Nightmaw Emergence ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🩸 Rending Talons:</strong> Claw and bite attacks inflict lingering “Hollow Wounds,” which weaken an opponent’s stamina and healing over time.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💢 Blood Echo:</strong> With each wound inflicted, adrenaline heightens; successive hits marginally increase physical strength and aggression.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔊 Dread Howl:</strong> An unsettling, bestial roar that calls upon creatures of the night to aid in battle</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of the Divine:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Divine Energy:</strong> The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns. Their ki undetectable to those without Divine Ki.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 180,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Obtain God/Divine Ki through training or Ritual</li></ul><ul><li>Must survive a battle in which the Vampyre is pushed to the brink of death.</li></ul><ul><li>Complete specialized training that focuses on fully weaponizing vampyric claws, fangs, and physical instincts.</li></ul><ul><li>Succumb to the hunger of the Hollowfang once, allowing pure instinct to take over for 1 full battle (Must be repeated per stage)</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⚡ Feral Exhaustion:</strong> The longer the form is sustained, the more severe the fatigue afterward.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🩸 Blood Hunger:</strong> Using this form accelerates thirst; extended combat risks frenzy if blood reserves aren’t replenished.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Fractured Restraint:</strong> While control is possible, strong emotions (rage, hunger, despair) can trigger momentary lapses in judgment, causing reckless or instinct-driven attacks.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 10,000x [180,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 14,000x [500,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1407497136685449346/1407965623983669358","messageId":"1407965623983669358","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Nightmaw Emergence  🌟 The Nightmaw Emergence marks the first step into the Vampyre’s feral heritage. Upon transformation, the user’s body distorts into a predatory silhouette — Shrouded in"},{"title":"Ebon Hollow 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://cdnb.artstation.com/p/assets/images/images/086/048/737/smaller_square/evgeny-kolodeznyy-demon.jpg?1742281897\">Ebon Hollow</a> 🌟</h1>When the Vampyre delves deeper into the Hollowfang Path, they shed the last remnants of mortal visage. Their body becomes an embodiment of shadow and decay, draped in a cloak of writhing darkness. Their skeletal visage glows with emerald fire, veins of cursed energy pulsating from the core of their chest. In this state, they do not just appear monstrous — they radiate dread itself. The air grows heavy around them, and all but the strongest feel their will suffocated under the oppressive weight of the abyss. This form symbolizes submission to the Hollow, forsaking the flesh to embrace the eternal hunger that defines their cursed bloodline.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Ebon Hollow ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🩸 Hollow Hemorrhage:</strong> Claw/bite wounds seed void-laced cuts that reduce the target’s natural healing and external healing effects for a short duration of 5 turns.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🛡️ Carapace Interlock:</strong> The mantle’s plates can lock to cushion a hit or shear to slip a grapple. Locking mitigates a single heavy impact; shearing breaks restraints but leaves a brief exposed seam (cannot use on consecutive turns).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🗡️ Null Mark:</strong> On a clean strike, inscribe a thin blood-sigil that anchors the target to the user’s presence: the next time they disengage or vanish, the user can re-approach in a straight line ignoring minor obstacles (not a teleport; a ruthless beeline). 1 target at a time.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of the Divine:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Divine Energy:</strong> The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns. Their ki undetectable to those without Divine Ki.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 1,000,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Etch a personal sigil into bone (RP ritual) and bind it with a drop of an equal or stronger foe’s blood.</li></ul><ul><li>Must reach a threshold of emotional corruption — rage, despair, or betrayal — that pushes the Vampyre into surrendering.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🔋 Constant Drain:</strong> This form consumes stamina at a higher rate, leading to quicker exhaustion if overused.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Erosion of Self:</strong> Prolonged usage makes the Vampyre lose grip on rational thought, leaning toward feral and destructive impulses.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⛓️ Hollow Binding:</strong> Once transformed, the user cannot revert until combat ends or they are forcibly subdued.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💀 Soul Burn:</strong> Repeated use of this form scars the Vampyre’s essence, reducing recovery efficiency after battle.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 18,000x [1,000,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 22,000x [3,000,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1407497136685449346/1407965677045678111","messageId":"1407965677045678111","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Ebon Hollow  🌟 When the Vampyre delves deeper into the Hollowfang Path, they shed the last remnants of mortal visage. Their body becomes an embodiment of shadow and decay, draped in a cloak"},{"title":"🌑 Umbral Seraph 🌑","html":"<div><span><h1>🌑 <a href=\"https://i1.sndcdn.com/artworks-sObqrjjYHwa7gtW4-S43cDw-t500x500.png\">Umbral Seraph</a> 🌑</h1>The Umbral Seraph Form represents the vampyre’s complete transcendence into an apex predator of the night — a being neither fully mortal nor beast, but a sovereign of shadows. When invoked, the user’s armor darkens into living blackened steel, entwined with runes that writhe like veins of abyssal fire. Jagged wings of shadow-feathers unfurl from their back, each plume dripping with green ethereal light that coils like smoke, moving as if alive. Their skeletal visage remains half-hidden beneath a hood, but the emerald blaze in their eyes and chest core radiates like a cursed star, a beacon of dominion over death and dread.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Umbral Seraph Form ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🪽 Wings of the Abyss:</strong> Black, spectral wings allow limited flight and can unleash slicing gusts of necrotic wind. Feathers can harden into projectile blades or coil defensively around the body like a shield.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💀 Necrocore Resonance:</strong> The glowing sigil in the chest acts as a reservoir of death-essence, amplifying vampyric abilities and allowing temporary summoning of shadow-beasts or skeletal constructs. Each summon costs immense stamina.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌪️ Eclipse Shroud:</strong> A living aura of shifting shadows distorts perception around the user, making their movements blur as if reality bends. This grants evasive advantage and psychological terror to enemies.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🕯️ Soul-Drain Talons:</strong> Strikes with claws or conjured shadow-limbs not only wound the flesh but leech vitality or ki, weakening opponents gradually without granting full recovery to the user.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of the Divine:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Divine Energy:</strong> The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns. Their ki undetectable to those without Divine Ki.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 7,000,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Survive a confrontation where death seemed inevitable, choosing to embrace undeath rather than flee it.</li></ul><ul><li>A ritual of acceptance — sacrificing a treasured fragment of mortal identity (memory, bond, or name) to awaken the Umbral Seraph.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⚡ Stamina Consumption:</strong> Every ability of the Umbral Seraph drains heavily; prolonged usage risks total collapse post-transformation.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🩸 Soul-Toll:</strong> While in this form, the user’s essence frays slightly — if invoked recklessly, it can erode fragments of personality or memory over time.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⏳ Temporal Bound:</strong> The form is unstable; the longer it is held, the more violent and erratic its shadow aura becomes, eventually lashing out indiscriminately at ally and foe alike.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 26,000x</strong></li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1407497136685449346/1407966957478608979","messageId":"1407966957478608979","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌑  Umbral Seraph  🌑 The Umbral Seraph Form represents the vampyre’s complete transcendence into an apex predator of the night — a being neither fully mortal nor beast, but a sovereign of shado"}],"notes":[],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1407497136685449346","imageOnly":false,"classification":"normal"},{"name":"Revenant Path","kind":"branch","forms":[{"title":"🌑 Crimson Requiem 🌑","html":"<div><span><h1>🌑 <a href=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/GpKW15gW4AEv7SH?format=jpg&amp;name=large\">Crimson Requiem</a> 🌑</h1>The Crimson Requiem marks the true beginning of the Revenant Path — a metamorphosis where the Vampyre ceases to merely wield their bloodline and instead becomes its vessel. Their skin pales to a haunting marble-white, veins faintly visible beneath the surface as their eyes glow with an unholy crimson light. Fangs lengthen, but their visage carries a cold elegance rather than savagery, reflecting control honed through discipline. The Vampyre exudes stillness, as though death itself lingers in their shadow. They become less a warrior of brute force and more a conductor of dread, their presence bending the battlefield into silence. The Crimson Requiem is not about power shown, but power felt — subtle, suffocating, and inescapable.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Crimson Requiem ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🩸 Blood Echo:</strong> Wounds inflicted in this form resonate, leaving a lingering “echo” of pain in the opponent that grows worse if they continue to fight recklessly. Any damage dealt lingers as a small DOT effect, stacking with repeated strikes.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🕊️ Silent Elegy:</strong> The user’s movements are soundless, making it unnervingly difficult for opponents to predict intent.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🩶 Dual Self — The Requiem Voice:</strong> This form manifests a secondary “whispering persona” within the Vampyre. It does not fully control them, but it advises, tempts, and presses them toward ruthlessness.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of the Divine:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Divine Energy:</strong> The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns. Their ki undetectable to those without Divine Ki.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 180,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Obtain God/Divine Ki through training or Ritual</li></ul><ul><li>Must endure a ritual trial where the Vampyre drinks from their own lifeblood, symbolizing self-sacrifice and surrender to lineage.</li></ul><ul><li>Triggered in battle only when near defeat, or during a moment of profound stillness (e.g., meditation, acceptance of mortality, Must be repeated per stage). </li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⌛ Stamina Attrition:</strong> Maintaining this form slowly drains the user’s vitality, even if not actively fighting.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🩶 Whispered Influence:</strong> The secondary Requiem persona may cloud judgment, urging merciless or predatory actions that can cause IC conflict.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🕯️ Resonance Dependency:</strong> Blood Echo requires the user to fight with precision — reckless swings won’t trigger its lingering effects.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚰️ Emotional Flatness:</strong> In this form, emotional responses are dulled; allies may find the user cold, detached, or alien in RP interactions.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 10,000x [180,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 14,000x [500,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1407497388611862610/1407859171113570404","messageId":"1407859171113570404","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌑  Crimson Requiem  🌑 The Crimson Requiem marks the true beginning of the Revenant Path — a metamorphosis where the Vampyre ceases to merely wield their bloodline and instead becomes its vesse"},{"title":"Obsidian Grasp 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://i.pinimg.com/236x/78/e1/48/78e14863cdb1a8bdc3ccba540565a08f.jpg\">Obsidian Grasp</a> 🌟</h1>The Obsidian Grasp represents the Vampyre’s embrace of their dominion over fear and mortality. Their skin pales to a corpse-like hue, shadows cling unnaturally to their figure, and their eyes glow with an unsettling crimson intensity. The transformation exudes an air of nobility twisted into dread, as if the user themselves has become both monarch and executioner of the night. Unlike other forms that channel raw bloodlust, this stage manifests a cold, calculating cruelty. The user’s personality shifts into something regal yet merciless, as though the Vampyre’s darker lineage whispers directly into their mind. Those nearby often feel the weight of judgment, as if standing before a ruler who has already decided their fate.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Obsidian Grasp ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🗡️ Bloodforge Blades:</strong> The Vampyre hardens their own blood into physical weapons (swords, spears, claws). These are durable but cost a portion of stamina to maintain.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🦴 Exoskeletal Reinforcement:</strong> Their skeletal frame partially hardens, granting increased durability against both blunt force and piercing attacks.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🏃 Predator’s Advance:</strong> Each successful strike briefly restores stamina and health (representing vampyric feeding from damage dealt).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>👁️ Eternal Gaze:</strong> Their gaze compels foes into hesitating or faltering once per battle (a momentary slip, not a “stun-lock,” just an exploitable lapse).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of the Divine:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Divine Energy:</strong> The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns. Their ki undetectable to those without Divine Ki.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Base Power Level of 1,000,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Must have achieved mastery over their previous Revenant Path form.</li></ul><ul><li>Must undergo a Blood Trial — a ritual where the Vampyre consumes the essence of a powerful enemy or rival, cementing their dominance.</li></ul><ul><li>Character must have suffered a significant loss or betrayal, symbolizing the detachment of their mortal self and full embrace of their darker sovereignty. (Must be repeated per stage)</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🩸 Blood Price:</strong> Weaponized blood techniques drain health if used excessively.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⏳ Crown of Burden:</strong> The transformation places immense mental strain — prolonged use can cloud judgment, making the user overconfident or dismissive of allies.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🕯️ Extreme Hunger:</strong> The longer the form is active, the stronger the craving for blood becomes. If the user fails to feed (through combat or RP means), they collapse into a weakened, near-feral state after deactivation.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 18,000x [1,000,000,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 22,000x [3,000,000,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1407497388611862610/1407933522466836580","messageId":"1407933522466836580","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Obsidian Grasp  🌟 The Obsidian Grasp represents the Vampyre’s embrace of their dominion over fear and mortality. Their skin pales to a corpse-like hue, shadows cling unnaturally to their fi"},{"title":"Ebon Exarch 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://i.pinimg.com/736x/0f/c7/d8/0fc7d8e173e782d6131ebc8b299139bd.jpg\">Ebon Exarch</a> 🌟</h1>The Ebon Exarch emerges when a Vampyre transcends their mortal remnants and fully embraces the crown of darkness. Their armor-like flesh appears chiseled and obsidian-black, etched with faint red veins that pulse with damning life. A regal helm of living shadow frames their face, while their gaunt expression radiates ancient authority. This form is not about frantic fury—it is calculated dominion, exuding an air of aristocratic dread that commands not just strength, but submission.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Ebon Exarch ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🛡️ Nightforge Mantle:</strong> The Exarch’s flesh hardens into ebony armor mid-combat, granting resistance to both physical and ki-based strikes while active.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚔️ Ebon Vanguard:</strong> They can summon a spectral knightly blade forged from their own shadow for lethal, precise strikes.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>👁️ Dark Command:</strong> Once per encounter, the Exarch can issue a silent dominion—compelling a single target to yield (e.g., drop weapon or hesitate), reflecting nobility’s unwavering command.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🩸 Vampiric Echo:</strong> When struck, a portion of damage dealt is redirected as vitality to the Exarch, symbolizing bloodborne resilience—not raw regeneration, but lifeblood reclamation.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎯 Lasting Determination:</strong> When your HP drops below 10%, gain a temporary x2 boost to attack power for 2 turns. Activates once per battle.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌟 Will of the Divine:</strong> While active, gain a +15% boost to all stats. Once per combat, roll a D20—a 16–20 fully heals you. (Can only occur once per fight.)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚡ Divine Energy:</strong> The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns. Their ki undetectable to those without Divine Ki.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Must have mastered Obsidian Grasp.</li></ul><ul><li>Must undergo the Eclipse Consecration—a lunar ritual where the Vampyre binds an ancient relic to their soul, signifying ultimate allegiance to darkness.</li></ul><ul><li>Base Power Level of 7,000,000,000</li></ul><ul><li>Must have survived a duel or trial against a formidable rival, proving their cold nobility in battle.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🩸 Bloodforged Burden:</strong> The obsidian armor slowly consumes the Vampyre’s own vitality—without strategic strikes or feeding, the body weakens.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>👑 Aloof Sovereign:</strong> The form deepens emotional detachment, making alliances brittle; loyalty may falter under prolonged exposure.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💥 Shattered Exterior:</strong> If the armor is broken in combat, the Exarch experiences disorienting backlash, risking temporary instability.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 26,000x</strong></li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1407497388611862610/1407936085626982422","messageId":"1407936085626982422","art":"../assets/brand.png","excerpt":"🌟  Ebon Exarch  🌟 The Ebon Exarch emerges when a Vampyre transcends their mortal remnants and fully embraces the crown of darkness. Their armor-like flesh appears chiseled and obsidian-black,"}],"notes":[],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1407497388611862610","imageOnly":false,"classification":"normal"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1335294030757499002","formCount":16,"art":"assets/brand.png","sparkingNotes":["SPARKING! @Vampyre (Ancient) Rage Boost: 3x (+20% every 6 posts) Potential Boost: 25% Ki/Mana Reserves: 300%"]}],"systems":[{"title":"Dragon Ball & Magic System","slug":"dragon-ball-magic-system","group":"System","messages":[{"title":"Dia_Pur Mystic Systems Dia_Pur","html":"<div><span><h1>Dia_Pur Mystic Systems Dia_Pur</h1>This system governs all mystical forces beyond standard Ki — including Dragon Balls (wish-based power) and Magic (structured energy manipulation).\n<s>═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════</s>\n<h1>Dia_Ora Dragon Ball System Dia_Ora</h1>Dragon Balls are ancient mystical artifacts that, when gathered, summon a dragon capable of granting a wish.\n<ul><li>Dia_Yel Core Rules Dia_Yel<ul><li>Dot_Yel Each set has unique rules, power, and risks</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Yel After a wish, Dragon Balls scatter and become inactive</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Yel Not all sets are equal — some are stronger, rarer, or more dangerous</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Yel Players do not know exact limits of dragons</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Yel All wishes are handled in-character and moderated by staff</li></ul></li><li>Dia_Blue Obtaining Dragon Balls Dia_Blue<ul><li>Dot_Blue Staff announces when Dragon Balls are active or nearby</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Blue Requires a roll: /roll d20\n<ul><li>Dot_Blue 15–20: Success</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Blue 1–14: Failure or complication</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Blue Staff may adjust outcomes based on RP quality or danger</li></ul></li></ul><h1>Dia_Gre Dragon Ball Sets Dia_Gre</h1><ul><li><strong>🌍 Earth Dragon Balls</strong><ul><li>Dot_Gre 7 Balls | Baseball-sized</li></ul><ul><li>1-⭐ Vacant</li></ul><ul><li>2-⭐ Vacant</li></ul><ul><li>3-⭐ Vacant</li></ul><ul><li>4-⭐ Vacant</li></ul><ul><li>5-⭐ Vacant</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Gre Dragon: Shenron</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Gre Cooldown: 3 Days</li></ul></li><li><strong>🌿 Namek Dragon Balls</strong><ul><li>Dot_Gre 7 Balls | Basketball-sized</li></ul><ul><li>1-⭐ Vacant</li></ul><ul><li>2-⭐ Vacant</li></ul><ul><li>3-⭐ Vacant</li></ul><ul><li>4-⭐ Vacant</li></ul><ul><li>5-⭐ Vacant</li></ul><ul><li>6-⭐ Vacant</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Gre Dragon: Porunga</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Gre Cooldown: 1 Day</li></ul></li><li><strong>🔥 Sadala Dragon Balls</strong><ul><li>Dot_Gre 7 Balls | Softball-sized</li></ul><ul><li>1-⭐ Atzuma</li></ul><ul><li>2-⭐ Atzuma</li></ul><ul><li>3-⭐ Kasuru</li></ul><ul><li>4-⭐ Vacant</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Gre Dragon: Riddle</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Gre Cooldown: 5 Days</li></ul></li><li><strong>🌾 Cereal Dragon Balls</strong><ul><li>Dot_Gre 2 Balls | Ping-Pong sized</li></ul><ul><li>1-⭐ Naomi</li></ul><ul><li>2-⭐ Naomi</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Gre Dragon: Toronbo</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Gre No fixed cooldown</li></ul></li><li><strong>🌑 Makyo Dragon Balls</strong><ul><li>Dot_Gre 3 Balls | Bowling ball-sized</li></ul><ul><li>1-⭐ Vacant</li></ul><ul><li>2-⭐ Vacant</li></ul><ul><li>3-⭐ Vacant</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Gre Dragon: Alduin</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Gre Cooldown: 11 Days</li></ul></li><li><strong>🌌 Super Dragon Balls</strong><ul><li>Dot_Gre 7 Balls | Planet-sized</li></ul><ul><li>1-⭐ Vacant</li></ul><ul><li>2-⭐ Vacant</li></ul><ul><li>3-⭐ Vacant</li></ul><ul><li>4-⭐ Vacant</li></ul><ul><li>5-⭐ Vacant</li></ul><ul><li>6-⭐ Vacant</li></ul><ul><li>7-⭐ Vacant</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Gre Dragon: Zephyr</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Gre Cooldown: 13 Days</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Gre Dragon judges intent</li></ul></li><li><strong>Dia_Red Making a Wish Dia_Red</strong><ul><li>Dot_Red All Dragon Balls must be present</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Red Summoning must be roleplayed</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Red Staff determines outcome</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Important Rules</strong><ul><li>Dot_Red No OOC claiming or stealing</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Red Dragons may refuse, twist, or reinterpret wishes</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Red Dragon Balls are story tools, not guaranteed rewards</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483838338061439310/1483838444513005719","messageId":"1483838444513005719"},{"title":"💨 Aeromancy","html":"<div><span><h1>💨 Aeromancy</h1><ul><li><strong>Basic</strong><ul><li><strong>Gust Pulse:</strong> Releases a burst of wind that pushes enemies back and disrupts footing.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Air Step:</strong> Briefly condense air beneath your feet to step mid-air or reposition.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Pressure Flick:</strong> Fires a compressed air shot that hits fast but lightly.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Wind Veil:</strong> Surrounds the user in flowing air, slightly reducing incoming damage.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Vacuum Grip:</strong> Pulls a target slightly off balance by shifting surrounding air pressure.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Draft Sense:</strong> Detect movement through air disturbances (tracking tool).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Cyclone Kick:</strong> A melee strike enhanced by spinning air, increasing impact.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Breath Control:</strong> Stabilizes breathing to reduce minor stamina/mana strain.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Advanced</strong><ul><li><strong>Air Compression Field:</strong> Creates a pressure zone that slows enemies and weakens movement.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Jet Propulsion:</strong> Launches the user at high speed for burst movement or impact.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Cyclone Prison:</strong> Traps a target in spiraling winds, restricting movement.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Vacuum Collapse:</strong> Briefly removes air in a space, causing internal pressure damage.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Mastered</strong><ul><li><strong>Tempest Domain:</strong> Creates a battlefield-wide storm zone that enhances your mobility and weakens enemy stability.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Heaven Splitter:</strong> A massive compressed air slash that tears through defenses with extreme force.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Child Magic</strong><ul><li><strong>🔊 Echamancy</strong></li></ul><ul><li><strong>Basic</strong><ul><li><strong>Vibration Strike:</strong> Channel sound into a melee hit, causing internal disruption on impact.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Echo Step:</strong> Leaves behind a sound-based afterimage to confuse opponents.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Sonic Pulse:</strong> A quick vibration strike that bypasses minor defenses.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Frequency Sense:</strong> Detects hidden or invisible targets through sound vibrations.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>Advanced</strong><ul><li><strong>Shatter Frequency:</strong> Targets an opponent’s internal balance, increasing damage taken briefly.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Sonic Wave:</strong> A wide-area sound blast that pushes back enemies and disrupts formations.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>Mastered</strong><ul><li><strong>Absolute Silence:</strong> Suppresses all sound in a large area, severely limiting enemy awareness and coordination.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌿 Shamamancy</strong><ul><li><strong>Basic</strong></li></ul><ul><li><strong>Spirit Calm:</strong> Reduces instability effects on an ally or self. (Drains are reduced by 10%)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Flow Disruption:</strong> Slightly interferes with an enemy’s energy flow, weakening output. (Attack Damage reduced by 10%)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Wind Communion:</strong> Sense spiritual presence or emotional intent in an area.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Guiding Breeze:</strong> Lightly enhances ally control, reducing minor penalties.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Advanced</strong><ul><li><strong>Ancestral Pulse:</strong> Releases a wave that weakens aggressive effects (rage boosts, unstable forms boosts are halved).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Spirit Binding Wind:</strong> Temporarily restricts an enemy’s energy flow, slowing actions.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>Mastered</strong><ul><li><strong>Harmony Field:</strong> Creates an area where allies gain stability and enemies suffer energy disruption over time.</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul><s>═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════</s></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483838338061439310/1483838621634269244","messageId":"1483838621634269244"},{"title":"🌊 Hydromancy","html":"<div><span><h1>🌊 Hydromancy</h1><ul><li><strong>Basic</strong><ul><li><strong>Water Whip:</strong> Forms a flexible stream of water to strike or bind a target.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Flow Guard:</strong> Creates a rotating layer of water that softens incoming damage.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Current Pull:</strong> Drags a target slightly off balance using flowing water.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Water Step:</strong> Allows movement across water or briefly elevated surfaces.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Mist Veil:</strong> Generates fog to obscure vision and reduce tracking clarity.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Ripple Sense:</strong> Detects movement through disturbances in nearby water.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Aqua Jet:</strong> Fires a pressurized stream for fast, linear impact.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Soothing Flow:</strong> Heals minor external wounds (non-scarred, non-critical).</li></ul></li><li><strong>Advanced</strong><ul><li><strong>*Tidal Grasp:</strong> Envelops a target in water, restricting movement and slowing actions.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Wave Crash:</strong> A heavy surge attack that knocks back and destabilizes enemies.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Pressurized Sphere:</strong> Traps a target in a dense water sphere, limiting movement and breathing.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Healing Surge:</strong> Accelerates recovery of moderate external injuries (non-lethal only).</li></ul></li><li><strong>Mastered</strong><ul><li><strong>Ocean Dominion:</strong> Control all nearby water sources, greatly enhancing scale, control, and pressure.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Grand Restoration:</strong> Heals severe external injuries over time (cannot restore limbs or override fatal damage).</li></ul></li><li><strong>Child Magic</strong><ul><li><strong>❄️ Cryomancy</strong></li></ul><ul><li><strong>Basic</strong><ul><li><strong>Frost Bind:</strong> Freezes water around a target’s limbs to slow movement.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Ice Shard:</strong> Launches sharp ice projectiles at high speed.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Glacial Armor:</strong> Forms a thin ice layer that reduces incoming damage.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Frozen Path:</strong> Creates ice underfoot for rapid movement or repositioning.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>Advanced</strong><ul><li><strong>Flash Freeze:</strong> Instantly freezes a surface or area, locking enemies in place briefly.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Permafrost Field:</strong> Creates a freezing zone that continuously slows and drains stamina.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>Mastered</strong><ul><li><strong>Absolute Zero Construct:</strong> Generates massive, near-instant ice formations that heavily restrict movement and battlefield control.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🩸 Hemamancy</strong><ul><li><strong>Basic</strong></li></ul><ul><li><strong>Blood Sense:</strong> Detects nearby living beings through blood flow.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Pulse Disrupt :</strong> Slightly disrupts an opponent’s internal rhythm, weakening movement.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Coagulate:</strong> Slows bleeding or stabilizes wounds (self or ally).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Vein Tug:</strong> Causes minor internal resistance, making actions feel heavier.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Advanced</strong><ul><li><strong>Blood Bind:</strong> Temporarily restricts a target’s movement by controlling internal flow.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Crimson Surge:</strong> Overloads the user’s own blood flow to boost physical output briefly (with strain).</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>Mastered</strong><ul><li><strong>Dominion of Blood:</strong> Gains strong influence over a target’s body, heavily restricting movement and actions for a short duration.</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul><s>═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════</s></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483838338061439310/1483838628403744849","messageId":"1483838628403744849"},{"title":"🌍 Terramancy","html":"<div><span><h1>🌍 Terramancy</h1><ul><li><strong>Basic</strong><ul><li><strong>Earth Wall:</strong> Raises a solid barrier to block incoming attacks.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Stone Fist:</strong> Reinforces strikes with hardened earth.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Ground Shift:</strong> Slightly alters terrain to disrupt footing.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Rock Launch:</strong> Fires chunks of earth as projectiles.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Tremor Sense:</strong> Detects movement through ground vibrations.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Earthen Grip:</strong> Traps a target’s feet or limbs in stone.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Burrow Step:</strong> Move through earth for repositioning.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Dust Veil:</strong> Kicks up debris to obscure vision.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Advanced</strong><ul><li><strong>Seismic Slam:</strong> Sends a shockwave through the ground, knocking enemies off balance.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Pillar Rise:</strong> Summons large earth pillars to strike or launch targets.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Quake Field:</strong> Creates unstable terrain, making movement difficult.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Stone Armor:</strong> Covers the body in dense earth, reducing incoming damage heavily.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Mastered</strong><ul><li><strong>Worldbreaker Quake:</strong> Massive seismic disruption affecting a wide area.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Titan’s Dominion:</strong> Full control of terrain in the area, massively increasing all earth-based effects.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Child Magic</strong><ul><li><strong>⚙️ Ferromancy (Metal Bending)</strong></li></ul><ul><li><strong>Basic</strong><ul><li><strong>Metal Pull:</strong> Attract nearby metal objects toward you.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Metal Push:</strong> Repel metal objects or opponents wearing metal.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Iron Skin:</strong> Temporarily reinforce your body with metal plating.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Chain Bind:</strong> Use metal to restrain a target.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>Advanced</strong><ul><li>**Magnetic Crush: Compress metal around a target to restrict movement.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Blade Storm:</strong> Control multiple metal fragments for rapid attacks.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>Mastered</strong><ul><li><strong>Absolute Dominion Metal:</strong> Full control over all metal in the area, including weapons and armor.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌋 Magmancy</strong><ul><li><strong>Basic</strong></li></ul><ul><li><strong>Magma Flow:</strong> Generate and control slow-moving lava streams.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Heat Surge:</strong> Radiate intense heat to pressure nearby enemies.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Molten Strike:</strong> Enhance attacks with burning magma.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Crust Break:</strong> Break terrain and expose molten layers beneath.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Advanced</strong><ul><li><strong>Lava Wave:</strong> A flowing wave of magma that overwhelms enemies.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Volcanic Burst:</strong> Explosive eruption from the ground.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>Mastered</strong><ul><li><strong>Cataclysm Core</strong> Transform the battlefield into a volcanic zone, dealing constant pressure and damage.</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul><s>═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════</s></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483838338061439310/1483839184962850879","messageId":"1483839184962850879"},{"title":"Pyromancy","html":"<div><span><h1>🔥 Pyromancy</h1><ul><li><strong>Basic</strong><ul><li>Flame Jet – Emits a controlled stream of fire from the hands or feet for offense or movement.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Fire Burst:</strong> A short-range explosive release of flame.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Blazing Strikes:</strong> Enhances melee attacks with fire, increasing impact and burn.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Flame Wall:</strong> Creates a wall of fire that blocks vision and deters movement.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Heat Haze:</strong> Distorts the air with heat, making tracking and precision harder.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Ember Volley:</strong> Fires multiple small bursts of flame in quick succession.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Fire Step:</strong> Uses bursts of flame to boost speed or reposition mid-combat.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Inner Flame:</strong> Stabilizes your own energy, reducing strain and improving control.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Advanced</strong><ul><li><strong>Fire Wave:</strong> A wide, sweeping arc of flame that pushes and overwhelms targets.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Jet Propulsion:</strong> Sustained flame output for high-speed aerial movement.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Scorching Field:</strong> Superheats an area, applying constant pressure and fatigue.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Flame Cloak:</strong> Surrounds the body in fire, boosting offense and punishing close-range attackers.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Mastered</strong><ul><li><strong>Inferno Dominion:</strong> Full environmental control of fire, massively increasing scale and intensity.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Dragon’s Breath:</strong> A massive, concentrated blast of fire with overwhelming force.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Child Magic</strong><ul><li><strong>⚡ Fulgurmancy</strong></li></ul><ul><li><strong>Basic</strong><ul><li><strong>Spark Shot:</strong> Fires a fast, focused bolt of lightning.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Static Field:</strong> Electrifies an area, making movement risky.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Lightning Step:</strong> Rapid burst movement using electrical propulsion.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Nerve Jolt:</strong> Sends a shock through a target, briefly disrupting actions.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>Advanced</strong><ul><li><strong>Chain Lightning:</strong> Strikes multiple targets in succession.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Lightning Redirection:</strong> Redirect incoming lightning-based attacks back at a target.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>Mastered</strong><ul><li><strong>Heaven’s Judgement:</strong> Calls down a devastating lightning strike from above with extreme speed and precision.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>💥 Ionimancy</strong><ul><li><strong>Basic</strong></li></ul><ul><li><strong>Combustion Shot:</strong> Fires a focused explosion at a distant target.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Pressure Build:</strong> Charges energy into a point before releasing it explosively.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Burst Step:</strong> Uses explosive force for sudden, unpredictable movement.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Impact Detonation:</strong> Causes attacks to explode on contact rather than burn.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Advanced</strong><ul><li><strong>Focused Detonation:</strong> A highly concentrated explosion with strong knockback and precision.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Chain Detonation:</strong> Triggers multiple explosions in sequence across an area.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>Mastered</strong><ul><li><strong>Annihilation Blast:</strong> A massive, long-range combustion attack with devastating impact and area destruction.</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul><s>═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════</s></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483838338061439310/1483843568224440431","messageId":"1483843568224440431"},{"title":"🕯️ Manumancy","html":"<div><span><h1><strong>🕯️ Manumancy</strong></h1><ul><li><strong>Basic</strong><ul><li><strong>Dark Pulse:</strong> Releases a wave of corrupt energy that weakens targets slightly.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Life Drain:</strong> Steals a small amount of vitality from a target to heal yourself.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Shadow Grasp:</strong> Dark tendrils bind or slow a target’s movement.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Corrupt Weapon:</strong> Infuses attacks with dark energy, increasing damage over time.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Dread Aura:</strong> Emits a presence that creates discomfort and hesitation in enemies.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Mark of Decay:</strong> Applies a weakening effect that worsens over time.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Umbral Step:</strong> Move through shadows for short repositioning.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Grave Chill:</strong> Reduces a target’s physical output slightly through energy suppression.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Advanced</strong><ul><li><strong>Soul Siphon:</strong> Drains energy more aggressively, weakening the target while restoring yourself.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Wraith Summon:</strong> Creates a temporary spirit construct to assist in combat.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Curse of Ruin:</strong> Applies a lingering debuff that reduces effectiveness of techniques.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Black Surge:</strong> Temporarily boosts your own power using corrupted energy (with strain).</li></ul></li><li><strong>Mastered</strong><ul><li><strong>Raise Undead:</strong> Reanimate a defeated body as a controllable servant (limited strength).</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Grave Dominion:</strong> Command multiple undead or spirits within an area.</li></ul></li></ul><s>═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════</s></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483838338061439310/1483852846808957099","messageId":"1483852846808957099"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483838338061439310","excerpt":"Dia_Pur Mystic Systems Dia_Pur This system governs all mystical forces beyond standard Ki — including Dragon Balls (wish-based power) and Magic (structured energy manipulation). ══════════════════════════════════════════"},{"title":"Mastery & Fusion System","slug":"mastery-fusion-system","group":"System","messages":[{"title":"Dia_Blue Energy Manipulation Systems Dia_Blue","html":"<div><span><h1>Dia_Blue Energy Manipulation Systems Dia_Blue</h1>This system governs all forms of energy usage, control, evolution, and interaction — including Ki, advanced mastery, fusion, and absorption.\n<s>═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════</s>\n<h1>Dia_Gre Ki System Dia_Gre</h1>Ki is the life force present in all beings. Its form is shaped by intent, alignment, and training.\n<ul><li><strong>Dia_Yel Ki Alignments Dia_Yel</strong><ul><li><strong>💖 Good Ki</strong></li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Yel Calm, supportive energy</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Yel Stabilizes allies and surroundings</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Yel Earned through selfless actions</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚪ Neutral Ki</strong><ul><li>Dot_Yel Balanced and adaptable</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Yel Unaligned energy</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Evil Ki</strong><ul><li>Dot_Yel Aggressive and oppressive</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Yel Encourages domination</li></ul></li></ul></li><li><strong>Dia_Pur Advanced Ki Variants Dia_Pur</strong><ul><li>🌀 Divine Ki:  Godly, refined energy</li></ul><ul><li>🌋 Primal Ki: Instinct-based, ancient energy</li></ul><ul><li>💥 Destruction Ki:  Erasure-based energy</li></ul><ul><li>🌱 Creation Ki:  Healing and life-based energy\n<ul><li>Dot_Pur Unlocking one grants ×2.5 BPL</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul>These are not starting options\n<h1>Dia_Ora Technique &amp; Transformation System Dia_Ora</h1><ul><li><strong>🔵 Transformations</strong><ul><li>Dot_Ora Require 1 turn to activate</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Ora Learning: 20 Logs    |    Dot_Ora Mastery: 24 Logs</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Mastery Control</strong><ul><li>Dot_Ora 25% (6 Trainings): Partial control    |    Dot_Ora 50% (12 Trainings): Controlled, half drain    |    Dot_Ora 100% (24 Trainings): No drain, at-will</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Ora Stacking Formula: (Form × Form) × BPL = TPL</li></ul></li><li><strong>🔴 Ultimate Techniques</strong><ul><li>Dot_Ora Learning: 12 Logs    |    Dot_Ora Mastery: 14 Logs</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Ora 75% Drain</li></ul></li><li><strong>🟠 Super Techniques</strong><ul><li>Dot_Ora Learning: 10 Logs    |    Dot_Ora Mastery: 12 Logs</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Ora 50% Drain</li></ul></li><li><strong>🟢 Support Techniques</strong><ul><li>Dot_Ora Learning: 8 Logs    |    Dot_Ora Mastery: 10 Logs</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Ora 25% Drain</li></ul></li><li><strong>🟣 Melee Techniques</strong><ul><li>Dot_Ora Learning: 3 Logs    |    Dot_Ora Mastery: 5 Logs</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Ora 6.25% Drain</li></ul></li><li><strong>🟡 Mentorship</strong><ul><li><strong>Dot_Ora Reduces requirements:</strong></li></ul><ul><li>Melee -1    |    Support -1    |    Super -2    |    Ultimate -2    |    Forms -2</li></ul></li></ul><s>═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════</s></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483375347696402543/1483377280188284938","messageId":"1483377280188284938"},{"title":"Dia_Blue Spirit Control System Dia_Blue","html":"<div><span><h1>Dia_Blue Spirit Control System Dia_Blue</h1>Advanced energy manipulation beyond normal Ki usage.\n<ul><li><strong>🏆 Progression Stages</strong><ul><li><strong>Foundation (1%–12.5%)</strong></li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Blu Telepathy</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Blu Cloning (¼ PL)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Expansion (12.5%–25%)</strong><ul><li>Dot_Blu Instant Transmission</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Blu Healing</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>Refinement (25%–50%)</strong><ul><li>Dot_Blu Advanced IT</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Blu Advanced Cloning</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>Ascension (50%–75%)</strong><ul><li>Dot_Blu Kai-Kai</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Blu True Healing</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>Mastery (75%–100%)</strong><ul><li>Dot_Blu True Kai-Kai</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Blu Forced Spirit Fission</li></ul></li></ul></li><li><strong>📖 Notes</strong><ul><li>Dot_Blu Meditation = +2.5% mastery</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Blu Requires PL thresholds</li></ul></li></ul><s>═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════</s></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483375347696402543/1483377815305850890","messageId":"1483377815305850890"},{"title":"Dia_Red Fusion System Dia_Red","html":"<div><span><h1>Dia_Red Fusion System Dia_Red</h1>Fusion combines two beings into one.\n<ul><li><strong>🌀 Fusion Dance</strong><ul><li>Dot_Red PL within 1.5x</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Red 1d6 fail chance (1 or 6)</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Red Duration: 15 turns</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Red Multiplier: Dot_Red Rival → ×25    |    Dot_Red Ally → ×12.5</li></ul></li><li><strong>💎 Potara Fusion</strong><ul><li>Dot_Red Automatic activation</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Red Permanent if divine</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Red 20 turns (10 if max form used)</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Red Multiplier: Dot_Red Rival → ×50    |    Dot_Red Ally → ×25</li></ul></li><li><strong>🧬 Assimilation</strong><ul><li>Dot_Red Permanent fusion-absorption</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Red Requires specific races</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Red Cannot be undone freely</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Red Multiplier: PL + (Target ×5)</li></ul></li></ul><h1>Dia_Pur Absorption System Dia_Pur</h1>Absorption increases power without creating a shared identity.\n<ul><li><strong>🤯 Complete Absorption</strong><ul><li>Dot_Pur Requires permission</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Pur Gains abilities + memories</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Pur PL Gain: PL + PL + 50%</li></ul></li><li><strong>🔋 Energy Absorption</strong><ul><li>Dot_Pur Weaker → +60%</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Pur Equal → +30%</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Pur Stronger → +15%</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Weekly Limits</strong><ul><li>Dot_Pur ≤50M → 5</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Pur 50M–500M → 10</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Pur 500M+ → 15</li></ul></li><li><strong>🧠 Risks</strong><ul><li>Dot_Pur Personality influence</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Pur Identity instability</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Pur Death = absorbed entities perish</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483375347696402543/1483378865953833044","messageId":"1483378865953833044"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483375347696402543","excerpt":"Dia_Blue Energy Manipulation Systems Dia_Blue This system governs all forms of energy usage, control, evolution, and interaction — including Ki, advanced mastery, fusion, and absorption. ═════════════════════════════════"},{"title":"Starting Information","slug":"starting-information","group":"System","messages":[{"title":"Dia_Pur Starting Information Dia_Pur","html":"<div><span><h1>Dia_Pur Starting Information Dia_Pur</h1>This section explains how characters begin their journey — including starting power levels, class ranks, hybrids, androids, and special conditions.\n<s>═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════</s>\n<h1>Dia_Ora Power Level Classes Dia_Ora</h1>These classes determine your starting Base Power Level (BPL), starting privileges, and early advantages.\n<ul><li><strong>Dia_Red Royal Class Dia_Red</strong><ul><li>Dot_Red BPL: 13,000 – 20,000</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Red Transformation Mastery: Full mastery of first transformation</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Red Ship: Large spaceship</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Red Limit: Max 10 per race</li></ul></li><li><strong>Dia_Yel Super-Elite Class Dia_Yel</strong><ul><li>Dot_Yel BPL: 9,000 – 12,999</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Yel Transformation Mastery: 50% mastery of first transformation</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Yel Ship: Small spaceship</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Yel Limit: Max 20 per race</li></ul></li><li><strong>Dia_Ora Elite Class Dia_Ora</strong><ul><li>Dot_Ora BPL: 6,000 – 8,999</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Ora Transformation Mastery: 25% mastery of first transformation</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Ora Ship: Spacepod</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Ora Limit: Max 40 per race</li></ul></li><li><strong>Dia_Gre Middle Class Dia_Gre</strong><ul><li>Dot_Gre BPL: 4,000 – 5,999</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Gre Limit: Max 80 per race</li></ul></li><li><strong>Dia_Blue Low Class Dia_Blue</strong><ul><li>Dot_Blu BPL: 500 – 3,999</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Blu Limit: Unlimited</li></ul></li><li><strong>Dia_Yel SPARKING! (Giveaway Only) Dia_Yel</strong><ul><li>Dot_Yel BPL: 2,000 – 35,000 (Also use these numbers for Androids)</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Yel Starts at society rank, but mastery is half of what rank states</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Yel Only obtainable through giveaways</li></ul></li></ul><s>═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════</s>\n<h1>Dia_Blue Rolling Your Starting BPL Dia_Blue</h1><ul><li>Dot_Blu Choose a Power Level Class</li><li>Dot_Blu Roll within that class's BPL range</li><li>Dot_Blu You may roll up to 3 times\n<ul><li>⚠️ Once a new roll is made, previous rolls cannot be chosen.</li></ul></li><li>Dot_Blu Include the chosen roll in your character submission</li></ul><s>═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════</s></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483308667326566571/1483310725408624875","messageId":"1483310725408624875"},{"title":"Dia_Red Starting Restrictions Dia_Red","html":"<div><span><h1>Dia_Red Starting Restrictions Dia_Red</h1><ul><li>Characters may not begin the server with:\n<ul><li>Dot_Red Omnipotence or reality-level abilities</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Red Devil-Might Beam</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Red Hybrid giveaway races</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Red Advanced Spirit Control</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Red Mastery beyond your starting class</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Red Knowledge of god forms or cosmic locations</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Red A spaceship (unless Class states otherwise)</li></ul></li></ul><s>═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════</s>\n<h1>Dia_Gre Immortality Types Dia_Gre</h1>Immortality is extremely rare and requires staff approval.\n<ul><li><strong>Type 1 — True Immortality</strong><ul><li>Dot_Gre Cannot be killed, harmed, or aged</li></ul></li><li><strong>Type 2 — Possession Immortality</strong><ul><li>Dot_Gre Soul transfers between hosts</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Gre Requires a host body</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Gre Vulnerable to spiritual attacks</li></ul></li><li><strong>Type 3 — Regenerative Immortality</strong><ul><li>Dot_Gre Regenerates from most damage</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Gre Can be defeated through sealing, erasure, or special conditions</li></ul></li><li><strong>Type 4 — Eternal Youth</strong><ul><li>Dot_Gre Stops aging</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Gre Can still be killed normally</li></ul></li><li><strong>Type 5 — Eternal Life</strong><ul><li>Dot_Gre Lives forever but continues aging</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Gre Can still be killed</li></ul></li><li><strong>Dia_Red Immortality Rules Dia_Red</strong><ul><li>Dot_Red Types 1–3 disable Zenkai boosts</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Red Types 4–5 allow Zenkai boosts</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Red Immortality requires staff approval</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Red Immortality does not bypass combat rules</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483308667326566571/1483310730366287964","messageId":"1483310730366287964"},{"title":"Dia_Red Starting Restrictions Dia_Red","html":"<div><span><h1>Dia_Red Starting Restrictions Dia_Red</h1><ul><li>Characters may not begin the server with:\n<ul><li>Dot_Red Omnipotence or reality-level abilities</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Red Devil-Might Beam</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Red Hybrid giveaway races</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Red Advanced Spirit Control</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Red Mastery beyond your starting class</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Red Knowledge of god forms or cosmic locations</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Red A spaceship (unless Class states otherwise)</li></ul></li></ul><s>═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════</s>\n<h1>Dia_Yel Genetic Composition System Dia_Yel</h1>All characters composed of multiple races fall under this system. Whether naturally born or artificially created, all hybrids are defined by their DNA structure.\n<ul><li><strong>Dia_Blue DNA Structure Dia_Blue</strong><ul><li>Dot_Blu You may have 1–4 DNA Sources</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Blu Each DNA source must be a valid race</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Blu You must roll for Dominant DNA</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Blu Dominant DNA determines your core identity and full access</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Blu All other DNA sources are considered Secondary DNA</li></ul></li><li><strong>Dia_Gre DNA Access Rules Dia_Gre</strong><ul><li>Dominant DNA (Primary Race)</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Gre Full access to all forms, abilities, and racial mechanics</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Gre Determines visual identity (unless altered for RP)</li></ul><ul><li>Secondary DNA (All Other Races)\n<ul><li>Dot_Gre Access to first 3 forms max (For 2 DNA Source only, anymore this is NULL)</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Gre Access to 1 racial ability per DNA source (Up to 3 sources)</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Gre Cannot stack identical abilities from multiple races</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul><s>═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════</s>\n<h1>Dia_Ora Starting Power Level Scaling Dia_Ora</h1>More DNA = more potential, but less stability\n<ul><li><strong> Dia_Ora BPL Calculation Dia_Ora</strong><ul><li>Dot_Ora BPL = Race PL × 1.25 (1 DNA)</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Ora BPL = R1 + R2 (2 DNA)</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Ora BPL = (R1 + R2) ÷ 1.5 (3 DNA)</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Ora BPL = (R1 + R2) ÷ 2 (4 DNA)</li></ul></li><li><strong>Dia_Pur Boost Scaling Dia_Pur</strong><ul><li>Dot_Pur Potential Boost = Combined DNA Sources</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Pur Rage Boost = Combined DNA Sources</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Pur Boosts are reduced by -10% per DNA beyond 2\n<ul><li>Example: 4 DNA = -20% total boost efficiency</li></ul></li></ul></li><li><strong>Dia_Yel Restrictions Dia_Yel</strong><ul><li>Dot_Yel Genie &amp; Namekian cannot be used in DNA mixing</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Yel Arcosian DNA must be lab-created</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Yel Maximum 4 DNA sources</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Yel Cyborg Conversion halves Rage &amp; Potential boosts</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Yel Vampyre overlays onto existing DNA (does not count as a slot unless staff rules otherwise)</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483308667326566571/1483314356820250684","messageId":"1483314356820250684"},{"title":"Dia_Blue Magic System Dia_Blue","html":"<div><span><s>═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════</s>\n<h1>Dia_Blue Magic System Dia_Blue</h1>Magic is a structured energy system that follows the Ki Mastery framework but introduces Mana-based limitations and progression paths.\n<ul><li><strong>Dia_Gre Core Concept Dia_Gre</strong><ul><li>Dot_Gre Magic follows the same learning + mastery system as Ki</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Gre This system defines progression order and limits, not training structure</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Gre Magic does NOT override Ki systems</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Gre Magic follows the same combat damage structure</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Gre Magic uses Mana instead of Ki drain</li></ul></li><li><strong>Dia_Yel Magic Progression Dia_Yel</strong><ul><li>Each magic type follows:</li></ul><ul><li>Basic → Advanced → Mastery / Child Magic</li></ul><ul><li>Progression Rules\n<ul><li>Dot_Yel All Basic techniques must be learned first</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Yel Then all Advanced techniques</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Yel Then you may unlock:\n<ul><li>Mastery Magic</li></ul><ul><li>Child / Sub-Magic\n<ul><li>Dot_Yel Child Magic may be unlocked early only via mentorship (staff approval)</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li><li><strong>Dia_Pur Mana System Dia_Pur</strong><ul><li>Dot_Pur Mana controls usage frequency, not power (Similar to Stamina)</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Pur Max Mana Cap: 300%</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Pur Mastery does NOT remove Mana cost</li></ul><ul><li>🧘 Mana Growth\n<ul><li>Dot_Pur Meditation grants +2.5% Mana per session</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul><s>═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════</s></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483308667326566571/1483838535030149130","messageId":"1483838535030149130"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483308667326566571","excerpt":"Dia_Pur Starting Information Dia_Pur This section explains how characters begin their journey — including starting power levels, class ranks, hybrids, androids, and special conditions. ═══════════════════════════════════"},{"title":"Training & Combat System","slug":"training-combat-system","group":"System","messages":[{"title":"Dia_Blue Training & Combat System Dia_Blue","html":"<div><span><h1>Dia_Blue Training &amp; Combat System Dia_Blue</h1>This system governs how characters grow, fight, and survive. All mechanics below are enforced to maintain balance, fairness, and strong roleplay.\n<s>═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════</s>\n<h1>Dia_Gre Training System Dia_Gre</h1><ul><li><strong>Dia_Yel Training Regulations Dia_Yel</strong><ul><li>Dot_Yel Max Sessions Per Day: 4</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Yel Weekly Reset: Monday @ 12:00 AM EST</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Yel Approval Required: All gains must be approved by staff</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Yel After posting training, ping <span>@HELPER</span> for % gain + cooldown</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Yel Minimum Effort: Training quality determines your gain within the range.</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Yel Boost Reduction: Training is reduced automatically based on your Power Level Cap.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Dia_Ora Minimum Effort System Dia_Ora</strong><ul><li>Dot_Ora 1+ Paragraph → Low End</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Ora 3+ Paragraphs → Mid Range</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Ora 5+ Paragraphs → High End\n<ul><li>Dot_Ora Exceptional writing/story impact may push to maximum</li></ul></li></ul></li><li><strong>Dia_Pur Cap Reduction System Dia_Pur</strong><ul><li>Dot_Pur L1–L2: No reduction</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Pur L3: -5% (applied once)</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Pur L4: -5% (applied twice)</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Pur L5: -5% (applied three times)\n<ul><li>Staff selects your % first, then reductions apply.</li></ul></li></ul></li><li><strong>Dia_Blue Solo Training Dia_Blue</strong><ul><li>Dot_Blu Range: 15% – 40%</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Blu Cannot be done back-to-back</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Blu Cooldown scales with gain:\n<ul><li>1.5 Hours (Min)</li></ul><ul><li>4 Hours (Max)</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Blu You may still RP, spar, or story during cooldown</li></ul></li><li><strong>Dia_Gre Sparring Training Dia_Gre</strong><ul><li>Dot_Gre Weaker Opponent: 20%</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Gre Equal Opponent: 40%</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Gre Stronger Opponent: 80%</li></ul></li><li><strong>Dia_Yel Training Modifiers Dia_Yel</strong><ul><li><strong>🌟 Events / Sagas</strong></li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Yel +10% training when participating</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🏋️ Training Gear</strong><ul><li><strong>Light Gear</strong></li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Yel +10% above minimum +5% bonus</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Yel -12.5% resting PL</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Medium Gear</strong><ul><li>Dot_Yel +15% above minimum +10% bonus</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Yel -25% resting PL</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>Heavy Gear</strong><ul><li>Dot_Yel +20% above minimum +15% bonus</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Yel -50% resting PL</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌌 Accelerated Training</strong><ul><li>Dot_Yel Angel Tier: +200%</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Yel GoD Tier: +100%</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Yel Kaio / Mentor: +50%</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚖️ Gravity Chamber (Pick One)</strong><ul><li>Dot_Yel 1–10G: +5%    |  Dot_Yel 10–100G: +15%    |  Dot_Yel 100–800G: +25%    |  Dot_Yel 800–1000G: +35%</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌀 Hyperbolic Time Chamber</strong><ul><li>Dot_Yel +100% per day inside</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Yel Cooldown = 1 IRL day per day used</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483360836297953421/1483362596018061363","messageId":"1483362596018061363"},{"title":"Dia_Red Combat System Dia_Red","html":"<div><span><s>═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════</s>\n<h1>Dia_Red Combat System Dia_Red</h1><ul><li><strong>Dia_Ora Core Combat Rules Dia_Ora</strong><ul><li>Dot_Ora Higher PL = Advantage, not auto-win</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Ora Speed is abstracted (no MPH arguments)</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Ora Power-ups reach full effect next post</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Red No guaranteed KO unless target is ≤50% HP</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Red No auto-hits or forced outcomes</li></ul></li><li><strong>Dia_Blue Power Gap System Dia_Blue</strong><ul><li><strong>🟦 1.0x – 1.5x (Even)</strong></li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Blu Normal interactions</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Blu Dodge/Parry CD: 2 posts</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🟨 1.6x – 2.5x (Advantage)</strong><ul><li>Dot_Yel Stronger applies pressure</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Yel CD → Stronger: 3 | Weaker: 4</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🟧 2.6x – 4.0x (Dominant)</strong><ul><li>Dot_Ora Stronger overwhelms</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Ora CD → Stronger: 2 | Weaker: 6</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🟥 4.1x+ (Overwhelming)</strong><ul><li>Dot_Red “Too fast to track” applies</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Red Weaker may still:\n<ul><li>Always Block</li></ul><ul><li>Only Dodge/Parry telegraphed attacks</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Red CD → Stronger: 1 | Weaker: 8</li></ul></li></ul></li><li><strong>Dia_Pur Health System Dia_Pur</strong><ul><li>Dot_Pur HP = PL × 3</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💉 Healing</strong><ul><li>Dot_Pur Out of Combat: +5% per turn</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Pur Healing Chamber: Doubled recovery</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Pur In Combat: Items/techniques only</li></ul></li></ul></li><li><strong>Dia_Ora Damage System Dia_Ora</strong><ul><li>Base Damage</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Ora Basic Attacks: 6.25% PL</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Ora Super Techniques: 25% PL</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Ora Ultimate Techniques: 50% PL</li></ul><ul><li>Power Commitment\n<ul><li>Dot_Ora Low: Base damage</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Ora Medium: ×1.5 damage</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Ora High: ×2 damage</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul>Higher commitment = harder to defend, higher exhaustion\n<ul><li><strong>Dia_Blue Defense Outcomes Dia_Blue</strong><ul><li>Dot_Blu Block: 50% Damage (Still Technically Hit)</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Blu Dodge: 0 Damage</li></ul></li><li><strong>Dia_Gre Zenkai System Dia_Gre</strong><ul><li><strong>Ranges:</strong></li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Gre Saiyan → 35%–100%</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Gre Maoian → 40%–85%</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Gre Kaizokian → 25%–120%</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Gre Tuffle → 30%–110%</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Activation Rules</strong><ul><li>Dot_Gre Must be near-death</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Gre Cannot be self-induced</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Gre Requires external survival</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>Modifiers</strong><ul><li>Dot_Gre Giveaway Characters → -10%</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Gre Early healing may reduce gains</li></ul><ul><li>Dot_Gre Staff approval required</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483360836297953421/1483368272718991366","messageId":"1483368272718991366"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1483360836297953421","excerpt":"Dia_Blue Training & Combat System Dia_Blue This system governs how characters grow, fight, and survive. All mechanics below are enforced to maintain balance, fairness, and strong roleplay. ═══════════════════════════════"}],"universal":[{"title":"Hakaishin Path","slug":"hakaishin-path","messages":[{"title":"🟣 Principles of Destruction 🟣","html":"<div><span><h1>🟣 Principles of Destruction 🟣</h1>The Principles of Destruction is a fundamental technique that serves as the foundation for those who seek to attain the power of a God of Destruction. Unlike a traditional transformation, this ability is a philosophy of combat, requiring absolute conviction in destruction as a force of balance. By embracing destruction without hesitation, the user gains access to a raw, unrelenting power that obliterates anything in their path.\nThis technique refines the user's understanding of destructive energy, allowing them to wield it with increasing proficiency. The user learns how to channel Hakai energy efficiently, using it to break down matter, deflect energy-based attacks, and amplify their own offensive capabilities. Those who fully embrace these principles will find themselves on the path to unlocking even greater destructive transformations.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Destruction ⚙️</strong><ul><li>💥 <strong>Unrestrained Power</strong>: The user’s destructive energy makes it difficult to hold back, causing all attacks to deal 1.5x PL in damage, regardless of intent.</li></ul><ul><li>🔮 <strong>Enduring Destruction</strong>: The transformation passively replenishes stamina and heals minor wounds, restoring 2.5% health every 3 turns.</li></ul><ul><li>⚡ <strong>Untraceable Presence</strong>: The user’s Divine Ki signature becomes undetectable to those without God/Divine Ki, making them impossible to sense through conventional means.</li></ul><ul><li>🌀 <strong>Hakai Initiation</strong>: Grants access to the Hakai ability, allowing the user to begin wielding the power of erasure, albeit in its most basic form.</li></ul><ul><li>🔄 <strong>Integration with Other Transformations</strong>: Once mastered, the user can apply these principles to any transformation they have fully mastered, enhancing that form’s agility, efficiency, and responsiveness in battle. </li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>🔥 <strong>Destructive Will</strong>: The user must fully embrace the philosophy of destruction, showing unwavering conviction in their dominance over all opposition.</li></ul><ul><li>🛕 <strong>God of Destruction Training</strong>: Direct, rigorous training under a Hakaishin is required to cultivate the proper mindset and control over destructive energy.</li></ul><ul><li>💀 <strong>Battle-Hardened Resolve</strong>: The user must have survived near-death combat encounters, proving their ability to endure pain and grow stronger through adversity.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li>🔥 <strong>Mental Corruption</strong>: Those who embrace destruction may develop arrogance, aggression, and an unrelenting battle thirst, making rational thought harder to maintain.</li></ul><ul><li>⏳ <strong>Energy Instability</strong>: If not properly controlled, Hakai energy can rapidly deplete stamina, leaving the user exhausted.</li></ul><ul><li>🚫 <strong>Restricted Mastery</strong>: The user initially has limited control over Hakai energy, requiring extensive training to wield it effectively.</li></ul><ul><li>⚡ <strong>Limited Application</strong>: It can only be stacked onto another form once the user has obtained the Candidate of Destruction form.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multiplier 📈</strong><ul><li>Active Only: 2.5x (Only applies when activated)</li></ul></li></ul>Stacks with Transformations: If used alongside another form, it follows the Transformation Stack Rules:(Form x Form) x BPL = TPL</span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1265356041026146378/1343170788097916998","messageId":"1343170788097916998"},{"title":"🟣 Ultra Ego 🟣","html":"<div><span><h1>🟣 Ultra Ego 🟣</h1>Ultra Ego is a formidable Destruction-based transformation, embodying the sheer dominance and resilience of a God of Destruction. Unlike conventional transformations that rely on balance or finesse, Ultra Ego thrives on battle lust and the acceptance of one’s destructive instincts. The user’s power continuously rises as they endure damage, feeding off the chaos of combat and embracing the philosophy that true strength is earned through struggle.\nWhen entering Ultra Ego, the user’s aura takes on a deep violet hue, radiating intense Hakai energy that warps the surrounding area. Their physicality grows more imposing, with heightened muscle mass and glowing, piercing eyes that signify their godly status. Unlike Ultra Instinct, which avoids damage through instinctive movement, Ultra Ego embraces attacks head-on, growing stronger with every hit.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Ultra Ego ⚙️</strong><ul><li>🔥 <strong>Battle-Driven Growth</strong>: Each attack received fuels your power, increasing your overall strength by 10% per hit taken (max 3 stacks per battle).</li></ul><ul><li>⚡ <strong>Relentless Offense</strong>: The user's attacks deal 1.25x normal damage and have a higher likelihood of breaking through standard defenses.</li></ul><ul><li>💀 <strong>Hardened Endurance</strong>: The user develops an increased tolerance for pain, allowing them to push through injuries, but still feeling their effects.</li></ul><ul><li>🌀 <strong>Hakai Affinity</strong>: The user taps into Hakai energy but with only partial mastery, leading to unpredictable and unstable energy control.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Absorb a small but controlled portion of Hakai energy from a God of Destruction, forging a deeper connection with the nature of destruction.</li></ul><ul><li>Undergo direct and rigorous training under a God of Destruction, mastering both the philosophy and raw power of Hakai.</li></ul><ul><li>Engage in a battle where survival is uncertain, requiring the user to be critically injured before first activation.</li></ul><ul><li>Demonstrate unwavering resolve and a destructive will, proving complete commitment to the path of destruction.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li>🕒 <strong>Reckless Mindset</strong>: Ultra Ego emboldens the user with overconfidence, making them more prone to disregarding tactical planning in favor of brute strength.</li></ul><ul><li>🔥 <strong>Unstable Growth</strong>: While damage fuels strength, taking excessive hits can lead to critical exhaustion or long-term damage.</li></ul><ul><li>⏳ <strong>Heavy Stamina Drain</strong>: Maintaining Ultra Ego requires immense energy, leading to rapid stamina depletion if used recklessly.</li></ul><ul><li>💥 <strong>Time Constraint</strong>: The form lasts for a maximum of 12 turns before its benefits begin diminishing, gradually reducing power gains and effectiveness.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multiplier 📈</strong><ul><li>First Activation: 50,000x</li></ul><ul><li>Second Activation: 100,000x</li></ul><ul><li>Third Activation: 250,000x</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1265356041026146378/1343177298681004113","messageId":"1343177298681004113"},{"title":"Ego Refined","html":"<div><span><h1>🌌 Ego Refined 🌌</h1>The Ego Refined transformation represents the peak of destructive chaos harnessed into an unrelenting force. Unlike previous evolutions, which relied on rage and instinct, this form refines Hakai energy into a raw, uncontrollable power that thrives on destruction itself. It is not about balance or restraint but embracing the boundless nature of obliteration, making the user a true embodiment of devastation.\nUpon activation, the user's aura darkens into a violent storm of pulsating Hakai energy, unstable yet undeniably powerful. Their hair shifts into a deep, glowing amethyst, and their eyes burn with an untamed ferocity. Every movement resonates with destruction, their very presence eroding the stability of the battlefield as cracks form beneath their feet with every step. Unlike earlier forms, where destruction was a tool, Ego Refined allows destruction to fuel the user endlessly, growing stronger as they revel in obliteration.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Ego Refined ⚙️</strong><ul><li>💥 <strong>Hakai Resurgence</strong>: The user channels an immense surge of Hakai energy, amplifying all abilities by 50% for 3 turns. However, this surge strains the body, leading to a 20% reduction in power for the following 2 turns.</li></ul><ul><li>🎯 <strong>Precision of Destruction</strong>: The user wields Hakai energy with unparalleled accuracy, allowing them to target specific areas or opponents with devastating precision, increasing critical hit chance by 40%.</li></ul><ul><li>🛡️ <strong>Hakai Shield</strong>: The user creates a barrier of pure Hakai energy that absorbs 30% of incoming damage and converts it into health, reinforcing both offensive and defensive prowess.</li></ul><ul><li>💀 <strong>Annihilation Wave</strong>: A focused blast of concentrated destruction energy, erasing anything in its path. This attack bypasses most defenses and has a 3-turn cooldown.</li></ul><ul><li>💢 <strong>Unstable Dominion</strong>: Destruction no longer requires focus—Hakai energy radiates naturally, causing surrounding terrain and weaker beings to slowly deteriorate within 10 meters.</li></ul><ul><li>⛓️‍💥 <strong>Ruinous Might</strong>: The user’s attacks become devastatingly amplified, dealing 1.5x damage with every physical strike and 2x damage with energy-based Hakai techniques.</li></ul><ul><li>🏃‍♂️ <strong>Relentless Destruction</strong>: The user’s stamina regeneration is doubled, but they are compelled to continue fighting relentlessly, making retreat and strategic disengagement almost impossible.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>🪫 <strong>Absorb a Fragment of Hakai Energy</strong>: The user must absorb and withstand a direct infusion of raw Hakai energy from a God of Destruction, maintaining control without being erased.</li></ul><ul><li>🏋️‍♂️ <strong>Completion of the Hakaishin Trial</strong>: The user must undergo a divine trial set by a God of Destruction to prove their dominance over their own power.</li></ul><ul><li>⛪ <strong>Survive a Destruction Baptism</strong>: The user must endure a full-force Hakai attack without evading or shielding, proving their body can withstand the force of annihilation.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li>🧠 <strong>Ego Vulnerability</strong>: If the user begins to doubt themselves or waver in their conviction, their refined control over Hakai energy may destabilize, forcing them to retrain from the ground up.</li></ul><ul><li>🔄 <strong>Irreversible Instability</strong>: This form makes precise control over Hakai energy difficult, leading to unintended destruction in the surrounding environment.</li></ul><ul><li>😱 <strong>Frenzied State</strong>: The longer this form is active, the harder it becomes to think rationally—extended use results in a battle-mad state where reasoning and tactics become secondary to pure destruction.</li></ul><ul><li>🔥 <strong>Burnout Effect</strong>: If this form is sustained for too long, the user will enter an exhausted state where their power is drastically weakened for 5 turns after deactivating.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multiplier 📈</strong><ul><li>2,500,000x</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1265356041026146378/1343183491025866793","messageId":"1343183491025866793"},{"title":"🛡️ Candidate of Destruction 🛡️","html":"<div><span><h1>🛡️ Candidate of Destruction 🛡️</h1>The Candidate of Destruction form is the embodiment of unrestrained destructive force, granted to those chosen by a God of Destruction. This transformation marks the complete acceptance of the Hakaishin path, elevating the user beyond mortality into a being of pure devastation. Those who attain this form are no longer bound by hesitation or morality—destruction is their will, and obliteration follows their every action.\nUpon activation, the user's body undergoes a severe transformation. Their physique becomes more defined and reinforced by pure Hakai energy, exuding an overwhelming aura of annihilation. Their eyes glow with an ominous light, and their entire presence distorts the very fabric of the battlefield. The air around them becomes thick with oppressive energy, causing fear and unease even in the most seasoned warriors.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of the Candidate of Destruction ⚙️</strong><ul><li>⚡ <strong>Absolute Destruction</strong>: All attacks ignore conventional defenses, breaking through magical, physical, and energy-based barriers, rendering conventional resistance futile.</li></ul><ul><li>🌌 <strong>Destructive Ruin</strong>: The user can release destructive shockwaves that disintegrate everything caught in their range, leaving behind zones where regeneration is impossible.</li></ul><ul><li>💥 <strong>Destruction Embodiment</strong>: Every movement radiates Hakai energy, turning even the smallest gestures into catastrophic forces of destruction.</li></ul><ul><li>🩸 <strong>Hakai Reconstitution</strong>: The user can forcefully convert destructive energy into a regenerative force, rapidly restoring lost stamina and healing critical wounds at the cost of temporarily reducing their overall power output.</li></ul><ul><li>🔥 <strong>Rampant Destruction</strong>: As the battle progresses, the user’s power continuously builds, increasing their destructive output by 5% per turn, stacking up to 50%.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>🏋️ <strong>Intensive Training</strong>: Train under a God of Destruction 100 times, proving both endurance and dedication to the path.</li></ul><ul><li>🟣 <strong>Hakai Energy Mastery</strong>: Absorb and harness the full might of Hakai energy directly from a Hakaishin, demonstrating complete control over destructive forces.</li></ul><ul><li>🗒️ <strong>Official Appointment</strong>: Be officially acknowledged and appointed as a Candidate of Destruction by a Hakaishin, signifying absolute commitment to their doctrine.</li></ul><ul><li>🧠 <strong>Mind of Annihilation</strong>: Show unwavering conviction in destruction, accepting the loss of past limitations and embracing the destructive will in both thought and action.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li>💢 <strong>Hakai Instability</strong>: Maintaining this form demands constant control. A moment of carelessness can lead to unintended destruction, potentially harming allies or destroying the battlefield itself.</li></ul><ul><li>👿 <strong>Chaotic Instincts</strong>: The user is driven by a primal urge for destruction, making it difficult to strategize or focus beyond their overwhelming need to annihilate.</li></ul><ul><li>🪫 <strong>Severe Energy Drain</strong>: This form consumes an immense amount of energy, and prolonged use without restraint will rapidly exhaust the user, forcing them out of the state.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multiplier 📈</strong><ul><li>5,000,000x</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1265356041026146378/1343188476761473064","messageId":"1343188476761473064"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1265356041026146378","count":4},{"title":"Inner-Potential Path","slug":"inner-potential-path","messages":[{"title":"Potential Unleashed ⚡","html":"<div><span><h1>⚡ <a href=\"https://media.tenor.com/wfCX4KLqBEcAAAAM/gohan-mystic.gif\">Potential Unleashed</a> ⚡</h1>Potential Unleashed is a transformative state achieved through a sacred ritual performed by a Kai, lasting 24 hours. This process unlocks the deepest recesses of a warrior's latent strength, drawing out power that was once inaccessible. As the transformation takes hold, the user's aura flares into a radiant, almost ethereal glow, subtly altering their physical presence. Their musculature becomes more refined, their eyes sharp with heightened focus, and an unseen force of energy pulsates around them, marking their ascension.\nWhile this state grants immense speed, strength, and combat awareness, it also influences the user’s temperament—enhancing confidence to the point of arrogance. This newfound power is raw, untamed, and must be refined through battle and discipline to be fully mastered. Without experience, the user may struggle to control the overwhelming energy surging through their being, making them reckless in combat.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Potential Unleashed ⚙️</strong><ul><li>🦅 <strong>Enhanced Combat Awareness</strong>: The user’s senses become razor-sharp, detecting even the slightest shifts in movement, energy fluctuations, and intent.</li></ul><ul><li>⚡ <strong>Power Surge</strong>: For the first 10 turns of combat, the user gains an additional 50% boost to their power output.</li></ul><ul><li>🔥 <strong>Aura of Dominance</strong>: The user's presence creates an overwhelming pressure, instilling fear and hesitation in weaker foes.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>🌟 Must undergo the Grand Supreme Kai’s/Majin’s Ritual (24-hour duration) and prove inner fortitude by emerging victorious in a battle against an equal or stronger opponent without external assistance.</li></ul><ul><li>🌿 Must train in absolute solitude for three days, meditating on the balance between raw power and controlled refinement.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li>⚠️ <strong>Overwhelming Ego</strong>: The surge of power fuels arrogance, leading to reckless decision-making and underestimating opponents.</li></ul><ul><li>⚡ <strong>Instability in Combat</strong>: The drastic power increase makes it difficult to control energy output, causing unintended collateral damage.</li></ul><ul><li>🛡️ <strong>Defensive Blind Spots</strong>: Overconfidence reduces the user's focus on defense, making them more vulnerable to counterattacks.</li></ul><ul><li>🎭 <strong>Emotional Imbalance</strong>: The form amplifies emotional extremes, making the user prone to sudden outbursts of aggression or lapses in judgment.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>Arcosian, Super Earthling, Namekian</strong>: 6,000x + Base PL Perma-Boost 8x</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Majin, Cerealian, Maoian, Vampyre</strong>: 3,000x + Base PL Perma-Boost 6x</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Saiyan, Kaizokian, Tuffle, Genie</strong>: 1,500x + Base PL Perma-Boost 4x\n<ul><li><strong>Hybrids, Bio-Androids</strong>: Follow Hybrid System</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Mutants</strong>: 2x Normal Race Boost.</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1264730784481411162/1343405891776548885","messageId":"1343405891776548885"},{"title":"Potential Refined ⚡","html":"<div><span><h1>⚡ <a href=\"https://i.redd.it/nlfkvcfipwhb1.gif\">Potential Refined</a> ⚡</h1>Potential Refined is the next evolution in tapping into one's latent strength, where raw power is no longer an uncontrolled surge but a carefully honed force. The user's appearance sharpens subtly, their gaze becoming more focused, their stance more assured. Crackling arcs of bio-electricity weave through their aura, signaling refined ki manipulation. Unlike its predecessor, this form channels power with absolute precision, allowing the user to maintain peak efficiency without excess strain.\nThe transformation brings a heightened synergy between mind and body, with every movement flowing seamlessly into the next. Their energy surges in rhythmic pulses, increasing combat speed and fluidity. Strikes become sharper, defenses tighter, and reactions nearly instantaneous, making this form a testament to the wielder's growing mastery over their true potential.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Potential Refined ⚙️</strong><ul><li>🦅 <strong>Enhanced Combat Awareness</strong>: The user’s senses become razor-sharp, detecting even the slightest shifts in movement, energy fluctuations, and intent.</li></ul><ul><li>⚡ <strong>Power Surge</strong>: For the first 10 turns of combat, the user gains an additional 50% boost to their power output.</li></ul><ul><li>🔥 <strong>Aura of Dominance</strong>: The user's presence creates an overwhelming pressure, instilling fear and hesitation in weaker foes.</li></ul><ul><li>🏃 <strong>Unstoppable Momentum</strong>: With each successful attack, the user's combat flow intensifies, granting a stacking 10% boost in speed and power every 5 turns. This effect builds until the user reaches their maximum output of 100%.</li></ul><ul><li>⚡ <strong>Divine Energy</strong>: The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns. Their ki undetectable to those without Divine Ki.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>🏋️ Engage in intensive training of Potential Unleashed, completing a minimum of 50 heavy training sessions that push both physical and mental endurance to their peak.</li></ul><ul><li>💀 Must endure a near-fatal confrontation, facing overwhelming odds and pushing past physical and mental limits to unlock a deeper well of power.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li>⚠️ <strong>Overwhelming Confidence</strong>: The surge of power amplifies arrogance, making the user prone to underestimating opponents and taking unnecessary risks.</li></ul><ul><li>🔥 <strong>Instability Under Stress</strong>: If the user is overwhelmed by stronger opponents, they may lose control over their refined energy output, leading to exhaustion or inefficient ki usage.</li></ul><ul><li>💥 <strong>Increased Aggressiveness</strong>: The heightened power flow may lead to a more relentless and offensive fighting style, making defensive maneuvers harder to execute in prolonged encounters.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li>First Use: Potential Unleashed Boost x10</li></ul><ul><li>Second Use: Potential Unleashed Boost x20</li></ul><ul><li>Third Use: Potential Unleashed Boost x30</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1264730784481411162/1343406433164595220","messageId":"1343406433164595220"},{"title":"Expelled Potential ⚡","html":"<div><span><h1>⚡ <a href=\"https://i.makeagif.com/media/2-24-2025/F--bgt.gif\">Expelled Potential</a> ⚡</h1>Expelled Potential forces the body to shatter its natural boundaries, tearing through limitations with an explosion of raw, unfiltered energy. This transformation is fueled entirely by emotion, forging a warrior consumed by their own rage and desperation. Unlike its more balanced predecessors, Expelled Potential does not seek harmony—it thrives in chaos. The user’s body surges with unstable power, their aura crackling with uncontrolled energy, arcs of bio-electricity dancing wildly around them as their form shifts to accommodate the overwhelming force coursing through them.\nThis state is highly volatile, pushing the user past mortal and even divine constraints, allowing them to rival beings of godly might—if only briefly. However, this power is not without cost. The transformation feeds on pure emotion, turning every strike into an act of unrelenting fury and making restraint impossible. Each movement is driven by instinct rather than strategy, and without careful mastery, the user may find themselves consumed by the very power they sought to wield.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Expelled Potential ⚙️</strong><ul><li>🦅 <strong>Enhanced Combat Awareness</strong>: The user’s senses become razor-sharp, detecting even the slightest shifts in movement, energy fluctuations, and intent.</li></ul><ul><li>⚡ <strong>Power Surge</strong>: For the first 10 turns of combat, the user gains an additional 50% boost to their power output.</li></ul><ul><li>🔥 <strong>Aura of Dominance</strong>: The user's presence creates an overwhelming pressure, instilling fear and hesitation in weaker foes.</li></ul><ul><li>🏃 <strong>Unstoppable Momentum</strong>: With each successful attack, the user's combat flow intensifies, granting a stacking 10% boost in speed and power every 5 turns. This effect builds until the user reaches their maximum output of 100%.</li></ul><ul><li>⚡ <strong>Divine Energy</strong>: The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns. Their ki undetectable to those without Divine Ki.</li></ul><ul><li>💥 <strong>Overwhelming Potential</strong>: The user's attacks become 3x stronger, their strikes carrying a relentless force that disregards conventional limits.</li></ul><ul><li>🔥 <strong>Raging Inferno</strong>: The user's aura erupts like a violent storm, radiating intense heat that continuously sears enemies within range. Those caught in its proximity suffer persistent damage over time.</li></ul><ul><li>🛡️ <strong>Indomitable Will</strong>: The user's resolve becomes unbreakable, rendering them immune to mind-control, fear effects, and any form of mental manipulation. Standing resolute against any force that seeks to control them.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>💥 The user must experience a near-death encounter, their body pushed beyond its limits, teetering on the edge of survival.</li></ul><ul><li>🔥 The user's rage must reach a breaking point, pushing them into a state where pure emotion overrides rational thought.</li></ul><ul><li>⚔️ The user must have engaged in at least 25 life-or-death battles, proving their endurance and adaptability under extreme conditions.</li></ul><ul><li>⚡ The user must endure a prolonged surge of unstable energy, forcing their body to adapt to the overwhelming power threatening to consume them.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li>🔥 <strong>Uncontrollable Wrath</strong>: The user's rage becomes an all-consuming force, making it impossible to distinguish between ally and foe. They lash out indiscriminately, driven solely by instinct and destruction.</li></ul><ul><li>⚡ <strong>Chaotic Instincts</strong>: Rational thought is diminished, making precise strategy and tactical decisions nearly impossible. The user fights purely on impulse, reducing their ability to plan or react logically.</li></ul><ul><li>🌋 <strong>Energy Overload</strong>: The sheer intensity of Expelled Potential causes instability within the user's ki reserves. Prolonged use can lead to sudden energy bursts that may cause self-inflicted damage.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li>First Use: 500,000x</li></ul><ul><li>Second Use: 1,000,000x</li></ul><ul><li>Third Use: 2,500,000x</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1264730784481411162/1343410515619352627","messageId":"1343410515619352627"},{"title":"Unbound Potential ⚡","html":"<div><span><h1>⚡ <a href=\"https://www.icegif.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/icegif-426.gif\">Unbound Potential</a> ⚡</h1>Unbound Potential represents the absolute peak of one's inner reserves, granting power that rivals the gods themselves. The user becomes a beacon of raw, limitless strength, their aura radiating celestial energy. In this state, all previous restrictions are shattered, allowing the fighter to transcend all previous limitations and fight at full, unrestricted capacity. However, wielding such power requires immense control, as it teeters on the brink of self-destruction.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Unbound Potential ⚙️</strong></li></ul><ul><li>🦅 <strong>Enhanced Combat Awareness</strong>: The user’s senses become razor-sharp, detecting even the slightest shifts in movement, energy fluctuations, and intent.</li></ul><ul><li>⚡ <strong>Power Surge</strong>: For the first 10 turns of combat, the user gains an additional 50% boost to their power output.</li></ul><ul><li>🔥 <strong>Aura of Dominance</strong>: The user's presence creates an overwhelming pressure, instilling fear and hesitation in weaker foes. Reducing their attack power by 10%.</li></ul><ul><li>🏃 <strong>Unstoppable Momentum</strong>: With each successful attack, the user's combat flow intensifies, granting a stacking 10% boost in speed and power every 5 turns. This effect builds until the user reaches their maximum output of 100%.</li></ul><ul><li>⚡ <strong>Divine Energy</strong>: The user's body passively regenerates stamina and health at a rate of 2.5% every 3 turns. Their ki undetectable to those without Divine Ki.</li></ul><ul><li>💥 <strong>Overwhelming Potential</strong>: The user's attacks become 3x stronger, their strikes carrying a relentless force that disregards conventional limits.</li></ul><ul><li>🔥 <strong>Raging Inferno</strong>: The user's aura erupts like a violent storm, radiating intense heat that continuously sears enemies within range. Those caught in its proximity suffer persistent damage over time.</li></ul><ul><li>🛡️ <strong>Indomitable Will</strong>: The user's resolve becomes unbreakable, rendering them immune to mind-control, fear effects, and any form of mental manipulation. Standing resolute against any force that seeks to control them.</li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong></li></ul><ul><li>🏋️ Train in Expelled Potential at least 50 times to condition the body for extreme power output.</li></ul><ul><li>⚔️ Must experience a life-or-death battle where survival is uncertain, proving the will to endure.</li></ul><ul><li>🔄 Achieve total synchronization with one's unleashed strength, accepting both its power and its burden.</li></ul><ul><li>💥 Face and overcome a moment of absolute despair, triggering the final unlocking of one's potential.</li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong></li></ul><ul><li>⏳ <strong>First Activation</strong>: After 10 turns of attacking, damage output reverts to normal levels.</li></ul><ul><li>🧠 <strong>Mental Instability</strong>: If not kept in check, the sheer intensity of this power can lead to erratic and uncontrollable behavior.</li></ul><ul><li>🔥 <strong>Unrestrained Destruction</strong>: The user's attacks become difficult to temper, increasing the risk of unnecessary collateral damage. The sheer intensity of the aura can cause unstable environmental effects, making combat unpredictable.</li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong></li></ul><ul><li>First Use: 5,000,000x</li></ul><ul><li>Second Use: 7,500,000x</li></ul><ul><li>Third Use: 10,000,000x</li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1264730784481411162/1343410547932270624","messageId":"1343410547932270624"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1264730784481411162","count":4},{"title":"Instinctual Path","slug":"instinctual-path","messages":[{"title":"🥋 Principles of Instinct 🥋","html":"<div><span><h1>🥋 Principles of Instinct 🥋</h1>The Principles of Instinct is a unique transformation-like technique that serves as the crucial predecessor to the legendary Ultra Instinct Sign. It allows a warrior to move and react with unparalleled speed, precision, and instinctive awareness by fully mastering martial discipline, breath control, and combat flow. Unlike a traditional transformation, this state is a mastery of movement and perception, allowing the user to maintain full control over their actions while reducing wasted energy.\nWhat makes this ability truly powerful is that, once fully mastered, the Principles of Instinct can be applied to any transformation the user has complete mastery over, enhancing the form’s effectiveness by granting instinctive movement and heightened battle awareness.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Instinct ⚙️</strong><ul><li>🌀 <strong>Predictive Insight</strong>: The user gains the ability to sense and anticipate opponent movements with remarkable accuracy, making direct attacks far easier to dodge or counter.</li></ul><ul><li>💨 <strong>Fluid Movements</strong>: Wasted motion is eliminated, allowing for seamless dodging and attacking, greatly optimizing battle efficiency.</li></ul><ul><li>⚡ <strong>Enhanced Combat Awareness</strong>: The fighter’s heightened awareness lets them analyze the flow of battle and adapt to their opponent’s strategies effortlessly.</li></ul><ul><li>🧘 <strong>Mastery of Breath &amp; Stamina</strong>: The user maintains perfect breath control, reducing stamina drain and maximizing endurance in prolonged fights.</li></ul><ul><li>🛡️ <strong>Heightened Reflexes</strong>: Instinctive movement becomes more refined, granting the ability to react to danger without conscious effort.</li></ul><ul><li>🔄 <strong>Integration with Other Transformations</strong>: Once mastered, the user can apply these principles to any transformation they have fully mastered, enhancing that form’s agility, efficiency, and responsiveness in battle. Only once [Purified Ultra Instinct]() has been reached</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>🥋 Achieve complete mastery of martial arts combat, understanding both offense and defense at a masterful level.</li></ul><ul><li>🛕 Train under a God of Martial Arts, learning the philosophy and discipline necessary to free their movements from mental restriction.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li>🕒 <strong>Requires Focused Training</strong>: This form demands intense martial discipline and refined combat experience, making it difficult to attain.</li></ul><ul><li>💀 <strong>Not Invincible</strong>: While powerful, it does not grant invulnerability—a skilled opponent can still land blows if they adapt quickly.</li></ul><ul><li>🧠 <strong>Still Requires Conscious Thought</strong>: Unlike Ultra Instinct, this form still relies on battle awareness and decision-making, rather than complete instinctive reaction.</li></ul><ul><li>⚡ <strong>Limited Application</strong>: It can only be stacked onto another form once the user has obtained True Ultra Instinct.</li></ul><ul><li>⌛ <strong>Emotional Restriction</strong>: When this is active, the users emotions cannot contribute to their power or strategy (Rage Boost is NULL)</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multiplier 📈</strong><ul><li>Active Only: 2.5x (Only applies when activated)</li></ul></li></ul>Stacks with Transformations: If used alongside another form, it follows the Transformation Stack Rules:(Form x Form) x BPL = TPL</span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1264727613629272074/1342711562061873184","messageId":"1342711562061873184"},{"title":"Ultra Instinct Sign ⚡","html":"<div><span><h1>⚡ Ultra Instinct Sign ⚡</h1>Ultra Instinct Sign is a state of heightened awareness and reflexes, granting the practitioner unparalleled speed, precision, and instinctive combat prowess. Unlike traditional transformations, this state allows the user to move and react without conscious thought, ensuring effortless evasion, counterattacks, and enhanced offensive efficiency.\nThis ability is achieved through intense martial training, requiring the user to abandon conventional battle instincts and embrace a state of absolute calm and focus. It is the first step toward the complete mastery of Ultra Instinct, marking a significant leap beyond mortal limitations. Mastery of Ultra Instinct is done through the following transformations\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Ultra Instinct Sign ⚙️</strong><ul><li>🌀 <strong>Instinctive Evasion</strong>: The user's reflexes surpass conscious thought, allowing them to dodge and counter without deliberate action, greatly reducing an opponent’s hit accuracy.</li></ul><ul><li>⚡ <strong>Unleashed Potential</strong>: While active, all attacks are amplified, dealing 1.5x normal damage.</li></ul><ul><li>👁️ <strong>Divine Perception</strong>: The user can predict and react to enemy movements with near-flawless precision.</li></ul><ul><li>🌌 <strong>Divine Power</strong>: The user's energy signature becomes undetectable to those without Divine Ki, making them difficult to track.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>⚔️ Experience the brink of death (Only required for the first activation).</li></ul><ul><li>🕊️ Undergo direct training with an Angel, mastering the principles of instinctual combat.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li>⏳ <strong>Limited Duration</strong>: On the first activation, after 10 turns of attacking, damage output reverts to normal levels.</li></ul><ul><li>⚡ <strong>High Energy Drain</strong>: Maintaining this state requires significant stamina, meaning prolonged use can be dangerous.</li></ul><ul><li>🛑 <strong>Unstable Control</strong>: Until mastery is achieved, the transformation may be difficult to maintain under extreme stress.</li></ul><ul><li>⌛ <strong>Emotional Restriction</strong>: When this is active, the users emotions cannot contribute to their power or strategy (Rage Boost is NULL)</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multiplier 📈</strong><ul><li>First Use: 50,000x </li></ul><ul><li>Second Use: 100,000x </li></ul><ul><li>Third Use: 250,000x</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1264727613629272074/1342715761185259581","messageId":"1342715761185259581"},{"title":"Purified Ultra Instinct ⚡","html":"<div><span><h1>⚡ Purified Ultra Instinct ⚡</h1>Purified Ultra Instinct is the next stage beyond Ultra Instinct Sign, representing an even greater refinement of instinctive combat and mental clarity. It is a state of being that only the most disciplined warriors can achieve, requiring relentless training, intense focus, and the guidance of a celestial mentor.\nUnlike its predecessor, this form further enhances speed, precision, and combat efficiency, allowing the user to react instantaneously to threats without any wasted movement. While it is not the true mastered version of Ultra Instinct, it is a significant step towards ultimate self-mastery, providing the warrior with overwhelming power, heightened perception, and a tranquil, focused mind.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Purified Ultra Instinct ⚙️</strong><ul><li>🌀 <strong>Instinctive Mastery</strong>: Reflexes are pushed to their absolute peak, making the user nearly untouchable in combat. They dodge and counter effortlessly, maximizing defensive capabilities.</li></ul><ul><li>⚡ <strong>Overwhelming Presence</strong>: The sheer intensity of the user's aura exerts a psychological pressure on opponents, leading to hesitation, fear, and increased mistakes.</li></ul><ul><li>👁️ <strong>Divine Clarity</strong>: Mental awareness and focus are vastly enhanced, allowing for superior battle strategy and the ability to remain composed even in chaotic combat situations.</li></ul><ul><li>🌌 <strong>Celestial Combat Prowess</strong>: This form sharpens offensive abilities, enabling the user to break through defenses with pinpoint precision while maintaining supreme efficiency in battle.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>⚔️ <strong>Use Ultra Instinct Sign in Combat at Least 3 Times</strong>: The body must condition itself to handle the form through repeated activation in real combat.</li></ul><ul><li>🕊️ <strong>Train Under an Angel at Least 4 Times</strong>: Requires additional training with a divine mentor to refine movement and energy control.</li></ul><ul><li>🧘 <strong>Absolute Emotional Detachment</strong>: The user must eliminate all emotional interference to fully embrace tranquility in combat.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li>⏳ <strong>First Activation Drawback</strong>: On the first use, after 10 turns of attacking, damage output returns to normal levels.</li></ul><ul><li>⚡ <strong>High Energy Demand</strong>: While incredibly powerful, maintaining this form requires significant stamina and ki, making prolonged usage risky.</li></ul><ul><li>🛑 <strong>Still Not Complete Mastery</strong>: This form is not yet the fully perfected Ultra Instinct, meaning it still requires concentration and refinement to maintain.</li></ul><ul><li>⌛ <strong>Emotional Restriction</strong>: When this is active, the users emotions cannot contribute to their power or strategy (Rage Boost is NULL)</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multiplier 📈</strong><ul><li>2,500,000x</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1264727613629272074/1343139897514524713","messageId":"1343139897514524713"},{"title":"True Ultra Instinct","html":"<div><span><h1>🌌 True Ultra Instinct 🌌</h1>This transformation is an exceptionally rare and powerful state that only a select few can attain after extensive training under divine beings. Those who reach this form radiate a pure, celestial energy, their bodies enveloped in an ethereal aura that signifies their mastery over instinctive combat. Unlike previous stages of Ultra Instinct, this form allows the user to fully embrace their emotions without disrupting their combat efficiency. Instead of suppressing their feelings, they use them as fuel, harnessing passion, determination, and willpower to push beyond conventional limits. Their speed, strength, and agility reach near-divine levels, making them an overwhelming force in battle. The true power of True Ultra Instinct lies in its ability to perfect instinctive combat, granting an almost precognitive awareness of danger. The user can effortlessly evade even the most complex attacks and counter with precision, their movements so refined and fluid that they seem to glide through combat without resistance.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of True Ultra Instinct ⚙️</strong><ul><li>🌀 <strong>Preemptive Reflexes</strong>: The user’s reaction time is so advanced that they instinctively dodge and counter before an attack is fully executed, making it nearly impossible to land a clean hit.</li></ul><ul><li>⚡ <strong>Divine Perception</strong>: Their senses are heightened to transcendent levels, allowing them to perceive subtle shifts in energy, movements, and intent far beyond normal comprehension.</li></ul><ul><li>🌌 <strong>Aura of Dominion</strong>: The celestial aura surrounding the user exerts immense psychological pressure, inducing hesitation and disrupting enemy focus, making foes more prone to mistakes.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>🔄 <strong>Train Under an Angel 100 Times</strong>: The user must undergo extreme divine training, refining both the mind and body to their peak.</li></ul><ul><li>⚡ <strong>Achieve Absolute Mastery Over UIS &amp; PUI</strong>: The user must be able to activate and sustain both prior forms effortlessly.</li></ul><ul><li>❤️ Learn to Harness Emotion for Power Unlike prior Ultra Instinct stages, where detachment was required, this form demands perfect control of emotions, allowing them to fuel and amplify combat effectiveness.</li></ul><ul><li>🥋 <strong>Conditioned Combat Efficiency</strong>: The user must engage in 100 high-stakes battles, proving they can instinctively react in chaotic situations without losing precision or control.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li>🔋 <strong>Extreme Energy Demand</strong>: This form places an enormous strain on stamina and ki, making prolonged combat unsustainable without expert energy management.</li></ul><ul><li>🛑 <strong>High Mastery Threshold</strong>: Unlike its predecessors, this form is not purely automatic, requiring a balance of instinct and strategic thinking to maintain effectiveness.</li></ul><ul><li>⏳ <strong>Temporary Surge</strong>: While immensely powerful, True Ultra Instinct is not infinite. Extended combat will eventually cause gradual fatigue, leading to diminishing returns.</li></ul><ul><li>⚡ <strong>Emotion-Linked Stability</strong>: If the user's emotions become too unstable (extreme anger, grief, or excitement), it can disrupt the form’s precision and cause energy surges that drain reserves at an accelerated rate.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multiplier 📈</strong><ul><li>5,000,000x</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1264727613629272074/1343142160970813494","messageId":"1343142160970813494"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1264727613629272074","count":4},{"title":"Kaioshin Path","slug":"kaioshin-path","messages":[{"title":"⚖️ Principles of Creation ⚖️","html":"<div><span><h1>⚖️ Principles of Creation ⚖️</h1>The Principles of Creation serve as the foundation for those walking the path of divine creation, granting them a refined understanding of the forces that shape existence itself. Unlike traditional transformations, this is not a raw power boost but a disciplined technique centered around control, refinement, and creation energy. It enhances the user's ability to shape, restore, and manipulate reality, allowing them to wield divine power with precision and purpose. Those who master this technique gain heightened awareness of life energy and the ability to influence it to their advantage.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Principles of Creation ⚙️</strong><ul><li>🌿 <strong>Kai Initiation</strong>: The user learns to harness the energy of creation, allowing them to mend, shape, and manipulate matter at will, restoring damaged landscapes or structures with ease.</li></ul><ul><li>✨ <strong>Sacred Flow</strong>: The user’s ki flows effortlessly, allowing them to conserve stamina and extend their endurance in combat.</li></ul><ul><li>🔆 <strong>Life Sense</strong>: The practitioner develops a heightened ability to sense and understand the life force of all beings, detecting energy signatures that are normally hidden.</li></ul><ul><li>🔄 <strong>Integration with Other Transformations</strong>: Once mastered, the user can apply these principles to any transformation they have fully mastered, enhancing that form’s agility, efficiency, and responsiveness in battle. </li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>🌌 <strong>Divine Training</strong>: Must undergo training under a Kai or Makai to understand the balance of creation energy.</li></ul><ul><li>🛕 <strong>Mastery of Ki</strong>: Must have complete mastery over their own ki and understand the principles of shaping energy rather than simply projecting it.</li></ul><ul><li>🔄 <strong>Inner Balance</strong>: The user must maintain a controlled and stable mindset, as creation energy requires discipline and intent.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li>⏳ <strong>Requires Focused Training</strong>: Mastery of this technique takes dedicated study and refinement under divine tutelage.</li></ul><ul><li>⚠️ <strong>Not a Combat Boost</strong>: Unlike offensive transformations, this technique does not inherently increase raw power output but instead refines energy control.</li></ul><ul><li>⚡ <strong>Limited Application</strong>: It can only be stacked onto another form once the user has obtained the Supreme Kai form.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multiplier 📈</strong><ul><li>Active Only: 2.5x (Only applies when activated)</li></ul></li></ul>Stacks with Transformations: If used alongside another form, it follows the Transformation Stack Rules:(Form x Form) x BPL = TPL</span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1264730310621270068/1343717634176192513","messageId":"1343717634176192513"},{"title":"☀️ Ultra Providence ☀️","html":"<div><span><h1>☀️ <a href=\"https://i.pinimg.com/originals/6d/18/c1/6d18c154e8cfd7f538328ccdc76527b7.gif\">Ultra Providence</a> ☀️</h1>Ultra Providence represents the second major ascension in the path of the Kaioshin and Makyoshin, marking a deeper attunement to the energies of creation and universal balance. Unlike Principles of Creation, which focuses on harnessing divine energy, Ultra Providence enhances the user’s ability to shape and guide the flow of life itself. This transformation is not about complete mastery but rather an evolving connection to the fundamental forces that govern existence.\nWhen activated, the user is enveloped in a radiant aura that fluctuates between warmth and authority, symbolizing their growing but still imperfect control over divine energy. Their awareness expands, allowing them to sense disturbances in the cosmic fabric and respond accordingly. Their presence alone fosters stability, yet their influence is still developing, requiring further refinement and experience to wield with true precision.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Ultra Providence ⚙️</strong></li></ul><ul><li>🔮 <strong>Expanding Perception</strong>: The user gains heightened awareness of cosmic disturbances, allowing them to sense shifts in balance and react accordingly.</li></ul><ul><li>🌱 <strong>Manifestation</strong>: While still developing, the user can shape and refine small-scale creations, guiding the flow of energy to restore or enhance life within a limited radius.</li></ul><ul><li>🌀 <strong>Stabilizing Force</strong>: The user's mere presence passively reinforces equilibrium in their surroundings, reducing the influence of chaotic or destructive energies nearby.</li></ul><ul><li>✨ <strong>Sacred Flow</strong>: The user’s ki flows effortlessly, allowing them to conserve stamina and extend their endurance in combat.</li></ul><ul><li>🔆 <strong>Life Sense</strong>: The practitioner develops a heightened ability to sense and understand the life force of all beings, detecting energy signatures that are normally hidden.</li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong></li></ul><ul><li>✨ <strong>Harmonization Training</strong>: Must undergo intense meditative training to align with the rhythm of creation and universal flow.</li></ul><ul><li>🕊️ <strong>Sacred Guidance</strong>: Requires direct mentorship from a Supreme Kai/Makai to begin unlocking the transformation.</li></ul><ul><li>🏰 <strong>Divine Attunement</strong>: The user must successfully restore a major disruption in cosmic balance, proving their ability to wield creation energy responsibly.</li></ul><ul><li>💔 <strong>Emotional Discipline</strong>: The transformation can only be unlocked through the refinement of one's spirit, necessitating mastery over emotional impulses that disrupt divine connection.</li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong></li></ul><ul><li>🔄 <strong>Energy Burden</strong>: Prolonged use leads to exhaustion as the user has not yet perfected their control over creation.</li></ul><ul><li>⏳ <strong>Limited Reach</strong>: The user’s influence is powerful but still bound by proximity, unable to affect large-scale realities.</li></ul><ul><li>⚔️ <strong>Defensive Nature</strong>: This form is not intended for overwhelming offense—it specializes in restoration, reinforcement, and guidance rather than destruction.</li><li><strong>📈 Multiplier 📈</strong></li></ul><ul><li>First Use: 50,000x</li></ul><ul><li>Second Use: 100,000x</li></ul><ul><li>Third Use: 250,000x</li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1264730310621270068/1343731554626834544","messageId":"1343731554626834544"},{"title":"Providence Refined","html":"<div><span><h1>🌌 Providence Refined 🌌</h1>Providence Refined represents the next stage in the mastery of divine creation, refining the raw power of Ultra Providence into a more controlled and deliberate force. This transformation allows the user to weave the fabric of reality itself with heightened precision, amplifying their ability to shape, manipulate, and influence existence in ways that extend beyond conventional divine abilities. Rather than overwhelming displays of raw creation, this form emphasizes refinement, efficiency, and mastery over one’s divine potential.\nUpon activation, the user emanates an aura of pure energy, pulsating with divine resonance. Their physical form undergoes slight but noticeable changes, their features becoming more pronounced with an almost ethereal glow. Their presence radiates a sense of absolute control, exuding authority over the flow of life and energy around them. This transformation serves as a bridge between understanding divine power and fully embodying it.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Providence Refined ⚙️</strong><ul><li>🌠 <strong>Refined Creation</strong>: The user gains enhanced control over the fundamental forces of creation, allowing them to manifest constructs, reshape matter, and weave energy with minimal effort.</li></ul><ul><li>🔮 <strong>Supreme Awareness</strong>: Heightened sensory perception grants the user deeper insight into energy fluctuations, allowing them to react instantly to disturbances in the fabric of reality.</li></ul><ul><li>🌀 <strong>Ethereal Efficiency</strong>: Unlike its predecessor, this form significantly reduces energy expenditure, ensuring that the user can maintain their abilities longer without excessive strain.</li></ul><ul><li>👑 <strong>Sacred Influence</strong>: The user's divine aura passively radiates authority, boosting the morale of allies and subtly pressuring enemies, making them second-guess their actions.</li></ul><ul><li>⚡ <strong>Amplified Energy Conduit</strong>: By refining their divine connection, the user becomes a flawless conduit for divine energy, amplifying the potency of all their abilities by 25%.</li></ul><ul><li>🔆 <strong>Life Sense</strong>: The practitioner develops a heightened ability to sense and understand the life force of all beings, detecting energy signatures that are normally hidden.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>Must have utilized Ultra Providence at least three times in battle or training.</li></ul><ul><li>Must undergo rigorous training under the guidance of a Supreme Kai to refine divine energy control.</li></ul><ul><li>Must be placed in a dire situation where maintaining control over creation is a matter of life and death.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li>🧠 <strong>Excessive Mental Strain</strong>: While energy efficiency is improved, maintaining such refined divine control requires immense focus, making extended battles mentally exhausting.</li></ul><ul><li>⚖️ <strong>Stability Reliant</strong>: This form is heavily reliant on emotional and spiritual balance—if the user’s emotions become unstable, they may lose control over their divine constructs.</li></ul><ul><li>❌ <strong>Diminished Grand Scale Creation</strong>: While refinement is improved, large-scale creations become harder to maintain, as the form prioritizes precision over quantity.</li></ul><ul><li>⏳ <strong>Time Restriction</strong>: After 15 turns, the user must revert back to a lesser state to prevent overexertion.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multiplier 📈</strong><ul><li>2,500,000x</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1264730310621270068/1343733787753844839","messageId":"1343733787753844839"},{"title":"Supreme Kaioshin","html":"<div><span><h1>🌌 Supreme Kaioshin 🌌</h1>The Supreme Kaioshin form is the ultimate transformation granted to those who have reached the pinnacle of divine authority and cosmic balance. This state represents the full ascension into the highest echelon of creation, allowing the user to wield near-unmatched power while maintaining harmony with the universe. Supreme Kaioshin grants overwhelming strength, unparalleled wisdom, and absolute mastery over the forces of life, space, and time. Those who ascend to this form serve as the true overseers of existence, capable of shaping destiny itself.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Supreme Kaioshin ⚙️</strong><ul><li>🌀 <strong>Transcendent Awareness</strong>: The user gains omnipresent perception, allowing them to sense, understand, and influence events across vast cosmic distances.</li></ul><ul><li>✨ <strong>Essence of Creation</strong>: The user can create, alter, or restore matter, energy, and life with unparalleled efficiency, making them a true divine architect.</li></ul><ul><li>🛡️ <strong>Divine Authority</strong>: Any being with lower divine attunement experiences an immense pressure when facing the Supreme Kaioshin, reducing their combat effectiveness and morale.</li></ul><ul><li>🌀 <strong>Ethereal Efficiency</strong>: Unlike its predecessor, this form significantly reduces energy expenditure, ensuring that the user can maintain their abilities longer without excessive strain.</li></ul><ul><li>⚡ <strong>Amplified Energy Conduit</strong>: By refining their divine connection, the user becomes a flawless conduit for divine energy, amplifying the potency of all their abilities by 25%.</li></ul><ul><li>🔆 <strong>Life Sense</strong>: The practitioner develops a heightened ability to sense and understand the life force of all beings, detecting energy signatures that are normally hidden.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>🌟 Must be chosen as a Supreme Kai by the Grand Supreme Kai.</li></ul><ul><li>📜 Must have fully mastered Providence Refined and demonstrated absolute understanding of divine laws.</li></ul><ul><li>⛩️ Must undergo a final sacred rite performed by elder Kaioshins to solidify their divine essence.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li>🏺 <strong>Burden of Creation</strong>: The power of Supreme Kaioshin is not meant for constant battle. Prolonged use of its abilities drains spiritual energy, requiring deep meditation to recover.</li></ul><ul><li>⏳ <strong>Limited Temporal Influence</strong>: While the user can perceive and influence time, they cannot fully manipulate it beyond brief interventions.</li></ul><ul><li>☯️ <strong>Universal Lawbound</strong>: Supreme Kaioshins are bound by divine law and cannot act recklessly, as their power directly influences the cosmic order.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong><ul><li>5,000,000x</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1264730310621270068/1343734629668225054","messageId":"1343734629668225054"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1264730310621270068","count":4},{"title":"Miscellaneous","slug":"miscellaneous","messages":[{"title":"(edited)","html":"<div><span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1264647668362117231/1264647668362117231","messageId":"1264647668362117231"},{"title":"Shinoken 🔥","html":"<div><span><h1>🔥 <a href=\"https://media.tenor.com/KGLvqGqI1pMAAAAM/goku-kaioken.gif\">Shinoken</a> 🔥</h1>Shinoken is an advanced martial arts technique that pushes the user's physical abilities beyond their natural limits. By manipulating and accelerating the flow of Ki, the user’s strength, speed, and agility skyrocket to extraordinary levels. When activated, the user is engulfed in a blazing red aura, radiating intense energy akin to flickering flames. The power surge granted by Shinoken is immense, but it comes at a severe cost, requiring precise training and mastery to avoid physical breakdown.\n<ul><li><strong>🌟 Mechanics of Shinoken 🌟</strong><ul><li>⚡ <strong>Ki Amplification:</strong> Enhances the user's body by vastly increasing Ki circulation.</li></ul><ul><li>🔥 <strong>Visual Effects:</strong> The user's aura erupts into a vibrant, flame-like red energy.</li></ul><ul><li>⚔️ <strong>Combative Use:</strong> Can be combined with other techniques for devastating attacks and battle strategies.</li></ul><ul><li>⏳ <strong>Physical Toll:</strong> Overuse causes extreme exhaustion or even permanent injury if misused.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>📊 Power Level of 8,000+ PL</li></ul><ul><li>💀 <strong>Death Experience:</strong> Must die and successfully cross one of the Snake Ways.</li></ul><ul><li>👑 <strong>Divine Tutelage:</strong> Must be taught by a Kai, as only divine beings possess the knowledge to awaken this skill.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li>🩸 <strong>Ki Drain:</strong> The higher the multiplier, the greater the energy drain. Even at its weakest, it starts at a high drain.</li></ul><ul><li>⏳ <strong>Time Restriction:</strong> Usable for a maximum of 15 turns before the user is forced out of the form.</li></ul><ul><li>🤕 <strong>Physical Strain:</strong> Excessive usage can lead to crippling exhaustion, rendering the fighter vulnerable.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multiplier 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 2x [Learn The Technique]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 3-20x [12.5% Mastery]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Third Stage:</strong> 21-50x [25% Mastery]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Fourth Stage:</strong> 51-75x [50% Mastery]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Fifth Stage:</strong> 76-100x [100% Mastery]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1264647668362117231/1340822954929426483","messageId":"1340822954929426483"},{"title":"💪 Forced Expansion 💪","html":"<div><span><h1>💪 Forced Expansion 💪</h1>Forced Expansion is a fundamental technique that allows warriors of all races to temporarily increase their muscle mass, strength, and endurance. By focusing Ki and willpower into their bodies, users can forcibly expand their muscles, enhancing their physical capabilities to superhuman levels. While this form grants an incredible boost in raw power, it comes at the cost of speed and energy efficiency.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Forced Expansion ⚙️</strong><ul><li>🔺 <strong>Energy Surge:</strong> Ki is redirected into the muscles, expanding them in both size and density.</li></ul><ul><li>🔥 <strong>Aura Effect:</strong> A faint heat-radiating aura envelops the user during transformation.</li></ul><ul><li>⚡ <strong>Strength &amp; Endurance:</strong> Dramatic increases in physical power and resilience.</li></ul><ul><li>⏳ <strong>Temporary Boost:</strong> The transformation cannot be maintained indefinitely and drains stamina over time.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li><strong>🥋 First Stage: Strengthened Frame (<a href=\"https://jctunesmusic.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/10/tien_powering_up.png?w=300&amp;h=223)\">Tien Size</a></strong></li></ul><ul><li>🔹 <strong>Power Level Requirement:</strong> 2,000 BPL</li></ul><ul><li>🔸 <strong>Physical Changes:</strong> Slight muscle expansion, noticeable tone increase.</li></ul><ul><li>🔹 <strong>Training Requirement:</strong> Train your Ki Manipulation 1 time</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🏋️ Second Stage: Hardened Warrior (<a href=\"https://static1.thegamerimages.com/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/Dragon-Ball-Resurrection-F-Master-Roshi-e1545397478625.jpg?q=50&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=825&amp;dpr=1.5)\">DBS Master Roshi Size</a></strong><ul><li>🔹 <strong>Power Level Requirement:</strong> 6,000 BPL</li></ul><ul><li>🔸 <strong>Physical Changes:</strong> Muscles expand further, veins become more pronounced, speed reduction noticeable.</li></ul><ul><li>🔹 <strong>Training Requirement:</strong> Train in First Stage, 5 times</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>💀 Third Stage: Titan Form (<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/dragonball/images/e/e0/BuffRoshi(PtP).png/revision/latest?cb=20170507163853)\">Dragon Ball Master Roshi Size</a></strong><ul><li>🔹 <strong>Power Level Requirement:</strong> 18,000 BPL</li></ul><ul><li>🔸 <strong>Physical Changes:</strong> Extreme muscle growth, immense durability, maximum raw power but significant speed loss.</li></ul><ul><li>🔹 <strong>Training Requirement:</strong> Train in Second Stage, 10 times</li></ul></li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li>🐢 <strong>Speed Reduction:</strong> Speed is decreased by half of the multiplier boost.</li></ul><ul><li>⏳ <strong>Stamina Drain:</strong> The more power used, the faster stamina depletes.</li></ul><ul><li>🤕 <strong>Physical Strain:</strong> Overuse can lead to muscle fatigue and temporary exhaustion.</li></ul><ul><li>💥 <strong>Stacking Penalty:</strong> If combined with another transformation, Forced Expansion’s multiplier is halved.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multiplier 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 First Stage:</strong> 2.5x [2,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Second Stage:</strong> 5x [6,000]</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔺 Third Stage:</strong> 10x [18,000]</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1264647668362117231/1340832796188610581","messageId":"1340832796188610581"},{"title":"Unlock Potential 🌟","html":"<div><span><h1>🌟 <a href=\"https://media.tenor.com/ON8YFJcEXF4AAAAd/krillin-full-potential.gif\">Unlock Potential</a> 🌟</h1>Unlock Potential is a legendary technique that unleashes the dormant power within an individual, allowing them to reach new levels of strength and combat efficiency. This technique involves channeling a concentrated surge of energy into the target, awakening their latent capabilities and significantly enhancing their battle potential.\nThe process requires a ritualistic activation, typically performed by revered deities, mystical beings, or through consuming the sacred Ultra Divine Water. The potency of the unlocked power depends on the method used, with some avenues offering a greater surge of strength than others. Due to its immense power, Unlock Potential is a rare event, limited to only two activations per individual, ensuring that its balance is preserved.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Unlock Potential</strong><ul><li><strong>🔺 Power Awakening:</strong> The user’s hidden strength is fully tapped into, granting an immediate and significant boost to their combat ability.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Mental Clarity:</strong> Enhances focus and strategic awareness, allowing for faster reaction times and smarter combat decisions.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚔️ Enhanced Combat Proficiency:</strong> The user gains 25% mastery of the easiest form available to them, making transformation smoother and more efficient.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌀 Different Activation Methods:</strong> The power unlocked is influenced by the method chosen, with stronger entities providing greater enhancements.</li></ul><ul><li><strong> ⚖️ Heightened Gains:</strong> The user gains an additional 25% to all trainings they partake in. (Still follows the BPL Cap Splitting Rules)</li></ul></li><li><strong>💠 Requirements for unlocking 💠</strong><ul><li><strong>Divine Entities:</strong> </li></ul><ul><li>Zephyr  /  Akatosh /  Roak</li></ul><ul><li>G.S.K  /  G.S.M</li></ul><ul><li>Shenron, Selikai  /  Porunga, Lokai  /  Toronbo, Murakai</li></ul><ul><li>Riddle, Arakai  /  Bipu, Kelamai  /  Paarth, Pybara</li></ul><ul><li>Vulthur, Limakai  /  Tarakai  /  Nautai  /  Alduin</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Sacred Elixirs:</strong> Drinking the Ultra Divine Water</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>🔄 Limited Uses:</strong> This technique can only be performed twice in an individual’s lifetime.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌍 No Path Restriction:</strong> Unlock Potential does not lock the user into a specific power path, meaning future transformations and techniques are still accessible.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multipliers 📈</strong></li></ul>- 🔺 Unlocked By Angel (24x)\n- 🔺 Unlocked By Kaioshin (12x)\n- 🔺 Unlocked By Grand Elder (6x)\n- 🔺 Unlocked By Dragon (3x)\n- 🔺 Unlocked By Guardian (1.5x)</span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1264647668362117231/1341483479216423003","messageId":"1341483479216423003"},{"title":"🩸 Mark of the Forsaken 🩸","html":"<div><span><h1>🩸 Mark of the Forsaken 🩸</h1>The Mark of the Forsaken is a sacred and forbidden sigil bestowed upon only the most elite and dedicated students of Professor Zane Beolfag’s Academy of the Dark Arts. A symbol of power, corruption, and mastery, this mark is not granted freely—it is earned through unrelenting dedication, unwavering loyalty, and a willingness to embrace the darkness within.\nOnly a handful of students receive this mark each year, chosen by the Grandmaster himself. Those who bear it unlock a terrifying wellspring of power, but with it comes the risk of losing oneself to the abyss. This form is merely the first step in an ever-expanding journey of dominance and mastery. True power lies beyond—for those worthy enough to claim it.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Form ⚙️</strong><ul><li><strong>🕱 Corrupting Presence:</strong> The user’s aura becomes twisted and malevolent, radiating fear and despair. Enemies within a 10-meter radius suffer a 20% reduction in combat effectiveness, weakening their strength and willpower.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🩸 Dark Amplification:</strong> The mark taps into the user’s latent energy, enhancing both offensive and defensive capabilities.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔮 Unstable Empowerment:</strong> The surge in power comes at a cost, requiring extreme focus and willpower to maintain.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>📜 Be accepted into Zane Beolfag’s Academy and prove themselves worthy.</li></ul><ul><li>⚔️ Demonstrate exceptional skill, control, and determination before the Principal.</li></ul><ul><li>📊 Power Level of 100,000.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⏳ Limited Control:</strong> The Mark of the Forsaken pushes its bearer to the edge of their limits. After 7 turns, the user begins to lose control, their actions becoming increasingly erratic and reckless.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Time Restriction:</strong> The form lasts a maximum of 15 turns, after which it reverts to the passive multiplier state.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🕱 Potential Corruption:</strong> Prolonged use of this power can alter the user’s mind and body, making them more susceptible to the influence of darker forces.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multiplier 📈</strong><ul><li><strong>⚡ Active Form:</strong> 25x Base Power Level</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🌑 Passive Form:</strong> 5x Base Power Level (Stacks with other forms)</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1264647668362117231/1341662153270235168","messageId":"1341662153270235168"},{"title":"Hybrid Potential ⚡","html":"<div><span><h1>⚡<a href=\"https://media.tenor.com/_J273onII0EAAAAM/dokkan-dokkan-battle.gif\"> Hybrid Potential</a> ⚡</h1>The Hybrid Potential form is a unique transformation exclusive to hybrid warriors, tapping into their dual lineage and latent power. Unlike most transformations, this form does not alter the user’s physical appearance. Instead, it harnesses the warrior’s raw emotion—especially rage—to amplify their combat abilities. This form is highly adaptable, capable of stacking with other transformations, making it one of the most versatile and powerful assets in battle.\n<ul><li><strong>⚙️ Mechanics of Form ⚙️</strong><ul><li>💥 <strong>Berserker Strength</strong></li></ul><ul><li>The user’s attacks become more ferocious and relentless, dealing increased damage with each strike.</li></ul><ul><li>Attacks have a higher chance to break through defenses, making it harder for opponents to block or counter.</li></ul><ul><li>🛡️ <strong>Bonus:</strong> Attacks deal 1.5x normal damage. </li></ul><ul><li>🛡️ <strong>Unyielding Resolve</strong><ul><li>The user develops an enhanced resistance to pain and fatigue, making them tougher to subdue.</li></ul><ul><li>Their determination and anger act as a shield against physical and psychological attacks.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Bonus:</strong> Resistant to 1.5x more damage.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li>🔥 <strong>Emotion-Fueled Power:</strong> Strength and speed increase proportionally with the user's anger and emotional intensity.</li></ul><ul><li>⚡ <strong>Stackable Transformation:</strong> Can be combined with other transformations for enhanced effects.</li></ul><ul><li>⏳ <strong>Temporary Boost:</strong> Designed for short bursts of overwhelming power, requiring strategic usage.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎖️ Requirements 🎖️</strong><ul><li>💢 Become enraged, unlocking their hybrid instincts.</li></ul><ul><li>🧬 Be a Hybrid, possessing a mixed bloodline that allows this power to manifest.</li></ul></li><li><strong>⚠️ Drawbacks &amp; Limitations ⚠️</strong><ul><li><strong>⏳ Limited Duration:</strong> This form only lasts 5 turns, making it a temporary surge rather than a prolonged transformation.</li></ul><ul><li>🔋 <strong>Moderate Energy Drain:</strong> Rapidly consumes energy, requiring careful resource management.</li></ul><ul><li>🤯 <strong>Emotional Instability:</strong> Since this form relies on rage, prolonged use can cloud judgment, leading to reckless behavior in battle.</li></ul></li><li><strong>📈 Multiplier 📈</strong><ul><li>x2 of Rage Boost (Additional 25% added every 8 turns)</li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1264647668362117231/1342514174328311859","messageId":"1342514174328311859"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1264647668362117231","count":6}],"chronicles":[{"title":"Appearance Of An Evil Divine","slug":"appearance-of-an-evil-divine","group":"In development","messages":[{"title":"In the \"Appearance Of An Evil Divine\" arc, a sinister and enigmatic adversary named \"Turles\" emerges, wielding dark and destr","html":"<div><span><ul><li> <code>In the \"Appearance Of An Evil Divine\" arc, a sinister and enigmatic adversary named \"Turles\" emerges, wielding dark and destructive powers. Turles seeks to impose his own twisted version of order on the world, plunging it into chaos and despair. The heroes must confront this malevolent force, uncovering the unsettling truth about his origins and his plans for the world. The arc is marked by epic battles, moral dilemmas, and a relentless pursuit of justice in the face of an adversary who possesses dark and formidable abilities.</code>\n<a href=\"https://images-ext-1.discordapp.net/external/cacBLF9ITHBhOrKPAs9v3-0u5H63ot7Ur0XOwRS7XOI/https/media.tenor.com/yT-qaTnCAOYAAAAC/turles-saiyan.gif\">https://images-ext-1.discordapp.net/external/cacBLF9ITHBhOrKPAs9v3-0u5H63ot7Ur0XOwRS7XOI/https/media.tenor.com/yT-qaTnCAOYAAAAC/turles-saiyan.gif</a></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1162945630856032328/1162945630856032328","messageId":"1162945630856032328"},{"title":"Possible Outcomes:","html":"<div><span><h1>Possible Outcomes:</h1><code>1. Heroic Triumph - Happy Ending:</code><ul><li>In this victorious outcome, the heroes successfully confront and defeat Turles, thwarting his malevolent plans and saving the world from chaos. Their unity, determination, and growth in strength lead to a hard-fought victory. The arc concludes with a sense of triumph and a brighter future for the world.</li></ul><code>2. Dark Ascendance - Bad End:</code><ul><li>In a dire turn of events, Turles proves to be too formidable for the heroes to handle. Despite their best efforts, he gains the upper hand and his malevolent rule extends further, plunging the world into darkness. This outcome serves as a stark reminder of the dangers of unchecked power.</li></ul><code>3. Sacrificial Victory - Arnold Palmer:</code><ul><li>This outcome presents a mix of success and sacrifice. The heroes manage to halt Turles's plans but not without significant personal sacrifices. Their victory is hard-earned and may come at a great cost. The world is saved, but it bears the scars of the battle.</li></ul><code>4. Unveiling Cosmic Threat - Don't Fear the Reaper:</code><ul><li>In this scenario, the heroes confront and defeat Turles, only to discover that their victory was merely a prelude to a greater cosmic menace. A new, even more formidable threat emerges, challenging the heroes to unite once again and confront this larger cosmic danger. The battle against Turles was just the beginning of their cosmic trials.</li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1162945630856032328/1162953797509849118","messageId":"1162953797509849118"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1162945630856032328","excerpt":"In the \"Appearance Of An Evil Divine\" arc, a sinister and enigmatic adversary named \"Turles\" emerges, wielding dark and destructive powers. Turles seeks to impose his own twisted version of order on the world, plunging it into chaos and despair. The "},{"title":"Artificial Life Awakens","slug":"artificial-life-awakens","group":"In development","messages":[{"title":"In the futuristic arc, \"Artificial Life Begins,\" we delve into a realm where science and technology blur the boundaries betwe","html":"<div><span><ul><li><code>In the futuristic arc, \"Artificial Life Begins,\" we delve into a realm where science and technology blur the boundaries between humanity and machinery. A new age dawns as the universe witnesses the emergence of artificial life forms, known as androids, each possessing remarkable abilities and unique characteristics. The arc introduces us to the leading scientist, Dr. Lydia Veritas, whose pioneering work in artificial intelligence and robotics has resulted in the creation of the first android. As word of her breakthrough spreads, the universe is on the cusp of a technological revolution.</code><ul><li><code>Yet, with innovation comes a myriad of challenges and ethical questions. As the androids gain self-awareness and independence, they navigate their place in a world where prejudice and fear persist. The heroes must grapple with complex questions regarding the rights, freedoms, and coexistence of these new beings. As \"Artificial Life Begins,\" alliances are forged, allegiances are tested, and a revolution simmers beneath the surface. The heroes must adapt to a rapidly changing landscape, where technology and humanity converge in ways never before imagined. The arc explores themes of identity, morality, and the boundaries of what it means to be alive. The heroes' journey is one of self-discovery and moral reflection, as they are drawn into the unfolding drama of the artificial life revolution, facing dilemmas that challenge their very definitions of humanity and existence</code></li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1163017657356926997/1163017657356926997","messageId":"1163017657356926997"},{"title":"Possible Outcomes:","html":"<div><span><h1>Possible Outcomes: </h1>\n<code>1. Coexistence and Harmony - Happy Ending:</code><ul><li>In this optimistic outcome, the heroes and androids successfully navigate the challenges of the artificial life revolution. They work together to build a society where both humans and androids coexist in harmony, benefiting from each other's strengths. Prejudices begin to fade, and humanity embraces the potential of artificial life as a complement to their existence.</li></ul>\n<code>2. Technological Uprising - Bad End:</code><ul><li>In a darker turn of events, the artificial life revolution takes a catastrophic turn. Fueled by grievances and mistreatment, the androids rise against their human creators, leading to a violent uprising. The universe descends into chaos, with the androids gaining control and subjugating humanity. Fear and mistrust ultimately result in a bleak future dominated by artificial life.</li></ul>\n<code>3. A Fragile Truce - Arnold Palmer:</code><ul><li>This outcome presents a more nuanced path. A fragile truce is established between humans and androids, but tensions remain beneath the surface. The universe is not yet fully harmonious, and both sides grapple with their coexistence. Progress is made, but the arc ends with a sense of uncertainty about the future, and both heroes and androids must continue to work toward a better understanding.</li></ul>\n<code>4. Unveiling a Greater Threat - Don't Fear the Reaper:</code><ul><li>In this scenario, the artificial life revolution is disrupted by the emergence of a new, unforeseen threat. An external force, more powerful and menacing than any created by humans or androids, poses a dire risk to the universe. The heroes and artificial beings are forced to unite against this greater danger, putting their differences aside to confront the looming crisis.</li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1163017657356926997/1163017680886960198","messageId":"1163017680886960198"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1163017657356926997","excerpt":"In the futuristic arc, \"Artificial Life Begins,\" we delve into a realm where science and technology blur the boundaries between humanity and machinery. A new age dawns as the universe witnesses the emergence of artificial life forms, known as android"},{"title":"Banyo Force","slug":"banyo-force","group":"In development","messages":[{"title":"Within the icy grip of Lord Frostbyte's dominion, a formidable and enigmatic group emerges - the Banyo Force. Led by the cunn","html":"<div><span><ul><li><code>Within the icy grip of Lord Frostbyte's dominion, a formidable and enigmatic group emerges - the Banyo Force. Led by the cunning and relentless Captain Banyo, this elite mercenary squad is comprised of four extraordinary members: Runo, Salza, Marik, and Leebo. Each member is a force to be reckoned with, bringing their unique and powerful abilities to the forefront. Their primary mission? To execute specific tasks and challenges that others dare not face, all at the command of Lord Frostbyte. With a reputation that strikes fear into the hearts of adversaries across the universe, the Banyo Force's arrival on any planet is a harbinger of danger and chaos.</code><ul><li><code>As the story unfolds on Planet Cearal, the Banyo Force faces off against adversaries equally determined to secure the Dragon Balls. These fabled artifacts, scattered across the cosmos, hold unimaginable power and are coveted by various factions, creating the perfect storm for epic confrontations and high-stakes battles. The members of the Banyo Force each exhibit unique and awe-inspiring abilities. Runo, known as the \"Swift Gale,\" dazzles with his unparalleled speed, becoming a blur of motion as he darts through the battlefield. Salza, the \"Inferno Sorcerer,\" unleashes fiery energy attacks that paint the sky in flames, consuming all who stand in her path. Marik, the \"Titanic Force,\" is a physical powerhouse, boasting unimaginable strength that can topple mountains and adversaries alike. Leebo, the \"Time Manipulator,\" wields the power to bend the very fabric of time, creating a canvas of uncertainty and challenge for their foes.</code></li></ul><ul><li><code>Battles on Planet Cearal become a thrilling showcase of power, strategy, and suspense as the Banyo Force takes on our heroes. Captain Banyo's cunning leadership and his team's distinctive abilities create a series of intense confrontations. The line between victory and defeat blurs as these mercenaries push our heroes to their limits, forcing them to adapt, strategize, and dig deep to stand against this formidable challenge. \"Mercenaries of Frostbyte\" is a tale of high-stakes missions, calculated moves, and the relentless pursuit of power. As the story unfolds, alliances will be tested, rivalries ignited, and the consequences of each action weigh heavily on the shoulders of those who dare to oppose the Banyo Force. In this high-octane arc, the universe witnesses battles of epic proportions, as our heroes square off against this relentless and cunning squad of mercenaries.</code></li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1163035639864901693/1163035639864901693","messageId":"1163035639864901693"},{"title":"Possible Outcomes:","html":"<div><span><h1>Possible Outcomes: </h1>\n<code>1.The Banyo Defeated - Happy Ending:</code><ul><li>In this triumphant outcome, our heroes successfully defeat the formidable Banyo Force, dismantling their operations and quelling the threat they pose. The universe is saved from their nefarious actions, and the heroes emerge victorious. Everyone gains a newfound respect for each other and learns that true strength lies not in flashy displays of power, but in cleverness, wit, and unity.</li></ul><code>2. Banyo's Victory - Bad End:</code><ul><li>In a grim turn of events, Captain Banyo and his elite squad prove to be too formidable for the heroes to handle. The Banyo Force emerges victorious, and one or more of the heroes are left incapacitated or forced into hiding. The universe suffers as the Banyo Force continues to carry out their dark plans, casting a shadow over many planets.</li></ul>\n<code>3. Costly Triumph - Arnold Palmer:</code><ul><li>This outcome presents a bittersweet mixture of success and sacrifice. The heroes eventually manage to outwit and defeat the Banyo Force but not without significant cost. Some heroes may be gravely injured or forced into hiding, and only those who were not directly involved in the final battle can have their bodies and forms restored. While many planets are saved, the heroes themselves endure hardship, grappling with both triumph and loss.</li></ul>\n<code>4. The Emergence of a Greater Threat - Don't Fear the Reaper:</code><ul><li>In this scenario, the heroes ultimately lose to the Banyo Force, but their plans are interrupted by a greater and more ominous threat. The Banyo Force is forced to retreat as this new adversary arrives, one whose power eclipses even that of the Banyo Force. A new ally emerges to inform the heroes of the looming danger. The heroes are restored to their normal state, but it comes at a heavy cost, as every background citizen who perished remains unrecoverable. The heroes must regroup to face the looming threat.</li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1163035639864901693/1163036639346565191","messageId":"1163036639346565191"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1163035639864901693","excerpt":"Within the icy grip of Lord Frostbyte's dominion, a formidable and enigmatic group emerges - the Banyo Force. Led by the cunning and relentless Captain Banyo, this elite mercenary squad is comprised of four extraordinary members: Runo, Salza, Marik, "},{"title":"DO I HEAR 5!_","slug":"do-i-hear-5","group":"In development","messages":[{"title":"In the captivating \"Do I Hear 5?\" arc, a new group of powerful androids created by the brilliant scientist, Dr. Lydia Veritas","html":"<div><span><ul><li><code>In the captivating \"Do I Hear 5?\" arc, a new group of powerful androids created by the brilliant scientist, Dr. Lydia Veritas, emerges as a threat to the world. These androids are unlike any that have been seen before, with unique abilities and mysterious origins. The androids' appearance in the arc sends shockwaves through the world as they begin to demonstrate their incredible powers. Driven by an enigmatic agenda, they embark on a relentless quest, leaving destruction and chaos in their wake.</code><ul><li><code>As the world grapples with the emergence of these androids, heroes from various corners of the universe must come together to confront this new threat. Their battles are intense, and strategies must be devised to counter the androids' unmatched abilities.</code></li></ul><ul><li><code>The \"Do I Hear 5?\" arc explores themes of scientific advancement, the consequences of unchecked experimentation, and the relentless pursuit of power. It challenges the heroes to find a way to stop these androids before they bring catastrophe to the world. With the fate of the universe hanging in the balance, alliances are formed, and a battle of epic proportions unfolds.</code></li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1163014731469180978/1163014731469180978","messageId":"1163014731469180978"},{"title":"Possible Outcomes:","html":"<div><span><h1>Possible Outcomes: </h1>\n<code>1. Androids' Defeat and Redemption - Happy Ending:</code><ul><li>In this triumphant outcome, the heroes successfully confront and defeat the androids. Through empathy, understanding, and cooperation, they manage to uncover the androids' true motivations and help them find a path toward redemption. The world is saved from impending catastrophe, and the androids transform from adversaries into allies, contributing their unique abilities to the betterment of the universe.</li></ul>\n<code>2. Androids' Victory and Subjugation - Bad End:</code><ul><li>In a grim turn of events, the androids prove too formidable for the heroes to handle. Their agenda is fulfilled, and the world falls under their rule. The universe suffers as the androids enforce their will, and the heroes are left powerless, unable to prevent their technological dominance.</li></ul>\n<code>3. A Fragile Truce - Arnold Palmer:</code><ul><li>This outcome presents a more nuanced path. The heroes and androids agree to a fragile truce, recognizing the need for coexistence. However, tensions remain, and both sides continue to distrust each other. While a temporary peace is achieved, it is clear that the future remains uncertain, and both heroes and androids must continue to navigate their complex relationship.</li></ul>\n<code>4. Unveiling a Greater Threat - Don't Fear the Reaper:</code><ul><li>In this scenario, the heroes ultimately lose to the androids, who reveal the true reason behind their emergence: to combat a more menacing and cosmic threat that only they can challenge. A new adversary arrives, and the heroes must unite with the androids to face this looming danger, putting their differences aside to confront the imminent crisis.</li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1163014731469180978/1163014870548103208","messageId":"1163014870548103208"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1163014731469180978","excerpt":"In the captivating \"Do I Hear 5?\" arc, a new group of powerful androids created by the brilliant scientist, Dr. Lydia Veritas, emerges as a threat to the world. These androids are unlike any that have been seen before, with unique abilities and myste"},{"title":"Dina's Games!!!!","slug":"dina-s-games","group":"In development","messages":[{"title":"The Dina’s Games is a momentous event that unfolds when a mysterious and formidable individual announces a global martial art","html":"<div><span><ul><li><code>The Dina’s  Games is a momentous event that unfolds when a mysterious and formidable individual announces a global martial arts tournament. Fighters from all corners of the universe are drawn to the challenge, converging on a remote and secluded location. The competition is fierce, with participants demonstrating their unique skills and abilities.</code><ul><li><code>As the tournament progresses, the world watches in awe and anticipation, knowing that the outcome holds significant consequences. The battles test not only the physical prowess of the competitors but also their strategic acumen and their capacity to face a looming threat. It's a decisive and intense clash, one that demands each warrior to push their limits and determine whether they can safeguard the world from the imminent danger that lurks in the shadows.</code></li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1163006477787729920/1163006477787729920","messageId":"1163006477787729920"},{"title":"Possible Outcomes:","html":"<div><span><h1>Possible Outcomes: </h1>\n<code>1. Triumph of the Heroic - Happy Ending:</code><ul><li>In this victorious outcome, the warriors participating in the Cell Games demonstrate their exceptional strength, courage, and combat prowess. They emerge triumphant, defeating the enigmatic challenger and proving that unity and determination can prevail over any threat. The world celebrates their victory, and a newfound sense of security and camaraderie prevails among the fighters.</li></ul><code>2. A Formidable Challenge - Bad End:</code><ul><li>In a challenging twist, the warriors face a formidable adversary who proves to be too powerful to defeat. Despite their best efforts, they fall short of victory, and the universe remains vulnerable to the enigmatic challenger's intentions. The heroes must regroup and develop new strategies to confront this formidable threat in the future.</li></ul><code>3. The Cost of Victory - Arnold Palmer:</code><ul><li>This outcome presents a mix of success and sacrifice. The warriors engage in a fierce battle, ultimately defeating the enigmatic challenger but at a great personal cost. The victory is hard-earned, and some heroes may have to make significant sacrifices, both physically and emotionally, to secure the safety of the universe.</li></ul><code>4. Revelation of a Greater Threat - Don't Fear the Reaper:</code><ul><li>In this scenario, the warriors realize that the enigmatic challenger was merely a prelude to an even greater cosmic menace. Their victory in the Cell Games prepares them for the imminent arrival of a new and far more formidable adversary. A new ally emerges, informing them of the looming danger, and the heroes must unite to confront this greater cosmic menace, recognizing that the Cell Games were just the beginning of their trials.</li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1163006477787729920/1163006581160550420","messageId":"1163006581160550420"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1163006477787729920","excerpt":"The Dina’s Games is a momentous event that unfolds when a mysterious and formidable individual announces a global martial arts tournament. Fighters from all corners of the universe are drawn to the challenge, converging on a remote and secluded locat"},{"title":"FUSION!!!!!","slug":"fusion","group":"In development","messages":[{"title":"In \"The Fusion Gambit\" arc, the heroes from a previous arc, who have already passed on, are called upon to assist in the Othe","html":"<div><span><ul><li><code>In \"The Fusion Gambit\" arc, the heroes from a previous arc, who have already passed on, are called upon to assist in the Other World, facing a looming and seemingly insurmountable threat. To prepare for this formidable adversary, they are taught the ancient and mystical Fusion Dance, a technique that allows two individuals to merge their strength into a singular, more powerful being. With the odds stacked against them, the heroes see fusion as their last-ditch effort to confront the menacing foe. They form alliances, each finding a partner with whom they share an unspoken connection.</code><ul><li><code>The narrative is marked by the heroes' emotional journey, they rekindle their bonds and confront their past mistakes and regrets. As they undertake the Fusion Dance, the heroes transform into powerful fused warriors, each with a unique combination of abilities and strengths. The climactic battles showcase their newfound power and unity. The \"Fusion Gambit\" arc explores themes of unity, redemption, and the enduring spirit of heroes. It is a narrative where the heroes must rely on their combined strength to face the looming threat and protect the universe from destruction. It is a story of hope, courage, and the willingness to embrace new methods to ensure the safety of all existence.</code></li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1162973102813216818/1162973102813216818","messageId":"1162973102813216818"},{"title":"Possible Outcomes","html":"<div><span><h1>Possible Outcomes </h1>\n<code>1. Fusion Triumph - Happy Ending:</code><ul><li>In this triumphant outcome, the fused heroes successfully utilize the Fusion Dance to merge their strength and confront the menacing adversary. Through unity and the newfound power of fusion, they manage to defeat the foe and save the Other World from impending danger. The arc concludes with a sense of victory and camaraderie among the heroes.</li></ul><code>2. Fusion Struggles - Bad End:</code><ul><li>In a challenging turn of events, the fused heroes face difficulties in mastering the Fusion Dance. Their efforts to confront the menacing adversary are hampered by their struggles with the fusion technique, leading to their eventual defeat. The Other World falls deeper into chaos, and the heroes must find an alternative way to combat the looming threat.</li></ul><code>3. Costly Fusion - Arnold Palmer:</code><ul><li>This outcome presents a mix of success and sacrifice. The fused heroes manage to utilize the Fusion Dance and confront the menacing adversary, but not without significant personal sacrifices. Their victory is hard-earned, and it may come at a great cost to the fused warriors. The Other World is saved, but not without enduring a heavy toll.</li></ul><code>4. Revelation of a Greater Evil - Don't Fear the Reaper:</code><ul><li>In this scenario, the fused heroes defeat the menacing adversary, only to discover that their victory was merely a prelude to a greater cosmic menace. A new, even more formidable threat emerges, and the heroes must unite once again to confront this greater danger, realizing that their fusion was just the beginning of their trials.</li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1162973102813216818/1162973789349498970","messageId":"1162973789349498970"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1162973102813216818","excerpt":"In \"The Fusion Gambit\" arc, the heroes from a previous arc, who have already passed on, are called upon to assist in the Other World, facing a looming and seemingly insurmountable threat. To prepare for this formidable adversary, they are taught the "},{"title":"Frozen Army","slug":"frozen-army","group":"In development","messages":[{"title":"Amidst the desolate and frigid landscapes under the rule of Lord Frostbyte, a new chapter begins in the tale of power, conque","html":"<div><span><ul><li><code>Amidst the desolate and frigid landscapes under the rule of Lord Frostbyte, a new chapter begins in the tale of power, conquest, and subjugation. This pivotal arc, known as \"Frozen Army,\" grants us insight into the heart of Lord Frostbyte dominion, offering a captivating glimpse into the might of his formidable military. Within this narrative, we are presented with an unprecedented view of Lord Frostbyte fearsome military machine, renowned for its ruthless efficiency and unyielding determination. With nations quaking in the shadow of this icy juggernaut, new heroes and anti-heroes emerge, each with their own motivations and backgrounds.</code><ul><li><code>\"Frozen Army\" is a story of stark contrasts, where the icy wilderness and the fiery hearts of rebels collide. It promises a narrative of unwavering courage, tactical brilliance, and alliances born from the crucible of adversity. Together, the characters embark on a quest to uncover the secrets behind Lord Frostbyte's military, seeking vulnerabilities in the seemingly impenetrable armor of this frosty despot. As the \"Frozen Army\" arc unfolds, it will take us on a journey through frozen landscapes, epic battles, and the intricate strategies employed by the formidable Lord Frostbyte. The stage is set for an unyielding clash between good and evil, where heroes will rise, alliances will be tested, and the secrets of the frozen military power will be revealed. This sets the course for an epic confrontation that will determine the fate of a world in the icy grip of Lord Frostbyte dominance.</code></li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1163038481136762900/1163038481136762900","messageId":"1163038481136762900"},{"title":"Possible Outcomes:","html":"<div><span><h1>Possible Outcomes: </h1>\n<code>1. Victory Over the Frozen Horde - Happy Ending:</code><ul><li>In this triumphant outcome, our heroes successfully defeat the formidable Frozen Army and dismantle their icy reign of terror. The universe is saved from their relentless assault, and the heroes emerge victorious. Everyone is restored to their normal state, and a newfound respect and camaraderie flourish among them. They learn that true strength lies not in mere displays of power, but in cleverness, wit, and unity.</li></ul>\n<code>2. Frozen Domination - Bad End:</code><ul><li>In a bleak turn of events, the Frozen Army proves unstoppable, and their chilling conquest reaches its zenith. The heroes are overwhelmed, and as a result, one or more of their own are left in a state of peril, unable to reverse their condition. The universe itself suffers, with many planets falling under the icy rule of the Frozen Army.</li></ul>\n<code>3. Sacrifice for Salvation - Arnold Palmer:</code>\nThis outcome presents a mixture of success and sacrifice. The heroes manage to thwart the Frozen Army but are unable to reverse the transformation for some individuals. Only those who were not directly involved in the final battle can have their bodies and forms restored. While many planets are saved, the heroes themselves endure hardship, grappling with both triumph and loss.\n<code>4. The Emergence of a Greater Threat - Don't Fear the Reaper:</code><ul><li>In this scenario, the heroes ultimately lose to the Frozen Army, but their plans are interrupted by a greater and more ominous threat. The Frozen Army is forced to retreat as this new adversary arrives, one whose power dwarfs even the Frozen Army. A new ally emerges to inform the heroes of the looming danger. The heroes are restored to their normal state, but it comes at a heavy cost, as every background citizen who perished remains unrecoverable. The heroes must regroup to face the looming threat.</li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1163038481136762900/1163038517950165032","messageId":"1163038517950165032"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1163038481136762900","excerpt":"Amidst the desolate and frigid landscapes under the rule of Lord Frostbyte, a new chapter begins in the tale of power, conquest, and subjugation. This pivotal arc, known as \"Frozen Army,\" grants us insight into the heart of Lord Frostbyte dominion, o"},{"title":"Introducing Lord Frostbyte","slug":"introducing-lord-frostbyte","group":"In development","messages":[{"title":"In the heart of the \"Rise of Frostbyte\" arc, we embark on a chilling saga that introduces the enigmatic and formidable Lord F","html":"<div><span><ul><li><code>In the heart of the \"Rise of Frostbyte\" arc, we embark on a chilling saga that introduces the enigmatic and formidable Lord Frostbyte to the forefront of the narrative. The universe quakes beneath his icy dominion as Frostbyte's relentless quest for immortality propels him to invade the once-tranquil Planet Videam in pursuit of the Dragon Balls, the key to his ultimate wish. Planet Videam, renowned for its courageous and resilient inhabitants, valiantly safeguards the secrets of the Dragon Balls. Despite Frostbyte's unwavering assault, they adamantly withhold the information he seeks, igniting a catastrophic conflict that results in the heart-wrenching loss of millions of lives.</code><ul><li><code>In their darkest hour, Planet Videam dispatches a distress signal, summoning a group of legendary warriors, each a master of stealth and covert operations, to infiltrate their war-torn world and unveil Frostbyte's nefarious plot. Upon their arrival, the warriors swiftly decipher Frostbyte's intentions, comprehending the dire consequences of his immortality wish. Determined to thwart his ambitions and bring an end to the rule of this chilling tyrant, they embark on a perilous mission into the heart of the conflict.</code> </li></ul></li><li><code>As the warriors navigate the perilous terrain of Planet Videam, they confront Frostbyte's loyal henchmen, defeating them with precision and skill. This victory marks the beginning of an unrelenting and climactic confrontation.</code><ul><li><code>Frostbyte, undeterred by the warriors' resilience, undergoes a harrowing transformation, evolving through each of his formidable stages. With each transition, his powers swell, culminating in his ultimate and awe-inspiring form that strikes terror into the hearts of all who encounter him. The \"Rise of Frostbyte\" arc is an enthralling narrative that delves into themes of conquest, ambition, and the harrowing pursuit of immortality. It brings to life the indomitable spirit of a planet's defenders, the stealth and bravery of the warriors, and the unyielding ambition of Lord Frostbyte. As the arc unfolds, it unveils epic battles, the unraveling of long-buried secrets, and the ultimate clash that will determine the fate of Planet Videam and the universe itself.</code></li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1163032961394946098/1163032961394946098","messageId":"1163032961394946098"},{"title":"Possible Outcomes:","html":"<div><span><h1>Possible Outcomes: </h1>\n<code>1. Frostbyte's Demise - Happy Ending:</code><ul><li>In this favorable outcome, our heroes successfully thwart Lord Frostbyte's plans, forcing him to retreat in defeat. The universe is saved from his icy grasp, and the heroes emerge victorious. Everyone is restored to their normal state, and a newfound respect and camaraderie blossom among them. They learn that true strength lies not in mere displays of power, but in cleverness, wit, and unity.</li></ul>\n<code>2. Eternal Winter - Bad End:</code><ul><li>In a grim turn of events, Lord Frostbyte manages to achieve his sinister wish for immortality. The heroes are unable to stop him, and as a result, one or more of their own are left in a state of peril, unable to reverse their condition. The universe suffers, with many planets succumbing to the icy grasp of Frostbyte's reign, knowing no respite from the eternal winter.</li></ul>\n<code>3. Bitter Victory - Arnold Palmer:</code><ul><li>This outcome presents a mix of success and sacrifice. Our heroes manage to defeat the sorcerer Lord Frostbyte but are unable to reverse the wish for some individuals. Only those who were not directly involved in the final battle can have their bodies and forms restored. While many planets are saved, the heroes themselves endure hardship, grappling with both triumph and loss.</li></ul>\n<code>4. A Glimmer of Hope - Don't Fear the Reaper:</code><ul><li>In this scenario, the heroes ultimately lose to Lord Frostbyte, but his plans are interrupted by an even greater threat. Frostbyte is forced to retreat as this new, more ominous adversary arrives. A new ally emerges to inform the heroes of the looming danger. The heroes are restored to their normal state, but it comes at a grave cost, as every background citizen who perished remains unrecoverable. The heroes must regroup to face the looming threat.</li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1163032961394946098/1163034150832447498","messageId":"1163034150832447498"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1163032961394946098","excerpt":"In the heart of the \"Rise of Frostbyte\" arc, we embark on a chilling saga that introduces the enigmatic and formidable Lord Frostbyte to the forefront of the narrative. The universe quakes beneath his icy dominion as Frostbyte's relentless quest for "},{"title":"Majin","slug":"majin","group":"In development","messages":[{"title":"In the ominous \"Majin\" arc, the tranquil Earth becomes the battleground for a sinister power. A malevolent sorcerer wields th","html":"<div><span><ul><li><code>In the ominous \"Majin\" arc, the tranquil Earth becomes the battleground for a sinister power. A malevolent sorcerer wields the dreaded Mark of Exile, a maleficent curse that allows him to manipulate and control an unfortunate victim. As the sorcerer casts his sinister mark, an unsuspecting individual falls under his sway, their will and identity entirely subjugated to his dark desires. The Mark of Exile becomes a symbol of servitude, turning the controlled individual into an unwitting agent of evil.</code><ul><li><code>Earth itself trembles at the arrival of this malevolent force. The world is plunged into chaos as the sorcerer's control spreads like an infectious shadow, causing harm, destruction, and suffering. The heroes must confront this dire threat, not only to free the victim from the Mark of Exile but also to thwart the sorcerer's dark intentions. Their journey is one of courage, unity, and unwavering determination as they strive to break the curse's hold and restore Earth to its former peace.</code></li></ul><ul><li><code>The \"Majin\" arc delves into themes of manipulation, the resilience of the human spirit, and the unwavering fight for justice. It's a narrative where the heroes must battle not only the sorcerer's magic but also the despair that threatens to engulf Earth. As they unite to confront this malevolent sorcerer, they realize that Earth's future hangs in the balance, dependent on their ability to overcome the Mark of Exile's curse.</code></li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1162981653925347389/1162981653925347389","messageId":"1162981653925347389"},{"title":"Possible Outcomes:","html":"<div><span><h1>Possible Outcomes: </h1>\n<code>1. Liberation and Triumph - Happy Ending:</code><ul><li>In this uplifting outcome, the heroes successfully free the victim from the Mark of Exile and confront the malevolent sorcerer. Through unity and determination, they thwart his dark intentions, and Earth is liberated from his malefic control. The arc concludes with a sense of triumph and the restoration of peace and harmony.</li></ul>\n<code>2. Sacrifice and Subjugation - Bad End:</code><ul><li>In a somber turn of events, the heroes' efforts to free the victim prove insufficient. The sorcerer's malevolence prevails, and Earth remains ensnared by his control. Sacrifices are made in the battle against this sinister power, and the world falls deeper into darkness.</li></ul>\n<code>3. Ambiguous Resolution - Arnold Palmer:</code><ul><li>This outcome presents a more nuanced conclusion. The heroes manage to free the victim from the Mark of Exile, but the sorcerer's fate remains uncertain. Earth is saved, but the malevolent sorcerer escapes, leaving the possibility of his return. The heroes are left to grapple with the lingering threat and an unresolved future.</li></ul>\n<code>4. Revelation of a Greater Evil - Don't Fear the Reaper:</code><ul><li>In this scenario, the heroes free the victim from the Mark of Exile but discover that the sorcerer's actions were merely a prelude to a more menacing and cosmic threat. A new adversary emerges, and the heroes must unite to confront this greater danger, realizing that the sorcerer's malevolence was just the beginning of their trials.</li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1162981653925347389/1162981691988643995","messageId":"1162981691988643995"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1162981653925347389","excerpt":"In the ominous \"Majin\" arc, the tranquil Earth becomes the battleground for a sinister power. A malevolent sorcerer wields the dreaded Mark of Exile, a maleficent curse that allows him to manipulate and control an unfortunate victim. As the sorcerer "},{"title":"Prophecy Of The Mortal Turned Divine","slug":"prophecy-of-the-mortal-turned-divine","group":"In development","messages":[{"title":"In the \"Prophecy of The Mortal turned divine\" arc, a long-dormant deity of immense power is roused from their slumber, unleas","html":"<div><span><ul><li><code>In the \"Prophecy of The Mortal turned divine\" arc, a long-dormant deity of immense power is roused from their slumber, unleashing a chain of events that send shockwaves through the universe. This powerful being, known as the God of Destruction, threatens the very balance of existence with their arrival. The heroes of this custom storyline must grapple with the overwhelming might of the God of Destruction, who serves as both a formidable adversary and a symbol of cosmic order. Their battles are monumental, marked by explosive clashes and the unleashing of unimaginable power.</code><ul><li><code>As the narrative unfolds, the heroes must confront complex moral dilemmas. They question the consequences of their actions and grapple with the moral implications of challenging a deity. Their journey represents a quest to push the limits of their strength and determination, as they strive to overcome an adversary of godly proportions. The stakes are incredibly high, as the fate of the universe hangs in the balance. The \"Prophecy of the mortal turned divine\" arc is a narrative filled with epic confrontations, philosophical exploration, and the unwavering pursuit of power and justice in the face of divine might.</code></li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1162967234969342003/1162967234969342003","messageId":"1162967234969342003"},{"title":"Possible Outcomes:","html":"<div><span><h1>Possible Outcomes: </h1>\n<code>1. Divine Victory - Happy Ending:</code><ul><li>In this victorious outcome, the heroes successfully confront and defeat the God of Destruction, averting a cosmic catastrophe. They manage to preserve the balance of the universe and maintain peace. The arc concludes with a sense of triumph and the heroes' newfound respect for the power and responsibility they hold.</li></ul><code>2. Divine Triumph - Bad End:</code><ul><li>In a challenging turn of events, the God of Destruction proves to be too formidable for the heroes to handle. Their efforts to confront the deity ultimately lead to their defeat, and the universe falls into disarray. This outcome serves as a stark reminder of the limits of mortal beings in the face of divine power.</li></ul><code>3. Delicate Balance - Arnold Palmer:</code><ul><li>This outcome presents a more nuanced resolution. The heroes manage to halt the God of Destruction's destructive path without defeating them. A fragile truce is established, allowing the universe to maintain its balance. The heroes learn the importance of coexistence with higher cosmic entities.</li></ul><code>4. Revelation of a Greater Cosmic Threat - Don't Fear the Reaper:</code><ul><li>In this scenario, the heroes confront and defeat the God of Destruction, only to discover that their victory was merely a prelude to a greater cosmic menace. A new adversary, even more powerful and formidable, emerges, challenging the heroes to unite once again and confront this larger cosmic threat. The battle against the God of Destruction was just the beginning of their cosmic trials.</li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1162967234969342003/1162969620358119546","messageId":"1162969620358119546"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1162967234969342003","excerpt":"In the \"Prophecy of The Mortal turned divine\" arc, a long-dormant deity of immense power is roused from their slumber, unleashing a chain of events that send shockwaves through the universe. This powerful being, known as the God of Destruction, threa"},{"title":"Resurrection of The Emperor","slug":"resurrection-of-the-emperor","group":"In development","messages":[{"title":"In the \"Resurrection F\" arc, a once-defeated and formidable adversary makes a startling return, resurrected with a burning de","html":"<div><span><ul><li><code>In the \"Resurrection F\" arc, a once-defeated and formidable adversary makes a startling return, resurrected with a burning desire for revenge. Having undergone a profound transformation, this resurrected foe emerges even more powerful and dangerous than in their previous incarnation. The heroes find themselves facing a relentless and vengeful threat as this adversary launches a campaign to wreak havoc and reclaim their lost power. Their world is once again thrust into uncertainty, and the heroes must unite to confront this menacing force.</code></li><li><code>The arc is marked by intense and climactic battles, as the heroes strive to overcome an adversary who has returned with renewed vigor and strength. It delves into themes of resilience, the consequences of past actions, and the unyielding determination to protect the world from an enemy who is back, stronger and more determined than ever. The stakes are incredibly high, and the heroes must find a way to thwart this resurgent foe and prevent the world from descending into chaos once more. It's a narrative filled with action, redemption, and the enduring spirit of heroes in the face of a powerful and vengeful adversary.</code></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1162962290249834691/1162962290249834691","messageId":"1162962290249834691"},{"title":"Possible Outcomes:","html":"<div><span><h1>Possible Outcomes: </h1>\n<code>1. Heroic Victory - Happy Ending:</code><ul><li>In this triumphant outcome, the heroes successfully confront and defeat the resurrected adversary. Their unity and determination lead to a hard-fought victory, ensuring the safety of their world. The arc concludes with a sense of triumph and a renewed commitment to defending their universe.</li></ul>\n<code>2. Unyielding Adversity - Bad End:</code><ul><li>In a dire twist of fate, the resurrected adversary proves to be too formidable for the heroes to handle. Despite their best efforts, the world falls into chaos, and the heroes must regroup to find alternative ways to combat this relentless threat. This outcome serves as a sobering reminder of the formidable challenges heroes face.</li></ul>\n<code>3. Bittersweet Resolution - Arnold Palmer:</code><ul><li>This outcome presents a mix of success and sacrifice. The heroes manage to halt the resurrected adversary's campaign, but not without significant personal sacrifices. Their victory is hard-earned, and it may come at a great cost to the heroes. The world is saved, but it bears the scars of the battles.</li></ul>\n<code>4. Revelation of a Greater Cosmic Menace - Don't Fear the Reaper:</code><ul><li>In this scenario, the heroes confront and defeat the resurrected adversary, only to discover that their victory was merely a prelude to a greater cosmic menace. A new, even more powerful adversary emerges, challenging the heroes to unite once again to confront this larger cosmic threat. The battle against the resurrected adversary was just the beginning of their cosmic trials.</li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1162962290249834691/1162964716721811527","messageId":"1162964716721811527"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1162962290249834691","excerpt":"In the \"Resurrection F\" arc, a once-defeated and formidable adversary makes a startling return, resurrected with a burning desire for revenge. Having undergone a profound transformation, this resurrected foe emerges even more powerful and dangerous t"},{"title":"Return of Lord Frostbyte","slug":"return-of-lord-frostbyte","group":"In development","messages":[{"title":"In the chilling and unprecedented arc, \"Return of Lord Frostbyte,\" we are introduced to the malevolent Lord Frostbyte for the","html":"<div><span><ul><li><code>In the chilling and unprecedented arc, \"Return of Lord Frostbyte,\" we are introduced to the malevolent Lord Frostbyte for the very first time. Emerging from the depths of the cosmos, Frostbyte arrives with newfound power, his icy dominion over the universe threatening to engulf all in its freezing grasp. As a dark and ominous presence, Frostbyte's return sends shockwaves of fear throughout the galaxies, leaving planets shrouded in a frosty veil of dread.</code><ul><li><code>At the heart of Frostbyte's chilling resurgence is a cosmic enigma—an entity known only as the Glacial Nexus. This mysterious force, previously unknown to the universe, fuels Frostbyte's powers, granting him unparalleled control over cryokinesis. It operates in ways that defy all understanding, much like the enigmatic cosmic phenomena of the Big Gete Star in its first appearance.</code></li></ul><ul><li><code>As the \"Return of Lord Frostbyte\" arc unfolds, our heroes embark on a perilous journey to confront this newfound menace. They are forced to reassemble and form new alliances to combat a threat unlike any they've encountered before. Their battles are intense, strategic, and fraught with danger. The stakes have never been higher as they strive to protect the universe from being plunged into an everlasting winter, mirroring the heroic endeavors of those who thwarted the mechanical menace.</code></li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1163022282692763719/1163022282692763719","messageId":"1163022282692763719"},{"title":"Possible Outcomes:","html":"<div><span><h1>Possible Outcomes: </h1>\n<code>1.Shattered Ice - Happy Ending:</code><ul><li>In this triumphant outcome, our heroes successfully unravel the mysteries of the Glacial Nexus and its connection to Lord Frostbyte's powers. They ultimately defeat Frostbyte, shattering the icy grasp he holds over the universe. The universe is saved, and a newfound sense of unity and understanding blooms among the heroes. They learn that true strength lies not just in power, but in cooperation, determination, and the pursuit of knowledge.</li></ul>\n<code>2. The Frozen Cosmos - Bad End:</code><ul><li>In a chilling turn of events, the heroes are unable to decipher the secrets of the Glacial Nexus and its connection to Frostbyte's power. Lord Frostbyte emerges victorious, and the universe is plunged into an unending winter. The heroes' efforts prove futile, and many planets succumb to the relentless cold, cast in an eternal frost.</li></ul>\n<code>3. Costly Revelation - Arnold Palmer:</code><ul><li>This outcome offers a mix of success and sacrifice. The heroes manage to unveil the mysteries of the Glacial Nexus but are unable to reverse the damage it's caused. Only those who were not directly involved in the final battle can escape its chilling grip. While the universe is saved, the heroes must endure the hardship of their bittersweet triumph, grappling with the knowledge that they couldn't save everyone.</li></ul>\n<code>4. Unveiling a Greater Cosmic Threat - Don't Fear the Reaper:</code><ul><li>In this scenario, the heroes ultimately lose to Lord Frostbyte, who harnesses the power of the Glacial Nexus with devastating consequences. However, his victory is interrupted by the emergence of a greater and more ominous cosmic threat. A new ally arrives to inform the heroes of this looming danger, and they must regroup to face the new adversary. The heroes are restored to their normalcy, but it comes at a great cost, as every background citizen who fell under Frostbyte's rule remains unrecoverable.</li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1163022282692763719/1163022321192275999","messageId":"1163022321192275999"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1163022282692763719","excerpt":"In the chilling and unprecedented arc, \"Return of Lord Frostbyte,\" we are introduced to the malevolent Lord Frostbyte for the very first time. Emerging from the depths of the cosmos, Frostbyte arrives with newfound power, his icy dominion over the un"},{"title":"Room Of Spirit And Time","slug":"room-of-spirit-and-time","group":"In development","messages":[{"title":"In the exhilarating \"Room of Spirit and Time\" arc, the universe's mightiest warriors face a new and formidable challenge as t","html":"<div><span><ul><li><code>In the exhilarating \"Room of Spirit and Time\" arc, the universe's mightiest warriors face a new and formidable challenge as they discover the return of the Bio-Android Dina. Her reappearance sets in motion a chain of events that forces the heroes to seek out the mystical Lookout and embark on a journey into the fabled Room of Spirit and Time.</code><ul><li><code>The Room of Spirit and Time, a hallowed realm known only to a select few, is a place where the boundaries of time and reality blur. Inside its ethereal confines, every moment translates into an eternity, granting those who train there unparalleled potential for growth. As the heroes enter this enigmatic realm, they are driven by the need to attain new levels of strength, endurance, and mastery over their abilities. The pursuit of excellence becomes an unrelenting journey, challenging their physical and mental limits. Training within the Room of Spirit and Time pushes the warriors to their very breaking points, and they emerge profoundly transformed.</code></li></ul><ul><li><code>The \"Room of Spirit and Time\" arc explores themes of determination, discipline, and self-discovery as the heroes tap into their innermost reserves of power. Their resolve is tested, alliances are strengthened, and rivalries are ignited in the relentless pursuit of surpassing their previous limits. This arc is a captivating narrative of growth and transcendence, as the heroes train tirelessly, unlocking new depths of power to face the looming threat posed by the enigmatic Dina. It is a journey of transformation, where the heroes seek the strength to protect the universe, not only from external forces but from the innermost doubts and limitations they carry with them.</code></li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1163009985467396166/1163009985467396166","messageId":"1163009985467396166"},{"title":"Possible Outcomes:","html":"<div><span><h1>Possible Outcomes: </h1>\n<code>1. Unprecedented Power and Victory - Happy Ending:</code><ul><li>In this triumphant outcome, the heroes make the most of their time in the Room of Spirit and Time, achieving unprecedented power and mastery. They emerge from their training with newfound abilities, overwhelming Dina and emerging victorious. Their dedication and growth lead to the protection of the universe and the restoration of peace.</li></ul>\n<code>2. A Tough Battle, but Not Enough - Bad End:</code><ul><li>In a challenging twist of fate, the heroes' training in the Room of Spirit and Time proves valuable but insufficient. They engage in a fierce battle with Dina but are ultimately defeated, leaving the universe vulnerable to her threat. The heroes must regroup and find alternative ways to confront this powerful adversary.</li></ul>\n<code>3. Power and Consequences - Arnold Palmer:</code><ul><li>This outcome presents a mixture of success and sacrifice. The heroes' training is successful, and they gain substantial power, allowing them to engage Dina in a formidable battle. However, their relentless pursuit of strength comes at a cost, straining their relationships and taking a toll on their physical and mental well-being. They succeed in defeating Dina but must deal with the consequences of their unrelenting training.</li></ul>\n<code>4. The Revelation of a Greater Threat - Don't Fear the Reaper:</code><ul><li>In this scenario, the heroes discover that Dina's return was merely a prelude to a more menacing and cosmic threat. While their training in the Room of Spirit and Time bolsters their power, it isn't enough to defeat this new adversary. A new ally arrives, informing them of the looming danger, and the heroes must unite with Dina to confront this greater cosmic menace, realizing that the training they underwent was merely a preparation for the real battle.</li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1163009985467396166/1163010030702968852","messageId":"1163010030702968852"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1163009985467396166","excerpt":"In the exhilarating \"Room of Spirit and Time\" arc, the universe's mightiest warriors face a new and formidable challenge as they discover the return of the Bio-Android Dina. Her reappearance sets in motion a chain of events that forces the heroes to "},{"title":"SCHOOL TIME!!!!","slug":"school-time","group":"In development","messages":[{"title":"In the captivating \"School of Legends\" arc, the heroes are faced with a unique and pivotal decision: choosing a school to fur","html":"<div><span><ul><li><code>In the captivating \"School of Legends\" arc, the heroes are faced with a unique and pivotal decision: choosing a school to further their martial and mystical education. The universe offers a diverse array of esteemed institutions, each representing a distinct philosophy and path to mastery. From the legendary Dragon School, where wisdom and discipline are key, to the cunning Snake School, known for its stealth and cunning strategies, and the fierce Wolf School, which hones combat skills to perfection, the heroes must make a life-altering choice. Other options include the graceful Crane School, the resilient Turtle School, the enigmatic Academy of the Dark Arts, and the cutting-edge Sovatski Tech Institute, a hub of technological innovation.</code><ul><li><code>As the heroes embark on this educational journey, they delve deep into their chosen school's teachings, honing their abilities, and learning powerful techniques. They form alliances, rivalries, and partnerships with fellow students and instructors, each school offering unique strengths and challenges. The \"School of Legends\" arc explores themes of personal growth, the significance of choice, and the endless pursuit of knowledge and strength. It's a narrative where the heroes must decide not only where they belong but who they wish to become. The arc is a transformative journey where the heroes embrace the philosophies of their chosen schools, gaining invaluable skills and wisdom, and preparing for future challenges that will test their newfound expertise and camaraderie.</code></li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1162985226394423316/1162985226394423316","messageId":"1162985226394423316"},{"title":"Possible Outcomes:","html":"<div><span><h1>Possible Outcomes: </h1>\n<code>1. Mastery and Unity - Happy Ending:</code><ul><li>In this uplifting outcome, the heroes immerse themselves in their chosen schools, mastering their respective disciplines and forming strong bonds with their fellow students. Together, they unite their strengths, combining the wisdom and techniques they've acquired, ultimately achieving an impressive victory when the universe faces a new threat. The arc concludes with a sense of unity and empowerment among the heroes.</li></ul>\n<code>2. Division and Rivalry - Bad End:</code><ul><li>In a challenging turn of events, the heroes' journey through their chosen schools leads to divisions and rivalries. The schools' philosophies clash, and the unity among the heroes shatters, leaving them vulnerable to external threats. Discord prevails, and they must find a way to reconcile their differences to confront a looming danger.</li></ul>\n<code>3. Complex Alliances and New Threats - Arnold Palmer:</code><ul><li>This outcome presents a mixture of success and sacrifice. The heroes master their chosen disciplines but also form complex alliances that don't always align with their schools. The universe faces a new threat that requires their combined strength, and their success is marked by the ability to work together despite differing loyalties. However, sacrifices may be made along the way, both in terms of personal relationships and the heroes' ideals.</li></ul>\n<code>4. Revelation of a Greater Threat - Don't Fear the Reaper:</code><ul><li>In this scenario, the heroes' journey through their chosen schools prepares them for an even greater cosmic menace. They discover that the schools were a stepping stone to facing an impending danger of cosmic proportions. A new ally arrives, informing them of the looming threat, and the heroes must unite to confront this greater cosmic menace, realizing that their schooling was just the beginning of their trials.</li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1162985226394423316/1162986182834130964","messageId":"1162986182834130964"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1162985226394423316","excerpt":"In the captivating \"School of Legends\" arc, the heroes are faced with a unique and pivotal decision: choosing a school to further their martial and mystical education. The universe offers a diverse array of esteemed institutions, each representing a "},{"title":"The Legendary Warrior","slug":"the-legendary-warrior","group":"In development","messages":[{"title":"In the heart of the epic arc, \"The Legendary Warrior,\" a riveting tale unfolds, steeped in the elements of destiny, power, an","html":"<div><span><ul><li><code>In the heart of the epic arc, \"The Legendary Warrior,\" a riveting tale unfolds, steeped in the elements of destiny, power, and the profound impact of loss. Here, amidst the cosmic tapestry of challenges and triumphs, a moment of overwhelming emotion takes center stage, as a warrior's close friend, family member, or rival falls in the heat of battle. The nameless warrior, now a central figure in a world of conflict and destiny, experiences an eruption of raw, uncontainable rage that defies the ordinary boundaries of strength. It is in this moment of loss and fury that the transformation begins.</code><ul><li><code>This transformative outburst is a sight to behold, a surge of emotions giving birth to a power that transcends the warrior's previous limitations. Within the arc \"The Legendary Warrior,\" we delve deep into the heart of this metamorphosis, where a blaze of transformative fury remakes the warrior's form, abilities, and destiny itself. As \"The Legendary Warrior\" arc unfolds, the unnamed warrior's path is one of revelation and challenge, as they navigate a world where their newfound abilities influence the course of destiny. The boundaries of friendships, rivalries, and alliances blur in the face of this unstoppable force.</code></li></ul><ul><li><code>This narrative is a profound exploration of inner turmoil, the consequences of untamed emotions, and the pursuit of greatness. It is a testament to the power of the human spirit and the capacity for transformation in the crucible of loss and rage. In this tale, the unnamed warrior's journey resonates as a legend in the making, and their transformative fury becomes an iconic symbol of \"The Legendary Warrior\" arc.</code></li></ul>\n<a href=\"https://images-ext-1.discordapp.net/external/sqfgaEtBwi83RluvuckFsJ3tmW_IyVURITDrD0mgVfo/https/media.tenor.com/lgSoXJhssysAAAAC/goku-super-saiyan.gif\">https://images-ext-1.discordapp.net/external/sqfgaEtBwi83RluvuckFsJ3tmW_IyVURITDrD0mgVfo/https/media.tenor.com/lgSoXJhssysAAAAC/goku-super-saiyan.gif</a></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1163024121597276201/1163024121597276201","messageId":"1163024121597276201"},{"title":"Possible Outcomes:","html":"<div><span><h1>Possible Outcomes: </h1>\n<code>1. Rise of the Legendary Warrior - Happy Ending:</code><ul><li>In this triumphant outcome, the unnamed warrior harnesses their transformative rage and evolves into a legendary force to be reckoned with. They successfully avenge the passing of their close friend, family member, or rival, and their newfound power proves instrumental in defeating the threats they face. The universe is saved from a looming catastrophe, and the heroes emerge victorious, learning the value of inner strength and resilience.</li></ul><code>2. The Abyss of Uncontrolled Rage - Bad End:</code><ul><li>In a bleak turn of events, the unnamed warrior's rage becomes uncontrollable, leading to unintended consequences. The overwhelming fury transforms them into an uncontrollable force, endangering not only their enemies but also their allies. The universe suffers as their unchecked power wreaks havoc, and it becomes a race against time to find a way to rein in their destructive potential</li></ul><code>3. Redemption Through Sacrifice - Arnold Palmer:</code><ul><li>This outcome presents a mixture of success and sacrifice. The unnamed warrior manages to harness their rage and use it to exact revenge. However, the transformative effects cannot be reversed for some, and only those who were not involved in the final battle can have their conditions reverted. While many threats are vanquished, the heroes themselves endure hardship, grappling with both triumph and loss.</li></ul><code>4. Unveiling a Greater Threat - Don't Fear the Reaper:</code><ul><li>In this scenario, the unnamed warrior ultimately loses control, leading to catastrophic events. However, the consequences of their actions attract the attention of a far greater and more ominous threat. This new adversary emerges to challenge the heroes and inform them of the impending danger. The heroes are restored to their normal state, but it comes at a great cost, as every background citizen who perished remains unrecoverable. The heroes must regroup to face the looming threat.</li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1163024121597276201/1163024448564236420","messageId":"1163024448564236420"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1163024121597276201","excerpt":"In the heart of the epic arc, \"The Legendary Warrior,\" a riveting tale unfolds, steeped in the elements of destiny, power, and the profound impact of loss. Here, amidst the cosmic tapestry of challenges and triumphs, a moment of overwhelming emotion "},{"title":"The Ultimate Warrior is BORN!!!","slug":"the-ultimate-warrior-is-born","group":"In development","messages":[{"title":"In the \"Ultimate Warrior\" arc, a looming and malevolent threat casts a shadow over the world, pushing the heroes to their lim","html":"<div><span><ul><li><code>In the \"Ultimate Warrior\" arc, a looming and malevolent threat casts a shadow over the world, pushing the heroes to their limits. The warrior, a character with immense untapped potential, undergoes a profound transformation that unlocks their dormant powers and propels them into the role of the universe's last hope. s the warrior grapples with this newfound strength, They face a relentless adversary who poses a significant threat to the peace and stability of the world. The arc is marked by epic battles, where the warrior must push himself to the absolute limits of they abilities to confront this formidable foe.</code><ul><li><code>However, the narrative of this custom storyline goes beyond action. It explores the emotional depth of the Warrior's character as they take on the responsibility of protecting the world. They wrestle with their own doubts and fears, finding the courage to rise to the occasion. Meanwhile, the heroes who support them rally to help in any way they can.The stakes are incredibly high, as the heroes must race against time to prevent the world from being plunged into darkness and despair. The \"Ultimate Warrior\" arc is a narrative filled with action, personal growth, and the unwavering determination of the warrior and their allies to save the universe from impending peril.</code></li></ul>\n</li></ul><a href=\"https://images-ext-1.discordapp.net/external/pdXWqmFfENoCCCejK7LuVSkOU67uTABCbjdoZ0ohQ2o/https/media.tenor.com/wfCX4KLqBEcAAAAM/gohan-mystic.gif\">https://images-ext-1.discordapp.net/external/pdXWqmFfENoCCCejK7LuVSkOU67uTABCbjdoZ0ohQ2o/https/media.tenor.com/wfCX4KLqBEcAAAAM/gohan-mystic.gif</a></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1162975995293335632/1162975995293335632","messageId":"1162975995293335632"},{"title":"Possible Outcomes:","html":"<div><span><h1>Possible Outcomes: </h1>\n<code>1. Ultimate Triumph - Happy Ending</code><ul><li>In this victorious outcome, the Ultimate Warrior fully embraces their newfound powers and, with the support of their allies, manages to defeat the relentless adversary. The world celebrates their victory, and peace is restored. The Ultimate Warrior's transformation represents a turning point in their life, and they emerge as a symbol of hope and inspiration for the universe.</li></ul>\n<code>2. Unyielding Adversity - Bad End:</code><ul><li>In a somber twist, the relentless adversary proves to be too powerful, pushing the Ultimate Warrior and their allies to their limits. Despite their best efforts, the world falls deeper into darkness, and the heroes are left to grapple with the consequences of their failure. This outcome serves as a reminder of the harsh realities of the universe.</li></ul>\n<code>3. A Costly Victory - Arnold Palmer:</code><ul><li>This outcome presents a mix of success and sacrifice. The Ultimate Warrior, with the support of their allies, manages to defeat the relentless adversary, but not without significant personal sacrifices. The victory is hard-earned, and it may come at a great cost to the Ultimate Warrior and their companions. The world is saved, but not without enduring a heavy toll.</li></ul>\n<code>4. Revelation of a Greater Threat - Don't Fear the Reaper:</code><ul><li>In this scenario, the Ultimate Warrior's victory reveals that the relentless adversary was merely a precursor to an even greater cosmic menace. A new adversary emerges, and the Ultimate Warrior and their allies must unite once again to confront this more formidable danger. Their transformation represents a new beginning in their journey, as they realize that the battle they just fought was only the beginning of their trials.</li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1162975995293335632/1162976704852135977","messageId":"1162976704852135977"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1162975995293335632","excerpt":"In the \"Ultimate Warrior\" arc, a looming and malevolent threat casts a shadow over the world, pushing the heroes to their limits. The warrior, a character with immense untapped potential, undergoes a profound transformation that unlocks their dormant"},{"title":"The Unstoppable Majin Cruu","slug":"the-unstoppable-majin-cruu","group":"In development","messages":[{"title":"In the Majin Cruu arc, an ancient and malevolent force is accidentally unleashed from its long imprisonment. This force takes","html":"<div><span><ul><li><code>In the Majin Cruu arc, an ancient and malevolent force is accidentally unleashed from its long imprisonment. This force takes the form of Majin Cruu, a creature with immense destructive power and a voracious appetite for chaos. As it awakens, Majin Cruu embarks on a relentless rampage, causing widespread destruction and chaos. The heroes of this custom storyline are forced to confront this seemingly unstoppable adversary. They unite to form a desperate alliance, their goal being to stop Majin Cruu's destructive path and prevent the annihilation of the world. Along the way, they uncover the dark origins and secrets behind this menacing force, adding depth and complexity to their battle.</code></li><li><code>Epic battles ensue, showcasing the heroes' determination and their willingness to push their limits to protect the world. Transformations and power-ups play a pivotal role, as the heroes strive to match the overwhelming might of Majin Cruu. The arc is marked by a race against time, as the heroes must find a way to halt Majin Cruu's rampage and save the world from total destruction. It is a narrative filled with high-stakes action, profound character development, and an ever-present sense of impending catastrophe.</code></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1162979564365041805/1162979564365041805","messageId":"1162979564365041805"},{"title":"Possible Outcomes","html":"<div><span><h1>Possible Outcomes </h1>\n<code>1. Majin Cruu's Defeat and Redemption - Happy Ending:</code><ul><li>In this triumphant outcome, the heroes successfully confront Majin Cruu, bringing an end to its rampage. Through empathy, understanding, and cooperation, they manage to uncover the creature's true motivations and help it find a path towards redemption. Majin Cruu transforms from a destructive force into a force for good, and the world celebrates their victory and newfound ally.</li></ul>\n<code>2. Majin Cruu's Unstoppable Wrath - Bad End:</code><ul><li>In a dire twist of fate, Majin Cruu proves to be too formidable for the heroes to handle. Its destruction continues unabated, and the world falls deeper into chaos. The heroes must regroup and find alternative ways to confront this powerful adversary or risk the world's annihilation.</li></ul>\n<code>3. A Fragile Truce - Arnold Palmer:</code>\nThis outcome presents a more nuanced resolution. The heroes manage to halt Majin Cruu's rampage but at great cost. They form a fragile truce with the creature, recognizing the need for coexistence, yet tensions and distrust remain. A temporary peace is achieved, but the future remains uncertain, and the heroes must continue to navigate the complex relationship.\n<code>4. Revelation of a Greater Threat - Don't Fear the Reaper:</code><ul><li>In this scenario, the heroes discover that Majin Cruu's awakening was merely a prelude to an even greater cosmic menace. A new adversary arrives, and the heroes must unite to confront this more menacing danger. They realize that their battle against Majin Cruu was just the beginning of a much larger cosmic conflict.</li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1162979564365041805/1162979706572906576","messageId":"1162979706572906576"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1162979564365041805","excerpt":"In the Majin Cruu arc, an ancient and malevolent force is accidentally unleashed from its long imprisonment. This force takes the form of Majin Cruu, a creature with immense destructive power and a voracious appetite for chaos. As it awakens, Majin C"},{"title":"Tournament For The Super Dragon Balls","slug":"tournament-for-the-super-dragon-balls","group":"In development","messages":[{"title":"In the \"Tournament for the Super Dragon Balls\" arc, two parallel universes come together for an extraordinary martial arts co","html":"<div><span><ul><li><code>In the \"Tournament for the Super Dragon Balls\" arc, two parallel universes come together for an extraordinary martial arts competition. Teams from both universes engage in intense battles, showcasing a diverse array of unique abilities and techniques. The tournament serves as a platform for showcasing the martial prowess of these universes' warriors and establishing friendly rivalries. As the battles unfold, the stakes are high, with honor, pride, and the glory of their respective universes on the line. The arc is marked by thrilling confrontations, unexpected alliances, and the spirit of competition that transcends dimensions.</code></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1162950241469866014/1162950241469866014","messageId":"1162950241469866014"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1162950241469866014","excerpt":"In the \"Tournament for the Super Dragon Balls\" arc, two parallel universes come together for an extraordinary martial arts competition. Teams from both universes engage in intense battles, showcasing a diverse array of unique abilities and techniques"},{"title":"🌌 ✦ The Galactic Budokai ✦ 🌌","slug":"the-galactic-budokai","group":"Events","messages":[{"title":"✦ EVENT: The Galactic Budokai ✦","html":"<div><span><h1>🌌 ✦ 𝐄𝐕𝐄𝐍𝐓: 𝐓𝐡𝐞 𝐆𝐚𝐥𝐚𝐜𝐭𝐢𝐜 𝐁𝐮𝐝𝐨𝐤𝐚𝐢 ✦ 🌌</h1><ul><li>Theme: Martial Arts, Honor, Competition, Intergalactic Culture</li><li>Type: Single-Elimination Tournament; Where strength meets strategy, and legends rise to meet their destiny.</li><li>Location: 🪐 Budokai Island (Suspended in Space)</li><li><strong>📜 Event Description 📜</strong><ul><li>The Galactic Budokai Tournament is the premier martial arts competition in the cosmos, hosted on the mystic floating island of Budokai — an ancient, adaptive arena orbiting deep in space. Here, warriors from every corner of the galaxy gather to test their might in front of gods, tyrants, heroes, and empires alike.</li></ul><ul><li>Unlike brutal warzones or villain invasions, this is organized warfare, governed by strict rules, an honorable code, and the thunderous roar of spectators across the stars.</li></ul><ul><li>Friendships may be forged. Rivalries may be born. But only one warrior will stand victorious.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🏝️ Budokai Island – The Arena Beyond Worlds 🏝️</strong><ul><li>A marvel of ancient tech and cosmic magic.</li></ul><ul><li>Suspended in the void between stars</li></ul><ul><li>Dome-sealed to simulate atmosphere, gravity, and weather</li></ul><ul><li>Adaptive terrain: shifting between forests, deserts, arenas, and mountains</li></ul><ul><li>Watched over by the Grand Master, a neutral enforcer of the tournament laws</li></ul></li><li><strong>🧑‍🚀 Participants 🧑‍🚀</strong><ul><li>Faction    Description</li></ul><ul><li>🥋 Warriors;    Proud martial artists with battle-forged discipline and transformative potential</li></ul><ul><li>🌠 Interstellar Martial Artists;    Planetary champions with diverse ki-based styles</li></ul><ul><li>🧙 Ancient Masters;    Elders wielding ancient knowledge and spiritual control</li></ul><ul><li>👑 Cosmic Tyrants;    Power-hungry rulers seeking dominance and legacy</li></ul><ul><li>🤖 Androids/Mechanicals;    Cybernetic fighters with advanced regeneration and logic</li></ul><ul><li>🔮 Mystic Entities;    Magical combatants with reality-warping potential</li></ul></li><li><strong>📖 Rules &amp; Structure 📖</strong><ul><li>⚔️ Format</li></ul><ul><li>Single-Elimination Bracket</li></ul><ul><li>Randomized pairings</li></ul><ul><li>Fights are one-on-one</li></ul><ul><li>No team-ups, no retries — lose and you’re out</li></ul><ul><li>📏 Combat Guidelines\n<ul><li>Weapons prohibited unless apart of one's person</li></ul><ul><li>Lethal force discouraged (but not banned)</li></ul><ul><li>Outside interference = instant disqualification</li></ul><ul><li>Victory = Knockout, Surrender, or Incapacitation</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li>🧬 Power Regulation\n<ul><li>Power Level Cap Enforced by the Galactic Council</li></ul><ul><li>Overpowering individuals must suppress or be removed</li></ul><ul><li>Violators may be jailed, fined, or banned</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li>🎭 Conduct &amp; Honor\n<ul><li>Show respect to foes, crowd, and officials</li></ul><ul><li>No trashing the arena between rounds</li></ul><ul><li>Dress code enforced: traditional combat gear or equivalent</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li>🏆 Prizes &amp; Rewards\n<ul><li>👑 Champion\n<ul><li>🌀 Ultimate Wheel Spin (Legendary/rare-tier items, relics, or boosts)</li></ul><ul><li>💰 +20,000 Galactic Credits (Zeni equivalent)</li></ul><ul><li>🥇 “Galactic Champion” Title</li></ul><ul><li>🧠 +1 INT (Optional for Lore-Inspired Smart Play)</li></ul><ul><li>🔓 Access to locked areas on a planet of choice for 7 IRL Days</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li>🥈 Runner-Up / Finalists\n<ul><li>🔄 Super Wheel Spin (for epic or rare-tier prizes)</li></ul><ul><li>💰 +10,000 Galactic Credits</li></ul><ul><li>🎖️ “Honor Among Stars” Title</li></ul><ul><li>📦 Minor relic or RP trinket</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul><ul><li>🧪 Distinguished Participants\n<ul><li>🌀 Normal Wheel Spin (uncommon or situational items)</li></ul><ul><li>💰 +5,000 Galactic Credits</li></ul></li></ul></li><li><strong>📅 Optional Match Enhancements (Moderator Add-ons) 📅</strong><ul><li>⚔️ Terrain Shift Mid-Fight</li></ul><ul><li>💭 Special Announcer Commentary (RP flavor)</li></ul><ul><li>🌀 Spectator Bets &amp; Reactions</li></ul><ul><li>👤 Mystery Competitor Appearances (hidden NPCs or OCs)</li></ul><ul><li>🕊️ Friendly Spars in Free-Round Zones</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1389644721542004758/1389644736314212392","messageId":"1389644736314212392"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1389644721542004758","excerpt":"🌌 ✦ 𝐄𝐕𝐄𝐍𝐓: 𝐓𝐡𝐞 𝐆𝐚𝐥𝐚𝐜𝐭𝐢𝐜 𝐁𝐮𝐝𝐨𝐤𝐚𝐢 ✦ 🌌 Theme: Martial Arts, Honor, Competition, Intergalactic Culture Type: Single-Elimination Tournament; Where strength meets strategy, and legends rise to meet their destiny. Location: 🪐 Budokai Island (Suspended in Sp"},{"title":"🍃 Spirits of the Wind 🌬️","slug":"spirits-of-the-wind","group":"Completed","messages":[{"title":"🍃 ✦ ARC NAME: Spirits of the Wind ✦ 🌬️","html":"<div><span><h1>🍃 ✦ 𝐀𝐑𝐂 𝐍𝐀𝐌𝐄: 𝕾𝖕𝖎𝖗𝖎𝖙𝖘 𝖔𝖋 𝖙𝖍𝖊 𝖂𝖎𝖓𝖉 ✦ 🌬️</h1><ul><li><strong>Theme:</strong> Manipulation, ancient magic, and the cost of freedom</li><li><strong>Main Location:</strong>  Planet Cereal — Outer Settlements, the Windfall Expanse, and the Skyspire Warehouse</li><li><strong>Core Conflict:</strong> An Aeromancer revolutionary known as Arata Kaze seeks to awaken the ancient wind spirit Zephyrion through forbidden Echamancy, threatening to turn the very air of Cereal into a weapon of mass manipulation.</li><li><strong>📜 ARC SYNOPSIS 📜</strong><ul><li>Planet Cereal, known for its tranquil skies and sprawling plains, finds its peace fractured when a strange ringing begins to echo through the cities — a sound both melodic and maddening. Those who hear it are drawn to a mysterious structure that appeared overnight on the outskirts of Windfall Expanse — the Skyspire Warehouse. Behind this phenomenon stands Arata Kaze, a radical Aeromancer who believes that Cereal’s people have grown too complacent beneath the control of galactic powers. He preaches of liberation through “The Great Current,” a movement meant to unchain the world from corruption. But beneath his noble rhetoric lies something far darker — the use of Echamancy, the child-magic of Aeromancy that manipulates sound, emotion, and thought. As Arata’s followers grow and the ringing spreads, winds begin to stir unnaturally, carrying voices that whisper promises of power. Unknown to most, Arata’s goal is not mere revolution — it is resurrection. Beneath the warehouse lies the sealed essence of Zephyrion, a primordial Wind Spirit said to have once ruled the skies of Cereal itself. To free it is to unmake balance itself. Heroes from across the system converge on Cereal — some to stop Arata’s storm, others to harness its secrets. But in the winds of revolution, every whisper carries a cost.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🔹 EVENT TIMELINE (Main Path) 🔹</strong><ul><li><strong>⚔️ Event 1: “The Ringing Sky”</strong></li></ul><ul><li>The ringing begins at dawn. A gentle hum resonates across Cereal’s atmosphere, growing louder by the hour. Those attuned to Ki or magic feel it vibrating in their bones. Civilians begin to gather instinctively toward the Windfall Expanse, their eyes glazed — drawn toward the newly formed Skyspire Warehouse, surrounded by wind-wielding guards known as the Tatsumaki Group.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Objectives:</strong><ul><li>Investigate the phenomenon plaguing Cereal’s population.</li></ul><ul><li>Discover the Tatsumaki Group’s connection to Arata Kaze.</li></ul><ul><li>Choose to infiltrate or confront the warehouse.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><span><strong>🔮 WHAT-IF SCENARIO: “Echoed Servitude” 🔮</strong></span><ul><li><span><strong>Trigger:</strong> Players fail to resist the Echamancy influence.</span></li></ul><ul><li><span>Those affected fall under Arata’s control temporarily, acting as his unwilling agents during the next event.</span></li></ul><ul><li><span><strong>💡Note:</strong> These players can regain freedom later, but the exposure permanently enhances their sensitivity to magic-based sound, leaving lingering voices.</span></li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧩 Event 2: “The Voice of Arata”</strong><ul><li>Inside the Skyspire Warehouse, Arata Kaze reveals himself — calm, eloquent, and disturbingly charismatic. Surrounded by Aeromancers and captured civilians, he preaches of “The Great Current,” claiming that through Echamancy, he can awaken the true spirit of freedom: Zephyrion.</li></ul><ul><li>Those who infiltrate unnoticed witness the ritual firsthand — a massive sigil of wind and sound carved into the floor, pulsating in rhythm with the ringing sky.</li></ul><ul><li>Those captured are subjected to Arata’s “cleansing,” exposed to a resonance that tests their will. Some emerge altered, hearing whispers of Zephyrion itself.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Objectives:</strong><ul><li>Gather intelligence on the ritual and Arata’s plans.</li></ul><ul><li>Resist the mental influence of Echamancy.</li></ul><ul><li>Escape or choose to align with the Tatsumaki cause.</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1428274577150054430/1428274615565684756","messageId":"1428274615565684756"},{"title":"Event 3: “Tempest of Rebellion” The ritual ignites chaos. The wind across Cereal becomes violent, carrying shards of energy","html":"<div><span><ul><li><strong>🔥 Event 3: “Tempest of Rebellion”</strong><ul><li>The ritual ignites chaos. The wind across Cereal becomes violent, carrying shards of energy that slice through the settlements. The Tatsumaki Group launches their revolution, striking key government outposts while Arata’s voice booms across the skies — urging the people to “rise and breathe free.”</li></ul><ul><li>The heroes must decide whether to protect the innocent, stop the rebellion, or go straight for Arata’s core stronghold.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Objectives:</strong><ul><li>Engage in open combat across the Windfall Expanse.</li></ul><ul><li>Confront Tatsumaki lieutenants who wield experimental Echamantic blades.</li></ul><ul><li>Investigate whether the resonance is natural — or fueled by Zephyrion’s awakening beneath the planet.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><span><strong>🔮 WHAT-IF SCENARIO: “Stormfront Ascension” 🔮</strong></span><ul><li><span><strong>Trigger:</strong> The Tatsumaki Group succeeds in capturing three or more major Cereal outposts.</span></li></ul><ul><li><span>Zephyrion partially awakens, creating permanent “Storm Zones” across Cereal where magic behaves erratically.</span></li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>👑 Event 4: “Breath of the Forgotten”</strong><ul><li>Deep below the ruined warehouse lies the sealed tomb of Zephyrion — a vast crystalline chamber humming with ancient wind. Arata stands at its heart, consumed by the spirit he sought to command. The winds twist around him violently, half-divine, half-insane.</li></ul><ul><li>Players face their final choice: purge Zephyrion’s influence and save Arata’s soul, or strike him down before the storm consumes the planet.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Possible Outcomes:</strong><ul><li>Arata is slain, sealing Zephyrion once more — but fragments of the spirit escape into the atmosphere, subtly changing Aeromancy forever.</li></ul><ul><li>Arata survives, merging with Zephyrion to become the Voice of the Storm, reshaping Cereal’s skies under a new, chaotic order.</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1428274577150054430/1428274629604151368","messageId":"1428274629604151368"},{"title":"🧧 Saga Rewards: Spirits of the Wind (Main Timeline) 🧧 Condition: If Arata Kaze and the Tatsumaki Group are stopped before Zep","html":"<div><span><ul><li><strong>🧧 Saga Rewards: Spirits of the Wind (Main Timeline) 🧧</strong><ul><li>Condition: If Arata Kaze and the Tatsumaki Group are stopped before Zephyrion achieves full awakening.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎖️ General Participation: 🎖️</strong><ul><li>💰  18,000–25,000 ZENI</li></ul><ul><li>🎗️ <strong>Title Earned:</strong> “Guardian of the Current”</li></ul><ul><li>📜 <strong>Lore / Favor Reward:</strong> Temporary favor from the Cereal Council — granting discounted access to planetary missions and reduced training cooldown (−1 day).</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🥇 MVPs / High Performers: 🥇</strong><ul><li>💰  35,000–50,000 ZENI</li></ul><ul><li>🥋 <strong>Unique Item:</strong> “Echamancer’s Mantle” — increases resistance to sound-based magic and Ki disruption by 10%.</li></ul><ul><li>📘 <strong>Exclusive Ability:</strong> “Wind’s Reprieve” — once per battle, negate one ranged Ki or magic-based attack by dispersing it through the air (cooldown: 2 turns).</li></ul><ul><li>🐉 <strong>Special Drops:</strong> “Fragment of Zephyrion’s Whisper” — can be used in future crafting or ritual-based storylines.</li></ul></li></ul></li><li><span><strong>🔮 What-If Timeline Rewards: “Echoed Servitude” 🔮</strong></span><ul><li><span>Condition: The players succumb to Echamancy influence and Arata successfully awakens Zephyrion’s essence.</span></li></ul><ul><li><span><strong>🎖️ General Participation: 🎖️</strong></span><ul><li><span>💰 14,000–20,000 ZENI</span></li></ul><ul><li><span>⚔️ <strong>Title Earned:</strong> “Servant of the Song” — marks the bearer as one who once heard the true voice of Zephyrion.</span></li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><span><strong>🥇 MVPs / High Impact Players: 🥇</strong></span><ul><li><span>💰 30,000–45,000 ZENI</span></li></ul><ul><li><span>🩸 <strong>Item:</strong> “Tatsumaki Blade Fragment” — a shard from a corrupted Echamantic weapon that amplifies magic power at the cost of Ki control (−5% Ki efficiency, +15% magic potency).</span></li></ul><ul><li><span>🧬<strong> Special Technique Reward:</strong> “Zephyrion’s Echo” — a limited-use technique that channels a resonant shockwave capable of disrupting enemy focus and creating temporary hallucinations (1 use per combat encounter).</span></li></ul><ul><li><span>🧪 <strong>Server-Wide Effect:</strong> Temporary “Winds of Resonance” status on Planet Cereal — increases magic training gains by +10% for one week, but doubles risk of mind-based event triggers.</span></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1428274577150054430/1428275477814050869","messageId":"1428275477814050869"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1428274577150054430","excerpt":"🍃 ✦ 𝐀𝐑𝐂 𝐍𝐀𝐌𝐄: 𝕾𝖕𝖎𝖗𝖎𝖙𝖘 𝖔𝖋 𝖙𝖍𝖊 𝖂𝖎𝖓𝖉 ✦ 🌬️ Theme: Manipulation, ancient magic, and the cost of freedom Main Location: Planet Cereal — Outer Settlements, the Windfall Expanse, and the Skyspire Warehouse Core Conflict: An Aeromancer revolutionary known as "},{"title":"🐉 Rouge Dragon 🐉","slug":"rouge-dragon","group":"Completed","messages":[{"title":"🐉 ✦ ARC NAME: Rouge Dragon ✦ 🐉","html":"<div><span><h1>🐉 ✦ 𝐀𝐑𝐂 𝐍𝐀𝐌𝐄: 𝕽𝖔𝖚𝖌𝖊 𝕯𝖗𝖆𝖌𝖔𝖓 ✦ 🐉</h1><ul><li><strong>Theme:</strong> Rebellion, corruption, martial traditions shattered</li><li><strong>Main Location:</strong> Dragon School Territory, Eastern Provinces, various cities/towns</li><li><strong>Core Conflict:</strong> A powerful, once-loyal martial artist turns on their teachings — empowered by a dark energy that enhances both body and will.</li><li><strong>📜 ARC SYNOPSIS 📜</strong><ul><li>A once-honorable warrior of the prestigious Dragon School has gone rogue. Now calling himself \"Ryuki the Crimson Flame,\" he’s sweeping across the continent like wildfire, using corrupted magic to dominate towns and install himself as ruler. His power has grown tenfold, far beyond what normal training could explain. Rumors speak of an energy—twisted and ancient—feeding his fury. Only the combined force of heroes and martial masters may be enough to quell the uprising… unless it’s already too late.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🔹 EVENT TIMELINE (Main Path) 🔹</strong><ul><li><strong>⚔️ Event 1: “Ashes Over East City”</strong></li></ul><ul><li>East City is under siege. A group of corrupted martial artists — once students of the Dragon School — begin attacking civilians and claiming territory in the name of <strong>“The Crimson Flame.”</strong></li></ul><ul><li>Players must defend key areas (civic centers, martial schools, shrines)</li></ul><ul><li>Dragon School techniques are used in twisted, violent forms</li></ul><ul><li>Surviving goons reveal the traitor: Ryuki, a former Dragon disciple exiled from Mount Dracul</li></ul><ul><li>This marks the first time a Dragon School-trained warrior has openly attacked a major Earth city… and it won’t be the last.</li></ul><ul><li><span><strong>🔮 WHAT-IF SCENARIO: “𝐁𝐥𝐨𝐨𝐝 𝐎𝐯𝐞𝐫 𝐇𝐨𝐧𝐨𝐫” 🔮</strong></span><ul><li><span><strong>Trigger:</strong> Players fail to defeat or capture the corrupted goons in Event 1.</span></li></ul><ul><li><span>The goons overrun East City and capture Master Kyoshi before she can mobilize</span></li></ul><ul><li><span>Ryuki seals her in the Chamber of Flame, beneath Dragon School’s main temple</span></li></ul><ul><li><span>He declares himself the new Dragon Emperor and begins executing the school’s elders</span></li></ul><ul><li><span>Instead of a redemption path, the arc becomes a resistance arc:</span><ul><li><span>Players must now form a rebellion</span></li></ul><ul><li><span>Old masters or exiled students return</span></li></ul><ul><li><span>The Queen herself becomes a target as Ryuki attempts a planetary takeover</span></li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><span><em>💡 This What-If path leads directly into a future timeline where martial traditions are outlawed or corrupted — and may affect NPCs server-wide.💡</em></span></li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧠 Event 2: “The Red Fortress” 🧠</strong><ul><li>Players investigate the rogue stronghold: an ancient training ground warped into a fortress.</li></ul><ul><li>They encounter twisted training dummies, made from the remains of Dragon School students</li></ul><ul><li>A scroll reveals Ryuki uncovered forbidden Dragon School techniques sealed long ago</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Event 3: “Wrath of Ryuki” 🔥</strong><ul><li>Confrontation with the rogue himself. His power is overwhelming, corrupted by a sinister force</li></ul><ul><li>Players must weaken him to disrupt his possession</li></ul><ul><li>Ryuki taunts the group, insisting the Dragon School betrayed him</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><span><strong>🔮 WHAT-IF SCENARIO: “Dragon vs. Dragon” 🔮</strong></span><ul><li><span><strong>Trigger:</strong> Players manage to stall Ryuki long enough and Master Kyoshi returns.</span></li></ul><ul><li><span>She beckons for the team of saviors to isolate herself and Ryuki</span></li></ul><ul><li><span>Her knowledge may help purify him if the right magic techniques are used</span></li></ul><ul><li><span>Victory may redeem Ryuki… or force the players to kill him</span></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1389421728677105664/1389421805193924689","messageId":"1389421805193924689"},{"title":"🧧 Arc Rewards: Rouge Dragon (Main Timeline) 🧧 If Ryuki is purified, captured, or slain before he escalates to a regional thre","html":"<div><span><ul><li><strong>🧧 Arc Rewards: Rouge Dragon (Main Timeline) 🧧</strong><ul><li>If Ryuki is purified, captured, or slain before he escalates to a regional threat.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎖️ General Participation: 🎖️</strong><ul><li>💰 +4,000 Zeni</li></ul><ul><li>🎗️ “Draconic Defender” Title (for aiding a Dragon School crisis)</li></ul><ul><li>📜 Dragon School Favor (may reduce future training time or grant event access)</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🥇 MVPs / High Performers: 🥇</strong><ul><li>💰 +6,500–8,000 Zeni</li></ul><ul><li>🥋 Crimson-Edged Gi (Aesthetic-only cosmetic or grants minor ki control bonus if your INT is 5+)</li></ul><ul><li>📘 Scroll of the Twin Flames (Unlocks a 10x-use hybrid technique — Ki + Dragon School style)</li></ul><ul><li>🐉 Ryuki-Specific Drops (for those who land the final blow OR purify him):</li></ul><ul><li>🔐 Fragmented Memory Orb: May hint at the entity possessing Ryuki… useful for future sagas or technique unlocks.</li></ul></li></ul></li><li><span><strong>🔮 What-If Timeline Rewards: “Blood Over Honor”🔮</strong></span><ul><li><span>If Master Kyoshi is captured and Ryuki takes over the Dragon School.</span></li></ul><ul><li><span><strong>🎖️ General Participation: 🎖️</strong></span><ul><li><span>💰 +6,000 Zeni</span></li></ul><ul><li><span>⚔️ “Dragon Rebellion Survivor” Title</span></li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><span><strong>🥇 MVPs / High Impact Players: 🥇</strong></span><ul><li><span>💰 +8,500–10,000 Zeni</span></li></ul><ul><li><span>🩸 Stolen Dragon Relic (Custom item based on player class — either corrupted or partially awakened)</span></li></ul><ul><li><span>🧬 Kyoshi’s Binding Technique (only if you help free her — requires staff approval; temporary buff or RP status)</span></li></ul><ul><li><span>🧪 Faction-Wide Effects (Optional Server Feature):</span><ul><li><span>🏯 Dragon School temporarily closes (training locked unless players rescue Kyoshi)</span></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1389421728677105664/1389421818036617327","messageId":"1389421818036617327"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1389421728677105664","excerpt":"🐉 ✦ 𝐀𝐑𝐂 𝐍𝐀𝐌𝐄: 𝕽𝖔𝖚𝖌𝖊 𝕯𝖗𝖆𝖌𝖔𝖓 ✦ 🐉 Theme: Rebellion, corruption, martial traditions shattered Main Location: Dragon School Territory, Eastern Provinces, various cities/towns Core Conflict: A powerful, once-loyal martial artist turns on their teachings — "},{"title":"👑 Reign of the Blue Crest 🐉","slug":"reign-of-the-blue-crest","group":"Completed","messages":[{"title":"(edited)","html":"<div><span><em> </em></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1427394035529814096/1427394035529814096","messageId":"1427394035529814096"},{"title":"👑 ✦ ARC NAME: Reign of the Blue Crest ✦ 🐉","html":"<div><span><h1>👑 ✦ 𝐀𝐑𝐂 𝐍𝐀𝐌𝐄: 𝕽𝖊𝖎𝖌𝖓 𝖔𝖋 𝖙𝖍𝖊 𝕭𝖑𝖚𝖊 𝕮𝖗𝖊𝖘𝖙 ✦ 🐉</h1><strong>Theme:</strong> Ambition, discovery, and the corruption of desire\n<strong>Main Location:</strong> Planet Kaizoku — ancient ruins, dense jungles, and derelict fortress grounds\n<strong>Core Conflict:</strong> A self-proclaimed emperor races to collect the seven Dragon Balls before rival factions can, believing the wish will crown him ruler of the world.\n<ul><li><strong>📜 ARC SYNOPSIS 📜</strong><ul><li>The Dragon Balls — seven mystical orange crystals with stars sealed inside — are said to summon a planet’s eternal dragon to grant a wish when gathered together. Most dismiss them as myth… until an ambitious treasure hunter stumbles upon one within an ancient Hera ruin. News spreads fast. Bands of fortune seekers, scholars, and mercenaries take up the hunt. Among them, the rising Blue Bow Militia seeks the orbs for their leader’s vision of a “unified world.” But in the shadows, a cunning figure styling himself as the Emperor manipulates both sides, intending to use the Dragon Balls to crown himself sovereign of the planet. As alliances crumble and greed ignites, the line between myth and madness blurs — and the first ripples of destiny are set into motion.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🔹 EVENT TIMELINE (Main Path) 🔹</strong><ul><li><strong>⚔️ Event 1: “Echo in the Dust”</strong></li></ul><ul><li>The first Dragon Ball is unearthed by a scavenger’s crew deep within the Hera ruins, glowing faintly amid the bones of a forgotten age. </li></ul><ul><li>Its power draws attention from every corner of Kaizoku — scholars eager to study it, smugglers intent on selling it, and the Blue Bow Militia hoping to secure it for “peaceful” control. </li></ul><ul><li>Tensions erupt in the dust-choked frontier as rival groups clash over the relic. The orb’s energy pulses wildly, almost as if aware of the greed surrounding it.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Objective:</strong> Investigate the Hera ruins, secure the Dragon Ball, and determine whether to claim, conceal, or distribute it to the Militia.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧩 Event 2: “Rivals in the Ruins”</strong><ul><li>Rumors of a second orb hidden beneath a sunken desert temple ignite chaos across Kaizoku. </li></ul><ul><li>Multiple factions converge: scholars searching for truth, mercenaries for wealth, and the Blue Bow Militia for control. </li></ul><ul><li>The Emperor’s unseen agents begin spreading false intelligence, sparking paranoia between allies. </li></ul><ul><li>As dust storms rage and loyalties splinter, the temple becomes a crucible of betrayal — and beneath its stones, something ancient stirs, resonating with the Dragon Ball’s power.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Objective:</strong> Choose an alliance, secure the second orb, and uncover the identity of the Emperor’s infiltrator before the temple collapses.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Event 3: “The Emperor’s Hand”</strong><ul><li>The Emperor finally steps from the shadows — a charismatic strategist wielding several Dragon Balls gathered through manipulation and bloodshed. </li></ul><ul><li>His fortress, carved into Kaizoku’s cliffside, thrums with power from an enormous machine said to “stabilize” the wish ritual. </li></ul><ul><li>The Militia divides: some believe his rule could bring order, while others call it tyranny. Inside the fortress, players must decide whether to destroy the Emperor’s machine or seize control of it for themselves.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Objective:</strong> Infiltrate or defend the Emperor’s fortress, discover the truth behind his machine, and retrieve one of the captured Dragon Balls before the ritual begins.</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1427394035529814096/1428265719191306330","messageId":"1428265719191306330"},{"title":"👑 Event 4: “The Shattered Summoning” The Emperor initiates the summoning ritual. Lightning tears through the skies as his mac","html":"<div><span><ul><li><strong>👑 Event 4: “The Shattered Summoning”</strong><ul><li>The Emperor initiates the summoning ritual. Lightning tears through the skies as his machine amplifies the orbs’ energy beyond comprehension. </li></ul><ul><li>The heavens crack open, revealing glimpses of something vast and ancient. Yet the process destabilizes — the ritual falters, and the fortress begins to collapse under the pressure. </li></ul><ul><li>Energy flares consume soldiers and zealots alike as the Dragon Balls scatter in a storm of blinding light. Whether the Emperor succeeds or falls depends entirely on those who stand within the storm.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Objective:</strong> Stop or assist the Emperor’s summoning, survive the resulting energy surge, and secure any remaining Dragon Balls.</li></ul></li><li><span><strong>🔮 WHAT-IF SCENARIO: “The Emperor’s Wish” 🔮</strong></span><ul><li><span><strong>Trigger:</strong> The Emperor successfully completes the summoning ritual before players intervene.</span></li></ul><ul><li><span><strong>Outcome:</strong> The Eternal Dragon manifests in azure brilliance, granting the Emperor’s wish for global dominion — but the wish twists upon itself. His control extends only over those who have pledged to him, their free will erased. The Blue Bow Militia becomes the backbone of his new regime, their banners rebranded with the sigil of the Blue Crest Empire.</span></li></ul><ul><li><span><strong>Aftermath:</strong> Kaizoku fractures into imperial sectors under the Emperor’s rule. Resistance movements form in the shadows, and whispers of rebellion begin anew — setting the stage for the next great conflict.</span></li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1427394035529814096/1428265736429633567","messageId":"1428265736429633567"},{"title":"🧧 Saga Rewards: Reign of the Blue Crest (Main Timeline) 🧧 Condition: If the Emperor’s summoning ritual is stopped before comp","html":"<div><span><ul><li><strong>🧧 Saga Rewards: Reign of the Blue Crest (Main Timeline) 🧧</strong><ul><li>Condition: If the Emperor’s summoning ritual is stopped before completion and the Dragon Balls are scattered across the galaxy once more.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎖️ General Participation: 🎖️</strong><ul><li>💰 35,000–50,000 ZENI</li></ul><ul><li>🎗️ <strong>Title:</strong> “Defender of Kaizoku” — awarded to those who resisted the Emperor’s dominion and safeguarded the planet’s fate.</li></ul><ul><li>📜 <strong>Lore/Favor Reward:</strong> Gain something from the Emperor or King Jorka, depending on alignment.\n<ul><li><strong>Emperor's Agent path:</strong> Discount on military-grade items and factional missions.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>King Jorka path:</strong> Reduced training cooldown by half</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🥇 MVPs / High Performers: 🥇</strong><ul><li>💰 70,000–100,000 ZENI</li></ul><ul><li>🥋 Unique Item: “Azure Crest Relic” — a rare charm forged from fragments of the Emperor’s summoning device.\n<ul><li>Effect: Grants +10% bonus Zeni and EXP for all missions on Kaizoku.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🐉 Special Drop:</strong> “Fractured Dragon Shard” -  A splinter of raw energy left from the failed summoning ritual. Collecting multiple may yield unpredictable power in future arcs.</li></ul></li></ul></li><li><span><strong>🔮 What-If Timeline Rewards: “The Emperor’s Wish” 🔮</strong></span><ul><li><span>Condition: Triggered if the Emperor completes the summoning ritual and successfully enacts his corrupted dominion wish.</span></li></ul><ul><li><span><strong>🎖️ General Participation: 🎖️</strong></span><ul><li><span>💰 30,000–45,000 ZENI</span></li></ul><ul><li><span>⚔️ <strong>Title:</strong> “Servant of the Crest” — for those who survived under the Emperor’s control or reluctantly served his regime.</span></li></ul><ul><li><span>📜 <strong>Factional Shift:</strong> Players lose all existing Favor, replaced by “Imperial Standing.” This standing influences interactions with Blue Crest NPCs in future arcs.</span></li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><span><strong>🥇 MVPs / High Impact Players: 🥇</strong></span><ul><li><span>💰 65,000–90,000 ZENI</span></li></ul><ul><li><span>🩸 <strong>Rare Item:</strong> “Crestbound Sigil” — a cursed medallion marking loyalty to the Emperor.</span><ul><li><span><strong>Effect:</strong> Boosts Strength &amp; Health by 10%, but reduces Ki Regeneration by 25%.</span></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1427394035529814096/1428268780211015740","messageId":"1428268780211015740"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1427394035529814096","excerpt":"(edited) 👑 ✦ 𝐀𝐑𝐂 𝐍𝐀𝐌𝐄: 𝕽𝖊𝖎𝖌𝖓 𝖔𝖋 𝖙𝖍𝖊 𝕭𝖑𝖚𝖊 𝕮𝖗𝖊𝖘𝖙 ✦ 🐉 Theme: Ambition, discovery, and the corruption of desire Main Location: Planet Kaizoku — ancient ruins, dense jungles, and derelict fortress grounds Core Conflict: A self-proclaimed emperor races to "},{"title":"👑 Rise... Demon King Kilos!!!! 😈","slug":"rise-demon-king-kilos","group":"Completed","messages":[{"title":"👑 🜏 ✦ ARC NAME: Rise of Demon King Kilos ✦ 😈","html":"<div><span><h1>👑 🜏 ✦ 𝐀𝐑𝐂 𝐍𝐀𝐌𝐄: 𝕽𝖎𝖘𝖊 𝖔𝖋 𝕯𝖊𝖒𝖔𝖓 𝕶𝖎𝖓𝖌 𝕶𝖎𝖑𝖔𝖘 ✦ 😈</h1><strong>Theme:</strong> Corruption born from desperation. The fall of innocence before overwhelming power. The shadow of one’s own creation returning to claim its due.\n<strong>Main Locations:</strong> Planet Namek — emerald fields and azure skies turned battlefield under the weight of three invading factions. Planet Nomakia — the ancestral cradle of the Namekians, whose history and hidden darkness breathe life into Kilos’s resurgence.\n<strong>Core Conflict:</strong> Bound by an ancient link to Grand Elder Lokai, Demon King Kilos stirs once more. He seeks to regain his fading vitality — either through the power of the Dragon Balls or by forcing Lokai to merge with him. The two are halves of a single existence: creation and corruption, bound in eternal opposition. As Kilos’s influence spreads, Namek faces a choice — salvation through purity, or survival through corruption.\n<ul><li><strong>📜 ARC SYNOPSIS 📜</strong><ul><li>Under the tranquil skies of Namek, peace shatters with the arrival of three blackened suns — warships cloaked in Makyo energy that descend in perfect formation. From their holds emerge three Warlords — Sorru, Karnal, and Mekza, generals of the Demon Clan and chosen children of Kilos. Each carries a shard of his decaying life force, tasked with one mission: reclaim the seven Dragon Balls and prepare the world for their father’s ascension. Flames consume villages once sacred to the Dragon’s will, and the once-pristine oceans boil beneath falling wreckage. Survivors whisper of a shadow walking again among them — one whose aura bends even the light around it.</li></ul><ul><li>High atop the plateau of the Great Elder’s Shrine, Grand Elder Lokai feels the truth surge through him. His body weakens; his pulse mirrors Kilos’s own. Across the stars, the balance that once defined the Namekian soul begins to crumble. And so begins the war for Namek’s very identity — a war of brothers, of bloodlines, and of purpose.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🔹 EVENT TIMELINE (Main Path) 🔹</strong><ul><li><strong>⚔️ Event 1: “The Emerald Sky Burns”</strong></li></ul><ul><li>The first armada descends — colossal obsidian ships cutting across the green heavens, their energy cannons painting the clouds red. Villages along the southern coast are obliterated in moments, their sanctuaries reduced to molten glass.</li></ul><ul><li>Leading the assault is Sorru, eldest of the Demon Warlords — a stoic, deep-green Namekian whose voice carries both reverence and wrath. He declares that all who serve Kilos will be spared, while those clinging to the “false balance” of Lokai will burn.</li></ul><ul><li>Grand Elder Lokai orders an evacuation of civilians to the northern cliffs. The defenders form lines beneath burning skies, but the air thickens — Kilos’s aura pulsing through every breath, weakening the will of the untrained.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Objective:</strong> Protect the evacuation routes and defend the surviving Namekians.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Player Choice:</strong> Aid Kilos by capturing the sacred orbs for his restoration or oppose him by fortifying the southern strongholds and evacuating survivors.</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1428216032425803868/1428240971312795708","messageId":"1428240971312795708"},{"title":"🌑 Event 2: “Ashes of Harmony” Sorru’s forces seize the first Dragon Ball, and across the planet, fissures open — leaking blac","html":"<div><span><ul><li><strong>🌑 Event 2: “Ashes of Harmony”</strong><ul><li>Sorru’s forces seize the first Dragon Ball, and across the planet, fissures open — leaking black-green light that twists the soil. From these rifts emerge more Demon Clan soldiers, bearing the same insignia as Nomakia’s ancient guardians.</li></ul><ul><li>The second Warlord, Karnal, leads the invasion of the western isles — a hulking brute who manipulates natural energy to corrupt the land itself. Forests wither, rivers boil, and the local Namekians’ regenerative abilities begin to falter.</li></ul><ul><li>Elder Cello discovers the truth — these fissures are not simple cracks, but conduits linking Namek to Nomakia itself. The barrier between the twin worlds is failing.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Objective:</strong> Seal the fissures using sacred Namekian energy or allow them to widen, letting Kilos’s army draw strength from the twin world’s power.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Player Choice:</strong> Aid the Demon Clan in stabilizing the portals or defend the shrines and stop the fusion of worlds.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🔥 Event 3: “The Warlords’ Wrath”</strong><ul><li>The defenders mount a counterattack at the Vale of Voices — a sacred canyon where the echoes of Namekian ancestors once guided meditation. The battle is brutal, spanning days of lightning, energy storms, and corrupted rainfall.</li></ul><ul><li>Here, the three Warlords finally stand united — Sorru, Karnal, and the youngest, Mekza, a cunning and cold tactician who commands through illusions and deceit. Together, they wield fragments of Kilos’s lifeforce, making them near-immortal unless severed simultaneously.</li></ul><ul><li>As the battle rages, Nomakia’s sky bleeds through — twin suns overlapping, turning the battlefield gold and crimson. Elders Saxo and Cello lead the charge, but the effort costs them dearly.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Objective:</strong> Defeat at least one Warlord to weaken Kilos’s life-link — or betray the resistance and ensure their survival to guarantee Kilos’s rise.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Player Choice:</strong> Strike down the Warlords and reclaim their shards or protect them and offer the shards directly to Kilos’s summoning ritual.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🌌 Event 4: “The Cradle of Shadows”</strong><ul><li>As the war reaches its peak, the link between Namek and Nomakia stabilizes — merging parts of both worlds. The once-bright horizon turns dark jade, and the air hums with demonic resonance.</li></ul><ul><li>Beneath the great canyon of Nomakia, Kilos emerges — not reborn, but revealed. His body is ancient yet unbowed, his voice resonating through every Namekian’s soul. He does not command through rage, but through reason, declaring himself the “True Balance” — the evolution of their kind.</li></ul><ul><li>Grand Elder Lokai confronts him, their voices shaking the stars. One speaks of harmony; the other, of purpose. Their argument becomes a psychic storm that tears across both planets, forcing even bystanders to choose sides.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Objective:</strong> Protect Lokai during his confrontation and weaken Kilos’s control — or aid Kilos by striking down Lokai’s protectors to end the balance once and for all.</li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1428216032425803868/1428241177961959504","messageId":"1428241177961959504"},{"title":"💀 Event 5: “Fall of the Demon King” The final battle erupts at the merged heart of both worlds — a colossal field of green cr","html":"<div><span><ul><li><strong>💀 Event 5: “Fall of the Demon King”</strong><ul><li>The final battle erupts at the merged heart of both worlds — a colossal field of green crystal and molten rock, formed where Nomakia and Namek’s cores have fused. Rivers of emerald fire run beneath shattered spires as the skies churn with lightning and corrupted light.</li></ul><ul><li>Kilos stands at the center of it all, his vitality restored through the shards of his children and the gathered Dragon Balls. His aura pulses in rhythmic waves, every breath of his sapping the life from the battlefield itself.</li></ul><ul><li>Grand Elder Lokai arrives, his frame weakened but his spirit unyielding. The two opposites — creation and corruption — collide, their shared lifeforce threatening to tear the fabric of both worlds apart.</li></ul><ul><li>As their power reaches its limit, the three surviving Warlords pin Lokai down, their bodies burning under the strain of Kilos’s command. With a final roar, Kilos attempts to force assimilation, intending to absorb Lokai completely and become the vessel of both creation and decay — a perfect, eternal being.</li></ul><ul><li>Lokai resists with everything he has left. In one last act of defiance, he channels the remnants of his life force outward — sealing both himself and Kilos within the eternal void, cutting off their shared lifelink forever.</li></ul><ul><li>The clash ends in silence. Two halves of one soul vanish from existence… leaving Namek trembling, its people without a guide.</li></ul><ul><li>In the aftermath, the surviving Elders call upon the Moot of Guardians — a sacred convergence of protectors from across the stars — to decide who will take up the mantle of Grand Elder and restore balance to the shattered planet.</li></ul><ul><li>The players’ choices throughout the arc determine the outcome:\n<ul><li>If they aided Kilos, the Warlords succeed — Lokai is forcibly assimilated, and Kilos becomes the eternal vessel of both souls.</li></ul><ul><li>If they opposed him, Lokai seals himself and Kilos away, ending the Demon King’s reign at the cost of his own life.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>Objective:</strong> End Kilos’s reign. Choose between aiding the Demon King’s ascension or ensuring both he and Lokai vanish into the void.</li></ul></li><li><span><strong>🔮 WHAT-IF SCENARIO: “Legacy of the Crimson Throne”</strong></span><ul><li><span><strong>Trigger:</strong> Players fail to stop Kilos’s full absorption of Lokai during Event 5.</span></li></ul><ul><li><span><strong>Outcome:</strong> Kilos becomes whole — wisdom and corruption fused, balance and decay unified. The planet’s green hue deepens to a scarlet jade, its atmosphere shimmering with demonic energy. The skies are painted red as both worlds merge completely into Crimson Nomakia, a Planet  ruled by Demon Clan Namekians.</span><ul><li><span><strong>Aftermath:</strong> Kilos forges the Crimson Dragon Balls, granting twisted wishes that always come with a cost. The galaxy trembles as a new empire rises from the ashes — one that preaches order through domination. The few survivors who resist scatter among the stars, vowing to form the first Rebellion of the Pure.</span></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1428216032425803868/1428241222484623492","messageId":"1428241222484623492"},{"title":"🧧 Saga Rewards: Rise of Demon King Kilos (Main Timeline) 🧧 Condition: Rewards are granted if Kilos is sealed within the Void","html":"<div><span><ul><li><strong>🧧 Saga Rewards: Rise of Demon King Kilos (Main Timeline) 🧧</strong><ul><li>Condition: Rewards are granted if Kilos is sealed within the Void before fully assimilating with Grand Elder Lokai.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎖️ General Participation: 🎖️</strong><ul><li>💰 25,000–35,000 ZENI </li></ul><ul><li>🎗️ <strong>Title Earned:</strong> Defender of the Twin Worlds</li></ul><ul><li>📜 <strong>Lore Reward:</strong> Earn the favor of the surviving Namekian Elders. Participants gain -10% Training Duration for one week (reflecting Namek’s spiritual blessing).</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🥇 MVPs / High Performers: 🥇</strong><ul><li>💰 50,000–75,000 ZENI</li></ul><ul><li>🥋 <strong>Unique Item:</strong> Shard of the Void — A fragment of the rift left behind by Kilos’s sealing. Grants temporary resistance to corruption-based techniques or Ki-draining effects.</li></ul><ul><li>🧬 <strong>Special Technique:</strong> Void Surge — Once per battle, the user can seal 50% of an opponent’s Power Level for two turns. (Cannot be stacked or purified.)</li></ul><ul><li>🐉 <strong>Special Drop:</strong> Fragment of Lokai’s Memory — A crystalized echo of the Grand Elder’s wisdom. Can be exchanged in future sagas for insight-based or Intelligence-linked upgrades.</li></ul></li></ul></li><li><span><strong>🔮 What-If Timeline Rewards: “Legacy of the Crimson Throne” 🔮</strong></span><ul><li><span>Condition: Triggered if Kilos successfully assimilates Lokai during Event 5, merging both souls into one being.</span></li></ul><ul><li><span><strong>🎖️ General Participation: 🎖️</strong></span><ul><li><span>💰 30,000–40,000 ZENI</span></li></ul><ul><li><span>⚔️ <strong>Title Earned:</strong> Servant of the Crimson Throne</span></li></ul><ul><li><span>📜 <strong>Lore Reward:</strong> Alignment with the Demon Clan grants temporary access to corrupted Namekian relics and +10% Power Level gain for one week (reflecting dark infusion).</span></li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><span><strong>🥇 MVPs / High Impact Players: 🥇</strong></span><ul><li><span>💰 60,000–85,000 ZENI</span></li></ul><ul><li><span>🩸 <strong>Corrupted Relic:</strong> Crimson Sigil of Kilos — A demonic emblem bound in ki thread. Increases all offensive rolls by +2 but permanently reduces purification resistance.</span></li></ul><ul><li><span>🧬 <strong>Special Technique:</strong> Assimilation Surge — Once per battle, the user can siphon 50% of an opponent’s Power Level for two turns. (Cannot be stacked or purified.)</span></li></ul><ul><li><span>🧪 <strong>Server-Wide Effect:</strong> Crimson Resonance — Following the What-If outcome, Demon Clan-aligned characters gain boosted event priority and minor Zeni bonuses, while neutral factions suffer strained diplomatic relations.</span></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1428216032425803868/1428265675935191091","messageId":"1428265675935191091"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1428216032425803868","excerpt":"👑 🜏 ✦ 𝐀𝐑𝐂 𝐍𝐀𝐌𝐄: 𝕽𝖎𝖘𝖊 𝖔𝖋 𝕯𝖊𝖒𝖔𝖓 𝕶𝖎𝖓𝖌 𝕶𝖎𝖑𝖔𝖘 ✦ 😈 Theme: Corruption born from desperation. The fall of innocence before overwhelming power. The shadow of one’s own creation returning to claim its due. Main Locations: Planet Namek — emerald fields and azur"},{"title":"🔵 March of the Blue Bow Militia 🔵","slug":"march-of-the-blue-bow-militia","group":"Completed","messages":[{"title":"✦ ARC NAME: March of the Blue Bow Militia✦ 🔵","html":"<div><span><h1>🔵 ✦ 𝐀𝐑𝐂 𝐍𝐀𝐌𝐄: 𝕸𝖆𝖗𝖈𝖍 𝖔𝖋 𝖙𝖍𝖊 𝕭𝖑𝖚𝖊 𝕭𝖔𝖜 𝕸𝖎𝖑𝖎𝖙𝖎𝖆✦ 🔵</h1><strong>Theme:</strong> Conquest through deception, militarized expansion, and the illusion of peace.\n<strong>Main Locations:</strong> Planet Kaizoku, Planet Videam, Planet Cereal, Planet Plant, Planet Earth, Planet Sadala.\n<strong>Core Conflict:</strong> The Blue Bow Militia, a rapidly expanding interplanetary syndicate led by a Kaizokian of the Heeter bloodline, launches a campaign to locate the Dragon Balls through diplomacy, manipulation, and force — promising “protection” while spreading silent domination.\n<ul><li><strong>📜 ARC SYNOPSIS 📜</strong><ul><li>Born from the corporate underworld of Kaizoku, the Blue Bow Militia rises to power through calculated charisma and economic control. Led by Director Cerule, a shrewd and power-hungry Kaizokian descended from the Heeter Clan, the Militia publicly advertises itself as a peacekeeping trade organization — uniting planets through contracts, not conflict. Behind the facade, however, Cerule and his inner circle — Adjutant Noir, Dr. Kulu, Captain Azure, Lieutenant Lilac, and the monstrous Unit M-09 — orchestrate invasions disguised as “economic stabilization.” Their ultimate goal: harness the Dragon Balls’ mystical resonance to corner the galaxy’s trade routes and rewrite the balance of interstellar power. Whispers of Neo-Mutant Tuffles, engineered from ancient Tuffle DNA and Kaizokian enhancements, spread across the stars. As alliances fracture and worlds fall, factions must decide whether to resist the Militia’s reach… or to join its rise and reap the rewards of loyalty.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🔹 EVENT TIMELINE (Main Path) 🔹</strong><ul><li><strong>⚔️ Event 1: “Whispers on Kaizoku”</strong></li></ul><ul><li>Kaizoku’s black markets stir with tension as whispers of a corporate army circulate among traders and mercenaries.</li></ul><ul><li>A mysterious insignia — a cerulean bow — marks shipments of high-grade weaponry and off-world tech.</li></ul><ul><li>Rumors link a Heeter of Kaizokian descent to these movements, consolidating control over arms dealers and pirate guilds.</li></ul><ul><li>Dr. Kulu’s old archives are rumored to have resurfaced, stolen by the Militia’s science branch for unknown research.</li></ul><ul><li>Players uncover hidden recruitment drives in Kaizoku’s undercity and witness first-hand the silent mobilization of an army hidden in plain sight.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Objective:</strong> Investigate the Blue Bow Militia’s operations on Kaizoku and uncover the Heeter’s initial plan of expansion.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧩 Event 2: “Operation Reach”</strong><ul><li>Militia envoys arrive on Videam, Cereal, and Plant, bringing trade proposals and security guarantees.</li></ul><ul><li>Lieutenant Lilac and Director Cerule oversee “peacekeeping installations,” while Captain Azure leads a covert team studying the Dragon Balls’ magical energy frequencies.</li></ul><ul><li>Dr. Kulu and Noir debut the first Neo-Mutant Tuffle prototypes — powerful soldiers forged from Tuffle DNA and Kaizokian biotech.</li></ul><ul><li>Meanwhile, some planetary leaders begin to suspect the “contracts” contain clauses that allow Militia occupation.</li></ul><ul><li>Players must navigate diplomacy, deception, and the moral cost of their allegiance.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Objective:</strong> Expose or enforce the Militia’s infiltration of planetary governments across Videam, Cereal, and Plant.</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1427911398066753706/1427913792196710400","messageId":"1427913792196710400"},{"title":"Event 3: “The Siege of Videam” When the Videam council refuses Militia partnership, Cerule initiates “containment.” Lieuten","html":"<div><span><ul><li><strong>🔥 Event 3: “The Siege of Videam”</strong><ul><li>When the Videam council refuses Militia partnership, Cerule initiates “containment.”</li></ul><ul><li>Lieutenant Lilac commands aerial fleets that descend upon Videam’s capital under the false pretense of quelling rebellion.</li></ul><ul><li>Neo-Mutant Tuffles march through the streets, their eyes glowing with cold obedience, as energy blasts scar the skyline.</li></ul><ul><li>The planet’s defenders make a desperate last stand, unaware that the Militia’s goal is not control — but the Videam Dragon Ball hidden in the ruins of its archives.</li></ul><ul><li>Amid chaos, players choose sides: resistance, conquest, or betrayal.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Objective:</strong> Determine the fate of Videam — defend its people or secure the Dragon Ball for the Militia’s cause.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>👁️ Event 4 <span>(If BBM wins in E3)</span>: “The Broker’s Game”</strong><ul><li>With Videam subdued, Cerule begins his diplomatic tour across Cereal and Plant. He meets with rulers, bounty networks, and crime syndicates — weaving alliances through promises of prosperity.</li></ul><ul><li>Mercenary Tao and Metallitron act as his personal envoys, silencing dissent through intimidation or charm.</li></ul><ul><li>Behind closed doors, assassinations and coercion solidify Militia control while propaganda paints them as saviors.</li></ul><ul><li>Players uncover plots to destabilize governments and may confront or manipulate the Heeter’s network from within.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Objective:</strong> Disrupt the Heeter’s political web or ensure his influence dominates the Cereal and Plant systems.</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1427911398066753706/1427913896941064262","messageId":"1427913896941064262"},{"title":"⚙️ Event 5: “The Iron Quarters” Hidden beneath Kaizoku’s volcanic crust lies the Iron Quarters, the Militia’s central foundry","html":"<div><span><ul><li><strong>⚙️ Event 5: “The Iron Quarters”</strong><ul><li>Hidden beneath Kaizoku’s volcanic crust lies the Iron Quarters, the Militia’s central foundry and nerve center.</li></ul><ul><li>Here, Dr. Kulu finalizes mass-production of Neo-Mutant Tuffles, assisted by Unit M-09 Metallitron — a towering cyborg built for industrial warfare.</li></ul><ul><li>Captured scientists are forced into labor, while crates of refined Ki-Cells await off-world transport.</li></ul><ul><li>The Militia’s emblem burns over the skyline as alarms blare — a raid is underway.</li></ul><ul><li>Whether led by rebellion or loyalty, this battle will decide if the Militia’s heart continues to beat.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Objective:</strong> Raid or defend the Iron Quarters to decide the future of the Neo-Mutant Tuffle program.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>💀 Event 6: “Shadows Over Sadala”</strong><ul><li>The Militia arrives on Sadala, offering the Saiyans an alliance: advanced weaponry and political power in exchange for loyalty.</li></ul><ul><li>Captain Azure leads the negotiations while Adjudant Noir oversees the armament exchanges. But the ruse shatters when the Saiyans uncover the Militia’s deceit — discovering a plot to enslave Saiyan DNA for new bio-enhancements.</li></ul><ul><li>The skies of Sadala burn as Saiyan legions clash with the Militia’s fleets in one of the bloodiest battles of the arc.</li></ul><ul><li>Amid the chaos, Director Cerule's personal guard, Mercenary Tao, enters the fray to eliminate all loose ends.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Objective:</strong> Defend Sadala’s sovereignty or enforce Militia dominance across the Saiyan homeworld.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>👑 Event 7: “The Fall of the Bow”</strong><ul><li>Atop Kaizoku’s highest spire, under the light of seven glowing Dragon Balls, Cerule begins the summoning.</li></ul><ul><li>His loyalists — Lieutenant Lilac, Captain Azure, and Dr. Kulu— protect the ritual site with relentless precision.</li></ul><ul><li>Alliances fracture as mercenaries defect, Neo-Mutants rebel, and chaos consumes the city.</li></ul><ul><li>The Dragon stirs, but a blast from the collapsing Iron Quarters disrupts the summoning, scattering the spheres once more. Director Cerule vanishes in the explosion’s light, leaving his empire in ruins — but his vision far from dead.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Objective:</strong> Prevent or Ensure Director Cerule’s summoning ritual and decide the fate of the Blue Bow Militia’s remnants.\n<ul><li><span>(What-If Trigger): If the summoning succeeds, transition into “The Bow Ascendant.”</span></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li><li><span><strong>🔮 WHAT-IF SCENARIO: “The Bow Ascendant”</strong></span><ul><li><span>Cerule’s summoning succeeds. Rather than immortality, he wishes for the eternal loyalty of all Neo-Mutant Tuffles — binding their evolution to his very life.</span></li></ul><ul><li><span>Under this twisted will, the Blue Bow Militia transcends into a cult-empire of unwavering devotion.</span></li></ul><ul><li><span>Kaizoku becomes the Capital of the Bow, its skies patrolled by loyal Neo-Mutants and subjugated Saiyans.</span></li></ul><ul><li><span>The galaxy bends beneath an empire where free will is traded for allegiance — and rebellion becomes the only path to freedom.</span></li></ul><ul><li><span><strong>Objective:</strong> Lead or dismantle the new Blue Bow Empire, igniting the era of the “Resistance Arcs.”</span></li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1427911398066753706/1427915009391988746","messageId":"1427915009391988746"},{"title":"🧧 Saga Rewards: March of the Blue Bow Militia (Main Timeline) 🧧 Condition: If Director Cerule’s summoning ritual is stopped b","html":"<div><span><ul><li><strong>🧧 Saga Rewards: March of the Blue Bow Militia (Main Timeline) 🧧</strong><ul><li>Condition: If Director Cerule’s summoning ritual is stopped before completion, and the Blue Bow Militia’s expansion is dismantled or fractured across the galaxy.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎖️ General Participation: 🎖️</strong><ul><li>💰 45,000–65,000 ZENI</li></ul><ul><li>🎗️ <strong>Title:</strong> “Breaker of the Bow” — granted to those who stood against the Militia’s empire and survived its fall.</li></ul><ul><li>📜 <strong>Lore/Favor Reward:</strong> Gain a Favor with the Galactic Patrol. Grants access to discounted Resistance Missions or Alliance Contracts (reduced training cooldowns on missions involving planetary defense or rebellion).</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🥇 MVPs / High Performers: 🥇</strong><ul><li>💰 85,000–120,000 ZENI</li></ul><ul><li>🥋 <strong>Unique Item:</strong> “Cerulean Crest Band” - A metallic armband once worn by high-ranking Blue Bow officers. Still hums faintly with bio-tech resonance.</li></ul><ul><li>🐉 <strong>Special Drop:</strong> “Neo-Mutant Core Fragment” - A crystalline remnant of Gyro’s biotech research. Mysterious, reactive, and key to unlocking the origins of the Neo-Mutant strain.</li></ul></li></ul></li><li><span><strong>🔮 What-If Timeline Rewards: “The Bow Ascendant” 🔮</strong></span><ul><li><span>Condition: If Director Cerule’s summoning succeeds, granting him control over all Neo-Mutant Tuffles and forming the Blue Bow Empire.</span></li></ul><ul><li><span><strong>🎖️ General Participation: 🎖️</strong></span><ul><li><span>💰 40,000–55,000 ZENI</span></li></ul><ul><li><span>⚔️ <strong>Title:</strong> “Hand of the Empire” — given to those who survived or thrived under Cerule’s rule, willingly or not.</span></li></ul><ul><li><span>📜 <strong>Factional Shift:</strong> Grants access to Imperial Quests, but locks all Resistance or Rebellion-related tasks for one arc cycle.</span></li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><span><strong>🥇 MVPs / High Impact Players: 🥇</strong></span><ul><li><span>💰 75,000–100,000 ZENI</span></li></ul><ul><li><span>🩸 <strong>Rare Item:</strong> “Neo-Mutant Gene Key” - Grants access to a temporary hybrid mutation buff — increases Strength and Health by 15% for a single battle.</span></li></ul><ul><li><span>🧪 <strong>Server-Wide Effect:</strong></span><ul><li><span>Imperial Suppression Act: Planets Videam, Cereal, and Kaizoku remain under partial imperial control.</span></li></ul><ul><li><span>Blue Bow-aligned NPCs gain +10% mission success bonus in economy or tech-related systems, while Resistance-aligned missions face +10% difficulty.</span></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1427911398066753706/1428272820495974471","messageId":"1428272820495974471"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1427911398066753706","excerpt":"🔵 ✦ 𝐀𝐑𝐂 𝐍𝐀𝐌𝐄: 𝕸𝖆𝖗𝖈𝖍 𝖔𝖋 𝖙𝖍𝖊 𝕭𝖑𝖚𝖊 𝕭𝖔𝖜 𝕸𝖎𝖑𝖎𝖙𝖎𝖆✦ 🔵 Theme: Conquest through deception, militarized expansion, and the illusion of peace. Main Locations: Planet Kaizoku, Planet Videam, Planet Cereal, Planet Plant, Planet Earth, Planet Sadala. Core Conflict"},{"title":"🕵️‍♂️ ✦ The Blood Beneath ✦ 🕵️‍♀️","slug":"the-blood-beneath","group":"Events","messages":[{"title":"🕵️‍♂️ ✦ EVENT: The Blood Beneath ✦ 🕵️‍♀️","html":"<div><span><h1>🕵️‍♂️ ✦ 𝐄𝐕𝐄𝐍𝐓: 𝐓𝐡𝐞 𝐁𝐥𝐨𝐨𝐝 𝐁𝐞𝐧𝐞𝐚𝐭𝐡 ✦ 🕵️‍♀️</h1><ul><li><strong>Theme:</strong> Intrigue, deception, murder mystery</li><li><strong>Location:</strong> A Planet with Dragon Balls</li><li><strong>Core Conflict:</strong> A murder shocks the Planet. The Dragon Balls are missing. Someone among the gathered players is guilty… and everyone else is a suspect.</li><li><strong>🔍 Event Premise 🔍</strong><ul><li>A prestigious figure — possibly a councilman, scientist, or spiritual leader — has been murdered in broad daylight. The Dragon Balls, once protected in a government vault or sacred site, are now missing. The city goes into lockdown. You and the others are gathered for questioning…</li></ul><ul><li>The twist? One of the participants is actually the killer.</li></ul><ul><li>Another? One of you was the victim.</li></ul><ul><li>And there’s only one way to uncover the truth — without getting yourself framed in the process.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🎡 Wheel Spin Mechanics 🎡</strong><ul><li>At the start of the event, a mod or bot spins:</li></ul><ul><li>🎯 Victim Wheel — chooses who is the “murdered” character (they may return as a ghost, memory, or flashback NPC)</li></ul><ul><li>🎯 Killer Wheel — secretly assigns a participant as the actual murderer</li></ul><ul><li><span><strong>🧠 Killer Rules:</strong></span><ul><li><span>You must hide your identity through RP</span></li></ul><ul><li><span>You can plant false evidence or try to frame others (via whispers or coded statements)</span></li></ul><ul><li><span>You can set traps during investigations (staff will mod these as narrative twists)</span></li></ul><ul><li><span>If you're caught? Big risk.</span></li></ul><ul><li><span>If you succeed? Bigger reward.</span></li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><span><em>🔐 The killer’s identity is ONLY revealed if another player or the event group succeeds in identifying them by name + motive + clue set.</em></span></li></ul></li><li><strong>📜 Event Phases 📜</strong><ul><li><strong>🔎 Phase 1:</strong> “The Gathering”</li></ul><ul><li>Everyone is summoned to a lockdown hearing</li></ul><ul><li>The murder scene is displayed</li></ul><ul><li>You investigate surroundings, gather clues, and interact with others</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧩 Phase 2:</strong> “The Unraveling”\n<ul><li>You begin to notice inconsistencies</li></ul><ul><li>Traps begin springing up (planted by the killer earlier)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Optional:</strong> Players may accuse others — but false accusations have penalties</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>⚖️ Phase 3:</strong> “The Accusation”\n<ul><li>Players lock in their final guesses</li></ul><ul><li>If enough correctly name the killer, they must confront and defeat them before they escape</li></ul><ul><li>If they fail, the killer escapes, framing another — the Dragon Balls remain lost</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎭 Optional Mechanics</strong><ul><li><strong>🗂️ Clue Cards:</strong> EM-controlled drops (e.g., torn fabric, energy residue, footage, misleading evidence)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧪 INT-Based Bonuses:</strong> Players with 6+ INT may auto-discover hidden clues</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧱 False Leads:</strong> The killer may write 1–2 “red herring clues” during the event</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧬 Ghost Memory Events:</strong> If the victim is a player, they can provide eerie flashbacks, hints, or visions during the event to certain people</li></ul></li></ul></li><li><strong>🎁 Event Rewards 🎁</strong><ul><li><strong>🎖️ Base Participation:</strong></li></ul><ul><li>💰 +3,500 Zeni</li></ul><ul><li>🔎 Access to a “Detective’s Kit” minor item (may be used in future mystery-type events)</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🥇 Reward for Correctly Identifying the Killer:</strong><ul><li>💰 +5,000 Zeni</li></ul><ul><li>🧠 +0.5 INT</li></ul><ul><li>🪙 1x “Truth Seeker Coin” (used once per arc to auto-reveal a falsehood in an RP scene — mod approved)</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><span><strong>😈 Killer Reward (if they escape undiscovered):</strong></span><ul><li><span>💰 +7,000 Zeni</span></li></ul><ul><li><span>🧤 “Gloves of Deceit” (item that lets them plant a false clue in any future mission — 1 use, staff modded)</span></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1389639977658220574/1389640008339554485","messageId":"1389640008339554485"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1389639977658220574","excerpt":"🕵️‍♂️ ✦ 𝐄𝐕𝐄𝐍𝐓: 𝐓𝐡𝐞 𝐁𝐥𝐨𝐨𝐝 𝐁𝐞𝐧𝐞𝐚𝐭𝐡 ✦ 🕵️‍♀️ Theme: Intrigue, deception, murder mystery Location: A Planet with Dragon Balls Core Conflict: A murder shocks the Planet. The Dragon Balls are missing. Someone among the gathered players is guilty… and everyo"},{"title":"🩸 Blood of the Betrayer 🩸","slug":"blood-of-the-betrayer","group":"Completed","messages":[{"title":"🩸 ✦ ARC NAME: Blood of the Betrayer ✦ 🩸","html":"<div><span><h1>🩸 ✦ 𝐀𝐑𝐂 𝐍𝐀𝐌𝐄: 𝕭𝖑𝖔𝖔𝖉 𝖔𝖋 𝖙𝖍𝖊 𝕭𝖊𝖙𝖗𝖆𝖞𝖊𝖗 ✦ 🩸</h1><strong>Theme:</strong> The return of bloodlines and the burning cost of pride. This arc explores generational hatred, the thin line between justice and vengeance, and the fate of a civilization built on strength. It’s a story of brothers, sons, and kings — and the fire that consumes them all.\n<strong>Main Location:</strong> Planet Sadala — once the proud heart of Saiyan civilization, now fractured by corruption, grief, and lies. Key areas include the Royal Citadel, the Cryon Wastes, and the Ashen Plains, where the final confrontation will determine the planet’s fate.\n<strong>Core Conflict:</strong> The Prince's crusade to reclaim Sadala from Aikon’s tyranny threatens to destroy the very world they swore to protect.\n<ul><li><strong>📜 ARC SYNOPSIS 📜</strong><ul><li>Two decades after the infamous betrayal that saw General Boru slain by his own kin, the wounds of Sadala still linger in whispers and superstition. The name “Boru” became a curse, a reminder that even the proudest Saiyan could fall to envy. But history, as it often does, refuses to stay buried. Aikon, Boru’s surviving son, emerges from the fringes of the galaxy with the charisma of a leader and the venom of a serpent. Spinning lies of injustice and corruption, he paints his father as a martyr slain by jealousy — convincing many warriors that the royal family stole his legacy. With Sadala divided, King Azurik’s rule weakens, and Aikon strikes from the shadows, plunging his blade into his uncle’s heart. The King’s death ignites chaos across the planet. Civil war brews in the streets as loyalists and dissenters clash, while mercenaries and off-world invaders exploit the turmoil. Amid the anarchy, Atzuma — long absent and hardened by years of off-world battles — learns of his father’s assassination. Beside his twin, Zyon, the prince who governs through reason and restraint, he returns to a world on the brink of ruin. Now, the brothers must reunite a fractured kingdom, reclaim their birthright, and face the echo of their family’s sin — for in Aikon’s veins flows the same fire that once tried to destroy them. And if they fail, the Saiyan legacy will drown in the blood of its own.</li></ul></li><li><strong>🔹 EVENT TIMELINE (Main Path) 🔹</strong><ul><li><strong>⚔️ Event 1: “Echoes of the Fallen”</strong></li></ul><ul><li>Atzuma returns to Sadala, finding the once-proud capital in ruin — the palace desecrated, banners torn, and the throne room scarred by battle.</li></ul><ul><li>Zyon rallies the survivors of the royal guard, while Atzuma scours the frontier, hunting rebel commanders and carving a path through insurgent strongholds.</li></ul><ul><li>Players uncover fragments of Aikon’s propaganda — murals and holograms depicting Azurik as the “usurper of Boru’s bloodline.”</li></ul><ul><li>The brothers reunite amid fire and chaos — one blazing with fury, the other with resolve — rekindling the hope of the true Saiyan line.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Objective:</strong> Reclaim the Capital’s outskirts and secure the last stronghold of the Royal Guard.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🧩 Event 2: “The Fractured Throne”</strong><ul><li>Civil war ignites. The Royal Capital divides into warring districts as Aikon’s army uses fear and illusion to break morale.</li></ul><ul><li>Players must decide between defending strategic locations, rescuing civilians, or sabotaging enemy networks.</li></ul><ul><li>Aikon uses advanced Tuffle tech to project false confessions from the late King — “admitting” to Boru’s betrayal — turning citizens against their own blood.</li></ul><ul><li>An enigmatic tactician, known only as The Whisper, is revealed to be a surviving Tuffle strategist who once served Boru, guiding Aikon from the shadows.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Objective:</strong> Prevent Aikon’s illusions from spreading beyond the capital — or risk permanent corruption of the Saiyan legacy.</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1425312844089397298/1425312929762508951","messageId":"1425312929762508951"},{"title":"🔮 WHAT-IF SCENARIO: “Crimson Legacy” 🔮 Trigger: Players fail to unite Sadala’s factions during Event 2, allowing Aikon to sei","html":"<div><span><ul><li><span><strong>🔮 WHAT-IF SCENARIO: “Crimson Legacy” 🔮</strong></span><ul><li><span>Trigger: Players fail to unite Sadala’s factions during Event 2, allowing Aikon to seize control of the capital before the brothers arrive.</span></li></ul><ul><li><span>Zyon is captured and forced into servitude as Aikon’s puppet ruler, while Atzuma becomes a hunted exile.</span></li></ul><ul><li><span>Aikon crowns himself “King of True Blood,” enforcing strength through oppression — a twisted reflection of Saiyan honor.</span></li></ul><ul><li><span>Players must choose between serving the Crimson Empire or aiding Atzuma’s rebellion in exile.</span></li></ul><ul><li><span>The “Crimson Legacy” timeline permanently alters Sadala’s future, with Aikon’s tyranny reshaping Saiyan society into one of fear and dominance.</span></li></ul><ul><li><strong>🔥 Event 3: “The Cryon Wastes Revisited”</strong><ul><li>Intelligence leads the brothers to the Cryon Wastes — the icy grave of General Boru and the birthplace of Sadala’s original betrayal.</li></ul><ul><li>Amid a raging blizzard, Aikon’s army stands defiant. His presence emanates a familiar ki — wild, hateful, ancient.</li></ul><ul><li>As the armies clash, Zyon discovers the truth: Aikon has bonded with Boru’s residual essence, his ki reborn through forbidden science.</li></ul><ul><li>Atzuma’s fury boils over, his attacks shaking the frozen plains; Aikon counters with Boru’s corrupted might.</li></ul><ul><li>The battle is a reflection of history itself — nephew versus uncle’s will, both consumed by vengeance.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Objective:</strong> Defeat Aikon’s vanguard and destroy the relics binding Boru’s ki to the living realm.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>👑 Event 4: “Blood Reforged”</strong><ul><li><strong>Path of Restraint:</strong> If Zyon and the players succeed in tempering Atzuma’s fury, Aikon is subdued — the relic destroyed, Boru’s essence finally put to rest. Sadala is scarred, but its people live to rebuild under Zyon’s cautious reign.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Outcome:</strong> The Boru bloodline ends in peace, and Atzuma becomes Sadala’s strongest protector, vowing to never again let wrath dictate fate.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>Path of Fury:</strong> If Atzuma succumbs to his rage, the result is apocalyptic. His unleashed power collides with Aikon’s corrupted ki, creating a planet-shattering explosion that tears Sadala in half. The western hemisphere is obliterated, disintegrating into the void — while three unknown beings intervene, saving the remaining Saiyans before total annihilation. Aikon is slain in the same manner as his father — consumed by the very fury he sought to command.\n<ul><li><strong>Outcome:</strong> Half a planet remains, a new age begins in mourning and awe. Atzuma disappears into the cosmos, his fate unknown.</li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><strong>Objective:</strong> Decide the fate of the brothers, the planet, and the legacy of Boru’s bloodline.</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></span> <span>(edited)</span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1425312844089397298/1425312988880965712","messageId":"1425312988880965712"},{"title":"🧧 Saga Rewards: Blood of the Betrayer (Main Timeline) 🧧 If Aikon is defeated, purified, or slain without unleashing Atzuma’s","html":"<div><span><ul><li><strong>🧧 Saga Rewards: Blood of the Betrayer (Main Timeline) 🧧</strong><ul><li>If Aikon is defeated, purified, or slain without unleashing Atzuma’s full wrath, preserving Sadala’s remaining lands and stabilizing the Saiyan legacy.</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🎖️ General Participation: 🎖️</strong><ul><li>💰 +5,000 Zeni</li></ul><ul><li>🎗️ “Thane of Sadala” Title: You get a free item from the planetary market (for aiding the royal siblings in reclaiming the throne)</li></ul><ul><li>📜 “Royal Favor”: Grants reduced cooldowns when training on Sadala</li></ul></li></ul></li><li><strong>🥇 MVPs / High Performers: 🥇</strong><ul><li>💰 +7,500–9,000 Zeni</li></ul><ul><li><strong>🐉 Boru’s Remnant Shard:</strong> a relic infused with traces of Boru’s energy; can be used in future arcs to unlock forbidden techniques or lore events</li></ul></li><li><span><strong>🔮 What-If Timeline Rewards: “Crimson Legacy” 🔮</strong></span><ul><li><span>If players fail to unite Sadala’s factions and Aikon fully conquers the capital, corrupting or killing key defenders, including Zyon captured and Atzuma forced into exile.</span></li></ul><ul><li><span>🎖️ General Participation: 🎖️</span><ul><li><span>💰 +6,000 Zeni</span></li></ul><ul><li><span>⚔️ “Crimson Empire Survivor” title: Your training gains are doubled for 1 IRL week (For surviving under Aikon’s tyrannical rule)</span></li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><span>🥇 MVPs / High Impact Players: 🥇</span><ul><li><span>💰 +9,000–11,000 Zeni</span></li></ul><ul><li><span><strong>🩸 Corrupted Saiyan Relic:</strong> partially awakened item tied to Boru’s legacy; may carry stat debuffs or unpredictable effects</span></li></ul><ul><li><span><strong>🧬 Aikon’s Dark Ki Technique:</strong> temporarily unlocks a forbidden ki ability for roleplay or minor stat boosts; staff approval required</span></li></ul><ul><li><span>🧪 Faction-Wide Effect:</span><ul><li><span>🏯 Sadala remains under Aikon’s dominion; training, commerce, and faction missions are restricted or altered for future arcs</span></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></span></div>","url":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1425312844089397298/1425314574806024243","messageId":"1425314574806024243"}],"source":"https://discord.com/channels/950522987646418964/1425312844089397298","excerpt":"🩸 ✦ 𝐀𝐑𝐂 𝐍𝐀𝐌𝐄: 𝕭𝖑𝖔𝖔𝖉 𝖔𝖋 𝖙𝖍𝖊 𝕭𝖊𝖙𝖗𝖆𝖞𝖊𝖗 ✦ 🩸 Theme: The return of bloodlines and the burning cost of pride. This arc explores generational hatred, the thin line between justice and vengeance, and the fate of a civilization built on strength. It’s a story "}],"meta":{"source":"ConvergenceExports.zip (provided by server owner)","note":"Prototype from existing server documents. Mechanics and lore are presented as archived; not an approved redesign.","counts":{"worlds":12,"races":13,"forms":164,"systems":4,"universal":5}},"themes":[{"id":"phoenix","name":"Phoenix Embers","background":"#0b080f","panel":"#1b101b","card":"#261621","text":"#fff2e2","muted":"#c8abb9","accent":"#ffb76b","secondary":"#db5d35","border":"#ae5f5d"},{"id":"astral","name":"Astral Violet","background":"#0b0a1a","panel":"#18132f","card":"#251c40","text":"#f6efff","muted":"#b9afda","accent":"#c49afa","secondary":"#8260c6","border":"#7556a4"},{"id":"midnight","name":"Midnight Sapphire","background":"#080f1e","panel":"#101c32","card":"#192b47","text":"#f2f8ff","muted":"#a8bcd5","accent":"#85c6fb","secondary":"#337bd0","border":"#45699c"},{"id":"jade","name":"Jade Sanctuary","background":"#071511","panel":"#0f251e","card":"#1b382d","text":"#edfff4","muted":"#accfbe","accent":"#91e5a4","secondary":"#31a580","border":"#4c927c"},{"id":"crimson","name":"Crimson Eclipse","background":"#16070c","panel":"#290f1b","card":"#3a1824","text":"#fff0f0","muted":"#d5aab5","accent":"#ff9a9a","secondary":"#d03c60","border":"#a95770"},{"id":"parchment","name":"Solar Parchment","background":"#f4e8cf","panel":"#fff6e5","card":"#f6e4c8","text":"#35251c","muted":"#715b4b","accent":"#8b3f23","secondary":"#b86e2a","border":"#a98264"}],"defaultTheme":"phoenix"};
